#. key: a faded altar of an unknown god
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a faded altar of an unknown god"
msgid ""
"An ancient altar, stripped of all identifying characteristics by the passage of\n"
"aeons. Praying at it will convert you to an unknown god, and the altar's deity\n"
"will greatly appreciate conversion at so ancient a site of worship.\n"
msgstr ""
"一座古老的祭坛，时间冲刷掉了它的全部特征。\n"
"在那里祈祷，将会皈依一个未知的神。\n"
"祭坛的神灵会非常感念于你在这样古老的礼拜场所进行皈依。\n"

#. key: a glowing golden altar of the shining one
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a glowing golden altar of the shining one"
msgid ""
"An altar to the Shining One, made from the purest gold and almost blinding in\n"
"its radiance.\n"
msgstr ""
"光明神的祭坛，由纯金制成，发出几近眩目的光芒。\n"

#. key: a broken altar of ashenzari
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a broken altar of ashenzari"
msgid ""
"A crystal altar which shattered to pieces when Ashenzari was cursed. There is\n"
"still a great power remaining within it: a dark aura holds the shards in\n"
"mid-explosion, suspended in time and space much like the god they herald.\n"
msgstr ""
"当艾申扎利被诅咒的时候，这座水晶祭坛也随之破碎。\n"
"这里依然残留着强大的力量：\n"
"黑色的光环将碎片定格在爆炸中期，悬停在时间和空间上，就像它们所昭示的神。\n"

#. key: a roughly hewn altar of beogh
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a roughly hewn altar of beogh"
msgid ""
"An altar to Beogh, unmistakably roughly hewn by orcish artisans.\n"
msgstr ""
"比欧弗的祭坛，做工粗糙，一眼就能看出是出自兽人工匠之手。\n"

#. key: a snail-covered altar of cheibriados
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a snail-covered altar of cheibriados"
msgid ""
"A timeless altar to Cheibriados the Contemplative.\n"
msgstr ""
"深思者切布理亚多的祭坛。\n"

#. key: a shadowy altar of dithmenos
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a shadowy altar of dithmenos"
msgid ""
"An altar to Dithmenos the Shadowed. It seems to absorb light from its\n"
"surroundings.\n"
msgstr ""
"隐没者迪斯姆诺的祭坛。它似乎在吸收四周的光。\n"

#. key: a white marble altar of elyvilon
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a white marble altar of elyvilon"
msgid ""
"An altar to Elyvilon the Healer, made from purest white marble and topped by a\n"
"sculpture of the Chalice of Purification.\n"
msgstr ""
"治愈者艾利维隆的祭坛，由纯白色大理石制成，顶端有净化之杯的雕像。\n"

#. key: a blossoming altar of fedhas
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a blossoming altar of fedhas"
msgid ""
"An altar to Fedhas Madash, covered in vibrant and colourful plant life.\n"
msgstr ""
"费德哈·莽动的祭坛，上面覆盖着生机盎然、色彩艳丽植物。\n"

#. key: an opulent altar of gozag
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an opulent altar of gozag"
msgid ""
"A glittering golden and bejewelled altar to Gozag Ym Sagoz the Greedy, gleaming\n"
"brightly even in the dim dungeon light.\n"
msgstr ""
"贪婪者哥萨戈·亿·赛格斯的祭坛，金光闪闪、饰以珠宝，\n"
"即使在昏暗的地牢也熠熠生辉。\n"

#. key: a hazy altar of hepliaklqana
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a hazy altar of hepliaklqana"
msgid ""
"An altar to Hepliaklqana the Forgotten, shrouded in mist and difficult to make\n"
"out clearly. Something about it seems terribly familiar, but it's impossible to\n"
"say exactly why.\n"
msgstr ""
"遗忘者惠普利亚卡纳的祭坛，被笼罩在薄雾中，难以清晰辨认。\n"
"有些东西似曾相识，但很难说清原因。\n"

#. key: a candlelit altar of ignis
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a candlelit altar of ignis"
msgid ""
"An altar to Ignis, the Dying Flame. It's completely covered in candles of all\n"
"shapes and sizes, but only one remains alight, its slender flame wavering in the\n"
"slightest breeze.\n"
msgstr ""
"曳焰伊格尼斯的祭坛。上面摆满了各种形状和大小的蜡烛，\n"
"但只有一根还亮着，它纤细的火焰在微风中摇曳。\n"

#. key: a viscous altar of jiyva
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a viscous altar of jiyva"
msgid ""
"A slimy, ever-shifting altar to Jiyva. You're not sure what it's made from, and\n"
"you don't really want to know.\n"
msgstr ""
"吉瓦的祭坛，黏滑、在不断变形。\n"
"你不确定这祭坛到底是用什么材料制造的，而且你也不想知道。\n"

#. key: an ancient bone altar of kikubaaqudgha
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an ancient bone altar of kikubaaqudgha"
msgid ""
"An altar created from piles of ancient bones, dedicated to the terrible\n"
"Demon-God Kikubaaqudgha.\n"
msgstr ""
"这座用远古骸骨堆积成的祭坛供奉的是恐怖的魔神——奇库巴库哈。\n"

#. key: a corrupted altar of lugonu
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a corrupted altar of lugonu"
msgid ""
"An altar to Lugonu the Unformed, possibly dedicated to some other power before\n"
"it was irrevocably corrupted.\n"
msgstr ""
"无形之神卢格努的祭坛，\n"
"这祭坛也许曾供奉过别的神祗，但现在已经不可逆转地被腐化了。\n"

#. key: a burning altar of makhleb
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a burning altar of makhleb"
msgid ""
"An ever-burning altar to Makhleb the Destroyer. Strange, twisting shapes are\n"
"visible in the flames.\n"
msgstr ""
"毁灭者马科列布的祭坛，上面永远燃烧着火焰。\n"
"透过火焰，可以隐约看到一些奇特而扭曲的形状。\n"

#. key: a sparkling altar of nemelex xobeh
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a sparkling altar of nemelex xobeh"
msgid ""
"An altar sparkling with a lightshow brighter than any gambling den's, to\n"
"attract followers for Nemelex Xobeh.\n"
msgstr ""
"这座祭坛上的灯光比任何一个赌场都要亮，\n"
"尼姆雷斯・索布在靠这种手段来吸引信徒。\n"

#. key: an iron altar of okawaru
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an iron altar of okawaru"
msgid ""
"An altar of iron and steel dedicated to the Warmaster Okawaru. Its edges are\n"
"surprisingly sharp.\n"
msgstr ""
"一座供奉战争之主奥卡瓦鲁的钢铁祭坛。祭坛的边缘出奇地锋利。\n"

#. key: a stormy altar of qazlal
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a stormy altar of qazlal"
msgid ""
"An altar dedicated to Qazlal Stormbringer, surrounded by fierce winds,\n"
"electrical discharges, puffs of fire and magma, and the occasional tremor.\n"
msgstr ""
"兴风者卡兹拉尔的祭坛，\n"
"被包裹在狂风、闪电、喷涌的烈火和岩浆之中，时而与之震颤。\n"

#. key: a sacrificial altar of ru
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a sacrificial altar of ru"
msgid ""
"An altar to Ru the Awakened in the shape of a pair of scales, with a heart in\n"
"one scale and a pictogram representing power and enlightenment in the other.\n"
msgstr ""
"觉醒者入的祭坛，\n"
"其外形是个天平，一个托盘中放有心，而另一个托盘中的符号象征力量和觉悟。\n"

#. key: a shimmering blue altar of sif muna
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a shimmering blue altar of sif muna"
msgid ""
"An altar to Sif Muna the Loreminder, covered in intricate patterns and writings\n"
"in long forgotten scripts. Atop a deep blue pedestal hovers a shimmering\n"
"condensation of pure magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"学识之主席夫·穆纳的祭坛，上面布满了错综复杂的图案和久久被遗忘的文字。\n"
"在深蓝色的基座上，盘旋着纯净的魔法凝结的光芒。\n"

#. key: a bloodstained altar of trog
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a bloodstained altar of trog"
msgid ""
"An altar to Trog the Wrathful, crudely made by what seem to be the hands of\n"
"giants and covered with bloodstains.\n"
msgstr ""
"狂怒者特洛戈的祭坛，它做工粗糙，像是由巨人建造的，上面溅满了鲜血。\n"

#. key: a hide-covered altar of uskayaw
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a hide-covered altar of uskayaw"
msgid ""
"An altar to Uskayaw the Reveller. It appears to be hollow and covered in a hide,\n"
"giving it a resonant surface. Carvings on the side depict grouped figures that\n"
"could be dancing or loving or fighting.\n"
msgstr ""
"狂欢者阿斯卡亚的祭坛。\n"
"它似乎是中空的，被一层皮覆盖着，形成了能够共振的表面。\n"
"侧面的雕刻描绘着一群人，他们可能在跳舞、爱恋或战斗。\n"

#. key: a radiant altar of vehumet
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a radiant altar of vehumet"
msgid ""
"An altar, ablaze in the lights of Iskenderun and promising great destructive\n"
"powers to those who would follow Vehumet.\n"
msgstr ""
"这座祭坛闪耀在伊斯肯德伦之光中，好像在对来人许诺：\n"
"只要追随维胡梅特，他就会赐予你无比的毁灭之力。\n"

#. key: an ornate altar of the wu jian council
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an ornate altar of the wu jian council"
msgid ""
"A red and gold altar to the Wu Jian Council. Sharp slivers of steel drift\n"
"through the quiet air surrounding it.\n"
msgstr ""
"无间门派的红金相间的祭坛。锋利的钢片在周围安静的空气中飘过。\n"

#. key: a shimmering altar of xom
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a shimmering altar of xom"
msgid ""
"An altar constantly shimmering in all visible colours, and probably some\n"
"invisible ones, matching the whims of Xom the Unpredictable.\n"
msgstr ""
"这座祭坛不断闪现着各色光芒，甚至可能还有不可见光，\n"
"和这座祭坛所供奉的神祗无常之主佐姆一样，变幻莫测。\n"

#. key: a basalt altar of yredelemnul
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a basalt altar of yredelemnul"
msgid ""
"An altar to Yredelemnul the Dark, worked from columnar basalt.\n"
msgstr ""
"黑暗神伊莱德莱姆努尔的祭坛，由柱状玄武岩建成。\n"

#. key: a glowing silver altar of zin
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a glowing silver altar of zin"
msgid ""
"An altar to Zin the Law-Giver, made from silver as pristine as Zin's followers\n"
"are expected to be, and glowing gently.\n"
msgstr ""
"定法者辛的祭坛，由银制成，与辛的追随者们所期望的一样纯净，柔和地发着光。\n"

#. key: the endless lava
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the endless lava"
msgid ""
"A sea of fire and brimstone as far as the eye can see. Anyone venturing across\n"
"it would be roasted in no time.\n"
msgstr ""
"一片火与硫磺的海洋，一望不知边际。任何冒险要穿越它的人，都会立刻被烤死。\n"

#. key: the floor
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the floor"
msgid ""
"The floor.\n"
msgstr ""
"地面。\n"

#. key: some deep water
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:some deep water"
msgid ""
"A pool of deep water. Only giant creatures can wade through this, and only\n"
"those well-adapted to water can swim through it; for the rest, the only way\n"
"through is to fly over.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个深水池。\n"
"只有巨型生物可以趟过去，水性好的则可以游；而其他的，就只能选择飞过去。\n"

#. key: some lava
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:some lava"
msgid ""
"An intensely hot pool of molten rock, emitting clouds of sulphurous smoke.\n"
"Nothing but the mythical salamander can cross this without flight.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个炽热的熔岩池，喷吐着硫磺烟云。\n"
"只有传说中的火蜥蜴才能不凭借飞行就能穿越它。\n"

#. key: some shallow water
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:some shallow water"
msgid ""
"A pool of cloudy, waist-deep water. Those well-adapted to water can swim\n"
"through it and attack normally. Non-swimmers must wade through the water slowly\n"
"and will occasionally fail to attack in melee when wading through shallow\n"
"water; although large creatures are able to keep their balance, move at a\n"
"normal speed, and avoid fumbling.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个浑浊的水池，深及腰部。\n"
"水性好的可以游过水，并能正常攻击。\n"
"不会游泳的必须缓慢地涉水，在趟过浅水时，有时会在近战中失手；\n"
"但大型生物能够以正常速度移动，以保持平衡，避免摔倒。\n"

#. key: a toxic bog
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a toxic bog"
msgid ""
"A filthy pool of poisonous, waist-deep sludge. Wading or swimming through the\n"
"sludge will damage and poison any creature, even those resistant to poison.\n"
"Those well-adapted to water can swim through it and attack normally.\n"
"Non-swimmers must wade through the water slowly and will occasionally fail to\n"
"attack in melee when wading through shallow water; although large creatures are\n"
"able to keep their balance, move at a normal speed, and avoid fumbling.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肮脏、有毒的淤泥池，深及腰部。\n"
"在淤泥中涉水或游泳会让任何生物中毒受伤，甚至是那些有毒抗的生物。\n"
"水性好的可以游过它，并能正常攻击。\n"
"不会游泳的必须缓慢地涉水，在趟过浅水时，有时会在近战中失手；\n"
"但大型生物能够以正常速度移动，以保持平衡，避免摔倒。\n"

#. key: some mud
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:some mud"
msgid ""
"A thick layer of gritty mud. [[liquefied]]\n"
msgstr ""
"一层厚厚的含有沙砾的泥。\n"
"<liquefied>\n"

#. key: the open sea
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the open sea"
msgid ""
"An expanse of endless wind and waves, with not a lighthouse in sight. Anyone\n"
"venturing across it would be lost beyond all hope in short order.\n"
msgstr ""
"前方只有无尽的风浪，在你视野可及之处都没有一座灯塔。\n"
"任何冒险要穿越它的人，很快都会失去一切希望。\n"

#. key: an unnaturally hard rock wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an unnaturally hard rock wall"
msgid ""
"A wall imbued with magic that makes it indestructible.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙被注入魔力，坚不可摧。\n"

#. key: a wall of the weird stuff which makes up pandemonium
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a wall of the weird stuff which makes up pandemonium"
msgid ""
"A wall made from the weird stuff which makes up Pandemonium. It seems to be\n"
"like rock in most other aspects.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙由构筑魔窟的奇特材料制成。在其他大多数方面，似乎都和岩石一样。\n"

#. key: a crystal wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a crystal wall"
msgid ""
"A wall made from polished crystal and imbued with arcane magics. They prevent\n"
"its easy destruction, and make it reflect heat and cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙由抛光水晶制成，充满了奥术魔力。\n"
"这使得墙难以被轻易破坏，并能反射热和冷。\n"

#. key: a translucent rock wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a translucent rock wall"
msgid ""
"A rock wall made from a mineral as translucent as good quality glass. Whether\n"
"it is natural or magical, you cannot tell.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面岩墙由一种像优质玻璃那样透明的矿物制成。\n"
"你不确定它的这种性质是自然的还是被魔法改造的。\n"

#. key: a translucent stone wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a translucent stone wall"
msgid ""
"A harder obstacle than rock walls. Only the mightiest magic can shatter stone\n"
"walls. It has been imbued with arcane magics which render it translucent.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是比岩墙更难对付的障碍。只有最强力的魔法才能打碎石墙。\n"
"这面墙壁被注入奥术魔法，因此变成了透明的。\n"

#. key: a translucent unnaturally hard rock wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a translucent unnaturally hard rock wall"
msgid ""
"A wall imbued with magic that not only makes it indestructible but also makes\n"
"it translucent like glass.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙被注入魔力，不仅使它坚不可摧，还让它变得像玻璃一样半透明。\n"

#. key: a stone wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a stone wall"
msgid ""
"A harder obstacle than rock walls. Only the mightiest magic can shatter stone\n"
"walls.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是比岩墙更难对付的障碍。只有最强力的魔法才能打碎石墙。\n"

#. key: a slime covered rock wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a slime covered rock wall"
msgid ""
"A rock wall coated with acidic green slime; just standing near it is enough to\n"
"cause temporary corrosion.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面岩墙附着着亮绿色的黏液。它摸起来是酸性的；站在它附近就会被暂时腐蚀。\n"

#. key: a metal wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a metal wall"
msgid ""
"A wall of bluish-grey metal. As every dungeon electrician knows, it will ground\n"
"even magical bolts of lightning.\n"
msgstr ""
"一面蓝灰色金属墙。地牢中的每个电工都知道，它甚至能让闪电箭接地。\n"

#. key: a rock wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a rock wall"
msgid ""
"A wall consisting of simple rock.\n"
msgstr ""
"这仅仅是一面岩墙。\n"

#. key: a shop
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a shop"
msgid ""
"A shop in the dungeon, beyond sight of the world above, manned by a secretive\n"
"and reclusive shopkeeper who cannot be bargained with, grants no refunds, and\n"
"is interested in nothing you may have to sell. Some shops hawk antiques of\n"
"unknown provenance, and offer little hint as to the quality or nature of their\n"
"goods.\n"
msgstr ""
"有一位神秘、隐居的商人在不见天日的地牢中开设了一家商店，\n"
"这里的商店不能还价，不会退款，而且也不会从你那里购买任何东西。\n"
"一些商店会出售来源不明的古物，店主自然不会告诉你这些商品的质量和性质。\n"

#. key: a stone staircase leading down
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a stone staircase leading down"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading further down.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往下层的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a stone staircase leading up
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a stone staircase leading up"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading back up.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往上层的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a tree
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a tree"
msgid ""
"A large tree. While in most places the dim light of the dungeon is not bright\n"
"enough to sustain large plants, there are spots where, with the grace of\n"
"Fedhas, trees as big as those on the surface can grow underground.\n"
msgstr ""
"一棵大树。在地牢的大多地方，昏暗的光线不足以维持大型植物的生长，\n"
"但有些地方，受到费德哈的关照，在地下生长的树木也长得和地表的一样大。\n"

#. key: a mangrove
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a mangrove"
msgid ""
"This tree is specially adapted for growing in swampy conditions. Its vines are\n"
"too thick to see through.\n"
msgstr ""
"这种树特别适合在沼泽环境中生长。它的藤蔓很茂密，看不到对面。\n"

#. key: a demonic tree
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a demonic tree"
msgid ""
"A tree hideously warped by the demonic forces of chaos. Despite its bizarre\n"
"appearance and occasional, unsettling movement, it seems harmless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一棵被混乱的恶魔力量扭曲的树。\n"
"尽管外形怪异，偶尔还会有令人不安的动作，但它似乎是无害的。\n"

#. key: a petrified tree
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a petrified tree"
msgid ""
"An ancient tree, long ago passed from biology into geology. While no longer\n"
"wooden in a material sense, it retains the spiritual qualities of a tree.\n"
msgstr ""
"一棵古树，很久以前就从生物学转入地质学意义。\n"
"虽然它在物质意义上不再是木质的，但保留了树的精神品质。\n"

#. key: an abandoned shop
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an abandoned shop"
msgid ""
"A shop that has been abandoned.\n"
msgstr ""
"这间商店已经被废弃了。\n"

#. key: an orcish idol
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an orcish idol"
msgid ""
"An idol of the orc god Beogh.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊兽人之神比欧弗的塑像。\n"

#. key: an iron grate
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an iron grate"
msgid ""
"A rusted iron grate, brittle enough to be disrupted with a spell or a wand\n"
"quite easily. It is too strong to be breakable by hand, however.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个生锈的铁门，可以用法术或法杖轻易破坏。但徒手还是不行。\n"

#. key: an escape hatch in the floor
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an escape hatch in the floor"
msgid ""
"A spring-loaded one-way escape hatch set in the dungeon floor, allowing the\n"
"adventurer beset by adversaries to exchange the perils of this level for the\n"
"perils of the next.\n"
msgstr ""
"地牢的地面上一个单向逃生口，\n"
"让被敌人围困的冒险者可以选择使用它逃离眼下的危险，面对下一层的危险。\n"

#. key: an escape hatch in the ceiling
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an escape hatch in the ceiling"
msgid ""
"A spring-loaded one-way escape hatch set in the ceiling.\n"
msgstr ""
"天花板上一个装有弹簧的单向逃生口。\n"

#. key: a shaft
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a shaft"
msgid ""
"A hole in the ground, leading to a dungeon level one or more floors deeper.\n"
msgstr ""
"地面上的一个洞，通往更深一层或多层的地牢。\n"

#. key: a sealed passage leading down
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a sealed passage leading down"
msgid ""
"A descending passage sealed tightly by a magical barricade. It is impossible to\n"
"climb through it so long as the magic holds.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条下行的通道，被魔法路障牢固地封印着。只要魔力一直存在，就不可能穿过它。\n"

#. key: a sealed passage leading up
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a sealed passage leading up"
msgid ""
"An ascending passage sealed tightly by a magical barricade. It is impossible to\n"
"climb through it so long as the magic holds.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条上行的通道，被魔法路障牢固地封印着。只要魔力一直存在，就不可能穿过它。\n"

#. key: an empty arch of ancient stone
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an empty arch of ancient stone"
msgid ""
"A stone archway that seems to lead to nowhere in particular.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个石拱门，看起来无法通往任何地方。\n"

#. key: a detected shop or portal
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a detected shop or portal"
msgid ""
"A gateway of some kind. You cannot tell where it leads without approaching it.\n"
msgstr ""
"某种入口。你不接近它就无法知道它通往哪里。\n"

#. key: a passage of golubria
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a passage of golubria"
msgid ""
"An unstable gateway that allows instantaneous travel to another nearby passage\n"
"of Golubria, and will close behind anything passing through it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个不稳定的传送门让你瞬间传送到附近的另一个格鲁布里亚的通道上，\n"
"只要有任何东西通过这个传送门，它就会立刻关闭。\n"

#. key: a portal to somewhere
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a portal to somewhere"
msgid ""
"A gash-like tear in reality that looks into some terrifying, starry otherworld.\n"
"Thankfully, the magic that opened it also prevents its vacuum from consuming\n"
"and swallowing everything in sight.\n"
msgstr ""
"现实空间中的一道伤口般的裂缝，揭示着某个可怕的、繁星点点的另一个世界。\n"
"幸运的是，打开这道裂缝的魔法同时也会阻止它将视线中的一切东西尽数吞没。\n"

#. key: a granite statue
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a granite statue"
msgid ""
"A stone statue whose features have long since withered away.\n"
msgstr ""
"一座石像，其形象早已被时间消磨。\n"

#. key: a gleaming silver wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gleaming silver wall"
msgid ""
"A wall made of pure silver, formed by the power of Zin to temporarily imprison\n"
"a monster within its confines.\n"
msgstr ""
"一面纯银制成的墙，由辛的力量生成，用来将一个怪物暂时囚禁起来。\n"

#. key: a dry fountain
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a dry fountain"
msgid ""
"A dried-up decorative fountain that has seen better days.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个干涸的喷泉，见证过美好的岁月。\n"

#. key: a fountain of clear blue water
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a fountain of clear blue water"
msgid ""
"A decorative fountain, flowing with clear water.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个装饰性喷泉，水流清澈。\n"

#. key: a fountain of blood
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a fountain of blood"
msgid ""
"A decorative fountain, spurting with foul-looking blood.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个装饰性喷泉，喷着看上去肮脏的血液。\n"

#. key: a fountain of sparkling water
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a fountain of sparkling water"
msgid ""
"A decorative fountain, flowing with brightly sparkling, faintly magic water.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个装饰性喷泉，流淌着闪烁、起泡的水。\n"

#. key: a runelight
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a runelight"
msgid ""
"An unearthly, glittering light, floating and twisting in midair. A Rune of\n"
"Zot is surely nearby, its power overspilling to cause this spectacular sight.\n"
msgstr ""
"一道超自然、闪耀的光芒，在半空中飘浮、扭曲。\n"
"附近肯定有个佐特符文，它溢出的能量生成出这一壮观的景象。\n"

#. key: a broken pillar
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a broken pillar"
msgid ""
"A ruined and crumbled stone pillar.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根残破的石柱。\n"

#. key: a one-way staircase leading down
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a one-way staircase leading down"
msgid ""
"A cursed staircase leading further down, imbued with magic to prevent any\n"
"return back up the stairs. Adventurers taking this passage will need to find a\n"
"return stairway somewhere else on the level where they arrive.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被诅咒的通往下层的楼梯，注入着魔力，以阻止任何回返。\n"
"走这条通道的冒险者，到达所通往的楼层后，需要找到其他能够返回楼梯。\n"

#. key: a one-way staircase leading up
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a one-way staircase leading up"
msgid ""
"A cursed staircase leading up, imbued with magic to prevent any return back\n"
"down the stairs. Adventurers taking this passage will need to find a return\n"
"stairway somewhere else on the level where they arrive.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被诅咒的通往上层的楼梯，注入着魔力，以阻止任何回返。\n"
"走这条通道的冒险者，到达所通往的楼层后，需要找到其他能够返回楼梯。\n"

#. key: a gate leading back out of this place
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gate leading back out of this place"
msgid ""
"A gate that will let you return whence you came.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个大门，你穿过它能回到你来的地方。\n"

#. key: a gate leading out of pandemonium
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gate leading out of pandemonium"
msgid ""
"A gate leading back to the dungeon.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个返回地牢的大门。\n"

#. key: a gate leading to another region of pandemonium
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gate leading to another region of pandemonium"
msgid ""
"A gate leading to yet another region of Pandemonium. There'll always be more.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往另一个魔窟的大门。魔窟是无穷无尽的。\n"

#. key: a one-way gate leading to the halls of pandemonium
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a one-way gate leading to the halls of pandemonium"
msgid ""
"A gate leading to the endless halls of Pandemonium.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往魔窟的无尽大厅的大门。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the depths
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the depths"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Depths.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往地底的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a gate to the realm of zot
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gate to the realm of zot"
msgid ""
"A gate leading to the Realm of Zot.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往佐特领域的大门。\n"

#. key: a gateway back into the dungeon
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway back into the dungeon"
msgid ""
"A gate which allows a feat popularly thought to be impossible: escaping Hell\n"
"alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道大门能让你做到一件通常被认为不可能的事：活着逃出地狱。\n"

#. key: a gateway leading out of the abyss
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway leading out of the abyss"
msgid ""
"A gateway out of the Abyss, shimmering and shifting in the impermanent\n"
"landscape.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个离开深渊的出口，在无常的景象中发光变幻。\n"

#. key: a gateway leading deeper into the abyss
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway leading deeper into the abyss"
msgid ""
"A strangely calm gateway amid the roiling landscape of the Abyss. It leads\n"
"further into the depths of the Abyss.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个出奇平静的入口，坐落在深渊那混沌的景象中。它通向深渊的更深处。\n"

#. key: a gateway to a ziggurat
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway to a ziggurat"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a ziggurat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往金字塔的门户。\n"

#. key: a gateway to the ashen valley of gehenna
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway to the ashen valley of gehenna"
msgid ""
"A gateway leading to Gehenna.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往欣嫩谷的入口。\n"

#. key: a gateway leading out of gehenna
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway leading out of gehenna"
msgid ""
"A gateway leading back to the Vestibule of Hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个返回地狱前庭的出口。\n"

#. key: a gateway to hell
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway to hell"
msgid ""
"A gateway leading to the Vestibule of Hell. Few would go there voluntarily.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往地狱前庭的入口。很少有人自愿前往那个地方。\n"

#. key: a gateway to the iron city of dis
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway to the iron city of dis"
msgid ""
"A gateway leading to the Iron City of Dis.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往狄斯铁城的入口。\n"

#. key: a gateway to the decaying netherworld of tartarus
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway to the decaying netherworld of tartarus"
msgid ""
"A gateway leading to Tartarus.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往塔尔塔罗斯的入口。\n"

#. key: a gateway to the freezing wastes of cocytus
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway to the freezing wastes of cocytus"
msgid ""
"A gateway leading to Cocytus.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往悲叹河的入口。\n"

#. key: a one-way gate to the infinite horrors of the abyss
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a one-way gate to the infinite horrors of the abyss"
msgid ""
"A gateway leading to the Abyss.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往深渊的入口。\n"

#. key: a crawl-hole back to the lair
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a crawl-hole back to the lair"
msgid ""
"A passage leading back to the Lair of Beasts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个返回兽穴的出口。\n"

#. key: an exit through the horrors of the abyss
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an exit through the horrors of the abyss"
msgid ""
"A gateway leading back to the dungeon via the madness of the Abyss.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通过疯狂的深渊返回地牢的出口。\n"

#. key: a staircase back to the dungeon
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase back to the dungeon"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading back up to the familiarity of the dungeon.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个返回你遇到过的地牢楼层的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase back to the lair
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase back to the lair"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading back up to the Lair of Beasts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个返回兽穴的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase back to the mines
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase back to the mines"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading back to the Orcish Mines.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个返回兽人矿井的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase back to the vaults
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase back to the vaults"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading back to the Vaults.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个返回宝库的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase leading out of the dungeon
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase leading out of the dungeon"
msgid ""
"This staircase leads back out of the dungeon.\n"
"\n"
"A staircase leading out of the dungeon. Climbing these stairs will end your\n"
"quest, whether you carry the Orb with you or not.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个楼梯，穿过它能离开地牢。\n"
"\n"
"这个楼梯是离开地牢的出口。爬上这些楼梯会结束你的探索，无论是否携带宝珠。\n"

#. key: a staircase back to the crypt
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase back to the crypt"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading back to the Crypt.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个返回墓室的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the crypt
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the crypt"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Crypt.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往墓室的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the ecumenical temple
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the ecumenical temple"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Ecumenical Temple.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往众神庙的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the elven halls
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the elven halls"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Elven Halls.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往精灵殿堂的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the lair
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the lair"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Lair of Beasts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往兽穴的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the orcish mines
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the orcish mines"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Orcish Mines.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往兽人矿井的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the shoals
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the shoals"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Shoals.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往海滩的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the slime pits
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the slime pits"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Slime Pits.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往黏液坑洞的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the snake pit
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the snake pit"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Snake Pit.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往蛇穴的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the swamp
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the swamp"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Swamp.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往沼泽的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a staircase to the tomb
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a staircase to the tomb"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to the Tomb of the Ancients.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往坟冢的楼梯。\n"

#. key: a gate to the vaults
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gate to the vaults"
msgid ""
"A gateway leading to the Vaults.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往宝库的入口。\n"

#. key: a transporter
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a transporter"
msgid ""
"A one-way portal to another place on this level. When using a transporter,\n"
"adjacent allies and monsters will travel with you to the other side.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往同层的另一个地方的传送门。\n"
"当使用了这个传送门，旁边的盟友和怪物也会随你一起到达另一边。\n"

#. key: a transporter landing site
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a transporter landing site"
msgid ""
"The destination site of a transporter. As the portal is one-way, you cannot use\n"
"this location to return back through the transporter.\n"
msgstr ""
"传送门的目的地。由于这个传送门是单向的，你无法通过此位置的传送门返回。\n"

#. key: an open door
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an open door"
msgid ""
"An open wooden door. If closed again, all monsters that can wield equipment,\n"
"and some of them that can't, could open it again. If it is closed and reopened\n"
"by a monster that is aware of you, it has a chance of breaking.\n"
msgstr ""
"一扇打开的木门。如果被怪物重新打开，它可能会破裂。\n"

#. key: a closed door
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a closed door"
msgid ""
"A closed wooden door. All monsters that can wield equipment, and some of them\n"
"that can't, may open it again. If it is opened by a monster while it is aware\n"
"of you, it has a chance of breaking.\n"
msgstr ""
"一扇关闭的木门。如果被怪物打开，它可能会破裂。\n"

#. key: a broken door
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a broken door"
msgid ""
"A disappointingly poorly maintained wooden door. It'd take nothing short of\n"
"magic to get this properly closed again.\n"
msgstr ""
"一扇令人失望、维护不善的木门。要想恰当地关闭它，只有魔法能做到。\n"

#. key: an open translucent door
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an open translucent door"
msgid ""
"An open door made from magically translucent wood. If closed again, all monsters\n"
"that can wield equipment, and some of them that can't, could open it again. If\n"
"it is closed and reopened by a monster that is aware of you, it has a chance of\n"
"breaking.\n"
msgstr ""
"这扇打开的门由神奇的半透明木材制成。如果被怪物重新打开，它可能会破裂。\n"

#. key: a closed translucent door
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a closed translucent door"
msgid ""
"A closed door made from magically translucent wood. All monsters that can wield\n"
"equipment, and some of them that can't, may open it again. If it is opened by a\n"
"monster while it is aware of you, it has a chance of breaking.\n"
msgstr ""
"这扇关闭的门由神奇的半透明木材制成。如果被怪物打开，它可能会破裂。\n"

#. key: a sealed door
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a sealed door"
msgid ""
"A door sealed tightly by arcane runes. It refuses to open for any creature not\n"
"recognised by its magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"这扇门被奥术符文牢固地封印着。只有被这扇门上面的魔法承认的生物才能打开它。\n"

#. key: a runed door
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a runed door"
msgid ""
"A door, covered in runic writing. It looks like there is something special\n"
"behind it — perhaps danger, perhaps treasure. You may break the runes by\n"
"opening it like any other door, but creatures of the dungeon will not dare\n"
"to try.\n"
msgstr ""
"这扇门上满是符文记号。\n"
"门的后面应该有什么特别的东西——可能是危险，也可能是宝藏。\n"
"像打开其他门那样就能破坏符文，但地牢里的生物可不敢尝试。\n"

#. key: an alarm trap
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an alarm trap"
msgid ""
"A trap that creates a loud noise to attract nearby monsters. In addition to the\n"
"noise it creates, it will apply an enchantment making monsters all over the\n"
"level aware of your location. Hostile monsters may trigger this trap themselves\n"
"to invoke its effects against you, but your allies will avoid stepping on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个陷阱会发出很大的噪音引来附近的怪物。\n"
"除了产生噪音外，它还会使用魔力，使当前层的所有怪物得知你的位置。\n"
"敌对的怪物可能会故意触发这个陷阱从而对你引起效果，而你的盟友会避免踩到它。\n"

#. key: a dispersal trap
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a dispersal trap"
msgid ""
"Anyone stepping on this trap will translocate themselves and anyone else in view\n"
"to a new location nearby. Hostile monsters may trigger this trap, but your\n"
"allies will avoid stepping on it.\n"
"\n"
"After triggering, it cannot be triggered again for several turns.\n"
msgstr ""
"任何踩上这个陷阱的人都会将自己和视野中的其他怪物转移到附近的新位置。\n"
"敌对的怪物可能会故意触发这个陷阱，而你的盟友会避免踩到它。\n"

#. key: a net trap
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a net trap"
msgid ""
"A large concealed net launcher hanging from the dungeon's ceiling. Enchanted by\n"
"the power of Zot, whenever an intelligent creature steps here - whether friend\n"
"or foe - the net will land only on you.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个挂在地牢天花板上的巨大而隐蔽的网。\n"
"它被佐特注入魔力，每当有智慧生物来到这里——无论是敌是友——网只会落你身上。\n"

#. key: a permanent teleport trap
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a permanent teleport trap"
msgid ""
"A magical trap which will displace anyone passing over it to a random place on\n"
"the same dungeon level.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个魔力陷阱，任何经过它的人会被传送到这层地牢的一个随机地点。\n"

#. key: a pressure plate
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a pressure plate"
msgid ""
"A trigger of some sort. You cannot tell what kind of trap it is attached to.\n"
"Its complicated detection system will trigger the trap even when someone flies\n"
"over it.\n"
msgstr ""
"某种触发机关。你无法确定它所连接的陷阱的类型。\n"
"它有着复杂的探测系统，即便是飞过也会触发陷阱。\n"

#. key: a teleport trap
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a teleport trap"
msgid ""
"A magical trap which will displace anyone passing over it to a random place on\n"
"the same dungeon level. It is worn with age, and will dissipate on use.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个魔力陷阱，任何经过它的人会被传送到这层地牢的一个随机地点。\n"
"它会被消磨，一旦被激活就会消散。\n"

#. key: a web
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a web"
msgid ""
"A spider's web. The spider who left it must have been huge, as it seems to be\n"
"made for trapping {{ return you.genus(true) }} rather than flies.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个蜘蛛网。留下这张网的蜘蛛肯定是个大家伙，\n"
"因为这似乎是用来诱捕{{ return you.genus(true) }}而不是苍蝇的。\n"

#. key: a zot trap
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a zot trap"
msgid ""
"A trap which inflicts dangerously unpredictable magical effects on those\n"
"unlucky enough to step on it. You may find yourself petrified, contaminated\n"
"with enormous amounts of wild magic, have mighty fiends summoned against you,\n"
"or the like. Hostile monsters may trigger this trap themselves to invoke its\n"
"effects against you, but your allies will avoid stepping on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个陷阱，会对那些不幸踩到陷阱的人造成危险、不可预知的魔法效果。\n"
"你可能会发现自己陷入深渊，被大量的野性魔法污染，\n"
"被召唤出的强大的恶魔来对付你，等等。\n"
"敌对的怪物可能会故意触发这个陷阱从而对你引起效果，而你的盟友会避免踩到它。\n"

#. key: a flagged portal
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a flagged portal"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a bailey, gradually fading away as the standard is lowered\n"
"to the ground.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往堡场的门户，会随着旗帜降至地面而逐渐消失。\n"

#. key: a gauntlet entrance
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gauntlet entrance"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a gauntlet.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往竞技场的门户。\n"

#. key: a flickering gateway to a bazaar
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a flickering gateway to a bazaar"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a bazaar, where itinerant merchants gather to sell their\n"
"wares. They never stay in one place for very long.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往集市的门户，行商聚集在那里出售商品。\n"
"他们永远不会在一个地方呆很长时间。\n"

#. key: a gateway to a bazaar
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway to a bazaar"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a bazaar, where itinerant merchants gather to sell their\n"
"wares. They will wait for you, but once you get a chance to browse their\n"
"inventory, the merchants will depart in search of other customers.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往集市的门户，行商聚集在那里出售商品。\n"
"他们会等你，但一旦你浏览过他们的存货，商家将出发寻找其他客户。\n"

#. key: a frozen archway
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a frozen archway"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to an ice cave. The archway is gradually melting away.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往冰窟的门户。拱门在渐渐融化。\n"

#. key: a glacial archway
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a glacial archway"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a glacial chasm, far more dangerous than the icy caverns\n"
"found in the shallower reaches of the Dungeon. The archway is gradually melting\n"
"away.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往冰川裂缝的门户，比地牢浅层的冰窟危险得多。拱门在渐渐融化。\n"

#. key: a sand-covered staircase
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a sand-covered staircase"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to an ossuary. Sand is continuously pouring onto it,\n"
"gradually blocking the entrance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往埋骨地的楼梯。沙子在不断倾泻，会逐渐封住入口。\n"

#. key: a glowing drain
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a glowing drain"
msgid ""
"A passage leading to a sewer. It is gradually rusting away.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往下水道的通道。它在逐渐锈蚀。\n"

#. key: a portal to a secret trove of treasure
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a portal to a secret trove of treasure"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a treasure trove. This portal is unstable and will collapse\n"
"after a single use.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往库藏的门户。这个门户一旦被使用过就会变得不稳定，并会崩溃。\n"

#. key: a dark tunnel
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a dark tunnel"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to the heart of a volcano. Rocks are falling from the roof and\n"
"sides of the tunnel, filling the entry.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往火山的门户。岩石不断从隧道顶部和侧面落下，将会堵住入口。\n"

#. key: a crumbling gateway
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a crumbling gateway"
msgid ""
"A salt-encrusted arch, covered with carved entreaties to the good gods to\n"
"contain the evils sealed therein. Whatever protections this arch once offered\n"
"have finally succumbed to the ravages of time, and a bitter breeze pours forth\n"
"from the distant land beyond.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被盐渍的拱门，上面雕满了诸善神，以求掩盖其中的邪恶。\n"
"这座拱门曾提供的任何保护终都屈服于时间的摧残，\n"
"遥远的土地上倾泻着刺骨的微风。\n"

#. key: a magical portal
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a magical portal"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a wizard's laboratory. It is fading away.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个通往巫师实验室的门户。它在逐渐消失。\n"

#. key: a collapsed entrance
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a collapsed entrance"
msgid ""
"A collapsed passage which cannot be used anymore.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个坍塌的通道，无法继续使用。\n"

#. key: a large window
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a large window"
msgid ""
"A window embedded in the side of an enormous metal pipe, allowing observation\n"
"of the water flowing inside.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个嵌在巨大金属管道侧面的窗户，从中可以观察到管内的水流。\n"

#. key: an ice choked empty arch of ancient stone
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an ice choked empty arch of ancient stone"
msgid ""
"An inoperative portal, nearly completely encased in a mass of ice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个失效的门户，几乎完全被冰块包裹。\n"

#. key: an ice covered gate leading back out of this place
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an ice covered gate leading back out of this place"
msgid ""
"A portal leading back to the place you came from. Its magic is holding the ice\n"
"at bay, preventing it from blocking the gate. You will be unable to return here\n"
"once you pass through it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个门户导向你回到原来的地方。\n"
"其魔力将冰挡在海湾，阻止它堵塞大门。一旦你穿过它，就再也无法回来了。\n"

#. key: an ice covered rock wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an ice covered rock wall"
msgid ""
"A rock wall covered by a thick layer of frost and ice.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面岩墙上有一层厚厚的冰霜。\n"

#. key: some ice crusted deep water
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:some ice crusted deep water"
msgid ""
"A pool of deep water, crusted with broken blocks of ice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个深水池，表面冻结成了碎冰块。\n"

#. key: some ice crusted shallow water
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:some ice crusted shallow water"
msgid ""
"A pool of shallow water, crusted with broken blocks of ice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个浅水池，表面冻结成了碎冰块。\n"

#. key: a rock-blocked tunnel
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a rock-blocked tunnel"
msgid ""
"A tunnel which is no longer passable.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个隧道不可继续通行。\n"

#. key: a rocky tunnel leading out of this place
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a rocky tunnel leading out of this place"
msgid ""
"An unstable passage in the volcanic rock, admitting a draft of cool air from\n"
"beyond. It leads back to the place you came from. You will be unable to return\n"
"here once you pass through it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个火山岩体中不稳定的通道，外面的冷空气可以从中进入。\n"
"它导向你回到原来的地方。一旦你穿过它，就再也无法回来了。\n"

#. key: an endless expanse of salt
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an endless expanse of salt"
msgid ""
"A seemingly endless, flat plain, wracked by blinding salt-storms. Anyone\n"
"venturing across it would be lost beyond all hope in short order.\n"
msgstr ""
"一片似乎无尽的平原被眩目的盐风暴肆虐着。\n"
"任何冒险要穿越它的人，很快都会失去一切希望。\n"

#. key: a ruined idol
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a ruined idol"
msgid ""
"A monument to the glory of a dead god. The statue has been methodically\n"
"defaced; not a single distinguishing feature remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"一座纪念碑，用来纪念已故的神的荣光。\n"
"这座雕塑已经被有条不紊地损毁了，没剩下一个可辨识的特征。\n"

#. key: a portal leading out of this place
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a portal leading out of this place"
msgid ""
"A shimmering magical gate leading back to the place you came from. You will be\n"
"unable to return here once you pass through it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个闪着微光的魔法门导向你回到原来的地方。一旦你穿过它，就再也无法回来了。\n"

#. key: an autumnal tree
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an autumnal tree"
msgid ""
"A large tree that appears to be permanently locked in an autumnal moment.\n"
"Leaves, coloured red and gold, fall from its branches and float gracefully to\n"
"the floor, but before they even reach the ground they shimmer and reappear on\n"
"the branches, ready to fall again.\n"
msgstr ""
"这棵高大的树木仿佛永远定格在秋季的一瞬间。\n"
"红色和金色的树叶从树枝上落下，优雅地飘在半空中，\n"
"但在它们碰到地面之前，它们会闪着光，重新出现在树枝上，将要再次飘落。\n"

#. key: a crumbled stone wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a crumbled stone wall"
msgid ""
"A stone wall on the brink of collapsing from disrepair but somehow remaining\n"
"standing, seemingly frozen in time.\n"
msgstr ""
"一面因年久失修而濒临坍塌的石墙，不知何故屹立不倒，仿佛凝固在时间里。\n"

#. key: a strange statue
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a strange statue"
msgid ""
"A statue with strange and alien features. Is it because the statue is worn and\n"
"tarnished that it has become so unrecognisable? Or is it that the subject was\n"
"something demonic and evil?\n"
msgstr ""
"这座雕塑看起来非常奇怪诡异。雕塑是因为磨损和失去光泽，就变得如此难以辨认？\n"
"还是它的主题就是什么恶魔和邪恶的东西？\n"

#. key: a strange rock wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a strange rock wall"
msgid ""
"A wall decorated with images you might see in a tomb.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙上装饰着你可能会在坟墓中看到的图像。\n"

#. key: a highly decorated stone wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a highly decorated stone wall"
msgid ""
"A wall covered with disturbing, horrifying images.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙上满是令人不安、恐怖图案。\n"

#. key: the rough-hewn floor
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the rough-hewn floor"
msgid ""
"The floor. It is rough and uneven in places.\n"
msgstr ""
"地面。有些地方粗糙不平。\n"

#. key: viscous fluid
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:viscous fluid"
msgid ""
"A sticky fluid which seems to be secreted by the nearby walls. It looks\n"
"disgusting.\n"
msgstr ""
"这里的墙壁似乎在分泌一种黏性液体。看起来真恶心。\n"

#. key: a sinewy wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a sinewy wall"
msgid ""
"A wall that looks strangely organic, but incredibly tough and durable.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙看起来像奇怪有机体，但却惊人地坚韧。\n"

#. key: a thin membrane
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a thin membrane"
msgid ""
"A strange membrane, thin enough to see through.\n"
msgstr ""
"这层奇怪的膜很薄，可以透过它看东西。\n"

#. key: the pulsating floor
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the pulsating floor"
msgid ""
"The floor. It pulses to an unknown beat.\n"
msgstr ""
"地面。它以未知的节奏搏动着。\n"

#. key: a broken fleshy orifice
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a broken fleshy orifice"
msgid ""
"It seems to be oozing quietly. Best not to touch it.\n"
msgstr ""
"它似乎在悄悄地渗出东西。最好不要碰它。\n"
"An open sea?\n"
"\n"
"虽然这与所有已知的物理和几何理论相悖，但不可否认的是：\n"
"就在这个狭小的空间中，有着一片可怕的茫茫大海，其大小令人难以置信。\n"
"\n"
"话说回来，那也可能只是一面蓝色的墙。\n"

#. key: zonguldrok's gravestone
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zonguldrok's gravestone"
msgid ""
"A gravestone of the house of Zonguldrok, still dripping with brackish ichor.\n"
msgstr ""
"宗古多克家的一块墓碑，上面还滴着微咸的灵液。\n"

#. key: a gravestone
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gravestone"
msgid ""
"A nameless grave.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个无名的墓碑。\n"

#. key: the dimension's edge
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the dimension's edge"
msgid ""
"The edge of this tiny, isolated plane, where space itself dissolves into\n"
"oblivion. Entering or affecting this black void is impossible.\n"
msgstr ""
"在这个孤独的微型位面边缘，就连空间本身就消失在虚无之中。\n"
"你不可能踏入这片黑色虚空，也不可能改变它。\n"

#. key: the damp floor
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the damp floor"
msgid ""
"The floor. It remains forever damp, perhaps due to the humidity or the constant\n"
"flow of clouds.\n"
msgstr ""
"地面。它永远保持潮湿，这可能是因为有潮气或云在不断流动。\n"

#. key: a wall of white crystal
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a wall of white crystal"
msgid ""
"A wall made from low-grade crystal with an opalescent gleam.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙由次等水晶制成，有着乳白色的光芒。\n"

#. key: a black wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a black wall"
msgid ""
"A wall made perhaps from stone, or solid charcoal, or a substance found only in\n"
"the deepest hells.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙可能是由石头或固体木炭或只有在最深处的地狱中才会有的物质制成的。\n"

#. key: a carved rock wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a carved rock wall"
msgid ""
"A wall decorated with images of death and destruction.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙上装饰着死亡和破坏的图案。\n"

#. key: a metal statue
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a metal statue"
msgid ""
"A base type statue for other statue flavours. If you see this, file a bug\n"
"report.\n"
msgstr ""
"一座其他风格雕塑的基本款雕塑。如果你碰到这个，请提交错误报告。\n"

#. key: a dead tree
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a dead tree"
msgid ""
"The dry remains of a long-dead tree.\n"
msgstr ""
"一棵死去已久的树的干枯残骸。\n"

#. key: a dead mangrove
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a dead mangrove"
msgid ""
"The dry remains of a long-dead mangrove.\n"
msgstr ""
"一棵死去已久的红树的干枯残骸。\n"

#. key: an iron statue
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an iron statue"
msgid ""
"A statue of an ancient warrior, festooned with trophies from fallen victims.\n"
"Some dark substance oozes from the gaps in its visor; surely it must be oil..?\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊古代战士的雕像，上面饰有从手下败将那里获得的战利品。\n"
"一些深色物质从其面甲的缝隙渗出，当然，这一定是油……？\n"

#. key: ashen ground
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ashen ground"
msgid ""
"Ash and embers, littered with broken treasures and worthless coins from realms\n"
"long fallen.\n"
msgstr ""
"灰烬和余烬，其中散落着早已陨落的王国的破碎的珍宝和毫无价值的硬币。\n"

#. key: a tempered metal wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a tempered metal wall"
msgid ""
"Walls of brass and nickel, covered in a thin golden foil steadily peeling away\n"
"in the constant, oppressive heat. Designs depict mortals dealing with devils,\n"
"but the former rarely seem to come out ahead on the exchange.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙由黄铜和镍制成，上面覆盖着的一层薄薄金箔在持续的高温下不断脱落。\n"
"图案描绘着凡人与魔鬼在做交易，但前者似乎很少能在交易中占上风。\n"

#. key: an ice-covered rock wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an ice-covered rock wall"
msgid ""
"A rock wall coated in a thick layer of ice. Twisted faces glower beneath the\n"
"surface, locked in perpetual grimaces of rage and betrayal.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面岩墙上有一层厚厚的冰霜。\n"
"表层下有扭曲的脸在怒目而视，这张愤怒和背叛的怪相永远被定格着。\n"

#. key: an ice-covered stone wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an ice-covered stone wall"
msgid ""
"A stone wall coated in a thick layer of ice. Twisted faces glower beneath the\n"
"surface, locked in perpetual grimaces of rage and betrayal.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面石墙上有一层厚厚的冰霜。\n"
"表层下有扭曲的脸在怒目而视，这张愤怒和背叛的怪相永远被定格着。\n"

#. key: frost-covered floor
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frost-covered floor"
msgid ""
"Earth locked within perpetual frost and cold. It seems ageless and changeless,\n"
"as though it has existed in this state for an eternity.\n"
msgstr ""
"这片地面永远被凝结在冰霜和寒冷之中。\n"
"它似乎是永驻的、不变的，仿佛这种状态已存在了永恒的时光。\n"

#. key: a golden statue
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a golden statue"
msgid ""
"A solid gold statue of a saint.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊纯金的圣人雕像。\n"

#. key: a silver statue
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a silver statue"
msgid ""
"A geometric statue of solid silver, in both material and form championing\n"
"security and stasis.\n"
msgstr ""
"一座由纯银制成的几何图形状雕塑，无论是材质还是形式，都在颂扬安全和静止。\n"

#. key: a scintillating statue
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a scintillating statue"
msgid ""
"A magically shifting statue seemingly content to glimmer and dance in place,\n"
"dedicated to the ineffable cosmic games of chaos.\n"
msgstr ""
"一座神奇的变幻着的雕塑，似乎满足于在此为难以言喻的宇宙混乱游戏献上微光和舞蹈。\n"

#. key: an arcane conduit
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an arcane conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its destructive mystic\n"
"energy will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇怪但坚固的金属结构，在收集和分析原始的环境魔法能量。\n"
"如果它被足够强大的魔法摧毁破坏，其神秘的破坏性能量会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: a misfortune conduit
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a misfortune conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its malevolent cursed\n"
"energy will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇怪但坚固的金属结构，在收集和分析原始的环境魔法能量。\n"
"如果它被足够强大的魔法摧毁破坏，其恶毒的诅咒能量会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: a dimensional conduit
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a dimensional conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its extraplanar warp\n"
"energy will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇怪但坚固的金属结构，在收集和分析原始的环境魔法能量。\n"
"如果它被足够强大的魔法摧毁破坏，其界外能量会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: a soul conduit
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a soul conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its negative energy will\n"
"harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇怪但坚固的金属结构，在收集和分析原始的环境魔法能量。\n"
"如果它被足够强大的魔法摧毁破坏，其负能量会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: an alchemical conduit
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an alchemical conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its venomous churning\n"
"energy will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇怪但坚固的金属结构，在收集和分析原始的环境魔法能量。\n"
"如果它被足够强大的魔法摧毁破坏，其搅动的有毒能量会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: a fiery conduit
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a fiery conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its ever-burning energy\n"
"will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇怪但坚固的金属结构，在收集和分析原始的环境魔法能量。\n"
"如果它被足够强大的魔法摧毁破坏，其不断燃烧的能量会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: an icy conduit
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an icy conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its chilling cold energy\n"
"will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇怪但坚固的金属结构，在收集和分析原始的环境魔法能量。\n"
"如果它被足够强大的魔法摧毁破坏，其冷酷的能量会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: an earthen conduit
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an earthen conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its seismic energy will\n"
"harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇怪但坚固的金属结构，在收集和分析原始的环境魔法能量。\n"
"如果它被足够强大的魔法摧毁破坏，其地震的能量会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: a storm conduit
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a storm conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its crackling energy will\n"
"harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇怪但坚固的金属结构，在收集和分析原始的环境魔法能量。\n"
"如果它被足够强大的魔法摧毁破坏，其爆裂的能量会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: a bedevilled crystal wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a bedevilled crystal wall"
msgid ""
"A wall made from shimmering crystal, from which some demonic plane peers out.\n"
"While its composition both make it resist destruction plus reflect both fire and\n"
"cold, the otherworldly forces within it seem to be entirely harmless... from\n"
"this end, anyway.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙由散发微光的水晶制成，一些恶魔位面从中向外隐现。\n"
"虽然它的组成成分既能抵抗破坏，又能反射火和寒，\n"
"但它内部的异界力量似乎完全无害……至少是就这一端而言。\n"

#. key: a silver wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a silver wall"
msgid ""
"A wall made of pure silver.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙由纯银制成。\n"

#. key: a rune-carved stone wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a rune-carved stone wall"
msgid ""
"A strangely slime-free stone wall, carved all over with countless protective\n"
"runes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一面奇怪的没有黏液的石墙，上面刻满了无数保护符文。\n"

#. key: a rune-carved clear stone wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a rune-carved clear stone wall"
msgid ""
"A strangely slime-free stone wall, with strange lights twinkling within its\n"
"airy confines. Mystical runes are scattered across its surface, seemingly\n"
"referring to a 'Royal Jelly'.\n"
msgstr ""
"一面奇怪的没有黏液的石墙，在它的流通区域，闪着奇异的光。\n"
"上面散布着的神秘符文，似乎在谈及一个“皇家胶冻”。\n"

#. key: a sarcophagus
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a sarcophagus"
msgid ""
"An ancient sarcophagus. It appears to be empty.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个古代的石棺。它似乎是空的。\n"

#. key: a heavily etched metal wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a heavily etched metal wall"
msgid ""
"A metal wall etched with murals depicting, in great and gruesome detail,\n"
"exactly what will be done to anyone caught stealing from the Vaults.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面金属墙上蚀刻着壁画，\n"
"以极其可怕的细节描绘着从宝库中盗窃被抓的人的悲惨下场。\n"

#. key: a heavily etched crystal wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a heavily etched crystal wall"
msgid ""
"A crystal wall etched with murals depicting, in great and gruesome detail,\n"
"exactly what will be done to anyone caught stealing from the Vaults.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面水晶墙上蚀刻着壁画，\n"
"以极其可怕的细节描绘着从宝库中盗窃被抓的人的悲惨下场。\n"

#. key: an adventurer's gravestone
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an adventurer's gravestone"
msgid ""
"The grave of an adventurer who came close to victory.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个坟墓埋葬着一位功亏一篑的冒险者。\n"

#. key: an elephant-shaped statue
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an elephant-shaped statue"
msgid ""
"A worn granite statue depicting an elephant standing guard.\n"
msgstr ""
"这座有些磨损的花岗岩雕塑刻画着一头大象在放哨。\n"

#. key: a weirdly glowing ball
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a weirdly glowing ball"
msgid ""
"A floating ball radiating with shimmering light.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个悬在半空中的球体散发着微光。\n"

#. key: a sealed sarcophagus
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a sealed sarcophagus"
msgid ""
"An ancient sarcophagus. It is sealed shut.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个古代的石棺。它密封着。\n"

#. key: a spawn point
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a spawn point"
msgid ""
"An entrance that the opposition may appear from.\n"
msgstr ""
"敌人可能会入场的地方。\n"

#. key: an exit from the tutorial
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an exit from the tutorial"
msgid ""
"A way out of the dungeon, letting you finish this lesson.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条路带你离开地牢，这样，这一课就结束了。\n"

#. key: haloed
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:haloed"
msgid ""
"This area is lit by a divine halo, decreasing your stealth, preventing\n"
"invisibility, and increasing the accuracy of attacks against any illuminated\n"
"creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"这片区域被神圣光环照亮，会削弱你的潜行能力，且阻止隐身，\n"
"并增加任何被照亮的生物的攻击精度。\n"

#. key: umbraed
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:umbraed"
msgid ""
"This area is wreathed by an umbra, improving your stealth if you are attuned to\n"
"the shadows, and decreasing the accuracy of attacks by those unattuned to the\n"
"shadows.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个区域被本影环绕，如果你被阴影所遮蔽，你的潜行能力得到提升，\n"
"那些无法适应阴影的怪物的攻击精度会降低。\n"

#. key: liquefied
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:liquefied"
msgid ""
"The ground here is liquefied, making movement slow and causing any attempts to\n"
"attack in melee to sometimes fail.\n"
msgstr ""
"这片地面被液化，移动会被减缓，发出任何近战攻击都有可能失手。\n"

#. key: disjunction haloed
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:disjunction haloed"
msgid ""
"This area is bathed in translocational energy, causing creatures to blink away\n"
"from the originator of the energy with an increasing chance the closer they are\n"
"to the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个区域暴露在移位能量中，\n"
"能量的发出者那里的生物会被闪送，距离施法者越近，几率就越大。\n"

#. key: ice covered
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice covered"
msgid ""
"This wall is covered in magical ice that freezes victims who wander nearby.\n"
"This damage bypasses any armour the target may have, and will slow cold-blooded\n"
"creatures. Each victim is only ever affected by one icy wall at a time.\n"
"\n"
"The creator of this icy covering and any of their allies can walk safely past\n"
"this wall.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙上覆盖着有魔力的冰，会冻结在附近徘徊的受害者。\n"
"这种伤害能无视目标可能拥有的任何护甲，还会暂时减缓冷血动物的速度。\n"
"每个受害者一次只能受到一堵冰墙的影响。\n"
"\n"
"墙上覆着的这种冰的创造者及其任何盟友都可以安全地经过这面墙。\n"

#. key: awoken
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:awoken"
msgid ""
"This tree has been temporarily enchanted to grant it some limited motility,\n"
"allowing it to lash out out at any adjacent enemies of the creature who awoke\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这棵树被暂时注入魔力，从而获得一些有限的活动能力，\n"
"它会猛烈攻击任何相邻的与唤醒它的生物为敌的怪物。\n"

#. key: tree burning
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tree burning"
msgid ""
"It is susceptible to bolts of lightning and to sufficiently intense sources of\n"
"fire. The resulting blaze can flare up, spreading to areas nearby and igniting\n"
"other trees.\n"
msgstr ""
"它容易受到闪电和足够强烈的火源的影响。\n"
"由此产生的大火可能会蔓延到附近区域，引燃其他树木。\n"

#. key: mangrove burning
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mangrove burning"
msgid ""
"It is susceptible to bolts of lightning and to sufficiently intense sources of\n"
"fire. Mangroves do not burn as vigorously as normal trees, due to growing on\n"
"swampy terrain, and leave behind shallow water after they smoulder.\n"
msgstr ""
"它容易受到闪电和足够强烈的火源的影响。\n"
"由于生长在沼泽地带，红树燃烧起来不像普通树木那样旺盛，在闷烧后会留下浅水。\n"

#. key: demonic tree burning
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonic tree burning"
msgid ""
"It is susceptible to bolts of lightning and to sufficiently intense sources of\n"
"fire. Burning this tree releases a cloud of pure chaos instead of flames.\n"
msgstr ""
"它容易受到闪电和足够强烈的火源的影响。\n"
"这棵树燃烧会释放出纯粹的混乱云而不是火焰云。\n"

#. key: acid dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:acid dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of an acid dragon. Although it does not provide its wearer with as\n"
"much protection as the armour made from the scales of some larger dragons, it is\n"
"somewhat lighter and less encumbering. It is also remarkably smooth, letting\n"
"corrosive slime flow off it like water.\n"
msgstr ""
"一套酸龙鳞甲。尽管它不像一些由更大的龙的鳞片制成的护甲那样，\n"
"能为穿戴者提供更多的防护，但它却更轻便、妨碍也更少。\n"
"它也非常光滑，腐蚀性的黏液会像水那样从上面流走。\n"

#. key: amulet of faith
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of faith"
msgid ""
"A charm crafted to call the attention of the gods to its wearer. This divine\n"
"attention makes it easier to please your god, but your god will also take more\n"
"notice of your transgressions. The amulet will drain some of your divine favour\n"
"when removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个精致的护身符旨在引起神对佩戴者的留意。\n"
"在神的注意下会更易取悦你的神，但神也会更容易察觉到你的冒犯。\n"
"当这个护身符被取下时，神会减少对你的好感。\n"

#. key: amulet of guardian spirit
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of guardian spirit"
msgid ""
"An amulet containing a protective spirit which will cause any damage taken to\n"
"be divided between the wearer's reserves of health and magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个护身符含有守护之灵，\n"
"它能让佩戴者的生命和魔力储备分摊承受受到的任何伤害。\n"

#. key: amulet of magic regeneration
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of magic regeneration"
msgid ""
"An amulet that increases the wearer's rate of magic regeneration. In order to\n"
"function, it must first attune itself to the wearer's body with full reserves\n"
"of magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个护身符可以提升佩戴者的魔力恢复速度。\n"
"它只有在魔力已满后佩戴，才能与身体相协调从而发挥作用。\n"

#. key: amulet of nothing
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of nothing"
msgid ""
"An amulet with no special properties.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个护身符没有特殊属性。\n"

#. key: amulet of reflection
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of reflection"
msgid ""
"An amulet which improves its wearer's ability to shield against attacks. If\n"
"no shield is worn, the force the amulet emits can serve as a weak shield on\n"
"its own. Regardless, any ranged attacks the wearer blocks will be reflected\n"
"back toward the attacker.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个护身符可以提升佩戴者格挡攻击的能力。\n"
"如果没有装备盾牌，这个护身符本身就相当于较弱的盾牌。\n"
"无论如何，任何以佩戴者为目标的远程攻击，都会返给攻击者。\n"

#. key: amulet of regeneration
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of regeneration"
msgid ""
"An amulet that increases the wearer's rate of health regeneration. In order to\n"
"function, it must first attune itself to the wearer's body at full health.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个护身符可以增加佩戴者的生命值恢复速度。\n"
"它只有在生命值已满后佩戴，才能与身体相协调从而发挥作用。\n"

#. key: amulet of the acrobat
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of the acrobat"
msgid ""
"An amulet that allows the user to tumble and roll to evade the blows of their\n"
"enemies, but only while moving and waiting. While taking other actions\n"
"(including climbing stairs) the amulet conveys no benefits.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个护身符，能让佩戴者以翻滚的方式躲避敌人的攻击，\n"
"但这只会在移动和等待时生效。在进行其他动作（包括爬楼梯）时，\n"
"这个护身符并不会带来相应正面效果。\n"

#. key: animal skin
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:animal skin"
msgid ""
"A large piece of thick skin covered in fur, cut from the corpse of an animal\n"
"and worn as a primitive garment. It offers rudimentary protection against harm,\n"
"but, having never been tanned, it carries a light stench of rotting flesh.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个从动物的尸体上切下的大块厚皮，上面还有毛，作为简陋的衣着。\n"
"它也能提供基础的保护以抵挡伤害。\n"
"由于没有鞣制过，这东西闻起来有一点腐肉的味道。\n"

#. key: arbalest
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:arbalest"
msgid ""
"A large piece of machinery used for firing bolts, braced with steel and cranked\n"
"with a windlass. It takes some time to load and fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"一架用于发射箭矢巨大的器械，钢铁构造，用曲柄转动绞盘。\n"
"装填和发射都需要一些时间。\n"

#. key: azure gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:azure gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"As clear and blue as a cloudless sky or a depthless sea, this gem holds its\n"
"secrets locked within impenetrable depths.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"这颗宝石像万里无云的天空或深不可测的大海那样清澈湛蓝，\n"
"它那难以穿透的深处隐藏着不为人知的秘密。\n"

#. key: bardiche
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bardiche"
msgid ""
"A long pole with an enormous, cleaving blade on one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根长柄，它的一端带有一个巨大的砍刃。\n"

#. key: barding
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:barding"
msgid ""
"Armour for the scaly midsections of nagas and centaurs.\n"
msgstr ""
"适用于纳迦和甲马身体中段的鳞片状的护甲。\n"

#. key: battleaxe
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:battleaxe"
msgid ""
"A large war axe with a formidable double-sided head.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把有着令人生畏的双面斧头的大型战斧。\n"

#. key: blade talisman
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blade talisman"
msgid ""
"A jagged cluster of blades, almost impossible to grasp without injury. Causes\n"
"long, needle-thin blades to grow from the wearer's body, allowing them to\n"
"perform rapid auxiliary melee attacks and even parry blows. Having so many\n"
"fragments of metal inside one's body reduces the effectiveness of body armour,\n"
"but Shapeshifting skill mitigates this effect as well as increases the damage\n"
"dealt.\n"
msgstr ""
"锯齿状的一簇刀片，很难抓着它而不受伤。\n"
"{{\n"
"    local hands = you.hand() .. \"s\"\n"
"    return \"长长的、针般薄的刀片从\" ..\n"
"           \"使用者的\" .. hands\n"
"}}中生出，更小的金属碎片会在他们体内生长，使其变形并降低铠甲的效力。\n"
"随着变身技能的提升，会减轻并最终消除后一种效果，并增加造成的伤害。\n"
"\n"
"变形后，装备的武器、盾牌和手套都会被融合。\n"

#. key: book of air
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of air"
msgid ""
"A primer on the elemental magics of Air. The great minotaur hero Vuxhurn, given\n"
"a copy of this book while trapped atop the tower of a wizard with a particularly\n"
"perverse sense of humour, used its pages to construct a rudimentary glider and\n"
"soared to freedom.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本气元素魔法的入门读物。\n"
"伟大的牛头人英雄乌克斯胡恩被困在一个有着特别过分的幽默感的巫师塔塔顶时，\n"
"得到了这本书的副本，他用这本书的书页搭建了一个简陋的滑翔机，飞向了自由。\n"

#. key: book of annihilations
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of annihilations"
msgid ""
"A tome of arcane fury, greatly sought after by sorcerers. It allows the gifted\n"
"and resourceful to conjure destruction with ease.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本关于奥术狂暴的巨著，深受术士追捧。有天赋和机敏的人能凭借它轻易唤起毁灭。\n"

#. key: book of armaments
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of armaments"
msgid ""
"A book describing various magical arms and armours. It was written in the midst\n"
"of a particularly bloody civil war, and the text is made substantially less\n"
"helpful by its author's frequent digressions describing the crimes committed by\n"
"the other side.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本描述各种魔法武器和盔甲的书。\n"
"它是在一场特别血腥的内战中写成的，\n"
"由于作者频繁地离题描述对方所犯下的罪行，文本在很大程度上不太有帮助。\n"

#. key: book of battle
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of battle"
msgid ""
"An astonishingly vain and self-aggrandising work. The author claims credit for a\n"
"wide swathe of weapon-augmenting magics, but seems to have misunderstood or\n"
"misrepresented most of them. Only a few of the spells described in the book\n"
"actually work.\n"
msgstr ""
"一部极其自负、自我膨胀的作品。作者声称这一系列武器增强魔法归功于他，\n"
"但从这本书来看，作者似乎不理解或误传了其中大部分内容。\n"
"这本书中描述的咒语中只有少数能起作用。\n"

#. key: book of beasts
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of beasts"
msgid ""
"A book of spells focused on the summoning of beasts. Its pages nip at careless\n"
"readers' fingers.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本专注于野兽召唤术的书。它的书页会夹住粗心读者的手指。\n"

#. key: book of blasting
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of blasting"
msgid ""
"A book of spells used to set off powerful explosions. This edition's binder\n"
"was careful to pad the cover, so that if its reader lacked sufficient caution,\n"
"the book, at least, would survive.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本关于制造强大爆炸的魔法书。这一版本的装订工小心地给封面包着护垫，\n"
"这样即使读者不够小心，至少这本书能保留下来。\n"

#. key: book of blood
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of blood"
msgid ""
"A book of works dedicated to the manipulation of blood, both that of the caster\n"
"and of creatures with particularly unusual ichor flowing through their veins.\n"
"Some claim it to have been composed by the vampire lord Jory, but it's unclear\n"
"why he would deign to share his secrets with others.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本关于操控血液的书，包括施法者的和血管中流着不寻常灵液的生物的血液。\n"
"有些人声称它是由吸血鬼领主乔里创作的，\n"
"但不清楚他为什么要屈尊于与他人分享其秘密。\n"

#. key: book of burglary
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of burglary"
msgid ""
"A book containing spells useful for theft, breaking and entering, and other\n"
"miscellaneous larceny.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书收录了多种关于偷盗、破坏、入室等各种行窃的实用法术。\n"

#. key: book of callings
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of callings"
msgid ""
"An introductory text on the magical summoning of beasts and beings from other\n"
"realms.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书阐述了用魔力召唤野兽和来自其他领域的生物。\n"

#. key: book of cantrips
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of cantrips"
msgid ""
"A book containing a small selection of very basic magic spells, intended for\n"
"beginners who wish to learn the rudiments of one of the featured magical\n"
"schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书面向想要学习某一特色魔法流派基本原理的初学者，\n"
"包含一些非常基础的魔法。\n"

#. key: book of chaos
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of chaos"
msgid ""
"A book of spells that leave the caster's surroundings in a state of complete\n"
"disarray. It's not clear why anyone would write such a thing, but it's here.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本能让施法者周围一片混乱的魔法书。\n"
"不清楚为什么会有人写这样的东西，但它就是在这里。\n"

#. key: book of conjurations
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of conjurations"
msgid ""
"A book containing an introduction to the destructive magical arts of\n"
"Conjurations.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本介绍塑能系的破坏性法术的书。\n"

#. key: book of dangerous friends
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of dangerous friends"
msgid ""
"A book describing the creation and use of magical entities best kept at arm's\n"
"reach. Or, preferably, even farther.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本描述创造和利用魔法造物的书，最好放在伸手可及的地方。\n"
"或许，放在更远的地方更可取。\n"

#. key: book of death
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of death"
msgid ""
"A manuscript containing dark spells of Necromancy. Each page is filled with\n"
"grotesque art depicting scenes of disgusting decay.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个记载黑暗的死灵术咒语的手稿。\n"
"每一页都以怪诞的风格绘满了令人作呕的腐烂场景。\n"

#. key: book of debilitation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of debilitation"
msgid ""
"A spellbook containing spells known for having a particularly unpleasant\n"
"effect on their victims. It's considered something of a faux pas in the\n"
"wizarding community to be seen with this book in one's collection.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本包含能对受击者产生特别不愉快效果的咒语的魔法书。\n"
"在巫师界，如果有人看到有谁收藏了这本书，会认为这种行为有失体统。\n"

#. key: book of decay
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of decay"
msgid ""
"A book of Necromancy, dictated by the god Kikubaaqudgha to an unfortunate\n"
"apostle across the course of a nine-day fugue. The necromancer is said to have\n"
"finished the dread work with their own life's blood... but of course this is\n"
"just a copy, written in almost entirely normal ink.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本死灵之书，由奇库巴库哈神在九天的神游过程中传述给一个不幸的门徒。\n"
"据说，死灵法师是用他们的鲜血完成了这个可怕的工作……\n"
"当然，这本书只是副本，几乎完全是用正常的墨水写成的。\n"

#. key: book of displacement
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of displacement"
msgid ""
"A book of spells to bring others closer, or sometimes farther, depending on the\n"
"user's whim.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本魔法书，旨在拉近或移送敌人，而具体怎么使用取决于使用者的念头。\n"

#. key: book of dreams
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of dreams"
msgid ""
"The somniloquent utterings of a famed mystic, using uniquely bizarre imagery\n"
"and cryptic digressions to describe spells drawn from the mystic's visions.\n"
msgstr ""
"本书收录了一位秘术师在神游时的呓语，\n"
"以奇异的意象和迷离的旁逸描述着他眼中浮现的咒语。\n"

#. key: book of fire
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of fire"
msgid ""
"A book containing advanced spells in the elemental school of Fire, stolen from\n"
"the secret college of the djinn.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本窃于灯神的秘密学院的书，包含火系魔法学派的高级咒语。\n"

#. key: book of fixed level
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of fixed level"
msgid ""
"A book of magic spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本魔法书。\n"

#. key: book of fixed theme
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of fixed theme"
msgid ""
"A book of magic spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本魔法书。\n"

#. key: book of flames
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of flames"
msgid ""
"The standard text used in arcane academies by students of the elemental magic\n"
"of Fire. Readers are recommended to wear a pair of insulated gloves.\n"
msgstr ""
"火系魔法学徒在奥术学院使用的标准读本。建议读者戴上隔热手套。\n"

#. key: book of frost
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of frost"
msgid ""
"A book of magic spells, often used as an introduction to the elemental magics\n"
"of Ice. Its pages feel unusually brittle, as if they'd crumble at a touch.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本魔法书，通常用作冰系魔法的入门读物。它的页面异常地脆，仿佛一碰就碎了。\n"

#. key: book of geomancy
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of geomancy"
msgid ""
"A book containing basic spells involving the element of Earth. Readers are\n"
"recommended to wear a pair of gardening gloves.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书中包含着基础的土元素咒语。建议读者戴上园艺手套。\n"

#. key: book of hexes
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of hexes"
msgid ""
"A spellbook containing an assortment of powerful Hexes, which sparkles and\n"
"shimmers as the pages are flipped.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本包含各种强大的妖术的魔法书，翻页时会闪闪发光。\n"

#. key: book of ice
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of ice"
msgid ""
"A book of advanced magical spells using the element of Ice. Readers are\n"
"recommended to wear a pair of warm gloves.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本关于运用冰元素的高级魔法书。建议读者戴上暖和的手套。\n"

#. key: book of iron
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of iron"
msgid ""
"An ancient, metal-bound spellbook, covered in dark red blotches. Are they\n"
"rust stains, or..?\n"
msgstr ""
"一本用金属装订的古老魔法书，上面有着深红色的斑点。它们是锈斑还是……？\n"

#. key: book of lightning
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of lightning"
msgid ""
"A book that fairly crackles with arcane power.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书上面的奥术能量在噼啪作响。\n"

#. key: book of minor magic
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of minor magic"
msgid ""
"A spellbook containing a variety of simple but useful magical incantations.\n"
"Many prominent spellcasters used this book to begin their arcane studies.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本魔法书中包含许多简单但实用的咒语。\n"
"许多著名的施法者都以这本书入门，开始他们的奥术研究。\n"

#. key: book of misfortune
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of misfortune"
msgid ""
"A spellbook dedicated to the art of inflicting creative calamities on one's\n"
"foes. Superstitious wizards claim that the book itself actually absorbs ill\n"
"fortune and carry it around as a good-luck charm, but the effects of this\n"
"seem subtle at best.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本魔法书致力于创造灾祸，施加到敌人头上。\n"
"迷信的巫师声称，这本书实际上是在吸收着厄运，并把它作为护身符随身携带，\n"
"但其效果充其量只能说是很微妙。\n"

#. key: book of necromancy
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of necromancy"
msgid ""
"A macabre book containing basic Necromancy spells. Readers are recommended to\n"
"wear a pair of gloves they don't mind disposing of afterward.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本可怕的书，包含着基础的死灵术。建议读者戴上用后不介意丢掉的手套。\n"

#. key: book of party tricks
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of party tricks"
msgid ""
"A book containing a variety of fun spells guaranteed to liven up any wizarding\n"
"party, as well as a number of toasts, jokes, and party games.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书中，包含各种保证能使任何巫师聚会活跃起来的有趣魔法，\n"
"还有许多祝酒词、笑话和派对游戏。\n"

#. key: book of power
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of power"
msgid ""
"A book of powerful and destructive magic spells, rumbling and shuddering with\n"
"barely-contained energies.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本关于强大而具有破坏性的魔法的书，隆隆作响，\n"
"因勉强克制着其中的能量而颤动着。\n"

#. key: book of scorching
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of scorching"
msgid ""
"A magical book, blasted and scoured by long exposure to the desert sun. Upon\n"
"its badly-weathered pages lie the secrets to inflicting the desert's dangers\n"
"upon the caster's foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本魔法书，由于长期暴露在沙漠的阳光下而碎裂、褪色。\n"
"在它那饱经风吹日晒的书页上，有着将沙漠的威胁施加给施法者敌人的秘密。\n"

#. key: book of sloth
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of sloth"
msgid ""
"A lazily written book.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本懒散地写下的书。\n"

#. key: book of spatial translocations
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of spatial translocations"
msgid ""
"A basic spellbook on the magical field of Translocations. Many would-be mages\n"
"have seen it disappear just as they needed it most.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本关于移位系魔法的初级魔法书。\n"
"许多即将成为法师的人在最需要它的时候，它却凭空消失了。\n"

#. key: book of spectacle
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of spectacle"
msgid ""
"A book covered in glittering sequins. An impromptu lightshow bursts from every\n"
"page, clearly reserving this book for only the tackiest of wizards.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书上满是闪烁的亮片。每翻动一页就有一阵即兴的灯光秀，\n"
"显然它是最俗气的巫师留下的。\n"

#. key: book of spontaneous combustion
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of spontaneous combustion"
msgid ""
"A heavy tome written with wildly flammable ink. Care must be taken even opening\n"
"it, but the power of the spells described therein is undeniable.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"Its desiccated pages smell faintly of sulphur.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"一本厚重的巨著，干燥的书页散发着淡淡的硫磺味。书写这本书所用的墨水非常易燃，\n"
"即便只是打开它也必须要小心，但书中记录的咒语的威力却是毋庸置疑的。\n"

#. key: book of the spheres
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of the spheres"
msgid ""
"A book containing a well-rounded collection of sphere-related spells. Its\n"
"final pages begin to describe a spell titled 'Summon Orb of Zot', but sadly,\n"
"the remainder of the book has been completely vaporised.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书中包含着与球体相关的详尽的咒语。\n"
"它的最后几页写着一个名为“召唤佐特宝珠”的咒语，\n"
"但遗憾的是，这本书的剩余部分已经完全蒸发了。\n"

#. key: book of storms
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of storms"
msgid ""
"A book written by the magician Lan Shi, who was preoccupied with the study and\n"
"control of natural phenomena. Most of Shi's works have been lost, but those\n"
"still remaining are treasured by wizards lucky (or unscrupulous) enough to get\n"
"their hands on a copy.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书由魔法师兰石编写，他致力于研究和控制自然现象。\n"
"石的大部分作品已经失传，但仍有些被幸运（或不道德）的巫师收藏着，\n"
"因此能够从中获得一份副本。\n"

#. key: book of the dragon
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of the dragon"
msgid ""
"A magical book of spells which allow some command over dragons and their\n"
"aspects.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本写有控制龙和其他关于龙的咒语的魔法书。\n"

#. key: book of the wilderness
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of the wilderness"
msgid ""
"A book holding lore ripped from distant and untamed lands, allowing their\n"
"denizens to be called forth to serve the reader.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"It smells distressingly musty.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"这本记载着传说的书是从遥远的蛮荒土地上撕扯过来的，\n"
"可以把那里的生物召唤来为读者服务。\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"它有股难闻的霉味。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: book of the earth
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of the earth"
msgid ""
"A guide to drawing immense power from the depths of the earth. The original was\n"
"written as a collaboration between the hill dwarves and the mountain dwarves, but\n"
"its compilation was cut short when a massive wave of earthquakes plunged the hill\n"
"dwarves' civilisation into ruin.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本指南从大地深处汲取了巨大的力量。它原本由丘陵矮人和山地矮人合著，\n"
"但由于一波巨大的地震毁灭了他们的文明，编纂时间被缩短了。\n"

#. key: book of the hunter
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of the hunter"
msgid ""
"A mundane book on hunting. Someone has gone through and covered the book in\n"
"corrections and scathing criticisms, crossing out entire sections in favour of\n"
"spells that accomplish the same task.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本关于狩猎的平淡无奇的书。\n"
"有人翻阅完这本书，所做的修正和严厉的批评涂满了整本书，\n"
"甚至还划掉了整个章节，换用了能完成相同任务的咒语。\n"

#. key: book of the moon
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of the moon"
msgid ""
"A book written by a mad wizard, who had become convinced that the moon far above\n"
"was composed, not of shining light, but of rock as solid as that beneath one's feet.\n"
"Many of the pages have been mangled beyond recognition, seemingly shredded by a\n"
"pair of powerful claws... but what would a troll be doing with a spellbook?\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书由一位疯狂的巫师所写，他深信天边的月亮不是由闪亮的光构成的，\n"
"而是像脚下那样坚硬的岩石构成的。\n"
"许多书页已被撕得面目全非，这似乎是被一对有力的爪子撕碎的……\n"
"但巨魔拿着一本魔法书做什么？\n"

#. key: book of the senses
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of the senses"
msgid ""
"A scholarly work, describing the senses used by living creatures to perceive the\n"
"world around them. A handful of spells are included to demonstrate the principles\n"
"being described.\n"
msgstr ""
"这部学术作品，描述着生物用来感知周围世界的器官。\n"
"它包含了一些咒语，以演示其所描述的原理。\n"

#. key: book of transmutation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of transmutation"
msgid ""
"A meticulous compendium of research notes, filled with formulae for decomposing\n"
"and reconstituting all manner of substances. It was written by one of the\n"
"legendary alchemists among the sludge elves, before that species mysteriously\n"
"vanished from the world. The author appears to have had a strange obsession with\n"
"becoming a butterfly, but even if their ultimate aim eluded them, many of the\n"
"spells detailed therein are nonetheless quite practical.\n"
msgstr ""
"一份细致的研究笔记摘要，里面充满了分解和重组各种物质的公式。\n"
"作者似乎对变成蜘蛛有一种奇怪的痴迷，\n"
"但即使他们的最终目标没能实现，书中详述的许多咒语仍然相当实用。\n"

#. key: book of the tundra
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of the tundra"
msgid ""
"A frost-gripped tome describing icy spells, somewhat abridged. The Vaults are\n"
"said to hold the full text, but the guardians of that place guard their\n"
"treasures jealously.\n"
msgstr ""
"一部结满冰霜的巨著，上面描写着冰系魔法，有些删节。\n"
"据说宝库里藏有全文，但那里的守卫对他们的宝藏严加保护。\n"

#. key: book of the warp
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of the warp"
msgid ""
"A book of advanced Translocations spells, written by a particularly\n"
"misanthropic mage. After its completion, they were never seen again, which may\n"
"or may not have been the point.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本高级移位魔法书，由一位特别蔑视世人的法师所写。\n"
"编写完成后，他们再也没出现过，这可能是也可能不是重点。\n"

#. key: book of touch
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of touch"
msgid ""
"A book describing spells requiring very close proximity to their target. The\n"
"author seems to have had a low opinion of their wizardly peers, and spends much\n"
"of the text describing the hygiene and social etiquette needed to enter close\n"
"proximity to other sentient beings.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书描述着需要邻近目标才能施放的咒语。作者似乎对他的同辈巫师评价很低，\n"
"还花了大量篇幅描述了接近其他有意识的生物所需的卫生和社交礼仪。\n"

#. key: book of unlife
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of unlife"
msgid ""
"An unholy book describing a variety of magical methods for the creation and\n"
"command of undead servants.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本邪恶的书描述了各种制造以及控制亡灵仆从的方法。\n"

#. key: book of vapours
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of vapours"
msgid ""
"A book of magic spells for creating an assortment of clouds, vapours and mists.\n"
"It is difficult to read, as the text is frequently interrupted by descriptions\n"
"of unusually-shaped clouds the author spotted while writing.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本关于创造各种云雾和蒸汽的魔法书。\n"
"它很难阅读，因为文本经常被打断，作者常常插叙在写作时碰到的奇形怪状的云。\n"

#. key: book of weapons
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of weapons"
msgid ""
"A book of spells used by rebels against an ancient and evil empire. The rebels\n"
"were crushed, but this book was rediscovered years later, found by paladins of\n"
"the crusade that finally destroyed the empire and slew its immortal twin\n"
"sovereigns.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本被叛军用来对付一个古老、邪恶的帝国的魔法书。\n"
"叛军被击溃，但这本书却被圣战的骑士发现，得以重见天日，\n"
"最终帝国覆灭，不朽的孪生君主被杀死。\n"

#. key: book of winter
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of winter"
msgid ""
"A book of spells written by the sorceress Ellawe, who sought to use her time\n"
"productively while trapped inside by particularly harsh weather for over six\n"
"months. A postscript details the bloody vengeance she took after discovering\n"
"the weather mage responsible.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本魔法书由女术师埃拉薇撰写，\n"
"她在被困在特别恶劣的天气中的六个多月里，试图利用好这段自己的时间。\n"
"后记详细描述了她在发现罪魁祸首是天气法师后，进行的血腥的报复。\n"

#. key: boomerang
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:boomerang"
msgid ""
"A curved, flat, throwing baton designed to return to its user.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个弯曲的、扁平的投掷短棒，其设计使它能回到使用者手上。\n"

#. key: box of beasts
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:box of beasts"
msgid ""
"A box filled with the bizarre leftovers of a depraved wizard's magical\n"
"experimentations. Opening it might set loose a friendly mutant beast: bizarre\n"
"creatures, each with their own combination of traits. Increased skill with\n"
"Evocations will allow stronger beasts to be released.\n"
"\n"
"There are six known traits:\n"
" * Bat beasts fly and move very quickly, but erratically.\n"
" * Fire beasts resist and breathe fire.\n"
" * Ox beasts resist cold, are armoured with thick fur, and can knock back foes.\n"
" * Shock beasts resist electricity and can transform into living lightning.\n"
" * Sting beasts resist poison and have a reaching poison-tail attack.\n"
" * Weird beasts can see invisible and attack with constricting tentacles.\n"
"\n"
"As far as anyone knows, all beasts have exactly two of these traits.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个盒子里满是堕落巫师的奇异实验残留。打开它会释放一只友好的变异兽：\n"
"每只奇异的生物都有自己的一套特质。激活技能越强，释放出的野兽就越强。\n"
"\n"
"有六种已知的特质：\n"
" ＊蝙蝠野兽能飞行且十分迅捷，但行动失序。\n"
" ＊火焰野兽能抵抗、喷吐火焰。\n"
" ＊公牛野兽耐寒，皮毛厚实，能击退敌人。\n"
" ＊电击野兽能抵抗电流并能变形成活体闪电。\n"
" ＊刺叮野兽有着毒抗并用毒性尾刺进行攻击。\n"
" ＊诡秘野兽能看见隐形并用触手进行束缚攻击。\n"
"\n"
"众所周知，任何野兽都恰好具有二种特质。\n"

#. key: broad axe
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:broad axe"
msgid ""
"An axe with langets, spikes, a lengthed haft and a single-bladed crescent head.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把带有细金属条、尖刺和一个月牙状的刃的长柄斧子。\n"

#. key: buckler
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:buckler"
msgid ""
"A small piece of wood and metal, to be strapped on one arm for defence.\n"
msgstr ""
"一小块木头和金属，通过绑在一只手臂上进行防御。\n"

#. key: chain mail
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:chain mail"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour made entirely out of tiny metal rings.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件完全用小金属环制成的护甲。\n"

#. key: cloak
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak"
msgid ""
"A cloth cloak.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件布披风。\n"

#. key: club
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:club"
msgid ""
"A heavy piece of wood. While clubs are rather primitive weapons, bashing\n"
"someone's skull in with one remains a very popular and effective means of\n"
"dispute resolution.\n"
msgstr ""
"一块沉重的木头。虽然棍棒是相当原始的武器，\n"
"但猛击某人的头颅仍是解决争端的一种十分流行且有效的方法。\n"

#. key: condenser vane
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:condenser vane"
msgid ""
"A magical device that condenses ambient energy into various destructive clouds.\n"
"When evoked these clouds form around hostile monsters near the user. The\n"
"quantity and lethality of these clouds increases with Evocations skill. At low\n"
"power it will create noxious fumes, and as power increases this gives way to\n"
"roaring flames, freezing vapours, and poisonous gas. At the highest tiers of\n"
"power storm clouds, acidic fog and clouds of excruciating misery become\n"
"available.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个魔法装置，可以将周围的能量凝结成各种具有破坏性的云。\n"
"当激活时，生成的云会环绕使用者附近的敌人。\n"
"这些云的数量和杀伤力会随激活技能的提高而提高。\n"
"当能量低时，它会生成毒烟，当能量增加时，会生成咆哮的火焰、冰汽和毒气。\n"
"当能量达到最高级别时，会生成强大的风暴云、酸雾和郁积愁云。\n"

#. key: corpse
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corpse"
msgid ""
"A corpse. Useless and dead.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具尸体。没有用处、没有生命。\n"

#. key: crystal plate armour
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crystal plate armour"
msgid ""
"An incredibly heavy but extremely effective suit of crystalline armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"这件水晶护甲重得吓人，但防护效果也非常好。\n"

#. key: dagger
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dagger"
msgid ""
"A double-edged fighting knife with a sharp point.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把有着刀尖、双刃的战刀。\n"

#. key: dart
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dart"
msgid ""
"A thin piece of metal, typically coated in some harmful substance. When thrown\n"
"it can deliver its toxins into the bloodstream of a living or demonic being.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个薄金属片，通常上面会涂有一些有害物质。\n"
"当投掷它时，会将其中的毒素传递到生物或恶魔的血液中。\n"

#. key: decaying skeleton
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:decaying skeleton"
msgid ""
"A decaying skeleton.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具正在腐烂的骷髅。\n"

#. key: deck of destruction
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deck of destruction"
msgid ""
"A deck of magical cards, most of which hurl death and destruction at one's foes\n"
"(or, if unlucky, at oneself).\n"
msgstr ""
"一副魔法卡牌，\n"
"其中的大部分牌会向你的敌人投射死亡和毁灭（或向你自己，如果倒霉的话）。\n"

#. key: deck of escape
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deck of escape"
msgid ""
"A deck of magical cards, mainly dealing with various forms of escape.\n"
msgstr ""
"一副魔法卡牌，主要用于多种形式的逃脱。\n"

#. key: deck of punishment
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deck of punishment"
msgid ""
"A deck of magical cards which wreak havoc on the user.\n"
msgstr ""
"一副魔法卡牌，向使用者带来灾难。\n"

#. key: deck of summoning
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deck of summoning"
msgid ""
"A deck of magical cards, depicting a range of weird and wonderful creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"一副魔法卡牌，上面描绘了一系列怪异而不可思议的生物。\n"

#. key: demon blade
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon blade"
msgid ""
"A terrible weapon, forged in the fires of Hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件可怕的武器，在地狱之火中锻造而成。\n"

#. key: demon trident
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon trident"
msgid ""
"A terrible three-pronged weapon, moulded by fire and brimstone.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件可怕的有着三股叉的武器，由火和硫磺铸成。\n"

#. key: demon whip
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon whip"
msgid ""
"A terrible weapon, woven in the depths of the inferno.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件可怕的武器，在炼狱深处编织而成。\n"

#. key: dire flail
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dire flail"
msgid ""
"A flail with long spikes and a heavy head.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把具有长刺和沉重头部的连枷。\n"

#. key: double sword
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:double sword"
msgid ""
"A fearsome weapon with a forked, razor-sharp blade.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把刀刃分叉、极其锐利的可怕的武器。\n"

#. key: dragon-coil talisman
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dragon-coil talisman"
msgid ""
"An intricate carving, inlaid with dragon tooth and scale. {{\n"
"    local desc = \"Transforms the wearer into a mighty\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race():find(\"Draconian\") then\n"
"        desc = desc .. \" dragon. The wearer retains their innate colour, \" ..\n"
"                       \"becomes resistant to poison, and their breath weapon's \" ..\n"
"                       \"power and recharge rate are greatly increased.\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        desc = desc .. \" golden dragon. The wearer becomes resistant to fire, \" ..\n"
"                       \"cold, and poison, and gains a powerful breath attack \" ..\n"
"                       \"that inflicts all three types of damage at once, but \" ..\n"
"                       \"only recharges as you gain XP.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"    return desc\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"一小瓶纯净的龙血，历经多年结晶而成。 {{\n"
"    local desc = \"将使用者变为一条强大的\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race():find(\"Draconian\") then\n"
"        desc = desc .. \"龙\"\n"
"        if you.race() ~= \"Grey Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \"，任何固有的吐息攻击的威力增强了\"\n"
"        end\n"
"        if you.race() == \"Red Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \"。使用者有了很强的火抗\" ..\n"
"                           \"和毒抗，但容易受到寒冷的伤害\"\n"
"        elseif you.race() == \"White Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \"。使用者有了很强的寒抗\" ..\n"
"                           \"和毒抗，但容易受到火的伤害\"\n"
"        elseif you.race() == \"Green Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \"并保持了它的固有颜色\"\n"
"        else\n"
"            desc = desc .. \"。使用者保持了它的固有颜色，并\" ..\n"
"                           \"变成有着毒抗的\"\n"
"        end\n"
"    else\n"
"        desc = desc .. \"，吐息火焰的龙。使用者有了很强的\" ..\n"
"                       \"火抗和毒抗，但\" ..\n"
"                       \"容易受到寒冷的伤害\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    desc = desc .. \"。\"\n"
"\n"
"    return desc\n"
"}} 提升变身技能可以增加爪子的攻击力和鳞甲的防御力。\n"
"\n"
"变形后，装备的任何武器和防具都会被融合。\n"

#. key: earthy gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:earthy gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"Deep within this gem, flowing leaves and swaying branches seem to lurk. And\n"
"here, a bone picked clean - there, a predator's eyes, staring hungrily out..?\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"在这颗宝石的深处，似乎暗藏着飘垂的树叶和摇曳的树枝。\n"
"而在这边，有一根剔得干干净净的骨头——\n"
"那边，有一个捕食者的眼睛，在贪婪地盯着外面……？\n"

#. key: eggplant
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eggplant"
msgid ""
"A rotten eggplant which you can throw at the Crawl developers. It's a bug if\n"
"you ever see this message.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个腐烂的茄子，你可以把它丢向Crawl的开发者。\n"
"如果你碰到它，说明遇到错误了。\n"

#. key: eudemon blade
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eudemon blade"
msgid ""
"A sacred blade from the forges of Heaven, inhabited by a good spirit. It is a\n"
"favoured weapon of the Shining One's servants.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把在天堂中锻成的圣刃，剑中住着一个圣灵。\n"
"这件武器深受光明神的信徒喜爱，而邪恶势力的则完全不能使用它。\n"

#. key: eveningstar
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eveningstar"
msgid ""
"The opposite of a morningstar. A balanced mace with a long shaft and a metal\n"
"head covered in lethal spikes.\n"
msgstr ""
"晨星锤的对应物。一个有着配重的权杖，长柄，金属头上覆有致命的尖刺。\n"

#. key: everburning encyclopedia
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:everburning encyclopedia"
msgid ""
"A book of magical spells, meticulously organised, dense, and almost entirely\n"
"burnt black. Only a few pages are still legible, but the power within still\n"
"blasts the reader with a furnace-like heat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本魔法书，精心编排，密密麻麻，却几乎完全被烧成黑色。\n"
"只有几页仍清晰可辨，但书中的力量仍像火炉一样，向读者喷射着能量。\n"

#. key: executioner's axe
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:executioner's axe"
msgid ""
"A fearsome weapon covered in dried blood and crude engravings of torture and\n"
"death, bearing an enormous axehead.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件可怕的武器，上面有着凝固的血和关于酷刑与死亡的粗糙雕刻，\n"
"带有一个巨大的斧头。\n"

#. key: falchion
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:falchion"
msgid ""
"A long single-edged sword with a slightly curved blade.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把长长的单刃剑，刀刃略微弯曲。\n"

#. key: fen folio
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fen folio"
msgid ""
"A collection of spells once used by the great swamp civilisations.\n"
msgstr ""
"伟大的沼泽文明使用过的法术合集。\n"

#. key: figurine of a ziggurat
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:figurine of a ziggurat"
msgid ""
"A small figurine made of some strange material, shaped like a stepped pyramid.\n"
"It is remarkably detailed – almost like a real, vast structure, shrunk somehow\n"
"smaller than a human hand.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由某种奇特物质制成的小雕像，形状像带有阶梯的金字形神塔。\n"
"它非常细致——比人手还小，却几乎像是以某种方式由真实、巨大的建筑缩放而来的。\n"

#. key: fire dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a fire-breathing dragon. It provides great protection from fire,\n"
"while rendering its wearer more susceptible to cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"吐息火焰之龙的鳞甲。\n"
"它能够提供极好的火抗，也致使它的穿戴者者更易受到寒冷的影响。\n"

#. key: flail
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flail"
msgid ""
"A mace with a short chain connecting the head to the haft.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把用短链连接头和柄的权杖。\n"

#. key: gem
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gem"
msgid ""
"A stone of unearthly beauty and almost immeasurable value outside the dungeon.\n"
"Within its confines, it is utterly useless.\n"
"\n"
"Zot hoards these gems jealously, and will spitefully smash them soon after an\n"
"adventurer enters the branch of the Dungeon in which they rest. Still, a very\n"
"quick-moving adventurer might seize one first and keep its precious shards.\n"
"Zot cannot track gems outside their home branches, so with truly astonishing\n"
"speed, it might be possible to abscond with one still intact... but such a\n"
"feat is difficult to credit, and likely pointless besides.\n"
"\n"
"Once the Orb of Zot is taken, Zot will be unable to smash any gems.\n"
msgstr ""
"一块来自地牢之外美丽绝伦、价值难以估量的石头。在它的范围内，它是完全无用的。\n"
"\n"
"佐特小心翼翼地贮藏着这些宝石，\n"
"一旦冒险者进入存在宝石的地牢分支，佐特就会恶意地打碎相应宝石。\n"
"然而，一个行动极其迅速的冒险者有机会抓到一个宝石，并保留其珍贵的碎片。\n"
"佐特无法在存放宝石的原分支之外继续追踪它，\n"
"因此，如果有真正惊人的速度，是有可能带着一颗完好无损的宝石成功逃脱……\n"
"然而这样的壮举简直是天方夜谭，而且可能毫无意义。\n"
"\n"
"一旦佐特宝珠被拿走，佐特将无法打碎任何宝石。\n"

#. key: giant club
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:giant club"
msgid ""
"A giant lump of wood.\n"
msgstr ""
"一块非常大的木头。\n"

#. key: giant spiked club
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:giant spiked club"
msgid ""
"A giant lump of wood with sharp spikes at one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨型木棒，一端装有尖木刺。\n"

#. key: glaive
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:glaive"
msgid ""
"A pole with a large, heavy blade on one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"杆子一端有着又大又重的刀刃。\n"

#. key: golden dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:golden dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a golden dragon. It is much heavier than most dragon scale\n"
"armours, and grants its wearer resistance to poison, fire and cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"一套金龙鳞甲。它比大多数龙鳞甲重得多，但能给穿戴者提供毒抗、火抗、寒抗。\n"

#. key: gold piece
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gold piece"
msgid ""
"A pile of glittering gold coins.\n"
msgstr ""
"一堆闪闪发亮的金币。\n"

#. key: granite talisman
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:granite talisman"
msgid ""
"A heavy stone icon, bearing the countenance of some long-forgotten king or god.\n"
"Transforms the wearer into a slow, stone statue. The wearer's stone body is\n"
"immune to poison and miasma, and gains resistance to electricity, negative\n"
"energy, and torment. Shapeshifting skill increases armour granted.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个沉重的石符，上面有一个被遗忘已久的国王或是神明的头像。\n"
"它能将使用者变成一个缓慢的石像。\n"
"使用者的石质身躯免疫毒和瘴气，并获得对电、负能量和折磨的抗性。\n"
"提升变身技能可以增加该形态赋予的防御力。\n"
"\n"
"变形后，装备的任何铠甲、手套和靴子都会被融合。\n"

#. key: grand grimoire
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grand grimoire"
msgid ""
"A book describing how the mighty among summoners can bend to their will the\n"
"terrible things from betwixt the planes. Many have been the unwary souls,\n"
"however, who have toyed with this tome and been driven mad by unimaginable\n"
"eldritch horrors.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本书描述了强大的召唤者如何扭曲他们的意志，\n"
"从而在位面之间产生了许多可怕的事情。有许多鲁莽的人摆弄过这本书，\n"
"却被难以想像的恐怖吓疯了。\n"

#. key: great mace
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:great mace"
msgid ""
"An enormous metal war club, of great cumbrousness.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根巨型金属战棍，非常笨重。\n"

#. key: great sword
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:great sword"
msgid ""
"A sword with a very long, heavy blade and a long handle.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把有着长柄和很长的沉重剑刃的剑。\n"

#. key: great wizards, vol. ii
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:great wizards, vol. ii"
msgid ""
"A collection of spells from great wizards throughout history. The author seems\n"
"to have been extremely enthusiastic, and each wizard is described in voluminous,\n"
"comprehensive detail.\n"
msgstr ""
"历史上伟大巫师的咒语集。作者似乎非常热情，\n"
"对每个巫师都有浩繁、全面的描述。\n"
"\n"

#. key: great wizards, vol. vii
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:great wizards, vol. vii"
msgid ""
"A collection of spells from great wizards throughout history. The author seems\n"
"to have been quite tired of their project - the wizards' descriptions are terse\n"
"and minimal, meeting the lowest requirement for completeness.\n"
msgstr ""
"历史上伟大巫师的咒语集。作者似乎对他们的项目已经厌倦了——\n"
"对巫师的描述简明扼要，只是满足了对完整性的最低要求。\n"

#. key: halberd
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:halberd"
msgid ""
"A polearm consisting of an axe blade topped with a spike, mounted on a long\n"
"shaft.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把长柄武器，在长柄的顶端，有一个带刺的斧刃。\n"

#. key: hammer
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hammer"
msgid ""
"A blunt striking weapon, essentially equivalent to a mace.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把钝击武器，基本上相当于权杖。\n"

#. key: hand axe
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hand axe"
msgid ""
"A small axe.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把小斧头。\n"

#. key: hand cannon
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hand cannon"
msgid ""
"A machine that fires metal slugs via applied thaumaturgy. Some enchant their\n"
"projectiles to fall forward instead of down, others bewitch the slugs with a\n"
"fatal attraction to their targets. All are slow, loud, and blast out thick\n"
"smoke with each shot.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个运用了奇术用于发射弹药的器械。\n"
"一些人为弹药附魔，使其向前而不是向下坠落；\n"
"另一些人为弹药附加了致命的朝向目标的引力。\n"
"这些动作都是缓慢的，并会发出巨响，每次发射都会喷出浓烟。\n"

#. key: hat
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat"
msgid ""
"A cloth hat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一顶布帽。\n"

#. key: helmet
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:helmet"
msgid ""
"A piece of metal headgear.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个金属头盔。\n"

#. key: horn of geryon
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:horn of geryon"
msgid ""
"The horn belonging to Geryon, guardian of the Vestibule of Hell. It has the\n"
"power to call forth demonic beasts. With high Evocations skill, it will call\n"
"greater numbers of beasts, with lower chances of those beasts being hostile.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个号角属于吉里昂，他是地狱前庭的守卫者。它能够用来召唤恶魔野兽。\n"
"具有的激活技能越高，它就能召唤更多的野兽，\n"
"并且这些野兽是敌对的几率也会更低。\n"

#. key: sling
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sling"
msgid ""
"A piece of cloth and leather for launching stones, adequate for hunting small\n"
"game like rabbits or goblins.\n"
msgstr ""
"一段用来发射石头的布料和皮革，能够猎捕小型猎物，诸如兔子和地精。\n"

#. key: ice dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a cold-breathing dragon. It provides great protection from cold,\n"
"while rendering its wearer more susceptible to fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"吐息寒冰之龙的鳞甲。\n"
"它能够提供极好的寒抗，也致使它的穿戴者者更易受到火的影响。\n"

#. key: ivory gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ivory gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"Countless spirits swirl around this gem, shrouding it in a bone-deep chill.\n"
"Unwelcome in the Good gods' afterlife, they find here a heaven of their own.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"无数灵体围绕着这颗宝石旋转，将它笼罩在彻骨的寒意中。\n"
"在善神转生之后，它们变得不受欢迎，但在这里找到了自己的天堂。\n"

#. key: jade gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jade gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"Sigils of fire burn deep within this gem, symbol of the eternal compact between\n"
"naga and salamander. Their bond is that of the poison which scourges the impure\n"
"and the flame which burns away impurity.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"这颗宝石的深处燃烧着火焰的印记，它象征着纳迦和火蜥蜴之间永恒的契约。\n"
"他们的结合是毒与火的结合，毒液责罚着腐化之物，火焰烧除着罪恶之物。\n"

#. key: javelin
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:javelin"
msgid ""
"A lightweight spear, designed for throwing. It will pass through the targets it\n"
"hits, potentially hitting all targets in its path until it reaches maximum\n"
"range.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Kobold\" or you.race() == \"Spriggan\" then\n"
"        return \"Unfortunately, it is too long and awkward for you to use.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"这根轻型矛是为投掷而设计的。\n"
"它将击穿目标，并有可能击中其路径中的所有目标，直到达到最大射程。\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Kobold\" or you.race() == \"Spriggan\" then\n"
"        return \"很遗憾，对于你来说它太长了，不方便使用。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: kite shield
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kite shield"
msgid ""
"A piece of wood and metal, to be strapped on one arm for defence.\n"
msgstr ""
"一块木头和金属，通过绑在一只手臂上进行防御。\n"

#. key: lajatang
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lajatang"
msgid ""
"A very rare and extremely effective weapon, featuring a pole with half-moon\n"
"blades at both ends.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把十分罕见而极为高效的武器，杆子的两端各有一个半月形的刃。\n"

#. key: large rock
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:large rock"
msgid ""
"A very large and very heavy stone. {{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Ogre\"\n"
"       or you.race() == \"Troll\"\n"
"   then\n"
"       return \"\"\n"
"   else\n"
"       return \"Only large creatures are capable of throwing it.\"\n"
"   end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"一块沉重的巨石。{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Ogre\"\n"
"       or you.race() == \"Troll\"\n"
"   then\n"
"       return \"\"\n"
"   else\n"
"       return \"只有大型生物才能投掷它。\"\n"
"   end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: leather armour
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:leather armour"
msgid ""
"A suit made from layers of tanned animal hide. It provides basic protection\n"
"with almost no hindrance to spellcasting or stealthy movement.\n"
msgstr ""
"这件护甲是用几层鞣过的动物皮做成的。\n"
"穿着它几乎不会对施法或潜行造成阻碍，不过它只能提供一点最基础的防护。\n"

#. key: lightning rod
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lightning rod"
msgid ""
"A rod that allows its wielder to fire unavoidable blasts of lightning.\n"
"Consecutive evocations cause the discharge to be sustained, which increases the\n"
"power level up to four times and allows the blast to be redirected to affect an\n"
"area. The strength of the blast increases with Evocations skill and, for\n"
"redirected blasts, decreases with the size of the affected area.\n"
msgstr ""
"这根杆子能让使用者射出无法闪避的闪电冲击。\n"
"连续激活将使其释出的能量增强，直至达到四倍的强度，\n"
"同时能够改变方向来攻击一整片区域。冲击的强度随激活技能的提高而提高，\n"
"变换了方向的冲击会随受影响区域的扩大而减弱。\n"

#. key: long sword
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:long sword"
msgid ""
"A sword with a long, slashing blade.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把长而凌厉的剑。\n"

#. key: longbow
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:longbow"
msgid ""
"A long, strong bow made of yew.\n"
msgstr ""
"一张紫杉制成的长而坚固的弓。\n"

#. key: mace
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mace"
msgid ""
"A short club with a metal head.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根带金属头的短棒。\n"

#. key: manual
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:manual"
msgid ""
"A valuable book which allows one to learn a certain skill faster.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很有用的书，能让人更快地学习某种技能。\n"

#. key: maxwell's memoranda
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maxwell's memoranda"
msgid ""
"A loosely bound collection of the infamous Maxwell's schemes, diagrams and plans.\n"
"Amidst messages written to and by his many minions, allies of convenience and\n"
"hated rivals, a patient reader can discover spells of electrifying power.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本松散的装订集，收录着臭名昭著的麦克斯韦的草图、图表和计划。\n"
"在与他的众多下属、处得来的友人和讨厌的竞争对手的往来信息中，\n"
"耐心的读者可以发现电能的咒语。\n"

#. key: maw talisman
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maw talisman"
msgid ""
"A miniature, desiccated head of some ferocious and hopefully extinct creature.\n"
"Transforms the wearer's midsection into a giant mouth, gnashing and ready to devour\n"
"foes. This maw confers a powerful bite attack which scales additionally with the\n"
"wearer's own strength and can devour slain creatures to temporariy increase\n"
"one's regeneration. Unfortunately, it also confers such profound hunger that it\n"
"can be difficult to pull oneself away from particularly appetising foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"某个凶猛且可能要灭绝的生物的干小头部。\n"
"它能将使用者的腹部变成一个咬牙切齿、准备吞食敌人的大嘴。\n"
"这张嘴巴可以吞食被杀死的生物并治疗使用者，使用者的变身技能和被吞食的生物越强，\n"
"治疗程度也越强。提升技能也会增加胃部造成的伤害。\n"
"\n"
"变形后，装备的铠甲都会被融合。\n"

#. key: midnight gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:midnight gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"The stoneborn brought forth this gem from the uttermost depths of the earth as\n"
"a gift and a warning: beware Zot! That it lies now within Zot's power is a sure\n"
"proof of the perversity of mortals and fate alike.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"石裔从大地的深处带来了这块宝石作为礼物和警告：当心佐特！\n"
"而它现在掌握在佐特的手中，这无疑证实了凡人的堕落，一如它的命运。\n"

#. key: milky-white gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:milky-white gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"Smooth as a spider's silk, white as the eyes of some crawling thing which has\n"
"lived too long in the dark, this gem buzzes with a fearful potential. Still, to\n"
"a certain eye, it possesses a strange allure...\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"这颗宝石光滑得像蜘蛛丝，白得像久居黑暗的爬行动物的眼睛，\n"
"嗡嗡作响，充满了可怕的潜能。\n"
"尽管如此，在某种程度上，它具有一种奇怪的吸引力……\n"

#. key: morningstar
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:morningstar"
msgid ""
"A mace with a head covered in short spikes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个头部带有短刺的权杖。\n"

#. key: mossy gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mossy gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"Though it drips with mud and muck, still a peculiar dignity attaches itself to\n"
"this gem. The people of the Swamp, who first carried this stone, struggled\n"
"against insurmountable odds. They failed, but there is much to admire even in\n"
"the ruin of their efforts.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"尽管这颗宝石滴着泥浆和淤泥，但它仍带着一种特殊的高贵气质。\n"
"最先拿起这块石头的沼泽居民曾与不可逾越的困难作了斗争。\n"
"他们失败了，但即使他们的努力付之东流，也有很多值得钦佩的地方。\n"

#. key: necronomicon
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:necronomicon"
msgid ""
"An extremely rare book, powerful and sinister. Many foolhardy magicians have\n"
"tried to study this tome, only to find themselves entangled within necromantic\n"
"forces they could not hope to control.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本极为罕见的书，强大而邪恶。许多鲁莽的魔法师试图研究这本巨著，\n"
"却发现自己已陷入了他们无法控制的亡灵力量之中。\n"

#. key: orb
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb"
msgid ""
"A sphere of crystal, carried in place of a shield. Magic scintillates within\n"
"its interior.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个水晶球，可拿在装备盾牌的位置。魔法在里面闪烁着。\n"

#. key: orb of zot
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb of zot"
msgid ""
"An invaluable artefact. Once you have escaped to the surface with it, your\n"
"quest is complete.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个无价之宝。只要你能带着它逃到地面，你的任务就宣告完成。\n"

#. key: orcbow
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orcbow"
msgid ""
"A recurved bow, crudely crafted from troll-bone and warg hair. The cave orcs'\n"
"use of archery, so unlike their surface-dwelling ancestors, shows the influence\n"
"of their elvish allies.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把反曲弓是用巨魔的骨头和座狼的毛发粗糙地制作而成。\n"
"洞穴兽人与那些居住在地表的表亲不同，他们掌握着箭术，\n"
"这表明他们受到了精灵盟友的影响。\n"

#. key: pair of boots
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pair of boots"
msgid ""
"A pair of boots. They are worn on the feet, and cover all but the largest\n"
"hooves and talons.\n"
msgstr ""
"一双靴子。它们要穿在脚上，一般是合身的，除非是最大的蹄子或爪子。\n"

#. key: pair of gloves
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pair of gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves. They are worn on the hands, and cover all but the largest\n"
"claws.\n"
msgstr ""
"一双手套。它们要戴在手上，一般是合身的，除非是最大的爪子。\n"

#. key: pearl dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pearl dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The nacreous scales of a pearl dragon. It grants its wearer resistance to\n"
"negative energies.\n"
msgstr ""
"一套珍珠龙的珍珠质鳞甲。它赋予穿戴者对负能量的抗性。\n"

#. key: phantom mirror
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:phantom mirror"
msgid ""
"A hand mirror which can create a reflection of a nearby creature, clouding\n"
"in the process. The reflection's duration increases with Evocations skill and\n"
"decreases with the willpower of the target. It is, invariably, slightly weaker\n"
"than the creature it mirrors.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面手镜，可以创建一个附近生物的镜像，在这个过程中会产生云层。\n"
"镜像的持续时间随激活技能的提升而增加，随目标的意志力越强而减少。\n"
"它总是比它所映射的生物稍弱些。\n"

#. key: phial of floods
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:phial of floods"
msgid ""
"An enchanted vessel of elemental water. Removing the stopper unleashes a torrent\n"
"of water, smashing the target and flooding the nearby area. If any creatures\n"
"engulfed by the wave need air to breathe, they'll be unable to cast spells until\n"
"they recover. The strength of the torrent and the duration of the flooding\n"
"increase with Evocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个充满水元素的魔法容器。\n"
"取下塞子，小瓶会释出洪流，将对目标造成伤害，并淹没周围地区。\n"
"如果有需要呼吸空气的生物被波浪吞没，在恢复正常前，他们将无法施法。\n"
"洪流的力量和持续时间会随激活技能的提升而提升。\n"

#. key: plate armour
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:plate armour"
msgid ""
"A full suit of solid metal plate: cuirass, pauldrons, vambraces, waist plate\n"
"and greaves. It provides excellent protection.\n"
msgstr ""
"一整套实心金属板：胸甲、护肩、臂甲、腰甲和胫甲。它提供了出色的保护。\n"

#. key: potion of ambrosia
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of ambrosia"
msgid ""
"A strange substance, produced by ghost moths. Consuming it causes regeneration\n"
"of health and magic, along with total befuddlement. The two effects are\n"
"fundamentally linked – the regeneration ends the moment the confusion does.\n"
msgstr ""
"其中的奇怪物质，是由鬼蛾产生的。\n"
"饮用它，健康和魔力的恢复速度会变快，但也会让人完全迷惑。\n"
"这两个效果本质上是相关的——恢复完成了，混乱也就结束了。\n"

#. key: potion of berserk rage
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of berserk rage"
msgid ""
"A potion which can send one into an incoherent rage, granting them a great but\n"
"temporary increase to their health, damage, and speed. In exchange, their mind\n"
"is clouded by anger, only allowing them to move and attack in melee. The rage\n"
"will wear off quickly if they do not attack monsters, and upon expiry, the\n"
"imbiber will be fatigued, causing them to slow dramatically and rendering them\n"
"unable to berserk again for a short duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"这瓶药水能让饮用者进入狂暴状态。\n"

#. key: potion of blood
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of blood"
msgid ""
"A potion containing the essence of life.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个瓶子里装着生命的精华。\n"

#. key: potion of brilliance
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of brilliance"
msgid ""
"A potion which increases the power of the drinker's spells and halves their\n"
"magic cost (rounding up).\n"
msgstr ""
"饮用这瓶药水会提高饮用者的魔力，并且魔力消耗减半（四舍五入）。\n"

#. key: potion of cancellation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of cancellation"
msgid ""
"A potion which ends most magical effects, good or bad, affecting one who drinks\n"
"it. It also reduces magical contamination.\n"
msgstr ""
"这瓶药水对饮用它的人来说，能终结大多数或好或坏的魔法效果。\n"
"它也能减少魔法污染。\n"

#. key: potion of curing
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of curing"
msgid ""
"A potion which restores a small amount of health, and cures poison and\n"
"confusion.\n"
msgstr ""
"这瓶药水能回复少量健康值，并治疗中毒和混乱。\n"

#. key: potion of enlightenment
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of enlightenment"
msgid ""
"A potion which uplifts both the body and mind of its drinkers, lifting them\n"
"from the ground and increasing their Will to resist the world's temptations.\n"
msgstr ""
"这瓶药水能够提升饮用者的身心，\n"
"将他们从地面升起，并增强他们抵抗世间诱惑的意志力。\n"

#. key: potion of experience
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of experience"
msgid ""
"A truly wonderful and very rare drink, which grants experience when consumed.\n"
msgstr ""
"一瓶非常罕见的极佳饮品，饮用时能给予经验。\n"

#. key: potion of haste
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of haste"
msgid ""
"An enchanted beverage which speeds the actions of anyone who drinks it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这种魔力饮料，能加快饮用者的行动速度。\n"

#. key: potion of heal wounds
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of heal wounds"
msgid ""
"A magical healing elixir which causes wounds to close and heal almost\n"
"instantly.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个神奇的疗伤灵药，能使伤口立刻愈合。\n"

#. key: potion of invisibility
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of invisibility"
msgid ""
"A potion which confers invisibility on one who consumes it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这瓶药水能让饮用者隐形。\n"

#. key: potion of lignification
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of lignification"
msgid ""
"A potion which transforms the imbiber into an animated tree with sap for blood and\n"
"branches capable of holding weapons. Such a tree has minimal evasion but increased\n"
"health and natural armour, and is resistant to poison, and immune to torment and\n"
"drowning. However, it is rooted in place while the transformation lasts, and\n"
"cannot teleport.\n"
msgstr ""
"这瓶药水能临时将饮用者变为会动的树，其枝干能持握武器。\n"
"变成树会更难闪避，但生命值和自身防护得到增强，有了毒抗，并免疫折磨和溺水。\n"
"然而，当处于这种形态时，会扎根原地，无法传送。\n"

#. key: potion of magic
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of magic"
msgid ""
"A valuable potion which grants an infusion of magical energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是瓶很有用的药水，它能注入魔力。\n"

#. key: potion of might
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of might"
msgid ""
"A potion which greatly increases the power of the drinker's melee attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"这瓶药水能大大增强饮用者的近战的威力。\n"

#. key: potion of mutation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of mutation"
msgid ""
"A potion which mutates the drinker, removing several mutations then\n"
"granting a few random mutations, which are likely (but not guaranteed) to be\n"
"beneficial.\n"
msgstr ""
"这瓶药水能让饮用者变异，会移除一些变异，然后带来一个随机的变异，\n"
"这些变异可能是（但不保证）有益的。\n"

#. key: potion of resistance
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of resistance"
msgid ""
"A potion which grants temporary resistance to a variety of harmful effects:\n"
"fire, cold, electricity, poison, and acid.\n"
msgstr ""
"这瓶药水能暂时地赋予饮用者对一些有害效果的抗性：火、寒、电、毒和酸。\n"

#. key: potion of attraction
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of attraction"
msgid ""
"A potion which makes the drinker attract enemies, translocating them quickly closer\n"
"for the duration of the effect. The effect is surprisingly subtle, and unwary\n"
"victims may sleep through it entirely.\n"
msgstr ""
"这瓶药水能让饮用者引来敌人，在效果持续时间能迅速将敌人拉到更近的地方。\n"
"其效果十分微妙，不警觉的、受影响的怪物可能仍在沉睡。\n"

#. key: prismatic gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:prismatic gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"Shining with every colour of the rainbow and a few others besides, some\n"
"consider this gem 'a bit tacky'. Preposterous!\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"这颗宝石闪耀着彩虹色和其他几种颜色，但一些人认为这颗宝石“有点俗气”。真是荒唐！\n"

#. key: quad damage
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quad damage"
msgid ""
"A mysterious item resembling a rune of some kind. Once evoked, it will make the\n"
"user glow blue and add a reverb to all sound... and there may be other effects\n"
"as well.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个看上去像是某种符文的神秘物品。\n"
"激活它会导致使用者身上发出蓝光并能给所有声音加入混响……也许还有其他效果。\n"

#. key: quarterstaff
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quarterstaff"
msgid ""
"A sturdy wooden pole, meant for fighting.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根结实的用于战斗的木棍。\n"

#. key: quicksilver dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quicksilver dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a quicksilver dragon. Although it does not provide its wearer\n"
"with as much protection as the scales of some heavier dragons, it is somewhat\n"
"lighter and less encumbering. The armour repels both attacks on the wearer's\n"
"willpower and magical modification of itself - it cannot be enchanted.\n"
msgstr ""
"一套水银龙鳞甲。尽管它不像一些更重的龙的鳞甲那样，\n"
"能为穿戴者提供更多的防护，但它却更轻便、妨碍也更少。\n"
"这套盔甲会抵抗对穿戴者意志力的攻击，\n"
"但也会抵抗针对自身的魔法改造——它不能被附魔。\n"

#. key: quick blade
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quick blade"
msgid ""
"A dagger with an uncanny enchantment upon it, allowing it to strike twice\n"
"for every blow its wielder makes. It takes great skill to use to its full\n"
"potential.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把带有不可思议的魔力的匕首，能让使用者一次发动双重攻击。\n"

#. key: rapier
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rapier"
msgid ""
"A slender, sharply pointed sword, with an uncommonly elegant design.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把纤细、尖锐的剑，有着非凡的优雅设计。\n"

#. key: ring mail
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring mail"
msgid ""
"A light leather suit reinforced with a covering of metal rings. It is\n"
"protective in combat, but slightly uncomfortable due to the added weight.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件覆有金属环的轻质皮革护甲。它在战斗中能提供防护，\n"
"但因重量的增加而略有妨碍。\n"

#. key: ring of dexterity
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of dexterity"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the dexterity of its wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能提升佩戴者的敏捷。\n"

#. key: ring of evasion
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of evasion"
msgid ""
"A ring that makes its wearer more capable of avoiding attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能提升佩戴者躲避攻击的能力。\n"

#. key: ring of flight
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of flight"
msgid ""
"A ring that grants its wearer flight.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能赋予佩戴者飞行的能力。\n"

#. key: ring of intelligence
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of intelligence"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the intelligence of its wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能提升佩戴者的智力。\n"

#. key: ring of resist corrosion
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of resist corrosion"
msgid ""
"A ring that protects its wearer from the effects of acid and corrosion.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能帮助佩戴者抵抗酸和腐蚀。\n"

#. key: ring of magical power
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of magical power"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases its wearer's reserves of magical power for so long as it\n"
"is worn.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能增加佩戴者的魔力储备。\n"

#. key: ring of poison resistance
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of poison resistance"
msgid ""
"A ring that protects its wearer from poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能帮助佩戴者抵抗毒。\n"

#. key: ring of positive energy
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of positive energy"
msgid ""
"A ring that protects its wearer from the effects of negative energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能帮助佩戴者抵抗负能量。\n"

#. key: ring of protection
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of protection"
msgid ""
"A ring that protects its wearer from most sources of damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能帮助佩戴者抵挡大多数种类的伤害。\n"

#. key: ring of protection from cold
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of protection from cold"
msgid ""
"A ring that protects its wearer from cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能帮助佩戴者抵抗寒冷。\n"

#. key: ring of protection from fire
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of protection from fire"
msgid ""
"A ring that protects its wearer from fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能帮助佩戴者抵抗火焰。\n"

#. key: ring of willpower
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of willpower"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases its wearer's willpower, protecting against certain\n"
"magical effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能提升佩戴者的意志力，以抵御某些魔法。\n"

#. key: ring of see invisible
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of see invisible"
msgid ""
"A ring that allows its wearer to see invisible things.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能让佩戴者看见隐形的东西。\n"

#. key: ring of slaying
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of slaying"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the wearer's accuracy and damage with ranged weapons and\n"
"melee attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指会增加佩戴者使用远程武器和近战的命中率和攻击力。\n"

#. key: ring of strength
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of strength"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the strength of its wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能提升佩戴者的力量。\n"

#. key: ring of wizardry
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of wizardry"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the success rate of its wearer's magical spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指能提升佩戴者施法的成功率。\n"

#. key: robe
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe"
msgid ""
"A large, loose-fitting, wide-sleeved outer garment made of light cloth. It\n"
"offers little protection against physical harm, but does not hinder evasion or\n"
"spellcasting.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件有着宽袖的宽松大件外套，由轻质布料制成。\n"
"它几乎无法防备物理伤害，但不会妨碍闪避或施法。\n"

#. key: rune of zot
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rune of zot"
msgid ""
"A charm which allows entry into the Realm of Zot.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个神符是打开佐特领域大门的钥匙。\n"

#. key: sack of spiders
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sack of spiders"
msgid ""
"A woven silk bag. Opening it will cover the area with webs, spiders, and other\n"
"skittering things. Evocations skill increases spider quality, quantity and webbing.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个用丝绸织成的袋子。打开它，蛛网、蜘蛛和其他爬虫会覆盖这片区域。\n"
"提升激活技能能增大蛛网、蜘蛛的强度和数量。\n"

#. key: sacred scourge
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacred scourge"
msgid ""
"A blessed weapon, woven by the saints in Heaven and hated by the unholy. It is\n"
"a favoured weapon of the Shining One's servants.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是一把神圣的武器，由天堂的圣徒所编织，并被邪恶者憎恨。\n"
"这件武器深受光明神的信徒喜爱。\n"

#. key: sanguine gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sanguine gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"They who smote down Death herself and buried themselves in a Tomb of their own\n"
"making were not shy of their ambitions. Fain to seize upon baubles and\n"
"overweening proud, their Lord journeyed into their eternal unrest with this gem\n"
"upon their breast.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"一些人击败了死神，把自己埋在自己建造的坟墓里，而且并不耻于自己的野心。\n"
"他们的主出于对小玩意儿的喜好和自负，把这颗宝石戴在胸前，\n"
"进入了他们永恒的动荡之中。\n"

#. key: scale mail
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scale mail"
msgid ""
"A leather suit covered with metal plates attached to each other in overlapping\n"
"rows to provide full protection, but at the cost of reduced freedom of\n"
"movement.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个皮革上覆有金属板，金属板相互重叠成排从而能够提供充分防护，\n"
"但代价是会对行动造成不便。\n"

#. key: scarf
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scarf"
msgid ""
"A length of stylish fabric. At its creation, enchantments were woven into it,\n"
"and as such it cannot accept further enchantment.\n"
msgstr ""
"一段时髦的织物。在制作它时，已经织入了魔法，因此它不能继续附魔。\n"

#. key: scimitar
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scimitar"
msgid ""
"A long sword with a wide, curved blade.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把具有弯曲阔刃的长剑。\n"

#. key: scroll of acquirement
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of acquirement"
msgid ""
"A wonderful scroll which causes the creation of a valuable item, with the\n"
"reader choosing from a small selection. The items offered will often be a\n"
"good match for the reader's skills; and if nothing recommends itself, the\n"
"reader can always choose a heap of gold.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张奇妙的卷轴，可以让读者选择要创建的物品类型，\n"
"从而凭空创造出一件珍贵的物品。所提供的物品通常与读者的技能非常匹配；\n"
"如果它推荐的东西没什么有用的，读者总是可以选择要一大堆金子。\n"

#. key: scroll of amnesia
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of amnesia"
msgid ""
"A scroll that allows its reader to selectively erase one spell from memory to\n"
"recapture the magical energy bound up with it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴能够让读者选择消除之前记住的一道法术，\n"
"以回复记忆法术时消耗掉的魔力。\n"

#. key: scroll of blinking
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of blinking"
msgid ""
"A scroll that allows its reader to teleport a short distance, with precise\n"
"control.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴能够让读者进行一次精确的短距离传送。\n"

#. key: scroll of brand weapon
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of brand weapon"
msgid ""
"A scroll that imbues a weapon with a random brand. Any existing brand will be\n"
"replaced with a different one, and any brand forbidden by your current god will\n"
"not be chosen. Artefacts cannot be branded in this way.\n"
"\n"
"Melee weapons will commonly be branded with the flaming, freezing, heavy,\n"
"venom or protection brand (or with the special brand exclusive to the category\n"
"of weapon being branded), and rarely with the draining, electrocution, spectral,\n"
"vampiric or chaos brand.\n"
"\n"
"Ranged weapons will commonly be branded with the flaming, freezing, heavy or\n"
"draining brand, and rarely with the electrocution or chaos brand.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴能给武器印上一个随机的印记。\n"
"任何已有的印记会被一个不同的替代，且不会被印上你当前的神所抵触的印记。\n"
"神器无法被这样印上印记。\n"
"\n"
"近战武器通常会被印上火焰、冰冻、重击、淬毒或防护的印记，\n"
"但很少会被印上衰竭、电击、幽灵、吸血或混乱的印记。\n"
"\n"
"远程武器通常会被印上火焰、冰冻、重击或衰竭的印记，\n"
"但很少会被印上电击或混乱的印记。\n"

#. key: scroll of butterflies
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of butterflies"
msgid ""
"A scroll that surrounds its user with a flight of beautiful butterflies, blowing\n"
"back other creatures nearby with the flapping of their wings.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴，能让使用者周围环绕着一群美丽的蝴蝶，\n"
"它们扇动翅膀，把附近的其他生物吹打回去。\n"

#. key: scroll of enchant armour
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of enchant armour"
msgid ""
"A scroll that places an enchantment on a piece of armour chosen by the reader.\n"
"Body armour and bardings can be enchanted up to the same value as their base\n"
"armour rating. Bucklers, kite shields and tower shields can be enchanted up to\n"
"+3, +5 or +8 respectively, and other armour can be enchanted up to +2. Magical\n"
"artefacts cannot be enchanted at all.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴，能让读者选择一件防具进行附魔。\n"
"铠甲和马铠可以附魔至与其自身护甲等级相同的值。\n"
"小圆盾、鸢盾和塔盾分别可以附魔至＋3、＋5或＋8，其他防具可以附魔至＋2。\n"
"神器无法继续附魔。\n"

#. key: scroll of enchant weapon
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of enchant weapon"
msgid ""
"A scroll that places an enchantment on a weapon chosen by the reader,\n"
"increasing both accuracy and damage. Weapons can be enchanted up to +9. Magical\n"
"artefacts cannot be enchanted at all.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴，能让读者选择一件武器进行附魔。武器最多能附魔至＋9。\n"
"神器无法继续附魔。\n"

#. key: scroll of fear
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of fear"
msgid ""
"A scroll that causes great fear in nearby foes, causing them to flee until\n"
"attacked, cornered, or enough time has passed.\n"
"\n"
"Non-living, undead and plant monsters cannot be feared, and berserk or frenzied\n"
"monsters are also immune.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴能极大地震慑附近的敌人，使他们逃跑，\n"
"除非他们受到攻击、走投无路或是已经过去了足够长的时间。\n"
"没有生命的、亡灵和植物类怪物不会吓到，狂暴或疯狂的怪物也对此免疫。\n"

#. key: scroll of fog
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of fog"
msgid ""
"A scroll that surrounds the reader with a dense cloud of fog, which can block\n"
"vision temporarily. The fog takes a short time to fully spill out.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴能在读者身边生成一层浓雾，暂时阻挡视线。\n"
"雾在短时间内就会完全消散。\n"

#. key: scroll of identify
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of identify"
msgid ""
"A useful magic scroll which identifies the properties of any unknown object.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张有用的魔法卷轴，可以鉴定任何未知物品的属性。\n"

#. key: scroll of immolation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of immolation"
msgid ""
"A scroll that fills the creatures around the reader with an unstable and\n"
"powerful inner flame. This fire is released any time the victims are hit, and\n"
"explosively released upon their death. Giant creatures cause bigger explosions.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴使读者周围的生物体内充满强大且不稳定的炽炎。\n"
"受害者一旦死亡，体内的火焰就会被释放出来，造成一次大爆炸。\n"
"巨型生物能造成更大的爆炸。\n"

#. key: scroll of noise
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of noise"
msgid ""
"A prank scroll that creates a loud noise when read.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个卷轴在阅读时会恶作剧般地制造大量噪音。\n"

#. key: scroll of poison
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of poison"
msgid ""
"A scroll that fills the air with poison, covering every unoccupied space in\n"
"sight with toxic fumes.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴能用于弥漫毒气，视线中每一个空置的空间都会被毒烟填充。\n"

#. key: scroll of revelation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of revelation"
msgid ""
"A scroll that reveals its reader's surroundings. The layout of the current\n"
"floor is fully mapped, and everything within a moderate radius, including\n"
"both visible and invisible monsters, is momentarily shown.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴能显现读者的周围环境。它会展现出当前楼层的所有布局，\n"
"并立刻揭示出一定范围内的所有东西，包括可见和隐形的怪物。\n"

#. key: scroll of silence
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of silence"
msgid ""
"A scroll that eliminates all sound near the reader. This makes reading scrolls,\n"
"casting spells, invoking divine abilities, or shouting impossible in the\n"
"reader's vicinity.\n"
"\n"
"Certain monsters have innate magical or special abilities which will still be\n"
"usable while silenced.\n"
"\n"
"The effect starts out with a large radius, which will then shrink, eventually\n"
"covering only the reader, before it times out.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴可以消除读者周围的所有声音。\n"
"这使得无法在读者附近阅读卷轴、施展咒语或呼唤神的能力。\n"
"这张卷轴另人苦恼的一面是，这些不自然的效果将极大地妨碍潜行。\n"
"\n"
"某些怪物具有与生俱来的魔法或特殊能力，即使被沉默也能使用。\n"
"\n"
"起始的生效范围较大，然后会缩小，最后只覆盖施法者，直到完全失效。\n"

#. key: scroll of summoning
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of summoning"
msgid ""
"A scroll that calls forth several allied creatures woven from shadow into the\n"
"shapes of those beings found within the reader's immediate vicinity.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个卷轴能召唤出几个作为友方的阴影生物，\n"
"他们会以当前读者附近的生物为模样塑造形象。\n"

#. key: scroll of teleportation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of teleportation"
msgid ""
"A scroll that translocates the reader to a random position after a short delay.\n"
"Reading this scroll while waiting for a teleportation will instead cancel it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴能在一小段时间之后，将读者传送到一个随机的位置。\n"
"在等待传送时再阅读这种卷轴，会取消其效果。\n"

#. key: scroll of torment
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of torment"
msgid ""
"A scroll that calls on the powers of darkness to inflict great pain on any\n"
"nearby creature — including the reader! This halves the resilience of all\n"
"living creatures and cuts down all holy creature resilence by about a third,\n"
"although it is never directly fatal.\n"
msgstr ""
"此卷轴将召来黑暗能量，给附近所有生物以极大的痛楚——甚至包括读者！\n"
"它能将生物生命值减半，尽管不会直接致死。\n"

#. key: scroll of vulnerability
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of vulnerability"
msgid ""
"A scroll that briefly halves the willpower of the reader and any nearby beings,\n"
"rendering them vulnerable to many magical effects. The scroll cannot affect\n"
"those fully immune to such effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴会将读者和周围的任何生物的意志力暂时减半，\n"
"使其易受许多魔法效果的影响。完全免疫这些效果的不受此卷轴影响。\n"

#. key: scythe
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scythe"
msgid ""
"A farm implement, usually only used by untrained mobs in combat. In practice,\n"
"it's quite similar to a halberd.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只是一个农具，通常只有没受过训练的家伙才会在战斗中使用它。\n"
"在使用时，它很像戟。\n"

#. key: serpent talisman
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:serpent talisman"
msgid ""
"A jade snake coiled around a fossilised egg. Transforms the wearer into an\n"
"amphisbaena - a legendary two-headed serpent. It is capable of wearing two\n"
"pieces of headgear at once and its powerful coils can wind around foes and crush\n"
"them to death, but its cold blood leaves it susceptible to being slowed by cold\n"
"attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条玉蛇盘绕在一个纳迦罗阇的纪念日蛋的周围。\n"
"它能将使用者变成一条抗毒的、决意将敌人缠绕、挤压至死的冷血巨蛇。\n"
"提升变身技能可以增加蛇鳞赋予的防御力。变形后，装备的任何武器和防具都会被融合。\n"

#. key: shining gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shining gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"Many are the treasures of the Ironbound Order, but none older nor more precious\n"
"than this steel-shining gem. The Vaults were first forged to hold it, and none\n"
"who gazed within its depths could fault the choice.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"铁缚会有很多珍宝，但没有比这颗发出钢铁光泽的宝石更古老、更珍贵的了。\n"
"宝库最初就是为了保存它而锻造的，任何人只要凝视它的深处，就不会做出错误的选择。\n"

#. key: shimmering gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shimmering gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"Unearthly energies gently flow along the surface of this gem, guided by the\n"
"archmage who first built the Elven Halls. Countless generations of elves\n"
"flocked to learn from her, but her foremost pursuit was always the perfection\n"
"of this piece of art.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"在最初建造精灵殿堂的大法师的引导下，超凡的能量沿着这颗宝石的表面缓缓流淌。\n"
"无数代精灵纷纷向她学习，但她的最高追求却始终是使这件艺术品臻于完美。\n"

#. key: shortbow
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shortbow"
msgid ""
"A curved piece of wood and string, for shooting arrows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一段弯曲的木头和绳子，用于射箭。\n"

#. key: short sword
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:short sword"
msgid ""
"A personal stabbing weapon with a short grip.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件个人用的短柄刺杀武器。\n"

#. key: smoky gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:smoky gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"Swirls of dark smoke seem to lurk in the depths of this gem. Countless dark\n"
"deeds were done in the Dungeon even before Zot seized and remade it, and their\n"
"dreadful residue now taints every hint of beauty trapped within its confines.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"这块宝石的深处似乎潜藏着一股黑烟。\n"
"甚至在佐特占领、改造地牢之前，就已经有无数的黑暗在地牢上演，\n"
"现在那些可怕的残留物玷污了困于地牢范围内每一个美丽的事物。\n"

#. key: spear
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spear"
msgid ""
"A hunting weapon consisting of a wooden shaft with a pointed metal head\n"
"fastened on one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把用于狩猎的武器，由木杆和固定在一端的金属尖头组成。\n"

#. key: staff of air
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of air"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of air spells cast by its wielder, and\n"
"insulates them from electricity. If the wielder is skilled in Evocations and\n"
"Air Magic, they can shock those struck by it, dealing electrical damage which\n"
"bypasses half of defenders' armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"这根法杖能增强使用者施展气系魔法的威力，并能使其与电绝缘。\n"
"如果使用者精通激活技能和气系魔法，就能用其电击受击者，\n"
"所造成的电击伤害能够穿透护甲。\n"

#. key: staff of alchemy
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of alchemy"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of alchemy spells cast by its wielder, and\n"
"protects them from the effects of poison. If the wielder is skilled in\n"
"Evocations and Alchemy, they can envenom those struck by it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这根法杖能增强使用者施展毒系魔法的威力，并能帮助其抵御毒的影响。\n"
"如果使用者精通激活技能和炼金术魔法，\n"
"就能用它让受击者中毒，所造成的毒性伤害能够穿透护甲。\n"

#. key: staff of cold
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of cold"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of ice spells cast by its wielder, and\n"
"protects them from the effects of cold. If the wielder is skilled in Evocations\n"
"and Ice Magic, they can freeze those struck by it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这根法杖能增强使用者施展冰系魔法的威力，并能帮助其抵御寒冷的影响。\n"
"如果使用者精通激活技能和冰系魔法，就能用其冰冻受击者，\n"
"所造成的寒冷伤害能够穿透护甲。\n"

#. key: staff of conjuration
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of conjuration"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of conjurations cast by its wielder. If the\n"
"wielder is skilled in Evocations and Conjurations, they can blast those they\n"
"strike with pure energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"这根法杖能增强使用者施展塑能系魔法的威力。\n"
"如果使用者精通激活技能和塑能魔法，他们可以用纯能量轰击所击中的人，\n"
"造成不可抗拒的伤害。\n"

#. key: staff of necromancy
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of necromancy"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of necromantic spells cast by its wielder, and\n"
"protects them from negative energy. If the wielder is skilled in Evocations and\n"
"Necromancy, they can inflict great pain on those living souls they strike,\n"
"dealing negative energy damage which bypasses armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"这根法杖能增强使用者施展死灵术的威力，并能帮助其抵御负能量的影响。\n"
"如果使用者精通激活技能和死灵术，就能让受击的灵魂承受痛楚，\n"
"所造成的负能量伤害能够穿透护甲。\n"

#. key: staff of earth
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of earth"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of earth spells cast by its wielder. If the\n"
"wielder is skilled in Evocations and Earth magic, they can fracture the ground\n"
"beneath those struck by it, dealing substantial damage - though much less to\n"
"creatures which fly.\n"
msgstr ""
"这根法杖能增强使用者施展土系魔法的威力。\n"
"如果使用者精通激活技能和土系魔法，\n"
"就能用其破碎受击的地面，造成巨大伤害——尽管对飞行生物的伤害要小得多。\n"

#. key: staff of fire
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of fire"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of fire spells cast by its wielder, and\n"
"protects them from the effects of fire. If the wielder is skilled in Evocations\n"
"and Fire Magic, they can burn those struck by it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这根法杖能增强使用者施展火系魔法的威力，并能帮助其抵御火焰的影响。\n"
"如果使用者精通激活技能和火系魔法，就能用其烧灼受击者，\n"
"所造成的火焰伤害能够穿透护甲。\n"

#. key: starry gem
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:starry gem"
msgid ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"Odd lights twinkle within the depths of this gem. From what strange stuff is it\n"
"made, and from what distant land did it travel?\n"
msgstr ""
"[[gem]]\n"
"\n"
"这颗宝石的深处闪烁着奇异的光芒。\n"
"它是用什么奇怪的物质制成的？它是从哪个遥远的地方流传过来的？\n"

#. key: steam dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:steam dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a steam-breathing dragon. Unlike the scales of some larger\n"
"dragons, it does not provide its wearer with much protection (beyond a\n"
"resistance to scalding steam), but it is extremely light and supple.\n"
msgstr ""
"吐息蒸汽之龙的鳞甲。\n"
"它为穿戴者提供的防护不如那些更大的龙的鳞甲（除了对灼热蒸汽的抵抗力），\n"
"但它却十分柔软、轻盈。\n"

#. key: stone
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stone"
msgid ""
"A small chunk of dense but otherwise unremarkable natural mineral. It can be\n"
"thrown to cause minor damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"一小块致密而常见的天然矿物。投掷它可以造成少量伤害。\n"

#. key: shadow dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shadow dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a great umbral dragon. It is heavier than most dragon scale\n"
"armours, but its encumbrance does not penalise the wearer's stealth. It also\n"
"grants additional stealth to the wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"巨大的影龙的鳞甲。它比大多数龙鳞甲重，\n"
"虽然如此，它却与阴影融合得很好，从而为穿戴者潜行带来巨大的好处。\n"

#. key: storm dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:storm dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a lightning-breathing dragon. It is heavier than most dragon\n"
"scale armours, and gives its wearer resistance to electrical discharges.\n"
msgstr ""
"吐息闪电之龙的鳞甲。它比绝大多数的龙鳞甲要重，但它能大大强化穿戴者的电抗。\n"

#. key: storm talisman
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:storm talisman"
msgid ""
"Lightning trapped, impossibly, in a bottle. Lets the wearer walk through the air\n"
"as a raging, lightning-filled tempest. The wearer's melee attacks are electrified\n"
"and strike all adjacent foes. The wearer also flies, gains immunity to poison,\n"
"miasma, petrification, constriction, and sticky flame, and also resists\n"
"electricity. They can launch themselves as a lightning bolt, blasting through\n"
"everything in their way.\n"
msgstr ""
"闪电不可思议地被捕获在一个瓶子里。\n"
"它能让使用者在空中穿行，如同一股狂暴的、充满闪电的风暴。\n"
"使用者的近战攻击将带有电属性，会打击到所有相邻的敌人。\n"
"使用者还能够飞行，免疫毒、瘴气、石化、束缚和的粘性火焰，并有了电抗。\n"
"他们可以像闪电箭一样发射自己，炸开挡路的一切。\n"
"风暴形态下的攻击力和闪避率高度取决于使用者的变身技能。\n"
"\n"
"变形后，装备的任何武器和盔甲都会被融合。\n"

#. key: swamp dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:swamp dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a swamp dragon. It confers resistance to poison on its wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"一套沼泽龙鳞甲。它能赋予穿戴者对毒的抗性。\n"

#. key: talisman of death
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:talisman of death"
msgid ""
"A grey-black vessel, infused with dark power through a sickening ritual.\n"
"Transforms the wearer into an undying offence against life itself.\n"
"\n"
"Foes struck by wearer's melee weapons or hands are weakened, slowed, and drained.\n"
"The wearer can also heal themself by tormenting living foes nearby; Shapeshifting\n"
"skill increases the amount healed. Further, the wearer resists cold, has enhanced\n"
"willpower, and is immune to poison, miasma, negative energy, and torment.\n"
"\n"
"The wearer also gains some of the more dubious benefits of having an undead body.\n"
"They are vulnerable to holy damage and Dispel Undead, and cannot consume potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个灰黑色的容器，以令人不安的仪式向其注入了黑暗的力量。\n"
"它能将使用者成为对生命存在的永恒冒犯。\n"
"\n"
"被使用者用近战武器或手击中的敌人会被虚弱、减速、衰竭。\n"
"使用者还可以通过折磨附近的活物敌人来治疗自己；提升变身技能能增加治愈量。\n"
"此外，使用者将能抵抗寒冷，意志力会增强，并免疫毒、瘴气、负能量和折磨。\n"
"\n"
"使用者还能从这副亡灵身躯中获得一些微妙的好处。\n"
"然而，他们易受神圣攻击和驱散亡灵的伤害，且无法服用药水。\n"

#. key: there-and-back book
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:there-and-back book"
msgid ""
"A compilation of children's stories about great adventures, always ending with\n"
"the traveller returning to the place they started. The love infused into its\n"
"pages by countless generations has granted it power, allowing a skilled mage to\n"
"transport others by reciting specific passages.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本汇编收录着关于伟大冒险的儿童故事，\n"
"这些故事总会以旅行者回到他们开始的地方为结束。无数代人向其中注入了爱，\n"
"赋予了它力量，使得熟练的法师可以通过吟诵特定的段落传送他人。\n"

#. key: throwing net
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throwing net"
msgid ""
"A mesh of ropes knotted together with weights around the edge, used to entangle\n"
"and entrap targets. Struggling victims can eventually destroy the net and break\n"
"free, if they live long enough.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个在边缘打结了重物的绳网，用来缠住和诱捕猎物。\n"
"挣扎着的受害者最终能摧毁网并获得自由，如果他们能活到那么久的话。\n"

#. key: tower shield
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tower shield"
msgid ""
"A large piece of wood and metal, to be strapped on one arm for defence.\n"
msgstr ""
"一大块木头和金属，通过绑在一只手臂上进行防御。\n"

#. key: tin of tremorstones
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tin of tremorstones"
msgid ""
"A set of dormant, magnetic earth elementals in the form of tiny, very heavy\n"
"pebbles. When released, the elementals are drawn magnetically to the center of\n"
"nearby monsters, where they literally explode with rage at their rest being\n"
"disturbed. Tremorstones usually land slightly off-target, and the user is\n"
"always at risk of being hit. However, armour is extremely effective at\n"
"repelling the lightweight fragments of rock from a tremorstone's explosion, so\n"
"a well-armoured wielder has little to fear. Evocations skill increases the\n"
"number of explosions.\n"
msgstr ""
"一组休眠的、有磁性的土元素，外形是微小的、非常重的鹅卵石。\n"
"当释放时，元素会被磁力吸引到附近怪物的中心，\n"
"在那里，它们会因在休眠时被扰动而愤怒地爆发。\n"
"震颤石通常会稍微偏离目标，并且使用者总有被击中的风险。\n"
"然而，护甲在抵挡震颤石的爆炸中所迸发的轻质岩石碎片非常有效，\n"
"所以一个全副武装的使用者没什么好担心的。提升激活技能能增加爆炸次数。\n"

#. key: trident
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trident"
msgid ""
"A fishing spear improved with a longer shaft and a three-pronged metal head.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把经过改进的鱼叉，有了更长的杆和三叉的金属头。\n"

#. key: trismegistus codex
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trismegistus codex"
msgid ""
"A magical book\n"
"written by a\n"
"numerologically obsessed wizard.\n"
"Everything from sentence\n"
"length to overall\n"
"organization is structured.\n"
"It's unclear whether\n"
"the author thought\n"
"this was helpful.\n"
msgstr ""
"这本魔法书，由痴迷于数字命理学的巫师所写。\n"
"从句子长度到整体组织，都是结构化的。\n"
"目前尚不清楚作者是否认为这是有用的。\n"

#. key: triple crossbow
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:triple crossbow"
msgid ""
"A crossbow with three strings arranged in series to provide exceptional power,\n"
"initially designed as a siege weapon and then scaled down. It takes a\n"
"considerable amount of time to load and fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个弩装有三根弦，能够为其提供出色的动力，最初它是被设计为攻城武器，\n"
"后来缩小了规模。装填和发射都需要一些时间。\n"

#. key: triple sword
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:triple sword"
msgid ""
"A formidable weapon created by a master craftsman. The blade of the sword forks\n"
"into three great razor-sharp edges.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把由大师级工匠打造的强大武器。这把剑的刀刃分叉成三个锋利的刀口。\n"

#. key: trishula
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trishula"
msgid ""
"A blessed trident moulded by cleansing flame, with three points symbolising the\n"
"combined might of the three holy gods. It is a favoured weapon of the Shining\n"
"One's servants.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把在圣火中铸就的三叉戟，它的三个尖寓意着三大善神的联盟。\n"
"这件武器深受光明神的信徒喜爱。\n"

#. key: troll leather armour
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:troll leather armour"
msgid ""
"The stiff and knobbly skin of a troll. It magically regenerates its wearer's\n"
"flesh, once attuned to the wearer's body at full health.\n"
msgstr ""
"巨魔坚硬而多节的外皮。它能神奇地恢复穿戴者的身体健康，\n"
"但需要在生命值已满后穿戴，才能与身体相协调从而发挥作用。\n"

#. key: the unrestrained analects
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the unrestrained analects"
msgid ""
"A collection of spells that assault everything in sight of the caster,\n"
"unrestrained by petty limitations like 'needing a clear shot' or 'concern about\n"
"collateral damage'.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本法术合集，收录着能攻击施法者视线范围内一切东西的咒语，\n"
"不受诸如“需要明确的射击”或“担心附带伤害”等琐碎原则的局限。\n"

#. key: wand of acid
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of acid"
msgid ""
"A magical device which throws bolts of corrosive acid.\n"
msgstr ""
"一支可以射出腐蚀性酸液的魔法道具。\n"

#. key: wand of charming
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of charming"
msgid ""
"A magical device which causes a creature to become fiercely, but briefly,\n"
"loyal to the user.\n"
msgstr ""
"这支魔法道具，能使一个生物变得凶猛，并短暂地效忠使用者。\n"

#. key: wand of digging
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of digging"
msgid ""
"A magical device which drills tunnels through unworked rock.\n"
msgstr ""
"一支用以在粗糙岩石上挖掘通道的魔法道具。\n"

#. key: wand of flame
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of flame"
msgid ""
"A magical device which throws little puffs of flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"一支能喷射出一些火焰的魔法道具。\n"

#. key: wand of iceblast
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of iceblast"
msgid ""
"A magical device which creates a loud explosion of ice shards, bypassing half\n"
"of victims' resistance to cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"这支魔法道具，能造成轰鸣作响的碎冰爆炸，这能穿透受击者的一半寒抗。\n"

#. key: wand of light
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of light"
msgid ""
"A magical device which fires a ray of searing light, injuring and blinding\n"
"those struck. Only living, undead, demonic and angelic monsters can be blinded,\n"
"and tougher monsters will recover their vision more quickly.\n"
msgstr ""
"这支魔法道具，能发射灼热的光线，使被击中的怪物受伤和失明。\n"
"只有动物、恶魔和天使类怪物才能失明。并且更强的怪物会更快地恢复视力。\n"

#. key: wand of mindburst
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of mindburst"
msgid ""
"A magical device which launches a psychic attack on a target creature. If it\n"
"overcomes their willpower, it 'blows their mind' in a violently literal fashion,\n"
"dealing damage that bypasses their armour entirely. It is useless against\n"
"mindless creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"一支能对目标生物造成心灵攻击的魔法道具。\n"
"如果它击垮了他们的意志力，它会以强烈的风格显示出文字“击溃了他们的心灵”，\n"
"并造成完全无视他们防具的伤害。它对没有意识的生物没有作用。\n"

#. key: wand of paralysis
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of paralysis"
msgid ""
"A magical device which can render a creature immobile, incapable of moving any\n"
"of its limbs.\n"
msgstr ""
"这支魔法道具，能使生物无法移动，且无法移动任何肢体。\n"

#. key: wand of polymorph
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of polymorph"
msgid ""
"A magical device which causes a creature to be transmogrified into another\n"
"form. It is especially effective against shape-changing creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"这支魔法道具能将目标生物变形成另一种形态。它对拥有变形能力的怪物特别有效。\n"

#. key: wand of quicksilver
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of quicksilver"
msgid ""
"A magical device which fires a beam of destructive energy, dispelling\n"
"enchantments on creatures struck.\n"
msgstr ""
"这支魔法道具，能发射一束破坏性能量，驱散被击中的生物身上的魔力。\n"

#. key: wand of roots
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of roots"
msgid ""
"A magical device which fires a magical seed, entangling its target and adjacent\n"
"foes in quick-growing tree roots. Those entangled will be immobilised and take\n"
"damage over time until they escape or the roots wither away. The roots will only\n"
"sprout from solid ground.\n"
msgstr ""
"这支神奇的道具，能够发射一颗魔法种子，\n"
"将目标和相邻的敌人缠绕在快速生长的树根中。\n"
"那些被缠绕的怪物会被固定，并随着时间的推移受到越来越大的伤害，\n"
"直到他们逃脱或根系枯萎。根系只会从坚实的土地中发芽。\n"

#. key: war axe
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:war axe"
msgid ""
"A military axe with a long haft and a single-bladed head.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把长柄、单刃的军用斧。\n"

#. key: whip
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:whip"
msgid ""
"A long plaited strip of leather. Originally developed for use in disagreements\n"
"with cattle, this simple weapon is now widely used to settle differences\n"
"between all sorts of creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条长长的编织而成的皮条。这种简易武器最初是用作放牧的工具的，\n"
"但用来教训其他种类的生物时一样好用。\n"

#. key: young poisoner's handbook
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:young poisoner's handbook"
msgid ""
"An introductory book for the magic arts of poison. Readers are recommended to\n"
"wear a pair of very thick, non-absorbent gloves.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本介绍毒系魔法的书。建议读者戴上非常厚实、没有吸收性的手套。\n"

#. key: amulet
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet"
msgid ""
"An amulet to be worn as jewellery around the neck, charged with arcane powers\n"
"of unknown provenance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个护身符，可以当作首饰佩戴在脖子上，其中充满了来源不明的奥术能量。\n"

#. key: book
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book"
msgid ""
"An arcane textbook containing magical spells of unknown origin.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本晦涩难懂的古书，写着不知何源的魔咒。\n"

#. key: potion
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion"
msgid ""
"An unlabelled flask containing a single dose of unknown liquid.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个没有标签的瓶子里装有某种未知的液体。\n"

#. key: ring
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring"
msgid ""
"A ring charged with arcane forces of unknown provenance, to be worn as jewellery\n"
"on a finger.\n"
msgstr ""
"一枚戒指，其中充满了来源不明的奥术能量，可以当作首饰佩戴在手指上。\n"

#. key: scroll
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll"
msgid ""
"A disposable arcane formula inscribed on parchment by a professional scribe or\n"
"sorcerer. Anyone can evoke the power of the arcane formula by reading it out\n"
"loud, but the nature of that power is not a priori apparent.\n"
msgstr ""
"某位专业的抄写员，也可能是术师，在这张羊皮纸上写下了一道一次性的魔法咒语。\n"
"任何人都可以通过大声阅读卷轴上的咒语来释放其中的魔力，\n"
"但你事先并不知道它施放的魔法到底是什么。\n"

#. key: staff
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff"
msgid ""
"A staff improved with arcane powers of unknown nature.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根被某种奥术能量强化过的木杖。\n"

#. key: wand
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand"
msgid ""
"An unusually magical sort of stick.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根可能含有魔力的小棍子。\n"

#. key: singing sword
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:singing sword"
msgid ""
"An enchanted blade which loves nothing more than to sing to its owner, whether\n"
"they want it to or not.\n"
msgstr ""
"这件被施了魔法的有刃武器最喜欢对它的主人唱歌，\n"
"至于主人想不想听它唱，它可管不着。\n"

#. key: wrath of trog
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wrath of trog"
msgid ""
"A bloodstained axe that was the favourite weapon of the old god Trog, before it\n"
"was lost. It induces a bloodthirsty berserker rage when used in battle, although\n"
"mere mortals who wield it will find themselves temporarily overwhelmed by Trog's\n"
"power.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把血迹斑斑的斧头在遗失之前，曾是古神特洛戈最爱的武器。\n"
"当在战斗中使用它时，它会引发嗜血狂暴，\n"
"凡人哪怕只是装备它，暂时都会被特洛戈的力量所压倒。\n"

#. key: mace of variability
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mace of variability"
msgid ""
"A large mace said to have appeared when Xom grew bored with the predictability\n"
"of more ordinary instruments of chaos.\n"
msgstr ""
"据说，当佐姆对普通混沌工具的可预测性感到厌倦时，出现了一个巨大的权杖。\n"

#. key: partisan of prune
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:partisan of prune"
msgid ""
"The partisan of Prune carries a terrible and insidious curse. Unless its wielder\n"
"maintains firm self-control, they are doomed to undergo a horrifying (albeit\n"
"temporary) transformation. This is normally trivial to resist, but incapacitated\n"
"wielders are certain to succumb, finding themselves nightmarishly purple, squishy,\n"
"and delicious. They can take comfort in learning that it's surprisingly hard to\n"
"injure a giant prune.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把梅干大刀带有可怕而阴险的诅咒。\n"
"持有它的人除非有着坚定的自制力，\n"
"否则注定会经历一场可怕的（尽管只是暂时的）变形。\n"
"反抗通常是徒劳的，而无能的持有者肯定会屈服，他们会发现自己变得湿软、美味，\n"
"颜色也变成梦魇般的紫色。\n"
"他们可以感到欣慰的是，弄伤一颗巨大的梅干却出人意料地难。\n"

#. key: staff of olgreb
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of olgreb"
msgid ""
"A staff which was once wielded by the great alchemist Olgreb.\n"
msgstr ""
"强大的炼金术士奥格雷布曾用过的一把法杖。\n"

#. key: crystal ball of wucad mu
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crystal ball of wucad mu"
msgid ""
"A sphere of flawless crystal, shaped by countless mantras. When one focuses upon\n"
"it, the boundaries between 'self' and 'other' sometimes seem to blur.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Djinni\" then\n"
"        return \"It is utterly useless to Djinn.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"一个满溢着魔力的水晶球。\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Djinni\" then\n"
"        return \"它对灯神完全无用。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: vampire's tooth
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vampire's tooth"
msgid ""
"An ivory-like quick blade that looks like it could have been crafted from the\n"
"tooth of some enormous predatory creature. It is lethally vampiric.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把形同象牙的快刃，看上去像是雕琢自某种巨型肉食动物的牙。那是致命的吸血鬼的。\n"

#. key: scythe of curses
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scythe of curses"
msgid ""
"A scythe surrounded by an ominous aura of dread. It carries a terrible and\n"
"ancient curse, which it busily inflicts on both the wielder and their enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把被环绕在不祥的恐惧光环下的镰刀。\n"
"它带有一种可怕而古老的诅咒，对持有者和敌人一并造成伤害。\n"

#. key: sceptre of torment
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sceptre of torment"
msgid ""
"An accursed bone sceptre, created by some unknown hellish power. When used in\n"
"combat, it causes agonising pain in all those unfortunate enough to gaze upon\n"
"it, save for the wielder.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把被诅咒的骨制节杖，由某种未知的地狱力量创造。\n"
"在战斗中使用时，它会给所有注视它的不幸者带来极度痛楚，除了持用者。\n"

#. key: sword of cerebov
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sword of cerebov"
msgid ""
"A twisted blade, covered in eerie flames. Its demonic power burns away at the\n"
"very essence of those it is wielded against.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把扭曲的剑，周身被包裹在奇异的火焰中。它的恶魔的力量能烧毁对方的内在属性。\n"

#. key: orb of dispater
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb of dispater"
msgid ""
"An orb pulsing with unholy energies, granting the power to unleash damnation\n"
"when held — although not without draining the wielder's vitality in the\n"
"process. It carries with it some of the corrosive malice of the Iron City of\n"
"Dis.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个充满邪恶能量的水晶球，能够赋予释放天谴的能力，但在此过程中，\n"
"并非不会耗竭使用者的生命力。它带有狄斯铁城的一些腐蚀性的恶意。\n"

#. key: sceptre of asmodeus
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sceptre of asmodeus"
msgid ""
"A bright ruby sceptre, carrying some of the powers of the arch-fiend Asmodeus.\n"
"It may call forth fiery demons from their infernal home to do the wielder's\n"
"bidding.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把明亮的红宝石节杖，带有魔王阿斯蒙蒂斯的某些力量。\n"
"持有者能凭借它召唤、号令来自地狱巢穴的火系恶魔。\n"

#. key: faerie dragon scales
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:faerie dragon scales"
msgid ""
"An enchanted suit of armour created from the scales of a rare breed of dragon,\n"
"now thought to be extinct. This prized relic is now one of the last proofs that\n"
"the vividly coloured faerie dragons ever existed.\n"
msgstr ""
"这套魔力铠甲，由一种稀有品种的龙的鳞片制成，而这个物种现在被认为已经灭绝。\n"
"这件珍贵的遗物是色彩鲜艳的精灵龙曾经存在过的最后证据之一。\n"

#. key: demon blade "bloodbane"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon blade \"bloodbane\""
msgid ""
"A blade forged in Hell by the sacrifice of countless tortured souls. It\n"
"inflicts the rage and suffering of those souls upon its wielder.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过献祭无数受难灵魂而在地狱锻造出的一把剑。\n"
"它将那些灵魂的狂怒和苦难都施加到持有者的身上。\n"

#. key: scimitar of flaming death
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scimitar of flaming death"
msgid ""
"A scimitar with a mysteriously smoking blade. Occasionally its heat leaks out,\n"
"covering opponents in magical flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把刀刃上冒着神秘烟气的弯刀。\n"
"有时它的热量会泄漏出来，将敌人裹在在魔法的火焰之中。\n"

#. key: eveningstar "brilliance"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eveningstar \"brilliance\""
msgid ""
"Soon after falling, Yredelemnul attempted to twist holy energy into a dark\n"
"mockery of itself, turning it against its progenitors and weakening it against\n"
"undead and demons. It was discovered too late that such a complete perversion\n"
"was uncontrollable; the foul flame destabilised or destroyed everything it was\n"
"infused into, except for several demonic test subjects and one stolen holy\n"
"weapon. A lesser, and more stable, version of the dark energy proved more\n"
"workable, and became Yredelemnul's umbra.\n"
"\n"
"This is that weapon: an eveningstar with its light long fled, despite its name,\n"
"and a shadow that repulses those its light used to comfort...\n"
msgstr ""
"一个闪闪发光的昏星锤。它照亮了地牢的幽深处，却也吸引了敌人。\n"
"亡灵憎恶它的光芒，那些想要隐身的怪物的图谋也无所遁形。\n"

#. key: demon blade "leech"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon blade \"leech\""
msgid ""
"A blade forged in Hell by the sacrifice of countless tortured souls. It fills\n"
"its wielder with the rage and suffering of those souls, and gorges itself\n"
"further on drained life force every time it strikes, leaving behind a mess of\n"
"blood and gore.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过献祭无数受难灵魂而在地狱锻造出的一把剑。\n"
"它让那些灵魂的愤怒和痛苦充斥着它的持有者，\n"
"每次攻击时，它都会吸取生命力，留下一团血污。\n"

#. key: dagger of chilly death
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dagger of chilly death"
msgid ""
"A dagger made of one huge shard of sapphire. It covers opponents in ice,\n"
"slowing down their movement somewhat.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把匕首由一整块巨型蓝宝石制成。它将冰覆盖在敌人身上，使他们的移动有所迟缓。\n"

#. key: dagger "morg"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dagger \"morg\""
msgid ""
"An ugly rusty dagger. Many years ago it was the property of a powerful mage\n"
"called Boris. He got lost in the Dungeon while seeking the Orb.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把丑陋、生锈的匕首。很多年前为一位名叫鲍里斯的强大法师所有。\n"
"他在地牢中搜寻宝珠时失踪了。\n"

#. key: scythe "finisher"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scythe \"finisher\""
msgid ""
"A long and exceedingly sharp scythe, capable of eviscerating in a single blow.\n"
"Its extraordinary speed is the work of a mad wizard, who spent years refining\n"
"it before discarding it in a fit of rage.\n"
"\n"
"The blade looses a low keen as it cuts through the air.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把锋利的长镰刀，一击就能将内脏掏出。\n"
"它那非凡的速度是出自一个疯狂的巫师的杰作，\n"
"他花了数年时间提炼它，却一怒之下将其丢弃。\n"
"\n"
"刀刃划过空气，留下咻咻的声音。\n"

#. key: greatsling "punk"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:greatsling \"punk\""
msgid ""
"A sling made of weird green leather, oozing corrosive slime. Originally the\n"
"weapon of a notorious mischief-maker and general scamp, it's since fallen into\n"
"less savoury hands.\n"
msgstr ""
"用奇怪的绿色皮革制成的投石索，渗出着腐蚀性的黏液。\n"
"它最初是臭名昭著的恶作剧制造者和小捣乱鬼的武器，后来落入令人不快的生物手中。\n"

#. key: longbow "zephyr"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:longbow \"zephyr\""
msgid ""
"A golden bow, strung with a lock of hair from the West Wind themselves. Tales\n"
"say it was crafted as a gift to an unrequited love and even centuries after their\n"
"untimely death, one can still feel longing carried on the gentle breeze that\n"
"surrounds its wielder.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把弓由气法师埃奥莱菲用空气编织而成，作为给乌斯卡亚的一个孩子的礼物。\n"
"这把弓能以惊人的速度拉动，发射迅速而准确。\n"
"它也几乎坚不可摧，这是幸运的，因为原主人被嫉妒的参与庆典的人撕成碎片。\n"

#. key: giant club "skullcrusher"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:giant club \"skullcrusher\""
msgid ""
"A massive enchanted cudgel that augments the already considerable strength of\n"
"anyone mighty enough to wield it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根巨大被施入魔法的棍棒，会增强任何强大到能够挥舞它的人本就相当强大的力量。\n"

#. key: glaive of the guard
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:glaive of the guard"
msgid ""
"A glaive commissioned several years ago by a wealthy queen fearful for the\n"
"safety of her vast treasury. No foe, the smith promised, could defeat a guard\n"
"wielding such a weapon!\n"
"\n"
"It was stolen a few months later, along with the rest of the queen's treasury;\n"
"the guard, it transpired, had been caught napping. Still, it should serve more\n"
"than adequately in the hands of a waking user.\n"
msgstr ""
"几年前，一位富有的女王委托制造一把大刀，她担心自己庞大的国库的安全。\n"
"铁匠保证，没有任何敌人能打败一个手持这把武器的卫兵！\n"
"\n"
"几个月后，它和女王金库里的其他东西一起被盗；据透露，这名卫兵被发现在打盹。\n"
"只是，它如果为清醒的人所用，本能大显身手。\n"

#. key: zealot's sword
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zealot's sword"
msgid ""
"A sword made of one huge piece of crystal. Legend says it was the Shining One's\n"
"gift to a worshipper. This blade is notorious for inducing bloodthirsty rage in\n"
"both the wielder and all of their followers.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把剑由一大块巨型水晶制成。传言是光明神赐予其信徒的。\n"
"这把剑因在持用者及其所有追随者中引起嗜血的狂暴而臭名昭著。\n"

#. key: arbalest "damnation"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:arbalest \"damnation\""
msgid ""
"An unholy crossbow, forged in the fires of Gehenna. It imbues the bolts it\n"
"fires with the raw power of its namesake. Thankfully, the blasts this weapon\n"
"produces never harm the one firing.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把邪恶的弩，在欣嫩谷的火中锻造而成。它将与它同名的原力注入了弩箭。\n"
"值得庆幸的是，这把武器产生的爆炸不会对开火的人造成伤害。\n"

#. key: sword of the dread knight
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sword of the dread knight"
msgid ""
"An adamantine great sword. Its first wielder was a worshipper of Yredelemnul\n"
"who eschewed the use of magic in combat, preferring to destroy her enemies with\n"
"brute force. Unfortunately for her, not all of her opponents shared her\n"
"limitations.\n"
"\n"
"It has felled countless great warriors under her grip, and the souls of those\n"
"who had their lives taken beckon it to take even more under its new owner.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把刚劲的巨剑。第一个持有它的人是伊莱德莱姆努尔的信徒，\n"
"她不屑于使用魔法，喜欢用蛮力毁灭敌人。\n"
"对她而言不幸的是，并非所有敌人像她那样局限。\n"

#. key: morningstar "eos"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:morningstar \"eos\""
msgid ""
"A jewelled morningstar, glowing brightly with the light of the dawn. It\n"
"illuminates the dungeon's recesses, revealing the machinations of those who\n"
"would prefer to stay invisible.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把镶有宝石的晨星锤，在曙光下熠熠生辉。\n"
"它照亮了地牢的幽深处，令那些想要隐身的怪物的图谋无所遁形。\n"

#. key: spear of the botono
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spear of the botono"
msgid ""
"A dark and malign artefact. It increases the potency of hexes cast by anyone\n"
"unwise enough to risk wielding it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把黑暗、邪恶的神器。它能强化那些不理智的要持握它的人施放妖术。\n"

#. key: trident of the octopus king
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trident of the octopus king"
msgid ""
"A trident stolen many years ago from the Octopus King's garden. Luckily, he\n"
"seems to be in no hurry to get it back.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把多年前从章鱼王的花园中偷来的三叉戟。幸运的是，他似乎不急于寻回。\n"

#. key: mithril axe "arga"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mithril axe \"arga\""
msgid ""
"A beautiful mithril axe, probably lost by some dwarven hero.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把精致的秘银斧，这大概是某个矮人英雄遗落的武器吧。\n"

#. key: elemental staff
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elemental staff"
msgid ""
"A powerful staff which used to belong to the leader of the Guild of Five\n"
"Elements. It is imbued with protective and offensive enhancements from all\n"
"the elemental schools of magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一支强大的法杖，曾经属于五行会的会长。\n"
"它注入了各种元素魔法流派的进攻和防御性增益。\n"

#. key: heavy crossbow "sniper"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:heavy crossbow \"sniper\""
msgid ""
"The sacred weapon of Toth-Mos, first apostle of the god Ashenzari. It grants\n"
"the wielder a fraction of Ashenzari's own vision, ensuring that every shot will\n"
"land true.\n"
msgstr ""
"艾申扎利的第一信徒托斯莫斯的骇人的武器。\n"
"它可以让持用者获得艾申扎利的一部分视野，保证例无虚发。\n"

#. key: longbow "piercer"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:longbow \"piercer\""
msgid ""
"An exceptionally large metal longbow.\n"
msgstr ""
"一张特别大的金属长弓。\n"

#. key: blowgun of the assassin
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blowgun of the assassin"
msgid ""
"This blowgun seems to guide the needle to seek the most lethal point to hit\n"
"the target, packing a nasty punch.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把吹矢枪似乎可以引导飞针寻找最薄弱的点，发出重击。\n"

#. key: lance "wyrmbane"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lance \"wyrmbane\""
msgid ""
"An enchanted lance deadly to all dragonkind. It grows more powerful every time\n"
"it inflicts a killing blow on a strong dragon. The more powerful it grows, the\n"
"harder it will be to find a worthy opponent.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把对所有龙类致命的魔法长枪。\n"
"每对一只强大的龙造成致命一击都使它的威力就会更强。\n"
"它的威力越强，与它相称的强敌越少。\n"

#. key: spriggan's knife
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spriggan's knife"
msgid ""
"A dainty little knife which was made by Spriggans, or for Spriggans, or\n"
"possibly from Spriggans. Anyway, it's in some way associated with those fey\n"
"folk.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把精致的小刀，由树精或为树精制作的。\n"
"不管怎么说，它在某种程度上与那些玄虚的传说有关。\n"

#. key: plutonium sword
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:plutonium sword"
msgid ""
"A triple sword made of weird glowing metal. It irradiates those it strikes,\n"
"causing a range of unpredictable effects — if they survive the impact of the\n"
"blade itself, that is.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把由奇异的发光金属制成的三重剑。它会辐射它所击中的，\n"
"产生一系列无法预知的后果——如果他们在利刃之下仍能幸存的话。\n"

#. key: great mace "undeadhunter"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:great mace \"undeadhunter\""
msgid ""
"A weapon imbued with magic to disrupt and destroy the forces binding undead\n"
"creatures together. Legends say that, long ago, a lich lord created many\n"
"such weapons to ensure the loyalty of his undead servants. Sadly, this mace\n"
"might be the last one left.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种充满魔力的武器，能够瓦解、摧毁将亡灵生物的身体缚在一起的力量。\n"
"传说，很久以前，一个巫妖领主制造了许多这样的武器，以确保其亡灵仆从的忠诚。\n"
"可悲的是，这支权杖可能是最后一个了。\n"

#. key: whip "snakebite"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:whip \"snakebite\""
msgid ""
"A double-ended whip made from the cured hides of black mambas, and enchanted\n"
"with toxins ranging from ordinary venoms to asphyxiating curare.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种由黑曼巴蛇的皮制成的双端鞭，附有从普通的毒液到令人窒息的箭毒碱毒素。\n"

#. key: knife of accuracy
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:knife of accuracy"
msgid ""
"It is almost unerringly accurate.\n"
msgstr ""
"它几乎精准到了不象话的地步。\n"

#. key: lehudib's crystal spear
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lehudib's crystal spear"
msgid ""
"Presumably this relic led to the invention of the famous spell, or maybe the\n"
"other way around.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许是这件神器就是那道著名法术的原型，也可能正好相反。\n"

#. key: captain's cutlass
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:captain's cutlass"
msgid ""
"An infamous weapon, once used by a vile pirate captain to slaughter countless\n"
"innocents. He finally met his destiny when a kraken swallowed his ship, and the\n"
"cutlass was thought to be lost with him.\n"
msgstr ""
"曾经有个邪恶的海盗船长用这件臭名昭著的武器杀了无数的无辜之人。\n"
"当一只海怪吞下他的船时，他终于碰到了自己的劫数，\n"
"而那把短弯刀曾被认为和他一样，不知所踪。\n"

#. key: storm bow
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:storm bow"
msgid ""
"A longbow with the colour of dark rain clouds that fires arrows like lightning.\n"
msgstr ""
"一张阴暗的雨云色的长弓，能射出闪电般的箭。\n"

#. key: tower shield of ignorance
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tower shield of ignorance"
msgid ""
"A shield unearthed from the remains of a ruined city. It bears an inscription\n"
"written in an ancient language. Scholars and wise men laboured for countless\n"
"hours to decipher it, and in time, a translation was finally settled on:\n"
"\n"
"\"With a shield like this, who needs to think?\"\n"
msgstr ""
"从城市废墟中出土的盾牌。上面有用古文书写的铭文。\n"
"学者和智者们花费了无数的时间来破译它，最终，译文敲定了：\n"
"\n"
"“有了这样的盾牌，谁需要思考？”\n"

#. key: robe of augmentation
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of augmentation"
msgid ""
"A variegated robe, woven with enchantments to enhance the wearer's physical and\n"
"mental abilities. Its creators wove in strands of hair from a hundred different\n"
"animals, each chosen for the unique strengths it could grant the robe's wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件斑驳的长袍，织入了魔法，以增强穿着者的身心。\n"
"它的制造者用百种不同动物的毛发进行编织，\n"
"每种动物的毛发都能赋予穿着者独特的力量。\n"

#. key: cloak of the thief
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak of the thief"
msgid ""
"A pitch-black cloak which allows its wearer to excel in the arts of thievery.\n"
"Even the clumsy will find their footsteps softer and the shouts of their\n"
"adversaries less attention-getting.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件漆黑的披风，能让它的穿着者精通盗窃艺术。\n"
"它还带有魔力，使穿着者能在雾的掩护下迅速撤退，以防止被发现。\n"

#. key: tower shield "bullseye"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tower shield \"bullseye\""
msgid ""
"Just in case you had trouble getting hit.\n"
msgstr ""
"以免在你受伤时遇到麻烦。\n"

#. key: crown of dyrovepreva
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crown of dyrovepreva"
msgid ""
"A large circlet of dull bronze, set with a dazzling array of gemstones. It was\n"
"first worn by a prince of the Titans, who sought protection from the incessant\n"
"warfare between his fellow princes. In practice, the main effect of the\n"
"artefact was to unite his rivals against him.\n"
msgstr ""
"一顶暗色青铜铸成的巨大王冠，镶嵌着许多光彩夺目的宝石。\n"
"一位泰坦族的王子曾戴过它，希望它能在王位之争中保护自己。\n"
"实际上，这件神器的主要效果是让他的对手联合起来对抗他。\n"

#. key: hat of the bear spirit
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat of the bear spirit"
msgid ""
"A fur hat once owned by Ukta, a powerful ogre shaman. It houses the spirit of\n"
"an especially mighty bear, whose rages devastated the ogres until it was slain.\n"
msgstr ""
"这顶毛帽曾经是一位强大的食人魔萨满——乌克塔的所有物。\n"
"它里面寄宿着一个特别强大的熊灵，它的愤怒控制了食人魔，直到它被杀死。\n"

#. key: robe of misfortune
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of misfortune"
msgid ""
"A splendid flowing robe of fur and silk whose lucky colour has faded.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件精美、顺滑的长袍，用毛皮和丝绸织成，其幸运的色彩已经褪去。\n"

#. key: cloak of flash
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak of flash"
msgid ""
"A cloak that twitches and jerks without any intervention.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件会自行抽动的披风。\n"

#. key: hood of the assassin
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hood of the assassin"
msgid ""
"A soft hood, enchanted by members of the Assassin's Guild to allow the wearer\n"
"to sense potential victims nearby, and to easily spot vulnerabilities after\n"
"closing in on them.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种柔软的兜帽，被刺客公会成员施入魔法，可以让佩戴者感知附近潜在的受击者，\n"
"并在接近他们后，轻易发现其弱点。\n"

#. key: lear's hauberk
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lear's hauberk"
msgid ""
"A well-made golden hauberk that covers all of its wearer's body parts. It\n"
"includes a chainmail coif, chausses and maille gauntlets.\n"
msgstr ""
"这套做工精良的黄金锁子甲能覆盖穿戴者的所有身体部位。\n"
"这套护甲中包含一顶锁子甲防护帽、一副腿甲，和一副链制手套。\n"

#. key: skin of zhor
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:skin of zhor"
msgid ""
"The {{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"smelly \"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}skin of some strange animal, native to cold and distant lands. It radiates\n"
"the chill of its native habitat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件{{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"难闻的\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}毛皮，源于某种在寒冷而遥远的地方生长的奇怪动物。它散发着原栖息地的寒意。\n"

#. key: salamander hide armour
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:salamander hide armour"
msgid ""
"Most salamanders' bodies are consigned to the fiery depths from which they\n"
"sprang. Rarely, though, salamanders instead preserve the skins of those that\n"
"passed. The runes and decorations on this hide suggest it once belonged to a\n"
"respected warrior or priest - perhaps even a king. The fiery spirit remains in\n"
"the skin, granting its power to the wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"大多数火蜥蜴的尸体都被送到他们生长的火海深处。\n"
"然而，火蜥蜴很少会保留那些蜕下的皮肤。这张皮上的符文和装饰表明，\n"
"它曾经属于一位受人尊敬的战士或祭司，甚至可能是一位国王。\n"
"炽热的灵魂留在皮肤中，赋予穿戴者力量。\n"

#. key: gauntlets of war
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gauntlets of war"
msgid ""
"A pair of thick steel gauntlets. They were Okawaru's reward for a mighty\n"
"warlord. The owner is destined to die in battle, but what a death it will be!\n"
msgstr ""
"一双厚厚的钢手套。这是奥卡瓦鲁对伟大的将军的赏赐。\n"
"它的主人注定要死在战斗中，但那将是一场多么惨烈的死亡啊！\n"

#. key: shield of resistance
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shield of resistance"
msgid ""
"A bronze shield, looking almost exactly like a tortoise's shell. It was built\n"
"by the adherents of an obscure minor faith, who imbued it with the power of\n"
"their god. As the god is said to, this shield protects against sword and sling,\n"
"frost and flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个青铜盾牌，看起来几乎和龟壳一模一样。\n"
"一个鲜为人知的小宗教的信徒们打造了它，将自己的神的力量注入其中。\n"
"正如神所说，这个盾牌可以抵御刀剑和投石索，霜和火焰。\n"

#. key: robe of folly
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of folly"
msgid ""
"A dull grey robe. It is enchanted to provide mages with immeasurable power,\n"
"and more than a little overconfidence...\n"
msgstr ""
"一件暗灰色长袍。它为法师们带来了不可估量的力量，还有过分的自信……\n"

#. key: maxwell's patent armour
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maxwell's patent armour"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour created by the famous inventor Maxwell, providing unparalleled\n"
"protective qualities at a very affordable price. His unorthodox materials left\n"
"it with certain shortcomings, but he's yet to have anyone come back for a\n"
"refund.\n"
msgstr ""
"由著名发明家麦克斯韦制造的一套铠甲，以非常实惠的价格提供无与伦比的防护性能。\n"
"他用的非正统材料给它带来了一定的缺陷，但还没有人回来退款。\n"

#. key: mask of the dragon
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mask of the dragon"
msgid ""
"The mask of the High Priest of ancient Erebora. In ancient times, the gods of\n"
"the Ereborans ceased to answer their prayers, and in desperation, the people\n"
"turned to the forbidden worship of dragons. Now, of their works, only this mask\n"
"remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"古代埃瑞博拉的高级祭司的面具。在古代，埃瑞博拉人的神灵不再响应他们的祈祷，\n"
"在绝望中，人们转而皈依被禁止的龙。现在，他们的遗物，只剩这个面具。\n"

#. key: robe of night
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of night"
msgid ""
"A long black robe made of strange glossy material. It shrouds its wearer in\n"
"darkness, reducing the range of vision. According to legend, it was the gift\n"
"of Rutra, a renowned demigoddess of the night, to one of her followers.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件黑色长袍，由奇特的有光泽材料制成。它用黑暗中笼罩着佩戴者，减小了视野。\n"
"根据传说，这是夜神拿德利送给她的一位追随者的礼物。\n"

#. key: scales of the dragon king
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scales of the dragon king"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour created from the enchanted scales of a once-mighty king of\n"
"dragons. In his time, titans and lesser dragons struggled with him in vain —\n"
"but as with all things, even he was eventually cast down and undone. Of his\n"
"life and deeds, this is all that remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"一套盔甲，由曾经强大的龙王的带有魔法的鳞片制成。\n"
"在他的时代，泰坦和较小的龙与他搏斗是徒劳的——但就像所有的事情一样，\n"
"即使是他最终也被打倒和毁灭。这是所有留存下来的，关于他的一生和事迹。\n"

#. key: hat of the alchemist
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat of the alchemist"
msgid ""
"A dirty hat. It bears signs of surviving many weird explosions, which suggests\n"
"it may have means of protecting the head inside from the risks involved with\n"
"alchemy experiments.\n"
msgstr ""
"一顶肮脏的帽子。它似乎经过许多次奇怪的爆炸，但还是幸存下来，由此来看，\n"
"这顶帽子应该能在碰到炼金实验事故时保护下面的脑袋不受伤害。\n"

#. key: fencer's gloves
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fencer's gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves made of white silk.\n"
msgstr ""
"一副用白色丝绸织成的手套。\n"

#. key: cloak of starlight
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak of starlight"
msgid ""
"A phosphorescent cloak, woven of pure light beams. The ripples of its folds\n"
"as the wearer leaps and swerves in combat may dazzle those who gaze on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件发出荧光的的披风，由纯粹的光线织成。\n"
"当穿戴者在战斗中跳跃和转向时，其褶皱的起伏，可能会让注视它的人眼花缭乱。\n"

#. key: ratskin cloak
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ratskin cloak"
msgid ""
"A cloak stitched from the hides of hundreds of hell rats by an enchantress with\n"
"far too much time on her hands. Many more rats remain somehow concealed within\n"
"it, and may scurry out to assist the wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"有个女巫闲得无聊，用数百只地狱鼠的皮缝制出这件披风。\n"
"还有更多的老鼠不知怎的藏在里面，它们可能会窜出来帮助穿戴者。\n"

#. key: shield of the gong
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shield of the gong"
msgid ""
"A heavy bronze gong that can be worn as a shield. Locked away in a temple for\n"
"many years, its bearer is shielded by decades of accumulated prayer.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个沉重的铜锣，可当盾牌用。\n"
"它被锁在寺庙里多年，它的持用者将承载着几十年积累的祈祷的庇佑。\n"

#. key: amulet of the air
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of the air"
msgid ""
"A sky-blue amulet, suffused with enchantments that protect the wearer and make\n"
"their Air spells more powerful. Its creator lacked just one thing: a steady\n"
"hand.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个天蓝色的护身符，充满了保护佩戴者的魔法，并能让他们的气法术更强大。\n"
"它的创造者只缺一样东西：一只稳健的手。\n"

#. key: ring of shadows
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of shadows"
msgid ""
"A black ring that can make its wearer one with the shadows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一枚黑色的戒指，它能使佩戴者融入阴影。\n"

#. key: amulet of cekugob
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of cekugob"
msgid ""
"A strange-looking piece of crystal on an ordinary-looking string, with an odd\n"
"selection of powers.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根看似普通的丝绳上串着一串奇怪的水晶，里面灌有各种奇异的能量。\n"

#. key: amulet of tranquility
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of tranquility"
msgid ""
"A pendant made of purest jade. It grants its wearer immense willpower and\n"
"mental fortitude.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个垂饰是用纯净的玉制成的。它能赋予佩戴者强大的意志力和毅力。\n"

#. key: necklace of bloodlust
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:necklace of bloodlust"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of bloodstained human and animal teeth, and something that\n"
"appears to be a piece of spine.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条串着沾有血迹的各种人与野兽的牙齿的项链，似乎还有一段被砍下来的脊椎骨。\n"

#. key: ring of the hare
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of the hare"
msgid ""
"An unadorned malachite ring, half of an ancient pair. Its wearer is\n"
"exceptionally difficult to catch.\n"
msgstr ""
"一枚朴实无华的孔雀石戒指，是一对古老戒指中的一只。佩戴了它，很难被追上。\n"

#. key: ring of the tortoise
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of the tortoise"
msgid ""
"A rough-hewn aquamarine ring, half of an ancient pair. Its wearer is\n"
"exceptionally difficult to harm.\n"
msgstr ""
"一枚粗糙的海蓝宝石戒指，是一对古老戒指中的一只。佩戴了它，很难受到伤害。\n"

#. key: ring of the mage
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of the mage"
msgid ""
"An enchanted sapphire, inset into a ring. It aids the spellcasting of its\n"
"wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指，镶着一颗有魔力的蓝宝石。它能强化佩戴者的施法能力。\n"

#. key: brooch of shielding
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brooch of shielding"
msgid ""
"A brooch with an intricate inlaid design, providing a range of magical\n"
"protections. Back in the good old days, every adventurer had one of these handy\n"
"devices. That, and a pony.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个设计复杂的胸针，提供一系列魔法保护。\n"
"从前，所有的冒险者都会带一个这种称手的东西。还有一匹小马。\n"

#. key: robe of clouds
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of clouds"
msgid ""
"A robe of a material as nebulous and insubstantial as the clouds. It whips the\n"
"air around it up into a furious storm as it ripples and swirls.\n"
msgstr ""
"这件长袍的材质像是云做的一样，模糊而虚幻。\n"
"当它泛起涟漪和漩涡时，它会将周围的空气搅成一场猛烈的风暴。\n"

#. key: hat of pondering
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat of pondering"
msgid ""
"The favourite hat of the slug wizard Gastronok, stained with reddish slime and\n"
"enchanted to aid in his arcane pondering. It has been specially enchanted to\n"
"protect against the desiccating effects of salt.\n"
msgstr ""
"鼻涕虫巫师加斯特罗诺克最喜欢的帽子，\n"
"沾有的红色黏液和附着的魔力有助于他那神秘的思考。\n"
"它被特地施了魔法以防盐的干燥效果。\n"

#. key: obsidian axe
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:obsidian axe"
msgid ""
"An axe with a powerful curse placed on it by one of the lords of Pandemonium,\n"
"so that unsuspecting adventurers would unleash demons into this world. Beware,\n"
"for it has ways of taking its wielder under its command...\n"
msgstr ""
"一位魔窟领主在这把斧头上施加了一道诅咒，\n"
"为的就是让你这样莽撞的冒险者把恶魔释放到这个世界中。\n"
"当心，它能够操纵持用者的行动……\n"

#. key: consecrated labrys
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:consecrated labrys"
msgid ""
"An axe with a delicate blessing placed on it by one of the sacred Seraphim,\n"
"so that worthy adventurers would rid this world of demons. Rejoice, for it has\n"
"ways of bringing courage to its wielder in even the darkest places...\n"
msgstr ""
"这把斧头上有着神圣的炽天使的祝福，这样受赏识的冒险者就能斩除世上的恶魔。\n"
"欢欣吧，因为即使在最黑暗的地方，它也能给持用者带来勇气……\n"

#. key: lightning scales
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lightning scales"
msgid ""
"A set of armoured plates assembled to protect a creature with a long, scaly\n"
"lower body. Faintly crackling with electricity, they supercharge their wearer's\n"
"ability to cover distance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一套用来保护下半身长而有鳞的生物板甲。\n"
"它发出微弱的电荷爆裂声，让佩戴者风驰电掣。\n"

#. key: black knight's barding
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:black knight's barding"
msgid ""
"A heavy barding made from pitch-black steel and inlaid with plates of black\n"
"diamond. It once protected the steed of the Black Knight during their reign of\n"
"terror. Those who wear it become partially undead, gaining some of the benefits\n"
"without the unfortunate downsides, although the great weight of metal and stone\n"
"slows the wearer somewhat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件重装马铠，由乌黑的钢制成并嵌有黑色钻石板。\n"
"在黑骑士的恐怖统治期间，它曾保护过他们的骏马。\n"
"穿戴上它后会部分变成亡灵，会获得相应好处，而没有不幸的弱点，\n"
"尽管金属和石头的巨大重量会让佩戴者变慢一些。\n"

#. key: amulet of vitality
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of vitality"
msgid ""
"A jewelled amulet famed for its powers of resilience and recuperation. Its\n"
"greatest notoriety came from its use by the dread necromancer Borgnjor, who\n"
"relied upon it to maintain her slender hold on life. After her final demise,\n"
"the amulet vanished from the pages of history.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个宝石护身符以其强大的恢复能力而闻名。它恶名昭彰，\n"
"因为可怕的死灵法师博格尼尔使用过它，她依靠它来维持自己纤弱的生命。\n"
"在她最终去世后，这个护身符也不知所踪。\n"

#. key: autumn katana
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:autumn katana"
msgid ""
"An exquisitely crafted sword. Its blade is so sharp that it can cut through\n"
"space itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把做工精致的剑。它的刀刃非常锋利，甚至可以切开空间。\n"

#. key: shillelagh "devastator"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shillelagh \"devastator\""
msgid ""
"A wooden cudgel, loaded with more than just lead.\n"
msgstr ""
"这根木棍，灌的可不仅仅是铅。\n"

#. key: dragonskin cloak
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dragonskin cloak"
msgid ""
"An opalescent cloak gleaming with the colours of all kinds of dragons. It\n"
"imbues the wearer with draconic resistances, although somewhat unreliably.\n"
msgstr ""
"这件乳白色的披风上闪烁着各种龙的颜色。\n"
"它为穿戴者注入了龙的抗性，但效果不是很可靠。\n"

#. key: ring of the octopus king
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of the octopus king"
msgid ""
"One of the eight rings once worn by the Octopus King and now scattered across\n"
"the land. Each has its own unique enchantment.\n"
msgstr ""
"章鱼王曾经戴过八枚戒指，现在散布在这片土地上，这是其中的一枚。\n"
"每个都有独特的魔力。\n"

#. key: axe of woe
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:axe of woe"
msgid ""
"As you hold this axe your mind does not feel fully your own. Your body begins\n"
"to exhibit strength far beyond its capabilities, and your movements become\n"
"guided by Makhleb.\n"
msgstr ""
"手中拿着这柄斧子的时候，你感觉你的身体似乎不再完全受你控制。\n"
"你的身体开始展现远超极限的力量，而马科列布似乎在指引着你的动作。\n"

#. key: moon troll leather armour
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:moon troll leather armour"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour rumoured to have been created by enchanting the hide of a\n"
"now-extinct species of troll. Whether the name rings true or is merely\n"
"appropriated to add mystique is something of a mystery. The armour's innate\n"
"powers of regeneration and magical protection, however, are hard to dispute.\n"
msgstr ""
"传说，这件甲胄是用一种已经灭绝了的巨魔的毛皮强化而成。\n"
"这个名头听起来是真的，但也可能仅仅是为了增添神秘感，这是个谜。\n"
"这件甲胄可以提升穿着者的恢复速度和魔法抗性，倒是实实在在的。\n"

#. key: macabre finger necklace
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:macabre finger necklace"
msgid ""
"An ugly dangling finger on a string. Everything about it reeks of malign\n"
"influences... but it's hard to avoid thinking that it would look better with a\n"
"ring on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根丑陋的手指挂在绳子上。\n"
"它的一切都散发着邪恶的影响力……但人们不禁会想，如果它戴了戒指看起来会更好。\n"

#. key: boots of the spider
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:boots of the spider"
msgid ""
"A novel pair of boots invented by a suitor of Arachne.\n"
msgstr ""
"由一个阿拉克尼的追求者发明的新奇的靴子。\n"

#. key: dark maul
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dark maul"
msgid ""
"A large, iron-shod maul specialised for dealing massively powerful blows. Such\n"
"power comes at a price: the maul's head is so heavy it takes a great length of\n"
"time to lift it up for another swing.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个大型铁锤，专门用来进行强有力的打击。\n"
"这个能力是有代价的：大锤的头部太重了，需要长时间休整才能再次抬起挥动。\n"

#. key: hat of the high council
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat of the high council"
msgid ""
"A relic of some ancient wizarding war. Centuries later, it still crackles with\n"
"effects from the residual hexes and magical energies it was once subjected to\n"
"on a daily basis; spellcasters able to get a handle on its power, however, will\n"
"find it enhances the power of their spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个古代巫师战争的遗物。几个世纪后，上面仍有残余魔法和能量，每天噼啪作响；\n"
"然而，如果施法者掌控了它的能量，将会发现它能增强其法术能力。\n"

#. key: arc blade
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:arc blade"
msgid ""
"A blade somehow crafted from pure electricity. It arcs wildly between the\n"
"wielder and their foes as it strikes.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是一把用纯电制作的刀刃。\n"
"当它攻击时，它会在持用者和他们的敌人之间疯狂地释放电弧。\n"

#. key: demon whip "spellbinder"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon whip \"spellbinder\""
msgid ""
"A weapon said to have once been used to keep unruly imprisoned wizards in line;\n"
"it violently disrupts the flow of magic around it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把据说用来管束不守法的巫师囚犯的武器；它猛烈地扰乱了周围的魔法流动。\n"

#. key: lajatang of order
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lajatang of order"
msgid ""
"A silver-bladed lajatang, once bestowed upon a favoured worshipper of Zin. It\n"
"became the most prized weapon of the many priests of Zin. After their order was\n"
"destroyed, it fell into disuse and vanished from history.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个银刃的月牙铲，曾被赐予一个受宠的辛的信徒。\n"
"它成了辛的众多祭司的最宝贵的武器。\n"
"他们的秩序被破坏后，它就被废弃，从历史中消失了。\n"

#. key: great mace "firestarter"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:great mace \"firestarter\""
msgid ""
"A huge mace imbued with potent fire magic. It fills those it strikes with an\n"
"inner flame, and offers some protection against the resulting devastation.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个注入强大火焰魔力的巨大权杖。\n"
"它用内部的火焰侵满它所击打的地方，并给予持用者一些保护，免受因此造成的破坏。\n"

#. key: orange crystal plate armour
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orange crystal plate armour"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour carved from transparent orange crystal. It provides remarkable\n"
"protection for both mind and body. The wearer can even channel psychic energies\n"
"through the crystal itself, enhancing their magical abilities. However, it's\n"
"rather heavy...\n"
msgstr ""
"一套用透明的橙色水晶雕刻而成的护甲。可以为肉体和心灵提供卓越的保护能力。\n"
"穿戴者甚至可以通过水晶引导精神力量来增强魔法能力。但是相当重……\n"

#. key: majin-bo
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:majin-bo"
msgid ""
"A staff inhabited by a mighty demon, tricked and trapped in this form long ago.\n"
"To survive, she now offers great arcane power in a terrible bargain: in\n"
"exchange for a tiny portion of the caster's life essence, taken every time its\n"
"wielder casts a spell, she will redirect the life essence of creatures damaged\n"
"by the spell to the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个居住着强大的恶魔的法杖，很久之前她就被以这种形式欺骗和困住。\n"
"为了活命，她现在在一笔可怕的交易中要付出巨大的奥术力量：\n"
"施法者每次施法时她会从中获取一小部分生命精华，\n"
"而她会将被法术伤害的生物的生命精华导向施法者。\n"

#. key: pair of quick blades "gyre" and "gimble"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pair of quick blades \"gyre\" and \"gimble\""
msgid ""
"Two quick blades joined by a chain. Swinging one compels the wielder to swing\n"
"the other, as if they have minds of their own.\n"
msgstr ""
"两个由链条连接的快刃。\n"
"挥动一个会迫使持有者挥动另一个，仿佛它们有自己的想法一样。\n"

#. key: maxwell's etheric cage
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maxwell's etheric cage"
msgid ""
"A fine mesh cage designed to capture magical energy. Experimental notes suggest\n"
"that research was abandoned when the cage began to capture magical\n"
"contamination almost as effectively. Anyone reckless enough to place it on\n"
"their head would find their magic regeneration dramatically increased, at the\n"
"cost of multiplying any magical contamination received.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个精致的网状笼子，旨在捕捉魔法能量。\n"
"实验记录表明，当笼子几乎开始有效地捕获魔法污染物时，却终止了研究。\n"
"任何鲁莽地将其放在头上的人会发现魔力恢复能力大大增强，\n"
"而代价是所受到的魔法污染成倍增加。\n"

#. key: crown of eternal torment
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crown of eternal torment"
msgid ""
"A gold crown set with jet-black gems. It permanently afflicts its wearer with\n"
"agonising pain, substantially reducing their resilience but rendering them\n"
"immune to further torments.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个镶有乌黑色宝石的金王冠。\n"
"它使佩戴者永久遭受痛楚，极大地降低其恢复力，但能使其免受进一步的折磨。\n"

#. key: robe of vines
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of vines"
msgid ""
"A robe woven of living vines. The vines form a symbiotic relationship with\n"
"their wearer, greatly increasing their regeneration, but preventing them from\n"
"being healed by potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件用活的藤蔓编织而成的长袍。藤蔓与穿戴者形成了共生关系，\n"
"大幅增强穿戴者的恢复能力，但是无法再通过药水获得治疗。\n"

#. key: kryia's mail coat
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kryia's mail coat"
msgid ""
"A coat of armour said to have been forged for Queen Kryia in her old age. She\n"
"continued to insist on leading her armies from the front even into her dotage,\n"
"and as her aging body failed her, this coat helped to enhance the healing\n"
"draughts that kept her alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"一副据说是为晚年的克里娅女王锻造的盔甲。\n"
"即使到了暮年，她仍继续坚持上前线带领军队，她逐渐年老衰弱，\n"
"这件外套有助于增强治愈力，维持她的生命。\n"

#. key: frozen axe "frostbite"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frozen axe \"frostbite\""
msgid ""
"A massive axe that looks like it was carved from a glacier, or possibly calved\n"
"from one. It leaves ice crystals in its wake as it swings through the air.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把巨大的斧头，像是在冰川上雕刻的，或是从冰川上崩裂下来的。\n"
"在空中挥舞它，会留下冰晶。\n"

#. key: armour of talos
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:armour of talos"
msgid ""
"A huge and weighty suit of bronze plate armour. Only one with a correspondingly\n"
"huge body can wear it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大而笨重的青铜板甲。只有拥有与之相称的巨大身躯的人能够穿戴。\n"

#. key: warlock's mirror
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:warlock's mirror"
msgid ""
"A handheld array of hexagonal mirrors, synthesised from a truly exotic\n"
"substance and polished to a blinding sheen.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个手持的六边形镜子阵列，由真正的奇异物质制成，并经过抛光，发出眩目的光泽。\n"
"它几乎能够反射任何攻击。\n"

#. key: amulet of invisibility
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of invisibility"
msgid ""
"An amulet that can be activated to render its wearer invisible.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个激活可以让佩戴者隐形的护身符。\n"

#. key: maxwell's thermic engine
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maxwell's thermic engine"
msgid ""
"A strange sword, one blade blistering hot and the other icy cold. When it hits\n"
"its target the thermal gradient increases. What causes this effect is unknown\n"
"but it is rumoured that otherworldly forces are involved.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把奇怪的剑，一个刃炽热，而另一个冰冷。当它击中目标时，热梯度会增大。\n"
"造成此效果的原因尚不清楚，但有传言说它与超自然的力量有关。\n"

#. key: demon trident "rift"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon trident \"rift\""
msgid ""
"A small wrinkle in the very fabric of reality, magically bound to a shaft by\n"
"some mad acolyte of Lugonu. Its attacks can warp through nearby space at the\n"
"wielder's command.\n"
msgstr ""
"一些卢格努的疯狂侍僧神奇地将现实结构中的细小皱纹地绑在一根柄上。\n"
"在持用者的支配下，它的攻击可以扭曲穿越附近的空间。\n"

#. key: sphere of battle
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sphere of battle"
msgid ""
"An orb encased in vividly coloured scales, wrought by a long-forgotten wizard.\n"
"It was the mage Iskenderun's favourite playtoy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个外面裹着艳丽鳞片的水晶球，由一个被遗忘已久的巫师制作。\n"
"这是法师伊斯肯德伦最喜欢的玩具。\n"

#. key: cigotuvi's embrace
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cigotuvi's embrace"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour borne of rotten flesh and bone and gristle, held intact by the\n"
"will of a long-dead sorcerer. The dreadful energies within it call to the bodies\n"
"of the recently dead, protecting the wearer with a cocoon of carrion.\n"
msgstr ""
"一套由腐肉、骨骼和软骨制成的护甲，一个早已死去的巫师弥留的意志维系着它的完整。\n"
"里面的可怕能量召唤着刚刚死去的人的尸体，用腐肉茧保护着穿戴者。\n"

#. key: seven-league boots
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:seven-league boots"
msgid ""
"An enchanted pair of boots which grant the ability to take strides of incredible\n"
"length, as long as the wearer is advancing bravely towards their foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一双注入了魔法的靴子，只要穿着它勇敢地朝敌人前进，就可以迈出难以置信的步伐。\n"

#. key: mad mage's maulers
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mad mage's maulers"
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves designed to carefully control and channel the flow of magic,\n"
"later misused and mangled by the lunatic murderer-mages of the Fifth Circle.\n"
"Their influence leaves the wearer utterly unable to cast spells - the wearer's\n"
"magic is redirected to far bloodier purposes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一副用来小心控制和引导魔法流动的手套，\n"
"后来被地狱第五层的疯狂杀人犯法师们误用并毁坏了。\n"
"它会让穿戴者完全无法施法——穿戴者的魔力被转而用于做更血腥的事情。\n"

#. key: dreamdust necklace
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dreamdust necklace"
msgid ""
"A dull dusty mixture trapped within a cracked crystal on a thin silver chain.\n"
msgstr ""
"在一条细银链上，暗淡的尘土被束缚在一颗破碎的水晶中。\n"

#. key: dreamshard necklace
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dreamshard necklace"
msgid ""
"A beautiful rainbow of colour and motion trapped within a delicate crystal on a\n"
"thin silver chain. Listening carefully, one can hear the distant echo of a\n"
"thousand dreams from all corners of reality, their melody giving a warm sense\n"
"of safety.\n"
msgstr ""
"在一条细银链上，色彩和运动的虹光被束缚在一颗精致的水晶中。\n"
"仔细聆听，你可以听到来自现实各个角落的一千个梦想的遥远回声，\n"
"它们的旋律给人一种温暖的安全感。\n"

#. key: delatra's gloves
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:delatra's gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of long ultramarine gloves, worn by a famed experimental alchemist in an\n"
"age long past. They channel the energy of discovery, empowering their wearer with\n"
"the force created by a blind step from ignorance to certainty.\n"
msgstr ""
"很久以前由一位著名的实验炼金术士戴过的一副群青色长手套。\n"
"它引导发现的能量，当佩戴者盲目地从未知到确定的探索时，会赋予其力量。\n"

#. key: woodcutter's axe
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:woodcutter's axe"
msgid ""
"A weapon that chops foes down as steadily and methodically as a forester cutting\n"
"wood. The unchanging rhythm of its work has settled on it with the force of\n"
"natural law, and no amount of force or skill can make it swing faster or slower.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把武器，能像伐木工砍伐树木一样有条不紊地砍倒敌人。\n"
"它的工作节奏一成不变，这是自然法则所决定的，\n"
"再强的力量或技能也无法使它挥动得更快或更慢。\n"

#. key: throatcutter
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throatcutter"
msgid ""
"Taken from a paladin of the Shining One by the common cutpurse who murdered her,\n"
"Throatcutter was used for a long series of increasingly sordid deeds thereafter.\n"
"Blood, murder and betrayal stain its history and blade both, and little trace now\n"
"remains of the blade which once stood between danger and the innocent.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个普通的扒手谋杀了一位光明神的圣骑士，\n"
"并从其手上夺走了割喉者，此后用它干了一系列越来越肮脏的事迹。\n"
"鲜血、谋杀和背叛玷污了它的历史和刀锋，\n"
"曾经为无辜的人格挡危险的刀锋现在几乎没有留下什么痕迹。\n"

#. key: staff of the meek
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of the meek"
msgid ""
"A sacred relic of the Monks of St. Lee, followers of the renunciate archmage. Just\n"
"as St. Lee sought to atone for the destruction his spells wrought by protecting\n"
"others, so his staff protects its wielder.\n"
msgstr ""
"遁世的大法师的信徒僧侣圣·李的圣遗物。\n"
"正如圣·李通过保护他人来弥补他的法术所造成的破坏一样，\n"
"他的法杖也保护着持用者。\n"

#. key: trishula "condemnation"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trishula \"condemnation\""
msgid ""
"A weapon to bring forth guilt from the guilty. It was first wielded by the archangel\n"
"Lucriel, who, on seeing the suffering of the first mortals, led them as an army\n"
"against the cruelty of the gods. The ragged survivors of Lucriel's army took this\n"
"weapon with them into the wilderness, the sole remnant of an archangel's virtue.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把让罪人产生罪恶感的武器。它最先是由天使长卢克利尔使用，\n"
"他看到了第一批凡人的苦难，就率领他们对抗残酷的诸神。\n"
"这这件武器是天使长美德的唯一见证，\n"
"卢克利尔大军中衣衫褴褛的幸存者带着它进入了荒野。\n"

#. key: amulet of elemental vulnerability
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of elemental vulnerability"
msgid ""
"A blue-steel amulet. Its creator, an exceedingly practical woman, designed it to\n"
"provide powerful protection against mundane jabs, stabs and bites. It's worse than\n"
"useless against fire and frost, but how often does anyone really need to worry\n"
"about that?\n"
msgstr ""
"一枚蓝色钢制护身符。它的创造者是一位非常务实的女性，\n"
"设计它旨在提供强大的保护，防止被轻易戳伤、刺伤和咬伤。\n"
"戴上它会更难应付火和霜，但有多少人真的需要担心这一点？\n"

#. key: mountain boots
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mountain boots"
msgid ""
"These sturdy boots were created by an artificer who lived high up on a remote\n"
"mountain peak, as protection against the mountain's near-constant avalanches,\n"
"rockslides, and snowstorms. No force short of translocations magic will budge\n"
"the wearer from their position.\n"
msgstr ""
"这双结实的靴子是由一位住在偏远山峰上的工匠设计的，\n"
"用来抵御山上几乎不间断的的雪崩、岩滑和暴风雪。\n"
"除了移位魔法之外，任何力量都不会使穿戴者偏离他们的位置。\n"

#. key: lochaber axe
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lochaber axe"
msgid ""
"This brutal weapon, long thought lost to history, combines the extended reach\n"
"of a polearm with the cleaving sharpness of an axe. Ghosts of ancient warriors\n"
"linger about it, draining fickle users.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把野蛮的武器，长期被遗忘在历史的长河中，\n"
"它兼具长柄武器的攻击范围和斧头的锋利。\n"
"古代战士的鬼魂弥留在它周围，衰竭着易变的使用者。\n"

#. key: hermit's pendant
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hermit's pendant"
msgid ""
"An ascetic once took a sacred vow, forswearing use of magical tools and ownership\n"
"of everything but this pendant. Which god they made this vow to remains a point of\n"
"bitter contention among the devout, but their pendant's power - and limitations -\n"
"are irrefutable.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位苦行者曾许下神圣的誓言，放弃使用魔法工具和除此垂饰以外拥有的一切。\n"
"是向哪一位神许下这个誓言仍然是虔诚者之间激烈争论的焦点，\n"
"但垂饰的力量——和局限性是无可辩驳的。\n"

#. key: slick slippers
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slick slippers"
msgid ""
"Crafted from the tanned, smooth hide of a Western Skyshark, these slippers are\n"
"astonishingly comfortable. They lack the protective benefits of a good pair of\n"
"boots, but they can get their wearers out of almost any bind.\n"
msgstr ""
"这双拖鞋是用西方天鲨的光滑的皮鞣制而成的，舒适得令人称奇。\n"
"它没有好靴子那样的保护作用，但它能让穿着者摆脱几乎所有束缚。\n"

#. key: force lance
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:force lance"
msgid ""
"A plain iron lance, imbued with supernatural gravitas via the artifice of the\n"
"mage Gell. It strikes with a force many times stronger than that imparted by\n"
"the wielder.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个普通的铁矛，通过法师盖尔的技艺，充满了超自然的威严。\n"
"它的打击力量比持用者所施加的力量强许多倍。\n"

#. key: toga "victory"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:toga \"victory\""
msgid ""
"An ancient artefact of Okawaru, these woolen robes were lost when a former\n"
"champion failed a duel. Its enchantments increase in power when the wearer\n"
"emerges victorious from threatening combat, but resorting to the use of scrolls\n"
"or potions for assistance causes them to fade away again.\n"
msgstr ""
"这件羊毛长袍是奥卡瓦鲁的一件古代神器，前冠军在决斗失败后遗落了它。\n"
"当穿戴者取得险胜时，其附着的魔力会增强，但求助于卷轴或药水会使它们再次消失。\n"

#. key: storm queen's shield
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:storm queen's shield"
msgid ""
"A disc of crackling metal, created by a woman whose cunning artifice and\n"
"crafty politics once united a continent. Most of her surviving inventions are\n"
"closely guarded by various royals, ostensible proof of their claim to be her\n"
"true successor, but this early prototype slipped through their fingers.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张噼啪作响的金属圆盘，由一位女人所造，\n"
"她曾运用狡猾的诡计和政治手腕，让一块大陆团结在了一起。\n"
"她的那些幸免于难的发明，大多被各个皇室成员严密保护着，\n"
"这些皇室成员都宣称自己才是她的真正继承人，\n"
"而这个早期的原型却从他们手中溜走了。\n"

#. key: hand cannon "mule"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hand cannon \"mule\""
msgid ""
"Hand cannons use magical dust to launch projectiles. The alchemists who craft\n"
"them boast of their potency, but omit the smoke and noise blasted out with each\n"
"shot. Filled with powdered blastmotes, Mule packs an especially powerful kick.\n"
msgstr ""
"手铳使用魔尘来发射弹药。\n"
"制造它们的炼金术士吹嘘了它们的威力，但略过了每次发射都会喷出烟和噪音。\n"
"如果充满爆炸粉尘，手铳『骡』就会有一个特别大的后坐力。\n"

#. key: __(_suffix_examine
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:__(_suffix_examine"
msgid ""
"It has been enchanted to dance through the air and attack under its own power.\n"
msgstr ""
"它被施了魔法，使得它能自己在空中飞舞攻击。\n"

#. key: agnes
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:agnes"
msgid ""
"This spriggan is aged and weathered from years of travel away from the forests\n"
"and swamps that are home to her kin. Her choice of weapon and astonishing speed\n"
"both speak to the training she underwent. Underestimate her at your peril!\n"
msgstr ""
"由于多年远离她的亲人居住的森林和沼泽，这个树精已苍老而饱经风霜。\n"
"她选择的武器和惊人的速度，都表明了她受过严格的训练。低估她，你就会有危险！\n"

#. key: aizul
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:aizul"
msgid ""
"Once the primary guardian serpent of a legendary treasure hoard, she was\n"
"disgraced after thieves looted it while she slept. She seeks to make up for her\n"
"failure by protecting the only treasure the villains overlooked, a single\n"
"precious talisman.\n"
msgstr ""
"她曾是一个传奇宝库的守卫巨蛇，\n"
"但却因为在她睡着时有盗贼窃取了宝库中的财宝而被驱逐。\n"
"她试图通过保护唯一一件被恶人忽视的宝藏——一个珍贵的符咒，来弥补自己的过失。\n"

#. key: amaemon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amaemon"
msgid ""
"Amaemon always knew he was different, but it was still a horrific surprise when\n"
"his demonic heritage manifested. As his body twisted, Amaemon was forced to flee\n"
"far from the surface. The passage of time has only left him more obsessed with\n"
"what he has lost - consumed by poison both physical and spiritual.\n"
msgstr ""
"亚麦依蒙一直知道自己是不同的，但当他的恶魔血统血统显现出来后，\n"
"仍然给他带来了惶恐的惊喜。随着身体的扭曲，亚麦依蒙被迫从地表远离。\n"
"时间的流逝只会让他更加沉迷于失去的东西——被肉体和精神上的毒药所吞噬。\n"

#. key: antaeus
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:antaeus"
msgid ""
"Once a hero among the titans, Antaeus grew jealous of the titan queen. In\n"
"single combat he challenged and slew her, and for this crime he was exiled and\n"
"descended into the Hells. Finding the inhabitants of that place no match for his\n"
"might, Antaeus tore from its substance a fourth Hell, Cocytus, a realm born of\n"
"frozen spite.\n"
msgstr ""
"安泰俄斯曾经是泰坦中的英雄，但他嫉妒泰坦女王。\n"
"在一次战斗中，他发起挑战并杀死了她，因此随后被流放到了地狱。\n"
"安泰俄斯发现栖息在那个地方的生灵无法与他匹敌，\n"
"于是他从其实质上撕开了第四层地狱——悲叹河，一个由冰冻和怨恨而生的领域。\n"

#. key: arachne
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:arachne"
msgid ""
"Once a talented human weaver, Arachne was transformed into a monstrous\n"
"half-spider by a jealous rival's curse. Driven out of her village, she found\n"
"sanctuary for a time among the jorogumo before a bitter feud forced her to\n"
"flee once more.\n"
"\n"
"Now she wanders other corners of the dungeon with a small retinue of loyal\n"
"students in tow, seeking a new domain in which they can spin their peerless\n"
"tapestries in peace.\n"
msgstr ""
"阿拉克尼曾是一位颇具天赋的人类纺织工，\n"
"被诅咒后变成了现在的样子：半人，半蜘蛛。\n"
"现在，她同情新家园中那些非人类的居民，她渴望处置任何威胁他们的人。\n"

#. key: asmodeus
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:asmodeus"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most cunning of the Lords of Hell, Asmodeus was born when the twin\n"
"fires of greed and treachery first sparked to life within a mortal's heart.\n"
"His hideous body is perpetually wreathed in flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"作为最伟大、最狡猾的地狱领主，\n"
"阿斯蒙蒂斯诞生于贪婪和背叛的双生之火第一次在凡人的心中燃起之时。\n"
"他那狰狞的身躯永远被火焰包围着。\n"

#. key: asterion
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:asterion"
msgid ""
"Once a king infamous for waging bloodthirsty campaigns, Asterion was exiled to\n"
"the depths of the dungeon for his crimes. Here he lurks in his tattered finery,\n"
"dreaming of a new kingdom. In his lust for power, the minotaur king turned to\n"
"the worship of Makhleb, and Makhleb has rewarded him with horrifying\n"
"destructive might.\n"
msgstr ""
"阿斯忒里翁曾经是一个国王，因发动了残酷的战争而臭名昭著，\n"
"后来因为他的罪行被流放地牢的地底。\n"
"他穿着破旧的华服潜伏在这里，梦想建立新的王国。\n"
"这个牛头人王出于对力量的渴望，转而皈依马科列布，\n"
"而马科列布也赐予他骇人的毁灭性力量。\n"

#. key: azrael
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:azrael"
msgid ""
"A powerful, belligerent efreet. (Is there any other kind?)\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强大、好战的火巨灵。（还有其他种类的吗？）\n"

#. key: bai suzhen
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bai suzhen"
msgid ""
"A weary draconian with foreign and watery scales. She has come to the Dungeon\n"
"in hopes of resurrecting her mortal husband; a noble cause, for a being once\n"
"known for quarrelling with saints and flooding unfortunate temples. If pressed\n"
"to her limits, she will reveal her true form, the mere sight of which struck\n"
"her husband dead. Adventurers may wish they were so lucky!\n"
msgstr ""
"一个疲惫的龙人，长有异样的似水的鳞片。\n"
"她来到地牢是为了一项崇高的事情，希望能找到复活她的凡人夫君的方法，\n"
"但她也因与和尚斗法而淹没不幸的佛寺而闻名。\n"
"如果把她逼得走投无路，她会展现出自己的真实形态，\n"
"她的丈夫仅仅只是看到就被吓死了。冒险者可能会希望他们也能这么幸运！\n"

#. key: boris
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:boris"
msgid ""
"An ancient and powerful lich. Like all true liches, Boris is immortal, and will\n"
"regenerate his desiccated skeletal remains even if completely disintegrated.\n"
"The same cannot be said for his many victims over his many centuries, from\n"
"which he collects and channels their dying woes and regrets.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强大的远古巫妖。和所有真正的巫妖一样，\n"
"鲍里斯是不朽的，即使被完全解离得只剩骨灰也能复生。\n"
"但对于几个世纪里他的那些受害者而言却并非如此，\n"
"在这些岁月中，他收集、引导着受害者临终的痛苦和遗憾。\n"

#. key: cerebov
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cerebov"
msgid ""
"A violent and wrathful demon, Cerebov appears as a giant humanoid covered in\n"
"shining golden armour and wielding a huge twisted sword.\n"
msgstr ""
"赛里鲍夫是一个残暴易怒的恶魔。\n"
"他有一个巨大的人形身躯，身穿黄金铠甲，手持一把扭曲的巨剑。\n"

#. key: chuck
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:chuck"
msgid ""
"Chuck the stone giant loves rocks, the bigger the better! Over the years, he\n"
"has managed to amass quite the collection, including some rare, enchanted ones.\n"
msgstr ""
"石巨人查克喜欢石头——越大的越好！\n"
"多年来，查克已经收集了大量的石头，其中包括几块附有魔法的稀有货。\n"

#. key: crazy yiuf
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crazy yiuf"
msgid ""
"A withered old gnoll with a long silver beard, wielding a quarterstaff and\n"
"wearing a cloak. He looks like a figure from mythology! Wait, is his beard held\n"
"on to his ears with hooks?\n"
msgstr ""
"一个干瘪的老豺狼人，长着银色的胡须，手持铁头木棒，穿着披风。\n"
"他看起来真像是神话故事里的角色！等等，他的胡子是用钩子挂在他的耳朵上的吗？\n"

#. key: dispater
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dispater"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most ruthless of the Lords of Hell, Dispater was born when first an\n"
"iron sword drank mortal blood. They despise mortal vanities, the pursuit of\n"
"‘reason’ and ‘beauty’ - the only art they enjoy is the art of war.\n"
msgstr ""
"作为最伟大、最残忍的地狱领主，迪斯帕特诞生于第一把铁剑饮用凡人的鲜血之时。\n"
"他鄙视凡人的虚荣心和对所谓“理性”、“美”的追求——\n"
"他唯一喜欢的艺术是战争艺术。\n"

#. key: dissolution
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dissolution"
msgid ""
"The Pits of Slime used to be a thriving civilisation, and Dissolution was the\n"
"prophet of their god. When the city was overtaken by its current residents,\n"
"only Dissolution survived, for they alone turned faithfully to the Slime God.\n"
"Dissolution became a tremendous mass of acidic ooze, yet retained their\n"
"intelligence. They are filled with hatred for anything that can hold a form.\n"
msgstr ""
"黏液坑洞曾经是一座繁荣的都市，而分解者则是居民们所信仰的神的先知。\n"
"当这座城市被现在的居民占领的时候，只有分解者活了下来，\n"
"因为他们选择转而忠于黏液神。\n"
"分解者已经变成了一大团酸性软泥，但他依然保留着他的心智。\n"
"他们极度憎恨一切有固定形态的东西。\n"

#. key: donald
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:donald"
msgid ""
"{{\n"
"    local descript = \"An adventurer just like you, trying to find the Orb.\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Merfolk\" and you.race() ~= \"Octopode\" then\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" Unlike you, and d\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" D\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    descript = descript .. \"espite his hatred of it, he takes to water \" ..\n"
"                           \"like a fowl.\"\n"
"\n"
"    return descript\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    local descript = \"一个和你一样在寻找宝珠的冒险者。\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Merfolk\" and you.race() ~= \"Octopode\" then\n"
"        descript = descript .. \"但不像你，尽管\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        descript = descript .. \"尽管\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    descript = descript .. \"他厌恶这个，却如鱼得水\" ..\n"
"                           \"。\"\n"
"\n"
"    return descript\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: dowan
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dowan"
msgid ""
"A beautiful but vain deep elf with an aptitude for magic and little else. His\n"
"skills are the perfect complement of his twin sister Duvessa's fighting prowess.\n"
"In search of more powerful spells, he journeys to the surface with his sister.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个美丽但高傲的地底精灵，有着魔法天赋，但除此之外，就没什么了。\n"
"他的技能是对他的双胞胎妹妹多维莎的格斗技能的完美补充。\n"
"为寻求更强大的魔法，他和他的妹妹一起前往地表。\n"

#. key: duvessa
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:duvessa"
msgid ""
"A plain-looking deep elven fighter who is technically brilliant in many forms of\n"
"combat, but over-confident because of it. She is complemented by the magical\n"
"skills of her twin brother, Dowan. She journeys to the surface to challenge\n"
"its greatest champions.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个外表普通的地底精灵战士，\n"
"她在多种形式的战斗中，技巧都非常精湛，但也因此过于自信。\n"
"她的双胞胎哥哥多万的法术技能对她起到了补充作用。\n"
"她前往地表以挑战最强大的斗士。\n"

#. key: edmund
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:edmund"
msgid ""
"A jealous sibling of Sigmund (indeed, the youngest of nine brothers). He has\n"
"none of Sigmund's skills in magic, but makes up for it with his skills in\n"
"fighting and a canny head for money. He is eager to prove his superiority by\n"
"killing hapless adventurers with his expensive flail and quick wit.\n"
msgstr ""
"西格蒙德的一个好嫉妒的弟弟（他是九个兄弟中最小的一个）。\n"
"他不像西格蒙德那样会施法，但他的格斗技能和精明的头脑弥补了这方面的不足。\n"
"他急着想要靠他的昂贵的连枷和诡计来杀死几个倒霉的冒险者，\n"
"以此来证明他的实力。\n"

#. key: enchantress
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:enchantress"
msgid ""
"First and most fearful of her kind, the Enchantress rules over the spriggans of\n"
"the dungeon. She wears an opalescent outfit made of dragon skin that shimmers\n"
"with many colours.\n"
msgstr ""
"妖术女王是她的同族中的至尊，也是最令人胆寒的，统领整个的地牢的树精。\n"
"她常穿着龙皮制成的乳白色外衣，闪烁着各色光芒。\n"

#. key: ereshkigal
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ereshkigal"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most inexorable of the Lords of Hell, Ereshkigal was born when\n"
"first a mortal breathed her last. Noiselessly she laughs at lives cut short and\n"
"loved ones separated by untimely death, enwreathed in the silence of the grave.\n"
msgstr ""
"作为最伟大、最无情的地狱领主，埃列什基伽勒诞生于第一个凡人咽气之时。\n"
"她无声地嘲笑被缩短的生命、所爱的人因过早死亡而分离、坟墓静静地被花圈围着。\n"

#. key: erica
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:erica"
msgid ""
"A wild-tempered adventuress. She's quite prideful for an octopode, and brandishes\n"
"their venomous capacity and camouflage talents with cruel force.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个性格狂野的女冒险者。\n"
"她为自己是章鱼而自豪，并以残暴的力量炫耀其毒性和伪装能力。\n"

#. key: erolcha
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:erolcha"
msgid ""
"An especially cunning ogre-mage.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个特别狡猾的食人魔法师。\n"

#. key: eustachio
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eustachio"
msgid ""
"An apprentice summoner with a flowing moustache. He has funny ideas about\n"
"honour.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个留着飘逸胡子的见习召唤师。他对荣誉有着有趣的想法。\n"

#. key: fannar
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fannar"
msgid ""
"A cold-hearted elven sorcerer, draped in robes of high office. They whisper\n"
"grimly to themself as they stalk the dungeon, trailing ice crystals through the\n"
"air behind them.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位冷血的精灵术师，身穿高级长袍。\n"
"他漫游地牢，时而阴冷地自言自语，身后的空气结为冰晶。\n"

#. key: frances
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frances"
msgid ""
"A stout warrior who once bested a powerful lord of Pandemonium in combat,\n"
"gaining control over the demon's realm and thanes. The battle left her with a\n"
"deep facial scar, one that she carries as a badge of honour rather than a\n"
"symbol of shame.\n"
msgstr ""
"这位结实的战士曾经在战斗中击败了一个强大的魔窟的领主，\n"
"从而得到了对恶魔领域和领主的统治权。\n"
"那场战斗在她脸上留下了一道深深的疤痕；\n"
"在她眼里，那不是羞耻的印记，反而是荣耀的象征。\n"

#. key: frederick
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frederick"
msgid ""
"A svelte fighter-mage with a gold-rimmed monocle, a keen sense of tradition,\n"
"and the blood of the gods running through his veins. He's here looking for a\n"
"worthy opponent, but he's yet to find one.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个身材苗条的战斗法师，戴着金边单片眼镜，有着强烈的传统观念，\n"
"血脉中流淌着众神的血。他正在寻找一个值得重视的对手，但还没有找到一个。\n"

#. key: gastronok
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gastronok"
msgid ""
"A voracious and surprisingly intelligent slug, devoted to eating everything and\n"
"everyone he comes across, with a pointed hat perched rakishly atop his head. He\n"
"acquired the hat the same way he acquired his intelligence and his knowledge of\n"
"spells: by consuming their former owner, a powerful wizard.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条贪婪且出奇聪明的蛞蝓，它会吃掉它遇到的所有人和物，\n"
"头上放荡地顶着一个尖帽子。他获得帽子与获得智慧和法术知识的方式相同：\n"
"吃掉帽子的前主人——一个强大的巫师。\n"

#. key: geryon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:geryon"
msgid ""
"A huge, three-headed, winged arch-demon, guardian of the four Hells. Legends\n"
"say that his silver horn can summon terrible beasts to aid him in battle.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的三头有翼大恶魔，是四个地狱的守卫者。\n"
"传说他的银色号角可以召唤可怕的野兽来助他战斗。\n"

#. key: gloorx vloq
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gloorx vloq"
msgid ""
"A shadowy figure clothed in profound darkness.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被深邃黑暗笼罩中的身影。\n"

#. key: grinder
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grinder"
msgid ""
"An inefficient shadow imp previously employed as a torturer in one of the lower\n"
"circles of Hell. She has a tendency to complain and make inane statements.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个无能的暗影小恶魔。她以前在地狱低层做拷问者工作。\n"
"她总喜欢滔滔不绝地抱怨和讲废话。\n"

#. key: grum
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grum"
msgid ""
"A tough-looking gnoll, wearing the pelt of one of his former war dogs.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个外表凶狠的豺狼人，身上穿着他以前的一条战犬的毛皮。\n"

#. key: grunn
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grunn"
msgid ""
"A brutally twisted undead gnoll in the eternal service of Ereshkigal, lord of\n"
"Tartarus. Legend has it that he sold his soul to return his most beloved hunting\n"
"dog to life. Whether that hound is a member of his current pack, none can say.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个残忍扭曲的豺狼人亡灵，永远为塔尔塔鲁斯的领主埃列什基伽勒服务。\n"
"传说他出卖了自己的灵魂，为了让他最心爱的猎犬得以复活。\n"
"这只猎狗是否属于他现在的群落，谁也说不准。\n"

#. key: harold
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:harold"
msgid ""
"A middle-aged bounty hunter, anxious to retire after one final job. He hopes to\n"
"settle down somewhere and live a quiet life with his family, using the money\n"
"from his final bounty: you.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位中年的赏金赏金猎人，急着要干完最后一票生意后退休。\n"
"他希望找个地方安顿下来，与他的家人过上平静的生活，\n"
"凭借他最后的赏金：你的命。\n"

#. key: ignacio
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ignacio"
msgid ""
"While a mortal cannot turn into a demon aside from divine intervention, this is\n"
"what happened to Ignacio after Makhleb saw his love for his job and smiled upon\n"
"him. He is now slated to continue the joy of his life for all eternity.\n"
"\n"
"Although his new form includes a number of large razor-sharp blades growing\n"
"from his demonic appendages, he kept his favourite axe and is eager to let you\n"
"test its edge.\n"
msgstr ""
"若是没有神明的介入，凡人是不可能变为恶魔的。\n"
"当马科列布看到伊格纳西欧对他的工作的热爱并对他微笑后，\n"
"伊格纳西奥身上就发生了这样的事情。现在他将永远继续他一生的乐趣了。\n"
"\n"
"尽管他的新形态有着从恶魔附肢长出的大量锋利的刀片，\n"
"但他还是保留了他最喜欢的斧头，并想用你来测试它的锋利程度。\n"

#. key: ijyb
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ijyb"
msgid ""
"A small and shrewd goblin inventor, wearing blue rags coated in soot.\n"
"She claims dominion over this level of the dungeon; trespassers will find\n"
"themselves on the business end of a homemade wand.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个小而精明的地精发明家，穿着沾满煤烟的蓝色破布。\n"
"她自称是这层地牢的统治者；入侵者会在她自制的魔杖那里迎来终结。\n"

#. key: ilsuiw
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ilsuiw"
msgid ""
"A deadly merfolk water-witch, who uses her dominion over the tides to draw\n"
"unwitting adventurers to their deaths.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个致命的鱼人水系女巫，她会驾御潮水将没有察觉到危险的冒险者引向死亡。\n"

#. key: jeremiah
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jeremiah"
msgid ""
"Jeremiah was a peaceful dreamer, prone to impromptu naps. They slipped into\n"
"slumber while gazing into a magical orb, and dreamed of an old and hateful\n"
"power binding them into service. Now Jeremiah stumbles through the dungeon,\n"
"searching for the precious dreamshard that will restore their master’s power,\n"
"unsure whether they wake or slumber still. Their dreams leak into reality in\n"
"the form of a constant stream of butterflies.\n"
msgstr ""
"耶利米是一个爱好和平的神游者，时常随兴打盹。\n"
"他们凝视着一个神秘的水晶球进入睡眠，\n"
"梦到有一种古老而可恨的力量把他们束缚在侍奉上。\n"
"现在耶利米跌跌撞撞地穿过地牢，寻找珍贵的、能恢复主人力量的梦碎片，\n"
"但不确定他们是醒着还是在沉睡。他们的梦以源源不断的蝴蝶流的形式渗入现实。\n"

#. key: jessica
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jessica"
msgid ""
"An evil apprentice sorceress. She entered the dungeon hoping to find a quiet,\n"
"secluded place where she could study the darker arts without being disturbed.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个邪恶的见习女术师。她来地牢是想找到一个安静、与世隔绝的地方，\n"
"这样就可以不受干扰地学习更黑暗的技艺了。\n"

#. key: jorgrun
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jorgrun"
msgid ""
"A dwarven magician, particularly well-attuned to the dungeon around him. He\n"
"wields powerful earth magic in combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位矮人魔法师，非常善于利用地牢的环境，他在战斗中使用强力的土系魔法。\n"

#. key: jory
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jory"
msgid ""
"Once a simple village peasant, Jory found himself transformed in undeath into a\n"
"powerful creature. Through the countless centuries unlived since then, he has\n"
"honed his skills in combat and magic, and amassed great wealth and many\n"
"possessions.\n"
msgstr ""
"乔里曾是一位普通的乡下农民，有一天发现自己化身成了强大不死怪物。\n"
"无数个世纪以来，他不断磨炼自己的战斗和魔法技能，也收敛了巨量的财富和宝物。\n"

#. key: joseph
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:joseph"
msgid ""
"Looks like a mercenary in a stupid-looking hat.\n"
msgstr ""
"看起来像一个戴着愚蠢帽子的雇佣兵。\n"

#. key: josephina
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:josephina"
msgid ""
"A fearsome necromancer who followed her craft beyond the limits of flesh and\n"
"life. Her pursuit of demonic knowledge left her body ruined, but the powers she\n"
"gained allowed her to rebuild her missing limbs from glittering ice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个可怕的死灵法师，追寻着她的技艺，超越了肉体和生命的界限。\n"
"她对恶魔知识的追求摧毁了她的身体，\n"
"但她获得的力量使她能够从闪闪发光的冰上重筑失去的四肢。\n"

#. key: josephine
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:josephine"
msgid ""
"A formidable necromancer, committed to her craft even after it left her aged,\n"
"decaying, and half-undead herself.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位令人敬畏的死灵法师，\n"
"即使在她年老、腐朽、半死不活的情况下仍致力于她的技艺。\n"

#. key: khufu
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:khufu"
msgid ""
"An incredibly powerful emperor on the way to godhood. He died quite some time\n"
"ago, but he sees no reason why that should stop him.\n"
msgstr ""
"这位非常强大的皇帝，要成为神。\n"
"很早之前他就去世了，但他认为没有任何理由能阻止他。\n"

#. key: kirke
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kirke"
msgid ""
"A master of transformation and treachery. Beware, or you may be the next swine\n"
"to join her herd!\n"
msgstr ""
"一个变化无常、背信弃义的大师。小心点，不然你会变成她身边的一头猪！\n"

#. key: lernaean hydra
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lernaean hydra"
msgid ""
"A huge beast, mightiest of hydras, infamous in myth and legend. It flows\n"
"through the water faster than a human can run, swatting aside trees as though\n"
"they were matchsticks. Its many heads slaver and gnash constantly as it hunts\n"
"for prey to slake its bottomless appetite.\n"
msgstr ""
"这头身形庞大的野兽，是九头蛇中的最强者，在传说和神话中臭名昭著。\n"
"它在水中游动的速度比人类跑得快，游动时会将树拍到一边，仿佛它们是火柴杆。\n"
"它的许多头在不断地淌着口水、磨着牙，想要捕获猎物，以满足其无尽的食欲。\n"

#. key: lodul
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lodul"
msgid ""
"An ogre emissary of the Ironbound Order, sent to find and stop intruders before\n"
"they enter the Vaults. Fiercely charismatic, he's rallied a small army of his\n"
"kin, overawing them with the long-range lightning array he wears on his back.\n"
"(The large coin purse he took from the Vaults is also quite persuasive.)\n"
msgstr ""
"一个铁缚会的食人魔使者，被派去追踪并阻止入侵者进入宝库。\n"
"他极具个人魅力，召集了一小群由同族组成的军队，\n"
"并凭借其背上的远程闪电阵震慑住了他们。\n"
"（他从宝库里拿走的一大笔钱也很有说服力。）\n"

#. key: lom lobon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lom lobon"
msgid ""
"Stoic and inscrutable, Lom Lobon is an ancient demon infamous for their mastery\n"
"of magic. Rumoured to be the most learned being in the halls of Pandemonium,\n"
"they are at times sought out by mortal wizards who offer their souls in\n"
"exchange for the secrets of the arcane. Lacking the terrible wrath present in\n"
"most demons, Lom Lobon's single eye instead hides a cold, impartial cruelty.\n"
msgstr ""
"洛姆·洛邦是一个以精通魔法而臭名昭著的古老恶魔，他坚忍而高深莫测。\n"
"据传他是魔窟里最博学的，有时凡人巫师会寻找到他，\n"
"要用自己的灵魂交换其奥术秘密。\n"
"洛姆·洛邦的独眼没有大多数恶魔身上那种可怕的愤怒，\n"
"反而隐现着一种冷酷、无差别的残忍。\n"

#. key: louise
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:louise"
msgid ""
"A mighty sorceress, clad from head to toe in heavy armour. Once an adventurer\n"
"looking for the fabled Orb of Zot, she was cast into the Abyss and got\n"
"hopelessly lost there. Toyed with by some greater power, she was stuck on the\n"
"hostile plane for nearly a decade. When she finally emerged from the Abyss,\n"
"Louise had become powerful indeed, but had also gone fully insane. She now\n"
"wanders the halls of the dungeon, seeking other adventurers to share her fate.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强大的女术师，用重甲全副武装。\n"
"她曾经是一个寻找传说中的佐特宝珠的冒险者，但却在途中被打入无尽深渊。\n"
"她被某个强大的存在玩弄着，被困在那个充满敌意的位面中长达十年之久。\n"
"在最终逃离深渊的时候，路易丝变得极为强大，但也完全失去了理智。\n"
"现在她徘徊在地牢之中，想让其他冒险者也承受与她一样的命运。\n"

#. key: mara
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mara"
msgid ""
"This tall and powerful demon is Mara, Lord of Illusions, mighty among dreamers.\n"
"He is capable of creating intricately detailed illusions, so real that they are\n"
"almost as deadly as the creatures they impersonate.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个高耸、强大的恶魔，名叫玛拉，地牢的幻象领主。他能制造复杂精细的幻象，\n"
"如此真实，以至于它们几乎与他们所模仿的生物一样致命。\n"

#. key: maggie
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maggie"
msgid ""
"In a distant time, Maggie was apprenticed to the dreaded Hell Knights - but she\n"
"grew impatient. In search of a shortcut to fame and fortune (and somewhat short\n"
"on imagination), she entered the Dungeon and set out to slay a dragon. Now\n"
"having slain one, Maggie sees no reason to stop.\n"
msgstr ""
"在遥远的岁月里，玛吉是可怕的地狱骑士的学徒——但她变得不耐烦了。\n"
"为了寻找成名和发财的捷径（有点缺乏想象力），\n"
"她进入了地牢，并着手杀死了一条龙。\n"
"现在已经杀了一个，玛吉觉得没有理由停下来。\n"

#. key: margery
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:margery"
msgid ""
"A lithe spellcaster in service to the powers of Hell; it is her duty to ensure\n"
"that the inhabitants of the Dungeon never forget their place. She personally\n"
"slew the ancient dragon from whose hide her strange armour is crafted.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个服侍于地狱力量的灵巧的施法者；\n"
"她的职责是确保地牢的居民永远不会忘记他们的使命。\n"
"她亲手杀死了一条古老的龙，她那奇怪的盔甲是用它的皮制作的。\n"

#. key: maurice
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maurice"
msgid ""
"A sly, conniving thief. A self-proclaimed legend, he was one of the most skilled\n"
"and crafty of the thieves and rogues lured by the Orb. The magical parasitic\n"
"vines that have claimed his body still wish to continue his life's work, with a\n"
"back-up plan of both a vicious magic-drinking maw and potent wands.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个狡猾、搞阴谋的盗贼。\n"
"他自称是一位传奇人物，是被宝珠吸引而来的小偷和流氓中最熟练、最狡诈的一个。\n"
"而占据了他身体的魔力寄生藤蔓仍然希望继续其一生的工作，\n"
"并拥有一个邪恶的吸取魔力的胃和强大的魔杖以备不时之需。\n"

#. key: menkaure
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:menkaure"
msgid ""
"A fair and noble ruler of an ancient and mighty kingdom, mummified after an\n"
"early death. His faithful priests subsequently infused him with great and\n"
"powerful magic, seeking to grant him eternal life. Now he is forgotten and\n"
"reduced to mouldering bandages and dry, brittle bones.\n"
msgstr ""
"他是强盛的古国中的一位公正而崇高的统治者，英年早逝后被做成了木乃伊。\n"
"他忠实的祭司们随后为他注入了强大的魔法，试图让他永生。\n"
"现在他已经被遗忘了，只剩腐烂的布条和干燥、脆弱的骸骨。\n"

#. key: mennas
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mennas"
msgid ""
"There was once a human priest named Mennas. He travelled far and wide as a\n"
"missionary of Zin, often venturing even into Orcish lands. He beseeched the orcs\n"
"to abandon their false tribes and return to the peoples of their birth; only\n"
"Zin's light could truly cleanse the weight of sin that had twisted their bodies.\n"
"\n"
"By all accounts the orcs were not happy with Mennas. Eventually, a group of them\n"
"demanded he recant his words and when Mennas remained silent, they cut out his\n"
"tongue.\n"
"\n"
"Whether or not this angel is that same Mennas is something of a mystery, as he\n"
"seems to have difficulty speaking.\n"
msgstr ""
"曾经有过一个叫梅纳斯的人类祭司。他四处游历，向所有人布道辛的教义，\n"
"甚至还去了兽人的领地，向兽人们宣扬律令与怜悯。据说兽人对梅纳斯并不满意。\n"
"他们要求他起誓比欧弗才是唯一的真神，\n"
"但梅纳斯不肯说，于是兽人们割掉了他的舌头。\n"
"\n"
"你不太清楚这个天使是否就是那个梅纳斯，因为他似乎说不出话来。\n"

#. key: mlioglotl
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mlioglotl"
msgid ""
"A demon prince once possessed a hunger for power that was exceptional even by\n"
"the standards of his kind. He betrayed his realm to Lugonu, and his reward was\n"
"to become this twisted mass of corruption, now known only as Mlioglotl.\n"
msgstr ""
"这位恶魔王子曾经对力量有一种渴望，即使以他的同类标准来衡量，\n"
"这种渴望也是超乎寻常的。他把自己的王国出卖给了卢格努，\n"
"而回报就是变为这个如今被称为姆利格洛特的扭曲的腐化团。\n"

#. key: mnoleg
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mnoleg"
msgid ""
"A weirdly glowing figure, dancing through the twisted air of Pandemonium.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个诡异的发光物体，在魔窟扭曲的世界中穿行舞动。\n"

#. key: murray
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:murray"
msgid ""
"A demonic skull rolling along the ground.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个恶魔般的头骨在地上滚动。\n"

#. key: natasha
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:natasha"
msgid ""
"A fast-moving magical cat. Once a powerful wizard's familiar, Natasha was\n"
"abandoned after her master was consumed by the very necromantic forces he sought\n"
"to control. Now she patrols the dungeon, taking a bloody vengeance with spell\n"
"and claw upon any adventurer who crosses her path.\n"
"\n"
"This cat doesn't have nine lives, but just one death isn't going to be enough\n"
"to put her down for good.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只移动迅速、有魔力的猫。娜塔莎曾是一个强大的巫师的伙伴，\n"
"但在她的主人被他试图控制的死灵力量吞噬后，她被遗弃了。\n"
"现在她在地牢里巡游，用法术和利爪对任何经过她的路线的冒险者进行血腥的报复。\n"
"\n"
"这只猫没有九条命，但仅仅一死也不足以让她安息。\n"

#. key: nellie
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nellie"
msgid ""
"A highly intelligent elephant who travelled as part of a circus. One dark\n"
"night, she slipped out of her chain and disappeared into Pandemonium, never to\n"
"be seen again.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头非常聪明的大象，曾随一个马戏团巡游。\n"
"有一天晚上，她挣脱了锁链，然后踏入了魔窟之中，从那以后就再也没有人见过她。\n"

#. key: nergalle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nergalle"
msgid ""
"A shrewd and wizened orc who has devoted her life to chronicling the bloody\n"
"history of her people. She claims to know the names and deeds of every last orc\n"
"who lost their life in their great exodus into the Dungeon, and even if this is\n"
"a lie, she nonetheless seems to be on a first-name basis with many of them.\n"
"\n"
"More than any other orc still breathing, she knows the blood and sacrifice it\n"
"took to make this place a refuge for her kind. She will not brook it being\n"
"intruded upon by anyone - least of all you.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个饱经沧桑的女巫师，比一般的兽人还要残忍。\n"
"活物怕她，死灵也遵从她的指令。她更偏爱后者。\n"

#. key: nessos
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nessos"
msgid ""
"A centaur warrior, skilled at warfare and deceit. They slew a mighty hydra, and\n"
"now its deadly blood drips, still-fuming, from their arrows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个半人马战士，擅长作战和诈术。\n"
"他曾杀死过一只强大的九头蛇，现在它的致命血液从箭上滴落，仍在冒烟。\n"

#. key: nikola
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nikola"
msgid ""
"A brilliant scientist obsessed with electricity. In his attempts to perfect his\n"
"electric golem, he was involved in a terrible accident, and now phases in and\n"
"out of reality.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个对电异常狂热的天才科学家。他在尝试改进他的电魔像时卷入一场可怕的事故，\n"
"因此现在时不时地进入或脱离现实。\n"

#. key: norris
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:norris"
msgid ""
"A relaxed water cultist with a healthy tan and a soothing voice. He\n"
"doesn't really care if it is you or he who dies — “both” would probably be the\n"
"best option.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个从容的水教徒，有着健康的棕褐色皮肤和舒缓的声音。\n"
"他并不在乎是你死还是他死——也许“同归于尽”才是最好的选择。\n"

#. key: pargi
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pargi"
msgid ""
"An unusually weak troll.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个异常虚弱的巨魔。\n"

#. key: parghit
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:parghit"
msgid ""
"An unusually strong troll, his thick frame scarred by many against-the-odds\n"
"victories. He has been wounded so many times that his body has adapted, and now\n"
"heals almost instantly. His necklace of troll claws is a memento of those who\n"
"underestimated him.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个异常强壮的巨魔，他壮硕的身躯上有许多恶战后留下的伤痕。\n"
"他受过很多次伤，身体已经适应了，现在伤口几乎能瞬间愈合。\n"
"他的巨魔爪项链会是那些低估他的人的纪念。\n"

#. key: pikel
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pikel"
msgid ""
"A wise kobold would fear the forces of Hell, and certainly would not set up a\n"
"highly lucrative transdimensional trade in damned souls. But Pikel is better\n"
"known for his whip than his wisdom, mercilessly tormenting his piteous charges\n"
"as he ferries them to their buyers.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个聪明的狗头人会畏惧地狱的力量，绝不会进行暴利、跨维度的该死的灵魂贸易。\n"
"但皮克尔更为人所知的是他的鞭子，而不是他的智慧，\n"
"当他把他的可怜的奴隶运送给他们的买家时，他无情地折磨着他们。\n"

#. key: polyphemus
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:polyphemus"
msgid ""
"A cyclops shepherd, he is very protective of his charges, whom he watches with\n"
"an undying fervor through his single massive eye. Nevertheless, he won't\n"
"hesitate to use them as projectiles in a pinch; after all, the best defence is\n"
"a good offence.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个独眼巨人牧羊人，非常爱惜自己的牲畜，\n"
"他用那只透露着永恒热情的巨大的眼睛注视着它们。\n"
"尽管如此，在紧要关头，他还是会毫不犹豫地将它们用作弹丸；\n"
"毕竟，最好的防守就是好的进攻。\n"

#. key: prince ribbit
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:prince ribbit"
msgid ""
"A frog of unusual size, with a tiny crown perched incongruously atop his head.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只个头不同寻常的青蛙，头上戴着个小王冠，显得很不协调。\n"

#. key: robin
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robin"
msgid ""
"A mountain hobgoblin, recently come in search of the legendary Orb. Not\n"
"foolhardy or reckless enough to delve into the depths of the Dungeon alone,\n"
"Robin has built a small army of minions. Potential competitors will quickly\n"
"find a stream of screaming goblins flying toward them!\n"
msgstr ""
"一个山地大地精，最近也前来寻找传奇的宝珠。\n"
"但他并没有莽撞地独自进入地牢深处，而是组建了由随从组成的小型队伍。\n"
"可能有竞争对手很快会发现有一股尖叫的地精向他们飞来！\n"

#. key: roxanne
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:roxanne"
msgid ""
"A strikingly realistic sapphire statue of a famous earth mage who disappeared\n"
"after a catastrophic mishap with a magical talisman.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊格外逼真蓝宝石雕像，其形象是一位著名的土系法师，\n"
"她在一次灾难性的事故后带着一个有魔力的符咒失踪了。\n"

#. key: rupert
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rupert"
msgid ""
"Rippling muscles, glistening pecs, incredible glutes - Rupert is the peak of\n"
"physical perfection. Even so, his roars seem louder than even his fantastic form\n"
"can explain. Perhaps he holds some talisman that lends supernatural force to his\n"
"bellows?\n"
msgstr ""
"起伏的肌肉、闪亮的胸肌、巨大的臀肌——鲁珀特达到了完美肉体的巅峰。\n"
"即便如此，他的咆哮似乎比以他那种奇异体形所能吼出的还要响亮。\n"
"也许，正是他持有的某个符咒，给他的吼叫带来了超自然的力量？\n"

#. key: saint roka
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:saint roka"
msgid ""
"A mighty warlord. Some orcs even say they are the Chosen One of Beogh.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位强大的将军。有些兽人甚至说他就是被比欧弗选中的人。\n"

#. key: sigmund
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sigmund"
msgid ""
"The elder of a pair of brothers who came for the Orb. No one knows what Sigmund\n"
"saw in the dungeon to drive him mad, but his shrewd magical tactics and wicked\n"
"scythe now leave little time for his victims to wonder. Despite his reputation\n"
"as a vicious murderer, his grandiose and dramatic ways have earned him the\n"
"admiration of many denizens of the dungeon.\n"
msgstr ""
"他是为宝珠而来的一对兄弟中的哥哥。\n"
"没人知道西格蒙德在地牢里看到了什么因而发疯，\n"
"但他狡猾的魔法战术和厉害的镰刀现在可没有留给让他的受害者好奇的时间。\n"
"尽管他有恶毒的凶手的名声，但他浮夸而戏剧化的手法赢得了许多地牢居民的赞叹。\n"

#. key: snorg
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:snorg"
msgid ""
"A particularly corpulent troll with a short temper and a sizable gut.\n"
"Uninterested in the Orb, Snorg delights in the endless parade of adventurers –\n"
"that is, easy meals — it attracts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个特别肥胖的巨魔，他的脾气很坏，肚子很大。史诺格对宝珠并不感兴趣，\n"
"而是喜欢冒险者的无休止的行进——也就是说，小菜——吸引了他。\n"

#. key: sojobo
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sojobo"
msgid ""
"Queen of the tengu, with legendary skill in swordsmanship, tactics, and magic.\n"
"Storytellers claim she once trapped a raging tempest in a bottle and kept it\n"
"as a talisman.\n"
msgstr ""
"天狗女王，其剑术、谋略和魔法出神入化。\n"
"讲故事的人说，她曾把一场强烈的风暴捕获在一个瓶子里，并把它当作符咒保存着。\n"

#. key: sonja
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sonja"
msgid ""
"A graceful kobold assassin. Admire her graceful pirouettes, thrill at her\n"
"daring leaps! But watch out for her knives!\n"
msgstr ""
"一位优雅的狗头人刺客。欣赏她优雅的旋转吧，因她那大胆的跳跃而震颤吧！\n"
"但要小心她的刀！\n"

#. key: terence
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:terence"
msgid ""
"A veteran of a war against the armataurs' elephant-riders. He has recently\n"
"retired to make a new home in the dungeon.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个暴力杀手。他杀人的原因不仅是为了钱，也是为了获取愉悦感。\n"
"泰伦斯之前在一次行动中失败了，因此不得不藏起来。\n"
"他头上还有悬赏呢——他可不能让任何看见他的人活着走出地牢！\n"

#. key: tiamat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tiamat"
msgid ""
"The earthly avatar of Tiamat, deity of dragonkind, here incarnated as a mighty\n"
"draconian warrior. Her scales seem to shimmer and change colour as you watch.\n"
msgstr ""
"提亚玛特的现世化身，龙族的神，在这里具现为强大的龙人战士。\n"
"当你观察她时，她的鳞片似乎会闪耀并变幻颜色。\n"

#. key: urug
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:urug"
msgid ""
"A coarse and lanky orc. Urug lost her eye in a fight with a harpy, and has\n"
"sworn to slay every last one of them. Unfortunately, the vision in her\n"
"remaining eye is not very good, and she has mistaken you for one.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"She smells terrible.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"一个身形粗犷、瘦长的兽人。\n"
"尤鲁格在与鸟妖的战斗中失去了一只眼睛，因此发誓要把世上的鸟妖全部杀光。\n"
"不幸的是，由于她剩下的一只眼视力不太好，她把你当成了鸟妖。\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"她很难闻。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: vashnia
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vashnia"
msgid ""
"An elite marksnaga who leads a skilled team of sharpshooters. She is\n"
"particularly skilled in translocation magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个领导着神射手团队的精英射手纳迦。她特别擅长移位魔法。\n"

#. key: vv
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vv"
msgid ""
"One of the Stoneborn, formed untold aeons ago with supreme command over rock.\n"
"Her people shelter deep within the living earth, so whatever has forced Vv\n"
"into the oppressive openness of the Dungeon must be dire indeed. But whatever\n"
"it is, she's not talking...\n"
msgstr ""
"数万年前形成的石裔之一，拥有对岩石的至高的控制力。\n"
"她的人民躲避在充满活力的大地深处，\n"
"因此迫使薇薇进入压抑、空旷的地牢的东西一定是很可怕的。\n"
"但不管是什么，她都不说话……\n"

#. key: xtahua
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:xtahua"
msgid ""
"An ancient and mighty dragon.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条强大的古龙。\n"

#. key: zenata
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zenata"
msgid ""
"A master weaponsmith, her flesh melding into steel so smoothly that it's hard to\n"
"tell where one ends and the other begins. She entered the Dungeon to search for\n"
"the secrets of an ancient, long-suppressed cult, said to have exalted metal over\n"
"flesh. The price of knowledge was her humanity - a price she paid eagerly.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位武器锻造大师，她的身体与钢铁融为一体，\n"
"以至于很难分清哪块是肉，哪块是钢铁。\n"
"她进入地牢是为了探寻一个古老的、长期被压制的邪教的秘密，\n"
"据说这个邪教推崇金属胜于肉体。知识的代价是她的人性——这是她热切付出的代价。\n"

#. key: serpent of hell gehenna
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:serpent of hell gehenna"
msgid ""
"A huge, red-glowing, three-headed dragon, shrouded in damnation. It is\n"
"possessed by the very essence of Gehenna and its eternal fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条巨大的、发出红光的三头龙，被笼罩在诅咒之中。\n"
"它被欣嫩谷的实质及其永恒之火所缠绕。\n"

#. key: serpent of hell cocytus
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:serpent of hell cocytus"
msgid ""
"A massive white three-headed dragon, covered with shards of gleaming ice,\n"
"wholly possessed by the nightmarish cold of Cocytus.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条巨大的白色三头龙，覆有锃亮的冰块碎片，\n"
"完全被悲叹河那噩梦般的寒冷所附着。\n"

#. key: serpent of hell dis
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:serpent of hell dis"
msgid ""
"A towering three-headed beast with an army's worth of swords for teeth. Each of\n"
"its scales is a shield with a razored edge.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个极高大的三头野兽，有着军队的利剑一般的牙齿。\n"
"它的每个鳞片都是边缘锋利的盾牌。\n"

#. key: serpent of hell tartarus
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:serpent of hell tartarus"
msgid ""
"Seemingly three pairs of lurid magenta eyes hanging in the darkness, the\n"
"outline of a vast, sinuous dragon is just barely perceptible behind. Its malice\n"
"is palpable.\n"
msgstr ""
"黑暗中似乎悬着三双可怕的洋红色眼睛，后面一条蜿蜒的巨龙轮廓隐约可见。\n"
"其恶意昭然若揭。\n"

#. key: acid blob
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:acid blob"
msgid ""
"A lump of sickly pustulent flesh, dripping with lethal acid.\n"
msgstr ""
"一坨长满肉瘤的恶心肉块，上面不断有致命的强酸滴落下来。\n"

#. key: acid dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:acid dragon"
msgid ""
"A small dragon with brilliant yellow scales, its mouth dripping with\n"
"corrosive slime.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条具有亮黄色鳞甲的小型龙，嘴上滴着腐蚀性的黏液。\n"

#. key: adder
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:adder"
msgid ""
"A common dungeon snake, a species of troglodytic reptile commonly found in\n"
"subterranean spaces.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条普通的地牢蛇，它是一种在地下常见的穴居爬行类动物。\n"

#. key: air elemental
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:air elemental"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from the elemental plane of air. It exists in this world as a\n"
"lightning-spitting spirit, stunning foes with its crackling bursts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自气元素位面的灵体。它以爆出闪电的灵体的形态存在于这个世界上，\n"
"以噼啪的爆裂声震慑敌人。\n"

#. key: alligator
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:alligator"
msgid ""
"An aggressive crocodilian with great crunching jaws full of sharp teeth.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条攻击性很强的鳄鱼，有着巨大、嘎吱作声的嘴，上面长满了锋利的牙齿。\n"

#. key: alligator snapping turtle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:alligator snapping turtle"
msgid ""
"A particularly large and nasty snapping turtle. Like its smaller relative, it\n"
"can reach out and bite from afar.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个特别巨大、危险的鳄龟。和它较小的亲缘物种一样，它也能从远处伸过来咬。\n"

#. key: anaconda
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:anaconda"
msgid ""
"A very large snake that moves with startling swiftness. It kills not by poison\n"
"but by constricting its prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条非常大的蛇，移动速度惊人。它不是通过毒液而是通过束缚猎物进行猎杀。\n"

#. key: ancestor
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ancestor"
msgid ""
"A humanoid construct of insubstantial memory, floating through the air. Though\n"
"perhaps somewhat changed in shape and bearing few discernable features, still\n"
"they seem somehow to resemble a warrior from the distantly remembered past.\n"
"The memory and the memorialist fight in concert, each able to fire past the\n"
"other.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个无实际记忆的人形造物，浮在空中。尽管外形会发生变化，\n"
"也没什么明显可辨的特征，但他们却像来自遥远记忆中过去的战士。\n"
"记忆和追忆者并肩战斗，双方的射弹都能穿越彼此。\n"

#. key: ancient champion
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ancient champion"
msgid ""
"An unfathomably ancient skeleton. It has hundreds of golden sigils etched onto\n"
"its bones, and pulses with terrible, unholy power.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具不可名状的远古骷髅。\n"
"它的骨头上刻有数百个金色印记，脉动着可怕的邪恶力量。\n"

#. key: ancient lich
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ancient lich"
msgid ""
"A lich who, having existed for countless centuries, has grown almost\n"
"unimaginably powerful through the study of dark magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个存在了无数个世纪的巫妖，通过研究黑魔法，强大得难以想象。\n"

#. key: ancient zyme
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ancient zyme"
msgid ""
"A nexus of sentient cancer and disease, borne aloft perhaps by malice alone.\n"
"Its nature inflicts withering illness on all living beings in its presence.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个有意识的疾病与肿瘤的结合物，也许它只是因恶意而生成。\n"
"它会本能地让出现在它面前的所有生物感染致命的疾病。\n"

#. key: angel
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:angel"
msgid ""
"A divine warrior of the Shining One. It is a towering winged figure of\n"
"unnatural beauty surrounded by an aura of brilliant white light.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个光明神的圣战士。其身上有高耸的翅膀，美得不像是这个世间的东西，\n"
"周身环绕着光彩夺目的白色光环。\n"

#. key: apis
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:apis"
msgid ""
"A placid, sacred bull of Elyvilon. Its status as an exalted envoy of the Healer\n"
"lets its very presence double the health of its allies.\n"
msgstr ""
"埃利维隆的一头平静而神圣的公牛。\n"

#. key: apocalypse crab
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:apocalypse crab"
msgid ""
"An opalescent crab with jet black eyes, and chaotic mists effusing from its\n"
"mandibles. Rumours claim that this species is waiting for the end of time.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个乳白色的螃蟹，长有黑玉般的眼睛，口器散发着迷雾。\n"
"传言称，这个物种在等待着时间的终结。\n"

#. key: arcanist
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:arcanist"
msgid ""
"A wizard fond of spectacle and destruction. They scorn the cowardice of other\n"
"magicians, who hide from their foes rather than simply blasting them out of\n"
"existence.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个喜欢精彩场面和破坏的巫师。\n"
"他们蔑视那些躲着敌人、而不是随手将其炸飞的懦弱的魔法师。\n"

#. key: armour echo
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:armour echo"
msgid ""
"The sweat and toil of the armourer working leather and steel infuses an\n"
"intention into their creation, a unique spark within every cuirass, pauldron and\n"
"vambrace. A skilled forgewright can manifest these intentions in physical form,\n"
"allowing their armour to protect its wearer in a more aggressive fashion than\n"
"armour customarily does.\n"
msgstr ""
"军械士的汗水和辛劳给他们的创造注入了灵魂，\n"
"每一件胸甲、护肩、臂甲都迸发着独特的火花。\n"
"一个熟练的巫师将这些火花聚集在一起，使他们的防具相比通常的防具，\n"
"会采取更具攻击性的方式保护穿戴者。\n"

#. key: aspiring flesh
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:aspiring flesh"
msgid ""
"The divided and churning remains of a protean progenitor, striving desperately\n"
"for form. Whatever they become, the last of their progenitor's power ensure it\n"
"will be stronger and swifter than any such creature found elsewhere in the\n"
"dungeon.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个变形之祖的分裂、搅动的遗骸，竭力变化着形态。无论它们变成什么，\n"
"它们祖先的最后力量将确保它比任何在地牢其他地方碰到的那种生物更强、更快。\n"

#. key: azure jelly
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:azure jelly"
msgid ""
"An extremely cold blob of bright blue cytoplasm, forming bits of frost in the\n"
"air around it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团极冷的亮蓝色细胞质，它周围的空气都结成了冰霜。\n"

#. key: ball lightning
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ball lightning"
msgid ""
"A swift sphere of coruscating electrical energy. It will explode at the\n"
"slightest disturbance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个迅捷、发光的电能球体。即使是最轻微的扰动也会使它爆炸。\n"

#. key: ball python
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ball python"
msgid ""
"A small snake that can augment its bite by constricting small creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条小蛇，它可以通过束缚小型动物来增加它的咬合力。\n"

#. key: ballistomycete
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ballistomycete"
msgid ""
"A lumpy reddish fungus covered in knobbly rhizome growths, growing well in the\n"
"dank underground dungeon. When it senses a threat, the ballistomycete may\n"
"release a deadly floating spore that explodes on its victims.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种块状淡红色真菌，覆有多节的根瘤，在阴湿的地牢中生长良好。\n"
"当它受到威胁时，可能会产生飘浮着的致命孢子，这会在受害者身上爆炸。\n"

#. key: ballistomycete spore
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ballistomycete spore"
msgid ""
"A fast, gas-filled floating spore released by a ballistomycete when it senses a\n"
"threat. After seeking out its foe, the spore will explode, damaging anything\n"
"caught in the blast and further confusing living creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个快速、充满气体的孢子，在弹道真菌受到威胁时会被释放。\n"
"在找到敌人后，孢子会爆炸，并对爆炸中的任何生物造成伤害和混乱。\n"

#. key: balrug
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:balrug"
msgid ""
"A huge and very powerful demon, wreathed in fire and shadows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大且强力的恶魔，身体被环绕在火焰与阴影之中。\n"

#. key: barachi
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:barachi"
msgid ""
"An amphibious humanoid with a very ugly attitude.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个形态非常丑陋的两栖人形生物。\n"

#. key: basilisk
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:basilisk"
msgid ""
"A crested lizard of middling size with a terrible petrifying gaze.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个中等大小、有羽冠的蜥蜴，有着可怕的石化凝视。\n"

#. key: bat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bat"
msgid ""
"A large grey bat that, despite being herbivorous, is quite aggressive. It is\n"
"myopic and uses echolocation to navigate.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只大型灰色蝙蝠，虽然是食草动物，但攻击性却很强。\n"
"它的视力很差，要靠回声来定位。\n"

#. key: battlemage
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:battlemage"
msgid ""
"A humanoid construct of insubstantial memory, floating through the air. Though\n"
"perhaps somewhat changed in shape and bearing few discernable features, still\n"
"it seems somehow to resemble a warrior from the distantly remembered past,\n"
"skilled with both conjurations and melee combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个无实际记忆的人形造物，浮在空中。\n"
"尽管外形会发生变化，也没什么明显可辨的特征，\n"
"但它却像来自遥远记忆中过去的战士，擅长塑能系法术和近战。\n"

#. key: battlesphere
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:battlesphere"
msgid ""
"A small globe of destructive energy. Each time its creator casts an offensive\n"
"spell, it will launch a magical barrage at the most injured nearby foe it can\n"
"reach.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个魔法能量小球。\n"
"每当它的创造者施放毁灭性的塑能系法术时，它会向一个随机敌人射出魔法飞弹。\n"

#. key: bennu
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bennu"
msgid ""
"A sacred, self-created sunbird, representative of rebirth. It has ascended\n"
"past the cycles of life and death, and calls upon aspects of both, rising forth\n"
"from death in a burst of unholy flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只神圣的、能自生的太阳鸟，象征着重生。\n"
"它已超脱了生死的轮回，望着生死的两边。它会从一团邪恶的火焰中复活。\n"

#. key: black bear
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:black bear"
msgid ""
"A small black bear. Like all ursines, it will become enraged if badly hurt.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头小型黑熊。和所有其他熊类一样，它会在受重伤时会变得狂暴。\n"

#. key: black draconian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:black draconian"
msgid ""
"A muscular black-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and powerful wings.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肌肉发达、长有黑色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和有力的翅膀。\n"

#. key: black mamba
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:black mamba"
msgid ""
"An astonishingly fast tropical snake whose bite bears a deadly venom.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条疾速的热带蛇，它的咬带有致命的毒液。\n"

#. key: blazeheart core
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blazeheart core"
msgid ""
"The exposed elemental core of a blazeheart golem. Far too unstable to remain\n"
"without its shell, it is in the process of violently exploding.\n"
msgstr ""
"焰心魔像暴露的元素核心。如果脱离外壳，它会变得非常不稳定，将造成剧烈爆炸。\n"

#. key: blazeheart golem
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blazeheart golem"
msgid ""
"A volatile elemental spark encased in a shell of slag iron. If destroyed while\n"
"its fires still blaze, the exposed core will violently detonate a moment later.\n"
msgstr ""
"它的渣铁外壳包裹着不稳定的元素火花。\n"
"如果它在其火焰仍在燃烧时被摧毁，暴露的核心将在片刻后剧烈爆炸。\n"

#. key: blink frog
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink frog"
msgid ""
"A species of frog that possesses the ability to blink at will. It can blink\n"
"itself close to its intended prey, or blink away to escape harm. It is commonly\n"
"found in packs.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种能自行闪现的大型蛙。\n"
"它既可以通过闪现来接近猎物，也可以利用闪现来逃脱伤害。这种蛙经常成群行动。\n"

#. key: blizzard demon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blizzard demon"
msgid ""
"A greater demon formed from wistful snow and bitter lightning.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个高阶恶魔，身体被环绕在雪与闪电之中。\n"

#. key: bloated husk
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bloated husk"
msgid ""
"A decaying undead corpse. When it reaches a victim (or if it's destroyed first),\n"
"the gases trapped inside it are released and create a large, violent\n"
"concussive blast.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具腐烂的亡灵尸体。当它靠近受害者（或者如果它在此之前就被摧毁）时，\n"
"里面的气体被释放，并产生巨大、猛烈的冲击波。\n"

#. key: block of ice
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:block of ice"
msgid ""
"A block of ice shaped like a statue, but worked by no living hands.\n"
msgstr ""
"这块冰像个雕塑，但并非人工所造。\n"

#. key: bog body
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bog body"
msgid ""
"An undead figure preserved by the brackish waters of a bog, and reanimated by\n"
"some unknown magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个亡灵生物，被沼泽的咸水所保存，并被某种未知的魔法复活。\n"

#. key: boggart
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:boggart"
msgid ""
"A malevolent and dangerous little sprite. The shadowy illusions it summons may\n"
"not be real, but are deadly all the same.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个邪恶又危险的小妖精。它能够召唤阴影幻象，虽然并非真实，但同样致命。\n"

#. key: bombardier beetle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bombardier beetle"
msgid ""
"An unassuming beetle filled with an incredible amount of hypergolic fluid. The\n"
"sticky spray it fires is capable of igniting predators and unwary adventurers\n"
"alike, though more experienced ones know to keep moving if they wish to avoid\n"
"a fiery grave.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只不起眼的甲虫，它的体内充满了大量的自燃液体。\n"
"它喷出的粘性喷雾能点燃捕食者和粗心的冒险者，\n"
"而更有经验的人知道，如果想要逃离这个火焰坟墓，最好继续前进。\n"

#. key: bone dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bone dragon"
msgid ""
"A mighty undead abomination, pieced together from the broken bones of many\n"
"dragons by powerful necromantic magic. The collective despair of such\n"
"desecrated dragons gives this horror its own undying breath weapon, in\n"
"billowing clouds of excruciating misery.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个强大的亡灵怪物，在强大的死灵术作用下由许多龙的断骨拼接而成。\n"
"幸运的是，在这个过程中，能吐出可怕的龙息的器官丢失了。\n"

#. key: boulder
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:boulder"
msgid ""
"A mass of fast-rolling stone, crushing everything in its path.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个快速滚动的石头，碾碎沿途的一切。\n"

#. key: boulder beetle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:boulder beetle"
msgid ""
"A grey beetle with an almost impenetrable rocky carapace. When at some distance\n"
"from its foe, a boulder beetle is capable of rolling at high speed, attempting\n"
"to crash into its target for heavy damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个灰色甲虫，有着几乎无法穿透的岩石外壳。\n"
"当与敌人有一定距离时，巨砾甲虫会高速滚动，试图撞向目标以造成严重伤害。\n"

#. key: bound soul
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bound soul"
msgid ""
"The soul of a living, holy, or demonic creature, captured by a dark sacrifice\n"
"to Yredelemnul. The bound soul will follow its captor through stairs and come\n"
"when recalled from a different level.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个生物、圣物的或邪物的灵魂，被献给伊莱德莱姆努尔的黑暗祭品所俘获。\n"
"缚魂将跟随它的捕获者穿过楼梯，并能在从不同的层召回。\n"

#. key: brain worm
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brain worm"
msgid ""
"A slimy fluorescent worm with a greatly distended head. This creature feeds on\n"
"others' intellect as it squirms through unworldly grime.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条黏滑的荧光蠕虫，长有极度膨胀的头部。\n"
"这个生物在超凡的尘垢中蠕动，以他人的智力为食。\n"

#. key: briar patch
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:briar patch"
msgid ""
"A tangled cluster of thorny briars, sharp enough to pierce thick hide and\n"
"armour. Although stationary, its branches are possessed with a will of their\n"
"own. They move to allow magic and missiles fired by those friendly to this\n"
"plant to pass through unaffected.\n"
msgstr ""
"一丛缠绕的带刺荆棘，锋利得足以刺穿厚皮和护甲。\n"
"它尽管静止不动，但却有着自己的意志。\n"
"他们会进行摆动，让那些对这种植物友好的人所发射的魔法和飞弹不受影响地穿过。\n"

#. key: brimstone fiend
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brimstone fiend"
msgid ""
"A huge and powerful demon wreathed in damnation, with great scaly wings. It is\n"
"one of the most fearsome denizens of any of the Hells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大且强力的恶魔，身体被环绕在天谴之中，还长有巨大的鳞翼。\n"
"这是地狱中最可怕的物种之一。\n"

#. key: broodmother
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:broodmother"
msgid ""
"A giant spider swollen with eggs. Its innumerable offspring are always at its\n"
"call.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只鼓满卵的巨型蜘蛛。它的无数孩子会永远听从其召唤。\n"

#. key: burial acolyte
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:burial acolyte"
msgid ""
"A masked priest in the service of Kikubaaqudgha, well-versed in choral rituals\n"
"to both rouse the dead and send them to eternal rest.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位服侍奇库巴库哈的蒙面祭司，精通唤醒死者和使其永远安息的合唱仪式。\n"

#. key: bush
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bush"
msgid ""
"A woody plant. It looks dry enough to be easily set on fire, and its foliage is\n"
"not very dense, permitting both magic and missiles to pass through unaffected.\n"
"However, it is firmly rooted, and requires significant effort to destroy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一株木本植物。它看起来并不潮湿，可以轻易被火点燃，它的枝叶也并不茂密，\n"
"魔法和飞弹也能不受影响地穿过。但它的根基却非常扎实，破坏它可得费一番力气。\n"

#. key: bullfrog
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bullfrog"
msgid ""
"An unusually aggressive amphibian that pursues its prey with rapid hops.\n"
"Its croak is loud and distinctive, but unlike its smaller counterparts above\n"
"ground, the dungeon bullfrog is as large as it sounds.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个攻击性极强的两栖动物，快速跳跃，追捕猎物。它的叫声响亮而独特，\n"
"但与地面上较小的的亲缘特种不同，地牢牛蛙的体形与其声音一样大。\n"

#. key: bunyip
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bunyip"
msgid ""
"A flesh-eating beast that uses its limbs and tail interchangeably. It moves\n"
"with alarming speed, but must pause to reorganise itself after each attack.\n"
"Its distinctive screams carry far and wide.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个食肉动物，交替使用肢体和尾巴。它能以惊人的速度移动，\n"
"但每次攻击后都必须停下来重新调整自己。它独特的尖叫声能传得很远很远。\n"

#. key: butterfly
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:butterfly"
msgid ""
"A large, brightly coloured butterfly with beautifully patterned wings,\n"
"fluttering incongruously through the darkness of the cave.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只亮丽的大蝴蝶，翅膀上有着漂亮的图案，\n"
"它飞舞的身影在这黑暗的洞窟中显得很不协调。\n"

#. key: cactus giant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cactus giant"
msgid ""
"A green-skinned, spiny colossus, with a hearty barrel chest and a thirst for\n"
"battle. Any foe that strikes it in melee will be lucky to live to regret it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个绿色皮肤、多刺的巨人，有着健壮的桶状胸脯，对战斗充满了渴望。\n"
"任何在近战中攻击他的敌人都会庆幸还能活着后悔。\n"

#. key: cacodemon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cacodemon"
msgid ""
"A maniacal demon, brimming with accursed power. Its gleeful laughter rarely\n"
"ceases, even in the heat of battle.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个恶魔奇丑无比，狂暴而有着传奇般的力量，\n"
"它会先使敌人失去行动能力，然后再将他们轰杀至渣。\n"

#. key: cane toad
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cane toad"
msgid ""
"A hideous toad whose thick, warty hide is covered in poison glands. Unlike its\n"
"smaller above-ground relatives, this dungeon-dweller is the size of a wolf.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个丑陋的蟾蜍，其厚而多疣的皮上长满了毒腺。\n"
"与地面上较小的亲缘特种不同，这只地牢物种有狼那么大。\n"

#. key: catoblepas
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:catoblepas"
msgid ""
"A sluggish black buffalo, its hide encrusted with dull scales. It carries its\n"
"hog-like head just above the ground, protected by a stiff mane of bristles.\n"
"Its fearsome breath turns flesh into stone.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头行动迟缓的黑色野牛，它的皮上覆有一层暗色的鳞片。\n"
"它那像猪一样的头刚刚高出地面，被坚硬的鬃毛保护着。\n"
"它那可怕的吐息会把肉体变成石头。\n"

#. key: caustic shrike
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:caustic shrike"
msgid ""
"A swift, nightmarish bird whose razor-sharp metallic feathers drip with\n"
"corrosive acid.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个轻盈、噩梦般的⻦。它那锋利的金属般的羽毛滴着腐蚀性的酸。\n"

#. key: centaur
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:centaur"
msgid ""
"A hybrid with the torso of a human atop the body of a horse. It is highly\n"
"skilled in archery.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个混种生物，在马的身体上有着人的躯干。其箭术很高超。\n"

#. key: centaur warrior
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:centaur warrior"
msgid ""
"A muscular centaur, veteran of numerous battles, armed with well-made weapons\n"
"and able to use them skilfully.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肌肉发达的半人马，身经百战，装备着精良的武器，能够熟练地使用它们。\n"

#. key: cerulean imp
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cerulean imp"
msgid ""
"A small, wilful minor demon. Its wings, far larger than its scrawny body, were\n"
"made to soar, and it lands only rarely and with the greatest reluctance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个矮小、任性的低阶恶魔。它的翅膀比它那瘦骨嶙峋的身体要大得多，\n"
"生来就是为了飞翔。它也很少、很不情愿着陆。\n"

#. key: chaos spawn
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:chaos spawn"
msgid ""
"A being of pure chaos, its form is constantly shifting, growing and then losing\n"
"eyes, mouths, claws and tentacles. It corrupts everything it touches.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由纯粹的混沌构成的存在，其形态在不断变化，\n"
"眼睛、嘴巴、爪子和触手不断在它的身体上长出来，随后又会消失。\n"
"被它碰到的东西都会遭到腐蚀。\n"

#. key: cherub
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cherub"
msgid ""
"A throne-bearer of the gods, whose head is beset by four faces: one of a man,\n"
"one of an ox, one of a lion, one of an eagle. It is one of the angelic beings\n"
"who stand before the good gods, singing eternal hymns of praise to their glory\n"
"and greatness.\n"
msgstr ""
"神的敕谕信使，他的头被四张脸环绕着：人的、牛的、狮的和鹰的。\n"
"他是站在善神一边的天使，为神的荣耀和伟大歌颂永恒的赞美诗。\n"

#. key: creeping inferno
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:creeping inferno"
msgid ""
"A formless mass of ancient fire, bound by heat and malevolence. It longs to\n"
"unleash itself as a wild fire storm, yet must first patiently burn towards its\n"
"victims with implaceable inevitability.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团无形的远古火焰，被高温和邪恶束缚着。\n"
"再轻微的干扰也会破坏将其连接在一起的纽带，并引发一场火焰风暴。\n"
"它渴望释放，但在被观察时似乎不愿移动。\n"

#. key: crimson imp
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crimson imp"
msgid ""
"A small, ugly minor demon. Its fanged maw seems locked in a permanent malign\n"
"grin, and its horns protrude obscenely from its scaly pate.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个矮小、丑陋的低阶恶魔。它那长满尖牙的嘴似乎永远保持着一副恶意的咧嘴笑，\n"
"它的角从有鳞的脑袋里可憎地突出来。\n"

#. key: crocodile
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crocodile"
msgid ""
"A crocodilian with powerful jaws.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条有着强力嘴巴的鳄鱼。\n"

#. key: crystal echidna
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crystal echidna"
msgid ""
"A spiny, long snouted rodent grown out of pure living crystal. It is\n"
"immune to most forms of magic and hurls both crystallising shots and painful\n"
"barbs.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由纯净的活性水晶生成的多刺、长鼻啮齿动物。\n"
"它对大多数形式的魔法免疫，并且会投掷水晶箭和令人疼痛的倒钩。\n"

#. key: crystal guardian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crystal guardian"
msgid ""
"An intricate animated statue made of heavily ensorcelled crystal that is\n"
"immune to most forms of magic. The spells which created it are so powerful\n"
"that even flesh may start to crystallise around any fragments that become\n"
"embedded in it - leaving its foes brittle and vulnerable.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个复杂精细的、会动的雕像，由厚重的而坚硬的水晶制成。\n"
"它对大多形式的魔法免疫，并能不可思议地抛射被任何表面反射的火焰或寒流。\n"

#. key: culicivora
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:culicivora"
msgid ""
"A small spider with rudimentary healing abilities. Though not undead, it packs\n"
"a nasty vampiric bite.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个有着基础治疗能力的小蜘蛛。虽然不是亡灵，但它会造成吸血鬼那样的咬伤。\n"

#. key: curse skull
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:curse skull"
msgid ""
"A charred skull floating in the air and rotating slowly. Mystic symbols are\n"
"carved into its blackened surface.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个烧焦的头骨，浮在空中慢慢旋转着。神秘的符号刻在它焦黑的表面上。\n"

#. key: curse toe
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:curse toe"
msgid ""
"A disembodied toe, hanging in the air and radiating an intense field of\n"
"negative energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个脱离躯体的脚趾浮在空中，在周围形成了一个致密的负能量场。\n"

#. key: cyclops
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cyclops"
msgid ""
"A giant with one eye in the centre of its forehead. Despite its lack of\n"
"binocular vision, it is able to throw boulders with fearsome accuracy.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个巨人的额头正中长着一只眼睛。\n"
"虽然独眼巨人只有一只眼视物，但他投出的石块命中率却很高。\n"

#. key: daeva
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:daeva"
msgid ""
"A towering winged figure radiating an aura of brilliant golden light. It is a\n"
"divine agent of the Shining One.\n"
msgstr ""
"其身上有高耸的翅膀，身体散发着璀璨的金光。他是一个光明神的圣使。\n"

#. key: dancing weapon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dancing weapon"
msgid ""
"A weapon enchanted to dance through the air and attack under its own power.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把武器被施了魔法，使得它能自己在空中飞舞攻击。\n"

#. key: dart slug
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dart slug"
msgid ""
"A small invertebrate. It hunts prey considerably larger than itself by firing\n"
"chitinous darts, using a concealed air bladder to launch them with remarkable\n"
"range and power.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个小型无脊椎生物。\n"
"它能通过隐藏的气囊射出有着惊人射程和威力的壳质飞镖来猎杀比它大得多的生物。\n"

#. key: deathcap
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deathcap"
msgid ""
"A noxious and deadly fungus suffused with negative energy. While parasitic in\n"
"life, undeath has granted it the ability to absorb its nutrients directly from\n"
"the life force of others.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个有毒的致命真菌，充满了负能量。\n"
"寄生在生物中，亡灵赋予它直接从其他生命中吸收营养的能力。\n"

#. key: death cob
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:death cob"
msgid ""
"A dreadful undead cob of maize. Look, this one was probably a mistake. We're\n"
"sorry.\n"
msgstr ""
"一块可怕的亡灵玉米棒。瞧，这可能是个错误。我们很抱歉。\n"

#. key: death drake
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:death drake"
msgid ""
"A dark and baleful minor dragon. It breathes a lethally potent miasma from its\n"
"pestilential maw.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条邪恶的黑色亚龙。它能从它的瘟疫之胃中喷吐出一团致命的瘴气。\n"

#. key: death knight
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:death knight"
msgid ""
"A warrior-priest of Yredelemnul, chanting fearful supplications to its dark god.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个伊莱德莱姆努尔的战斗祭司，向黑暗之神吟诵着可怕的祈求。\n"

#. key: death scarab
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:death scarab"
msgid ""
"A hideous swarming undead insect, exuding death and decay and feeding on the\n"
"life energies of those unfortunate enough to encounter it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个成群涌现的可怕的亡灵昆虫，散布着死亡和腐化，\n"
"以它所遇到的不幸生物的生命能量为食。\n"

#. key: death yak
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:death yak"
msgid ""
"A larger and beefier relative of the common dungeon yak. Its little red eyes\n"
"gleam with hunger for living flesh.\n"
msgstr ""
"这头牦牛比常见的亲缘物种地牢牦牛更大、更强。\n"
"它红色的双眼闪烁着，仿佛在诉说对鲜肉的渴望。\n"

#. key: deep elf annihilator
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf annihilator"
msgid ""
"A deep elf who exults in conjured mayhem and destruction. It is widely hated\n"
"and feared, both for the power and for the precision of its destructive magics.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个以唤起伤害和破坏为乐的地底精灵。\n"
"其毁灭魔法强大而精准，许多人对他又恨又怕。\n"

#. key: deep elf archer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf archer"
msgid ""
"An experienced deep elf fighter with a penchant for ranged combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个经验丰富的地底精灵战士，喜欢远程战斗。\n"

#. key: deep elf blademaster
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf blademaster"
msgid ""
"A champion of the deep elves, who scorns magic and is devoted to the study of\n"
"the sword. It wields two weapons with astonishing dexterity and speed.\n"
msgstr ""
"地底精灵的勇士之一，他蔑视魔法，毕生致力于剑术。\n"
"他能以难以置信的敏捷和速度持两把武器作战。\n"

#. key: deep elf death mage
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf death mage"
msgid ""
"A deep elf surrounded by a shimmering aura of negative energy, as a result of\n"
"its practice of necromancy and life-sapping magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个地底精灵，被闪烁的负能量光环所环绕，\n"
"这是他练习死灵术和衰竭生命力的魔法的结果。\n"

#. key: deep elf demonologist
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf demonologist"
msgid ""
"A deep elf who is marked heavily by long years of contact with unnatural\n"
"demonic forces and the creatures of the Abyss.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个地底精灵，长期接触非自然的恶魔力量和深渊中的生物。\n"

#. key: deep elf elementalist
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf elementalist"
msgid ""
"A deep elf commanding the primal forces of the universe. It is renowned for its\n"
"ability to pin down even the most elusive foes with powerful, unavoidable magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个支配宇宙原始力量的地底精灵。即使再难以捉摸的敌人，\n"
"他也能用强大的、不可回避的魔法进行牵制和锁定，他也因此而闻名。\n"

#. key: deep elf high priest
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf high priest"
msgid ""
"An exalted servant of the ancient dark god of the deep elves, basking in\n"
"hellish death magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"地底精灵的远古黑暗之神的一个显赫的仆从，沉浸在地狱般的死亡魔法中。\n"

#. key: deep elf knight
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf knight"
msgid ""
"A battle-hardened deep elf fighter.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个身经百战的地底精灵战士。\n"

#. key: deep elf master archer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf master archer"
msgid ""
"A deep elf archer who has devoted a lifetime to the mastery of archery,\n"
"dismissing magic as a frivolous distraction.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个地底精灵射手，毕生致力于精通箭术，将魔法视为一种无聊的消遣。\n"

#. key: deep elf pyromancer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf pyromancer"
msgid ""
"A deep elf learned in the ways of fiery magic. It is capable of casting a\n"
"wide array of scorching spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个地底精灵，掌握了火系魔法。它可以施放各种灼热法术。\n"

#. key: deep elf sorcerer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf sorcerer"
msgid ""
"A mighty spellcaster who draws power from the very Hells, and possesses lethal\n"
"arcane abilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强大的施法者，他从地狱中汲取力量，并有着致命的奥术能力。\n"

#. key: deep elf zephyrmancer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep elf zephyrmancer"
msgid ""
"An elf with a singular focus on the magic of the air, leaving little time to\n"
"study anything else.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个专注于气体魔法的精灵，几乎没有时间学习其他东西。\n"

#. key: deep troll
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep troll"
msgid ""
"A stooped troll with dark skin. It often travels in packs.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个驼背的黑皮巨魔。他们经常成群出没。\n"

#. key: deep troll earth mage
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep troll earth mage"
msgid ""
"A particularly intelligent deep troll. It uses its magic to tunnel through the\n"
"earth and ambush foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个极其聪明的地底巨魔。他会运用他的魔法穿过大地伏击敌人。\n"

#. key: deep troll shaman
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deep troll shaman"
msgid ""
"A deep troll blessed with divine power to strengthen and hasten its kin.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个有着圣洁法力的地底巨魔，能够强化、加速他的同类。\n"

#. key: demigod
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demigod"
msgid ""
"A human-like figure with an aura of power betraying its divine ancestry.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个人形生物身上的能量气息，揭示着他背叛了他的神圣先祖。\n"

#. key: demonic crawler
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonic crawler"
msgid ""
"A hellish insectoid creature, fueled by some infernal power that constantly\n"
"regrows its chitinous segments. Nothing short of a lethal blow will stop it\n"
"for long.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个地狱的昆虫类生物，由某种地狱般的力量刺激着，不断代谢着它的壳节。\n"
"除非是致命的一击，否则没有什么能长久地阻挡它。\n"

#. key: demonspawn
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonspawn"
msgid ""
"A half-mortal, half-demonic creature, with its hellish heritage asserting\n"
"itself through a certain devilish cast to its features.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个半人半魔的生物，能从身上一些恶魔的特征看出他有来自地狱的血统。\n"

#. key: demonspawn blood saint
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonspawn blood saint"
msgid ""
"A half-mortal, half-demonic creature, radiating an intense heat. It weaves\n"
"powerful and unpredictable spells of devastation.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个半人半魔的生物，散发着强烈的热量。他编织着强大而不可预测的毁灭咒语。\n"

#. key: demonspawn corrupter
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonspawn corrupter"
msgid ""
"A half-mortal, half-demonic creature, oozing with dark energies. It twists\n"
"space around itself, and can corrupt weapons, armour and even the very flesh of\n"
"its opponents.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个半人半魔的生物，散发着黑暗能量。\n"
"他扭曲了自身周围的空间，可以腐蚀武器、盔甲甚至对方的血肉。\n"

#. key: demonspawn soul scholar
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonspawn soul scholar"
msgid ""
"A half-mortal, half-demonic creature, covered in icy blue scales. Its devotion\n"
"to the deities of death grants it great insight into the vulnerabilities and\n"
"applications of mortal souls.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个半人半魔的生物，身上覆盖着冰蓝色的鳞片。\n"
"他挥动着的黑暗力量，那是来自死亡之神的恩赐。\n"

#. key: demonspawn warmonger
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonspawn warmonger"
msgid ""
"A half-mortal, half-demonic creature, now more beast than whatever species it\n"
"is descended from. It is devoted to martial combat, disrupting the magic of its\n"
"foes as it feasts off of endless conflict.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个半人半魔的生物，现在他比他的任何后裔更像是野兽。\n"
"他全力以赴地战斗，在无休止的战斗中破坏敌人的魔法。\n"

#. key: diamond obelisk
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:diamond obelisk"
msgid ""
"A towering obelisk surrounded by a powerful storm.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个高耸的方尖塔，被强大的风暴所环绕。\n"

#. key: dire elephant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dire elephant"
msgid ""
"A huge pachyderm, wilder and fiercer than normal elephants, with a very thick\n"
"hide, powerful legs, and a memory to die for.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种巨大的厚皮动物，比普通大象更加狂野和凶猛，\n"
"有着厚实的皮、有力的腿，还有可以铭记到死的记忆力。\n"

#. key: djinni
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:djinni"
msgid ""
"An elemental spirit formed from smokeless fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由无烟火形成的元素之灵。\n"

#. key: oblivion hound
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:oblivion hound"
msgid ""
"A demon lapdog of the queen of Tartarus, bound to hunt her enemies. The first\n"
"time a foe hears its howl, it will echo in their mind, calling nightmarish\n"
"creatures to hunt them. Those who survive have the small consolation of being\n"
"inoculated against that particular hound's howl.\n"
msgstr ""
"塔尔塔罗斯的一条恶魔宠物狗，准备追猎她的敌人。\n"
"当敌人第一次听到它的嚎叫时，嚎叫会在他们的脑海中回响，\n"
"呼唤噩梦般的生物来猎杀他们。\n"
"那些幸存者有一个小小的安慰，那就是接种了抵御这种特殊猎犬嚎叫疫苗。\n"

#. key: draconian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:draconian"
msgid ""
"A brown-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings. It is yet to\n"
"develop the distinct colouring and powerful breath attack of its mature form.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个长有棕色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"
"他还尚未发育出成熟形态的独特色彩和强大的吐息攻击。\n"

#. key: draconian annihilator
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:draconian annihilator"
msgid ""
"A draconian that uses powerful conjurations to destroy anyone who dares to\n"
"stand in its way.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个龙人，他会使用强大魔法消灭任何胆敢阻挡他的敌人。\n"

#. key: draconian knight
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:draconian knight"
msgid ""
"A draconian protected by thick scales, skilful weapon use, and complementary\n"
"magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个身上长有厚鳞片的龙人，擅长使用武器和辅助性的魔法。\n"

#. key: draconian monk
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:draconian monk"
msgid ""
"A draconian who has eschewed the study of weaponry and magic in order to train\n"
"in the art of unarmed combat. Its scaly fists, well-thewed legs, and mighty\n"
"tail rain down blows upon its opponents.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个龙人，为了专心修炼徒手格斗技艺，而放弃了学习武器和魔法。\n"
"他那覆有鳞片的拳头、肌肉发达的腿、有力的尾巴，如雨点般密集地砸向敌人。\n"

#. key: draconian scorcher
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:draconian scorcher"
msgid ""
"A cunning draconian who has mastered the inner secrets of the element of fire.\n"
"Its scales are sooty from years of magical pyrotechnics.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个狡猾的龙人，掌握着火元素的独特奥秘。\n"
"他的鳞片因多年的魔法烟火的施放而被熏黑。\n"

#. key: draconian shifter
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:draconian shifter"
msgid ""
"A draconian master of the warp, who can translocate both itself and anyone else\n"
"to any place, either on this world or outside of it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个精通空间扭曲的龙人，\n"
"他有能力将自己或是其他任何人传送到任何一个地方，包括这个世界之外。\n"

#. key: draconian stormcaller
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:draconian stormcaller"
msgid ""
"A draconian deriving its thunderous powers and draconic allies from the worship\n"
"of Qazlal.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个龙人从对卡兹拉尔的崇拜中获得雷霆般的力量和龙族盟友的协助。\n"

#. key: dread lich
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dread lich"
msgid ""
"A lich who has made terrible pacts with demonic forces to augment its dark\n"
"magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巫妖，为了增强其黑暗魔法，与恶魔力量签订了可怕的契约。\n"

#. key: dream sheep
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dream sheep"
msgid ""
"A drowsy, fluffy ovine whose coat sparkles with motes of dream dust. It gathers\n"
"in herds and fills the air with dream dust, overwhelming its victims and\n"
"putting them to sleep.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只睡意朦胧、毛绒绒的绵羊，毛上闪耀着梦尘。\n"
"它们成群聚在一起，让空气中充满了梦尘。梦尘覆盖在受害者身上，使之陷入沉睡。\n"

#. key: drowned soul
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:drowned soul"
msgid ""
"A cold and hollow apparition of the drowned dead, chained by some lingering\n"
"attachment to the depths in which it perished. It rushes to embrace the living,\n"
"sharing the last moments of its watery fate with whatever it touches.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个冰冷、空洞的溺死者的亡灵，被某种挥之不去的情感束缚在它死去的深渊中。\n"
"它冲过去抱住生者，\n"
"要让接触到的任何人也品尝到它生命的最后一刻淹在水里的滋味。\n"

#. key: dryad
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dryad"
msgid ""
"A spirit of nature, bound to the forest in which it resides. It is capable of\n"
"calling upon the trees to defend against incursions.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个自然之灵，与栖息的森林紧密相连。她能够召唤树木以抵御入侵。\n"

#. key: dwarf
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dwarf"
msgid ""
"A member of a short, sturdy mountain-dwelling folk.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个矮小结实的山地居民。\n"

#. key: earth elemental
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:earth elemental"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from the elemental plane of earth. It exists in this world as a\n"
"sinuous stream of silt and stone, capable of smoothly flowing through solid\n"
"rock.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自土元素位面的灵体，凭借占据着一块泥土和岩石而存在于这个世界上。\n"

#. key: efreet
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:efreet"
msgid ""
"An imposing, muscular figure engulfed in a cloud of searing flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个威严而强壮的生物，全身被一团灼热的火焰裹挟着。\n"

#. key: eidolon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eidolon"
msgid ""
"An ancient skeletal apparition, sheathed in a cloud of mist. Its form glows\n"
"white-hot with debilitating energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个远古的骷髅幻影，隐没于一团云雾之中。\n"
"它的身体发出白热的光，散发着衰弱能量。\n"

#. key: eldritch tentacle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eldritch tentacle"
msgid ""
"An immense, squamous appendage of some unseen creature, dripping with ichor and\n"
"tipped with a single, terrible-looking claw.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条巨大、多鳞的肢体属于某个看不见的生物，败液从上面滴落，\n"
"在肢体的末端还长有一个骇人的爪子。\n"

#. key: eldritch tentacle segment
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eldritch tentacle segment"
msgid ""
"A part of an immense, squamous appendage. It thrashes and pulsates like no\n"
"other living thing.\n"
msgstr ""
"某条巨大、多鳞的肢体的一部分。你从未见过其他活物像它这样抽打、悸动。\n"

#. key: electric golem
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:electric golem"
msgid ""
"An animated figure made completely of electricity, created in some demented\n"
"wizard's experiment.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个完全由电形成的造物，它是在某个疯狂巫师的实验中被创造出来的。\n"

#. key: electric eel
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:electric eel"
msgid ""
"A type of fish capable of generating a powerful electric field.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种能产生强大电场的鱼。\n"

#. key: eleionoma
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eleionoma"
msgid ""
"Spirits of marshes and bogs. From the cypresses and willows of the fens stems the\n"
"power of these fierce protective spirits. With the boughs and branches they flow,\n"
"emerging from trees near their foes to strike.\n"
msgstr ""
"湿地和沼泽之灵。沼地的柏树和柳树孕育出这些凶猛的守护之灵。\n"
"随枝条摆动，他们从敌人附近的树上冒出来进行攻击。\n"

#. key: elemental wellspring
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elemental wellspring"
msgid ""
"A swirling conflux of elemental water streaming from the elemental plane into\n"
"this one, with powerful spirits and mighty floods flowing from it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一股元素水漩流，从元素位面流到这个位面，倾泻着强大的灵体和洪流。\n"

#. key: elephant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elephant"
msgid ""
"A large, thick-hided pachyderm. It crushes its foes and then thrashes them with\n"
"its trunk.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的厚皮动物。它会踩扁它的敌人，然后再用鼻子进行抽打。\n"

#. key: elf
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elf"
msgid ""
"An elf, a member of an ancient fey race.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个精灵——一个古代精类种族中的一员。\n"

#. key: emperor scorpion
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:emperor scorpion"
msgid ""
"A giant scorpion with a massive barb on its tail dripping deadly venom. It is\n"
"one of the largest arachnids known.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只巨大的蝎子，尾巴上有一个巨大的倒刺，滴着致命的毒液。\n"
"它是已知的最大的蛛形纲动物之一。\n"

#. key: endoplasm
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:endoplasm"
msgid ""
"A glob of grey sludge that has somehow developed a rudimentary awareness and\n"
"limited motility. It periodically draws heat from its surroundings to sustain\n"
"itself, freezing enemies unfortunate enough to be adjacent at the time.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团灰色污泥，不知何故已具备了初步的意识，有着有限的运动能力。\n"
"它周期性地从周围吸取热量，以维持自身的生存，同时冰冻附近不幸的敌人。\n"

#. key: entropy weaver
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:entropy weaver"
msgid ""
"A gaunt humanoid with flaking, pale chitin. Its spindly limbs are capable of\n"
"startlingly quick movement and end in razor-sharp talons.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个瘦削的人形怪物，有一身苍白、蜕皮的甲壳。\n"
"其瘦长的四肢的行动极为迅速，并长有锋利的爪子。\n"

#. key: ettin
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ettin"
msgid ""
"A two-headed giant, stronger than most, and able to land devastating blows left\n"
"and right with its two huge weapons.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个长有双头的巨人，比大多数巨人都要强壮，\n"
"能够用两支巨型武器左右开弓，发动毁灭性的打击。\n"

#. key: executioner
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:executioner"
msgid ""
"A horribly powerful and swift demon, its shape obscured by a cloud of swirling\n"
"scythe-like blades.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个极其强大、敏捷的恶魔，一团旋转的镰刀形的刀刃遮蔽了其身形。\n"

#. key: eye of devastation
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eye of devastation"
msgid ""
"A huge eyeball, encased in a levitating globe of incandescent energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨型眼球，被裹在一个飘浮、炽热的能量球之中。\n"

#. key: faun
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:faun"
msgid ""
"A hybrid with the torso of a human atop the forelegs of a goat. It is fabled\n"
"for its ability to play with the minds of those who intrude into its domain.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个混种生物，在山羊的前腿上有着人的躯干。\n"
"传说中，他能够玩弄闯入其领地的生物的心灵。\n"

#. key: felid
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:felid"
msgid ""
"A feline creature that has been granted sentience by magical means. It uses the\n"
"gift of speech to demand milk, treats and catnip.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只猫科动物被魔法赋予了心智。它会利用它的语言能力索要牛奶、零食和猫薄荷。\n"

#. key: fenstrider witch
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fenstrider witch"
msgid ""
"Followers of the ancient swamp ways, these witches rise above the muck and mire\n"
"on a pair of stilt-like chicken legs. They are masters of pain and poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"这些女巫践行着古代的沼泽道路，她们踩着一双高跷状的鸡腿越过淤泥和泥沼。\n"
"她们是痛楚和毒药大师。\n"

#. key: fire bat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire bat"
msgid ""
"A bat whose leathery body burns with a hot flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只蝙蝠的毛皮上燃烧着一团炽热的火焰。\n"

#. key: fire crab
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire crab"
msgid ""
"A variety of crab prized for its brilliantly jewelled shell. The rarity of the\n"
"shells is only enhanced by its almost supernatural ability to wade through\n"
"molten lava and expel massive quantities of flames.\n"
msgstr ""
"这种螃蟹因其璀璨的镶有宝石的外壳而备受珍视。\n"
"它的壳更为珍奇之处在于它那几近超自然的力量，它可以穿过熔岩，喷出大量火焰。\n"

#. key: fire dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire dragon"
msgid ""
"A great reptilian beast with powerful claws on its limbs, covered in thick\n"
"red scales and with two huge bat-like wings. Little trails of smoke spill\n"
"from its toothy maw.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条巨大的爬行类野兽，四肢上有强力的爪子，覆盖着厚厚的红色鳞片，\n"
"长有两只巨大的蝠翼形翅膀。它那长满利牙的口中冒出几缕烟雾。\n"

#. key: fire elemental
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire elemental"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from the elemental plane of fire, which exists in this world as\n"
"a brilliant column of raging flames.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自火元素位面的灵体，它以一柱熊熊的火焰的形态存在于这个世界上。\n"

#. key: fire giant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire giant"
msgid ""
"A giant with obsidian skin and a wild mane of glowing red hair, holding aloft a\n"
"fiery sword. Fire giants believe that they are destined to unite and burn the\n"
"entire world to cinders.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨人，有着黑曜石皮肤和狂野、浓密的炽红色头发，高举着一把燃烧着的剑。\n"
"火巨人相信他们终将联合起来，要把整个世界烧成灰烬。\n"

#. key: fire vortex
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire vortex"
msgid ""
"A swirling cloud of flame. After striking a foe, it disintegrates.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团旋转的火焰云。击中敌人后，它会解体。\n"

#. key: flayed ghost
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flayed ghost"
msgid ""
"A hideous floating undead creature, the anguished spirit of a tortured victim,\n"
"with torn skin hanging from an emaciated body. It restlessly stalks the\n"
"dungeon, inflicting the anguish it felt in life upon those still living.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个丑陋、飘浮着的亡灵。\n"
"它是饱受折磨的受害者的苦痛灵魂，瘦骨嶙峋的身体上垂着撕裂的皮肤。\n"
"它不停在地牢中搜寻着，想把它受到痛苦强加给那些还活着的人。\n"

#. key: frilled lizard
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frilled lizard"
msgid ""
"A lizard with a giant and colourful fringe folded around its neck. It flares\n"
"its impressive frill at its victims while hissing angrily.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只蜥蜴，脖子上有着巨大、五颜六色的褶边。\n"
"它一边愤怒地嘶叫，一边向敌人展示它那令人印象深刻的褶边。\n"

#. key: formicid
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:formicid"
msgid ""
"A sentient ant that walks upright and is competent at digging.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个有意识的蚂蚁，能够直立行走，善于挖掘。\n"

#. key: formless jellyfish
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:formless jellyfish"
msgid ""
"A gelatinous assemblage of tentacles and venom, leaving a glistening trail\n"
"as it slides along. Surely such a mockery of life could not be natural..?\n"
msgstr ""
"一团触手和毒液的凝胶状混合物，在滑动时会留下闪闪发光的痕迹。\n"
"当然，这种玩笑般的生命可能并非来自自然……？\n"

#. key: foxfire
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:foxfire"
msgid ""
"A thin wisp of flaming swamp gas. It will burn the first hostile thing it\n"
"touches and then dissipate.\n"
msgstr ""
"一缕稀薄的燃烧着的沼气。它会烧掉任何冒险靠太近的东西，无论是朋友还是敌人。\n"

#. key: freezing wraith
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:freezing wraith"
msgid ""
"An incorporeal skeletal form surrounded by a cloud of freezing air, likely the\n"
"remains of some unfortunate adventurer. It now floats slowly through the\n"
"dungeon, seeking to share its fate with others.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个虚体的骷髅周身环绕着一团冷气。可能是某个不幸冒险者的遗骸。\n"
"现在它在地牢中缓慢飘动，想让别人也遭到和它一样的命运。\n"

#. key: frost giant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frost giant"
msgid ""
"A giant with blue skin and hair like ice and snow. Its eyes are as bleak as\n"
"winter skies. It marches grimly into battle with a great, frosty axe and\n"
"howling blasts of cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨人，有着蓝色皮肤，长有冰雪般的头发。他的眼睛像冬季的天空一样阴郁。\n"
"他带着一把冰霜巨斧，裹挟着呼啸的寒流，冷酷地投入战斗。\n"

#. key: fulminant prism
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fulminant prism"
msgid ""
"A slender prism of unstable, soft gold that crackles with barely-contained\n"
"destructive energy. Any blow which cracks its fragile surface is likely to\n"
"result in a violent explosion.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个细长的棱镜的难以控制的破坏性能量噼啪作响。\n"
"任何能在它那脆弱的表面上产生裂纹的打击，都很有可能产生猛烈的爆炸。\n"

#. key: fungus
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fungus"
msgid ""
"A lumpy grey fungus, growing well in the dank underground dungeon.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种块状的灰色真菌，在潮湿的地牢里生长良好。\n"

#. key: gargoyle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gargoyle"
msgid ""
"A granite statue of a hideous winged monster, somehow brought to life.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个可怕的有翼怪物的花岗岩雕像，不知怎么活过来了。\n"

#. key: ghost crab
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ghost crab"
msgid ""
"A crab twisted by proximity to negative energy. Apparitions of the dead swirl\n"
"around it, only barely visible.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只因接近负能量而扭曲的螃蟹。周围盘旋着几乎看不见的鬼魂。\n"

#. key: ghost moth
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ghost moth"
msgid ""
"A vile interdimensional predator that feeds on the life force of living beings.\n"
"It resembles an enormous, spiny moth.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只穿梭在次元间的邪恶捕食者，以活物的生命力为食。\n"
"它看起来像是一只巨大的、长刺的飞蛾。\n"

#. key: ghoul
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ghoul"
msgid ""
"A decayed cadaver, reanimated and accursed with a terrible hunger. It desires\n"
"nothing but to feed on the flesh of the living, and will fell its victims with\n"
"its vicious claws.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具活过来的腐烂的尸体，被极度的饥饿所诅咒。\n"
"它只想以活人的肉为食，并会用其恶毒的爪子击倒受害者。\n"

#. key: glass eye
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:glass eye"
msgid ""
"A floating eyeball formed from living glass. Only the divine Jiyva could form\n"
"such a curious servitor.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由活性玻璃形成的浮眼。只有神圣的吉瓦才能生成这么奇异的侍从。\n"

#. key: glowing orange brain
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:glowing orange brain"
msgid ""
"A huge pulsating brain, floating just off the floor and glowing with mutagenic\n"
"energies. It radiates a constant psychic influence upon nearby allies, using its\n"
"vast intellect to empower their spellcasting abilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个硕大的皱皱巴巴的大脑浮在地面上，散发着诱变能量。它似乎时不时地在悸动。\n"

#. key: glowing shapeshifter
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:glowing shapeshifter"
msgid ""
"A shapeshifter which has lost control over its transformations, and is\n"
"constantly changing form.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个变形人已经失去了对变形的控制能力，在不断地变换形态。\n"

#. key: gnoll
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gnoll"
msgid ""
"A taller and better-equipped relative of goblins, and ally of orcs. It is\n"
"somewhat doglike in appearance.\n"
msgstr ""
"地精和兽人的一个身材更高、装备更好的近亲，外貌有点像狗。\n"

#. key: gnoll bouda
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gnoll bouda"
msgid ""
"A gnoll witch possessed by a spirit of spite which flashes out from behind\n"
"their eyes. Its strange chants and ululations send other gnolls into a wild\n"
"frenzy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被怨灵附身的豺狼人女巫，怨灵在其眼后闪现。\n"
"它那奇怪的吟唱和呼喊能让其他豺狼人陷入疯狂。\n"

#. key: gnoll sergeant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gnoll sergeant"
msgid ""
"A commander of a pack of gnolls. Scars on its stout body give evidence of how\n"
"it earned its rank.\n"
msgstr ""
"一群豺狼人的首领。他壮硕的身躯上满是伤痕，这足以证明他是怎么赢得今天的地位的。\n"

#. key: goblin
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:goblin"
msgid ""
"A short, impatient and unfriendly humanoid. Goblins first appeared only a few\n"
"years ago, but are now remarkably numerous. Sadly, no number of raucous goblin\n"
"parties will put them in a welcoming mood toward adventurers.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个矮小、急躁、不友好的人形生物。地精在几年前才开始出现，但现在数量惊人。\n"
"遗憾的是，没有几个喧闹的地精派对能让冒险者觉得自己受到了欢迎。\n"

#. key: golden dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:golden dragon"
msgid ""
"A great winged dragon covered in shining golden scales. Legends say that its\n"
"blood runs both hot and cold, and is venomous to boot.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条有翼巨龙，身上覆盖着闪耀的金鳞。传说它的血滚烫而又寒冷，并有着毒性。\n"

#. key: golden eye
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:golden eye"
msgid ""
"A tiny and shimmering floating eye, swift as the wind and glistening like gold.\n"
"It has a peculiarly hypnotic look.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个微小、发出微光的浮眼。它和风一样迅捷，并会像金子一样闪闪发光。\n"
"它的外表很特别，似乎能将人催眠。\n"

#. key: goliath frog
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:goliath frog"
msgid ""
"A frog of exceptional size, for a frog. It lashes its prey with its tongue\n"
"from a distance to coat them in its acidic stomach juices.\n"
msgstr ""
"对于蛙来说，它的体形极其巨大。\n"
"它从远处用舌头抽打猎物，把它们卷入酸性的胃液中。\n"

#. key: great orb of eyes
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:great orb of eyes"
msgid ""
"A levitating ball, covered in malignant eyes and humming with eldritch\n"
"energies. Many is the adventurer ripped limb from limb by its dreadful\n"
"eyeteeth.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个飘浮的球，上面满是恶毒的眼睛，怪异的能量在嗡嗡作响。\n"
"许多冒险者被它那可怕的眼牙肢解了。\n"

#. key: green death
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:green death"
msgid ""
"A bloated form covered in oozing sores and exhaling clouds of lethal poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"这团肿胀的东西上面满是渗出的疮，它不断排放出致命的毒云。\n"

#. key: green draconian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:green draconian"
msgid ""
"A muscular green-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肌肉发达、长有绿色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

#. key: grey draconian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grey draconian"
msgid ""
"A muscular grey-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肌肉发达、长有灰色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

#. key: guardian mummy
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:guardian mummy"
msgid ""
"An ancient warrior, embalmed and cursed to walk in undeath for eternity.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个远古的战士，其尸体被防腐处理，被诅咒永远以死者之躯行走在世上。\n"

#. key: guardian serpent
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:guardian serpent"
msgid ""
"A rare and distinct member of scaly society, light and swift like a snake, yet\n"
"also intelligent like a naga. It is said that a guardian serpent would rather\n"
"die in battle than leave anything to an intruder.\n"
msgstr ""
"它是有鳞生物中稀有而独特成员，既像蛇一样轻快，又有与纳迦一样的智力。\n"
"据说，守卫巨蛇宁可战死也不会让入侵者拿走任何东西。\n"

#. key: halazid warlock
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:halazid warlock"
msgid ""
"An ancient undead sorcerer, exhumed by the living divines Sheza and Sargol and\n"
"forced to labour night and day to anchor them to the world. Even after the fall\n"
"of the divine twins, it works to resurrect its fallen masters.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个古代的亡灵术师，被还在世的神西泽和萨格尔发掘出来，\n"
"被迫昼夜不停工作让他们弥留在世上。\n"
"即使在这对神倒下后，它仍在努力复活它那陨落的主人。\n"

#. key: harpy
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:harpy"
msgid ""
"A bird-like creature with a human face that roams the coasts endlessly, feared\n"
"for its sharp claws and harrying strikes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个长有人脸的鸟状生物，无休止地在海岸上飞荡，要当心她的利爪和扑打。\n"

#. key: sin beast
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sin beast"
msgid ""
"A ravenous brute of a demon - as much animal as person. Born from the residue\n"
"of mortal depravity, it gorges itself on malice and magic alike.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个令人厌恶的人兽杂种，会发出令人恐惧的咆哮。\n"

#. key: hell hog
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hell hog"
msgid ""
"An extremely large and aggressive swine, bred in Hell, whose breath burns its\n"
"foes to ash.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头在地狱中被养大、攻击性极强的巨型猪，其吐息能将敌人烧成灰烬。\n"

#. key: hell hound
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hell hound"
msgid ""
"A huge black dog with glowing red eyes, and smoke pouring from its fanged\n"
"mouth.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条黑色的大狗长着炽红色眼睛，它那长满利齿的口中不断有烟雾喷出。\n"

#. key: hell knight
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hell knight"
msgid ""
"A heavily armoured warrior, in league with the powers of Hell, and usually\n"
"accompanied by other unsavoury beings of its ilk.\n"
msgstr ""
"一名身着重甲的战士，与地狱力量结盟，经常与其他令人作呕的家伙集群行动。\n"

#. key: hell rat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hell rat"
msgid ""
"A unusually large rat. Its weird, knobbly orange skin glows with the infernal\n"
"energies that spawned it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只特别大的老鼠。它那怪异的、长满疙瘩的橙色表皮散发着孕育它的地狱能量。\n"

#. key: hell sentinel
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hell sentinel"
msgid ""
"A towering monolith constructed and possessed by demonic forces. A thousand\n"
"eyes leer through slits in its jagged, spiked armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"一块巨大的雕像，由恶魔力量构造和控制。\n"
"千只眼睛透过它那凹凸不平、长满尖刺的铠甲的缝隙窥视着。\n"

#. key: hellephant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hellephant"
msgid ""
"An abhorrent pachyderm, descendant of demons, burning from within with the\n"
"fires of Hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头令人憎恶的厚皮动物，它是恶魔的后裔，体内燃烧着地狱之火。\n"

#. key: hellion
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hellion"
msgid ""
"A hateful demon, desirous to see all life destroyed by its damnation.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个可恶的恶魔，渴望用它的诅咒毁灭所有见到的生命。\n"

#. key: hellwing
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hellwing"
msgid ""
"A hideous skeletal demon. It swoops through the air on powerful wings of\n"
"ancient withered skin, taking sadistic joy from harrying those who would try to\n"
"flee its grasp.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个丑陋的骷髅恶魔。它用强大的、表皮老而干瘪的翅膀在空中掠过，\n"
"从袭扰那些试图逃离它掌控的人中获得虐待狂的快乐。\n"

#. key: hexer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hexer"
msgid ""
"A humanoid construct of insubstantial memory, floating through the air. Though\n"
"perhaps somewhat changed in shape and bearing few discernable features, still\n"
"it seems somehow to resemble a warrior from the distantly remembered past,\n"
"ready with debilitating spells and deadly knifework.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个无实际记忆的人形造物，浮在空中。\n"
"尽管外形会发生变化，也没什么明显可辨的特征，\n"
"但它却像来自遥远记忆中过去的战士，准备着衰弱法术和致命的刀法。\n"

#. key: hippogriff
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hippogriff"
msgid ""
"A large creature with the hindquarters of a horse and the wings, head and\n"
"talons of a great eagle. As popular heraldric creatures, some fortresses may\n"
"keep them as symbols and defenders alike, where they in turn launch intruders\n"
"into the waiting blades of their masters.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个大型生物。它的后腿和臀部像狮子，但它又长着如同巨鹰的翅膀、头部和爪子。\n"

#. key: hobgoblin
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hobgoblin"
msgid ""
"A larger and even ruder goblin. Hobgoblins are perfectly capable of wielding\n"
"weapons, but most prefer to beat their opponents to death with their bare hands.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个体形更大，甚至更粗暴的地精。\n"
"大地精完全有能力持握武器，但大多数更喜欢徒手把他们的敌人打死。\n"

#. key: hog
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hog"
msgid ""
"A large even-toed ungulate. Like human beings, it is omnivorous, intelligent,\n"
"and nearly hairless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头大型偶蹄类动物。像人类一样，杂食、聪明，而且几乎不长毛。\n"

#. key: holy swine
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:holy swine"
msgid ""
"A rare celestial version of a usually filthy animal, said to be an angelic\n"
"being who succumbed to hostile magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"在通常肮脏的动物之中罕见地出现了一个神圣品种，\n"
"据说，它是被敌对魔法击败的天使变成的。\n"

#. key: hound
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hound"
msgid ""
"A fearsome hunting dog, lithe and alert.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条骇人的猎狗，灵巧而又机警。\n"

#. key: howler monkey
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:howler monkey"
msgid ""
"An aggressively territorial primate, known for the astonishing variety and\n"
"volume of noise it can produce.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个好斗的灵长类动物，因所发出的噪音出奇地种样多、音量大而闻名。\n"

#. key: human
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:human"
msgid ""
"An uppity sort of surface-dwelling, hairless ape. Dwarves think of them as\n"
"fragile, elves think of them as clumsy, and monsters think of them as tasty.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个傲慢的、生活在地表的无毛猿猴。\n"
"矮人认为他们太脆弱，精灵认为他们太笨拙，怪物们则觉得他们很好吃。\n"

#. key: hydra
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hydra"
msgid ""
"A great and nightmarish lacertilian beast. It has many heads, and the potential\n"
"to grow many more!\n"
"\n"
"Hitting it with any bladed weapon bigger than a short blade risks lopping a\n"
"head off and causing two more to grow in its place. Very large claws, such as\n"
"trolls', are long enough to do the same. Only a weapon branded with flame will\n"
"cauterise the wound and prevent more heads from growing.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头噩梦般的巨型蜥蜴类怪兽。它有很多个头，而且可能还会长出更多！\n"
"\n"
"用任何比短刃更大的有刃武器击打它，有可能会砍掉一个头部，\n"
"但却会导致其位置上长出另外两个头。\n"
"用巨大的爪子进行攻击，比如巨魔的爪子，也会因足够长，导致产生同样的情况。\n"
"只有用带有火焰印记的武器才能灼烧伤口并防止长出更多的头。\n"

#. key: ice beast
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice beast"
msgid ""
"A terrible creature, formed of snow and crystalline ice. Its feet leave puddles\n"
"of icy water on the floor.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由雪和冰晶构成的可怕生物。它所踏及的地面上会留下一滩冰水坑。\n"

#. key: ice devil
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice devil"
msgid ""
"A man-sized demon covered in glittering ice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个人类大小的恶魔，身上覆盖着闪光的寒冰。\n"

#. key: ice dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice dragon"
msgid ""
"A white, frost-coated dragon. Snowflakes trickle from its nostrils.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条满身冰霜的白龙。雪花从它的鼻孔上落下。\n"

#. key: ice fiend
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice fiend"
msgid ""
"A huge frigid demon covered in frost and wreathed in freezing air. It is one of\n"
"the most terrible denizens of the many Hells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大而寒冷的魔鬼，身上覆满冰霜，被冰冷的空气环绕着。\n"
"这是地狱中最可怕的魔物之一。\n"

#. key: ice statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice statue"
msgid ""
"An imposing idol of some nameless arctic god, carved in glistening deep blue\n"
"ice. Freezing vapours swirl about it, and a chill pervades the air.\n"
msgstr ""
"某个无名的极地神祗的壮观神像，用发光的深蓝色冰雕刻而成。\n"
"冰汽在它身边盘旋，空气中弥漫着寒意。\n"

#. key: iguana
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iguana"
msgid ""
"A green lizard with strong jaws and sharp teeth, prized for its flesh.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条绿色蜥蜴长有强壮的颚和尖锐的牙齿，它的肉价值很高。\n"

#. key: imperial myrmidon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:imperial myrmidon"
msgid ""
"A warrior initiated in the mysteries of a dying cult, dedicated to serve\n"
"thrones long-fallen. Its blows strip away magical defences, leaving its foes\n"
"vulnerable to even the simplest hexes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个在没落的邪教的奥秘中得到启蒙的战士，致力于服侍失落已久的王座。\n"
"他的攻击会剥去魔法防御，让他的敌人哪怕面对最简单的法术也会显得脆弱。\n"

#. key: inugami
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:inugami"
msgid ""
"A mystical canine, frequently bound into the service of wizards and sorcerers.\n"
"Its eyes flicker with remarkable intelligence, but its bite is no less sharp\n"
"than its wilder cousins.\n"
"\n"
"They are difficult to truly kill - when gravely wounded, they instead return to\n"
"spiritual form to lick their wounds until ready to be summoned again.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只神秘的犬科动物，经常为巫师和术师服务。\n"
"它的眼睛闪烁着非凡的智慧，它的咬伤也不比它更狂野的表亲逊色。\n"
"\n"
"它们很难被真正杀死——\n"
"当受到重伤时，它们会回到灵体形态舔舐伤口，直到准备好再次响应召唤。\n"

#. key: iron dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iron dragon"
msgid ""
"A very heavy, slow and apparently flightless dragon. It is named for its\n"
"scales, which are so tough they might be iron. Small flakes of metal trail from\n"
"its nostrils.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条龙非常沉重、迟缓，而且似乎不会飞。\n"
"它因其鳞片而得名，鳞片坚韧得像铁一样。铁屑从它的鼻孔中飞出。\n"

#. key: iron elemental
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iron elemental"
msgid ""
"A rare and powerful spirit from the elemental plane of earth, it exists in this\n"
"world by inhabiting a hulking mass of iron.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自土元素位面的罕见而强大灵体，\n"
"凭借占据着一个巨大的铁块而存在于这个世界上。\n"

#. key: iron giant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iron giant"
msgid ""
"A huge, rusting monolith, larger than any other species of giant. It packs\n"
"an incredible punch.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个生锈的巨像，比其他任何各类的巨人都要大。他有着惊人的冲击力。\n"

#. key: iron golem
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iron golem"
msgid ""
"A large, ponderous and very solid statue of metal, given the power of\n"
"locomotion through some esoteric means.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊巨大、笨重而且极其坚固的金属雕像，某种深奥的法术赐予了它行动能力。\n"

#. key: iron imp
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iron imp"
msgid ""
"An ugly, twisted little minor demon with metal skin.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个丑陋、扭曲的低阶恶魔，长有钢铁皮肤。\n"

#. key: iron troll
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iron troll"
msgid ""
"A great troll, mighty of limb and plated with thick scales that resemble\n"
"lightly rusted iron, especially in their hardness.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强大的巨魔，四肢强壮，身上厚重的鳞片不仅看起来像生锈的铁，\n"
"而且硬度也和铁差不多。\n"

#. key: ironbound convoker
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ironbound convoker"
msgid ""
"A guardian mage clad in pattern-etched armour. It can recite words of power\n"
"to summon distant allies and imbue them with unnatural might.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个身穿有着刻蚀图案盔甲的守卫法师。\n"
"他可以吟诵强大的咒语来召唤附近的盟友，并给他们灌输异常的力量。\n"

#. key: ironbound frostheart
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ironbound frostheart"
msgid ""
"An emaciated warrior-mage, bound to guard long-coveted treasures. It calls\n"
"forth deadly frost from its surrounds, freezing foes that are next to walls.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个憔悴的战斗法师，致力于守护渴望已久的宝藏。\n"
"他会从周围召唤出致命的冰霜，冻结靠近墙边的敌人。\n"

#. key: ironbound thunderhulk
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ironbound thunderhulk"
msgid ""
"A brutish figure, hastily armoured in scraps of leather and metal to combat\n"
"a fearsome intruder. On its back is an antique, arcane 'lightning rod', which\n"
"calls down thunder on distant foes, although it cannot hit nearby targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个粗野的生物，匆忙披上皮革和金属碎片，以抵抗可怕的入侵者。\n"
"他的背上有一根古老、神秘的“引雷针”，可以向远处的敌人发出雷霆，\n"
"尽管它无法击中附近的目标。\n"

#. key: ironbound preserver
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ironbound preserver"
msgid ""
"A towering, muscular figure, capable of safeguarding its allies by selflessly\n"
"accepting a portion of the injuries inflicted upon them.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个高耸、肌肉发达的人，会无私地抗下友方受到的部分伤害来保护他们。\n"

#. key: jackal
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jackal"
msgid ""
"A small canine scavenger. Packs of jackals roam the underworld, searching for\n"
"carrion to devour.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个小型的犬科食腐动物。成群结队的豺狼游荡在地下世界中寻找腐肉来果腹。\n"

#. key: jelly
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jelly"
msgid ""
"A pulsating mass of acidic protoplasm.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团悸动的酸性原生质。\n"

#. key: jiangshi
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jiangshi"
msgid ""
"A vampiric thrall bound into servitude by esoteric rituals. Though its rigid\n"
"limbs give it an awkward gait, it moves with surprising speed, leaping upon its\n"
"victims and leeching away their life essence with its vicious claws.\n"
msgstr ""
"被神秘的仪式束缚为吸血的奴隶。尽管其僵硬的四肢使它步态笨拙，\n"
"但却有着惊人速度，它扑向受害者，用恶毒的爪子吸取他们的生命精华。\n"

#. key: jorogumo
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jorogumo"
msgid ""
"A spider spirit that takes the appearance of a human. It weaves deadly magics to\n"
"incapacitate and kill its prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个化身为人类的蜘蛛精。她编织着致命的法术，使猎物丧失行动能力并进行捕杀。\n"

#. key: juggernaut
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:juggernaut"
msgid ""
"A gigantic humanoid with thick iron plates welded to its skin. It moves with\n"
"alarming speed and deals incredible damage with its immense fists, but must\n"
"rest between blows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的人形怪，皮上烙着厚铁板，却移速极快。他能以惊人的速度移动，\n"
"用巨大的拳头造成难以置信的伤害，但必须在打击之间进行休整。\n"

#. key: jumping spider
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jumping spider"
msgid ""
"A spider which weaves webs between its front legs and leaps at its prey,\n"
"ensnaring them. The speed with which it leaps is almost supernatural.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只蜘蛛会在它的两条前腿间织网，然后扑向猎物，将其捕捉。\n"
"它跳跃的速度几乎是超自然的。\n"

#. key: killer bee
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:killer bee"
msgid ""
"A giant bee, bearing a deadly barb which can sting repeatedly.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只巨型的蜂，长着致命的倒刺，可以反复刺叮。\n"

#. key: killer klown
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:killer klown"
msgid ""
"A comical figure full of life and laughter. It looks very happy to see you...\n"
"but is there a slightly malicious cast to its features? Is that red face paint\n"
"or something altogether less pleasant?\n"
msgstr ""
"一个满是活力和欢笑的丑角。他见到你似乎非常开心……\n"
"不过，他的脸上似乎透露出些微恶意？\n"
"那块红色的东西真的只是脸上的涂料吗，还是其他什么令人不快的东西？\n"

#. key: knight
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:knight"
msgid ""
"A humanoid construct of insubstantial memory, floating through the air. Though\n"
"perhaps somewhat changed in shape and bearing few discernable features, still\n"
"it seems somehow to resemble a warrior from the distantly remembered past,\n"
"well equipped with arms and armour both.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个无实际记忆的人形造物，浮在空中。\n"
"尽管外形会发生变化，也没什么明显可辨的特征，\n"
"但它却像来自遥远记忆中过去的战士，装备着精良的武器和盔甲。\n"

#. key: kobold
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kobold"
msgid ""
"A small, greyish creature with the look and temperament of a feral dog. No one\n"
"knows for sure where kobolds come from, but ancient demon-gods, evil spirits,\n"
"and meddling wizards have all been suggested as culprits.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个灰色的小型动物，其外表和性格都很像疯狗。\n"
"没人确切知道狗头人到底是从哪来的，\n"
"不过远古的魔神、邪灵和不安分的巫师都经常被指控为元凶。\n"

#. key: kobold brigand
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kobold brigand"
msgid ""
"A kobold that is bigger and tougher than the ordinary kobold, with a penchant\n"
"for underhanded tactics.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个狗头人比普通的狗头人更大、更强壮，并且喜欢卑鄙的战术。\n"

#. key: kobold blastminer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kobold blastminer"
msgid ""
"A kobold, ready with multiple armaments to defend itself from the many\n"
"dangers of the depths. The blastmote-packed cannon on its shoulder bears its\n"
"maker's mark, and is fiercely loyal; it will fire for none other.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个狗头人，准备了多种武器来保护自己免受深处的许多危险。\n"
"扛在其肩上的装着爆炸粉尘的火铳带有制造商的标记，而且非常忠诚：\n"
"其他人无法用它开火。\n"

#. key: kobold demonologist
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kobold demonologist"
msgid ""
"A kobold in league with demonic powers, able to call forth beings from the\n"
"depths of Hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个与恶魔力量结盟的狗头人，能召唤来自地狱深处的生物。\n"

#. key: komodo dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:komodo dragon"
msgid ""
"An enormous monitor lizard more than capable of preying on large animals.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条超巨型的蜥蜴，能够捕食大型动物。\n"

#. key: kraken
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kraken"
msgid ""
"A gargantuan sea monster, capable of devouring entire ships. Its many tentacles\n"
"reach towards the shore and crush any who draw near.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只巨大的海怪，能吞噬整艘船。它的许多触手伸向岸边，会把任何靠近的人击碎。\n"

#. key: large abomination
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:large abomination"
msgid ""
"A hideous conglomeration of mangled body parts, possessed and altered in ways\n"
"that challenge sanity. Each varies in speed, strength, or resilience by\n"
"the nature of whatever unfortunates were used to make it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一坨残缺的身体部位的可怕组合，以挑战理智的方式进行着控制和变化。\n"
"每一块的耐用性都会因所取用的不幸者的体质而有所不同。\n"

#. key: laughing skull
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:laughing skull"
msgid ""
"A blazing swift skull that cackles with the bleak malice of the dead. Fond of\n"
"swarming, its laughter grows more spiteful and powerful for each nearby member\n"
"of its own kind.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个燃烧的、迅捷的头骨，带着死者冷酷的恶意咯咯地笑着。\n"
"它喜欢成群结队，一旦附近有同类成员，笑声将变得更恶毒、更强大。\n"

#. key: lava snake
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lava snake"
msgid ""
"A burning red snake which dwells in pools of lava. It spits gobs of molten rock\n"
"at passers-by.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条火红色的蛇，栖息在岩浆池之中。它会向路过的人喷射一团熔岩。\n"

#. key: lemure
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lemure"
msgid ""
"An accursed soul magically bound to hellish servitude for the highest bidder.\n"
"If its master is slain, it will be freed, departing this realm with gratitude.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被诅咒的灵魂，被魔法束缚在地狱般的奴役之下，会为最高出价者而战。\n"
"如果它的主人被杀，它将得到自由，带着感激离开这个世界。\n"

#. key: lich
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lich"
msgid ""
"A powerful wizard who has learned to cheat death itself, now existing as a\n"
"skeletal, desiccated corpse kept intact by a mighty exercise of dark magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"有些强大的巫师甚至能骗过死亡本身，\n"
"而现在它只剩一具骷髅、干燥的尸体，通过强大的黑暗魔法维系着存在。\n"

#. key: lightning spire
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lightning spire"
msgid ""
"A buzzing contraption made from a coil and a rod. It irregularly zaps\n"
"electricity at the most distant enemy in its range.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个用线圈和一根杆子制成的嗡嗡作响的仪器。它会向附近的生物释放电流。\n"

#. key: lindwurm
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lindwurm"
msgid ""
"A small serpentine dragon with a pair of strong forelimbs. Its thick scales\n"
"give off an eerie red glow.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条小型蛇形龙，长有一对强壮的前肢。它坚厚的鳞片发出诡异的红光。\n"

#. key: living spell
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:living spell"
msgid ""
"A spell, waiting to cast itself at the first foe that enters its range. Once\n"
"it does, it'll dissipate into the ether.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个法术，在等待着时机，向第一个进入其射程的敌人施放。\n"
"一旦发生，它便会消散到以太中。\n"

#. key: lost soul
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lost soul"
msgid ""
"The echo of an unmourned soul. Though the memories of its living self are\n"
"long-faded, it is drawn to the moment of death by some lingering instinct. It\n"
"seizes upon the passage of other souls, losing the last vestiges of its being\n"
"in the memories of another's life.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个无人哀悼的灵魂的回音。尽管它自己生前的记忆已经褪去很久了，\n"
"但还是被某种弥留的本能拉到了死亡的那一刻。\n"
"它夺取他人灵魂的旅程，在别人生命的记忆中失去了自己存在的最后一丝痕迹。\n"

#. key: lurking horror
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lurking horror"
msgid ""
"A formless mass of negative energy, bound to bring terrible torment once the\n"
"forces holding it together dissolve. The alien presence of intruders to the\n"
"Abyss is sure to unravel it, yet it seems perversely drawn toward them; still,\n"
"it seems somehow reluctant to move while being observed.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个无定形的负能量团，一旦维系它的力量消失，势必带来可怕的折磨。\n"
"尽管闯入深渊的异形必定会拆解它，但它反倒像故意要吸引他们。\n"
"不过，在被观察的时候，它似乎不太想移动。\n"

#. key: mana viper
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mana viper"
msgid ""
"A violet-scaled serpent with faintly glowing eyes. It thirsts for magic as well\n"
"as flesh, and its bite can drink dry the magical reservoirs of even a powerful\n"
"mage in no time.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条长有紫色鳞片和微微发光的眼睛的巨蛇。它对魔法的渴望如同对肉的渴望一样，\n"
"哪怕是一个强大的法师被它咬一口，魔力库也会瞬间被吸干。\n"

#. key: manticore
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:manticore"
msgid ""
"A hideous cross-breed, bearing the features of a human and a lion, with great\n"
"bat-like wings. Its tail bristles with spikes that can be loosed at potential\n"
"prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个狰狞的混种动物：它身上既有人的特征也有狮子的特征，\n"
"还长着一对巨大的蝠翼形翅膀。它的尾巴上长满的尖刺，会射向潜在的猎物。\n"

#. key: martyred shade
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:martyred shade"
msgid ""
"The wandering shade of a long-dead soul who died for a forgotten cause. Though\n"
"their memories have turned to mist, something deep within still compels them to\n"
"serve and sacrifice - no matter the cost.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个早已死去、为某个被遗忘的事业而献身的灵魂的游荡阴影。\n"
"尽管它们的记忆已经变得模糊，但内心深处的某种东西仍然驱使它们去服侍和牺牲——\n"
"无论付出什么代价。\n"

#. key: meliai
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:meliai"
msgid ""
"A nymphal hybrid, with a winged torso of a human atop the stinging abdomen\n"
"of a bee. The meliai serve under many roles: priestesses of nature, nurses to\n"
"the divine, and warrior-champions for their hives.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个仙女的混种，上方是带有翅膀的人类躯体，下方是长有蜂刺的腹部。\n"
"白橡树仙女扮演着众多角色：自然的祭司、神圣的看护者和蜂巢的战士。\n"

#. key: merfolk
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:merfolk"
msgid ""
"A hybrid with the torso of a human and the tail of a fish. It is capable of\n"
"dwelling both in water and on land, and fiercely defends its domain.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个人身鱼尾的混种生物。他能在水中和陆地上栖居，并会激烈地捍卫其领地。\n"

#. key: merfolk aquamancer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:merfolk aquamancer"
msgid ""
"A slender merfolk mystic with unusually webby hands. Its form shifts and\n"
"glistens as if seen through ocean spray.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个纤细的鱼人秘术师，有着不同寻常的蹼状手。\n"
"他的形态变幻、发光，仿佛是透过海浪所看到的。\n"

#. key: merfolk avatar
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:merfolk avatar"
msgid ""
"A beguiling merfolk whose voice mesmerises listeners. It carries no weapon,\n"
"but its song summons drowned souls to defend the sea against intruders.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个迷人的鱼人，她的声音令听众陶醉其中。\n"
"她虽然没有持任何武器，但她的歌声能召唤溺魂，抵抗入侵者，保卫海洋。\n"

#. key: merfolk impaler
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:merfolk impaler"
msgid ""
"A powerfully muscled merfolk warrior, bearing a deadly weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强壮的鱼人战士，手持一把致命的武器。\n"

#. key: merfolk javelineer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:merfolk javelineer"
msgid ""
"A fearsome merfolk champion with a piercing gaze and a large bundle of\n"
"javelins.\n"
msgstr ""
"一名值得敬畏的鱼人勇士，目光锐利，还携有一大捆标枪。\n"

#. key: merfolk siren
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:merfolk siren"
msgid ""
"A beguiling merfolk whose voice can mesmerise listeners.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个迷人的鱼人，她的声音会迷住听众。\n"

#. key: minotaur
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:minotaur"
msgid ""
"A large muscular human with the head of a bull. It makes its home in a\n"
"gauntlet where it awaits worthy challengers.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个高大、壮硕的人形生物，长着一颗牛头。他居住在竞技场，等待值得较量的挑战者。\n"

#. key: molten gargoyle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:molten gargoyle"
msgid ""
"A hideous molten stone statue come to life, with flames licking across its\n"
"body.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个可怕的熔岩雕像活了过来，火舌缠绕着它的身体。\n"

#. key: moth of wrath
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:moth of wrath"
msgid ""
"A moth known for its ability to inspire rage by touching its foes, or merely\n"
"gazing at its friends. For some inexplicable reason, it was eradicated from\n"
"the surface centuries ago.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种飞蛾，以其通过触碰它的敌人或仅仅凝视它的友方就能激发狂暴的能力而闻名。\n"
"由于某些莫名其妙的原因，几个世纪前它就从地表消失了。\n"

#. key: mummy
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mummy"
msgid ""
"An undead figure covered in bandages and embalming fluids, compelled to walk by\n"
"an ancient curse. It radiates a malign aura.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个裹着绷带和防腐液的亡灵，被古老的诅咒驱使着行走。它散发出邪恶的气息。\n"

#. key: mummy priest
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mummy priest"
msgid ""
"An ancient servant of a long forgotten god, embalmed and cursed to walk in\n"
"undeath for all eternity.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位被遗忘已久的神明的远古仆人，经过防腐处理并被诅咒永生不死。\n"

#. key: mutant beast
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mutant beast"
msgid ""
"A bizarre creature, twisted and warped by overexposure to magical radiation.\n"
"Each has a different set of traits.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇异的生物，由于过度暴露于魔力辐射而扭曲变形。每个都有不同的特征。\n"

#. key: naga
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:naga"
msgid ""
"A hybrid that is human from the waist up; below is a scaly, muscular snakelike\n"
"tail. Its mouth drips with venomous saliva.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个人和蛇的混种，他的腰部以上是人类，下面却是一条健壮的、长着鳞片的蛇尾。\n"
"他的嘴边滴着毒性唾液。\n"

#. key: naga mage
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:naga mage"
msgid ""
"A naga that has trained in the use of magic, trailed by an eldritch nimbus. It\n"
"is especially skilled in spells dealing with poison and venom.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个纳迦进行过施法训练，所到之处都会留下神秘的灵气。\n"
"他特别擅长施放和毒有关的法术。\n"

#. key: naga ritualist
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:naga ritualist"
msgid ""
"An esoteric mystic draped in talismans. It venerates poison as a sacred gift\n"
"and means of spiritual purification.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个高深莫测的秘术师，佩戴着护身符。他将毒药尊崇为神圣的礼物和净化精神的手段。\n"

#. key: naga sharpshooter
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:naga sharpshooter"
msgid ""
"A naga with exceptionally keen eyesight, adept in the use of ranged weaponry\n"
"and simple magics which allows it to snipe at targets across nearly any\n"
"obstruction.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个视力极其敏锐的纳迦，善于使用远程武器和简单魔法，\n"
"使得他几乎可以跨越任何阻碍狙击目标。\n"

#. key: naga warrior
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:naga warrior"
msgid ""
"A fearsome naga warrior clad in sturdy armour and wielding a mighty weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个令人敬畏的纳迦战士，身穿坚甲，手拿利器。\n"

#. key: nagaraja
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nagaraja"
msgid ""
"A magnificent example of the naga. It is an expert at both martial and magical\n"
"arts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个在纳迦中受到尊崇的模范。他精通武术和魔法。\n"

#. key: nameless horror
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nameless horror"
msgid ""
"A malign force from the space between planes. It is hostile to the magic forces\n"
"that removed it from its home. These horrors are often the result of mistaken\n"
"summoning spells and have slain many aspiring wizards.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自位面之间的邪恶力量。它对把它带离家园的魔法力量充满敌意。\n"
"这个恐怖通常是召唤魔法出错的结果，并杀死了许多有抱负的巫师。\n"

#. key: nargun
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nargun"
msgid ""
"An ancient stone creature that has lived among these frozen caves since before\n"
"Antaeus rent Cocytus into being. It tolerates its new neighbors begrudgingly,\n"
"preferring the company of its petrified enemies. Veins of ice permeate its\n"
"frozen stone flesh.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个古老的石质生物，在安泰俄斯占据悲叹河之前就一直生活在这些冰冻的洞穴中。\n"
"它不情愿地容忍新邻居，宁愿与石化类的敌人为伍。\n"
"冰脉在它那冰冻的石肉中流通着。\n"

#. key: necromancer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:necromancer"
msgid ""
"An evil wizard who is devoted to the practice of death magic, the mastery of\n"
"unholy energies, and the raising of corpses into a parody of life.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个邪恶的巫师毕生钻研死亡魔法的奥秘，\n"
"掌握邪恶的能量，以及给予尸体虚假的生命。\n"

#. key: necrophage
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:necrophage"
msgid ""
"A vile undead creation of the most unholy necromancy, made from the decaying\n"
"corpses of humanoid creatures. It exists to spread disease and decay.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被最邪恶的死灵法术创造出来的亡灵造物，其身体由人形生物的腐尸拼凑而成。\n"
"它的存在的就是为了散布疾病与腐化。\n"

#. key: neqoxec
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:neqoxec"
msgid ""
"A weirdly shaped demon, pulsing and shifting with mutagenic energies, its belly\n"
"distended with the devoured brains of its victims.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇形怪状的恶魔。它的身体受变异能量的影响，不断搏动变化着，\n"
"它的肚子因吞食太多受害者的脑子而发胀。\n"

#. key: obsidian statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:obsidian statue"
msgid ""
"A beautiful statue of an unknown creature, jet-black like a tear in reality.\n"
"Its eyes glow with an otherworldly, malignant radiance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊美丽的未知生物的雕像，黑玉般晶莹的色泽像是现实中的泪珠。\n"
"它的眼睛闪烁着超乎寻常的邪恶光芒。\n"

#. key: occultist
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:occultist"
msgid ""
"A wizard fond of illusion and treachery. They scorn the crudeness of other\n"
"magicians, who hurl wild conjurations toward their foes rather than cunningly\n"
"exploiting their greatest weaknesses.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个喜欢幻象和背叛的巫师。\n"
"他们蔑视那些向敌人疯狂施展魔法、而不是巧妙利用其最大的弱点的粗鲁的魔法师。\n"

#. key: octopode
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:octopode"
msgid ""
"A more intelligent cousin of the mighty kraken, capable of using tools and\n"
"spells. It is fully amphibious, but most of its species choose to stay beneath\n"
"the waves and serve their King.\n"
msgstr ""
"强大的海怪的一个近亲，但比海怪更聪明，能够使用工具和魔法。\n"
"它是完全两栖的，但它们大多数物种还是选择留在波涛之下，服侍它们的王。\n"

#. key: ogre
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ogre"
msgid ""
"A large, ugly, and fat creature, distantly related to goblins. It is\n"
"tremendously strong, and likes fighting alongside its orc friends.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个又大又丑又胖的生物，是兽人和地精的近亲。他强壮得难以置信。\n"

#. key: ogre mage
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ogre mage"
msgid ""
"A rare breed of ogre, skilled in the use of magic. It usually becomes a\n"
"chieftain among its kin.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个罕见的食人魔，擅长使用魔法。他通常是一群食人魔的酋长。\n"

#. key: oklob plant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:oklob plant"
msgid ""
"A very dangerous plant which fends off predators by spraying corrosive vitriol\n"
"at them. Even experienced adventurers give oklob plants a wide berth.\n"
msgstr ""
"这株危险的植物能靠喷吐腐蚀性强酸来击退捕食者。\n"
"即使是有经验的冒险者也会尽量远离酸箭草。\n"

#. key: oklob sapling
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:oklob sapling"
msgid ""
"A young oklob plant. It is more fragile than the mature specimen, but the acid\n"
"it sprays is just as deadly.\n"
msgstr ""
"一株酸箭草幼苗。它比成熟的更脆弱，但喷出的酸同样致命。\n"

#. key: oni
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:oni"
msgid ""
"A large, rowdy, and drink-loving creature. When they're not busy with their\n"
"duties serving any number of gods, oni mostly love a good fight.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个体形巨大、吵闹、爱喝酒的生物。\n"
"当鬼不忙于侍奉神明的职责时，他们通常会喜欢痛快地打上一架。\n"

#. key: ophan
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ophan"
msgid ""
"A creature from the heavenly realms. It consists of a wheel within a wheel, and\n"
"both of these are covered in eyes; strange flames of holy fire flicker all over\n"
"it. To be seen by its countless eyes is to be highlighted and branded as both\n"
"dissident and quarry for its allies to hunt down.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自天国的生物。\n"
"它由一个轮套着另一个轮组成，两个轮上都布满了眼睛；上面不时闪现出奇异的圣火。\n"

#. key: orange crystal statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orange crystal statue"
msgid ""
"An intricately carved idol of some nameless godling, hewn of translucent orange\n"
"crystal. Its lifeless eyes seem to glitter uncannily with a wicked\n"
"intelligence. It is capable of unleashing a powerful psychic assault upon the\n"
"minds of any who approach it.\n"
msgstr ""
"某个无名神祗的神像，用透明橙色水晶细致地雕刻而成。\n"
"它那无生命的眼睛似乎闪烁着邪恶的智慧。\n"
"它会对任何接近它的人的心灵发动强大的精神攻击。\n"

#. key: orange demon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orange demon"
msgid ""
"An amber-coloured demon with a barbed tail not unlike that of a scorpion.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个琥珀色的恶魔，尾巴上的倒刺，与蝎子无异。\n"

#. key: orb guardian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb guardian"
msgid ""
"A huge, glowing, four-limbed purple creature with heightened senses, created by\n"
"the Orb itself. It guards the Orb with enormous punctiliousness and violence,\n"
"and its death will alert any Boundless Tesseracts on the level to begin creating\n"
"reinforcements.\n"
"\n"
"Unless the Orb has already been disturbed, it will refuse to abandon its duty\n"
"by leaving the floor.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大、发光的紫色四肢生物，有着特别敏锐的知觉，被宝珠自身所创造。\n"
"它谨慎地守卫着那球，在有必要使用暴力时也完全不会犹豫。\n"

#. key: orb of destruction
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb of destruction"
msgid ""
"A conjured globe of pure magic that homes onto a designated target, albeit with\n"
"massive inertia. A smart and agile person may move out of its path, causing it\n"
"to miss its target. It cannot be avoided by Dodging skill, and is able to make\n"
"sharp turns to hit adjacent targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个变出的纯魔法球，能够锁定指定目标，尽管具有巨大的惯性。\n"
"一个聪明而敏捷的人可能会选择偏离它的路径，会让它错过目标。\n"
"但仅凭闪避技能无法避免它，并且它能够急转弯以击中相邻目标。\n"

#. key: orb of fire
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb of fire"
msgid ""
"A globe of raw primordial fire, capable of impressive pyrotechnics and of\n"
"twisting the very flesh of creatures who come into its ken.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由最原始的火焰构成的球体，能够发出壮观的烟火，\n"
"并能扭曲进入其视野的生物的肉体。\n"

#. key: orb spider
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb spider"
msgid ""
"An eerily glowing spider with strands of pure energy emerging from its\n"
"spinnerets. It seems to want to keep its distance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只发着奇异光芒的蜘蛛，纯粹的魔法能量从它的喷丝头上涌出。\n"
"它似乎在竭力和你保持距离。\n"

#. key: orc
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orc"
msgid ""
"A subterranean tribe whose forebearers were once scattered across every corner\n"
"of the surface world. Eons of persecution have taught them the necessity of\n"
"violence and the importance of having your brethren at your side.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个丑陋的地下生物，被认为是人类、猪或是鸭嘴兽的远亲。\n"
"兽人喜欢成群聚在一起，制造骚乱。\n"

#. key: orc high priest
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orc high priest"
msgid ""
"An exalted servant of the orc god Beogh and a master of many foul rites, to\n"
"whose aid Beogh will even send beings from the netherworld.\n"
msgstr ""
"这名兽人是兽人之神比欧弗的高级仆从之一，主管多种污秽仪式，\n"
"比欧弗甚至会派遣地狱生物来支援他。\n"

#. key: orc knight
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orc knight"
msgid ""
"A heavily armoured orc, covered in scars from many past battles. It commands\n"
"its brethren in battle, rousing them to greater, more violent efforts with\n"
"bloodcurdling shouts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个重甲兽人，身上布满过去战斗留下的疤痕。\n"
"他在战斗中指挥着他的兄弟，用恐怖的吼声激发他们投入更大、更暴力的力量。\n"

#. key: orc priest
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orc priest"
msgid ""
"A servant of Beogh, the ancient god of the orcs. Beogh rewards its devoted\n"
"prayers by striking down its enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个兽人侍奉比欧弗——古老、残忍的兽人之神。\n"
"通过打击敌人，比欧弗会回报其虔诚的祈祷。\n"

#. key: orc sorcerer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orc sorcerer"
msgid ""
"An exceptionally competent orcish wizard, in league with hellish and chthonic\n"
"forces and motivated by the purest imaginable strain of malevolence.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个高超的兽人巫师，与地狱和黑暗力量为盟，被设想到的最阴暗的恶意驱使着。\n"

#. key: orc warlord
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orc warlord"
msgid ""
"A supreme commander of an orc host, skilled at both melee and ranged combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"兽人大军的最高指挥官，擅长近战和远程战斗。\n"

#. key: orc warrior
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orc warrior"
msgid ""
"An experienced, armoured and well-armed orc soldier, able to command a small\n"
"mob of its fellows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一名装备精良、战斗经验丰富的兽人士兵。他是一个小型战团的首领。\n"

#. key: orc wizard
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orc wizard"
msgid ""
"An orc who has gained proficiency in the occult arts, using them for martial\n"
"purposes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个精通神秘技艺的兽人，会将其用于战斗。\n"

#. key: pale draconian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pale draconian"
msgid ""
"A muscular humanoid with pale scales, a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肌肉发达、长有苍白色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

#. key: pandemonium lord
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pandemonium lord"
msgid ""
"A formidable demon lord inhabiting the endless halls of Pandemonium. Each one\n"
"is different, with its own set of strengths and weaknesses.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个可怕的恶魔领主居住在无尽魔窟之中。\n"
"每个魔窟领主都是独一无二的存在，拥有不同的能力和弱点。\n"

#. key: peacekeeper
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:peacekeeper"
msgid ""
"A four-legged humanoid construct, tasked with recapturing escaped prisoners and\n"
"punishing heretics. Long after the fall of the empire it once served, it\n"
"continues to enforce imperial law, knowing no jurisdiction.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个有着四条腿的人形造物，其任务是抓捕逃犯和惩罚异教徒。\n"
"它曾服务过的帝国已经覆灭很久了，\n"
"它却仍在执行着众所周知已经没有管辖权的帝国法律。\n"

#. key: pearl dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pearl dragon"
msgid ""
"A dragon consecrated to the holy divine powers. Its breath is blessed fire, and\n"
"its claws sear its victims with divine wrath.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条侍奉于神圣力量的龙。它的吐息是神圣的火，利爪会带着神怒灼伤受害者。\n"

#. key: phantasmal warrior
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:phantasmal warrior"
msgid ""
"A hideous translucent green spirit of a warrior fallen in battle but recalled\n"
"to this plane by unholy magic. The blade it wields is ethereal, rendering those\n"
"it strikes weak-willed and vulnerable to dark magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个可怕的、幽绿色的战败战士的灵魂，被邪恶魔法召回到这个层面。\n"
"它所持的利刃是虚无的，被它伤到的会更易受魔法影响。\n"

#. key: phantom
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:phantom"
msgid ""
"A nearly-transparent undead spirit, suspected by some sages to be a degenerate\n"
"form of ghost, with no memories of its former life. It rarely stays in one\n"
"place for long.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个几乎全身透明的亡灵幽魂，有些贤者怀疑它是一种退化的鬼魂，\n"
"因为它完全没有生前的记忆。它很少会在一个地方停留很长时间。\n"

#. key: pharaoh ant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pharaoh ant"
msgid ""
"A royal ant returned to unlife through strange, probably horrifying means. It\n"
"binds the souls of its allies when slain, allowing them to fight on after death\n"
"as simulacra.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只皇家蚂蚁通过奇怪的，可能是可怕的方式恢复了生命。\n"
"当盟友被杀时，它会缚住他们的灵魂，让他们在死后作为拟像继续战斗。\n"

#. key: pillar of salt
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pillar of salt"
msgid ""
"A pillar of salt shaped like a statue, but worked by no living hands.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根像是雕像的盐柱，但并非由手工打造。\n"

#. key: plant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:plant"
msgid ""
"A plant that has adapted to grow in the unpleasant dungeon environment,\n"
"somehow thriving even underground in the absence of the sun.\n"
msgstr ""
"一株已经适应在恶劣的地牢环境中生长的植物，\n"
"不知何故在没有太阳的地下也能茁壮成长。\n"

#. key: player ghost
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:player ghost"
msgid ""
"The apparition of an unfortunate adventurer, retaining many of the skills and\n"
"abilities the adventurer had in life. It is condemned to haunt this particular\n"
"level of the dungeons, lashing out violently at the next adventurer to cross\n"
"its path.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是某个不幸冒险者的鬼魂，它依然保有着许多生前拥有的技能和能力。\n"
"它被诅咒，徘徊在这一层地牢，向碰见它的下一个冒险者发起猛烈的攻击。\n"

#. key: polar bear
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:polar bear"
msgid ""
"A bear covered in glistening white fur, habituated to cold conditions. Like all\n"
"ursines, it will become enraged if badly hurt.\n"
msgstr ""
"这头熊身上披着发光的白色皮毛，能在寒冷环境中生存。\n"
"和所有其他熊类一样，它会在受重伤时会变得狂暴。\n"

#. key: profane servitor
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:profane servitor"
msgid ""
"A blasphemous being that was once an angel of the Shining One. It now stands as\n"
"unliving proof that not even the holiest of beings are beyond Yredelemnul's\n"
"grasp.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个渎神之物曾经是光明神的天使之一。然而，现在它的存在只能证明一件事：\n"
"即使是世间最圣洁的存在也无法逃出伊莱德莱姆努尔的魔掌。\n"

#. key: program bug
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:program bug"
msgid ""
"A ravenous and incredibly buggy monster. Please report its existence to the\n"
"DevTeam.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个贪婪、令人难以置信的臭虫怪物。请向开发者团队报告它的存在。\n"

#. key: protean progenitor
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:protean progenitor"
msgid ""
"A gargantuan humanoid of fractured shape from the aeons when the seas were but\n"
"primordial soup. The many shapeshifters of the dungeon once sloughed off from\n"
"these unfathomably ancient beings, and when they themselves finally cease, even\n"
"their remains will give birth one last time to furious monsters.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的、身形破碎的人形生物，当海洋还是原始汤的洪荒时代，他就已经出现了。\n"
"地牢中许多变形人就是从这些深不可测的古代生物身上脱落的，\n"
"当这些远古生物最终终结时，他们的遗体甚至还会在这最后一次生成愤怒的怪物。\n"

#. key: putrid mouth
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:putrid mouth"
msgid ""
"A starved spirit whose mouth is a pit of rot, emitting vile fumes. Its putrid\n"
"maw cannot eat the food it finds, so it moans with rage and desparate hunger.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个饥饿的灵魂，它的嘴是个腐烂的坑，散发着恶臭。\n"
"它那腐烂的嘴无法吃它找到的食物，愤怒地呻吟着，绝望地饿着。\n"

#. key: purple draconian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:purple draconian"
msgid ""
"A muscular purple-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肌肉发达、长有紫色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

#. key: queen bee
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:queen bee"
msgid ""
"A ruler of a swarm of bees, even larger and more dangerous than its many\n"
"offspring.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个蜂群的统治者，她比她的后代更大、更危险。\n"

#. key: quicksilver dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quicksilver dragon"
msgid ""
"A long and sinuous dragon, seemingly more neck and tail than anything else. Its\n"
"skin shines like molten mercury, magical energies arc from its pointed snout,\n"
"and it moves with terrifying swiftness.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条长而蜷曲着的龙，看起来几乎完全是颈和尾巴。\n"
"它的皮肤像熔铸的水银一样发着光，口鼻喷射着魔法能量，而且它的动作迅捷得吓人。\n"

#. key: quicksilver elemental
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quicksilver elemental"
msgid ""
"A mercurial spirit drawn from the elemental plane of earth. It exists in\n"
"this world by inhabiting a shimmering body of liquid metal.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自土元素位面的灵体。\n"
"它凭借占据着一个闪闪发光的液态金属体而存在于这个世界上。\n"

#. key: quokka
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quokka"
msgid ""
"A pesky little marsupial that is a bit like a rat, but not quite.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个烦人的小型有袋动物外形有点像老鼠，但只是有点像而已。\n"

#. key: radroach
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:radroach"
msgid ""
"A giant cockroach that has been exposed to high amounts of mutagenic energy. It\n"
"is horrifyingly mutated, but this has only made it stronger.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个暴露于大量诱变能量的巨型蟑螂。\n"
"它发生了可怕的变异，但这只会让它变得更强大。\n"

#. key: ragged hierophant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ragged hierophant"
msgid ""
"A bedraggled priest, once-fine robes now lined with salt and dust. Forsaken by\n"
"the gods, it now relies on constructs to protect itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个邋遢的祭司，曾经华丽的长袍现已沾满了盐和灰尘。\n"
"他被诸神抛弃，现在依赖造物保护自己。\n"

#. key: rakshasa
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rakshasa"
msgid ""
"A maneater demon, bestial and misshapen, in search of hidden power and\n"
"knowledge. It is an expert in the art of illusion, and is exceptionally\n"
"intelligent and cruel.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个老虎外形的恶魔，寻求隐藏的力量与知识。它是幻术大师，极其狡猾、残忍。\n"

#. key: rat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rat"
msgid ""
"A dirty rodent that has grown large and aggressive in the dungeon environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个肮脏的啮齿动物在地牢的环境下长得又大又凶猛。\n"

#. key: raiju
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:raiju"
msgid ""
"A profoundly unnatural hound, crackling with electricity. It travels in packs,\n"
"and covers great distances by bursting into living lightning.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条很反常的猎犬，身上的电流噼啪作响。\n"
"它们成群行动，并能以爆出活体闪电的方式行进很远的距离。\n"

#. key: reaper
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:reaper"
msgid ""
"A haunting form wielding a giant scythe, ceaselessly harvesting the souls of\n"
"the living.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具骷髅挥舞着一把巨大的镰刀，不断收割生者的灵魂。\n"

#. key: red devil
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:red devil"
msgid ""
"A larger cousin of the common imp, with a fiendish grin and two short wings\n"
"sprouting from its shoulders. It favours tridents and loves to skewer its\n"
"victims with painful barbs.\n"
msgstr ""
"常见的小恶魔的一个体形更大的近亲，咧着邪恶的笑容，肩上生有两个短小的翅膀。\n"
"它喜欢三叉戟，爱用令人痛苦的倒刺串起它的受害者。\n"

#. key: red draconian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:red draconian"
msgid ""
"A muscular red-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肌肉发达、长有红色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

#. key: hornet
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hornet"
msgid ""
"A buzzing hornet with a vicious stinger dripping with paralytic poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只嗡嗡作响的大黄蜂身上有一根毒刺，上面滴着麻痹性毒液。\n"

#. key: redback
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:redback"
msgid ""
"A vicious black spider with a splash of red on its swollen abdomen. Its\n"
"mandibles drip with lethal poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只凶狠的黑色蜘蛛，它肿胀的腹部上有一大块红斑。\n"
"致命毒液正从它的虫颚上滴落下来。\n"

#. key: revenant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:revenant"
msgid ""
"The skeletal remains of someone who died unmourned and forgotten. It burns with\n"
"an unquenchable hunger to be remembered.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个缠绕着幽冷蓝色火焰的骷髅，跨在今生和来世之间。\n"
"弥留的亡者的回响在鬼火中摇曳着。\n"

#. key: ribbon worm
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ribbon worm"
msgid ""
"A giant annelid, glistening with slime, with unusually large teeth. It expels\n"
"fragments of its own innards to ensnare unsuspecting prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条巨大的环节动物，身上的黏液闪烁着，牙齿大得出奇。\n"
"它排出自己内脏的碎片来诱捕毫无戒心的猎物。\n"

#. key: rime drake
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rime drake"
msgid ""
"A small but dangerous dragon. Its breath is visible even on the warmest days.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个小而危险的龙。即使在最炎热的天气里，也能看到它的吐息。\n"

#. key: river rat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:river rat"
msgid ""
"A rodent with hair of a most peculiar green colour, and a powerful bite. It\n"
"tends to form great swarms with its kin.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个长有奇异绿毛的啮齿动物，咬合力很强。它往往和它的同类成群生活。\n"

#. key: rockslime
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rockslime"
msgid ""
"An oozing avalanche, scouring the ground beneath it as it rumbles forward.\n"
"It consumes only the metal and bone from its victims, using them to reinforce\n"
"itself even further.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个涌出的山崩，它隆隆前进时冲刷着下方的地面。\n"
"它只吞食受害者的金属和骨头，用它们来进一步增强自身。\n"

#. key: royal jelly
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:royal jelly"
msgid ""
"A particularly rich and golden gelatinous thing. Smaller jellies swim and pulse\n"
"just below its surface, ready to burst forth at the slightest touch.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个特别浓郁的金色凝胶状物质。\n"
"更小的胶冻在它的表面下游泳、搏动，只要稍加触碰就会爆发。\n"

#. key: royal mummy
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:royal mummy"
msgid ""
"An ancient pharaoh, embalmed and cursed to undeath, now capable of great and\n"
"terrifying feats of magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位古代法老，被防腐并诅咒为不死之人，现在能够完成伟大而可怕的魔法技艺。\n"

#. key: rust devil
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rust devil"
msgid ""
"A hideous humanoid figure with rust-spotted metal skin, spreading corrosion\n"
"and decay to all it touches.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个丑陋的人形人物，有着锈迹斑斑的金属皮肤，\n"
"要把腐蚀和腐烂蔓延到所有接触到的地方。\n"

#. key: salamander
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:salamander"
msgid ""
"A red, flaming half-human half-snake creature with a legendary affinity for\n"
"fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个红色的、燃烧的半人半蛇的生物，传说和火的关系很密切。\n"

#. key: salamander mystic
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:salamander mystic"
msgid ""
"A member of the salamander's scholarly caste, possessed of lesser size and\n"
"strength, but wise in the ways of magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"火蜥蜴学者阶级中的一员，虽然体形和力量都比较小，但精通魔法。\n"

#. key: salamander tyrant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:salamander tyrant"
msgid ""
"An intimidating volcano lord. It commands the magma of its realm as an\n"
"extension of its body, and the majesty of its gaze can weaken even the proudest\n"
"challenger.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个令人生畏的火山领主。他能控制自己领域内的岩浆，仿佛是身体的延伸。\n"
"再骄傲的挑战者也会因他那威严的目光而畏缩。\n"

#. key: saltling
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:saltling"
msgid ""
"A small, human-shaped agglomeration of salt. It was created by the last\n"
"fugitive loyalists of the fallen eastern empire, forced in desperation to\n"
"construct golems from local resources to defend themselves.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个小型的人形盐块。它是由最后一批忠于没落的东方帝国的逃亡者创建的，\n"
"他们在绝望中被迫用当地资源建造魔像来保护自己。\n"

#. key: satyr
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:satyr"
msgid ""
"A more intelligent relative of the faun, often found in their company, and far\n"
"more unforgiving of — and dangerous to — interlopers.\n"
msgstr ""
"法翁羊人的一个更聪明的近亲，经常成群行动，对入侵者来说更为无情，也更危险。\n"

#. key: scorpion
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scorpion"
msgid ""
"A loathsome arachnid, armed to the teeth. Its body is covered in a thick\n"
"carapace, its tail is tipped by a venomous sting, and its forelimbs are\n"
"equipped with a pair of sharp grasping claws.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只讨厌的蛛形纲动物，武装到了牙齿。\n"
"它的躯体上覆着一层厚厚的甲壳，尾巴末端有一根毒刺，前肢上还长有一对利爪。\n"

#. key: sea snake
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sea snake"
msgid ""
"A brightly coloured snake, very comfortable in the water. It has a highly\n"
"potent venomous bite.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条颜色鲜艳的蛇，水性很好。它的咬伤有很强的毒性。\n"

#. key: searing wretch
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:searing wretch"
msgid ""
"An animated corpse alight with terrible fire. The flames are fueled by its\n"
"regenerating flesh, which bubbles and melts as it grows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具会动的尸体，燃烧着可怕的火焰。\n"
"火焰由其再生的肉提供燃料，肉在火焰生成时会起泡并融化。\n"

#. key: seraph
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:seraph"
msgid ""
"A six-winged servant of the good gods, of the highest rank of the angelic\n"
"hosts. Its eyes burn with divine fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个善神的仆人，生有六翼，是最高级别的天使。他的眼睛燃烧着圣焰。\n"

#. key: servant of whispers
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:servant of whispers"
msgid ""
"A member of an order of monks who abandoned their former faith. It now serves\n"
"a minor god of wind and whispers, who allows it to calm the air and, when\n"
"in great need, to break the stillness with divine thunder.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个放弃原先信仰的僧侣。\n"
"现在他侍奉掌管风和低语的低阶的神，这使得他能让空气平静下来，\n"
"或是非常需要的时候，用神圣的雷声打破寂静。\n"

#. key: shadowghast
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shadowghast"
msgid ""
"A skulking apparition that disguises itself as a harmless shadow. Attuned to the\n"
"dim light of the dungeon, it can slip in and out of sight at will, moving\n"
"swiftly from one pool of shade to the next before striking unerringly at the\n"
"blind spots of those who cannot see it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一缕无生命的影，在地牢的黑暗中滑入滑出。\n"
"它迅速而无声地从一潭阴影移动到另一潭阴影，从盲点准确地向人袭来。\n"

#. key: shadow demon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shadow demon"
msgid ""
"A mysterious demonic figure, difficult to distinguish from the darkness around\n"
"it. It weaves the shadows into powerful minions.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个神秘的魔鬼，很难把它从周围的黑暗中分辨出来。它把阴影编成强大的仆从。\n"

#. key: shadow dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shadow dragon"
msgid ""
"A great umbral dragon, radiating evil and death. Its breath reeks of the grave.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条巨大的暗影龙，散发着邪恶和死亡。它的吐息弥漫着坟墓的气味。\n"

#. key: shadow imp
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shadow imp"
msgid ""
"A shadowy minor demon, with an affinity for the necromantic arts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个影状的低阶恶魔，对巫术有浓厚兴趣。\n"

#. key: shadow wraith
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shadow wraith"
msgid ""
"A mist-wreathed skeletal shadow, hanging in mid-air. It drains away the\n"
"life force of living beings.\n"
msgstr ""
"烟雾缭绕的骸骨之影，在半空中游荡。它以活物的生命力为食。\n"

#. key: shambling mangrove
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shambling mangrove"
msgid ""
"A gnarled mangrove, possessed of sapience and a cantankerous disposition. Its\n"
"roots run deep through the water and soil of its marshy home and can make\n"
"footing very difficult for those who provoke its ire. Marsh fauna are often\n"
"found nesting within its branches, and may not take kindly to being disturbed.\n"
msgstr ""
"一片长有节瘤的红树林，智慧而性情乖戾。\n"
"它的根深深扎入水和它的沼泽家园中，这使得激怒它的人很难站稳脚根。\n"
"沼泽动物常在它的枝上筑巢，他们被打扰了可不是善茬。\n"

#. key: shapeshifter
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shapeshifter"
msgid ""
"A disturbing creature with the power to change its form. It is very rarely\n"
"observed alive in its natural state.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个诡异的怪物拥有变换自己形态的能力。它原本形态的存在很少被观察到。\n"

#. key: shard shrike
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shard shrike"
msgid ""
"An incredibly fast-moving bird, known for impaling its prey on shards of ice\n"
"before tearing them to pieces. It has acclimated to the desolate wastes of\n"
"Cocytus, and is enveloped with an accursed chill.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个移动速度极快的⻦，因为会在撕碎猎物前用冰碎片将其刺穿而闻名。\n"
"它已适应悲叹河那荒凉的废墟，被严酷的寒意裹挟着。\n"

#. key: shining eye
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shining eye"
msgid ""
"A strangely deformed floating eyeball, pulsating with flesh-twisting energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个诡异变形了的浮眼，悸动着扭曲血肉的能量。\n"

#. key: shock serpent
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shock serpent"
msgid ""
"A sinuous serpent whose body crackles with volatile electricity. Its electric\n"
"shroud can discharge when struck, inflicting a painful shock on any nearby\n"
"foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条蜿蜒的巨蛇，身上不稳定的电流噼啪作响。\n"
"它的电罩被攻击时会放电，对附近的敌人造成痛苦的电击。\n"

#. key: silent spectre
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:silent spectre"
msgid ""
"A terrible spirit which brings an unearthly silence to the area around it,\n"
"making it impossible to recite the magical incantations involved with casting\n"
"spells or reading scrolls.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个可怕的幽魂给周围区域带来超乎寻常的寂静，\n"
"身处结界中的时候无法吟诵魔法咒语，也就不能施放魔法或是阅读卷轴。\n"

#. key: simulacrum
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:simulacrum"
msgid ""
"An icy replica of a monster, animated by heretical magics.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个怪物的冰制复制品，由异端魔法所激活。\n"

#. key: sixfirhy
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sixfirhy"
msgid ""
"A small vile creature that moves in bursts, stopping then darting with\n"
"lightning speed. It sprays sparks as it goes.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个邪恶的小东西会突然停下，然后又以闪电般的速度突进。它边走边迸出电火花。\n"

#. key: skeletal warrior
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:skeletal warrior"
msgid ""
"A vicious and heavily armed humanoid skeleton, animated by unholy power.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具被不洁之力复活的人形骷髅，性情凶暴，装备精良。\n"

#. key: skeleton
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:skeleton"
msgid ""
"A skeleton compelled to unlife by the exercise of necromancy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具被死灵法术复活的骷髅。\n"

#. key: sky beast
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sky beast"
msgid ""
"A strange aerial creature formed of fleshy clouds and electric feathers. It\n"
"commands the faint wind currents of the Dungeon with every strike, which will\n"
"buffet its victims in dramatic correlation to the amount of open air around\n"
"said prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的飞行生物由云层和扭曲的血肉构成，它时不时爆出电火花，\n"
"偶尔还会从视野中完全消失。\n"

#. key: skyshark
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:skyshark"
msgid ""
"Skysharks cut through the air with a thoughtless ease. Just a taste of blood\n"
"gives them an enraged strength, and further morsels drive them into a frenzy.\n"
msgstr ""
"天鲨自在地划过天空。\n"
"哪怕只有一丝血也能激起它们愤怒的力量，要是有更多的鲜血会使其陷入疯狂。\n"

#. key: sleepcap
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sleepcap"
msgid ""
"A surprisingly ambulatory mushroom. It wafts its spores over prey to send them\n"
"into a deep sleep, making it simple for the fungus to kill and devour them.\n"
"It can take months for its mycelia to fully infiltrate and digest victims.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个令人惊奇的会走动的蘑菇。它能将孢子飘散到猎物身上，\n"
"使猎物进入深度睡眠，这样真菌就能轻易杀死并吞噬它们。\n"
"菌丝可能需要数月时间才能完全侵入并消化受害者。\n"

#. key: slime creature
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slime creature"
msgid ""
"An icky glob of slime that slithers along the ground. It can merge with other\n"
"slime creatures to become dramatically more dangerous, and is especially likely\n"
"to do so in confined spaces.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团黏稠的软泥在地上蠕动着。\n"
"它可以与其他黏液生物融合，会变得更加危险，尤其是在密闭空间中。\n"

#. key: small abomination
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:small abomination"
msgid ""
"A hideous mass of body parts. Each varies in speed, strength, or resilience by\n"
"the nature of whatever unfortunates were used to make it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团可怕的肢体。每一块的耐用性都会因所取用的不幸者的体质而有所不同。\n"

#. key: smoke demon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:smoke demon"
msgid ""
"An infernal demon that manifests itself as a writhing cloud of smoke. Having\n"
"considerable pyrokinetic powers, it can very effectively attack its enemies\n"
"from afar.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个地狱恶魔化身为一团翻腾的烟雾。\n"
"它拥有强大的火焰异能，可以在远处给予它的敌人巨大打击。\n"

#. key: snaplasher vine
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:snaplasher vine"
msgid ""
"A swift and sinuous vine brought alive by a dryad's magic. It can quickly bind\n"
"and entangle the dryad's foes, dragging them back to the forest from which it\n"
"surges.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个迅捷而蜿蜒的藤蔓，被树妖用魔法赋予生命。\n"
"它能快速将树妖的敌人束缚、缠绕住，将他们拖回它所涌现的森林。\n"

#. key: snaplasher vine segment
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:snaplasher vine segment"
msgid ""
"Part of a swift and sinuous vine brought alive by a dryad's magic. It can\n"
"quickly bind and entangle the dryad's foes, dragging them back to the forest\n"
"from which it surges.\n"
msgstr ""
"一节迅捷而蜿蜒的藤蔓，被树妖用魔法赋予生命。\n"
"它能快速将树妖的敌人束缚、缠绕住，将他们拖回它所涌现的森林。\n"

#. key: snapping turtle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:snapping turtle"
msgid ""
"A belligerent testudine with an armoured carapace. Its neck is surprisingly\n"
"extensible and can reach out and bite from afar.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只长着坚硬甲壳的凶猛乌龟。它的脖子有惊人的延展性，可以从远处伸过来咬。\n"

#. key: soul eater
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:soul eater"
msgid ""
"A demon that manifests as a malignantly shifting shadow gliding through the\n"
"air. It radiates an intense aura of negative force.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个恶魔看起来就像是一团恶意翻腾的阴影，在空气中滑过。\n"
"它散发着强烈的负能量力场。\n"

#. key: spark wasp
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spark wasp"
msgid ""
"A profoundly unnatural insect covered in vaguely metallic plates. Its stinger\n"
"crackles with electricity, capable of delivering a powerful shock to unwary\n"
"victims, and is capable of closing the distance with them at shockingly\n"
"lethal speed.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个完全非自然的昆虫，身上像是覆盖着金属板。它的毒刺噼啪带着电，\n"
"能给那些不小心的受害者强大的电击，它也能以惊人的致命速度拉近与他们的距离。\n"

#. key: spatial maelstrom
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spatial maelstrom"
msgid ""
"A malevolent rift in reality, dissolving all terrain it passes by into swirling\n"
"vortices.\n"
msgstr ""
"现实空间中的一个狂暴的裂口，能把它经过的所有地形溶解成旋涡。\n"

#. key: spatial vortex
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spatial vortex"
msgid ""
"A crazily shifting twist in the fabric of reality.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个在现实空间中的螺旋，疯狂地移动、变化着。\n"

#. key: spectral thing
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spectral thing"
msgid ""
"A hideous glowing apparition.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个可怕的发着光的幽灵。\n"

#. key: spectral weapon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spectral weapon"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from a weapon — it never strikes on its own. Damage done to it\n"
"will be partially mirrored onto the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个从武器中汲取的灵魂——它永远不会自行攻击。\n"
"对它造成的损伤会部分反馈到施法者身上。\n"

#. key: spellspark servitor
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spellspark servitor"
msgid ""
"A magical construct forged around a spark of its creator's own arcane power,\n"
"allowing it to wield some of their destructive magics directly.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个魔法造物，铸入了塑能师的魔法，\n"
"并与外层位面召唤而来原始元素面的智慧相融合。\n"
"它那被锻造的魔法赋予它使用其创造者的一些破坏性法术的能力。\n"

#. key: spriggan
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spriggan"
msgid ""
"A small humanoid, resembling a human or elf except for the size. It moves at a\n"
"great speed, and loves playing dirty tricks on people.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个小型人形生物，除了体形小了点之外和人类或精灵没什么区别。\n"
"他能快速移动，喜欢对人们搞点恶作剧。\n"

#. key: spriggan air mage
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spriggan air mage"
msgid ""
"A magically adept spriggan blessed with the secrets of the winds.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个擅长魔法的树精，通晓风的奥秘。\n"

#. key: spriggan berserker
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spriggan berserker"
msgid ""
"A relatively mighty spriggan that plunges recklessly into combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个相对而言比较强壮的树精总是一马当先冲入战斗之中。\n"

#. key: spriggan defender
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spriggan defender"
msgid ""
"An elite, well-equipped spriggan warrior, renowned for its unbelievable agility\n"
"and its prowess with advanced weaponry.\n"
msgstr ""
"一名装备精良的树精战士，\n"
"他靠他精湛的武器技能和难以置信的灵巧赢得了同胞的尊敬。\n"

#. key: spriggan druid
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spriggan druid"
msgid ""
"A spriggan whose connection with the birds and the beasts is exceptionally\n"
"strong. If it dies, its sacrifice will heal and temporarily strengthen nearby\n"
"animals.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个树精和飞鸟、野兽有着特别密切的联系。\n"
"如果它死了，它的牺牲会治愈并暂时增强附近的动物。\n"

#. key: spriggan rider
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spriggan rider"
msgid ""
"A spriggan that has tamed a hornet as its mount, and is tasked with protecting\n"
"the spriggan fens and cairns from intruders.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个以驯服了的大黄蜂作为座骑的树精，\n"
"其使命是保护树精沼泽和石冢免受入侵者的袭击。\n"

#. key: starcursed mass
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:starcursed mass"
msgid ""
"A mass of stellar detritus that glows with the sickly putrescence of a dying\n"
"star, forever shrieking soundlessly in a voice beyond mortal grasp. Its form\n"
"undulates constantly, dividing spontaneously and then withdrawing when\n"
"threatened. When divided, its deafening chorus of screams can overwhelm the\n"
"minds of even the bravest warriors, leaving them stunned and helpless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团星星的碎片，散发着垂死星星的病态腐化的光芒，永远无声地尖叫着，\n"
"发出凡人无法理解的声音。其形态常常在波动，自发地分裂，受到威胁时又缩回去。\n"
"当分裂时，它那震耳欲聋的齐声尖叫能压垮哪怕最勇敢的战士的理智，\n"
"使他们感到震惊和无助。\n"

#. key: starflower
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:starflower"
msgid ""
"A mass of lashing vines and tentacles growing out of the husk of a dead star.\n"
"Space itself runs through the xylem and phloem of its branches, which appear to\n"
"be in many places at once.\n"
msgstr ""
"从死星的外壳中长出的一团藤蔓和触须。\n"
"空间贯通着它的分支的木质部和韧皮部，它们似乎同时存在于许多地方。\n"

#. key: starspawn tentacle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:starspawn tentacle"
msgid ""
"The writhing appendage of a tentacled starspawn, capable of grasping nearly any\n"
"prey and dragging it back to be devoured. Any damage dealt to it hurts the\n"
"whole creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"星之眷族扭动的附肢，几乎能捕获任何猎物，并把它们拖回去吞食。\n"
"对它造成的任何伤害都能伤及整体。\n"

#. key: starspawn tentacle segment
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:starspawn tentacle segment"
msgid ""
"A sinuous length of an extended starspawn tentacle. Any damage dealt to it\n"
"hurts the whole creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"一段弯曲的星之眷族延伸了的触手。对它造成的任何伤害都能伤及整体。\n"

#. key: statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:statue"
msgid ""
"A piece of sculpted granite with glowing red eyes. Although it is rooted to its\n"
"base, it can still move parts of itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"一块雕刻了的花岗岩，有着发光的红眼。\n"
"尽管它固定于底座，但身体的一部分仍能活动。\n"

#. key: steam dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:steam dragon"
msgid ""
"A relatively small grey dragon, with a resilient-looking scaly hide and steam\n"
"pouring from its mouth.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条相对较小的灰色龙，身上的鳞皮看起来很坚韧，口中不时喷出蒸汽。\n"

#. key: steelbarb worm
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:steelbarb worm"
msgid ""
"A large worm covered with hard, spiky metal plates. Despite the apparent\n"
"heaviness of its outer armour, it is rather fast.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条覆有硬而多刺的金属板的大蠕虫。尽管它的外甲看起来很重，但速度相当快。\n"

#. key: stoker
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stoker"
msgid ""
"A mortal who made an unholy pact in life, now chained to tend the fires of\n"
"hell in undeath as payment.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个凡人在生前订立了邪恶的契约，现在被束缚在亡灵身上照料地狱之火作为报酬。\n"

#. key: stone giant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stone giant"
msgid ""
"A gigantic humanoid with grey skin almost as hard as rock. It carries several\n"
"boulders, and is perfectly capable of flinging them a great distance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的人形生物，他的灰色表皮几乎和石头一样硬。\n"
"他携带着好几块巨石，而且完全有能力将巨石抛出很远。\n"

#. key: storm dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:storm dragon"
msgid ""
"A powerful dragon with a hide of thick matte scales almost like blue rubber,\n"
"and enormous scaly wings crackling with sparks.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条非常强大的龙，它身上厚厚的、粗糙的鳞甲简直像是蓝色橡胶，\n"
"巨大无比的鳞翼，上面不时迸出电火花。\n"

#. key: strange machine
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:strange machine"
msgid ""
"A strange mechanical contraption, all hisses and pops. Shadows seem to dance\n"
"across its reflective surface.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇怪的机械装置，发出嘶嘶和砰砰声。 阴影似乎在其反射面上跃动着。\n"

#. key: sun demon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sun demon"
msgid ""
"A demonic figure shining with the heat and fury of a fallen star.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个恶魔，身体散发着陨星的炽热和愤怒。\n"

#. key: sun moth
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sun moth"
msgid ""
"A moth of transcendent beauty, coated in pyrophoric scales. Tiny cinders dance\n"
"and twirl in its wake and whenever it beats its wings, they ignite in such\n"
"spectacular displays of incandescence that one could almost forget how far away\n"
"the sun is from this place.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只美丽绝伦的飞蛾，身上覆盖着发光鳞片。\n"
"微小的余烬在它的尾迹上飞舞盘旋，每当它扇动翅膀，\n"
"余烬就会燃烧出炽热的壮观景象，以至于人们几乎会忘记太阳离这里有多远。\n"

#. key: swamp dragon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:swamp dragon"
msgid ""
"A slimy dragon, its gnarly hide covered in swamp muck. Noxious gases dribble\n"
"from its snout.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条大型龙的身上满是黏液，它粗糙的表皮包裹在沼泽的污泥之中。\n"
"它的鼻孔不时喷出毒气。\n"

#. key: swamp drake
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:swamp drake"
msgid ""
"A small and slimy dragon, covered in swamp muck and giving off a terrible\n"
"stench.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条小龙浑身上下都是黏液和污泥，散发着可怕的恶臭。\n"

#. key: swamp worm
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:swamp worm"
msgid ""
"A large slimy worm, adept at traversing swamps and marshes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条满身黏液的蠕虫，擅长在沼泽的污泥中穿行。\n"

#. key: tarantella
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tarantella"
msgid ""
"A small but greatly-feared spider. Its touch alone causes victims to break into\n"
"a frenzied dance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个体形小但很令人恐惧的蜘蛛。它的叮咬会让受害者陷入狂舞。\n"

#. key: tainted leviathan
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tainted leviathan"
msgid ""
"Before even the oldest of ancient liches mastered life and death, a group of\n"
"titans attempted to pull themselves free of mortality through brute strength.\n"
"They almost succeeded before rot dragged them to Ereshkigal. A glimmer of their\n"
"former beauty remains, alluring despite the stench.\n"
msgstr ""
"在最早的远古巫妖掌握生死之前，就曾有一群泰坦试图通过蛮力摆脱死亡。\n"
"在腐烂将他们拖到埃列什基伽勒那里之前，他们几乎要成功了。\n"
"尽管留有恶臭，但仍保留着他们昔日美丽的微光。\n"

#. key: tengu
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tengu"
msgid ""
"A humanoid figure with the head and talons of a bird. Its ferociously combative\n"
"nature belies its fragile appearance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个人形生物，却长着鸟的头和爪子。他看似脆弱，其实十分好战。\n"

#. key: tengu conjurer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tengu conjurer"
msgid ""
"A tengu with a talent for the destructive magical arts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个擅长破坏性魔法的天狗。\n"

#. key: tengu reaver
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tengu reaver"
msgid ""
"An elite, ferocious tengu highly skilled with both steel and spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个凶恶的天狗精英，擅长兵器和法术。\n"

#. key: tengu warrior
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tengu warrior"
msgid ""
"A particularly bloodthirsty tengu who has opted to hone its skill in airborne\n"
"fighting and weaponry instead of spellcasting.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个极其嗜血的天狗，他选择磨炼自己的空中格斗和武器技能，而非施法。\n"

#. key: tentacle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tentacle"
msgid ""
"The mighty tentacle of a kraken. Any damage dealt to it hurts the whole\n"
"creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条健壮的触手是某个海怪的身体的一部分。对它造成的任何伤害都能伤及整体。\n"

#. key: tentacle segment
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tentacle segment"
msgid ""
"A part of the mighty tentacle of a kraken. Any damage dealt to it hurts the\n"
"whole creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"某个海怪的健壮的触手的一部分。对它造成的任何伤害都能伤及整体。\n"

#. key: tentacled monstrosity
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tentacled monstrosity"
msgid ""
"A writhing mass of tentacles, all covered in putrid mucus.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团翻腾蠕动的触手，上面粘满了腐臭的黏液。\n"

#. key: tentacled starspawn
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tentacled starspawn"
msgid ""
"A lumbering maw shrouded in a mass of sinuous tentacles. On spotting prey, its\n"
"tentacles lunge outward, dragging victims directly to its waiting gullet.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个迟缓的胃被大量弯曲的触手包裹着。\n"
"一旦发现猎物，它的触手就会向外冲去，把受害者直接拖入等待着的食管之中。\n"

#. key: thrashing horror
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:thrashing horror"
msgid ""
"A seething mass of yellow flesh. It thrashes erratically, staggering foes\n"
"beneath the weight of its impacts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团翻滚的黄色肉团。它不规律地扭动着，在其冲撞的力量下，敌人摇摇晃晃。\n"

#. key: titan
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:titan"
msgid ""
"A huge, bolt-hurling, lightning-limned humanoid. It is unusually large and\n"
"powerful, even among giants.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的人形生物，能投掷闪电束，身形被闪电所勾勒。\n"
"即使在巨人之中，他也是最大、最强的。\n"

#. key: thorn hunter
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:thorn hunter"
msgid ""
"A predatory marsh plant, possessed of motility and a rudimentary intelligence.\n"
"It ensnares its prey with protrusions of spiny brambles and then skewers the\n"
"trapped creatures with its razor-sharp thorns.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种食肉的沼泽植物，有行动力和一定智力。\n"
"它会伸出荆棘捕捉猎物，然后用锋利的刺刺穿被困的生物。\n"

#. key: toadstool
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:toadstool"
msgid ""
"A short-lived species of fungus typically found on or around decaying organic\n"
"matter.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个短命的真菌通常只在腐烂的有机物附近出现。\n"

#. key: toenail golem
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:toenail golem"
msgid ""
"A huge animated statue made entirely from toenail clippings. Some people just\n"
"have too much time on their hands.\n"
msgstr ""
"这尊巨大的会动的雕像完全由剪下的脚趾甲制成。某些人真是闲得没事做啊。\n"

#. key: tormentor
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tormentor"
msgid ""
"A malign devil covered in all manner of claws, spines, and cruel hooks. It is\n"
"able to inflict torturous agony on those foolish enough to gaze upon it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个凶悍的恶魔身上全是爪子、骨刺、倒钩之类的东西。\n"
"它能让蠢到敢于直视它的人体验极端的痛苦。\n"

#. key: torpor snail
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:torpor snail"
msgid ""
"A ponderous gastropod with a rock-hard shell. It is said to be in some way\n"
"connected with the god Cheibriados; its very presence slows the movements of\n"
"unwary adventurers, leaving them easy prey for its terrifying, ever-gnashing\n"
"radulae.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个缓慢的腹足类动物，有着石头般坚硬的外壳。\n"
"据说与它切布理亚多神有一定联系。\n"
"它能放慢那些鲁莽的冒险者的移动，然后将其作为它那骇人、不断磨着的牙齿中猎物。\n"

#. key: training dummy
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:training dummy"
msgid ""
"A mannequin used for battle practice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个用于战斗训练的人偶。\n"

#. key: troll
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:troll"
msgid ""
"A huge and physically powerful humanoid creature. Short on intelligence but\n"
"long on brawn, its thick knobbly hide heals rapidly from most wounds.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个体形巨大、身体强壮的人形生物。\n"
"他头脑简单，但肌肉发达，而且他那结节状的厚皮能迅速愈合大多数伤口。\n"

#. key: twister
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:twister"
msgid ""
"A whirling vortex of frost.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个冰霜旋涡。\n"

#. key: two-headed ogre
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:two-headed ogre"
msgid ""
"A huge ogre with two heads on top of its bloated body. It is capable of holding\n"
"a weapon in each giant hand.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肥胖的食人魔，顶上长着两个脑袋。他的两只巨手能各持一件武器。\n"

#. key: tyrant leech
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tyrant leech"
msgid ""
"An exceptionally aggressive blood-sucking annelid that thrives in swamps and\n"
"marshlands.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个极具攻击性的吸血的环节动物，它们在沼泽和湿地中兴旺地繁衍。\n"

#. key: tzitzimitl
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tzitzimitl"
msgid ""
"A horrific fallen divinity, possessing jaws of gnashing stone and a necklace of\n"
"starry organs. It spreads disease and despair, and patiently awaits the end of\n"
"days when it will devour the sun.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个令人畏惧的堕落神灵，有着由咬合的石块形成的颌和由星体构成的项链。\n"
"它散布着疾病和绝望，耐心等待着末日降临，那时它会吞噬太阳。\n"

#. key: ufetubus
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ufetubus"
msgid ""
"A chattering and shrieking minor demon. They delight in sneaking past and\n"
"backstabbing their prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个低阶恶魔总爱发出啁啾声和尖啸声。他们喜欢溜过猎物，然后对其发动背刺。\n"

#. key: ugly thing
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ugly thing"
msgid ""
"An ugly thing. According to legend, it is the otherworldly spawn of a wizard's\n"
"breeding experiment. Yuck.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个丑陋的东西。传说，这种恐怖的变异生物是某个巫师的杂交实验的超自然产物。\n"
"呕。\n"

#. key: unseen horror
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:unseen horror"
msgid ""
"A creature rarely seen by anyone; those few who have seen one would rather they\n"
"hadn't. It moves erratically.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物很少被看到，那些看到过的少数人宁愿自己没看到过。它的运动没有规律。\n"

#. key: ushabti
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ushabti"
msgid ""
"A funerary stone figurine kept in tombs to serve the deceased as they pass\n"
"through the afterlife. It is inscribed with spells to protect the interred for\n"
"eternity.\n"
msgstr ""
"陪葬用的石头小雕像，放入坟墓中可以供死者通往来世。\n"
"上面刻有咒语，来保持被埋葬者的不朽。\n"

#. key: vampire
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vampire"
msgid ""
"A human cursed with vampirism, drifting in a state between life and undeath,\n"
"perpetually hungry for the blood of the living.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个受到吸血鬼化诅咒的人类，游走在生与死之间，永远渴望着生者的鲜血。\n"

#. key: vampire bat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vampire bat"
msgid ""
"A large black bat with vicious fangs that feeds on blood. It is the preferred\n"
"form for vampires in disguise.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只大型黑蝙蝠，长着獠牙，以血为食。吸血鬼喜欢伪装成这个形态。\n"

#. key: vampire knight
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vampire knight"
msgid ""
"A powerful vampire noble who complements its combat prowess with dark magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强大的吸血鬼贵族，用黑魔法完善他的战斗技能。\n"

#. key: vampire mage
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vampire mage"
msgid ""
"A sorcerer who, by accident or design, has been afflicted with the curse of the\n"
"vampire. Regardless, through undeath, it has finally mastered the art of dark\n"
"magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"不管是自愿的还是被迫的，这名术士是受到了吸血的诅咒。\n"
"但不管怎么说，在不死之力的帮助下，这名法师终于完全掌握了黑暗魔法的奥秘。\n"

#. key: vampire mosquito
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vampire mosquito"
msgid ""
"A mosquito that has fed upon tainted blood and been transformed into a\n"
"revolting and pestilent undead insect, seeking to drain its victims to the last\n"
"drop.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只蚊子以受污染的血液为食，变成了一只令人作呕、散播疾病的亡灵昆虫。\n"
"它的目的是将它的猎物吸干——一滴不留。\n"

#. key: vault guard
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vault guard"
msgid ""
"A heavily armed and armoured guardian of the Vaults.\n"
msgstr ""
"宝库的卫兵之一，武器、盔甲装备精良。\n"

#. key: vault sentinel
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vault sentinel"
msgid ""
"A vigilant scout, quick to alert its fellows to the presence of intruders. It\n"
"marks such intruders with powerful magic, making them unable to hide from\n"
"pursuit no matter where they flee.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个警惕的侦察员，能迅速提醒同伴出现了入侵者。\n"
"他会用强大的魔法标记入侵者，使他们无法躲到哪里都无法摆脱追捕。\n"

#. key: vault warden
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vault warden"
msgid ""
"A veteran commander, able to seal nearby doorways and staircases to prevent\n"
"intruders from either trespassing further or escaping alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"一名经验丰富的指挥官，能封锁附近的门廊和楼梯，\n"
"以免入侵者继续侵入或逃之夭夭。\n"

#. key: very ugly thing
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:very ugly thing"
msgid ""
"A very ugly thing. According to legend, it is the otherworldly spawn of a\n"
"wizard's breeding experiment. Double yuck!\n"
msgstr ""
"一个极其丑陋的东西。\n"
"传说，这种恐怖的变异生物是某个巫师的杂交实验的超自然产物。呕，呕！\n"

#. key: vine stalker
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vine stalker"
msgid ""
"A bizarre symbiotic creature, made up of a carnivorous vine magically combined\n"
"with a humanoid.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇异的共生生物，由食肉藤蔓与人形生物神奇地结合而成。\n"

#. key: void ooze
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:void ooze"
msgid ""
"The viscous detritus of a thousand failed spells, surging forward with unnerving\n"
"speed. Its very substance is a hole in the fabric of magic; enchantments find no\n"
"purchase there and even momentary contact with it can leave one's spells greatly\n"
"diminished.\n"
msgstr ""
"一层薄薄的反光黏液，覆盖了一大片区域，能够以惊人的速度向前冲去。\n"
"妖术会像水一样从它身上滑落。\n"

#. key: walking earthen tome
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:walking earthen tome"
msgid ""
"A spellbook that has gone too long without being read. It overflows with magic,\n"
"forming thick armour from its binding, legs from its pages, and periodically\n"
"erupting in flurries of free-floating, self-casting spells.\n"
"\n"
"It is coated with impossibly ancient dust.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很久没有读过的魔法书。它充满魔力，它的封皮形成了厚厚的盔甲，\n"
"书页长出了腿，并周期性地爆出自由飘浮的自行施放的法术。\n"
"\n"
"它被一层不可思议的古老灰尘覆盖着。\n"

#. key: walking crystal tome
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:walking crystal tome"
msgid ""
"A spellbook that has gone too long without being read. It overflows with magic,\n"
"forming thick armour from its binding, legs from its pages, and periodically\n"
"erupting in flurries of free-floating, self-casting spells.\n"
"\n"
"It is encrusted with long, sharp, deadly-looking crystals.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很久没有读过的魔法书。它充满魔力，它的封皮形成了厚厚的盔甲，\n"
"书页长出了腿，并周期性地爆出自由飘浮的自行施放的法术。\n"
"\n"
"它镶嵌着长而锋利的致命水晶。\n"

#. key: walking divine tome
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:walking divine tome"
msgid ""
"A spellbook that has gone too long without being read. It overflows with magic,\n"
"forming thick armour from its binding, legs from its pages, and periodically\n"
"erupting in flurries of free-floating, self-casting spells.\n"
"\n"
"Its cover bears the icon of a long-forgotten god, still fully possessed of wrath.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很久没有读过的魔法书。它充满魔力，它的封皮形成了厚厚的盔甲，\n"
"书页长出了腿，并周期性地爆出自由飘浮的自行施放的法术。\n"
"\n"
"它的封面上有一个被遗忘已久的神像，仍然充满着愤怒。\n"

#. key: walking frostbound tome
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:walking frostbound tome"
msgid ""
"A spellbook that has gone too long without being read. It overflows with magic,\n"
"forming thick armour from its binding, legs from its pages, and periodically\n"
"erupting in flurries of free-floating, self-casting spells.\n"
"\n"
"It glistens with a thick layer of unmelting ice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很久没有读过的魔法书。它充满魔力，它的封皮形成了厚厚的盔甲，\n"
"书页长出了腿，并周期性地爆出自由飘浮的自行施放的法术。\n"
"\n"
"它那层未融化的坚冰在闪烁着。\n"

#. key: walking tome
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:walking tome"
msgid ""
"A spellbook that has gone too long without being read. It overflows with magic,\n"
"forming thick armour from its binding, legs from its pages, and periodically\n"
"erupting in flurries of free-floating, self-casting spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很久没有读过的魔法书。它充满魔力，它的封皮形成了厚厚的盔甲，\n"
"书页长出了腿，并周期性地爆出自由飘浮的自行施放的法术。\n"

#. key: wandering mushroom
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wandering mushroom"
msgid ""
"A large, fleshy mushroom that wanders slowly around the dungeon. It is both\n"
"innately curious and incredibly shy, pursuing the objects of its curiosity only\n"
"when out of sight. Noxious spores drift around its cap.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个在地牢中慢慢游走的大型肉质蘑菇。它有与生俱来的好奇心，而且又非常害羞，\n"
"只有在没有人看着的时候才会去追寻引起它好奇心的东西。\n"
"它的菌帽旁有毒性孢子在飘动。\n"

#. key: warg
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:warg"
msgid ""
"A particularly evil-looking wolf, usually found in the company of orcs.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条体形巨大、面目狰狞的狼，通常和兽人一起出现。\n"

#. key: war gargoyle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:war gargoyle"
msgid ""
"A rare type of gargoyle, constructed from a solid steel statue and imbued with\n"
"vicious strength, speed, and weaponised breath.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个罕见的石像鬼，由坚固的钢铁雕像幻化而成，\n"
"浸入了邪恶的力量、速度和能造成伤害的吐息。\n"

#. key: water elemental
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:water elemental"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from the elemental plane of water. It exists on this world as\n"
"part of a body of water and can engulf other beings in its form, depriving them\n"
"of breath and voice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自水元素位面的灵体。它作为水体的一部分存在于这个世界上，\n"
"在这个形态下可以吞没其他生物，让他们无法呼吸、发出声音。\n"

#. key: water moccasin
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:water moccasin"
msgid ""
"A largish venomous brown snake. It usually lives near water, and is an able\n"
"swimmer.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条体形较大的棕色毒蛇。它通常生活在水边，擅长游泳。\n"

#. key: water nymph
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:water nymph"
msgid ""
"A capricious nature spirit, deeply bonded with the waters in which it lives.\n"
"Wherever they flow, so may it, and ponds and rivers surge and leap at its\n"
"whim.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个反复无常自然之灵，与她所栖息的水域紧密相连。\n"
"它们流到哪里，她就会到哪里，池塘和河流也会因为她的兴起而汹涌澎湃。\n"

#. key: weeping skull
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:weeping skull"
msgid ""
"An undead skull kept aloft by unholy clouds of collective misery, which slowly\n"
"drift out in its wake. It mourns without end for the living, the dead, and its\n"
"own former life all alike.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被聚集的邪恶愁云托起的亡灵头骨，云层在它的身后慢慢飘出。\n"
"它为生者、死者和它自己的前世无休止地哀悼着。\n"

#. key: wendigo
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wendigo"
msgid ""
"A gaunt spirit of frozen hunger, so ravenous it will consume friend and foe\n"
"alike. According to legend, if one cuts off its legs, it will feast upon its own\n"
"marrow. It stalks those lost wandering in the cold and hunts with the force of\n"
"blizzards.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个冰冷饥饿、枯槁的灵魂，如此贪婪，以至于无论敌人还是朋友，它都要吞噬。\n"
"传说，如果砍掉它的腿，它甚至会朵颐自己的骨髓。\n"
"在寒冷的地方它会跟踪那些徘徊着的迷路的人，并会用暴风雪的力量进行猎杀。\n"

#. key: white draconian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:white draconian"
msgid ""
"A muscular white-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肌肉发达、长有白色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

#. key: white imp
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:white imp"
msgid ""
"A small and mischievous minor demon covered in frost.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个小而调皮的低阶恶魔，浑身都是冰霜。\n"

#. key: wight
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wight"
msgid ""
"An ancient warrior, kept in a state of perpetual undeath by its desire to die\n"
"with honour in battle.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位古代战士，怀着在战斗中光荣地死去的执念而永远保持着不死状态。\n"

#. key: will-o-the-wisp
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:will-o-the-wisp"
msgid ""
"A green-glowing gaseous entity, flickering and pulsing irregularly as it hovers\n"
"through the air. Travelers have been known to confuse these for distant lanterns -\n"
"a mistake rarely made twice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个绿色发光的气态实体，悬在空中，时时不规则地闪烁、悸动。\n"
"众所周知，旅行者会将这些与远方的灯笼相混淆——这种错误很少有机会犯两次。\n"

#. key: wind drake
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wind drake"
msgid ""
"A small but powerful dragon, particularly adept amongst its kin at manipulating\n"
"the currents of air that surround it. It can exhale powerful blasts of wind.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条小而强大的龙，在它的同类中它尤为善于操控周围的气流。它能呼出强烈的风。\n"

#. key: wolf
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wolf"
msgid ""
"A strong wild canine, with sharp teeth and a healthy appetite.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条强壮的犬科动物，拥有尖利的牙齿和旺盛的食欲。\n"

#. key: wolf spider
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wolf spider"
msgid ""
"A hairy fast-moving hunting spider with vicious mandibles, the size of a wolf.\n"
"It roams the dungeon in search of prey, which it kills with its deadly venom.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个多毛的、行动快速的猎蛛，有凶恶的下颚，体形像狼那么大。\n"
"它在地牢中漫游以寻找猎物，并用致命的毒液将其杀死。\n"

#. key: worldbinder
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:worldbinder"
msgid ""
"A cloud of thick fog, with faint, feeble claws constantly reaching out and then\n"
"fading back into the fog. When threatened, it calls forth creatures banished to\n"
"the void between realities, using them to defend itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团浓雾，虚弱无力的爪子不停地伸出来，然后又消退在雾中。\n"
"当受到威胁时，它会召唤被放逐到现实和虚空之间的生物，利用它们来保护自己。\n"

#. key: wraith
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wraith"
msgid ""
"A cloud of black mist surrounding an insubstantial skeletal form. Its eyes burn\n"
"bright with unholy malevolence and hunger for life essence, on which it feeds.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团黑色的薄雾裹挟着一具虚无的骷髅。\n"
"它的眼中闪烁着不洁的恶意，以及对吞食生命精华的渴望。\n"

#. key: wretched star
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wretched star"
msgid ""
"A conflux of unearthly light and energy, awash in unnatural colours and strange\n"
"forms no normal being was meant to perceive. It fills all those in its presence\n"
"with the disorder of the Abyss.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个诡异的光线和能量的聚合物，充斥着不自然的色彩和奇怪的形态，\n"
"非正常人所能理解。他会让所有在它面前的人充满深渊的混乱。\n"

#. key: wyvern
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wyvern"
msgid ""
"A dragon-like creature with a long, sharply pointed tail. Although smaller and\n"
"less formidable than true dragons, it is nonetheless a foe to be reckoned with.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条类龙生物长有一条长长的尖尾巴。虽然双足飞龙体形比真龙小，\n"
"而且也没有真龙那么可怕，但它仍然是一个不容小觑的敌人。\n"

#. key: yak
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:yak"
msgid ""
"A common dungeon yak, covered in shaggy yak hair and bearing a nasty pair of\n"
"yak horns.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头普通的地牢牦牛，身上长满蓬松的牛毛，头上长着一对尖锐的牛角。\n"

#. key: yaktaur
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:yaktaur"
msgid ""
"A hybrid with the torso of a robust human atop the body of a yak. It excels in\n"
"ranged combat, and is also a formidable foe in close quarters.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个混种生物，在牦牛的身体上有着人的躯干。\n"
"他不但擅长远程战斗，近战方面也是个强大的敌人。\n"

#. key: yaktaur captain
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:yaktaur captain"
msgid ""
"An exceptionally strong and brutish yaktaur, able to order its weaker brethren\n"
"around to do its bidding.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个异常强壮、野蛮的半人牛，能够让他较弱的兄弟服从他的命令。\n"

#. key: yellow draconian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:yellow draconian"
msgid ""
"A muscular yellow-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个肌肉发达、长有黄色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

#. key: ynoxinul
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ynoxinul"
msgid ""
"A winged demon covered in shiny metallic scales. It has a legion of minor\n"
"demons under its command.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个有翼的恶魔，身上覆有闪耀的金属鳞片。它指挥着一个低阶恶魔军团。\n"

#. key: zombie
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zombie"
msgid ""
"A corpse raised to undeath by necromancy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具被死灵法术复活的尸体。\n"

#. key: test spawner
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:test spawner"
msgid ""
"(If you see this outside wizmode or the arena, this is a bug.)\n"
"\n"
"Whatever it is, it is capable of spawning countless monsters by casting Shadow\n"
"Creatures, and is virtually undestructible itself.\n"
"\n"
"To destroy it, lower the central elevator pillar, then pump rockets into the\n"
"hole in its exposed brain when the pillar rises to an appropriate height. You\n"
"can add another rocket while jumping down.\n"
"\n"
"Oh wait, wrong game.\n"
msgstr ""
"（如果你在向导或竞技场模式之外见到它，说明你遇到程序错误了。）\n"
"\n"
"不管它是什么，反正它能靠施放阴影生物法术来产生无数的怪物，\n"
"而且它本身基本不可能被破坏。\n"
"\n"
"要想破坏它，你得把中间的升降柱降下去，\n"
"然后赶在柱子回升到原本的高度前用火箭轰击它暴露在外的脑洞。\n"
"你可以在跳下时候再加一个火箭。\n"
"\n"
"噢，等等，好像串戏了。\n"

#. key: ghost
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ghost"
msgid ""
"The remains of a monster that existed in an older version, but has since been\n"
"removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"旧版中怪物的残骸，但已经被移除。\n"

#. key: sensed monster
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sensed monster"
msgid ""
"A hostile monster whose presence has been detected.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个敌对怪物，其存在已被察觉。\n"

#. key: trivial sensed monster
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trivial sensed monster"
msgid ""
"A trivially weak monster whose presence has been revealed by the power of\n"
"Ashenzari.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个微不足道的弱小怪物，其存在已被艾申扎利的力量所揭示。\n"

#. key: easy sensed monster
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:easy sensed monster"
msgid ""
"A weak monster whose presence has been revealed by the power of Ashenzari.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个弱小怪物，其存在已被艾申扎利的力量所揭示。\n"

#. key: tough sensed monster
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tough sensed monster"
msgid ""
"A somewhat dangerous monster whose presence has been revealed by the power of\n"
"Ashenzari.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个有一定危险性的怪物，其存在已被艾申扎利的力量所揭示。\n"

#. key: nasty sensed monster
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nasty sensed monster"
msgid ""
"A very dangerous monster whose presence has been revealed by the power of\n"
"Ashenzari.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个非常危险的怪物，其存在已被艾申扎利的力量所揭示。\n"

#. key: friendly sensed monster
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:friendly sensed monster"
msgid ""
"A friendly monster whose presence has been {{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Ashenzari\" then\n"
"        return \"revealed by the power of Ashenzari\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"detected\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个友好的怪物，其存在已被{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Ashenzari\" then\n"
"        return \"艾申扎利的力量所揭示\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"察觉\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}。\n"

#. key: cloud mage
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloud mage"
msgid ""
"A strange wizard who has attained mastery over clouds, making deft and\n"
"foreboding mystic gestures.\n"
msgstr ""
"这位奇怪的法师已经掌握了云雾的奥秘，\n"
"他的施法的神秘手势不仅娴熟而且还给人一种威压感。\n"

#. key: head instructor
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:head instructor"
msgid ""
"A powerful warrior-mage who instructs aspiring students in physical, magical,\n"
"and anti-magical combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位强大的战斗法师，指导有抱负的学生进行物理、魔法和反魔法战斗。\n"

#. key: hellbinder
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hellbinder"
msgid ""
"A mighty spellcaster wreathed in arcane energies, muttering profane\n"
"incantations.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位强大的施法者，全身被包裹在奥术能量中，呢喃着肮脏、亵渎的咒语。\n"

#. key: master blaster
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:master blaster"
msgid ""
"A mighty old lich, notorious for blasting people with powerful conjurations at\n"
"the slightest provocation, or just on a whim.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强大的老巫妖，它臭名昭著，因为它只要受到一点挑拨\n"
"（甚至有时只是心情不好）就会用强大的塑能法术轰杀别人。\n"

#. key: statue of wucad mu
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:statue of wucad mu"
msgid ""
"A statue made of a fine glassy orange crystal. It depicts a mystic known as\n"
"Wucad Mu, who mastered the matters of the mind, and is imbued with Wucad Mu's\n"
"powers of mental combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由精细的橙色玻璃水晶制成的雕像。\n"
"它所刻画的是一位掌握了心灵奥秘的的秘术师——乌卡德·穆，\n"
"而这尊雕像也充满了乌卡德·穆的精神战斗能力。\n"

#. key: moon troll
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:moon troll"
msgid ""
"A bizarre breed of intelligent troll, glowing with mysterious power from beyond\n"
"this world which shields it from damage except at close range.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇异的、有智慧的巨魔，闪耀着这个世界之外的神秘力量。\n"

#. key: air elementalist statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:air elementalist statue"
msgid ""
"A delicate statue of a tengu gliding through the air. It looks quite\n"
"insubstantial.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊精美的雕像，雕的是一个在空中滑翔的天狗。它看起来虚无缥缈。\n"

#. key: antique champion
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:antique champion"
msgid ""
"An unfathomably expensive skeleton. It has countless sigils engraved into its\n"
"bones, and pulses with a ghostly presence.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具贵得不可理喻的骷髅。它的骨头上刻有无数的印记，脉动着幽灵的存在。\n"

#. key: archer statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:archer statue"
msgid ""
"A statue of a beautiful elven archer, sculpted in finest marble. It holds a\n"
"bow aloft, and appears to be magically animated, letting it use the bow to\n"
"riddle intruders with arrows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个美丽的精灵射手雕像，由最好的大理石雕刻而成。\n"
"它高举着弓，似乎有了魔力，能用弓箭把入侵者射得满是窟窿。\n"

#. key: bog mummy
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bog mummy"
msgid ""
"An undead figure preserved by the brackish waters of a bog. It has begun to\n"
"decay heavily, and looks fragile.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个亡灵生物的身体被沼泽的咸水保存起来。\n"
"它已经腐朽得很严重了，看起来很脆弱。\n"

#. key: captured wizard
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:captured wizard"
msgid ""
"A wild-eyed wizard whose tongue has been cut out, frantically mumbling and\n"
"waving its arms but unable to cast a single spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个怒目而视的巫师。\n"
"他的舌头已被割下，疯狂地咕哝着，挥舞着手臂，但就是连一个法术也施展不了。\n"

#. key: charred statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:charred statue"
msgid ""
"A statue that has been imbued with flame, allowing it to make use of simple\n"
"fire-based conjurations.\n"
msgstr ""
"看起来，这尊雕像被灌入了火焰魔法，赋予它使用一些简单的火系塑能术的能力。\n"

#. key: cigotuvi's monster
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cigotuvi's monster"
msgid ""
"A terrifying creation that appears to have been constructed from the body parts\n"
"of every monstrous creature imaginable, with writhing tentacles sprouting from\n"
"its form.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个可怕的造物，由各种所能想像到的各种怪物的身体部件拼凑而成，\n"
"扭曲的触手从它的身体中蠕动出来。\n"

#. key: conjurer statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:conjurer statue"
msgid ""
"A statue able to harness the mightiest of pure conjurations ever devised by\n"
"Iskenderun.\n"
msgstr ""
"由伊斯肯德伦设计的一个能够驾驭有史以来最强大的纯魔法的雕像。\n"

#. key: deformed humanoid
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deformed humanoid"
msgid ""
"A poor creature that looks hideously deformed.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个可怜的生物外表严重畸形。\n"

#. key: demonic plant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonic plant"
msgid ""
"A demonic mockery of a plant, covered with mysterious appendages and writhing\n"
"tentacles. It appears to be harmless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个恶魔般恶劣的植物，满是神秘的附肢和蠕动的触手。它似乎是无害的。\n"

#. key: dimme
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dimme"
msgid ""
"A terrible creature with demonic ancestry. Its presence is horrifying, but\n"
"supernaturally compelling.\n"
msgstr ""
"有着恶魔血统的可怕生物。它的存在是令人畏惧的、超出寻常、难以抗拒的。\n"

#. key: drunken dwarf
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:drunken dwarf"
msgid ""
"A dwarf who seems to be working as an ale quality tester, and is enjoying the\n"
"job a little too much.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个矮人的工作是检验酒的质量。他似乎有点太享受他的工作了。\n"

#. key: earth elementalist statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:earth elementalist statue"
msgid ""
"A plain statue of a dwarf wielding a pickaxe. It looks incredibly heavy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊普通的矮人雕像，雕像的手中拿着一把鹤嘴锄。它看起来重得要命。\n"

#. key: fire elementalist statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire elementalist statue"
msgid ""
"An ornately worked statue of an orc holding a torch aloft, hewn from black\n"
"basalt. The air around it shimmers.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊华丽的兽人雕像，手中高举着一个用黑色的玄武岩雕成的火炬。\n"
"它周围的空气似乎微微发光。\n"

#. key: flesh golem
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flesh golem"
msgid ""
"An animated mound of misshapen flesh, sculpted over an iron skeleton.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团会动的畸形肉堆，在铁骨架上塑成。\n"

#. key: frost-covered statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frost-covered statue"
msgid ""
"A statue of a mage, with frost constantly forming across its surface.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊法师雕像，其表面不断生成冰霜。\n"

#. key: ghost-faced bat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ghost-faced bat"
msgid ""
"A bat with a spectral visage.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只有着幽灵般面孔的蝙蝠。\n"

#. key: giga bat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:giga bat"
msgid ""
"An enormous, bloated bat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只膨胀的巨型蝙蝠。\n"

#. key: greater air elemental
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:greater air elemental"
msgid ""
"A mighty spirit drawn from the elemental plane of air, surrounded by a\n"
"deadly vortex of frost.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自气元素位面的强大灵体，周围环绕着致命的冰霜旋涡。\n"

#. key: ice bat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice bat"
msgid ""
"An undead creature in the shape of a bat, made of ice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个蝙蝠形的亡灵生物，它的身体是由冰构成的。\n"

#. key: flame-cult kobold
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flame-cult kobold"
msgid ""
"A kobold that has been enchanted to explode in a blaze of fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个狗头人被附了魔法，在火焰中会爆炸。\n"

#. key: mad acolyte of lugonu
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mad acolyte of lugonu"
msgid ""
"A devoted follower of Lugonu, driven mad by years of living in the Abyss.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个卢格努的忠实追随者，被多年的深渊里的生活逼疯了。\n"

#. key: malarious merfolk avatar
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:malarious merfolk avatar"
msgid ""
"A young merfolk that looks deeply ill, but is still capable of bespelling its\n"
"audience.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个年轻的鱼人，看起来病得很重，但仍能吸引听众。\n"

#. key: master elementalist
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:master elementalist"
msgid ""
"A demented wizard commanding the primal forces of the universe.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个控制着宇宙原始力量的疯狂巫师。\n"

#. key: megabat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:megabat"
msgid ""
"A huge black bat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的黑色蝙蝠。\n"

#. key: microbat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:microbat"
msgid ""
"A bat that, despite its name, is not any smaller than a megabat.\n"
msgstr ""
"虽然这只蝙蝠的名字里没有“大”字，但其实它并不比大蝙蝠要小。\n"

#. key: spectator
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spectator"
msgid ""
"A follower of Okawaru, granted the honour of spectating a duel to the death.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奥卡瓦鲁的追随者，被赐予观看生死决斗的殊荣。\n"

#. key: oklob plant annihilator
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:oklob plant annihilator"
msgid ""
"A mere plant that has somehow attained sentience and the use of magic, by some\n"
"inconceivable sorcery.\n"
msgstr ""
"它虽然只是个植物，却通过某种不可思议的魔力，获得了知觉和使用魔法的能力。\n"

#. key: oklob sapling priest
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:oklob sapling priest"
msgid ""
"An immature oklob plant that seems to be mumbling some orisons... er, what?!?\n"
msgstr ""
"这株幼年酸箭草似乎在咕哝某种咒语……呃，啥鬼？！\n"

#. key: orb golem
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb golem"
msgid ""
"A metal golem crackling with magical energies. It must have been created by\n"
"a truly devious wizard, or possibly someone who misheard what monsters could\n"
"be found in the Realm of Zot.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊金属魔像，身上的魔法能量噼啪作响。它一定是由一位非常狡猾的巫师创造的，\n"
"或者是有人听错了能在佐特领域发现哪些怪物。\n"

#. key: phase bat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:phase bat"
msgid ""
"A strange, glowing bat that flutters through more dimensions than the average\n"
"bat.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只奇怪的发光蝙蝠似乎同时在多个次元中飞行着。\n"

#. key: phase spider
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:phase spider"
msgid ""
"An otherworldly spider that can move short and medium distances by briefly\n"
"shifting between the planes of reality, in order to better ensnare its prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只奇异的蜘蛛通过在多个现实位面中相位来快速进行中短距离移动，\n"
"以便更轻松地捕住它的猎物。\n"

#. key: pristine statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pristine statue"
msgid ""
"An immaculately sculpted porphyry statue of an archer poised to release a bolt,\n"
"with a full quiver at the hip.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊雕刻得很完美的斑岩雕像，其形象是一名正要放箭的弓箭手，\n"
"他的臀部有一个装满了的箭筒。\n"

#. key: rotten bat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rotten bat"
msgid ""
"A bat that is well past its sell-by date.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个早已过了保质期的蝙蝠。\n"

#. key: sickly merfolk siren
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sickly merfolk siren"
msgid ""
"A young merfolk that looks quite sick, but still has the power to mesmerise its\n"
"victims.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个年轻的人鱼，看样子病得不轻，但仍有迷惑其受害者的能力。\n"

#. key: skeletal bat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:skeletal bat"
msgid ""
"A bat skeleton without the decency to lie unmoving like dead bats are supposed\n"
"to.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只骷髅蝙蝠就是不肯像正常的死蝙蝠一样趴在地上一动不动。\n"

#. key: water elementalist statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:water elementalist statue"
msgid ""
"A smooth statue of a beautiful merfolk bathing in a fountain, sculpted from\n"
"creamy, faintly pinkish travertine. It glistens softly in the light.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊光滑的在泉中沐浴的鱼人雕像，由奶油色、略带浅粉色的钙华雕刻而成。\n"
"它在光线下中柔和地闪耀着。\n"

#. key: witch
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:witch"
msgid ""
"An old and unnaturally ugly human, wearing robes stained with what appears to\n"
"be swamp ooze, cauldron soot and brew ingredients.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个年老而异常丑陋的人，所穿的长袍上沾染着沼泽淤泥、大锅的烟灰和酿造原料。\n"

#. key: withered plant
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:withered plant"
msgid ""
"A plant whose life has been drained away, but with its physical form still\n"
"intact. It looks like it died many {{ if you.branch() == \"Crypt\" or\n"
"you.branch() == \"Tomb\" or you.branch() == \"Zot\" then return \"centuries\";\n"
"else return \"years\"; end }} ago.\n"
msgstr ""
"这株植物的生命力已被吸干，然而它的躯壳仍然完好。\n"
"看上去它已经死了好几{{ if you.branch() == \"Crypt\" or\n"
"you.branch() == \"Tomb\" or you.branch() == \"Zot\" then return \"世纪\";\n"
"else return \"年\"; end}}了。\n"

#. key: worm
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:worm"
msgid ""
"A giant annelid, glistening with slime, with unusually large teeth.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条巨大的环节动物，身上的黏液闪烁着，牙齿大得出奇。\n"

#. key: zin angel
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zin angel"
msgid ""
"A divine agent of Zin. It is a towering winged figure with an aura of brilliant\n"
"white light. Its face is marked by a scowl, as if its zeal against any real or\n"
"perceived vice overshadows its goodness.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个辛的圣使。其身上有高耸的翅膀，身体有着璀璨的白光。\n"
"他的脸上有种怒容，似乎他那对抗现实和察觉到的恶的热忱盖过了他的善意。\n"

#. key: zot statue
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zot statue"
msgid ""
"A profoundly disturbing statue, hewn from a single piece of dark gabbro\n"
"scintillating with tiny crystals. It is impossible to tell whether it is\n"
"intended to represent some creature or personage, or to be completely abstract.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊令人深感不安的雕像，只用一块黑色辉长岩雕刻而成，\n"
"上面的小水晶块还闪着微光。很难说它是在表现某种动物或人物，还是完全抽象。\n"

#. key: bag of meat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bag of meat"
msgid ""
"One of the legions of abominations created by the sculptors of flesh. It is a\n"
"horrendous imitation of the human form, consisting of an unrecognisable mass of\n"
"meat stitched together with limbs sewn on seemingly at random. Its skin hangs\n"
"off loosely in some places and bulges repulsively in others. Each one bears a\n"
"large symbol carved into its flesh, a mark of pride from its twisted creator.\n"
msgstr ""
"由肉雕师制造的憎恶军团中的一员。\n"
"这是一件可怕的人形仿制品，由一大堆无法辨认的肉连在一起，\n"
"肢体似乎随意缝在上面。在有些地方它的皮肤松弛下垂，有些地方则臃肿地隆起。\n"
"每个都有着一个刻在其肉里的巨大符号，这是其性格扭曲的创造者的骄傲的象征。\n"

#. key: large bag of meat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:large bag of meat"
msgid ""
"One of the legions of abominations created by the sculptors of flesh. Its\n"
"bloated hulk pulsates and throbs constantly with accursed fires. It looks as if\n"
"it could explode into a torrent of viscera at any moment.\n"
msgstr ""
"由肉雕师制造的憎恶军团中的一员。它那肿胀的身躯随着诅咒的火焰不停悸动着。\n"
"它似乎随时都有可能爆成内脏的洪流。\n"

#. key: meat berserker
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:meat berserker"
msgid ""
"One of the legions of abominations created by the sculptors of flesh. Its form\n"
"is large and muscular. It moves swiftly and with impetuous fury, the sole\n"
"thought within its being to rend you apart with great fervour. As it rages, it\n"
"creates a cacophonous din.\n"
msgstr ""
"由肉雕师制造的憎恶军团中的一员。它的体形很壮硕。\n"
"它移动迅速而狂暴，唯一的念头就是激情地把你撕碎。\n"
"当它狂怒时，会发出刺耳的噪音。\n"

#. key: meat hydra
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:meat hydra"
msgid ""
"One of the legions of abominations created by the sculptors of flesh. Each of\n"
"its eight necks is distended and elongated, connected to a colossal body\n"
"crumpled and dripping with ichor. Its many heads spew blood while writhing and\n"
"convulsing in agony, as it brings torment to itself and anything else that\n"
"beholds its foul visage.\n"
msgstr ""
"由肉雕师制造的憎恶军团中的一员。\n"
"它的八个脖子都被伸展拉长，与一个起皱的、滴着腐液的巨大身体相连。\n"
"它的许多头痛苦地翻滚、痉挛着，并吐出鲜血，\n"
"它给它自己和任何见到它那污秽容貌的人带来了痛苦。\n"

#. key: meat beast
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:meat beast"
msgid ""
"One of the legions of abominations created by the sculptors of flesh. Ablaze\n"
"with demonic frenzy, it gores and tramples with ferocity unmatched. Its skin is\n"
"flayed, exposing the glistening tendons and sinew underneath, and the teeth\n"
"inside its cavernous maw are stained with blood.\n"
msgstr ""
"由肉雕师制造的憎恶军团中的一员。\n"
"在恶魔的迷乱中狂暴着，无比残酷地杀戮、践踏着。它的皮肤被剥了，\n"
"露出发光的筋肉和下方的肌腱，它的硕大的胃里的牙齿沾满了血污。\n"

#. key: sculptor of flesh
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sculptor of flesh"
msgid ""
"An artisan of unlife, the sculptor appears as a grim skeletal form. It has six\n"
"long arms ending in mangled hands with broken fingers, upon which it crawls\n"
"like a spider. Its skull is abnormally large and full of holes. Its bones are\n"
"reddened and fractured, inscribed with the unholy spells it weaves to assemble\n"
"its puppets.\n"
msgstr ""
"这位雕工是亡灵的工匠，外形是阴冷的骨架。\n"
"它有六支长臂，末端是残缺的手掌和断了的手指，利用这些它像一只蜘蛛一样爬行。\n"
"它的头骨异常的大而且布满了洞。\n"
"它的骨头发红并断裂，上面刻有它用来装配傀儡的邪恶咒语。\n"

#. key: destroyer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:destroyer"
msgid ""
"The destroyers begin to descend upon you. They come in numbers and with wrath,\n"
"maws gaping like abaddon, bottomless and abyssal. They bring your doom and will\n"
"feast on your remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"毁灭者开始向你袭来。他们带着怒气成群降临，\n"
"胃裂开得像是像地狱、无止境得像是深渊。\n"
"他们会给你带来厄运，并在你的遗骸上饕餮。\n"

#. key: accursed
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:accursed"
msgid ""
"The accursed are the ones who came before. They have come to ensure you share\n"
"their fate.\n"
msgstr ""
"被诅咒者是先前亡故的人。他们想让你也陷入他们的命运。\n"

#. key: tyrant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tyrant"
msgid ""
"A colossal mass of bones and skulls, a walking tomb. You hear shrieks and\n"
"screams as it approaches, shattering off bones with each crushing step,\n"
"reassembling itself in eternal unrest.\n"
msgstr ""
"大堆骨头和头骨，它简直是个行走的坟墓。当它接近时，你会听到尖叫和呼啸，\n"
"每个步伐都是毁灭性的，骨头在碎裂，同时又无休止地进行重组。\n"

#. key: dread
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dread"
msgid ""
"An affront to existence, a void in which there is only torment and damnation.\n"
"Its unearthly form is torn and twisted, black and hollow. It is bereft of\n"
"rational thought, knowing only hatred and the desire to desecrate your soul.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个对存在冒犯的虚无，徒留折磨和诅咒。它那怪异的形态被撕裂扭曲，漆黑空洞。\n"
"它失去了理智，只怀有仇恨和亵渎你灵魂的欲望。\n"

#. key: scourge
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scourge"
msgid ""
"A vast serpentine form with raw and diseased skin, seeping bile and pus,\n"
"spouting venom and blight.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的蛇形生物，皮肤粗糙、病态，渗着胆汁和脓液，喷着毒液和枯萎病。\n"

#. key: observer
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:observer"
msgid ""
"You see the unseen, you stare and they stare back. They whisper and laugh, they\n"
"grin and cry, they leer at you with contempt and gaze at you in adoration. They\n"
"are the observers, they are the judge of your worth and will decide your end.\n"
msgstr ""
"你看着看不见的，你凝视着他们，他们也凝视着你。\n"
"他们低语着，笑着，他们又笑又哭，他们轻蔑地睨视着你，崇敬地凝望着你。\n"
"他们是观察者，他们是你的价值的仲裁，并决定着你的结局。\n"

#. key: wretched soul
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wretched soul"
msgid ""
"A spectre, struggling to leave the mortal world it is incarcerated in. It\n"
"drains life and unlife from all those it comes into contact with.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个鬼魂，挣扎着离开囚禁它的尘世。它从接触过的身上吸取生命和非生命。\n"

#. key: fleshlord
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fleshlord"
msgid ""
"One of the greatest servants of the Meatlord. It is muscular, agile and full of\n"
"malevolence.\n"
msgstr ""
"血肉领主最强大的随从之一。它强健敏捷，充满了怨恨。\n"

#. key: vile
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vile"
msgid ""
"An emaciated figure brimming with damnation and plague. Its appearance\n"
"signifies the end of days.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个消瘦的身形，充满了诅咒和瘟疫。它的出现意味着世界末日。\n"

#. key: the servant
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the servant"
msgid ""
"His glaive is alight with the flames of hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"他的大刀燃烧着地狱的火焰。\n"

#. key: the captor
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the captor"
msgid ""
"Those who enter will not escape.\n"
msgstr ""
"进入的人无法再逃脱。\n"

#. key: the defiler
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the defiler"
msgid ""
"His shield is emblazoned with images of infernal flames.\n"
msgstr ""
"他的盾上饰有地狱火的图案。\n"

#. key: the meatlord
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the meatlord"
msgid ""
"You behold the embodiment of filth, corruption and depravity: the Meatlord. His\n"
"foul body is bloated to the extreme, leaking viscous fluid and the stench of\n"
"death. His head is that of a boar with bulging eyes and tusks split in two, his\n"
"snout flares and oozes as he snorts and squeals at the sight of you, and his\n"
"mouth is a toothless rift which drools pools of blood and vomits forth\n"
"disgusting remains. His neck is stretched and lops forward, its skin sagging\n"
"downward. His immense gut writhes and distorts as the larvae within await their\n"
"repugnant release. His legs are unrecognisable masses of flesh, covered in\n"
"protrusions and throbbing boils. Your mind reels at the sight of this hideous\n"
"form, and your senses begin to shut down in an attempt to preserve your sanity\n"
"as you choke on the oppressive stench.\n"
msgstr ""
"你看到了污秽、腐化和堕落的化身，血肉领主。\n"
"他那肮脏的身体肿到了极致，流着粘液，散发着死亡的恶臭。\n"
"他的头是野猪，长有凸出的眼睛和两个獠牙，\n"
"他的猪嘴抽动着，淌着液体，一见到你就会喷着鼻息、发出尖叫。\n"
"他的嘴是个没有牙的裂口，流着血，吐着令人作呕的残渣。\n"
"脖子向前伸展、耷拉着，皮肤下垂着。他的脖子向前伸展、耷拉着，皮肤下垂着。\n"
"当体内的幼虫要恶心地释出时，他的肠道会蠕动、扭曲。\n"
"他的腿是一团无法辨认的肉，被突起、跳动着的脓包覆盖着。\n"
"当你看到这个丑恶的形体时，思维开始崩溃，感官开始停止，\n"
"以试图在令人窒息的压迫性的恶臭中留有一丝理智。\n"

#. key: the unspeakable
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the unspeakable"
msgid ""
"You hear the echoes of planets behind the deafening roar of stars as it\n"
"approaches. It is the jaws of the abyss. It brings forth crawling chaos from\n"
"within. It is the last sight you will ever see.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你接近时，你会听到恒星那震耳欲聋的轰鸣声和随后的行星的回音。\n"
"它是深渊的入口。它带来了从内向外蔓延的混乱。这将是你看到的最后的景象。\n"

#. key: abjuration spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:abjuration spell"
msgid ""
"Reduces the remaining duration of any nearby hostile summoned creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"减少附近任何敌对的召唤物的剩余存续时间。\n"

#. key: agonising touch spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:agonising touch spell"
msgid ""
"Cuts the health of an adjacent creature in half. This damage is never\n"
"directly lethal.\n"
msgstr ""
"让一个邻近生物的生命值减半。但永远不会直接杀死目标。\n"

#. key: agony spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:agony spell"
msgid ""
"Cuts the health of a target creature in half. This damage is never directly\n"
"lethal.\n"
msgstr ""
"让一个目标生物的生命值减半。但永远不会直接杀死目标。\n"

#. key: airstrike spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:airstrike spell"
msgid ""
"Causes the air around a creature to twist itself into a whirling vortex of\n"
"meteorological fury. It does more damage to targets surrounded by empty space.\n"
msgstr ""
"使目标生物周围的空气扭曲成一团狂暴的气旋。\n"
"如果目标周围空旷，它会造成更大的伤害。\n"

#. key: alistair's intoxication spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:alistair's intoxication spell"
msgid ""
"Converts a small portion of the brain matter of those around you into alcohol,\n"
"attempting to confuse all intelligent creatures within view (although\n"
"poison-resistant creatures may resist the effects). The caster will experience\n"
"vertigo briefly if they successfully make contact with other minds. It is\n"
"frequently used as an icebreaker at wizard parties.\n"
msgstr ""
"将你周围怪物的大脑中的一小部分物质转化成酒精，\n"
"以此混乱视野中的所有智慧生物（但有毒抗的生物可能会抵抗这个效果）。\n"
"如果施法者成功地与他人心灵接触，他们将短暂地经历眩晕。\n"
"在巫师们的宴会上，这道法术经常被用来打破冷场。\n"

#. key: anguish spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:anguish spell"
msgid ""
"Afflicts nearby foes with supernatural anguish, causing all damage they deal to\n"
"rebound on them for the duration of the effect. Strong-willed foes can resist the\n"
"necromantic visions of pain and suffering, and mindless creatures are unaffected.\n"
msgstr ""
"用超自然的痛苦折磨附近的敌人，\n"
"使他们在效果持续期间发出的所有伤害会反弹到他们身上。\n"
"意志力强的敌人可以抵抗痛苦的死灵幻觉，而没有意识的生物则不受到影响。\n"

#. key: animate dead spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:animate dead spell"
msgid ""
"For some time after casting this, living creatures killed by the caster will rise\n"
"as zombies. The chance of reanimating a monster and the duration of the effect\n"
"increase with spell power. Re-casting this spell will return zombies to dust, as\n"
"will leaving the floor.\n"
msgstr ""
"在施法后的一段时间内，被施法者杀死的活物会复活成丧尸。\n"
"使怪物复活的几率和效果的持续时间，随法力的增强而增加。\n"
"重新施放此法术将使丧尸归于尘土，即使是那些离开地面的也是如此。\n"

#. key: antimagic gaze spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:antimagic gaze spell"
msgid ""
"Causes the target's magic to leak into the air, as though they were hit by an\n"
"antimagic weapon, and heals the caster for the amount of magic drained,\n"
"with no direct line of fire required.\n"
msgstr ""
"该法术无需直射，能使目标的魔力泄到空中，就像他们被反魔法武器击中一样，\n"
"并根据所抽出的魔力对施法者进行一定程度的治疗。\n"

#. key: apportation spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:apportation spell"
msgid ""
"Pulls the top item or group of similar items from a distant pile to the floor\n"
"near the caster. With low power, items might not be moved all the way to the\n"
"caster's position.\n"
"\n"
"Extremely powerful magical items, such as the Orb of Zot, may actively resist\n"
"the pull of this spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"把附近地上一堆物品中最顶端的一件物品或一组类似物品拉向施法者。\n"
"法力低的情况下，物品可能不会一直朝施法者移动。\n"
"\n"
"特别强大的魔法物品——例如佐特宝珠，可能会主动抵抗该法术的拉力。\n"

#. key: arcjolt spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:arcjolt spell"
msgid ""
"Sends a wave of electricity through everything adjacent or near-adjacent to\n"
"the caster. The electricity continues to arc through everything in a connected\n"
"chain, though the caster themself is unaffected. The damage dealt bypasses half\n"
"of defenders' armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"发出一道能穿透所有与施法者相接或与其相邻物相接的物体的电流。\n"
"电流继续在连接链中形成电弧穿透所有物体，但施法者自己不受影响。\n"
"防御者的防具无法抵御它造成的一半伤害。\n"

#. key: avatar song spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:avatar song spell"
msgid ""
"Sings a powerfully haunting song. Adventurers who fail to resist will become\n"
"unable to move away from the singer (and will sometimes be drawn closer\n"
"involuntarily), while other creatures will become dazed outright.\n"
"\n"
"In addition, it may call forth drowned souls from any nearby bodies of deep\n"
"water.\n"
"\n"
"Leaving the caster's line of sight will end the movement-controlling effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"唱出萦绕心头的歌，使附近的受术者不愿离开歌者，\n"
"它还能从附近的深水中召唤溺魂。\n"

#. key: awaken forest spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:awaken forest spell"
msgid ""
"Gives some limited motility to nearby trees, allowing them to sway their\n"
"branches and shift their roots. Such enchanted trees will lash at any adjacent\n"
"enemy.\n"
msgstr ""
"为附近的树赋予运动能力，它们得以甩动树枝，移动根茎。\n"
"这些被施加魔法的树将会猛击邻近的敌人。\n"

#. key: awaken vines spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:awaken vines spell"
msgid ""
"Causes vines to grow from the ground. The vines will reach out and grab\n"
"interlopers, dragging them towards any nearby trees.\n"
msgstr ""
"让藤蔓破土而出。藤蔓会伸向前抓住闯入者，把他们拖向任一附近的树。\n"

#. key: banishment spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:banishment spell"
msgid ""
"Banishes a creature into the Abyss.\n"
msgstr ""
"将一个生物放逐到深渊。\n"

#. key: battlecry spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:battlecry spell"
msgid ""
"Inspires nearby allies of the caster to fight more aggressively, increasing\n"
"the strength of their blows.\n"
msgstr ""
"激励施法者附近的友方更积极地投入战斗，增加他们的打击力量。\n"

#. key: berserk other spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:berserk other spell"
msgid ""
"Causes a nearby ally to fly into a berserk rage. Going berserk temporarily\n"
"increases health, speed, and damage dealt in melee.\n"
msgstr ""
"使附近的友方爆发狂怒。\n"
"进入狂暴状态后，会暂时提升生命值、速度以及近战攻击力。\n"

#. key: bind souls spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bind souls spell"
msgid ""
"Bestows an enchantment on other nearby living creatures that causes them to\n"
"rise as simulacra after being slain.\n"
msgstr ""
"对附近的生物施法，它们被杀死后会变成拟像。\n"

#. key: blink allies away spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink allies away spell"
msgid ""
"Blinks allies in sight of the caster away from a nearby enemy.\n"
msgstr ""
"将施法者视野内的友方从附近敌人那里闪送走。\n"

#. key: blink allies encircling spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink allies encircling spell"
msgid ""
"Translocates a number of allies in the caster's sight to surround a targeted\n"
"enemy.\n"
msgstr ""
"将施法者视野内的友军转移到目标敌人周围。\n"

#. key: blink away spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink away spell"
msgid ""
"Translocates the caster to a location further away from a targeted enemy.\n"
msgstr ""
"将施法者转移到远离目标敌人的位置。\n"

#. key: blink close spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink close spell"
msgid ""
"Translocates the caster a short distance towards a targeted enemy.\n"
msgstr ""
"将施法者转移到靠近目标敌人的位置。\n"

#. key: blink other close spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink other close spell"
msgid ""
"Translocates a targeted enemy a short distance towards the caster. It cannot be\n"
"resisted by willpower.\n"
msgstr ""
"将目标敌人向施法者处转移一小段距离。意志力无法抗拒它。\n"

#. key: blink other spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink other spell"
msgid ""
"Randomly translocates a targeted enemy a short distance. It cannot be resisted\n"
"by willpower.\n"
msgstr ""
"随机地将目标敌人转移一小段距离。意志力无法抗拒它。\n"

#. key: blink range spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink range spell"
msgid ""
"Translocates the caster to a location further away from a targeted enemy, but\n"
"still within sight of the target.\n"
msgstr ""
"将施法者移到远离目标敌人的位置，但仍然在其视线范围内。\n"

#. key: blink spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink spell"
msgid ""
"Randomly translocates the caster a short distance. After translocating in this\n"
"way, the spell cannot be cast again for a short period of time depending on\n"
"spell power.\n"
msgstr ""
"随机地将施法者转移一小段距离。\n"
"以这种方式移位后，短时间内无法再次施展该法术，其间隔时间取决于法力。\n"

#. key: blinkbolt spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blinkbolt spell"
msgid ""
"Transforms the caster into a lightning bolt, and translocates the caster to\n"
"the bolt's destination.\n"
msgstr ""
"将施法者变为闪电箭，并将施法者转移到目的地。\n"

#. key: bolt of cold spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bolt of cold spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a penetrating bolt of frost.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一道穿透性的寒冰箭。\n"

#. key: bolt of devastation spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bolt of devastation spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a bolt of grief and heartache that cuts its victims' willpower in half.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一道悲伤和心痛之箭，使受害者的意志力减半。\n"

#. key: bolt of draining spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bolt of draining spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a penetrating bolt of negative energy which drains any living creature\n"
"it strikes.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一道穿透性的负能量箭，被击中的生物会陷入衰竭。\n"

#. key: bolt of fire spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bolt of fire spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a penetrating bolt of flames.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一道穿透性的烈火箭。\n"

#. key: bolt of magma spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bolt of magma spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a penetrating bolt of molten rock. Half of its damage bypasses fire\n"
"resistance.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一道穿透性的岩浆箭。它造成的一半伤害，火抗无法抵御。\n"

#. key: bombard spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bombard spell"
msgid ""
"Blasts an iron ball toward a target. The force of the blast often sends the\n"
"caster staggering backwards.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个目标轰击铁球。轰击的力量也常常会使施法者踉跄地向后退。\n"

#. key: borgnjor's revivification spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:borgnjor's revivification spell"
msgid ""
"Instantly heals any and all wounds suffered by the caster, but also permanently\n"
"damages their health, to a degree dependent on (and inversely related to) power.\n"
"\n"
"It is powerful enough to cancel the effects of Death's Door, although doing so\n"
"will briefly paralyse the caster. It has no effect on the undead.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道法术瞬间治愈施法者身上所有的创伤，\n"
"但同时会永久损失最大生命值，其程度与法术力量成反比。\n"
"\n"
"这道法术极为强大，足以将施法者从“死亡之门”里拉出来，\n"
"但这么做施法者会被暂时麻痹。它对亡灵无效。\n"

#. key: borgnjor's vile clutch spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:borgnjor's vile clutch spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth hands from corpses interred beneath the dungeon floor long ago.\n"
"Enemies caught in the area will be held in place and constricted until they\n"
"break free.\n"
msgstr ""
"唤起地牢地层下被长久掩埋的尸体的手。\n"
"被抓住的敌人会被束缚在原地，直到他们挣脱。\n"

#. key: brain bite spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brain bite spell"
msgid ""
"Drains a small amount of a visible enemy's mind and a proportion of their magic,\n"
"with no direct line of fire required. If the enemy has near-emptied magic\n"
"reserves, they will take doubled damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"令视野中的一个敌人流失少量心智和一定比例的魔力，无需直射。\n"
"如果敌人的魔力储备几近耗尽，则会受到双倍伤害。\n"

#. key: brom's barrelling boulder spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brom's barrelling boulder spell"
msgid ""
"Unleashes a massive rolling boulder in a given compass direction. This boulder\n"
"damages any creature it hits, rolling over those who perish beneath it and\n"
"pushing any others helplessly backwards (along with anyone else unfortunate\n"
"enough to be standing behind them).\n"
"\n"
"Its size and reckless locomotion make it difficult to use in confined areas; if\n"
"launched down narrow passages, it will rapidly abrade against the walls and fall\n"
"apart. It will also crumble if it leaves the caster's sight or strikes a wall\n"
"or otherwise unmoveable creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"在给定的基本方向上释出一个硕大的滚动巨砾。\n"
"巨砾碾压、击退那些被它撞击的生物，每次撞击自身就会磨损。\n"
"如果它撞到墙上，它会炸成岩石碎片，这时造成的伤害能被防具大大减轻。\n"
"\n"
"巨砾有时会左右摆动，如果它离开了施法者的视线，就会自行解体。\n"

#. key: call canine familiar spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:call canine familiar spell"
msgid ""
"Summons an inugami to the caster's aid. These mystical canines form a bond with\n"
"their summoner, strengthening them in direct proportion with the caster's\n"
"spellpower.\n"
"\n"
"Recasting this spell while your familiar is nearby will imbue it with additional\n"
"magic, mending some of its wounds, cleansing it of poison, and causing its next\n"
"attack to strike more quickly and cleave adjacent foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个犬神来协助施法者。\n"
"这些神秘的犬科动物与它们的召唤者形成了一种纽带，施法者的法力越强，它们就越强。\n"
"\n"
"当你的魔宠在附近时，重施这个法术会给它注入额外的魔力，愈合它的一些伤口，\n"
"并使它的下一次攻击更快，从而撕碎附近的敌人。\n"

#. key: call down damnation spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:call down damnation spell"
msgid ""
"Blasts a targeted enemy with damnation, with no direct line of fire required.\n"
"These unholy forces harm the victim and anyone adjacent, and are not affected\n"
"by any means of protection, such as armour or resistances. However, certain\n"
"creatures, usually those able to invoke damnation themselves, are entirely\n"
"unscathed by damnation.\n"
msgstr ""
"用天谴轰击敌人，无需直射。这些邪恶的力量会伤害目标和附近的任何人，\n"
"并且不被任何保护手段削弱，比如盔甲或抗性。\n"
"然而，某些生物，通常是那些能够召唤天谴的生物，完全不受到其伤害。\n"

#. key: call down lightning spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:call down lightning spell"
msgid ""
"Blasts a targeted enemy with lightning, with no direct line of fire required.\n"
"The targeting magics need distance to function, so enemies that are adjacent\n"
"or nearly adjacent cannot be struck by this.\n"
msgstr ""
"用闪电轰击敌人，无需直射。\n"
"目标性魔法需要有距离才能发挥作用，因此相邻或几乎相邻的敌人无法被击中。\n"

#. key: call imp spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:call imp spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth a minor demon from the pits of Hell, equipped with a spear with\n"
"which to jab at the caster's enemies. The quality of the imp's weaponry rises\n"
"with spell power.\n"
msgstr ""
"从地狱中召唤出一个低阶恶魔，它配备着一支长矛，可以戳刺施法者的敌人。\n"
"小恶魔的武器质量随法力的增强而提升。\n"

#. key: call lost souls spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:call lost souls spell"
msgid ""
"Summons some necromantic spectres. These lost souls can enter the bodies of more\n"
"powerful undead to bring them back from brink of demise, or turn dying living\n"
"creatures into ghostly versions of themselves.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一些死灵。这些遗魂可以进入更强大的亡灵的身体，\n"
"把它们从死亡边缘拉回来，或者把垂死的活物变成它们自己那般的鬼魂。\n"

#. key: call of chaos spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:call of chaos spell"
msgid ""
"Calls upon the powers of chaos to empower nearby allies, granting them haste,\n"
"might, doubled vigour, or improved resistances. The chaotic magic may\n"
"occasionally backfire and cause allies to instead lose their willpower or be\n"
"berserked, polymorphed, or filled with inner flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"召来混沌的力量增强附近的友方，提升他们的速度、力量、敏捷属性，或抗性。\n"
"这个混沌的魔法偶尔会适得其反，\n"
"导致友方失去意志力或变得狂暴、被变形或被内焰所充斥。\n"

#. key: call tide spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:call tide spell"
msgid ""
"Allows the caster to affect the tidal phase of all water within a large\n"
"distance. Soon after calling it, the waters on the whole level will reach high\n"
"tide. Waters near the caster will reach even higher levels than they would\n"
"normally.\n"
msgstr ""
"施法者能影响大范围的水的潮汐状态。召唤后不久，整层的水将会涨潮。\n"
"施法者附近的水位会比通常更高。\n"

#. key: cantrip spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cantrip spell"
msgid ""
"Casts one of a number of minor spells, aimed at trying to bolster the caster's\n"
"morale. They have no noticeable effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"施放一个初级魔法，意在提升施法者的士气。它没有明显的效果。\n"

#. key: cause fear spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cause fear spell"
msgid ""
"Causes fear in those near to the caster, causing those affected to be unable to\n"
"approach the caster, and to sometimes fail to attack them in melee. Leaving the\n"
"caster's line of sight will end the effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道法术让施法者附近的生物陷入恐惧之中，使它们无法接近施法者，\n"
"对施法者的近战攻击有可能失败。离开施法者的视野范围将结束效果。\n"

#. key: chain of chaos spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:chain of chaos spell"
msgid ""
"Creates an arc of pure chaos, striking nearby creatures with unpredictable\n"
"effects. The arc can touch upon the caster without harming them.\n"
msgstr ""
"创造一个纯混沌能量的弧，以不可预知的效果攻击周围的生物。\n"
"能量弧会触及施法者但不会伤害他。\n"

#. key: chain lightning spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:chain lightning spell"
msgid ""
"Releases a massive electrical discharge that arcs to the creature nearest the\n"
"caster and then outward from it. The further it travels, the less damage it\n"
"does. Secondary arcs have limited range and do little damage to the caster.\n"
"The spell bypasses half of defenders' armour and resistance to electricity.\n"
msgstr ""
"释放一股巨大的电流，这股电流会在各个目标间不断弹跳，直到最后接地被导开。\n"
"它走得越远，造成的伤害就越小。次生电弧的范围有限，对施法者的伤害很小。\n"
"该法术造成的一半伤害，防御者的防具和电抗无法抵御。\n"

#. key: charm spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:charm spell"
msgid ""
"Causes an otherwise hostile creature to fight on the caster's side for a while.\n"
"Adventurers, set on their quest for the ORB, instead suffer momentary confusion.\n"
msgstr ""
"使一个敌对生物为施法者战斗一段时间。\n"

#. key: chaos breath spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:chaos breath spell"
msgid ""
"Exhales a large cloud of fumes filled with the very essence of chaos.\n"
msgstr ""
"呼出一大片充满纯粹混乱精能的云。\n"

#. key: cleansing flame spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cleansing flame spell"
msgid ""
"Invokes a huge blast of divine fury centered on the user, severely damaging\n"
"undead and demons and dealing damage to all other hostile creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"激起以使用者为中心的巨大的神怒爆炸，会对亡灵和恶魔造成严重伤害，\n"
"并对所有其他敌对生物造成伤害。\n"

#. key: cold breath spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cold breath spell"
msgid ""
"Exhales a focused blast of icy-cold air.\n"
msgstr ""
"呼出一道集中的冰气。\n"

#. key: concentrate venom spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:concentrate venom spell"
msgid ""
"Intensifies the natural venom of the target monster. Poisonous bites and spit\n"
"become intense enough to slow and asphyxiate.\n"
msgstr ""
"强化目标怪物自身的毒液。叮咬和唾液的毒性变得更强，会造成减慢和窒息。\n"

#. key: confuse spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:confuse spell"
msgid ""
"Induces a state of bewilderment and confusion in a creature's mind.\n"
msgstr ""
"使生物的头脑陷入迷惑和混乱。\n"

#. key: confusing touch spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:confusing touch spell"
msgid ""
"Enchants the caster's dominant hand with magical energy. This energy is\n"
"released when the caster touches a monster, and may induce a state of confusion\n"
"in the monster. The caster's attacks do no damage while attempting to touch a\n"
"monster in this way.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道法术能在施法者的手中注入魔法能量。当施法者触碰一个怪物时，\n"
"这些能量会被释放出来，可能会让目标怪物陷入混乱。\n"
"施法者以这种触碰怪物的方式进行的攻击不会造成伤害。\n"

#. key: confusion gaze spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:confusion gaze spell"
msgid ""
"Induces a state of bewilderment and confusion in a creature's mind, with no\n"
"direct line of fire required.\n"
msgstr ""
"在一个生物的头脑中引发困惑和混乱，无需直射。\n"

#. key: conjure ball lightning spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:conjure ball lightning spell"
msgid ""
"Creates a pack of ball lightnings, which seek out the nearest enemy before\n"
"exploding in a huge blast of electricity. The damage dealt bypasses half of\n"
"defenders' armour. Casters are advised to use caution; the lightning is not\n"
"mindful of what it may hit.\n"
"\n"
"The magic which keeps ball lightnings cohesive has limited range, so they may\n"
"dissipate harmlessly if allowed to drift too far away from their caster before\n"
"exploding.\n"
msgstr ""
"创造数个球状闪电，寻找到敌人后造成巨大的闪电爆炸。\n"
"防御者的防具无法抵御它造成的一半伤害。\n"
"施法者需要谨慎，因为闪电并不能判断它击中的是什么。\n"
"\n"
"让球状闪电保持凝聚的魔力的范围有限，如果在爆炸前离施法者太远，\n"
"他们可能会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: conjure living spells spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:conjure living spells spell"
msgid ""
"Creates several living, autonomous spells, which cast themselves at the first foe\n"
"to enter their range. Once cast, they dissipate.\n"
msgstr ""
"创造几个活的、自主的法术，它们会向第一个进入其射程的敌人施放自己。\n"
"一旦施放，它们就会消散。\n"

#. key: corona spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corona spell"
msgid ""
"Causes a halo of glowing light to surround and effectively outline a creature.\n"
"This glow offsets the dark, musty atmosphere of the dungeon, and makes the\n"
"affected creature appreciably easier to hit.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道法术创造出光晕以环绕生物，有效地勾勒出其轮廓。\n"
"这道光驱散了地牢中的黑暗和霉味，因此要击中目标生物就容易多了。\n"

#. key: corrosive bolt spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corrosive bolt spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a penetrating bolt of highly-corrosive acid.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一道穿透性的酸。\n"

#. key: corrupt spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corrupt spell"
msgid ""
"Unleashes Abyssal energies in the immediate vicinity. This changes the\n"
"appearance of the affected area and temporarily summons creatures from the\n"
"Abyss. This cannot be used in the Abyss itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"在附近释放深渊的能量。这会改变受影响区域的外观，并暂时召唤出深渊中的生物。\n"
"它不能在深渊中释放。\n"

#. key: corrupting pulse spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corrupting pulse spell"
msgid ""
"Instills a corruption within all visible targets, temporarily mutating their\n"
"bodies in an adverse fashion. It cannot affect artificial beings, and the\n"
"undead will decompose if affected.\n"
msgstr ""
"向所有可见目标注入腐化，暂时对他们的身体造成有害的变异。\n"
"它不会影响人造物，亡灵受到影响也能消解它。\n"

#. key: creeping frost spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:creeping frost spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth freezing cold from the walls. Any enemies of the caster standing\n"
"next to the walls will be frozen and will find their movements slowed. Cold\n"
"resistance will reduce damage, but not prevent the freezing effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"激起墙壁中刺骨的寒意。任何站在墙边的施法者的敌人都会被冻结，\n"
"并会发现他们的移动速度变慢了。寒抗能削减其伤害，但无法抵御冰冻效果。\n"

#. key: curse of agony spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:curse of agony spell"
msgid ""
"Curses a foe, halving their remaining health after each of the next two times\n"
"that the caster strikes them in melee.\n"
msgstr ""
"诅咒一个敌人，接着施法者近战攻击他两次，其剩余生命值将会减半。\n"

#. key: death channel spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:death channel spell"
msgid ""
"Binds the souls of slain living, demonic and holy creatures, forcing their\n"
"spectres to remain and fight for the caster for as long as the channel lasts.\n"
msgstr ""
"束缚被杀的生物、邪物和圣物的灵魂，迫使他们的灵魂留下来，\n"
"并在效果持续的时间里为施法者而战。\n"

#. key: death rattle spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:death rattle spell"
msgid ""
"Exhales the essence of the dying, creating clouds of noxious miasma.\n"
msgstr ""
"呼出死亡的实质，制造出有毒的瘴气。\n"

#. key: death's door spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:death's door spell"
msgid ""
"Renders the caster nigh invulnerable to harm for a brief period, but brings\n"
"them dangerously close to death in the process. So close, in fact, that the\n"
"body believes itself to be dead — healing effects will do nothing.\n"
"\n"
"The caster will receive one warning shortly before the spell expires. After\n"
"expiry, the spell cannot immediately be recast, but with high power the caster\n"
"will be left further from death when the effect ends. It has no effect on those\n"
"who are already undead.\n"
msgstr ""
"使施法者在短时间内几乎不受伤害，但在此过程中会使他们危险地接近死亡。\n"
"事实上，如此接近，以至于身体认为自己已经死了——治疗效果将无济于事。\n"
"\n"
"施法者将在法术结束前不久收到一个警告。结束后，无法立即重新施展该法术，\n"
"但在效果结束时，法力高的施法者将会更远离死亡。\n"
"它对那些已经是亡灵的没有影响。\n"

#. key: debugging ray spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:debugging ray spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a ray which does massive damage (1500 hp) and always hits.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一道能造成巨大伤害（1500 hp）的射线，而且百发百中。\n"

#. key: deflect missiles spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deflect missiles spell"
msgid ""
"Envelops the caster in a repulsion field, greatly increasing their evasion\n"
"against all types of projectile - even while otherwise incapacitated.\n"
msgstr ""
"降低施法者受到投射攻击的几率，使其更容易躲闪。\n"
"单目标性攻击比穿透性攻击更容易回避。\n"

#. key: dig spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dig spell"
msgid ""
"Digs a tunnel through unworked rock.\n"
msgstr ""
"从未成形的岩石中挖出一条通道。\n"

#. key: dimension anchor spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dimension anchor spell"
msgid ""
"Blocks any translocations attempted by the affected target, be they voluntary\n"
"or not. This includes even some cross-plane effects, although notably not\n"
"Banishment.\n"
msgstr ""
"阻止受影响目标尝试进行的任何移位，无论是否是主动的。\n"
"这甚至包括一些跨层移位，但不包括放逐。\n"

#. key: dimensional bullseye spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dimensional bullseye spell"
msgid ""
"Weaves a link between the caster's weaponry and a chosen target. Whenever the\n"
"caster fires or throws something at a *different* enemy, a matching projectile\n"
"will be teleported at the target. Spellpower increases their accuracy.\n"
msgstr ""
"在施法者的武器和选定的目标之间建立连接。\n"
"每当施法者向*不同的*敌人投射东西时，对应的弹药就会传送到目标。\n"
"法力越强，命中率就越高。\n"

#. key: discord spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:discord spell"
msgid ""
"Drives nearby creatures into an wild frenzy, causing them to mercilessly\n"
"attack anything and everything nearby with great strength and speed.\n"
msgstr ""
"驱使附近的生物陷入疯狂，使它们以极大的力量和速度无情地攻击周围的一切。\n"

#. key: disjunction spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:disjunction spell"
msgid ""
"Destabilises the space in a sphere around the caster for a while, causing\n"
"anyone nearby to blink away from the caster. The chance of blinking depends on\n"
"the distance from the caster, being nearly certain when directly adjacent.\n"
msgstr ""
"让施法者周围一个球形区域内的空间结构变得不稳定，\n"
"使周围生物从施法者那里被闪送走。闪送的概率取决于到施法者的距离，\n"
"当直接近身时，几乎一定会被闪送。\n"

#. key: dispel undead spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dispel undead spell"
msgid ""
"Harms an adjacent undead creature greatly by interfering with the forces\n"
"binding it together.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过干扰将亡灵的身体缚在一起的力量，对邻近的亡灵造成极大伤害。\n"

#. key: dispel undead range spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dispel undead range spell"
msgid ""
"Harms an undead creature greatly by interfering with the forces binding it\n"
"together.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过干扰将亡灵的身体缚在一起的力量，对一个亡灵造成极大伤害。\n"

#. key: dispersal spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dispersal spell"
msgid ""
"Teleports away any creatures within a short distance of the caster. Any\n"
"creature with the Will to resist will still be irresistibly blinked a shorter\n"
"distance, and any monster it affects at all has a separate Will-based chance\n"
"of being confused by the warping of space.\n"
msgstr ""
"传送掉施法者近距离的任何生物。\n"
"任何有抵抗意志的生物仍然会被不可抗拒地被闪送一小段距离，\n"
"而它所影响的任何怪物都有几率被空间的扭曲所混乱，\n"
"这个几率的判定只取决于意志力。\n"

#. key: oblivion howl spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:oblivion howl spell"
msgid ""
"Unleashes a piercing howl that catches and echoes in victims' minds. While\n"
"those echoes linger, nightmarish creatures will hear and track them to their\n"
"source. It can only be used once by a given creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"发放出刺耳的嚎叫，在受害者的脑海中回荡。\n"
"当那些回声还在徘徊时，噩梦般的生物会听到并追踪它们的来源。\n"
"这个法术只能由特定的生物施放一次。\n"

#. key: dragon's call spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dragon's call spell"
msgid ""
"Issues a powerful call to a draconic realm, beckoning forth dragon after dragon\n"
"to engage the summoner's enemies. The spell is taxing to maintain, and each new\n"
"dragon which answers the call will further drain the summoner's magical\n"
"reserves. After the call ends, it cannot be issued again for a short time. The\n"
"duration of the call and the species of dragons called depend on spell power.\n"
msgstr ""
"向龙域发出强力呼唤，召唤龙与召唤者的敌人交战。\n"
"维持该法术很费力，每条被召唤的新龙将进一步消耗召唤者的魔力。\n"
"召唤结束后，短时间内无法再次施展它。召唤的龙的持续时间和种类取决于法力。\n"

#. key: drain life spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:drain life spell"
msgid ""
"Drains the life force of any nearby enemies, healing the user depending on\n"
"the damage dealt.\n"
msgstr ""
"吸取附近任何生物的生命，并根据造成的伤害治疗使用者。\n"

#. key: drain magic spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:drain magic spell"
msgid ""
"Causes the target's magic to leak into the air, as though they were hit by an\n"
"antimagic weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"使目标的魔力泄到空中，就像他们被反魔法武器击中一样。\n"

#. key: dream dust spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dream dust spell"
msgid ""
"Overwhelms the target with soporific dream dust, putting them to sleep with an\n"
"enchanting visual display. Additional dream sheep will increase the strength\n"
"and duration of this effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"用梦尘淹没目标，使他们入睡。另有梦羊时，会增加效果的强度和持续时间。\n"

#. key: druid's call spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:druid's call spell"
msgid ""
"Recalls woodland creatures from elsewhere on the same level.\n"
msgstr ""
"召回同层其他地方的林地生物。\n"

#. key: electrical bolt spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:electrical bolt spell"
msgid ""
"Throws a bolt of electricity at the target, with high accuracy.\n"
msgstr ""
"向目标射出一道有着很高精确度的闪电箭。\n"

#. key: enfeeble spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:enfeeble spell"
msgid ""
"Overwhelms an enemy with malignant energies, irresistibly weakening their melee\n"
"attacks and reducing the power of their spells. It will additionally daze and\n"
"blind any foe that fails to resist the full force of the curse - even those\n"
"without visual senses!\n"
msgstr ""
"用邪恶能量压倒敌人，不可抗拒地削弱他们的近战攻击、扰乱他们的魔法。\n"
"它还会使任何无法抵抗全部诅咒力量的敌人眩晕和失明。\n"

#. key: ensnare spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ensnare spell"
msgid ""
"Shoots a stream of webbing at a creature, ensnaring the target in a sticky web.\n"
msgstr ""
"向生物射出一连串的网，使目标困于黏性的网中。\n"

#. key: ensorcelled hibernation spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ensorcelled hibernation spell"
msgid ""
"Lowers its target's metabolic rate, inducing hibernation. After awakening, the\n"
"target will be unable to be put to sleep again for some time.\n"
msgstr ""
"降低目标的代谢率，诱导冬眠。目标苏醒后，将在一段时间内无法再次入睡。\n"

#. key: entropic weave spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:entropic weave spell"
msgid ""
"Corrodes the target, with no direct line of fire required.\n"
msgstr ""
"腐蚀目标，无需直射法术。\n"

#. key: eringya's noxious bog spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eringya's noxious bog spell"
msgid ""
"Causes the caster to release a torrent of sludge that transforms nearby areas\n"
"into a toxic bog. The sludge damages and poisons all monsters, even those\n"
"resistant to poison. The bog cannot form on areas adjacent to multiple solid\n"
"features, nor on areas that lack solid floor, like deep water or lava. The\n"
"transformation is temporary and cannot be sustained out of the caster's sight.\n"
"Spellpower will increase how long the bog lingers.\n"
msgstr ""
"施法者释放出一股污泥，将附近区域变成有毒的沼泽。\n"
"污泥会对所有怪物造成伤害、引起中毒，即使是那些抗毒的怪物。\n"
"沼泽不能在有多个坚固地形相邻的区域形成，也不能在缺少坚实地面的区域形成，\n"
"例如深水或熔岩。变化只是暂时的，且无法在施法者的视线外持续。\n"
"法力越强，沼泽的持续时间就越长。\n"

#. key: eruption spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eruption spell"
msgid ""
"Splits the earth to draw up a localised, short-lived volcano under the target.\n"
msgstr ""
"裂开地面，在目标下方生成一个局部的、短暂存在的火山。\n"

#. key: flay spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flay spell"
msgid ""
"Opens painful illusionary wounds on the target's body, which disappear after\n"
"a short time or on the death of the caster. This cannot kill directly, and is\n"
"ineffective against unnatural targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"撕开目标身上痛苦的幻象伤口，伤口会在施法者死亡后或短时间内消失。\n"
"它不能直接杀死对方，并对非自然目标无效。\n"

#. key: fire breath spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire breath spell"
msgid ""
"Breathes a blast of fire at a targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个目标生物喷吐火焰气流。\n"

#. key: fire storm spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire storm spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth a mighty storm of roaring flame directly onto the target, dealing\n"
"damage in a large area and leaving behind short-lived fire vortices. Half of\n"
"its damage bypasses fire resistance.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道法术能在目标区域塑造出一团威力巨大的火焰风暴，\n"
"在造成火焰伤害的同时还会留下一些短暂存在的火旋涡。\n"
"它造成的一半伤害，火抗无法抵御。\n"

#. key: fireball spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fireball spell"
msgid ""
"Hurls an explosive ball of fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"掷出一个爆炸性的火球。\n"

#. key: flame wave spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flame wave spell"
msgid ""
"Blasts the caster's surroundings with a wave of fire. If the caster maintains\n"
"focus and supplies the spell with magical power (by waiting in place and not\n"
"taking any other actions), more and larger flame waves will radiate outward.\n"
msgstr ""
"用一波火焰冲击施法者的周围。\n"
"如果施法者保持专注，并为法术提供魔力（通过原地等待而不采取任何其他行动），\n"
"就会向外辐射更多更大的火焰波。\n"

#. key: flaming cloud spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flaming cloud spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures up a large cloud of roaring flames.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一团咆哮的火焰云。\n"

#. key: flash freeze spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flash freeze spell"
msgid ""
"Freezes the air around a target, causing significant harm and slowing the\n"
"target's movement for a short time. Half of its damage bypasses cold resistance.\n"
msgstr ""
"冻结一个目标周围的空气，对目标造成重大伤害并减慢其移动速度。\n"
"它造成的一半伤害，寒抗无法抵御。它对已被冻结的目标没有影响。\n"

#. key: force lance spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:force lance spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a shaft of concussive force. If the impact deals damage, it may knock the\n"
"target back. If this knockback causes the target to hit a wall or another\n"
"creature, both will take additional damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"发出一道冲击力。如果它对目标造成伤害，可能会将其击退。\n"

#. key: forceful invitation spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:forceful invitation spell"
msgid ""
"Summons some creatures from one of the Snake Pit, the Spider Nest, the Swamp,\n"
"the Shoals, the Elven Halls, the Vaults, or the Crypt; the specific branch\n"
"varies with the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"从蛇穴、蜘蛛巢、沼泽、海滩、精灵殿堂、宝库或墓室，其中之一召唤一些生物，\n"
"具体分支因施法者而异。\n"

#. key: foxfire spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:foxfire spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures two balls of burning swamp gas adjacent to the caster. The balls will\n"
"rapidly seek the nearest monster and burn them. They will dissipate harmlessly\n"
"if unable to reach a target or if the caster swaps places with them.\n"
msgstr ""
"在施法者附近生成两个燃烧的沼气球。球会迅速寻找最近的怪物并灼烧它们。\n"
"如果不能到达目标或者施法者与它们互换位置，它们将会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: freeze spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:freeze spell"
msgid ""
"Freezes an adjacent creature, dealing damage that bypasses any armour the\n"
"target may have. This may temporarily slow cold-blooded creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"冰冻一个相邻的目标，造成的伤害能无视目标可能拥有的任何护甲。\n"
"这可能会暂时减缓冷血动物的速度。\n"

#. key: freezing cloud spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:freezing cloud spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures up a large cloud of lethally cold vapour.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一大团致命的冰汽云。\n"

#. key: frozen ramparts spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frozen ramparts spell"
msgid ""
"Encases surrounding walls with ice for a short time. Foes that wander near the\n"
"icy walls will be damaged, and this may temporarily slow cold-blooded creatures.\n"
"Each victim is only ever affected by one icy wall at a time.\n"
"\n"
"The ice will crack and fall away if the caster moves to a new position.\n"
msgstr ""
"用冰封住周围的墙壁一小段时间。在冰墙附近游荡的敌人会受到伤害，\n"
"并可能会暂时减缓冷血生物的速度。每个受害者一次只能受到一面冰墙的影响。\n"
"\n"
"如果施法者移动到新位置，冰会破裂、脱落。\n"

#. key: fugue of the fallen spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fugue of the fallen spell"
msgid ""
"Calls out to the lingering remnants of the long dead. While active, each\n"
"non-summoned enemy the caster or their allies slays attracts more vengeful\n"
"souls into the caster's weapon, temporarily enhancing their melee and ranged\n"
"effectiveness. When this bonus reaches its maximum, every hit will unleash a\n"
"glimmer of the dead's suffering, causing pain damage to each other foe adjacent\n"
"to your target.\n"
"\n"
"Recasting this spell will release your grip on the souls you've attracted,\n"
"resetting any bonus you've accumulated, and the cacophonous wailing of the dead\n"
"may attract unwanted attention even while you maintain it.\n"
msgstr ""
"呼唤那些早已逝去的弥留物。在激活状态下，\n"
"施法者及其盟友每杀死一个非召唤的敌人就会吸引更多复仇的灵魂进入施法者的武器，\n"
"暂时提高其近战和远程攻击力。当这个加成达到最大值时，\n"
"每次命中都会释出死者一丝痛苦，对与目标相邻的其他敌人造成痛楚伤害。\n"
"\n"
"重施这个法术会你会失去对吸引来的灵魂的控制，重置你积累的任何加成，\n"
"即使你要保持它，死者刺耳的哀嚎也会引起不必要的注意。\n"

#. key: fulminant prism spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fulminant prism spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures a shining prism of an unstable soft gold alloy. This is useless as\n"
"legal tender, however, as it will unfortunately violently explode with arcane\n"
"force after a short duration. If destroyed prematurely, its blast will be much\n"
"weaker.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一个棱镜，它会在短时间内释放出猛烈的奥术力量。\n"
"如果提前摧毁它，它的爆炸力会弱得多。\n"

#. key: funeral dirge spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:funeral dirge spell"
msgid ""
"A ritual chant that briefly rouses several nearby undead allies to move more\n"
"swiftly and strike with greater might.\n"
msgstr ""
"这首仪礼歌可以短暂地唤起附近的几个亡灵盟友，\n"
"让他们更快地移动，并以更大的力量进行攻击。\n"

#. key: ghostly fireball spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ghostly fireball spell"
msgid ""
"Hurls an exploding ball of negative energy which drains any living creature\n"
"it engulfs.\n"
msgstr ""
"掷出一个负能量爆炸球，将衰竭所吞噬的生物。\n"

#. key: ghostly sacrifice spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ghostly sacrifice spell"
msgid ""
"Uses an ally's motivating essence to create a blast of negative energy,\n"
"draining any living creature it engulfs. The being used to fuel the spell, no\n"
"matter whether living or construct, is consumed and unmade in the process.\n"
msgstr ""
"使用友方的行动力制造出一股负能量，将衰竭其吞噬的所有生物。\n"
"在这个过程中，被用来为法术提供燃料的，\n"
"无论是生物还是造物，都会被衰竭或破坏。\n"

#. key: glaciate spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:glaciate spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures forth a mighty blast of ice. Creatures within its cone-shaped area of\n"
"effect take damage, with higher damage being dealt to those close to the\n"
"caster. Those hit by the blast are encased in ice, slowing their movement, and\n"
"those killed by the blast may be frozen into solid blocks of ice. Half of its\n"
"damage bypasses cold resistance.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一个巨大的冰爆。在其锥形效果区内的生物会受到伤害，\n"
"越靠近施法者的生物会受到越高的伤害。被卷入爆炸的会被冰封住，\n"
"减慢其移动速度，被爆炸杀死的可能会被冻成冰块。\n"
"它造成的一半伤害，寒抗无法抵御。\n"

#. key: grasping roots spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grasping roots spell"
msgid ""
"Calls giant grasping roots from deep underground that hold and constrict their\n"
"victim. The roots will retreat if the victim breaks free or if the caller moves\n"
"out of view.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤来自地下深处的巨大抓握的根，抓住并束缚受害者。\n"
"如果受害人挣脱或它离开召唤者的视野，则根会撤去。\n"

#. key: infernal servant spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:infernal servant spell"
msgid ""
"Summons a major demon.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个大恶魔。\n"

#. key: hailstorm spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hailstorm spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures a cannonade of hail, battering nearby creatures that fail to dodge.\n"
"The eye of the storm is wide enough that monsters adjacent to the caster are\n"
"unaffected. Due to the strong impact and cutting edges, half of its damage\n"
"bypasses cold resistance.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成冰雹炮弹，袭击附近未能躲避的生物。\n"
"风暴眼足够宽大，施法者附近的怪物不会受影响。\n"
"由于强烈的冲击和切削，它造成的一半伤害，寒抗无法抵御。\n"

#. key: haste other spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:haste other spell"
msgid ""
"Speeds the actions of a nearby ally.\n"
msgstr ""
"加速一个附近友方的行动。\n"

#. key: harpoon shot spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:harpoon shot spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a long and flexible barbed mass. The ensnared victim will either be\n"
"pulled adjacent to the caster or collide with anything blocking the way.\n"
msgstr ""
"发射一个长而灵活的带刺重物。\n"
"被它捕捉的受害者会被拉到施法者附近或与挡住去路的东西相撞。\n"

#. key: haste spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:haste spell"
msgid ""
"Speeds the actions of the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"加速施法者的行动。\n"

#. key: haunt spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:haunt spell"
msgid ""
"Calls wraiths and ghosts to haunt the caster's target. They will only attack\n"
"the creature they are haunting, and will dissipate quickly once their target\n"
"dies. The number of spectres summoned increases with spell power.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤幽灵和鬼魂，以困扰施法者的目标。他们只会攻击他们所缠扰的生物，\n"
"一旦目标死亡，它们会迅速消散。召唤出的幽灵数量随法力增强而增加。\n"

#. key: hellfire court spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hellfire court spell"
msgid ""
"Summons demons of flame and damnation.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤火属性的恶魔和天谴。\n"

#. key: heal other spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:heal other spell"
msgid ""
"Heals a nearby ally.\n"
msgstr ""
"治疗一个附近的友方。\n"

#. key: hunting call spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hunting call spell"
msgid ""
"Inspires nearby allies to quicken their movement.\n"
msgstr ""
"激励附近的友方加快他们的移动。\n"

#. key: hurl sludge spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hurl sludge spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures a focused blast of highly toxic sludge, poisoning the victim and\n"
"drenching their surroundings. The sludge damages and poisons all monsters,\n"
"even those resistant to poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一道饱含剧毒的污泥，它会让受害者中毒并使其周围环境变湿。\n"
"污泥会对所有怪物造成伤害、引起中毒，即使是那些抗毒的怪物。\n"

#. key: holy breath spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:holy breath spell"
msgid ""
"Exhales a large cloud of blessed flame, shining with the glory of the good\n"
"gods. These flames are especially dangerous to undead and demonic creatures,\n"
"and have no effect on holy creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"呼出一团巨大的、闪耀着善神荣光的神圣火焰。\n"
"这些火焰对亡灵和恶魔生物特别致命，对神圣生物没有影响。\n"

#. key: holy flames spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:holy flames spell"
msgid ""
"Traps an enemy in a ring of blessed flame. These flames are especially\n"
"dangerous to undead and demonic creatures, and have no effect on holy\n"
"creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"用神圣的火焰圈住一个敌人。\n"
"这些火焰对亡灵和恶魔生物特别致命，对神圣生物没有影响。\n"

#. key: iceblast spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iceblast spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a large mass of ice, which explodes on impact. Half of its damage\n"
"bypasses cold resistance.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出大量冰块，在撞击时会爆炸。\n"
"由于强大的冲击和切削，它甚至对耐寒生物也有一定的影响。\n"

#. key: ignite poison spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ignite poison spell"
msgid ""
"Converts all nearby poison into liquid flame, burning poisoned creatures from\n"
"within. It also turns clouds of poison and mephitic gases into flame. The\n"
"caster is not affected directly.\n"
msgstr ""
"将附近的所有毒素变成液态火焰，以此从内部灼烧有毒的生物。\n"
"它还会将有毒云和毒气变成火焰。施法者不会直接受到影响。\n"

#. key: ignition spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ignition spell"
msgid ""
"All foes in the caster's surroundings are engulfed in balls of fire. The caster\n"
"and their allies are protected from the fire and will never be harmed by this\n"
"spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"施法者周围的所有敌人都被火球吞噬。\n"
"施法者及其友方免受火焰伤害，永远不会被此法术伤害。\n"
"\n"

#. key: infestation spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:infestation spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth a plague of scarabs, infesting affected creatures for a duration\n"
"depending on power and causing death scarabs to grow and burst from them upon\n"
"death.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤甲虫瘟疫，它会在一定时间内根据法力侵染受影响的生物，\n"
"死亡甲虫会在那些生物死亡时滋生、爆发。\n"

#. key: injury bond spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:injury bond spell"
msgid ""
"Binds the caster to nearby allies, reducing all damage they take by half in\n"
"exchange for suffering half of the prevented damage themselves.\n"
msgstr ""
"将施法者与附近的友方连接，将他们受到的任何伤害的一半转移给施法者。\n"

#. key: injury mirror spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:injury mirror spell"
msgid ""
"Reflects damage taken for a short duration, hurting attackers whenever the\n"
"caster takes any damage. After the duration wears off, the caster cannot cast\n"
"this spell again for a short while.\n"
msgstr ""
"在一小段时间内反射受到的伤害，每当受到伤害都会反伤攻击者。\n"

#. key: ink cloud spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ink cloud spell"
msgid ""
"Releases a thick cloud of ink to obscure vision.\n"
msgstr ""
"释出浓厚的墨云，模糊视线。\n"

#. key: inner flame spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:inner flame spell"
msgid ""
"Fills an enemy with an intense fire. This fire is released any time the target\n"
"is hit, and explosively released upon death. The size of the explosion caused\n"
"is dependent on the size of the target.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个敌人身体中灌入烈火。目标一旦死亡，体内的火焰就会被释放出来，\n"
"造成一次大爆炸。爆炸的范围大小取决于目标体形。\n"

#. key: invisibility spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:invisibility spell"
msgid ""
"Turns the caster invisible.\n"
msgstr ""
"使施法者隐形。\n"

#. key: invisibility other spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:invisibility other spell"
msgid ""
"Turns a nearby ally invisible.\n"
msgstr ""
"使附近的一个友方隐形。\n"

#. key: iron shot spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iron shot spell"
msgid ""
"Hurls a large and heavy metal shot.\n"
msgstr ""
"掷出一个巨大而沉重的钢铁投射物。\n"

#. key: irradiate spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:irradiate spell"
msgid ""
"Transmutes an ultra-thin layer of the caster's skin (or equivalent) directly\n"
"into pure magical energy, blasting adjacent creatures. It may heavily deform\n"
"its victims, weakening them and reducing their armour. The caster is not left\n"
"entirely unaffected; some of the magic lingers, enough to leave them\n"
"dangerously contaminated after a few castings.\n"
msgstr ""
"将施法者一层极薄的皮肤的（或类似物质）直接转为纯魔法能量，轰击相邻生物。\n"
"这可能会使目标严重变形、虚弱，并削弱其护甲。施法者并非完全不受影响；\n"
"身上仍残留着一些魔力，在几次施法后它们会对身体造成危险的污染。\n"

#. key: iskenderun's battlesphere spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iskenderun's battlesphere spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures a small globe of destructive energy. Each time its creator casts a\n"
"offensive spell, the battlesphere will also fire an unerring volley of energy at\n"
"the most injured nearby foe it can reach.\n"
"\n"
"The battlesphere's creator can freely fire through its position without harming\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一个魔法能量小球。\n"
"每当它的创造者施放破坏性法术（除了作战球本身或咒铸侍从）时，\n"
"作战球都会向一个随机敌人射出自己的能量。\n"
"法力越强，作战球的持续时间就越长，每次造成的伤害就越大。\n"

#. key: iskenderun's mystic blast spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iskenderun's mystic blast spell"
msgid ""
"Detonates a crackling sphere of destructive energy. The explosion will hit all\n"
"nearby monsters with physical force, knocking them back if damage is done.\n"
"Spellpower increases damage and knockback distance.\n"
msgstr ""
"引爆一个劈啪作响的毁灭性的能量球。\n"
"爆炸会以物理力量冲击附近的所有怪物，那些受到伤害的还会被击退。\n"

#. key: jinxbite spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jinxbite spell"
msgid ""
"Calls the attention of trickster spirits. While it holds, the spirits will\n"
"follow up on the caster's attacks. If the spell overcomes victims' willpower,\n"
"they will suffer minor damage and be drained by the sprites' playful malice.\n"
"\n"
"Fae assistance is fickle, however; they cannot be beckoned unless a susceptible\n"
"victim is visible, and will depart rapidly once no more remain. Calling on the\n"
"fae also reduces the caster's own willpower for a time.\n"
msgstr ""
"唤起顽劣之灵的留意。效果还在持续时，顽劣之灵会跟进施法者的攻击。\n"
"如果这个法术击垮了受害者的意志力，\n"
"他们将受到轻微伤害，并会被灵体顽皮的恶意衰竭。\n"
"\n"
"然而，灵体的援助是反复无常的；除非看到了易受影响的受害者，\n"
"否则无法呼唤他们，而且一旦没有其他受害者，它们就会迅速消散。\n"
"呼唤灵体也会在一段时间内降低施法者自身的意志力。\n"

#. key: volatile blastmotes spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:volatile blastmotes spell"
msgid ""
"Brings forth a cloud of volatile blastmotes around the caster. These explode\n"
"on contact with open flame or with creatures - including any caster foolish\n"
"enough to linger in them! The explosion is concussive, knocking adjacent\n"
"creatures away. Damage done rises with the spell's power.\n"
msgstr ""
"在施法者周围生成一团不稳定的爆炸粉尘云。\n"
"这些物质在接触明火或生物时会爆炸——包括任何愚蠢到还在其中逗留的施法者！\n"
"这个震荡性的爆炸，会对邻近生物造成冲击。所造成的伤害随法力增强而增加。\n"

#. key: leda's liquefaction spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:leda's liquefaction spell"
msgid ""
"Liquefies the ground around the caster, making it difficult to move through.\n"
"Any movement through liquefied ground will be slowed, and creatures stuck in\n"
"the liquefied ground will be unable to fly. Attempts to attack the caster\n"
"in melee may fail.\n"
"\n"
"The effect starts out with a radius depending on power, which will then shrink,\n"
"eventually covering only the caster, before it times out. Maintaining the\n"
"connection to the ground slows the caster's movement, even if they are flying.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道法术让施法者身边的地面液化，使地面变得难以通行。\n"
"在液化地面的任何移动都将减慢，被困在液化地面上的生物将无法飞行。\n"
"近战攻击施法者的尝试可能会失败。\n"
"\n"
"起始的生效范围的半径取决于法力，然后会缩小，最后只覆盖施法者，\n"
"直到完全失效。维持着与大地的连接会减慢施法者的移动速度，即使他们正在飞行。\n"

#. key: lee's rapid deconstruction spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lee's rapid deconstruction spell"
msgid ""
"Fragments a wall or a suitably brittle visible monster into an explosion of\n"
"deadly shrapnel. It can be used on monsters made of ice, bone, or any wall-like\n"
"substance, as well as those turned to stone by petrification. Its damage is\n"
"strongly reduced by armour.\n"
"\n"
"Targets made from rock, stone, ice or bone will cause a small explosion. Metal\n"
"targets will cause a small but more damaging explosion, and targets made from\n"
"crystal will cause a large and more damaging explosion.\n"
msgstr ""
"将一堵墙或一个可见的易碎怪物炸成致命的碎片。\n"
"这适用于由冰、骨或任何壁状物质构成的怪物，\n"
"也可以用在那些被石化成石头的怪物。防具可以大大削弱其造成的伤害。\n"
"\n"
"由岩石、冰或骨构成的目标会引起小爆炸。\n"
"金属目标会引起一个范围小却更具有破坏性的爆炸，\n"
"而水晶目标会引起一个范围大而更具有破坏性的爆炸。\n"

#. key: legendary destruction spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:legendary destruction spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures two explosive magical effects in instant succession. The effects can\n"
"be any mix of Fireball, Iceblast, and Ghostly Fireball.\n"
msgstr ""
"立刻连续产生两个爆炸魔法效果。效果会是火球、冰爆和鬼火球的任意组合。\n"

#. key: lehudib's crystal spear spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lehudib's crystal spear spell"
msgid ""
"Hurls a lethally sharp shard of crystal.\n"
msgstr ""
"掷出一个致命、锋利的水晶碎片。\n"

#. key: lesser beckoning spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lesser beckoning spell"
msgid ""
"Beckons the target forward, attempting to place them adjacent to the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"将目标引来，试图让他们靠近施法者。\n"

#. key: lightning bolt spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lightning bolt spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a mighty bolt of lightning. Its damage bypasses half of defenders'\n"
"armour, and it can be bounced off walls to hit targets twice.\n"
msgstr ""
"发射一道强大的闪电箭。防御者的防具无法抵御它造成的一半伤害。\n"
"它可以从墙壁上弹回，击中目标两次。\n"

#. key: magic dart spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:magic dart spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a small bolt of magical energy which never misses.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道法术射出一支小魔法射弹，该法术百发百中。\n"

#. key: major destruction spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:major destruction spell"
msgid ""
"Shoots a random harmful beam or explosion at the targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"向目标生物射出随机的有害射束或爆炸。\n"

#. key: major healing spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:major healing spell"
msgid ""
"Heals a large amount of damage to the caster's body.\n"
msgstr ""
"治愈施法者所受的大部分创伤。\n"

#. key: malign gateway spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:malign gateway spell"
msgid ""
"Tears a gash in reality, creating a self-sustained but temporary portal to an\n"
"unknown, tainted otherworld. It requires open space to succeed. After a short\n"
"time, a powerful clawed tentacle will reach through the portal, remaining bound\n"
"to the caster's will for a duration depending on power. With the portal's\n"
"expiry, the tentacle will be severed and turn on the caster. The duration of\n"
"the portal increases with spell power.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道法术能在现实世界中撕开一道裂口，\n"
"创造出能暂时维系、通往另一个被污染的世界的传送门。\n"
"该法术需要开阔的空间才能成功。\n"
"片刻之后，一条强大的长有爪子的触手将穿过传送门，\n"
"在一段时间内会受施法者的意志所制约，其持续时间取决于法力。\n"
"随着传送门的失效，触手将被切断并转而攻击施法者。\n"
"传送门的持续时间随法力的增强而增加。\n"

#. key: malign offering spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:malign offering spell"
msgid ""
"Drains life from an enemy, healing nearby allies in the process.\n"
msgstr ""
"吸取一个敌人的生命，同时治疗附近的盟友。\n"

#. key: malmutate spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:malmutate spell"
msgid ""
"Bestows a mutation on a target. The mutation is almost always harmful. It\n"
"cannot affect artificial beings, and the undead will decompose if affected.\n"
msgstr ""
"让一个目标发生一次变异。这种变异几乎总是有害的。\n"
"它不会影响人造物，亡灵受到影响也能消解它。\n"

#. key: manifold assault spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:manifold assault spell"
msgid ""
"Warps space into paradoxical configurations to strike many visible foes with\n"
"one melee attack. Power increases the number of foes attacked with one cast,\n"
"though unarmed attacks strike only half as many targets at once, as additional\n"
"care must be taken when warping one's own limbs.\n"
"\n"
"The time taken for the attack is exactly the same as a normal melee attack.\n"
"Attacks performed this way never miss, but the exact spot struck cannot be\n"
"controlled precisely, making them unable to do extra damage against unsuspecting\n"
"foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"将空间扭曲成反常的结构，以在一次近战攻击中能同时打击多个可见敌人。\n"
"以这种方式发动多重徒手打击需要非常高的能量，\n"
"因为在扭曲自己的四肢时要更加全神贯注。\n"
"\n"
"这个攻击所花费的时间与普通近战攻击完全相同。\n"
"它不够精准，所以它不能对毫无戒备的敌人造成额外的伤害。\n"

#. key: mara summon spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mara summon spell"
msgid ""
"Weaves illusions of the caster. Such illusions have the same physical prowess\n"
"as the original, and can cast the same spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"编织施法者的幻象。这类幻象与原先的有同样的物理能力，并能施同样的法术。\n"

#. key: march of sorrows spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:march of sorrows spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures a stream of stolen suffering, leaving clouds of excruciating misery in\n"
"its wake and around its targets. These clouds of negative energy will rapidly\n"
"drain the living of small fractions of their maximum health.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一股窃取的痛苦之流，它的尾迹和目标周围会留下郁积愁云。\n"
"这些负能量云会迅速使受害者流失与最大生命值成比例的生命值。\n"

#. key: marshlight spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:marshlight spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures two balls of burning swamp gas adjacent to the caster. The balls will\n"
"rapidly seek the nearest monster and burn them. Wizards attempted to copy this\n"
"with the spell 'Foxfire', but their version is much less powerful.\n"
msgstr ""
"在施法者附近生成两个燃烧的沼气球。球会迅速寻找最近的怪物并灼烧它们。\n"
"巫师试着将其仿制为“狐火”，但他们的版本的威力要小得多。\n"

#. key: martyr's knell spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:martyr's knell spell"
msgid ""
"Beckons forth the soul of a long-dead martyr to shield your allies for a time.\n"
"This soul suffers a portion of the damage your allies would otherwise receive.\n"
"\n"
"If it is slain (again!), it will transform into a flayed ghost, inflicting\n"
"illusory wounds on foes. Such wounds are fleeting, and will disappear when the\n"
"ghost departs - unless you kill its victims first.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个早已死去的殉道者的灵魂来保护你的盟友一段时间。\n"
"这个灵魂将分担你的盟友原本会受到的伤害。\n"
"\n"
"如果它被杀（再次！），它将变成一个剥皮鬼，会对敌人造成虚幻的创伤。\n"
"这样的伤口转瞬即逝，当鬼魂离开时就会消退——除非你能先杀死它的受害者。\n"

#. key: mass confusion spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mass confusion spell"
msgid ""
"Causes confusion in all who gaze upon the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"让所有注视着施法者的人陷入混乱之中。\n"

#. key: maxwell's capacitive coupling spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maxwell's capacitive coupling spell"
msgid ""
"Gradually builds up electric charge in the caster, so long as they maintain\n"
"focus (by waiting in place and not taking any other actions). When a threshold\n"
"is reached, the charge couples with the nearest foe, vaporising them instantly.\n"
"Higher spell power will allow the caster to accumulate charge more rapidly. The\n"
"spell requires a visible target to begin accumulating charge, though a different\n"
"foe may be targeted when the charge is released.\n"
msgstr ""
"施法者保持专注（通过原地等待而不采取任何其他行动），\n"
"施法者就会逐渐积累电荷。当达到阈值时，电荷会与最近的敌人结合，\n"
"立即将他们蒸发。法力越强，施法者越能更快地积累电荷。\n"

#. key: mephitic cloud spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mephitic cloud spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures a fragile flask that explodes into short-lived clouds of noxious fumes.\n"
"These clouds may cause confusion in any creature not resistant to poison.\n"
"Tougher, more experienced creatures are less likely to be affected.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一团短暂存在的毒性烟雾，这可能会对任何没有毒抗的生物造成混乱。\n"
"越坚韧、经验等级越高的怪物越不会受此影响。\n"

#. key: mesmerise spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mesmerise spell"
msgid ""
"Attempts to entrance all enemies in sight. Adventurers who fail to resist will\n"
"become unable to move away from the caster, while other creatures will become\n"
"dazed outright.\n"
"\n"
"Leaving the caster's line of sight will end the movement-controlling effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"使目标生物不愿离开施法者。离开施法者的视野范围将结束效果。\n"

#. key: metabolic englaciation spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:metabolic englaciation spell"
msgid ""
"Lowers the metabolic rate of every creature in the caster's vicinity, slowing\n"
"all those who are not resistant to cold. Cold-blooded creatures will be\n"
"affected much more strongly, and tougher creatures will be slowed for a\n"
"shorter time.\n"
msgstr ""
"降低施法者周围所有生物的新陈代谢速率，减慢所有没有寒抗的生物。\n"
"冷血生物将受到更强烈的影响，而更强壮的生物会在更短的时间内被减速。\n"

#. key: metal splinters spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:metal splinters spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a burst of metal splinters. Its damage is strongly reduced by armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一连串金属碎片。防具可以大大削弱其造成的伤害。\n"

#. key: miasma breath spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:miasma breath spell"
msgid ""
"Creates a large cloud of foul pestilence, poisoning and sometimes slowing any\n"
"living creatures it touches.\n"
msgstr ""
"产生一大团恶臭的瘟疫云，对接触到的任何生物造成毒害并有时会造成减速。\n"

#. key: might other spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:might other spell"
msgid ""
"Significantly increases a nearby ally's damage dealt in melee.\n"
msgstr ""
"大大增加周围友方的近战的攻击力。\n"

#. key: might spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:might spell"
msgid ""
"Significantly increases the caster's damage in melee.\n"
msgstr ""
"大大增加施法者的近战的攻击力。\n"

#. key: mindburst spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mindburst spell"
msgid ""
"Launches a psychic attack. If it overcomes the victim's willpower, it\n"
"'blows their mind' in a violently literal fashion, dealing damage that\n"
"bypasses their armour entirely. It is useless against mindless creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"发动心灵攻击。如果它击垮了受害者的意志力，\n"
"它会以强烈的风格显示出文字“击溃了他们的心灵”，\n"
"并造成完全无视他们防具的伤害。它对没有意识的生物没有作用。\n"

#. key: minor healing spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:minor healing spell"
msgid ""
"Heals a small amount of damage to the caster's body.\n"
msgstr ""
"治愈施法者所受的小部分创伤。\n"

#. key: monstrous menagerie spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:monstrous menagerie spell"
msgid ""
"Summons a powerful exotic creature to the caster's aid: either a manticore, a\n"
"lindwurm, or a sphinx marauder.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个强大的外来生物来帮助施法者：蝎尾狮、林德虫，如果有更强的法力，\n"
"甚至会是斯芬克斯。施展这个魔法时的法力越强，也会增加野兽自身的力量。\n"

#. key: mourning wail spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mourning wail spell"
msgid ""
"Exhales a stream of forgotten grief, leaving clouds of excruciating misery in\n"
"its wake but skipping past creatures that would be vulnerable to it. These\n"
"clouds of negative energy will rapidly drain the living of small fractions of\n"
"their maximum health.\n"
msgstr ""
"呼出一股被遗忘的悲伤之流，它的尾迹会留下郁积愁云，\n"
"但会跳过那些容易受到它影响的生物。\n"
"这些负能量云会迅速使受害者流失与最大生命值成比例的生命值。\n"

#. key: noxious cloud spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:noxious cloud spell"
msgid ""
"Creates a large cloud of noxious fumes, which may cause confusion.\n"
msgstr ""
"产生大量有毒烟雾，这可能会引起混乱。\n"

#. key: olgreb's toxic radiance spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:olgreb's toxic radiance spell"
msgid ""
"Causes the caster to radiate toxic energy, continuously inflicting poison on\n"
"everything in line of sight for as long as the spell lasts.\n"
msgstr ""
"施法者放出毒能量，在法术持续时内持续对视线内的所有生物造成毒害。\n"

#. key: orb of destruction spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb of destruction spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures an orb made of pure destructive magic. Compared to most other\n"
"projectiles, these orbs travel at a relatively slow pace. The orbs home onto\n"
"their targets, yet because of their huge inertia, especially agile opponents\n"
"may be able to outmanoeuvre them. The orbs need some time to stabilise, and a\n"
"nascent orb will deal reduced damage.\n"
"\n"
"Residents of the dungeon are able to maintain the orb until it impacts a\n"
"target, but when cast by you the orb will dissipate upon leaving your line of\n"
"sight.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一个毁灭性的纯魔力球。比起其他的发射物，这种能量球的飞行速度相对较慢。\n"
"能量球会自动追踪目标，但因为它们的惯性太强，\n"
"因此特别敏捷的对手可能会躲开它们。\n"
"球体需要一段时间来稳定，新生的能量球无法发挥出全部的伤害潜力。\n"
"\n"
"地牢的居民可以在它撞到目标前一直维持着球体，但你在施放时，\n"
"球体在离开你的视线时就会消散。\n"

#. key: orb of electricity spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb of electricity spell"
msgid ""
"Hurls a crackling orb of electrical energy, creating a huge explosion on\n"
"impact. Its damage bypasses half of defenders' armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"掷出噼啪作响的电能量球，在撞击时产生巨大爆炸。\n"
"防御者的防具无法抵御它造成的一半伤害。\n"

#. key: ozocubu's armour spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ozocubu's armour spell"
msgid ""
"Envelops the caster's body in a protective layer of thick ice, granting a\n"
"substantial bonus to armour as long as they remain in their current location.\n"
"The ice will crack and fall away if the caster moves to a new position. The\n"
"spell decreases in effectiveness in heavier armour, granting a lower bonus the\n"
"higher the encumbrance rating of the caster's armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"在施法者的身体上覆一层厚的冰，只要他们呆在现在的位置，就有大量的防御加成。\n"
"如果施法者移动到新位置，冰会破裂、脱落。\n"
"该法术对重甲效果变弱，施法者的护甲的负担等级越高，加成越低。\n"

#. key: ozocubu's refrigeration spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ozocubu's refrigeration spell"
msgid ""
"Turns the air bitterly cold, freezing all other creatures in line of sight.\n"
"This is less effective against creatures packed tightly together - those\n"
"adjacent to their allies will be partly insulated from the cold, taking less\n"
"damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"使空气变得非常寒冷，冻结视线中的所有其他生物。\n"
"这对紧密聚在一起的生物效果较差——\n"
"一些与其他生物相邻的生物会部分地隔绝于寒冷，受到的伤害较小。\n"

#. key: pain spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pain spell"
msgid ""
"Inflicts an extremely painful injury upon one living creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"让一个活物遭受极大的痛苦。施法者本身也会因法术的反噬而受到一点伤害。\n"

#. key: paralyse spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:paralyse spell"
msgid ""
"Prevents a creature from taking any action for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"让一个生物短期无法做出任何行动。\n"

#. key: paralysis gaze spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:paralysis gaze spell"
msgid ""
"Irresistibly prevents a creature from taking any action for a short time,\n"
"requiring multiple charges but not line of fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"让一个生物在短期内不可抗拒地无法做出任何行动，需要多次充能但不需要发射。\n"

#. key: passage of golubria spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:passage of golubria spell"
msgid ""
"Opens two gateways (one always near the caster), which allow instantaneous\n"
"transport to random other open gateways to any creature entering them. There is\n"
"no limit to the number of gateways that can be open at one time. However,\n"
"gateways close a short time after being opened, or immediately once entered.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道法术开启两扇传送门（其中一扇总是出现在施法者附近）；\n"
"任何走进传送门的生物都会被随机传送到另一个打开着的传送门。\n"
"同一时间可以打开的传送门数量并没有限制。\n"
"但是，传送门在打开后会短时间内关闭，或是一旦进入就立刻关闭。\n"

#. key: passwall spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:passwall spell"
msgid ""
"Allows the caster to travel a short distance through an adjacent rock wall and\n"
"emerge again on the other side. This spell takes an unusally long time to cast,\n"
"during which the caster will be unable to act, but also gain increased armour\n"
"from their attunement to the rock.\n"
msgstr ""
"施法者可以穿过相邻的岩墙行进一小段距离，然后重新出现在另一边。\n"
"施展这个法术需要很长时间，\n"
"在此期间施法者将无法行动，但也会从他们对岩石的调谐中获得更多防御力。\n"

#. key: petrify spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:petrify spell"
msgid ""
"Petrifies a targeted creature and up to two other foes in a chain. Those which\n"
"do not muster the Will to resist are briefly slowed, and then turned to stone.\n"
"Until they return to flesh, they are unable to act, but also take half damage.\n"
"The spell's power is lessened against secondary targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"石化一个目标生物和最多与之相连的两个生物。\n"
"那些意志力不足以抵抗该法术的生物会暂时变慢，然后变成石头。在他们恢复肉身前，\n"
"他们无法行动，但受到的伤害会减半。该法术对次级目标的威力会减弱。\n"

#. key: petrifying cloud spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:petrifying cloud spell"
msgid ""
"Exhales calcifying dust, which petrifies anyone affected for longer than a\n"
"brief moment.\n"
msgstr ""
"呼出僵化尘，受影响的会被石化较长一段时间。\n"

#. key: phantom mirror spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:phantom mirror spell"
msgid ""
"Creates a phantom copy of a creature. The copy will be somewhat fragile, but\n"
"otherwise almost indistinguishable from the original.\n"
msgstr ""
"创造一个怪物的幻影。复制品会比较脆弱，但除此之外与原品无别。\n"

#. key: plane rend spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:plane rend spell"
msgid ""
"Summons some of the greater threats from one of the Pits of Slime, the Elven\n"
"Halls, the Vaults, the Crypt, the Tomb of Ancients, or the Realm of Zot; the\n"
"specific branch varies with each cast of the spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"从黏液坑洞、精灵殿堂、宝库、墓室或远古坟冢，其中之一召唤一些生物，\n"
"每次施法时，分支都会有所不同。\n"

#. key: plasma beam spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:plasma beam spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a penetrating beam of plasma at one of the caster's most distant foes.\n"
"The ionised beam bypasses half of defenders' armour, and a second beam of fire\n"
"follows in its wake.\n"
msgstr ""
"向施法者最远的一个敌人发射穿透性的等离子束。\n"
"电离束会先穿透防御者的一半防具，火焰束接着紧随其后。\n"

#. key: poison arrow spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:poison arrow spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a magical arrow coated with the most vile and noxious toxin. Even those\n"
"resistant to poison will be poisoned by it, and a small portion of its direct\n"
"damage bypasses poison resistance.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一支淬有最致命毒药的箭矢。即使是那些有毒抗的也会被毒害，\n"
"它造成的部分直接伤害，毒抗无法抵御。\n"

#. key: poisonous cloud spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:poisonous cloud spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures forth a great cloud of lethal gases.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一团致命的毒云。\n"

#. key: polar vortex spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:polar vortex spell"
msgid ""
"Turns the air around the caster into a freezing vortex, doing tremendous damage\n"
"to everyone caught in it that can only be half-mitigated by resistance to\n"
"cold. Those affected will also be swept up into the air and tossed around.\n"
"Only the eye of the storm is a safe place, and it follows the caster. The\n"
"vortex is unable to follow the caster through long-distance translocations.\n"
"The spell's effectiveness is greatly diminished in closed areas. After the\n"
"vortex fades, it cannot be called forth again for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"将施法者周围的空气变成一个冰冻的旋涡，对卷入其中的生物造成巨大伤害，\n"
"而这种伤害只能通过寒抗来减轻一半。受影响的会被卷到空中并被抛来抛去。\n"
"只有风暴眼是安全的，并且它还会跟随施法者。\n"
"但施法者在进行长距离移位后，这个旋涡无法继续跟随施法者。\n"
"在封闭区域，该法术的效果会大大降低。旋涡消散后，短时间内无法再次施展它。\n"

#. key: polymorph spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:polymorph spell"
msgid ""
"Randomly alters the form of a creature. It is especially effective against\n"
"shape-changing creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"随机改变一个生物的外形。该法术对会变换形态的生物尤其有效。\n"

#. key: porkalator spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:porkalator spell"
msgid ""
"Transforms the target into a pig. The target moves swiftly but cannot cast\n"
"spells. The caster's demise will cause the transformation to end.\n"
msgstr ""
"将目标变为猪。目标的移动变得迅捷，但无法施法。施法者一死，变形就会结束。\n"

#. key: portal projectile spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:portal projectile spell"
msgid ""
"Teleports a fired or thrown missile at a targeted enemy.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个目标敌人传送一个投射的弹药。\n"

#. key: primal wave spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:primal wave spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures a torrent of water that may knock back the target, and creates a\n"
"pool of shallow water for a short duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一湍激流，它可能会击倒目标，并在短时间内形成一滩浅水。\n"

#. key: pyre arrow spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pyre arrow spell"
msgid ""
"Launches a glob of liquid fire that clings to a targeted creature, dealing\n"
"armour-ignoring fire damage over multiple turns. The victim can put the fire out\n"
"much more quickly by moving.\n"
"\n"
"If the target is insubstantial, the liquid fire will fail to stick.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个生物发射一团会粘在身上的液体火焰，在多个回合内造成无视护甲的火焰伤害。\n"
"受害者可以通过移动更快地将火扑灭。\n"
"\n"
"如果目标是非实体的， 这个液体火焰会无法粘着。\n"

#. key: pyroclastic surge spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pyroclastic surge spell"
msgid ""
"Draws searing flames from lava. Any enemies of the caster standing\n"
"next to or above lava will be burned.\n"
msgstr ""
"从熔岩中引出灼热的火焰。任何站在熔岩旁边或上方的施法者的敌人都会被灼烧。\n"

#. key: quicksilver bolt spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quicksilver bolt spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a bolt of dispelling energy at a targeted creature, possibly removing\n"
"some of its enchantments.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Breathe Dispelling Energy ability>\n"

#. key: resonance strike spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:resonance strike spell"
msgid ""
"Calls a surge of power from the earth, striking an enemy within the caster's\n"
"sight. The spell cascades through nearby constructs, growing in strength with\n"
"each one standing near the target.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一股来自大地的力量，攻击施法者视线内的敌人。\n"
"法术将附近的造物串联起来，每有一个造物在目标附近就会增强力量。\n"

#. key: roll spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:roll spell"
msgid ""
"Roll into a ball, granting the boulder beetle tremendous speed as well as\n"
"double melee damage. The roll may only be performed when at distance from a\n"
"foe, and the beetle will always unroll after an attempted roll attack.\n"
msgstr ""
"滚成一个球，给予巨砾甲虫巨大的速度以及双倍的近战攻击力。\n"
"只有在与敌人有一定距离时才能进行翻滚，\n"
"并且甲虫在进行滚动攻击后总会展开身体。\n"

#. key: sandblast spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sandblast spell"
msgid ""
"Blasts a target with high-velocity rock shards. Gathering the rock from ambient\n"
"grit is slow, making this spell take one-and-a-half times as long to cast as\n"
"most. Its damage is strongly reduced by armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"将一些小碎石以极高的速度射向目标。因为从周围环境中获得岩石的速度很慢，\n"
"使得这个法术的施法时间多出大多数法术的一半。防具可以大大削弱其造成的伤害。\n"

#. key: sap magic spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sap magic spell"
msgid ""
"Taints a targeted creature's ability to cast spells. Casting a spell while\n"
"afflicted with this condition causes the target to lose access to their magic,\n"
"briefly preventing them from casting any further spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"腐化目标生物施放咒语的能力。\n"
"施法时如果被它影响会被打断，并被短暂阻止再次施法。\n"

#. key: scorch spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scorch spell"
msgid ""
"Scorches a random foe. Those injured by this have their resistance to fire\n"
"burned away for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"灼烧一个随机敌人。受此伤害的会在短时间内失去火抗。\n"

#. key: sculpt simulacrum spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sculpt simulacrum spell"
msgid ""
"Forms icy simulacra of an adjacent living, demonic, or holy creature. These\n"
"fragile doppelgangers will take shape over a short period of time, eventually\n"
"gaining the ability to move and attack the caster's enemies.\n"
"\n"
"The good gods frown on this spell, as it works blood and ichor into unnatural\n"
"facsimiles.\n"
"\n"
"You can maintain up to 5 simulacra simultaneously.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成以相邻的一个生物、邪物或圣物为原型的冰制拟像。\n"
"这些脆弱的替身将在短时间内成型，最终获得移动和攻击施法者敌人的能力。\n"
"\n"
"善神不喜欢这个法术，因为它能把血和灵液变成不自然的赝品。\n"
"\n"
"你最多可以同时维系5个拟像。\n"

#. key: seal doors spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:seal doors spell"
msgid ""
"Imparts seals on nearby doors and stairs, preventing those not allied with\n"
"the caster from traversing them.\n"
msgstr ""
"封印附近的门和楼梯，防止非施法者的友方穿过它们。\n"

#. key: searing ray spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:searing ray spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a continuous piercing ray of arcane energy from the caster's hands. So\n"
"long as the caster maintains focus upon the spell and supplies it with magical\n"
"power (by waiting in place and not taking any other actions), the ray will\n"
"follow the caster's target if it should move.\n"
msgstr ""
"从施法者的手中射出一束持续的穿透性奥术能量射线。\n"
"如果施法者保持专注，并为法术提供魔力（通过原地等待而不采取任何其他行动），\n"
"射线将会追踪施法者的目标。\n"

#. key: searing breath spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:searing breath spell"
msgid ""
"Breathes a blast of fire at a targeted creature, leaving a cloud of flames at\n"
"the endpoint.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个目标生物喷吐火焰气流，在终点留下一团火焰云。\n"

#. key: sentinel's mark spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sentinel's mark spell"
msgid ""
"Bestows a strong beacon upon a targeted creature. It announces the presence\n"
"and location of the marked creature to everyone on the same level.\n"
msgstr ""
"给目标生物一个显著的信标。\n"
"这会向同层的每个怪物广播被标记生物的存在及其位置。\n"

#. key: seracfall spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:seracfall spell"
msgid ""
"Violently collapses a nearby simulacrum into a large mass of ice, which\n"
"explodes on impact. The ice affects even cold-resistant creatures somewhat, due\n"
"to the strong impact and cutting edges.\n"
msgstr ""
"猛烈地将附近的一个拟像崩成大冰块，它会在轰然倒塌时爆炸。\n"
"由于强大的冲击和切削，它甚至对耐寒生物也有一定的影响。\n"

#. key: shadow creatures spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shadow creatures spell"
msgid ""
"Creates replicas of creatures native to the caster's current location, weaving\n"
"them from shadows and threads of Abyssal matter.\n"
msgstr ""
"创建施法者当前地域的生物复制品，它们由深渊物质的阴影和丝线编织而成。\n"

#. key: shadow shard spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shadow shard spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a shard of hardened shadow at a single enemy.\n"
msgstr ""
"模仿迪斯姆诺信徒的攻击魔法，射出暗影碎片。\n"

#. key: shatter spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shatter spell"
msgid ""
"Causes an enormous burst of concussive force around the caster, dealing severe\n"
"damage to all nearby creatures. It is especially effective against those made\n"
"from ice, bone, or any wall-like substance (such as rock, metal or crystal), as\n"
"well as those turned to stone by petrification. It is less effective against\n"
"flying, gelatinous and insubstantial creatures. It may also destroy nearby\n"
"walls.\n"
msgstr ""
"这道法术让施法者身边爆发出一道巨大的冲击力，对附近所有生物造成严重伤害。\n"
"它对那些由冰、骨或任何壁状物质构成的怪物尤为有效，\n"
"以及在那些被石化成石头的怪物。它对飞行、凝胶状和非实体生物的效果较差。\n"
"它可能会摧毁周围墙壁。\n"

#. key: sheza's dance spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sheza's dance spell"
msgid ""
"Summons weapons from far and wide - a dagger newly forged, a sword long-rusted\n"
"in a moldering tomb, an axe still steaming with the blood of its victim -\n"
"animating them and sending them out to attack.\n"
msgstr ""
"从四面八方召唤武器——一把新锻造的匕首，一把在腐朽的坟墓中生锈已久的剑，\n"
"一把仍在蒸腾着受害者热血的斧头——激活它们并派他们出击。\n"

#. key: shock spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shock spell"
msgid ""
"Throws a bouncing bolt of electricity. It bypasses half of defenders' armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"发射出一支会反弹的闪电箭。防具无法完全抵御它。\n"

#. key: sigil of binding spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sigil of binding spell"
msgid ""
"Creates two sigils nearby. Anyone who passes over them will be bound, able to\n"
"act and dodge normally but unable to move away. When the effect wears off,\n"
"their movement speed will rebound, giving them temporary swiftness. Swiftness\n"
"from any source grants immunity to binding.\n"
"\n"
"Only one set of sigils can be maintained at a time, and they will expire\n"
"prematurely if they leave your sight.\n"
msgstr ""
"在附近创造两个印记。任何经过它们的人都会被束缚，可以行动和闪避，但无法移动。\n"
"当效果消失时，移动速度会回升，暂时使他们变得迅捷。\n"
"从任何来源获取的迅捷属性都能免疫束缚。\n"
"\n"
"一次只能维护一组印记，而且如果它们离开你的视线，就会提前失效。\n"

#. key: silence spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:silence spell"
msgid ""
"Eliminates all sound near the caster. This makes reading scrolls, casting\n"
"spells, invoking divine abilities, or shouting impossible in the caster's\n"
"vicinity.\n"
"\n"
"Certain monsters have innate magical or special abilities which will still be\n"
"usable while silenced.\n"
"\n"
"The effect starts out with a radius depending on power, which will then shrink,\n"
"eventually covering only the caster, before it times out.\n"
msgstr ""
"消除施法者附近的所有声音。\n"
"这使得无法在施法者附近阅读卷轴、施展咒语、喊叫或呼唤神的能力。\n"
"这个魔法另人苦恼的一面是，这些不自然的效果将极大地妨碍潜行。\n"
"\n"
"某些怪物具有与生俱来的魔法或特殊能力，即使被沉默也能使用。\n"
"\n"
"起始的生效范围的半径取决于法力，然后会缩小，最后只覆盖施法者，\n"
"直到完全失效。\n"

#. key: siren song spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:siren song spell"
msgid ""
"Sings a haunting song that mesmerises nearby listeners. Adventurers who fail to\n"
"resist will become unable to move away from the singer, while other creatures\n"
"will become dazed outright.\n"
"\n"
"Leaving the caster's line of sight will end the movement-controlling effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"唱出萦绕心头的歌，使附近的受术者不愿离开歌者。\n"
"离开施法者的视野范围将结束效果。\n"

#. key: sleep spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sleep spell"
msgid ""
"Puts a targeted creature to sleep. Taking damage will typically wake the\n"
"target, and loud sounds can potentially do so as well.\n"
msgstr ""
"使一个目标生物沉睡。对目标造成伤害会将其唤醒，\n"
"如果发出巨大响声，也可能会这样。\n"

#. key: slow spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slow spell"
msgid ""
"Slows the actions of a creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"减慢一个生物的行动。\n"

#. key: slug dart spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slug dart spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a sharp dart of hardened chitin.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一个坚硬甲壳质的锋利飞镖。\n"

#. key: smiting spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:smiting spell"
msgid ""
"Smites any targeted enemy within sight, with no direct line of fire required.\n"
msgstr ""
"惩戒视线内的任何敌人，无需直射。\n"

#. key: spawn tentacles spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spawn tentacles spell"
msgid ""
"Extends large tentacles to attack nearby enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"伸出巨大的触手攻击附近的敌人。\n"

#. key: spectral cloud spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spectral cloud spell"
msgid ""
"Creates a cloud of spectral mist, dealing minor damage to all creatures other\n"
"than the undead. Dangerous but short-lived spectral undead creatures will\n"
"coalesce from the mist over time.\n"
msgstr ""
"制造一团幽灵迷雾云，对亡灵以外的所有生物造成轻微伤害。\n"
"随时间的推移，危险但短暂存在的幽灵亡灵生物将从迷雾中聚合。\n"

#. key: spellspark servitor spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spellspark servitor spell"
msgid ""
"Constructs a metallic servant with a spark of the caster's own arcane knowledge\n"
"at its core. This spark allows the servitor to unleash some of the destructive\n"
"spells known to its creator, though the strongest and most volatile\n"
"of magics cannot be imbued in this fashion. The strength of the servitor\n"
"increases with spell power.\n"
"\n"
"(While you know this spell, you may choose which of your eligible spells it will\n"
"cast with the Imbue Servitor ability.)\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个界外元素，并将其束缚到由施法者自己的魔法锻造的坚固外壳之中。\n"
"侍从有能力释放其创造者所知的一些破坏性法术，\n"
"尽管最强大和最不稳定的魔法不会以这种方式灌输进去。\n"
"侍从的力量随法力的增强而增加。\n"

#. key: spit acid spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spit acid spell"
msgid ""
"Spits acid at a targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个目标生物喷吐酸液。\n"

#. key: spit lava spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spit lava spell"
msgid ""
"Spits lava at a targeted creature. Half of its damage bypasses fire resistance.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个目标生物喷吐熔岩。它造成的一半伤害，火抗无法抵御。\n"

#. key: splinterspray spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:splinterspray spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a burst of wooden splinters. Its damage is strongly reduced by armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一连串木头碎片。防具可以大大削弱其造成的伤害。\n"

#. key: sporulate spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sporulate spell"
msgid ""
"Releases a fast, gas-filled floating spore. After seeking out its foe, the\n"
"spore will explode, damaging anything caught in the blast and further confusing\n"
"living creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"释放一个快速，充满气体的浮动孢子。\n"
"在找到敌人后，孢子会爆炸，并对爆炸中的任何生物造成伤害和混乱。\n"

#. key: starburst spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:starburst spell"
msgid ""
"Releases penetrating bolts of fire from the caster in every direction.\n"
msgstr ""
"从施法者的各个方向射出道穿透性的烈火箭。\n"

#. key: static discharge spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:static discharge spell"
msgid ""
"Releases electrical charges against those next to the caster. These may arc to\n"
"other adjacent creatures, or back to the caster, before eventually grounding\n"
"out. It deals reduced damage when arcing to the caster, and the damage dealt\n"
"bypasses half of defenders' armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"向施法者身边的生物释放出几股电流。\n"
"这些电流会作弧形运动，攻击到周围生物，或返给施法者，直到最后接地被导开。\n"
"它的电弧对施法者造成的伤害较低，它造成的一半伤害防御者的防具无法抵御。\n"

#. key: steam ball spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:steam ball spell"
msgid ""
"Throws a ball of hot steam towards a targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个目标生物投射蒸汽球。\n"

#. key: sticky flame spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sticky flame spell"
msgid ""
"Unleashes a short-ranged spray of incendiary goo that clings to an adjacent\n"
"creature and deals armour-ignoring fire damage over several turns. If the victim\n"
"is allowed to move, it will put out the fire prematurely.\n"
"\n"
"If the target is insubstantial, the liquid fire will fail to stick.\n"
msgstr ""
"释放一股短程的粘性燃烧物质，它会附着在邻近的生物身上，\n"
"并在几个回合内造成无视护甲的火焰伤害。如果受害者能够移动，他会更快地将火扑灭。\n"
"\n"
"如果目标是非实体的， 这个液体火焰会无法粘着。\n"

#. key: still winds spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:still winds spell"
msgid ""
"Brings the air into unnatural stillness across a huge area, preventing anything\n"
"short of a polar vortex from breaking the calm. The effect takes concentration\n"
"to maintain, and only lasts a short time; if the caster is killed, clouds will\n"
"begin to form again as normal.\n"
msgstr ""
"使空气在一大片区域内进入反常的静止状态，\n"
"防止除极地旋涡之外的任何事物破坏平静。\n"
"该效果需要集中注意力才能维持，且只能持续很短的时间；\n"
"如果施法者被杀死，则云会重新正常形成。\n"

#. key: sting spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sting spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures a jagged shard of crystallised toxins. The stinger's impact will always\n"
"poison a susceptible target. Even resistant targets have a chance to be poisoned\n"
"and immune monsters will still be damaged by the physical impact of the stinger.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成一个锯齿状的结晶毒素碎片。毒刺的冲击总是会让易感目标中毒。\n"
"即使是有毒抗的目标也有可能中毒，免疫毒的怪物也会受到毒刺的物理冲击。\n"

#. key: stoke flames spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stoke flames spell"
msgid ""
"Adds malice to hellish fires, binding it with flame into a creeping inferno.\n"
msgstr ""
"为地狱之火添加恶意，与火焰结合成蔓延的毁灭性的大火。\n"

#. key: stone arrow spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stone arrow spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a sharp spine of rock.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一个锋利的岩锥。\n"

#. key: strip willpower spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:strip willpower spell"
msgid ""
"Greatly reduces the target's willpower, making them more vulnerable to a\n"
"variety of magical effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"大大削弱目标的意志力，使其更容易受到各种魔法效果的影响。\n"

#. key: stunning burst spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stunning burst spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a weak electrical burst which, on impact, causes very brief paralysis.\n"
"Willpower is of no use against this effect, but resistance to electricity can\n"
"sometimes prevent it.\n"
msgstr ""
"发出微弱的电脉冲，撞击时会造成短暂的麻痹。\n"
"意志力对抵抗这种影响毫无用处，但电抗有时可以阻止它的影响。\n"

#. key: sublimation of blood spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sublimation of blood spell"
msgid ""
"Converts some of the caster's blood into magical energy. The process is painful\n"
"but never directly lethal. The efficiency of the conversion increases with the\n"
"spell's power.\n"
msgstr ""
"将施法者的部分血液转化为魔法能量。这个过程是痛苦的，但绝不会直接致命。\n"
"转换的效率随法力增强而增加。\n"

#. key: summon air elementals spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon air elementals spell"
msgid ""
"Summons one or more air elementals.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个或多个气元素。\n"

#. key: summon cactus giant spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon cactus giant spell"
msgid ""
"Summons a warrior from a particularly prickly tribe. Foes that strike these\n"
"giants in melee are in for a painful surprise! When cast at a higher power,\n"
"older, more robust warriors will answer the call.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个来自多刺部落的战士。在近战中攻击这些巨人的敌人会体验到痛苦的惊喜！\n"
"当以更高法力施放，会让老练的、更强壮的战士响应召唤。\n"

#. key: summon demon spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon demon spell"
msgid ""
"Opens a gate to the realm of Pandemonium and draws forth one of its inhabitants\n"
"to serve the caster for a time.\n"
msgstr ""
"打开一扇通往魔窟领域的大门，引出其中一位居民为施法者效劳一段时间。\n"

#. key: summon dragon spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon dragon spell"
msgid ""
"Summons and binds a powerful dragon to perform the caster's bidding. At high\n"
"power it may summon particularly deadly varieties of dragon, or multiple lesser\n"
"dragons at once.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤并束缚一条强大的龙来执行施法者的命令。\n"
"当法力很高时，便可以召唤特别致命的龙，或者同时召唤多个较弱的龙。\n"

#. key: summon drakes spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon drakes spell"
msgid ""
"Summons multiple drakes and lindwurms.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤多条亚龙和林德虫。\n"

#. key: summon earth elementals spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon earth elementals spell"
msgid ""
"Summons one or more earth elementals.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个或多个土元素。\n"

#. key: summon emperor scorpions spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon emperor scorpions spell"
msgid ""
"Summons multiple noble and monstrous emperor scorpions.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤多条高贵而凶暴的帝王蝎。\n"

#. key: summon executioners spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon executioners spell"
msgid ""
"Summons multiple Executioners to tear apart foes of the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤多个处决者撕裂施法者的敌人。\n"

#. key: summon eyeballs spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon eyeballs spell"
msgid ""
"Summons multiple floating eyeballs that may be able to vitrify, polymorph,\n"
"confuse, mutate or disintegrate.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤多个浮动眼球，它们可能会造成玻化、变形、混乱、变异或碎裂。\n"

#. key: summon fire elementals spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon fire elementals spell"
msgid ""
"Summons one or more fire elementals.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个或多个火元素。\n"

#. key: summon forest spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon forest spell"
msgid ""
"Forcefully intersects a forested plane with this world. It requires open space\n"
"to succeed. While the spell holds, a spirit of the forest will be called forth,\n"
"and the trees of the forest will be awakened to deal damage to nearby enemies.\n"
"Spell power increases the duration, size, and thickness of the intersected\n"
"plane; as well as the strength of the spirit.\n"
msgstr ""
"强行将森林位面与这个世界相交。该法术需要开阔的空间才能成功。\n"
"当法术生效时，森林之灵会被召唤出来，\n"
"森林的树会被唤醒，并对附近的敌人造成伤害。\n"
"法力能增加位面相交的持续时间、大小和密集程度；灵体的力量也会更强。\n"

#. key: summon greater demon spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon greater demon spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth one of the greater demons of Pandemonium to serve the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个魔窟的高阶恶魔为施法者效劳。\n"

#. key: summon sin beast spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon sin beast spell"
msgid ""
"Summons a deadly sin beast.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个致命的地狱兽。\n"

#. key: summon hell sentinel spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon hell sentinel spell"
msgid ""
"Summons a Hell Sentinel, a nightmarish edifice of animated hate.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个地狱哨兵，一个充满仇恨的噩梦般的造物。\n"

#. key: summon holies spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon holies spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth divine warriors to aid the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤圣战士来帮助施法者。\n"

#. key: summon horrible things spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon horrible things spell"
msgid ""
"Opens a gate to the Abyss and calls through two or more hideous abominations\n"
"from that dreadful place. While powerful, brushing one's mind against the fabric\n"
"of the Abyss in this manner invites Doom upon the caster and may eventually cost\n"
"them greatly.\n"
msgstr ""
"打开一扇通往深渊的大门，并从那个恐怖领域中召唤两个或更多可怕的憎恶。\n"
"打开此门可能会消耗施法者的一部分智力。召唤出的憎恶数量随法力增强而增加。\n"

#. key: summon hydra spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon hydra spell"
msgid ""
"Summons a many-headed hydra to fight alongside the caster for a short time.\n"
"Spell power determines the number of heads.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一只多头的九头蛇来在短时间内与施法者并肩战斗。\n"
"法力决定着头的数量。\n"

#. key: summon ice beast spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon ice beast spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth a beast of ice to serve the caster. The strength of the beast\n"
"depends on spell power.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一只冰兽为施法者效劳。野兽的力量取决于法力。\n"

#. key: summon illusion spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon illusion spell"
msgid ""
"Summons a temporary mirror image of an enemy. Such a copy has the same physical\n"
"prowess as the original, and can cast the same spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个暂时存在的敌人的镜像。\n"
"这个复制品与原先的有同样的物理能力，并能施同样的法术。\n"

#. key: summon mana viper spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon mana viper spell"
msgid ""
"Summons a violet-scaled serpent whose bite can swiftly drain the magical\n"
"reserves of nearly any foe. At higher power, the antimagic properties of the\n"
"viper's bite grow even stronger.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一条紫色鳞片的蛇，其撕咬可以迅速耗掉敌人几乎所有的魔力。\n"
"法力越强，蝰蛇叮咬所具有的反魔法属性就越强。\n"

#. key: summon minor demon spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon minor demon spell"
msgid ""
"Summons between one and three minor (rank 5) demons.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤1到3个小恶魔（等级5）。\n"

#. key: summon mushrooms spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon mushrooms spell"
msgid ""
"Summons wandering mushrooms and deathcaps next to a targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"在一个目标生物旁召唤漫游的蘑菇和毒鹅膏。\n"

#. key: summon scarabs spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon scarabs spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth a swarm of death scarabs.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤出一群死亡圣甲虫。\n"

#. key: summon scorpions spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon scorpions spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth a swarm of venomous scorpions.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤出一群毒蝎子。\n"

#. key: summon small mammal spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon small mammal spell"
msgid ""
"Summons a rat, bat, or quokka to the caster's aid. Spell power increases the\n"
"chance of summoning a quokka.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一只老鼠、蝙蝠或短尾矮袋鼠来协助施法者。\n"
"法力越强，越有可能召唤出短尾矮袋鼠。\n"

#. key: summon spiders spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon spiders spell"
msgid ""
"Summons one or more spiders.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个或多个蜘蛛。\n"

#. key: summon tzitzimitl spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon tzitzimitl spell"
msgid ""
"Summons a tzitzimitl, a demon of disease and despair.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个蚀日星髅，一个疾病和绝望的恶魔。\n"

#. key: summon ufetubus spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon ufetubus spell"
msgid ""
"Summons multiple ufetubi; small, annoying demons.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤多个尖喙魔；小而恼人的恶魔。\n"

#. key: summon undead spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon undead spell"
msgid ""
"Summons multiple undead monsters, creating various ghosts, vampires, wraiths\n"
"and other lesser undead.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤多个亡灵怪物，生成各种鬼魂、吸血鬼、幽灵和其他次要的亡灵生物。\n"

#. key: summon vermin spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon vermin spell"
msgid ""
"Summons multiple rats, spiders, worms, and frogs.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤多只老鼠，蜘蛛、蠕虫和蛙类动物。\n"

#. key: summon water elementals spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon water elementals spell"
msgid ""
"Summons one or more water elementals.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个或多个水元素。\n"

#. key: swiftness spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:swiftness spell"
msgid ""
"Calls forth winds to greatly increase the caster's movement speed. After the\n"
"effect ends, the caster's movements will be sluggish for a time.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤风以极大地提高施法者的移动速度。效果结束后，施法者的动作会暂时变慢。\n"

#. key: symbol of torment spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:symbol of torment spell"
msgid ""
"Calls on the powers of darkness to cause agonising injury to any living or\n"
"holy thing in the caster's vicinity, cutting their health in half (partially\n"
"resisted by negative energy resistance). This damage is never directly lethal.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤黑暗力量对施法者附近的生物造成痛苦的伤害，使其生命值减半。\n"
"但永远不会直接杀死目标。\n"

#. key: teleport other spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:teleport other spell"
msgid ""
"Attempts to teleport a targeted creature out of the caster's sight, after a\n"
"short delay.\n"
msgstr ""
"随机传送一个目标生物。\n"

#. key: throw ally spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throw ally spell"
msgid ""
"Throws a nearby ally at the monster's foe, doing minimal damage and landing the\n"
"thrown monster nearby.\n"
msgstr ""
"将附近的一个友方投向怪物敌人，对其造成极少伤害，并使所扔出的友方落在附近。\n"

#. key: throw barbs spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throw barbs spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a volley of barbs at the target, skewering them and making movement\n"
"painful.\n"
msgstr ""
"向目标射出一连串的倒刺，刺穿他们，使他们的行动变得很痛苦。\n"

#. key: throw flame spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throw flame spell"
msgid ""
"Throws a small puff of flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"抛出一小团火焰。\n"

#. key: throw frost spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throw frost spell"
msgid ""
"Throws a small puff of frost.\n"
msgstr ""
"抛出一小团冰霜。\n"

#. key: throw icicle spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throw icicle spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a shard of ice. Due to its strong impact and cutting edges, half of its\n"
"damage bypasses cold resistance.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一个冰的碎片。由于它那强烈的冲击和切削，造成的一半伤害，寒抗无法抵御。\n"

#. key: throw klown pie spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throw klown pie spell"
msgid ""
"Throws a harmful yet strangely delicious pie that can inflict its victim with a\n"
"number of irresistible and debilitating temporary effects. These include\n"
"inducing vertigo, silence, fire vulnerability, fragility, blindness, or an\n"
"aversion to drinking potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"扔出一个有害而奇怪的美味馅饼，可能让受击者暂时遭受许多削弱效果。\n"
"这些效果包括导致眩晕、沉默、不耐火焰、衰竭或厌恶饮用药水。\n"
"可怕、透明的月亮派甚至能让任何冒险者变得像它精致的脆皮一样脆弱。\n"

#. key: thunderbolt spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:thunderbolt spell"
msgid ""
"Creates an arc of electricity.\n"
msgstr ""
"产生一道电弧。\n"

#. key: kiss of death spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kiss of death spell"
msgid ""
"Conjures forth a fragment of the caster's essence and twists it into a fragment\n"
"of death, painfully draining the victim. The caster, too, will find their health\n"
"reduced, until they gain enough experience to recover.\n"
msgstr ""
"生成施法者的精华碎片，并将其扭曲成死亡碎片，它会沉痛地衰竭受击者。\n"
"施法者也会发现他们的生命值降低了，直到他们获得足够的经验值才能恢复。\n"

#. key: tukima's dance spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tukima's dance spell"
msgid ""
"Animates the weapon of a targeted foe, ripping it from their hands and causing\n"
"it to attack them relentlessly. Once the target dies, the weapon will fall to\n"
"the ground shortly thereafter.\n"
"\n"
"Certain powerful named artefacts cannot be animated, and any properties that\n"
"require skill in evocations will not be active.\n"
msgstr ""
"给一个目标敌人的武器主注入生命，它会脱离敌人掌控，倒戈相向。\n"
"一旦目标死亡，武器很快就会落地。\n"
"\n"
"某些强大的有名字的神器不会被影响，任何需要激活技能的属性都不会被激活。\n"

#. key: upheaval spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:upheaval spell"
msgid ""
"Calls on the forces of nature to blast a small area with magma, ice, wind,\n"
"or rubble.\n"
msgstr ""
"呼唤自然力量，用岩浆、冰、风或碎石轰击一小片区域。\n"

#. key: vampiric draining spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vampiric draining spell"
msgid ""
"Steals the life of an adjacent living creature and grants it to the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"窃取邻近生物的生命并给予施法者。\n"

#. key: venom bolt spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:venom bolt spell"
msgid ""
"Fires a penetrating bolt of poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"发射一道穿透性的毒箭。\n"

#. key: virulence spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:virulence spell"
msgid ""
"Makes a targeted creature more vulnerable to poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"使一个目标生物更易受到毒害。\n"

#. key: momentum strike spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:momentum strike spell"
msgid ""
"Blasts a target with energy borrowed from the caster's own future movement. For\n"
"a short time afterward, the caster will be left immotile - unable to walk, fly\n"
"around, slither, etc. Only motile creatures can cast this spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"施法者从自己的未来移动中借来能量轰击目标。\n"
"在之后的一小段时间内，施法者将无法动弹——不能行走、飞行、滑翔等。\n"
"只有能动的生物才能施放这个法术。\n"

#. key: vhi's electric charge spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vhi's electric charge spell"
msgid ""
"Sends the caster hurtling at a chosen nearby enemy, launching a high-accuracy\n"
"melee attack on arrival. Additional electric damage will be dealt based on the\n"
"length of the charge, the power of the spell, and the physical damage of the\n"
"attack. The caster is wrapped in an envelope of twisted space, allowing them\n"
"to safely pass through creatures, traps, and harmful terrain, and to displace\n"
"creatures at their destination. The time taken by the spell is the greater of\n"
"the time normally needed to cast a spell or that needed to launch one melee\n"
"attack.\n"
msgstr ""
"让施法者冲向选定的一个附近敌人，在近身时发动高精度的近战攻击。\n"
"所造成的额外的电击伤害将根据蓄力的长度、法术的威力和物理攻击力进行结算。\n"
"施法者被包裹在扭曲的空间中，从而得以安全地穿过生物、陷阱和有害地形，\n"
"并置换在目的地的生物。\n"
"该法术所花费的时间是正常施展一个法术或发动一次近战攻击所需的时间中的较大者。\n"

#. key: vitrify spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vitrify spell"
msgid ""
"Renders a creature's body structure as brittle and fragile as glass, increasing\n"
"the damage they take from all sources.\n"
msgstr ""
"使一个生物的身体结构变得像玻璃那样易碎而脆弱，\n"
"任何来源的攻击都会对其造成更多伤害。\n"

#. key: vitrifying gaze spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vitrifying gaze spell"
msgid ""
"Irresistibly renders a creature's body structure as brittle and fragile as\n"
"glass, increasing the damage they take from all sources. It requires line of\n"
"sight but not line of fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"使一个生物的身体结构不可抗拒地变得像玻璃那样易碎而脆弱，\n"
"任何来源的攻击都会对其造成更多伤害。该法术依赖视线而不是射线。\n"

#. key: volley of thorns spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:volley of thorns spell"
msgid ""
"Launches a small hail of sharp thorns.\n"
msgstr ""
"射出一小束锋利的荆棘。\n"

#. key: wall of brambles spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wall of brambles spell"
msgid ""
"Causes brambles to rapidly grow nearby. They have almost no structural\n"
"strength, but the wicked thorns they bear make their removal difficult. Such\n"
"brambles are sparse enough that almost any missile can pass through unhindered.\n"
msgstr ""
"使附近荆棘迅速生长。它们几乎没有结构性力量，\n"
"但它们上面的恶刺使它们很难被清除。\n"
"这种荆棘是稀疏的，几乎任何飞弹都可以穿过它们。\n"

#. key: warning cry spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:warning cry spell"
msgid ""
"Generates a loud noise, alerting nearby enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"发出巨大的噪音，警示周围的敌人。\n"

#. key: waterstrike spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:waterstrike spell"
msgid ""
"Causes the water around or under the target to violently swirl, dealing damage.\n"
"It can affect targets standing in or flying above water.\n"
msgstr ""
"使目标周围或下方的水剧烈旋转，造成伤害。\n"
"它可以影响站在水中或在水上飞行的目标。\n"

#. key: weakening gaze spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:weakening gaze spell"
msgid ""
"Irresistibly weakens a creature's melee attacks for a period of time,\n"
"requiring line of sight but not line of fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"在一段时间内不可抗拒地削弱一个生物的近战攻击，它依赖视线而不是射线。\n"

#. key: wind blast spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wind blast spell"
msgid ""
"Causes a strong gust of wind, pushing away creatures and clouds in a cone. If\n"
"this causes a creature to collide with something, it will take damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"产生一股强风，在锥形区域里将生物和云团吹散。\n"

#. key: woodweal spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:woodweal spell"
msgid ""
"Draws on the vitality of leaf and bark to heal a large amount of damage.\n"
"Cannot be cast without a tree adjacent.\n"
msgstr ""
"利用树叶和树皮的生命力来治疗大量创伤。\n"
"如果没有相邻的树，则无法施放。\n"

#. key: word of recall spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:word of recall spell"
msgid ""
"Recalls intelligent allies from elsewhere on the same level to the caster,\n"
"after a short delay.\n"
msgstr ""
"在短时间延迟后，将同层的有智慧的友方召回到施法者那边。\n"

#. key: yara's violent unravelling spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:yara's violent unravelling spell"
msgid ""
"If cast upon a creature already blessed (or cursed) with magical enchantments,\n"
"those enchantments will be torn apart, transforming into a spray of\n"
"destructive mutagenic radiation. The victim and anyone adjacent will be\n"
"blasted and heavily deformed, weakening them and reducing their armour.\n"
"Summoned creatures are particularly vulnerable, as the enchantments binding\n"
"them to this plane will unravel and cause them to be dismissed immediately.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果施放在一个已经被魔法祝福（或诅咒）的生物身上，这些魔法将被撕碎，\n"
"转化为破坏性的诱变辐射。受害者和任何相邻的都会被炸伤并严重变形，\n"
"使他们虚弱并削弱他们的护甲。\n"
"被召唤的生物特别容易受到伤害，\n"
"因为将他们绑定到这个位面的魔法会瓦解并导致他们立刻消散。\n"

#. key: ashenzari
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ashenzari"
msgid ""
"While it seems inconceivable that the divine could be shackled, Ashenzari is\n"
"just that: bound to the sky for eternity, the unbudging god is all-knowing,\n"
"all-seeing. Devoted worshippers are allowed to grasp shreds of this knowledge\n"
"and foresight, but be warned: to Ashenzari, power and blessing and curse are\n"
"all the same thing.\n"
msgstr ""
"即使是神也会被囚禁，虽然这听起来有点不可思议，但艾申扎利正是如此——\n"
"祂被牢牢地钉在苍穹之上，遥望世间、通晓一切。\n"
"虔诚的信徒可以掌握这些远见卓识的碎片，但要小心：\n"
"对艾申扎利而言，力量、祝福与诅咒都是一回事。\n"

#. key: beogh
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:beogh"
msgid ""
"A god of outcasts, pariahs, and the dispossessed, Beogh's altars are rarely\n"
"found among those of other faiths, but Beogh's missionaries may always be sought\n"
"by those looking for a place to belong. Worshippers will find many friends\n"
"within the dungeon, and those who prove their strength to Beogh may gain\n"
"lifelong companions the equal of any adventurer. To worship Beogh is to believe\n"
"there is strength that transcends species and bloodline. To worship Beogh is to\n"
"be an orc.\n"
msgstr ""
"比欧弗是个邪神，很多住在地牢中的洞穴兽人都信奉于祂。\n"
"只有兽人会献身于比欧弗，并且他们必须用血祭去证明自己的忠诚。\n"
"狂热的比欧弗信徒会发现越来越多信徒凝聚在身边，\n"
"这是一个充满迹象和征兆的时代，兽人们越来越相信他们的弥赛亚即将降临。\n"

#. key: cheibriados
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cheibriados"
msgid ""
"Cheibriados is a god of deliberation. Those following Cheibriados travel more\n"
"slowly the further they progress in their faith, and are forbidden from using\n"
"any means to hasten themselves. In the process of so imitating their god, they\n"
"attain perfection of mind and body, and the mysteries of time unfold before\n"
"them. Especially devout followers may even momentarily abandon the flow of\n"
"time and its needless disturbances.\n"
msgstr ""
"切布理亚多是个审慎的神。切布理亚多的信徒在他们的信仰中会渐渐放慢脚步，\n"
"并且被禁止使用任何手段来加速自己。\n"
"在如此效仿他们的神的过程中，他们达到了身心的完美，时间的奥秘在他们面前展开。\n"
"特别虔诚的信徒甚至会暂时离弃时间的流动，免受尘事的打扰。\n"

#. key: dithmenos
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dithmenos"
msgid ""
"Dithmenos is the god of night and of things half-seen in flickering torchlight.\n"
"Worshipped by actors as often as thieves, followers of Dithmenos can learn to\n"
"control their own shadow as if it were an extension of their body - misdirecting\n"
"onlookers and acting upon the world with force as tangible as anything that has\n"
"ever been imagined lurking in the dark.\n"
msgstr ""
"隐没者迪斯姆诺希望一切成为黑暗。\n"
"迪斯姆诺的信徒对所处的环境中的阴影产生了一种奇怪而超凡脱俗的亲近感。\n"
"这个神鄙视物质世界，并不断试图侵占它。\n"
"因此迪斯姆诺奖励那些运用死亡和毁灭的人，同时用黑暗逐渐吞噬他们。\n"

#. key: elyvilon
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elyvilon"
msgid ""
"Elyvilon the Healer welcomes all kind souls prepared to help others. Those\n"
"individuals can expect to gain powerful healing abilities, by which they can\n"
"avoid bloodshed. Elyvilon appreciates exploration of the dungeon. Elyvilon's\n"
"followers can convert to the Shining One or Zin while keeping some piety.\n"
msgstr ""
"治愈者艾利维隆欢迎一切乐于助人的善人。这些信徒可以获得强大的治疗能力，\n"
"从而避免流血。艾利维隆会赏识在地牢中探索的行为。\n"
"艾利维隆的信徒在转而皈依光明神或者辛时，仍能保留一部分的虔诚值。\n"

#. key: fedhas
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fedhas"
msgid ""
"Fedhas is the god of plant and fungal life. Followers are prevented from\n"
"harming any species under Fedhas' protection. In return, Fedhas grants a number\n"
"of abilities that promote the growth of plants and fungi. These abilities may\n"
"incidentally prove useful to adventurers.\n"
msgstr ""
"费德哈是植物与真菌类生物的神祗。费德哈禁止祂的信徒伤害受祂保护的物种。\n"
"作为回报，费德哈赐予祂的信徒们让植物和真菌加速生长的能力。\n"
"对冒险者来说，这些能力可能会派上用场。\n"

#. key: gozag
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gozag"
msgid ""
"Gozag Ym Sagoz the Greedy teaches that the world belongs to the rich. Those\n"
"accepting this principle may exchange their gold for divine assistance.\n"
"Followers of Gozag do not earn piety; the only way to impress this god is by\n"
"amassing a fortune, and worshippers may request as much assistance as they can\n"
"afford. Fortunately, Gozag's worshippers are said to have the touch of gold.\n"
msgstr ""
"贪婪者哥萨戈·亿·赛格斯教导说，世界属于富人。\n"
"接受这一原则的人可以用他们的财富换取神的帮助。\n"
"哥萨戈的信徒不会获得虔诚值；给这个神留下印象的唯一方法是积累财富，\n"
"信徒会尽可能祈求他们所能负担得起的帮助。\n"
"幸运的是，据说哥萨戈的信徒拥有金手指。\n"

#. key: hepliaklqana
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hepliaklqana"
msgid ""
"Hepliaklqana the Forgotten accepts the worship of those who would remember\n"
"their forebears, and fight alongside the greatest of them all. Acolytes of\n"
"Hepliaklqana sacrifice a small part of their life essence to manifest their\n"
"ancestor into the world; as they explore and form new experiences, they will\n"
"find themselves able to shape and control their ancestor's memory, eventually\n"
"bringing them into the ranks of the mythical heroes.\n"
msgstr ""
"遗忘者惠普利亚卡纳那接受那些记得他们祖先的人的崇拜，\n"
"并与他们中最伟大的人并肩战斗。惠普利亚卡纳的信徒舍弃自己生命精华的一小部分，\n"
"以在世界中显现他们的祖先。随着他们不断探索和积累经验，\n"
"他们将发现自己能够塑造和控制祖先的记忆，最终把他们引入神话英雄之列。\n"

#. key: ignis
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ignis"
msgid ""
"Ignis the Dying Flame offers followers power over fire in many forms. All of\n"
"Ignis' power is offered unconditionally to any who would deign to worship, but\n"
"once used, it can never be replenished. Ignis' other worshippers deserted long\n"
"ago; the divine fire burns low, and soon it will go out.\n"
msgstr ""
"曳焰伊格尼斯为信徒提供了多种形式的制约火焰的力量。\n"
"伊格尼斯会将所有力量都无条件地提供给任何有意崇拜祂的人，但一旦使用，\n"
"就永远无法补充。其他伊格尼斯的崇拜者早已被摈弃了；\n"
"圣火烧得很低，很快就会熄灭。\n"

#. key: jiyva
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jiyva"
msgid ""
"Jiyva is the ancient deity of the slimes. Followers are expected to\n"
"support the spread and satiation of their fellow slimes by allowing them to\n"
"consume items, and are prevented from harming any slimes. Especially favoured\n"
"followers will become as shapeless as their god, mutating wildly.\n"
msgstr ""
"吉瓦是黏液古神。\n"
"信徒应满足其黏液同伴吞食物品以扩张和果腹的需要，不得伤害任何黏液。\n"
"特别受眷顾的信徒将会变得如同他们的神一样没有定形，他们会疯狂地变异。\n"

#. key: kikubaaqudgha
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kikubaaqudgha"
msgid ""
"Kikubaaqudgha is a terrible Demon-God, served by those who wish to indulge in\n"
"the powers of death. An evil god, Kikubaaqudgha requires worshippers to cause\n"
"the death and destruction of as many creatures as possible. In exchange,\n"
"Kikubaaqudgha offers great assistance to the aspiring necromancer: a supply of\n"
"useful bodies, knowledge of dark magic, and protection against necromantic\n"
"backlash.\n"
msgstr ""
"希望掌控死亡之力的人往往会选择侍奉恐怖的魔神——奇库巴库哈。\n"
"作为一个邪神，奇库巴库哈要求祂的信徒尽可能杀死、毁灭各类生物。\n"
"作为交换，奇库巴库哈为有抱负的死灵法师给出了极大的帮助：\n"
"提供有用的躯体、黑魔法知识，并防止死灵法术的反噬。\n"

#. key: lugonu
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lugonu"
msgid ""
"Banished to the chaotic realm of the Abyss, Lugonu the Unformed seeks followers\n"
"to spread bloodshed and corruption in the overworld. Those who gain Lugonu's\n"
"favour will be granted some of the power of the Abyss itself, allowing them to\n"
"call forth eldritch horrors, and even to travel between the overworld and the\n"
"Abyss at will.\n"
msgstr ""
"被放逐到深渊的混沌领域，无形之神卢戈努寻求信徒在上界散播杀戮和腐败。\n"
"那些得到卢格努眷顾的信徒，将被赋予一些深渊本身的力量，\n"
"让他们能够召唤出怪异的恐怖，甚至可以自行在上界和深渊之间穿行。\n"

#. key: makhleb
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:makhleb"
msgid ""
"Makhleb the Destroyer is a fearsome deity of bloodshed and mortification of the\n"
"flesh. Followers are expected to cleanse others by inflicting suffering and\n"
"death on them in Makhleb's name. Dedicated followers may also access the raw\n"
"energies and hell-spawned servants of chaos, so that they may better break the\n"
"impure world and its false laws for their evil god's glory.\n"
msgstr ""
"毁灭者马科列布是位可怕的流血、坏疽之神。\n"
"马科列布要求信徒以祂的名义，通过带去痛苦和死亡来净化别人。\n"
"虔诚的信徒会接触到原始能量和地狱产生的混沌仆从，\n"
"以更好地打破这个不纯洁的世界及其错误的法则，彰显他们的邪神的荣耀。\n"

#. key: nemelex xobeh
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nemelex xobeh"
msgid ""
"Nemelex is a strange and unpredictable chaotic trickster god, whose powers are\n"
"invoked through magical packs of cards painted in the ichor of demons. Followers\n"
"will be granted decks of cards as they traverse the dungeon, and are encouraged\n"
"to trust in the cards to provide them with divine assistance. However, the\n"
"Trickster can also ensure that fortune favours the bold.\n"
msgstr ""
"尼姆雷斯是一个奇怪、难以捉摸、混沌的杂耍者之神，\n"
"祂的力量是借助有着魔力、涂着恶魔腐液的牌来激活的。\n"
"信徒在地牢穿行时将获得一副牌，并被鼓励着相信这些牌能为他们提供神圣的帮助。\n"
"然而，杂耍者之神也会让命运眷顾勇者。\n"

#. key: okawaru
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:okawaru"
msgid ""
"Okawaru is a dangerous and powerful god of battle. Followers are expected to\n"
"constantly prove themselves in combat, and may channel Okawaru's might to\n"
"enhance their prowess. Okawaru demands that followers prove themselves by their\n"
"own strength alone, and so worshippers are forbidden from gaining allies by any\n"
"means. Okawaru pays little heed to easy victories, but will reward worshippers\n"
"for heroic feats against mighty foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"奥卡瓦鲁是一位危险而强大的战斗之神。\n"
"奥卡瓦鲁要求信徒在战斗中不断证明自己，并注入其力量来增强他们自身的实力。\n"
"奥卡瓦鲁需要信徒仅凭自己的力量证明自己，因此禁止信徒以任何方式获得盟友。\n"
"奥卡瓦鲁不太在乎轻松的胜利，\n"
"但会奖赏那些在对抗强大敌人时做出英勇壮举的信徒。\n"

#. key: pakellas
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pakellas"
msgid ""
"Pakellas the Inventive believes in the supremacy of devices, magical or\n"
"otherwise, over spells and other forms of magic. Followers, although cut off\n"
"from ambient magical power, are provided with magical energy to empower their\n"
"devices so long as they use them to assert Pakellas' supremacy. Pakellas will\n"
"grant devout worshippers access to increasingly powerful devices.\n"
msgstr ""
"发明者帕克拉斯深信无论是魔力还是其他方面，装置才是至高无上的，\n"
"远胜于咒语和其他形式的魔法。信徒尽管被切断了与周围魔法力量的联系，\n"
"但被赐予魔法能量以供给他们的装置，只要将它们用于维护帕克拉斯的至高无上。\n"
"帕克拉斯会赐予虔诚的信徒越来越强大的装置。\n"

#. key: qazlal
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:qazlal"
msgid ""
"Qazlal Stormbringer is a violent god of tempests, who delights in unleashing\n"
"the forces of nature against the unsuspecting. Those who invite Qazlal's gaze\n"
"will find themselves the eye in a storm of elemental destruction, from which\n"
"only their God can protect them. Pious worshippers of Qazlal will gain the\n"
"ability to direct and control the destructive might of the storm.\n"
msgstr ""
"兴风者卡兹拉尔是一个狂暴的风暴之神，喜欢释放自然的力量来对付没有戒心的人。\n"
"那些请求卡兹拉尔注视的人会发现他们的眼睛在毁灭性的风暴之中，\n"
"只有他们的神才能保护他们。\n"
"虔诚的卡兹拉尔信徒将获得指挥和控制风暴破坏性力量的能力。\n"

#. key: ru
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ru"
msgid ""
"Of all the gods, only Ru opposed creation. Not as folly, but as distraction.\n"
"Initiates of Ru can open channels to the powers underlying the visible world by\n"
"renouncing the fetters that bind them here. These sacrifices are not made to\n"
"Ru, but rather given up freely and permanently. Having made such sacrifices,\n"
"initiates will become able to draw upon this immense power to aid themselves,\n"
"eventually gaining the ability to unleash its destructive might against their\n"
"foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"在所有神灵中，只有入反对创造。不是因为愚蠢，而是那样会分心。\n"
"入的启蒙者可以通过舍弃束缚他们的枷锁，打开可见世界的隐含力量的通道。\n"
"这些舍弃不是为入做出的，而是自愿、永久放弃的。\n"
"做出了这样的舍弃后，信徒将利用这种巨大的力量来帮助自己，\n"
"并最终获得释放毁灭性力量的能力来对抗敌人。\n"

#. key: sif muna
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sif muna"
msgid ""
"Sif Muna the Loreminder is a contemplative but powerful deity, served by those\n"
"who seek magical knowledge. Followers who triumph over their foes can call upon\n"
"the Loreminder for magical power and the ability to cast spells beyond their\n"
"magical training. The devout are rewarded with a supply of spellbooks taken\n"
"directly from Sif Muna's legendary library.\n"
msgstr ""
"学识之主席夫·穆纳是一位沉稳而强大的神祗，追求魔法知识的人会崇拜祂。\n"
"打败敌人的信徒可以请求学识之主来获得魔法力量和施展未训练的法术的能力。\n"
"虔诚的信徒会获得直接取自席夫·穆纳的传奇图书馆的魔法书作为回报。\n"

#. key: the shining one
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the shining one"
msgid ""
"Followers of the Shining One are bound to the code of the honourable warrior,\n"
"soldiers in their god's eternal crusade against evil. For forsaking dark magic\n"
"and underhanded tactics, the Shining One rewards them and their allies with the\n"
"power they need to slay demons and the undead. Especially devout warriors can\n"
"even call upon angels in times of need. The Shining One's followers can convert\n"
"to Elyvilon or Zin while keeping some piety.\n"
msgstr ""
"光明神的信徒必须遵守光荣战士的守则，他们是他们的神对抗邪恶的永恒圣战的战士。\n"
"由于抵触黑暗魔法和卑鄙的战术，\n"
"光明神赐予信徒及其盟友杀死恶魔和亡灵所需的力量。\n"
"特别虔诚的战士甚至可以在需要的时候召唤天使。\n"
"光明神的信徒在转而皈依艾利维隆或者辛时，仍能保留一部分的虔诚值。\n"

#. key: trog
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trog"
msgid ""
"Trog is an ancient god of anger and violence. Followers are expected to kill in\n"
"Trog's name, and especially to slay wizards. In return, worshippers of Trog\n"
"gain the ability to go berserk at will in combat, and will be granted\n"
"assistance in the form of powerful weapons and mighty allies. Followers are\n"
"absolutely forbidden the use of spell magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"特洛戈是愤怒和暴力古神。特洛戈的信徒要以祂之名杀死敌人，特别是要杀死巫师。\n"
"作为回报，信徒们会获得在战斗中自行狂暴的能力，\n"
"并会被赐予强大的武器和强力的盟友作为援助。特洛戈不允许祂的信徒使用魔法。\n"

#. key: uskayaw
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:uskayaw"
msgid ""
"Uskayaw the Reveller is a god of ecstatic dance. In the dungeon, Uskayaw\n"
"appreciates the passion and rhythm of combat, rewarding followers for each\n"
"strike they deliver and for the damage they deal their foes. The longer the\n"
"dance continues, the greater powers Uskayaw offers. When the dance ends,\n"
"Uskayaw quickly loses interest.\n"
msgstr ""
"狂欢者乌斯卡亚是狂舞之神。在地牢中，乌斯卡亚喜欢战斗的激情和节奏，\n"
"会在每一次打击和对敌人造成伤害时给予信徒奖励。舞蹈持续的时间越长，\n"
"乌斯卡亚提供的力量就越大。当舞蹈结束时，乌斯卡亚会很快失去兴趣。\n"

#. key: vehumet
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vehumet"
msgid ""
"Vehumet is a god of the destructive powers of magic. Followers will gain divine\n"
"assistance in commanding the hermetic arts, and the most favoured stand to gain\n"
"access to some of the fearsome spells in Vehumet's library. One's devotion to\n"
"Vehumet can be proven by the causing of as much carnage and destruction as\n"
"possible.\n"
msgstr ""
"维胡梅特是魔法毁灭力量之神。信徒在掌握魔法技艺方面会获得神助，\n"
"而那些最受祂眷顾的信徒会取得维胡梅特的图书馆中一些可怕的魔法。\n"
"信徒必须尽其所能制造屠杀及破坏来证明自身对维胡梅特的忠诚。\n"

#. key: wu jian
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wu jian"
msgid ""
"The Wu Jian Council is a congregation of martial monks, ascended to divinity\n"
"after battling their way out of the afterlife. Disciples of the Council are\n"
"able to execute acrobatic martial maneuvers, such as wall jumps, spinning\n"
"attacks and punishing lunges. They will eventually become able to request\n"
"help in the form of a storm of heavenly clouds.\n"
msgstr ""
"无间门派由武僧聚集而建。武僧通过与来世斗争后可踏入神坛。\n"
"门徒可以做出特技般的动作，比如墙跳、旋转攻击以及惩戒弓步。\n"
"他们最终可以以天云风暴的形态获得神的助力。\n"

#. key: xom
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:xom"
msgid ""
"Xom is a wild and unpredictable god of chaos, who seeks not worshippers but\n"
"playthings with which to toy. Many choose to follow Xom in the hope of\n"
"receiving fabulous rewards and mighty powers, but Xom is nothing if not\n"
"capricious. There is nothing a follower can do to influence Xom's mood.\n"
msgstr ""
"佐姆是个狂暴且难以捉摸的混沌之神，他不在乎崇拜者而是在寻找用来玩耍的东西。\n"
"许多人选择跟随佐姆想得到丰厚的回报和强大的力量，然而不反复无常就不是佐姆了。\n"
"信徒无法做任何事情来影响佐姆的情绪。\n"

#. key: yredelemnul
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:yredelemnul"
msgid ""
"Cast down by the good gods eons ago, Yredelemnul seeks to despoil their\n"
"creations and chain all living souls within their inexorable grip. Followers who\n"
"would conquer in Yredelemnul's name are granted the power to reap an army of the\n"
"dead and bind powerful souls into eternal service - provided they can sweep\n"
"across the land in a tide as inexorable as their god.\n"
msgstr ""
"黑暗神伊莱德莱姆努尔被那些寻求死亡和灵魂力量的信徒崇拜着。\n"
"信徒可以获得亡灵奴隶军团和许多其他有用的力量，以更好地利用生者的灵魂。\n"
"伊莱德莱姆努尔特别宠爱那些在自己周围聚集大量灵魂的人。\n"

#. key: zin
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zin"
msgid ""
"Zin is a god of discipline. Followers must remain pure of body and soul,\n"
"refraining from dark magic and chaotic acts. They must also tithe a fraction of\n"
"all gold gained, preferably followed by donations of more. In exchange,\n"
"worshippers may invoke Zin's wrath upon sinners, and eventually gain various\n"
"divine protections. Zin's followers can convert to Elyvilon or the Shining One\n"
"while keeping some piety.\n"
msgstr ""
"辛是法则之神。信徒必须保持纯洁的身体和灵魂，戒除黑暗魔法和混沌的行为。\n"
"他们还必须将所获得的全部黄金中的一部分用于什一税，最好供奉更多黄金。\n"
"作为交换，信徒可以唤起辛对罪人的愤怒，并最终获得各种神圣的保护。\n"
"辛的信徒在转而皈依艾利维隆或者辛时，仍能保留一部分的虔诚值。\n"

#. key: ashenzari powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ashenzari powers"
msgid ""
"Ashenzari exhorts followers to curse their possessions, periodically offering\n"
"these curses to worshippers as they explore. These curses grant improvements\n"
"to specific skills, but cursed equipment cannot normally be enchanted and can\n"
"only be removed by shattering it forever. As worshippers equip more cursed\n"
"equipment, Ashenzari will grant increasing knowledge of the surrounding dungeon.\n"
"Eventually, Ashenzari will reveal the invisible, grant clarity of mind, and\n"
"protect worshippers from the Dungeon's malevolent forces.\n"
msgstr ""
"艾申扎利劝诫信徒诅咒他们的东西，在他们进行探索时会向他们定期提供这些诅咒。\n"
"这些诅咒可以提升特定技能，但被诅咒的装备不能被附魔，只能通过永久粉碎才能消除。\n"
"如果信徒装备更多被诅咒的物品，艾申扎利就会赐予他们更强的对周围地牢的感知力。\n"
"最终，艾申扎利将揭示隐形的东西，让头脑清晰，并保护信徒免遭地牢的恶意。\n"

#. key: beogh powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:beogh powers"
msgid ""
"Worshippers will gain the power to call down Beogh's wrath upon their\n"
"oppressors, and other orcs will start to see them as one of their own.\n"
"Especially promising adherents will find themselves beset by rivals for Beogh's\n"
"favour, but overcoming these trials without fleeing will gain them loyal\n"
"companions whom Beogh will resurrect time and time again, so long as they\n"
"continue to fight and avenge in Beogh's name. A true chosen one may even rally\n"
"an entire orcish army to avenge a wrongful death.\n"
msgstr ""
"比欧弗的信徒可以对敌人进行惩戒，甚至可以获得自己的兽人随从，\n"
"他们可能会在战斗中受到比欧弗的祝福，并可根据需要会被召回。\n"
"最终，信徒可以在水上行走。比欧弗有时会直接干预以挽救信徒的性命，\n"
"比欧弗的选民最终甚至能复活其他死去的兽人。\n"

#. key: cheibriados powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cheibriados powers"
msgid ""
"Followers of Cheibriados move more slowly as they gain favour. As they move\n"
"slower, worshippers of Cheibriados are granted increased attributes.\n"
"Cheibriados rewards the faithful with the power to slow other creatures and the\n"
"power to briefly distort the flow of time. Devout worshippers will gain the\n"
"ability to inflict great harm on all those who move more quickly than they do,\n"
"and finally the ability to step out of the flow of time entirely.\n"
msgstr ""
"对切布理亚多的追随者而言，越受宠幸，移动速度就越慢。\n"
"切布理亚多的信徒越慢，就越会被赋予属性。\n"
"切布理亚多会赐予忠诚的信徒减慢其他生物和瞬间扭曲时间流的能力。\n"
"虔诚的信徒将获得对所有移动速度比他们更快的怪物造成巨大伤害的能力，\n"
"并最终能完全跳脱时间的流动。\n"

#. key: dithmenos powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dithmenos powers"
msgid ""
"Followers of Dithmenos are surrounded by an unnatural quiet, which helps the\n"
"sounds they make go unnoticed. As they rise in devotion, they will find their\n"
"own shadow begins to imitate some of their actions, attacking when they attack\n"
"and even casting shadowy magics that mimic the form - if not the substance - of\n"
"whichever schools of magic they had been utilising.\n"
"\n"
"More devout worshippers additionally gain the ability to swap places with their\n"
"shadow to mislead enemies, grasp other beings' shadows to unleash their magic on\n"
"the worshipper's behalf, and finally call down a night so dark that it hides all\n"
"denizens of the dungeon from each other.\n"
msgstr ""
"迪斯姆诺的信徒不断被阴影笼罩，阴影的范围反映着他们的虔诚程度。\n"
"迪斯姆诺赐予信徒立刻步入周围生物的阴影的能力，\n"
"并在受到攻击时偶尔会用黑烟掩护追随者。当迪斯姆诺的信徒足够虔诚时，\n"
"会发现自己的影子能够主动出击，并最终自己也获得转化为暗影形态的能力。\n"

#. key: elyvilon powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elyvilon powers"
msgid ""
"The Healer offers followers a number of means to heal themselves from damage\n"
"and other ill effects. Followers may also attempt to pacify hostile monsters\n"
"and turn them neutral. Elyvilon may directly intervene to save a follower's\n"
"life, and if there has been no such intervention recently, is sure to prevent\n"
"a killing blow against especially pious followers. Elyvilon may also\n"
"occasionally protect the follower's allies from death.\n"
msgstr ""
"治愈之神赋予信徒各种方法来治愈自己的伤口和其他负面状态。\n"
"艾利维隆也能让信徒治疗敌对的怪物，以期能让它们不再与信徒为敌。\n"
"艾利维隆有时会直接出手以拯救信徒的性命，如果近期没有这样的干预，\n"
"一定会抵挡对特别虔诚的信徒的致命打击。\n"
"艾利维隆偶尔也会保护信徒的盟友免于死亡。\n"

#. key: fedhas powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fedhas powers"
msgid ""
"Plants and fungi will not attack Fedhas' worshippers without provocation.\n"
"Worshippers may walk through plants or fungi, and even fire missiles or spells\n"
"through them without causing harm. Fedhas grants powers to temporarily grow a\n"
"menagerie of plant allies whose strength and duration increase with Invocations\n"
"skill. Worshippers may grow a protective wall of briar patches as well as\n"
"ballistomycetes that fire damaging spores whose explosions confuse living\n"
"creatures. Devout followers can overgrow a stretch of solid terrain with a\n"
"cluster of plant allies or even summon a mighty oklob plant.\n"
msgstr ""
"植物和真菌不会主动攻击费德哈的信徒。\n"
"信徒可以穿过植物或真菌，甚至射出的弹药和法术也能穿过它们，而不对其造成伤害。\n"
"费德哈会赐予临时生成植物盟友的能力，\n"
"这些植物盟友的力量和存在时间会随着祈祷技能的提升而增加。\n"
"信徒能够生成一道用于防卫的荆棘之墙，\n"
"还会生成弹道真菌，它们会发射破坏性孢子，其爆炸会让生物混乱。\n"
"虔诚的信徒可以在一片坚实的土地上长满植物盟友，或是召唤出强大的酸箭草。\n"

#. key: gozag powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gozag powers"
msgid ""
"For Gozag, both flesh and spirit are inferior to wealth, and therefore all\n"
"monsters are turned to gold upon death. Other monsters may then be briefly\n"
"distracted by imaginings of great wealth. Stalwarts can purchase immediate help\n"
"in the form of potions, and may also pay to attract shopkeepers into the\n"
"dungeon. Particularly well-off adherents may bribe the inhabitants of a branch\n"
"of the dungeon to turn a blind eye to their presence, or even to change their\n"
"allegiance.\n"
msgstr ""
"对哥萨戈而言，肉体和灵魂都比不上财富，所有怪物在死时都会被祂转化成金币。\n"
"其他怪物可能会因为贪财而暂时分散注意力。\n"
"忠实的信徒可以通过购买药水即时地获取帮助，也可以花钱吸引店主入驻地牢。\n"
"特别富有的信徒可以贿赂整个地牢分支，使怪物对他睁一只眼闭一只眼，甚至会投诚。\n"

#. key: hepliaklqana powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hepliaklqana powers"
msgid ""
"Hepliaklqana's worshippers are served by a guardian formed from a part of their\n"
"life essence, in the shape of their greatest ancestor. This ancestor is at\n"
"first remembered as they were at the start of their fabled adventures, but will\n"
"advance in skill as their descendant does. Hepliaklqana always allows followers\n"
"to recall their ancestor to their side, and, even if the ancestor is destroyed,\n"
"Hepliaklqana will call it forth again not long after. Further advancement in\n"
"Hepliaklqana's service allows worshippers to restore and strengthen their\n"
"ancestor, to swap them with other creatures, and to choose how to remember\n"
"their life's talents.\n"
msgstr ""
"惠普利亚卡纳的信徒的生命精华的一部分会形成守卫者，\n"
"守卫者会以他们最伟大的先祖的形态，效力于他们。先祖从记忆中刚浮现时，\n"
"和传说中他们在冒险启程时那样弱小，但也会像他们后代一样不断提升技能。\n"
"惠普利亚卡纳总是能让信徒将他们的先祖召唤到他们身边，即使先祖被毁灭，\n"
"惠普利亚卡纳也会在不久召唤他。惠普利亚卡纳进一步助力后，\n"
"能让信徒恢复、增强其先祖，还能让其他生物与他们交换位置，\n"
"并能选择如何铭刻他们一生的才能。\n"

#. key: ignis powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ignis powers"
msgid ""
"Followers can armour themselves in flame, call a swarm of foxfires against their\n"
"foes, or let Ignis' heat lift them to another level of the dungeon. However, the\n"
"guttering flames of Ignis' power will only sustain a limited number of\n"
"invocations before only flickering embers remain. No matter how depleted, Ignis\n"
"will always grant followers resistance to fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"信徒可以在火焰中武装自己，召唤出狐火群攻击敌人，\n"
"或者凭借伊格尼斯的热量将其抬升到另一层地牢。然而，\n"
"伊格尼斯那摇曳火焰的力量的唤起次数是有限的，最后只剩下颤动的余烬。\n"
"但是不论怎样被衰竭，伊格尼斯始终会给予信徒对火的抗性。\n"

#. key: jiyva powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jiyva powers"
msgid ""
"Jiyva will gradually fill the dungeon with jellies. These and any other fellow\n"
"slimes will rapidly consume nearby items, as well as slowly consuming items from\n"
"elsewhere in the dungeon. As they spread slime across more of the dungeon, Jiyva\n"
"will grant followers increasingly rapid health and magic regeneration, and will\n"
"begin mutating them to better reflect Jiyva's image. Followers will later become\n"
"able to call forth acidic ooze from the walls of the dungeon, and to turn\n"
"monsters to slime with a touch.\n"
msgstr ""
"吉瓦会用胶冻逐渐填充地牢。\n"
"你的黏液同伴会迅速吞食附近的物品并慢慢吞食地牢其他地方的物品。\n"
"随着他们在地牢的更多地方散播黏液，吉瓦能让信徒越来越快地恢复健康和魔力，\n"
"并开始使他们变异，以更好地反映吉瓦的形象。\n"
"信徒最终能够从地牢的墙壁上唤起酸性软泥，并能通过触碰将怪物变成黏液。\n"

#. key: kikubaaqudgha powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kikubaaqudgha powers"
msgid ""
"Kikubaaqudgha will enhance servants' necromantic prowess with gifts of\n"
"Necromancy spells. Kikubaaqudgha will protect followers from the effects of\n"
"necromantic miscasts and death curses, and may even shield them from unholy\n"
"torment. Followers can unearth dying wretches as necromantic fodder, and may\n"
"invoke the sign of ruin to harm their enemies. Kikubaaqudgha will eventually\n"
"allow followers to either receive knowledge of the most forbidden necromantic\n"
"magic, or to have their weapon imbued with pain.\n"
msgstr ""
"奇库巴库哈会赐予仆人死灵法术，以提升其死灵术能力。\n"
"奇库巴库哈会保护信徒免受死灵术失误和死亡诅咒的影响，\n"
"甚至能让他们抵御邪恶的折磨。信徒可以发掘垂死的可怜虫作为死灵的饲料，\n"
"并能降祸折磨。奇库巴库哈最终会允许信徒获取最禁忌的死灵知识，\n"
"或者给他们的武器注入痛楚。\n"

#. key: lugonu powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lugonu powers"
msgid ""
"Followers of Lugonu gain powers to depart the Abyss at will, to banish monsters\n"
"there, and to flee back inside when needed. Lugonu will also banish nearby foes\n"
"if any other god attempts to interfere with their followers. Later, followers\n"
"will be able to corrupt the ordered world, opening a gate for creatures\n"
"of the Abyss to pass through, and to gate themselves directly into this realm of\n"
"chaos. Lugonu will protect followers who unwield weapons imbued with the\n"
"distorting energies of the Abyss, and eventually will offer to distort a\n"
"follower's melee weapon. Lugonu expects followers to spread unceasing\n"
"chaos in the overworld, and as such does not grant piety to worshippers while\n"
"they remain in the Abyss itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"卢格努的追随者可以自行离开深渊、把敌人放逐到深渊或在需要时逃往深渊。\n"
"如果有任何其他神试图干预卢戈努的追随者，卢戈努也会放逐附近的敌人。之后，\n"
"追随者将腐化有序的世界，为深渊生物打开大门，让他们直接进入这个混沌的领域。\n"
"卢戈努会保护卸下注入深渊扭曲能量的武器的追随者，\n"
"并最终能让追随者的一个近战武器烙上扭曲印记。\n"
"卢戈努希望追随者在上界不断散播混乱，因此，当他们留在深渊中时，不会得到虔诚值。\n"

#. key: makhleb powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:makhleb powers"
msgid ""
"Makhleb offers followers the ability to unleash bolts of chaotic destruction at\n"
"the cost of their own health as well as call in help from powerful (if sometimes\n"
"uncooperative) demons. The most devoted of worshippers will eventually be gifted\n"
"with knowledge of Infernal Marks, allowing them to ritually brand their own\n"
"bodies in exchange for one of the Destroyer's many hellish powers.\n"
"\n"
"Makhleb's powers all come with a price in blood. However, Makhleb will grant\n"
"followers renewed health in return for killing beings of all kinds.\n"
msgstr ""
"马科列布为信徒提供了通过混沌、破坏性攻击造成巨大伤害的手段。\n"
"信徒也可以召唤强大的恶魔以寻求帮助。获得马科列布的力量要以血为代价。\n"
"然而，马科列布将给予信徒新的生命力，作为杀死各种生物的回报。\n"

#. key: nemelex xobeh powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nemelex xobeh powers"
msgid ""
"The Trickster's followers gain various ways to influence fate when playing\n"
"their cards. The effects of the cards will be more powerful with higher piety\n"
"and with greater Invocations skill. Later, followers will gain powerful\n"
"abilities to manipulate the cards, allowing them to choose one of three drawn\n"
"cards, to gain the effects of multiple cards at once, and finally to stack\n"
"decks and re-order their contents.\n"
msgstr ""
"杂耍者的信徒在玩他们的牌时获得了各种影响命运的路径。\n"
"有着更高的虔诚值和更高的祈祷技能将使牌的效果更强大。随后，\n"
"信徒将获得强大的能力来操控牌，能够抽三张选一张、甚至能同时得到多张牌的效果，\n"
"并最后能堆叠牌组、将其重新排序。\n"

#. key: okawaru powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:okawaru powers"
msgid ""
"Followers of Okawaru will gain the ability to temporarily increase their skills\n"
"in combat, and, much later, to deal much faster blows. Okawaru will eventually\n"
"gift followers with ammunition, weapons and armour. The most favoured of\n"
"Okawaru may challenge their foes to honourable single combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"奥卡瓦鲁的信徒将获得在战斗中暂时提升技能的能力，\n"
"后面还能以更快的速度进行攻击。最终奥卡瓦鲁会赐予信徒弹药、武器和护甲。\n"
"最受奥卡瓦鲁宠幸的信徒，可以与他的敌人进行一场荣誉的决斗。\n"

#. key: pakellas powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pakellas powers"
msgid ""
"Followers of Pakellas do not regenerate their magic power naturally, and are\n"
"forbidden from using external means to do so; instead, they are granted\n"
"magical energy on killing beings. They may use increasing amounts of magical\n"
"energy to strengthen their devices, temporarily granting them additional\n"
"power, and can also use their magical energy to recharge their devices.\n"
"Sufficiently devout followers will receive new devices from Pakellas, and may\n"
"eventually petition Pakellas to personally charge one of their devices beyond\n"
"its normal limits.\n"
msgstr ""
"帕克拉斯的信徒不能自然地恢复他们的魔力，并被禁止使用外部手段这样做；\n"
"取而代之的是，他们被赋予了通过杀死生物获得魔力的能力。\n"
"他们可以用越来越多的魔法能量来强化他们的装置，暂时赋予它们额外的力量，\n"
"也可以使用魔法能量来为装置充能。\n"
"非常虔诚的信徒将获得帕克拉斯赐予的新装置，\n"
"并最终可以请求帕克拉斯对他们的装置进行超出正常限制的充能。\n"

#. key: qazlal powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:qazlal powers"
msgid ""
"Followers of Qazlal are protected from all clouds. As a follower of Qazlal\n"
"gains divine favour, they are slowly surrounded by a loud storm. In addition to\n"
"generating noise, the storm causes elemental clouds to appear near followers,\n"
"blocks attacks, and (for the particularly devout) deflects incoming\n"
"projectiles. Qazlal allows followers to incite nature against their foes,\n"
"causing a localised natural disturbance or, for particularly devout followers,\n"
"a more widespread disaster. Followers of Qazlal eventually gain temporary\n"
"resistances after taking damage, and can give life to clouds, turning them into\n"
"allied elementals.\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹拉尔的信徒会受到保护，免受云的侵袭。当卡兹拉尔的信徒获得神的恩宠时，\n"
"会被一场巨大的风暴慢慢包围。除了产生噪音，风暴还能使元素云出现在信徒附近，\n"
"阻挡攻击和（对于那些特别虔诚的人来说）偏转来袭的射弹。\n"
"卡兹拉尔能让信徒煽动大自然的力量对抗他们的敌人，造成局部的自然干扰，\n"
"而那些特别虔诚的信徒，还能释出更大范围的灾难。\n"
"最终卡兹拉尔的信徒会在受到伤害后获得临时抗性，\n"
"并能给云带来生命，让他们成为友方元素。\n"

#. key: ru powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ru powers"
msgid ""
"Ru will offer followers a number of sacrifices as they travel the dungeon. On\n"
"accepting these sacrifices, followers will gradually gain an aura of immense\n"
"power. This aura will initially cause foes that attempt to harm them to falter\n"
"and become stricken with maladies. After making further sacrifices, followers\n"
"will be able to draw on this power to restore their health and magic, or to\n"
"make a lightning-fast explosive leap. Exceptional sacrificants can unleash\n"
"their power in a massive strike against all their foes. Each of the powers of\n"
"Ru's sacrificants increases in strength with more piety from more sacrifices.\n"
msgstr ""
"在信徒穿行地牢时，入会要求做出一些舍弃。\n"
"在接受做出这些舍弃后，信徒将逐渐获得有着巨大力量的光环。\n"
"这个光环一开始会使试图伤害他们的敌人步履蹒跚并患上疾病。\n"
"在做出进一步的舍弃后，信徒将能用此力量来恢复他们的健康和魔力，\n"
"或做出疾如雷电的爆炸跳跃。杰出的供奉者能释出他们的力量对所有敌人大规模攻击。\n"
"入的供奉者做出的舍弃越多，虔诚值越多，力量会越强大。\n"

#. key: sif muna powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sif muna powers"
msgid ""
"Sif Muna grants followers the ability to rapidly restore their magical energy,\n"
"and to forget spells at will, so as to learn new ones. Worshippers can call\n"
"upon the Loreminder to help cast any spell they've discovered, even if it's\n"
"well beyond their current magical training. Over time, devout followers will\n"
"receive spellbooks containing a vast range of spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"席夫·穆纳赐予信徒快速恢复魔法的能力，和自行忘记法术的能力，\n"
"以便学习新的法术。信徒可以请求学识之主来帮助施放他们发现的任何法术，\n"
"即使这远超他们目前的魔法训练等级。\n"
"随时间的推移，虔诚的信徒会得到包含大量法术的魔法书。\n"

#. key: the shining one powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the shining one powers"
msgid ""
"Followers of the Shining One are surrounded by a halo that reveals their\n"
"enemies to them. Followers will gain power by killing evil beings, and with\n"
"growing piety their life force will be protected. The Shining One will keep\n"
"summoned and charmed allies on their side longer, should the allies prove\n"
"worthy of the crusade. Followers will gain use of a divine shield to protect\n"
"them in battle. Later, they can channel blasts of cleansing flame that are\n"
"particularly damaging to unholy beings, and can call upon powerful divine\n"
"beings as temporary allies. Highly pious followers may request the Shining\n"
"One's blessing upon a weapon. The Shining One may occasionally directly\n"
"intervene to save a follower's life.\n"
msgstr ""
"光明神的信徒被光环环绕，光环能向他们揭示敌人。\n"
"信徒能通过杀死邪恶的怪物获得能力，并随虔诚值的提高，他们的生命力将得到保护。\n"
"光明神会让被召唤和魅惑的盟友更久地站在他们一边，\n"
"如果这些盟友能证明他们能够进行圣战。信徒在战斗中可以使用圣盾保护自己。\n"
"稍后，他们可以引导净化烈焰，这会对邪恶的怪物会造成极大的伤害，\n"
"并能召唤强大的神圣生物作为临时盟友。\n"
"非常虔诚的信徒可以请求光明神对武器进行祝福。\n"
"光明神有时会直接介入，以拯救信徒的生命。\n"

#. key: trog powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trog powers"
msgid ""
"Trog offers various powers to help followers in battle. Followers will gain the\n"
"ability to go berserk at will, and Trog will extend the duration of their\n"
"berserk rage on killing foes. Trog will grant followers the ability to rapidly\n"
"heal their wounds while fortifying their willpower, and later the ability to\n"
"call in powerful raging allies. Eventually, Trog will gift followers with\n"
"weapons, often with antimagic effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"特洛戈会提供各种力量来帮助信徒进行战斗。信徒将获得自行狂暴的能力，\n"
"并且在他们在杀死敌人后，特洛戈能够延长其狂暴的持续时间。\n"
"特洛戈将赋予信徒快速治愈伤口的能力，同时增强其意志力，\n"
"以及后面能召唤强大、狂暴的盟友的能力。\n"
"最后，特洛戈将赐予信徒武器，那些武器通常具有反魔法的效果。\n"

#. key: uskayaw powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:uskayaw powers"
msgid ""
"Worshippers of Uskayaw can stomp to damage foes around them, and rapidly move\n"
"through a line of creatures while confusing them. When a worshipper's dance\n"
"reaches a certain point, Uskayaw will immediately stop all foes so that the\n"
"dancer may take a solo. As the dance continues, Uskayaw will link the emotions\n"
"of foes, forcing them to share their pain. The duration of these effects will\n"
"increase with Invocations skill, and as long as the intensity of the dance is\n"
"sufficient they may be repeated after a short time. If the dance continues\n"
"further, Uskayaw allows worshippers to end it by melding with and then\n"
"violently exploding from a foe, killing it instantly.\n"
msgstr ""
"乌斯卡亚的信徒可以通过跺击而伤害周围的敌人，并能混乱他们快速穿过的一排生物。\n"
"当信徒的舞蹈达到一定程度，乌斯卡亚可以立即使所有敌人停下，以便让舞者独舞。\n"
"随着舞蹈的继续，阿斯卡亚将连接敌人的情绪，迫使他们都要承受痛楚。\n"
"这些效果的持续时间将随着祈祷技能的提升而增加，只要舞蹈够强，\n"
"它们可以在短时间内重复。如果舞蹈继续下去，乌斯卡亚能让信徒与敌人融合，\n"
"然后在敌人身上猛烈爆发，立即杀死敌人。\n"

#. key: vehumet powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vehumet powers"
msgid ""
"Worshippers of Vehumet will quickly be able to recover their magical energy\n"
"upon killing beings. As they gain favour, they will also gain enhancements to\n"
"their destructive spells — first assistance in casting such spells and then\n"
"increased range for conjurations. Vehumet will offer followers the knowledge of\n"
"increasingly powerful destructive spells as they gain piety.\n"
msgstr ""
"维胡梅特的信徒可以通过杀死其他生物来快速回复自身的魔力。\n"
"随着他们得到宠幸，他们所使用的破坏性法术会得到各种强化——\n"
"首先，会在施这些法术时提供帮助，然后会增加法术的射程。\n"
"随着信徒虔诚度的增长，维胡梅特会传授他们越来越强力的破坏性法术的知识。\n"

#. key: wu jian powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wu jian powers"
msgid ""
"Disciples of the Council learn to perform three martial techniques while moving\n"
"around in combat. They will also be taught to move at unfathomable speeds for\n"
"short distances, and become able to summon a storm of golden clouds to increase\n"
"their precision and damage for as long as they keep using martial attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"门徒在战斗中走位时会学习实践三种武术。他们还将学习以不可测的速度短距离移动，\n"
"且他们只要持续使用武术攻击，就能召唤一场金色云雾风暴来增加他们的精度和伤害。\n"

#. key: xom powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:xom powers"
msgid ""
"To worship Xom is to live riskily. In a good mood Xom may shower worshippers\n"
"with gifts, while at other times this capricious god could decide to “spice\n"
"things up a little” and send worshippers to their doom. If such toys of Xom\n"
"prove to be interesting, so much the better; if not, well, there'll be other\n"
"playthings...\n"
msgstr ""
"信仰扫姆就是在过冒险的生活。在祂心情好的时候，祂可能会赐给信徒各种礼物；\n"
"而在其他时候，这个反复无常的神祗可能要“加点料”，让信徒陷入死地。\n"
"如果你这种玩具能引起佐姆的兴趣，那当然更好；\n"
"如果不行的话……唔，佐姆还有别的玩具可以玩呢。\n"

#. key: yredelemnul powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:yredelemnul powers"
msgid ""
"Followers of Yredelemnul carry the Black Torch, allowing them to gather souls\n"
"and surround themselves in darkness. They can raise foes who die in the light of\n"
"the torch as mindless servants, hurl torchlight to scour the living and empower\n"
"the dead, and bind especially noteworthy souls to fight for them in death with\n"
"the full capacities they held in life. Especially devout worshippers can even\n"
"call down the inescapable grip of the Fallen directly, binding foes helplessly\n"
"in place as the very life is sucked from them. Yredelemnul will also dispatch\n"
"undead servants to aid followers at the start of each new conquest.\n"
msgstr ""
"伊莱德莱姆努尔赋予信徒复活被杀死的敌人并迫使他们效力的力量。\n"
"信徒还可以召回亡灵随从，从生物身上汲取生命进行治疗，\n"
"将他们的亡灵军队换成伊莱德莱姆努尔的更强大的仆从。\n"
"有了足够强大的亡灵群，信徒可以完全束缚住敌人的灵魂，\n"
"并使其在死后能够拥有生前的全部能力，并为他们而战。\n"

#. key: zin powers
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zin powers"
msgid ""
"Zin grants followers the ability to preach to the unenlightened masses, and\n"
"powers to vitalise their bodies, protecting them from various afflictions.\n"
"Later, followers gain the ability to imprison their foes temporarily. Followers\n"
"can eventually find temporary safety in a divine refuge. As piety grows,\n"
"followers will be protected from mutation and the Hells, and Zin may even\n"
"occasionally directly intervene to save a follower's life.\n"
msgstr ""
"辛赋予祂的信徒们向愚昧大众传道的能力，让他们的身体充满活力，\n"
"保护他们不受各种不利状态的影响。到了后期，信徒还可以暂时囚禁他们的敌人。\n"
"信徒最终可以在神圣的避难所中寻找到片刻的安全。随着虔诚值的提升，\n"
"信徒将免受变异和地狱的影响，而且辛有时甚至会直接介入，以拯救信徒的性命。\n"

#. key: ashenzari wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ashenzari wrath"
msgid ""
"Those who abandon Ashenzari will immediately have their curses shattered,\n"
"destroying whichever items they imbued with divine wisdom. Thereafter,\n"
"Ashenzari's wrath is constant and unrelenting for its duration. Victims will\n"
"find their skills impaired, and their enemies divinely guided – never losing\n"
"track of them, never ending the hunt.\n"
msgstr ""
"那些背叛艾申扎利的人将立即被他们的诅咒所撕裂，摧毁任何浸入着神圣智慧物品。\n"
"此后，艾申扎利的无情的愤怒持续不断。受灾者将会发现他们的技能被削弱了，\n"
"敌人也受到神的指引——永远不会迷失行踪，永远不会结束追猎。\n"

#. key: beogh wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:beogh wrath"
msgid ""
"Blasphemers against the word of Beogh find themselves assaulted by waves of\n"
"orcish warriors, or by dancing electric weapons. Beogh may also simply smite\n"
"such blasphemers – and when smiting true sinners, Beogh has a heavy hand\n"
"indeed! Those who still worship Beogh will also find their followers regularly\n"
"deserting them.\n"
msgstr ""
"亵渎比欧弗的人会发现他们会被一波波兽人战士或飞舞的带电武器所攻击。\n"
"比欧弗也可能只是简单打击这些亵渎神明的人——当惩戒真正的罪人时，\n"
"比欧弗下手确实很重！仍崇拜比欧弗的也会发现他们的随从常常抛弃他们。\n"

#. key: cheibriados wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cheibriados wrath"
msgid ""
"Offenders against Cheibriados will find their movements remain slow while\n"
"the attention of Cheibriados remains upon them, and may have any magical hasting\n"
"stripped away. They may also become further slowed, be put to sleep, or be\n"
"beset by the unparalleled volume of the inevitable passage of time ringing\n"
"throughout the Dungeon.\n"
msgstr ""
"冒犯切布理亚多的人会发现他们的移动仍然很慢，\n"
"而切布理亚多仍注意着他们，并常会清除通过魔法进行的加速。\n"
"他们可能会变得更慢，置入睡眠状态，或者身体渐渐腐烂。\n"

#. key: dithmenos wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dithmenos wrath"
msgid ""
"When angered, Dithmenos turns the shadows against victims. Monsters emerge from\n"
"the darkness, both illusions woven from shadow and the very shadow themselves\n"
"turning against sinners. Dithmenos' subtle punishments are, if anything, more\n"
"dangerous: victims find the shadows ripped away from them, hunted with nowhere\n"
"to hide; or find themselves smothered in shadow and sleeping, perhaps forever.\n"
msgstr ""
"当迪斯姆诺被激怒时，会将阴影投向受灾者。怪物从黑暗中冒出，\n"
"它们都是由阴影编织而成的幻象，而阴影本身也会攻击罪人。\n"
"迪斯姆诺的不明显的惩罚甚至更危险：受灾者发现阴影从他们身上除去，\n"
"被追猎而无处躲藏；或发现自己被裹在阴影中陷入沉睡，也许这会是永远的。\n"

#. key: elyvilon wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elyvilon wrath"
msgid ""
"Elyvilon is not a god known for wrath. Still, those earning Elyvilon's ire will\n"
"find the Healer occasionally protecting their foes from their attacks, and even\n"
"from death.\n"
msgstr ""
"艾利维隆不是以愤怒著称的神。\n"
"那些惹怒艾利维隆的人会发现治愈者有时会保护他们的敌人免受攻击，甚至免受死亡。\n"

#. key: fedhas wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fedhas wrath"
msgid ""
"Those who offend Fedhas will find the forces of nature invoked against them\n"
"through a dramatic increase in greenery. They may find themselves transmuted\n"
"into the plants they have forsaken, or surrounded by impenetrable walls of\n"
"briars plus vicious acid-spitting oklob plants.\n"
msgstr ""
"自然力量会召唤的破坏性的纯粹元素会对付那些冒犯费德哈的人。\n"
"附近尸体上会冒出一波又一波弹道真菌，\n"
"最恶劣的冒犯者会被有生命的蘑菇和喷吐酸液的酸箭草包围。\n"

#. key: hepliaklqana wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hepliaklqana wrath"
msgid ""
"Hepliaklqana believes that the only reasonable punishment for turning one's\n"
"back on the path of memory is to be denied its use. All new experience is\n"
"denied to the unfortunate apostate, until Hepliaklqana decides they have\n"
"been punished enough. The life essence sacrificed to manifest an ancestor will\n"
"not be returned until Hepliaklqana is mollified, and this will not be quick:\n"
"unlike some, Hepliaklqana has a long memory.\n"
msgstr ""
"惠普利亚卡纳认为对背弃记忆的人最适当的惩罚便是禁止使用记忆。\n"
"不幸的叛教者无法得到任何新经验，\n"
"直到惠普利亚卡纳认为他们已经受到了足够的惩罚。\n"
"用于显现先祖而牺牲的生命精华要等到惠普利亚卡纳被安抚后才能返回，\n"
"而这不会很快：惠普利亚卡纳的记性很好。\n"

#. key: gozag wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gozag wrath"
msgid ""
"The first of Gozag's punishments is commercial: all shops opened through\n"
"Gozag's intervention shut their doors forever. The disloyal are advised to\n"
"finish their shopping before they launch their betrayal. For as long as Gozag\n"
"remains angered, ex-worshippers may sometimes be bedazzled by the glint of coin,\n"
"and their potions will have a chance to fail when quaffed. Any foes that are\n"
"encountered may also be granted potions of their own to assist them against\n"
"those who resign from Gozag's service.\n"
msgstr ""
"哥萨戈的第一个惩罚是交易方面的：在哥萨戈的干涉下，所有商店永远关门大吉。\n"
"建议不忠的人在背叛前完成购物。只要哥萨戈还在愤怒，喝药就可能会失败，\n"
"且遇到的任何敌人可能被获得赐予的药水，帮着对付前信徒。\n"

#. key: ignis wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ignis wrath"
msgid ""
"The wrath of Ignis is now weaker than that of most other gods. Apostates will\n"
"find their resistance to fire stripped away completely, and will be periodically\n"
"assaulted by fire elementals, find their enemies strengthened by fire, or even\n"
"have the floor burned out from beneath them. Experienced and cautious\n"
"adventurers will likely overmaster these assaults.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在伊格尼斯的愤怒比其他大多数神的都要弱。\n"
"叛教者会发现他们的火抗被完全剥夺，并且会定期受到火元素的袭击，\n"
"他们的敌人也被火所强化，甚至脚下的地面都会被烧毁。\n"
"经验丰富且谨慎的冒险者可能会战胜这些攻击。\n"

#. key: jiyva wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jiyva wrath"
msgid ""
"Jiyva's vengeance is swift and gurgling. All slimes turn against those who\n"
"offend Jiyva, and Jiyva ensures a plentiful supply of further slimes. Victims,\n"
"too, will find their own bodies becoming unstable; acquiring debilitating\n"
"mutations or contamination, as well as having any gifts of slime mutations\n"
"stripped away from them.\n"
msgstr ""
"吉瓦的报复迅捷而可怕。所有的黏液都会对付那些冒犯吉瓦的人，\n"
"吉瓦也会确保带来充足的黏液。受灾者同时会发现自己的身体变得不稳定，\n"
"定期转变为奇怪的形态并招致不利的变异，且会被剥离任何黏液变异所带来的恩赐。\n"

#. key: kikubaaqudgha wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kikubaaqudgha wrath"
msgid ""
"Kikubaaqudgha's wrath brings forth all the dread powers of necromancy. Victims\n"
"may witness the devastating Sign of Ruin form upon themselves, or both doomed\n"
"and drained without any respect for their negative energy resistance.\n"
"Furthermore, Kikubaaqudgha's gifts become tainted: the dead rise again as foes,\n"
"and those that attempt to use necromantic magic to fend off wrath will find it\n"
"backfiring on them when least expected.\n"
msgstr ""
"奇库巴库哈的愤怒会招致所有死灵系魔法的可怕力量。受灾者会饱受折磨，\n"
"自己的身体和能量也会被衰竭。此外，奇库巴库哈的恩赐也会被污染：\n"
"那些试图使用死灵法术来抵挡愤怒的，发现它会在最意想不到的时候反戈一击。\n"

#. key: lugonu wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lugonu wrath"
msgid ""
"Lugonu's ire renders the barrier between reality and the Abyss weak and\n"
"permeable. Space warps, hurling victims across the dungeon, or even directly\n"
"into the Abyss. Lugonu also reaches out and sends the chaotic inhabitants of\n"
"the Abyss against victims, with veteran adventurers facing the greatest horrors\n"
"of the Abyss. Lugonu does not forgive easily, and will not allow ex-worshippers\n"
"to rejoin the fold while Lugonu's wrath still lasts.\n"
msgstr ""
"卢格努的愤怒使得现实与深渊间的屏障变得脆弱、易渗透。\n"
"空间会扭曲，将受害者扔过地牢，甚至会直接掷入深渊。\n"
"卢格努也会出手将深渊里的混沌生物送来对付受灾者，\n"
"让资深的冒险者面对深渊中最可怕的事物。\n"
"卢格努不会轻易饶恕，在祂还在愤怒时，前信徒无法重新皈依。\n"

#. key: makhleb wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:makhleb wrath"
msgid ""
"Those who invite the fury of Makhleb are buried in demons and destruction.\n"
"The greatest punishments are reserved for the strongest sinners; crystal spears\n"
"and Executioners are hurled with abandon only at those Makhleb finds truly\n"
"deserving!\n"
msgstr ""
"触怒马科列布的人将被恶魔和毁灭埋葬。\n"
"罪行最深者将受到最严厉的惩戒，马科列布会将水晶矛和处决者投向应受惩罚的罪人！\n"

#. key: nemelex xobeh wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nemelex xobeh wrath"
msgid ""
"Those who abandon Nemelex Xobeh have all of their gifted decks revoked\n"
"immediately. They are also regularly forced to draw from the deck of\n"
"Punishment, inflicting a range of unpleasant effects including draining,\n"
"torment and polymorphing, as well as calling upon other gods to assist in\n"
"inflicting wrath.\n"
msgstr ""
"那些背弃尼姆雷斯・索布的人的所有被赐予的牌组被立刻废弃。\n"
"他们还被强制抽取惩罚牌组，受到衰竭、折磨和变形等不愉快的效果，\n"
"还要承受尼姆雷斯・索布号召其他来协助的神的怒火。\n"

#. key: okawaru wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:okawaru wrath"
msgid ""
"Okawaru's most vicious warriors are sent against rebellious servants. Novices\n"
"find themselves swarmed by packs of ogres and gnolls, while champions are\n"
"surrounded by titans and elvish blademasters.\n"
msgstr ""
"奥卡瓦鲁的最凶残的战士会被派来对付叛变的仆人。\n"
"新手会发现他们被成群的食人魔和豺狼人吞没，而老手会被泰坦和精灵剑圣包围。\n"

#. key: pakellas wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pakellas wrath"
msgid ""
"Those that offend Pakellas will find themselves completely unable to make use\n"
"of their devices for the duration of Pakellas' displeasure. Those who abandon\n"
"Pakellas altogether will also continue to be unable to regenerate their magical\n"
"power so long as Pakellas' attention remains on them.\n"
msgstr ""
"那些冒犯帕克拉斯的人会发现自己在帕克拉斯不悦的期间完全无法使用他们的装置。\n"
"那些完全放弃帕克拉斯的人，只要帕克拉斯的注意力还在他们身上，\n"
"他们也无法恢复他们的魔力。\n"

#. key: qazlal wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:qazlal wrath"
msgid ""
"Qazlal's wrath is swift and unmistakable. Sinners are stripped of their\n"
"resistances and assaulted by furious elemental creatures, and Qazlal will\n"
"create mighty thunderclaps to alert their foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹拉尔的愤怒是迅速而明确的。罪人会被剥夺抗性并会被狂怒的元素生物攻击，\n"
"卡兹拉尔也会发出强力的雷声让罪人的敌人警觉。\n"

#. key: ru wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ru wrath"
msgid ""
"Those who leave Ru's service will not receive any further punishment; however,\n"
"their piety will be lost even upon rejoining, and their sacrifices remain\n"
"forever.\n"
msgstr ""
"不再侍奉入不会受到进一步的惩罚；\n"
"然而，即使重新加入，他们的虔诚值还是会失去，做出的舍弃永远会遗留。\n"

#. key: sif muna wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sif muna wrath"
msgid ""
"Those in Sif Muna's ill graces find the very forces of magic rebelling against\n"
"them. They are confused and stupefied, their magical reserves drained, their\n"
"enchantments unravelled. Casting spells, too, becomes unreliable – and even\n"
"dangerous.\n"
msgstr ""
"那些辜负席夫·穆纳的恩宠的人会发现魔力正在抵触他们。他们会被混乱并失去知觉，\n"
"其魔力储备被耗尽，施加的魔法也会被瓦解。施法也变得不可靠——甚至是有危险的。\n"

#. key: the shining one wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the shining one wrath"
msgid ""
"The Shining One's wrath is straightforward and unmistakable. Its victims find\n"
"themselves smitten with holy fire and beset with holy warriors. Sinners will be\n"
"silenced, and the Shining One will also shout to alert the victim's foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"光明神的愤怒直截了当，而毫不含糊。其受灾者会发现他们被圣火打击，\n"
"被圣战士包围。罪人会被沉默，光明神会呼喊，让罪人的敌人警觉。\n"

#. key: trog wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trog wrath"
msgid ""
"Trog's wrath is incandescent. Offenders find themselves swarmed by berserkers –\n"
"from packs of bears to, for the most powerful, mobs of giants and trolls.\n"
"Otherwise, those who anger Trog will regularly lose both their strength and\n"
"self-control as they thoughtlessly thrash in place.\n"
msgstr ""
"特洛戈的愤怒是强烈的。罪人会发现自己被狂战士吞没——\n"
"从成群的熊到最强大的巨人和巨魔。\n"
"激怒特洛戈的人的身体开始腐烂、变慢、崩溃，特洛戈可能还会直接惩戒他们。\n"

#. key: uskayaw wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:uskayaw wrath"
msgid ""
"Uskayaw's wrath turns the powers of the dance against the offender. The prude\n"
"will find their foes going berserk and will be forced to helplessly watch as\n"
"foes execute their own solos. When the dance is getting too slow, Uskayaw will\n"
"cause noise to attract more revellers.\n"
msgstr ""
"阿斯卡亚的愤怒将舞蹈的力量转向罪人。拘谨的人会发现他们的敌人开始疯狂，\n"
"并无奈地看敌人自己独舞着。当舞蹈太慢时，阿斯卡亚会引起噪音以吸引更多狂欢者。\n"

#. key: vehumet wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vehumet wrath"
msgid ""
"Those that anger Vehumet find destruction amply heaped upon them. Novices are\n"
"struck by flame and frost; archmages by crystal spears and firestorms. Their\n"
"own conjurations, too, are wont to misfire at the worst possible moments.\n"
msgstr ""
"那些激怒维胡梅特的人会发现灾祸重重降临在他们头上。\n"
"新手会发现他们被火和霜袭击；大法师会被水晶矛和火暴攻击。\n"
"他们自己施的塑能系魔法也会在最糟的时刻落空。\n"

#. key: wu jian wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wu jian wrath"
msgid ""
"Those who turn against the Council must be prepared to endure death by a\n"
"thousand cuts. No hiding place is secure, no disguise perfect enough to avoid\n"
"the sudden spring of traps, the flying daggers and the armies of animated\n"
"weapons that will ambush the betrayer.\n"
msgstr ""
"那些背叛门派的人要准备忍受千刀万剐。\n"
"没有什么藏身之处是安全的，没有足够完美的伪装能避开突然出现的陷阱，\n"
"飞扬的匕首，会动的武器大军也会伏击叛徒。\n"

#. key: xom wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:xom wrath"
msgid ""
"Unfaithful ex-followers will find themselves suffering through Xom's bad moods\n"
"for so long as Xom can be bothered to remember about them. Still, Xom's caprice\n"
"remains; the unfaithful are rewarded just as the faithful are punished.\n"
msgstr ""
"佐姆的不忠的前信徒会被察觉，只要佐姆还在因记得他们而烦扰，\n"
"他们自己就得忍受佐姆的坏情绪。\n"
"不过，佐姆依然反复无常，不忠的人可能得到奖赏，忠诚的人却被惩罚。\n"

#. key: yredelemnul wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:yredelemnul wrath"
msgid ""
"Those who anger Yredelemnul find themselves beset by legions of the dead.\n"
"Sometimes, the god will also intervene directly, binding the unfaithful in\n"
"inescapable chains as Yredelemnul's dark army demonstrates the price of\n"
"betrayal.\n"
msgstr ""
"那些激怒伊莱德莱姆努尔的人会发现他们被亡灵大军包围。\n"
"新探险者会被丧尸和骷髅攻击；而老手会被伊莱德莱姆努尔最强大的亡灵仆从包围。\n"
"受灾者自己的亡灵仆从会抛弃他们，并瓦解为尘土。\n"
"伊莱德莱姆努尔的愤怒可能会耗尽不忠者的生命力。\n"

#. key: zin wrath
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zin wrath"
msgid ""
"Those under Zin's wrath will find their beneficial mutations stripped away,\n"
"their enemies alerted, and their senses confounded by the axioms of Law;\n"
"confusion, fainting, blindness and complete paralysis will be their lot.\n"
msgstr ""
"惹怒辛的人会发现他们的有益变异被剥去，他们的敌人被警觉，\n"
"他们的感知因法则公理有原则困扰；混乱、晕厥和完全麻痹，将是他们命运的全部。\n"

#. key: wu jian extra
#. Preserve @marker@ substitutions exactly.
#: dat/descript/gods.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wu jian extra"
msgid ""
":nowrap\n"
"  .......       .......  (.) <lightred>Lunge</lightred>: Move directly towards an enemy to deal\n"
"  ..<lightred>@</lightred>.O..  -->  ...<lightred>@</lightred>O..  extra damage.\n"
"  .......       .......\n"
"\n"
"  .......       ...<lightred>@</lightred>...  (*) <lightred>Whirlwind</lightred>: Move between two tiles adjacent to\n"
"  ...<lightred>@</lightred>O..  -->  ....O..  an enemy to strike them lightly. Multiple adjacent\n"
"  .......       .......  foes can be attacked simultaneously this way.\n"
"\n"
"  ..#....       ..#....  (**) <lightred>Wall Jump</lightred>: Vault off a nearby wall and strike\n"
"  ..#<lightred>@</lightred>O..  -->  ..#.O<lightred>@</lightred>.  enemies adjacent to the landing spot. Vaulting takes\n"
"  ..#....       ..#....  two turns. Activated via the (a)bility menu.\n"
"\n"
"These prevent enemies from getting free attacks on you while you move away.\n"
msgstr ""
":nowrap\n"
"  .......       .......  (.) <lightred>弓步</lightred>：直接冲向一个敌人以造成\n"
"  ..<lightred>@</lightred>.O..  -->  ...<lightred>@</lightred>O..  额外伤害。\n"
"  .......       .......\n"
"\n"
"  .......       ...<lightred>@</lightred>...  (*) <lightred>旋风</lightred>在两个地块之间移动，地块要毗邻着\n"
"  ...<lightred>@</lightred>O..  -->  ....O..  一个敌人，并对其轻击。多个相邻的\n"
"  .......       .......  敌人会这样同时遭受攻击。\n"
"\n"
"  ..#....       ..#....  (**) <lightred>墙跳</lightred>：从附近的一面墙上跳下，并打击\n"
"  ..#<lightred>@</lightred>O..  -->  ..#.O<lightred>@</lightred>.  与着陆点相邻的敌人。起跳需要\n"
"  ..#....       ..#....  两个回合。通过能力（a）菜单激活。\n"
"\n"
"这些可以防止敌人在你移开时白白攻击你。你不能在挖掘时用武术进行攻击。\n"

#. key: dungeon
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dungeon"
msgid ""
"It is still a mystery how this bizarre place was created. Some claim that it is\n"
"the playground of bored gods, whereas others maintain that it was shaped by all\n"
"kinds of species who fled the overworld and shunned the light. No matter what\n"
"its origin, this deep cavern is filled with riches unheard of as well as with\n"
"ample dangers to any intruder. Few have escaped alive, and even fewer have kept\n"
"some sliver of sanity sufficient to tell the tale.\n"
msgstr ""
"如何创建这个离奇的地方仍然是个谜。有些人声称这是无聊的神灵的游乐场，\n"
"而另一些人则认为它是由逃离上界躲避光明的各种物种塑造的。\n"
"无论其起源如何，这个深深的洞穴充斥着闻所未闻的财富，\n"
"并对任何闯入者都构成了同样巨大的危险。\n"
"鲜有幸存者能够逃脱，更少有人仍能保持一丝理智来讲述这里的故事。\n"

#. key: temple
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:temple"
msgid ""
"The Ecumenical Temple is a place of peace and refuge from the insanity of the\n"
"dungeon. It usually contains altars to most of the known gods. Gods that value\n"
"exploration grant no piety for exploring the Temple.\n"
msgstr ""
"众神庙是个安宁的地方，是远离地牢中疯狂的事物的庇护所。\n"
"它包含大多数有名的神的祭坛。\n"
"那些重视探索的神，不会在信徒探索神庙时给予虔诚值。\n"

#. key: orcish mines
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orcish mines"
msgid ""
"The Orcish Mines are home to the orcs that have settled in the Dungeon, their\n"
"humanoid allies, and piles of freshly mined gold. Enterprising merchants who\n"
"sell to all comers have set up trading posts among the orcs and their brethren\n"
"to make good use of that gold.\n"
msgstr ""
"兽人矿井充满了地牢原生的洞穴兽人、类人的劳工和成堆的新开采的黄金。\n"
"有雄心的商人在这里建立了贸易站来帮助兽人减轻负担。\n"

#. key: elven halls
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elven halls"
msgid ""
"The Elven Halls are home to the deep elves, a race that turned their backs on\n"
"the sun long ago. Their halls are filled with riches, but a deadly welcome\n"
"awaits any would-be robbers. In their long seclusion, the deep elves have\n"
"perfected dark sorceries of a power the orcs can only dream of!\n"
msgstr ""
"精灵殿堂是地底精灵的家园，一个很久以前背弃太阳的种族。\n"
"他们的殿堂里堆满了财富，但任何想抢劫的人都会受到致命的欢迎。\n"
"在他们漫长的隐居生活中，地底精灵已经完善了黑暗的法术，\n"
"那是兽人做梦才能得到的！\n"

#. key: lair
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lair"
msgid ""
"Most adventurers find the Lair of Beasts to be an exciting change of climate.\n"
"And indeed, there is something to be said about getting gored, mauled and eaten\n"
"rather than sliced, burnt or stabbed.\n"
"\n"
"The Lair contains the entrances to one of the Swamp or the Shoals, one of the\n"
"Snake Pit or the Spider Nest, and to the Pits of Slime.\n"
msgstr ""
"大多冒险者会找到野兽之巢，发现这里有了令人兴奋的气氛变化。\n"
"事实上，在之前你总被砍成碎片、烧成灰烬或者被刺穿，\n"
"但在这里你则会被顶伤、被撕咬或者干脆被吞掉。\n"
"\n"
"兽穴包含沼泽或海滩、蛇穴或蜘蛛巢以及黏液坑洞的入口。\n"

#. key: swamp
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:swamp"
msgid ""
"A swampy wasteland, the Swamp is filled with ooze, muck, flies and large\n"
"slavering carnivorous monsters.\n"
"\n"
"A dungeon features only one of the Swamp and Shoals branches.\n"
msgstr ""
"一片潮湿的荒地，沼泽中满是软泥、腐质、苍蝇和大型流着口水的食肉类怪物。\n"
"\n"
"地牢只有一个沼泽或海滩分支。\n"

#. key: shoals
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shoals"
msgid ""
"The exotic underground beaches of the Shoals make up a few small islands in a\n"
"seemingly endless sea. The merfolk have made it their home, alongside many\n"
"dreaded sea creatures.\n"
"\n"
"A dungeon features only one of the Shoals and Swamp branches.\n"
msgstr ""
"在看似无尽的海洋中，奇异的地下海滩形成了一些小岛。\n"
"鱼人和许多可怕的海洋生物在这里安家。\n"
"\n"
"地牢只有一个沼泽或海滩分支。\n"

#. key: snake pit
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:snake pit"
msgid ""
"The corridors of the Snake Pit are home to all varieties of serpent, and are\n"
"inhabited by a society of powerful nagas and salamanders.\n"
"\n"
"A dungeon features only one of the Snake Pit and Spider Nest branches.\n"
msgstr ""
"蛇穴中的通道是各种蛇类的家，在这里也栖息着纳迦和火蜥蜴的群落。\n"
"\n"
"地牢只有一个蛇穴或蜘蛛巢分支。\n"

#. key: spider nest
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spider nest"
msgid ""
"The crumbling, web-choked caverns of the Spider Nest are packed with poisonous\n"
"arthropods and assorted creepy-crawlies.\n"
"\n"
"A dungeon features only one of the Spider Nest and Snake Pit branches.\n"
msgstr ""
"摇摇欲坠、布满蛛网的蜘蛛洞中满是有毒的节肢动物和\n"
"各种各样令人毛骨悚然的爬行动物。\n"
"\n"
"地牢只有一个蜘蛛巢或蛇穴分支。\n"

#. key: slime pits
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slime pits"
msgid ""
"The Slime Pits are the amorphous realm of acids, jellies and slimes. Even the\n"
"walls drip with painful acid. Any trace of intelligent beings has long been\n"
"dissolved. Still, there are rumours of great treasures deep down, hidden safely\n"
"away in secret chambers without any entrance.\n"
msgstr ""
"黏液坑洞是酸、胶冻和黏液的不定形领域。甚至墙上也滴着致命的酸。\n"
"任何智慧生物的痕迹早已被分解了。尽管如此，\n"
"还是有传言说在地下有大量的宝藏，安全地藏在没有任何入口的密室中。\n"

#. key: vaults
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vaults"
msgid ""
"The Vaults are said to be home to great treasures and sealed evils alike, its\n"
"origin known only to its guardians: the Ironbound Order. Intruders face an\n"
"organised defence of trained maneuvers, arms and arcana, animated constructs,\n"
"coerced allies, and tamed beasts, all in common cause.\n"
msgstr ""
"宝库可能是由一些强大的暴君建造的，据说里有着大量宝藏。\n"
"入口周围散落着的血表明这儿也存在一定程度的暴力行为。\n"

#. key: crypt
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crypt"
msgid ""
"The Crypt is a huge repository for the ancient dead. The air is chill and\n"
"fetid, the walls cold and damp. Bones are strewn liberally everywhere, and\n"
"every noise echoes worryingly, violating the overbearing silence of the grave.\n"
msgstr ""
"墓室是个巨大的存有古代死者的库。空气又冷又臭，墙壁又冰又湿。\n"
"到处都散落骨头，每个噪音都会不安地回荡着，扰动着墓地那肃杀一切的寂静。\n"

#. key: tomb
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tomb"
msgid ""
"The Tomb of the Ancients is a place of damnation, of horrors animated by the\n"
"vilest necromancy. The list of those who have returned from this place of pure\n"
"death is exceedingly short.\n"
msgstr ""
"远古坟冢是个被诅咒的地方，是由最邪恶的死灵系魔法激发的恐怖之地。\n"
"载有从这个纯粹的死亡之地生还的人的名单非常短。\n"

#. key: hell
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hell"
msgid ""
"The Vestibule of Hell is guarded by Geryon, along with various denizens of\n"
"each of the hells themselves.\n"
"\n"
"Portals to the Vestibule of Hell are found abundantly in the Depths.\n"
msgstr ""
"地狱前庭由吉里昂和来自各个地狱的生物看守着。\n"
"\n"
"通往地狱前庭的传送门在地底随处可见。\n"

#. key: dis
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dis"
msgid ""
"The Iron City of Dis is home to many of the most resilient guardians of hell.\n"
"Those who do not belong in the halls of Dis will find the very earth itself\n"
"opposing them.\n"
"\n"
"The malice of this metal realm corrodes equipment.\n"
msgstr ""
"狄斯铁城是许多最为坚韧的地狱守卫的家园。\n"
"那些不属于狄斯城殿堂的人会发现甚至大地都在和他们作对。\n"
"\n"
"这个金属领域中的恶意会腐蚀设备。\n"

#. key: gehenna
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gehenna"
msgid ""
"Gehenna is a realm of lava, flames and damnation. Those who linger will have\n"
"fire and brimstone rained down upon them.\n"
"\n"
"The acrid smoke renders scrolls unreadable.\n"
msgstr ""
"欣嫩谷是熔岩、炽焰和诅咒的领域。那些逗留在此的人必然会淋上火和硫磺雨。\n"
"\n"
"刺鼻的烟雾使得无法阅读卷轴。\n"

#. key: cocytus
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cocytus"
msgid ""
"Cocytus is a grim and frost-bitten wasteland. Intruders will find the biting\n"
"winds and icy inhabitants of the wastes impeding their progress.\n"
"\n"
"The frigid cold congeals potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"悲叹河是个严酷的、冰封的荒地。\n"
"闯入者会发现刺骨的寒风和废地上的冷酷的栖息者阻碍了他们的前进。\n"
"\n"
"酷寒凝结了药水。\n"

#. key: tartarus
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tartarus"
msgid ""
"Tartarus is a decaying netherworld. Over time, the undead, demons and devils of\n"
"this place drain the life from any who dare to enter.\n"
"\n"
"The all-pervading rot saps visitors' willpower.\n"
msgstr ""
"塔尔塔罗斯是堕落的下界。\n"
"随着时间的流逝，亡灵和恶魔能吸尽任何胆敢进入的人的生命。\n"
"\n"
"无处不在的腐烂侵蚀了过往者的意志力。\n"

#. key: zot
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zot"
msgid ""
"The Realm of Zot is a region of the dungeon that is so terrifying, so full of\n"
"madness, frenzy and lunacy, that it has been locked securely against random\n"
"trespassers. Only the most demented adventurers would dare gather the required\n"
"keys, break the seal and penetrate deeper — all in the vain hope for a fabled\n"
"artefact no one has ever laid eyes on before.\n"
msgstr ""
"佐特领域是地牢中一个如此恐怖、充满疯狂和迷乱的区域，\n"
"它被锁得很牢固，防止随便闯入。\n"
"只有最痴狂的冒险者才敢收集领取所需的钥匙，打破封印，\n"
"并更深入地穿行——这一切虚妄的希望都寄托于一个没有人见过的神器。\n"

#. key: abyss
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:abyss"
msgid ""
"The Abyss is a truly bizarre place, ever-changing and twisted. It is filled\n"
"with all sorts of monsters, mostly of demonic nature, whose common aim is to\n"
"feast on intruders. It is also the garbage dump for many sorcerers, who delight\n"
"in sending would-be champions like you to these proving grounds of madness.\n"
"Reportedly, there is some structure to the chaos, as Lugonu seems to concoct\n"
"schemes around this place and its denizens.\n"
"\n"
"Portals to the Abyss are found abundantly in the Depths.\n"
"\n"
"The Abyss consists of seven infinite levels. The abyssal rune of Zot can be\n"
"found from the third level onwards, and is more common at greater depths.\n"
"Portals back to the dungeon are scattered throughout the Abyss, and are found\n"
"more commonly at greater depths or while carrying the abyssal rune.\n"
"\n"
"Killing monsters will warp the substance of the Abyss, eventually generating a\n"
"gateway out. Further persistence will wear holes in the Abyss, allowing descent\n"
"into deeper layers.\n"
"\n"
"The fabric of the Abyss takes greater notice of the powerful; no matter how\n"
"they arrive, more experienced adventurers will find themselves drawn deeper\n"
"within the maddening expanse of that realm.\n"
msgstr ""
"深渊确实是个奇异的地方，不断地扭曲变化。\n"
"里面充满了各种怪物，大多是恶魔类的，他们的共同目标是享用闯入者。\n"
"这也是许多术士的废料堆，\n"
"他们乐于将你这样的未来的胜利者送入疯狂的试验场。\n"
"据说，这些混乱是有一定组织的，卢格努似乎在和当地居民在这里策划阴谋。\n"
"\n"
"在地底可以发现许多通往深渊的传送门。\n"
"\n"
"深渊有七个无尽的层面。深渊的佐特符文可能会从第三层起找到，\n"
"在更深的地方更常见。\n"
"返回地牢的出口散布在深渊中，在更深的地方或携带深渊符文时会更常出现。\n"
"\n"
"当冒险者在深渊逗留，会发现自己难以抗拒地陷入其中。\n"
"杀掉怪物会扭曲深渊中的物质，最终生成通道。\n"
"继续在深渊中存留，会磨出坑来，从而跌入更深的层面。\n"
"深渊记得它的访客——一旦冒险者到过一层，\n"
"以后再到深渊时总是会把他们至少弄到那么远。\n"

#. key: pandemonium
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pandemonium"
msgid ""
"Pandemonium is an infinite realm of pain and suffering. While there are many\n"
"treasures to be found within, they are guarded by cruel demons and even\n"
"crueller demon lords.\n"
"\n"
"Portals to Pandemonium are found abundantly in the Depths.\n"
"\n"
"Pandemonium is endless. Each area of Pandemonium has a small chance of\n"
"containing a portal back to the dungeon, either directly or via the Abyss.\n"
"\n"
"No fewer than five runes of Zot can be found in Pandemonium:\n"
" • the fiery rune resides in the blazing realm of Cerebov\n"
" • the glowing rune can be found in the contaminated domain of Mnoleg\n"
" • the magical rune is guarded by the arcane powers of Lom Lobon\n"
" • the dark rune is hidden in the shadowy abode of Gloorx Vloq\n"
" • the demonic rune exists in multiple places, owned by less famous lords\n"
msgstr ""
"魔窟是个有着无尽痛苦和折磨的领域。尽管在那里可以找到许多宝藏，\n"
"但它们由残酷的恶魔和更为残酷的恶魔领主守卫着。\n"
"\n"
"可以在地底发现大量通往魔窟的传送门。\n"
"\n"
"魔窟是无尽的。\n"
"魔窟的每个区域都小概率包含返回地牢或是直接通往深渊的传送门。\n"
"\n"
"在魔窟至少可以找到五种佐特符文：\n"
" •炽热符文藏于赛里鲍夫的烈火领域\n"
" •发光符文可以在受污染的姆诺莱格地区找到\n"
" •魔法符文由洛姆·洛邦的奥术力量守护\n"
" •黑暗符文藏于克罗克斯·弗拉克的阴暗住所中\n"
" •恶魔符文存在于多个地方，由不太知名的领主所有\n"

#. key: ziggurat
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ziggurat"
msgid ""
"A ziggurat is a strange tower constructed of incrementally larger combat\n"
"arenas, each containing greater wealth and even greater danger than the last.\n"
"Beware, for a ziggurat is not a place for the faint of heart: even the bravest\n"
"and most skilled adventurers have met their ends in one. While a portal to\n"
"safety will be present on every level, once left, a ziggurat cannot be\n"
"re-entered.\n"
"\n"
"One ziggurat is guaranteed in the Depths. Tales tell of a magical item found\n"
"at the bottom of each ziggurat, granting access to a new ziggurat in turn. Such\n"
"an item is also said to be found at the bottom of the Tomb of the Ancients. Each\n"
"time a ziggurat is conquered by exiting it from the final floor, subsequent\n"
"ziggurats will become increasingly dangerous and lucrative.\n"
msgstr ""
"金字塔是由越来越大的战斗场所构成的奇特塔楼，\n"
"每个都比上一个有着更多的财富和更大的危险。\n"
"当心，胆小的人不适合呆在金字塔：\n"
"即使是最勇敢，最熟练的冒险者也可能终结在这里。\n"
"虽然每层都有通向安全的传送门，但一旦离开，就无法重新进入金字塔。\n"
"\n"
"地底肯定有个金字塔。\n"
"传说中，在每一个金字塔的底部都能找到一件魔法物品，\n"
"可以让你依次进入一个新的金字塔。\n"
"据说在远古坟冢的底部也能找到这样的物品。\n"
"每次攻克完金字塔，从最后一层离开，\n"
"随后的金字神塔将变得越来越危险和有利可图。\n"

#. key: gauntlet
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gauntlet"
msgid ""
"An elaborate complex designed to lure foolhardy adventurers seeking riches and\n"
"glory. Those who enter must choose a path through several combat arenas, each\n"
"of which contains treasure guarded by dangerous and sometimes exotic creatures.\n"
"At the end awaits a fearsome minotaur, guarding a large hoard of loot taken from\n"
"the bodies of foolish adventurers.\n"
"\n"
"Long-range teleports are impossible in Gauntlets.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个精心设计的复杂结构，旨在吸引莽撞的冒险者寻求财富和荣耀。\n"
"那些进入的人必须选择一条路径穿越几个战斗场所，\n"
"每个战斗场所都包含被危险的，有时是奇异的怪物保护的宝藏。\n"
"最后，一个可怕的牛头人在等候着，\n"
"他看守着从愚蠢的冒险者身上取下的大量战利品。\n"
"\n"
"请注意，竞技场中强大的魔法阻止远程传送。\n"

#. key: bazaar
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bazaar"
msgid ""
"While some merchants set up shop in the dungeon, others travel in caravans from\n"
"place to place. The bazaars of these itinerant traders feature a number of\n"
"different shops and often have better stock than the sedentary ones, sometimes\n"
"even at a bargain.\n"
msgstr ""
"一些商人在地牢开店，而另一些商人则组成商队从一个地方到另一个地方。\n"
"这些行商的集市有许多不同的商店，通常比那些固定的店面有更好的存货，\n"
"有时甚至会打折。\n"

#. key: trove
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trove"
msgid ""
"Once upon a time, an enterprising thief and wizard created a system of portals\n"
"leading into the secret treasure troves and chambers of the rich. Too scared to\n"
"loot them himself, he instead charged an extortionate fee for entry to anyone\n"
"who wanted to rifle through them.\n"
"\n"
"The items inside such troves are likely to be useful, but beware: the wizard is\n"
"long dead, and even while alive he never offered a money-back guarantee.\n"
msgstr ""
"很久以前，一个有胆识的小偷和巫师创造了一个传送门系统，\n"
"通向富人的宝库和密室。他们自己不敢抢劫，\n"
"而是向任何想来搜刮的人收取高额入境费。\n"
"\n"
"宝库中的物品很可能是有用的，但要小心：\n"
"这个巫师已经死了很久了，即使活着，他也从不保证给退款。\n"

#. key: sewer
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sewer"
msgid ""
"Every inhabited place needs to dispose of its waste products. The Dungeon too\n"
"has its stinking sewers and drains, full of filthy water and ignored by most\n"
"but used as hideaways by the disgusting and the desperate. Old tales speak of\n"
"dangerous creatures stalking through the foul-smelling green water, preying on\n"
"each other without mercy. The tales also allude to valuable items accidentally\n"
"washed into the drainage tunnels, forgotten and left to grow mouldy in the damp\n"
"caverns.\n"
msgstr ""
"任何有人居住的地方都需要处理垃圾。\n"
"地牢也有恶臭的下水道和阴沟，充满了脏水，大部分人会选择无视，\n"
"但对于某些肮脏或走投无路的生物而言却是绝佳的藏身之处。\n"
"古老的传说中，危险的怪物在散发恶臭的绿水中潜行，残酷地互相捕杀。\n"
"传说还提到了一些无意中被冲进下水管道的宝物，\n"
"被遗忘在潮湿的洞穴深处慢慢发霉。\n"

#. key: ossuary
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ossuary"
msgid ""
"The ossuary is a small tomb containing the remains and grave goods of some\n"
"distant relatives of the pharaohs, along with the corpses of their retainers\n"
"and household animals. It is undoubtedly riddled with many traps, and its\n"
"undead denizens are unlikely to take kindly to looting.\n"
msgstr ""
"埋骨地是一个小坟墓，里面有法老的一些远亲的遗体和陪葬品，\n"
"还有他们的家仆和家畜的尸体。\n"
"毫无疑问，它布满了陷阱，而且它的亡灵居民不大可能乐于被搜刮。\n"

#. key: bailey
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bailey"
msgid ""
"The bailey is the occupied and well-guarded fortress of a ruthless warlord.\n"
"The treasures within are protected by both physical barriers and large numbers\n"
"of well-armed humanoid warriors.\n"
msgstr ""
"堡场是个仍被兽人领主占领的要塞，守卫森严。\n"
"里面的宝藏被物理屏障和大量装备精良的人形战士保护着。\n"

#. key: ice cave
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice cave"
msgid ""
"The {{ if you.branch() == \"Elf\" or you.branch() == \"Swamp\" or\n"
"you.branch() == \"Snake\" or you.branch() == \"Shoals\" or you.branch() == \"Spider\"\n"
"then return \"glacial chasm\"; else return \"ice cave\"; end }} is a desolate cavern\n"
"shaped from solid ice and filled with the echoes of bestial howls. The intricate\n"
"carvings and statues which once lined its walls have been warped and obscured by\n"
"centuries of slow melting and refreezing.\n"
msgstr ""
"The {{ if you.branch() == \"Elf\" or you.branch() == \"Swamp\" or\n"
"you.branch() == \"Snake\" or you.branch() == \"Shoals\" or you.branch() == \"Spider\"\n"
"then return \"冰川裂隙\"; else return \"冰窟\"; end }}\n"
"是一个由坚冰形成的荒凉的洞穴，充满了野兽嚎叫的回声。\n"
"那些曾排列在墙上的复杂的浮雕和雕像，\n"
"经过几个世纪的缓慢融化和重新冻结，已经变得扭曲而模糊。\n"

#. key: volcano
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:volcano"
msgid ""
"Built from enormous blocks of obsidian, the volcano's sweltering chambers may\n"
"once have served as a temple to some strange deity, or perhaps the dwelling of\n"
"a mighty fire giant. The air shimmers with oppressive heat, and the dull roar\n"
"of the volcano's heart never ceases.\n"
msgstr ""
"火山由巨大的黑曜石构成，其闷热的房间可能曾经是某个奇怪神灵的庙宇，\n"
"也可能是一个强大的火巨人的住所。\n"
"大气弥漫着压抑的热量，火山中心低沉的轰鸣声从未停止过。\n"

#. key: wizlab
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wizlab"
msgid ""
"In ages past, the most powerful mages would frequently find or construct small\n"
"realms sealed off from the rest of the world, where they could isolate\n"
"themselves in the pursuit of ever-greater magical knowledge and power. The\n"
"mages are long gone, but many of their arcane laboratories still exist, filled\n"
"with the results of their experiments. Those willing to explore these\n"
"laboratories may find powerful magical treasures, but be warned: any wizard\n"
"capable of constructing such a realm deserved their reputation.\n"
msgstr ""
"在过去的时代中，最强大的法师会经常寻求或建造与世隔绝的小领域，\n"
"他们可以在那里隔绝外界，以追求越来越崇高的魔法知识和力量。\n"
"法师早已离去，但许多他们的奥术实验室仍然存在，堆满了他们的实验结果。\n"
"那些愿意探索这些实验室的人可能会发现强大的魔法宝藏，\n"
"但要警告：任何能够建设这样一个领域的巫师担得起其享有的名声。\n"

#. key: depths
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:depths"
msgid ""
"The Depths are the deepest part of the dungeon proper, subject to the\n"
"corrupting influence of the Realm of Zot without being considered a part of it.\n"
msgstr ""
"地底是地牢级别的最深处，它自己会受到佐特领域的腐化影响，\n"
"但不会被认为是后者的一部分。\n"

#. key: desolation
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:desolation"
msgid ""
"The Desolation was once ruled by the divines Sheza and Sargol. After the dread\n"
"twins were cast down, the good gods reduced their former realm to salt, that\n"
"such a terrible cult would never rise again. Amidst the ruins, only the last\n"
"cultists of the dead gods, their heretical constructs, and the guardians\n"
"of the cult's legendary treasure yet remain.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"荒地一度由邪神西泽和赛格尔统治。\n"
"在这对可怕的双胞胎被打倒之后，善神把他们以前的领域变成了一片盐地，\n"
"这样可怕的邪教再也不会兴起了。\n"
"在废墟中，只剩最后的死神的信徒、他们的异教建筑，\n"
"和邪教的传奇宝藏的守护者。\n"
"\n"

#. key: arena
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:arena"
msgid ""
"Okawaru's most favoured followers are granted access to the Arena to duel\n"
"against their foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"奥卡瓦鲁赐予了他最宠幸的追随者进入角斗场与敌人决斗的权限。\n"

#. key: fighting
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fighting"
msgid ""
"Fighting skill increases your accuracy and damage in physical combat, and\n"
"also increases your maximum health.\n"
msgstr ""
"格斗技能增加你的物理攻击的命中率和伤害，同时还能提升你的生命力上限。\n"

#. key: short blades
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:short blades"
msgid ""
"Short Blades are more effective than any other weapon type at stabbing helpless\n"
"foes.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled with Short Blades will allow you to attack more quickly with all\n"
"weapons of this type, as well as increasing your accuracy and damage with them.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled with Short Blades increases your effectiveness with Long Blades,\n"
"and vice versa.\n"
msgstr ""
"短刃类武器相比其他种类的武器更适合刺杀未警觉的敌人。\n"
"\n"
"提升短刃技能能提升你使用此类武器的攻击速度、命中率和攻击力。\n"
"\n"
"提升短刃技能能同时提升你的长刃技能，反之亦然。\n"

#. key: long blades
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:long blades"
msgid ""
"Being skilled with Long Blades will allow you to attack more quickly with all\n"
"weapons of this type, as well as increasing your accuracy and damage with them.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled with Long Blades increases your effectiveness with Short Blades,\n"
"and vice versa.\n"
msgstr ""
"提升长刃技能能提升你使用此类武器的攻击速度、命中率和攻击力。\n"
"\n"
"提升长刃技能能同时提升你的短刃技能，反之亦然。\n"

#. key: axes
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:axes"
msgid ""
"Axes cleave through multiple enemies with a single swing, hitting foes in an\n"
"arc around the wielder.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled with Axes will allow you to attack more quickly with all weapons\n"
"of this type, as well as increasing your accuracy and damage with them.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled with Axes increases your effectiveness with Maces & Flails and\n"
"Polearms, and vice versa.\n"
msgstr ""
"挥动斧类武器能同时劈砍周围一圈多个敌人。\n"
"\n"
"提升斧技能能提升你使用此类武器的攻击速度、命中率和攻击力。\n"
"\n"
"提升斧技能能同时提升你的棍棒技能和长柄武器技能，反之亦然。\n"

#. key: maces & flails
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maces & flails"
msgid ""
"Being skilled with Maces & Flails will allow you to attack more quickly with\n"
"all weapons of this type, as well as increasing your accuracy and damage with\n"
"them.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled with Maces & Flails increases your effectiveness with Axes and\n"
"Staves, and vice versa.\n"
msgstr ""
"提升棍棒技能能提升你使用此类武器的攻击速度、命中率和攻击力。\n"
"\n"
"提升棍棒技能能同时提升你的斧技能和杖技能，反之亦然。\n"

#. key: polearms
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:polearms"
msgid ""
"Polearms can be evoked with ‘v’ to attack enemies from two spaces away.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled with Polearms will allow you to attack more quickly with all\n"
"weapons of this type, as well as increasing your accuracy and damage with them.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled with Polearms increases your effectiveness with Axes and Staves,\n"
"and vice versa.\n"
msgstr ""
"装备长柄武器时可以使用“v”键攻击两格远的敌人。\n"
"\n"
"提升长柄武器技能能提升你使用此类武器的攻击速度、命中率和攻击力。\n"
"\n"
"提升长柄武器技能能同时提升你的斧技能和杖技能，反之亦然。\n"

#. key: staves
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staves"
msgid ""
"Staves require a relatively low amount of skill to be used most effectively,\n"
"although they lack the high damage potential of some other weapon classes.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled with Staves will allow you to attack more quickly with all\n"
"weapons of this type, as well as increasing your accuracy and damage with them.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled with Staves increases your effectiveness with Maces & Flails and\n"
"Polearms, and vice versa.\n"
msgstr ""
"不需要很高的技能等级就能精通杖类武器，\n"
"但是杖类武器的攻击力潜力没有其他种类的武器那么高。\n"
"\n"
"提升杖技能能提升你使用此类武器的攻击速度、命中率和攻击力。\n"
"\n"
"提升杖技能能同时提升你的棍棒技能和长柄武器技能，反之亦然。\n"

#. key: ranged weapons
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ranged weapons"
msgid ""
"Being skilled with Ranged Weapons will let you attack more quickly with all\n"
"bows, crossbows and slings, as well as increasing your accuracy and damage with\n"
"them.\n"
msgstr ""
"提升远程武器技能能提升你使用所有弓、弩和投石索的攻击速度、命中率和攻击力。\n"

#. key: throwing
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throwing"
msgid ""
"Training Throwing will make thrown weapons (such as javelins) more accurate\n"
"and damaging. It also makes certain magical darts more likely to have an\n"
"effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"提升投掷技能能强化投掷类武器（如标枪）的效果。\n"
"它还能提升回旋镖投出后回到投掷者的几率，并让某些魔法飞镖更容易生效。\n"

#. key: armour
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:armour"
msgid ""
"Armour skill multiplies the AC gained from wearing armour of all kinds, both\n"
"from body armour and cloaks, gloves, etc. It also slightly lessens penalties\n"
"to spellcasting and ranged weapon speed from heavy armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"护甲技能使穿戴各种护甲（包括铠甲、披风、手套等）所获得的防护成倍增加。\n"
"它也些微减少了重甲对施法和远程武器的攻击速度的负面影响。\n"

#. key: dodging
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dodging"
msgid ""
"The Dodging skill will affect your chance of dodging an attack, be it melee,\n"
"ranged or magical. Certain types of attack cannot be dodged, however, such as\n"
"enchantments (which must be resisted with willpower) and explosions.\n"
msgstr ""
"闪避技能会影响你躲开敌人攻击（包括近战、远程和魔法攻击）的几率。\n"
"但也有一些攻击类型无法被闪避，例如妖术（只有意志力才能抵抗）和爆炸。\n"

#. key: stealth
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stealth"
msgid ""
"By training Stealth, you can make it less likely that monsters will notice you\n"
"if they are asleep or otherwise unalert, and increase your chances of monsters\n"
"losing track of you after you leave their vision. Note that more powerful\n"
"monsters tend to be more suspicious and observant.\n"
"\n"
"Stealth skill, along with the weapon skill for your equipped weapon, also\n"
"governs the likelihood of doing a great amount of damage when attacking a\n"
"distracted or helpless creature, as well as the amount of extra damage dealt.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过训练潜行，怪物在睡觉等不警觉的时候会更难注意到你，\n"
"你从怪物的视野中消失后，他们也会更难进行追踪。\n"
"注意，更强大的怪物往往更加多疑、敏锐。\n"
"\n"
"提升潜行技能和你所装备的武器的武器技能，\n"
"在攻击不警觉的敌人时会增加造成额外伤害的几率和攻击力。\n"

#. key: shields
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shields"
msgid ""
"A high Shields skill helps you block melee attacks or projectiles (both magical\n"
"and non-magical) with your equipped shield, and reduces their penalty to your\n"
"evasion, attack speed and spellcasting success.\n"
msgstr ""
"强大的格挡技能可以帮助你用装备的盾牌阻挡近战攻击或投射物\n"
"（无论是魔法还是非魔法），\n"
"并减小盾牌对你的闪避、攻击速度和施法成功率的负面影响。\n"

#. key: unarmed combat
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:unarmed combat"
msgid ""
"Being skilled in Unarmed Combat increases your accuracy, damage and attack\n"
"speed in melee combat when barehanded.\n"
msgstr ""
"提升徒手格斗技能会增加你在近战时空手战斗的命中率、攻击力和攻击速度。\n"

#. key: spellcasting
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spellcasting"
msgid ""
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Djinni\" then\n"
"        return \"Being skilled in Spellcasting increases the success rate and spell \"..\n"
"               \"power of all spells.\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"Being skilled in Spellcasting slightly increases the success \" ..\n"
"                \"rate and spell power of all spells, along with increasing your \" ..\n"
"                \"magical reserves. Training Spellcasting also gives you more spell \" ..\n"
"                \"slots to spend on new spells.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Djinni\" then\n"
"        return \"提升施法技能会提升施法的成功率和\"..\n"
"               \"法术威力。\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"提升施法技能会提升施法的成功率和\" ..\n"
"                \"和法术威力，并增加\" ..\n"
"                \"魔力储备。训练施法技能也会获得更多的法术\" ..\n"
"                \"槽，以放置新的法术。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: conjurations
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:conjurations"
msgid ""
"Conjurations are battle oriented spells, which often work by conjuring up a\n"
"chunk of short-lived matter and propelling it towards the victim to deal direct\n"
"damage. Being skilled in Conjurations usually increases the damage and accuracy\n"
"of such spells, and sometimes affects their range or the size of the area\n"
"affected.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled in Conjurations increases the success rate and spell power of\n"
"spells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools,\n"
"in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill\n"
"in these schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"塑能系魔法是关注战斗的魔法流派，\n"
"旨在塑造出一团短暂存在的物质并将其推向敌人以造成伤害。\n"
"提升塑能技能通常会增加使用这类法术的攻击力和命中率，有时也会增加其影响范围。\n"
"\n"
"提升塑能技能会提升咒法系法术的成功率和强度。许多法术属于多个魔法流派，\n"
"对于这类法术，法术的成功率和强度由这些流派的技能的平均值决定。\n"

#. key: hexes
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hexes"
msgid ""
"Hexes try to bestow various enchantments on nearby things. While none do direct\n"
"damage, being ensorcelled can effectively take an opponent out of combat,\n"
"although they often require overcoming an opponent's willpower to have an effect.\n"
"Skill in Hexes can help overcome this.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled in Hexes increases the success rate and spell power of spells in\n"
"this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools, in which\n"
"case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill in these\n"
"schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"妖术旨在为施法者周围的物体注入魔力。\n"
"虽然不会直接造成伤害，但很容易让中招的敌人失去战斗力，\n"
"尽管妖术通常需要击垮敌人的意志力才能生效。\n"
"提升妖术技能有助于击垮敌人的意志力。\n"
"\n"
"训练妖术技能会提升妖术系法术的成功率和强度。许多法术属于多个魔法流派，\n"
"对于这类法术，法术的成功率和强度由这些流派的技能的平均值决定。\n"

#. key: summonings
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summonings"
msgid ""
"Summonings deals with summoning creatures from another plane of reality to\n"
"temporarily aid you. Increasing Summonings skill may grant a number of effects\n"
"depending on the spell, such as longer duration or more powerful allies. Note\n"
"that summoned beings do not leave corpses and give no experience when killed,\n"
"and their equipment is as ephemeral as they are.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled in Summonings increases the success rate and spell power of\n"
"spells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools,\n"
"in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill\n"
"in these schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤系魔法旨在从另一个现实位面召唤生物来暂时帮助你。\n"
"提升召唤技能会根据具体法术带来一系列效果，例如更长的持续时间，更强大的盟友。\n"
"需要注意的是，召唤生物不会留下尸体，击杀他们也不会获得经验值和装备。\n"
"\n"
"提升召唤技能会提升召唤系法术的成功率和强度。许多法术属于多个魔法流派，\n"
"对于这类法术，法术的成功率和强度由这些流派的技能的平均值决定。\n"

#. key: necromancy
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:necromancy"
msgid ""
"Necromancy is the art of draining and gaining life, although most often\n"
"associated with zombies and other undead. As such, Necromancy spells have a\n"
"wide range of effects, ranging from spells to create or disrupt the undead to\n"
"spells granting unholy healing in various forms.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled in Necromancy increases the success rate and spell power of\n"
"spells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools,\n"
"in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill\n"
"in these schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"死灵术是汲取和获取生命的艺术，即使它通常与丧尸和其他亡灵有关。\n"
"因此，死灵术有着广泛的效果，\n"
"从创造或破坏亡灵的法术到用各种形式进行邪恶治疗的法术。\n"
"\n"
"提升死灵术技能会提升死灵系法术的成功率和强度。许多法术属于多个魔法流派，\n"
"对于这类法术，法术的成功率和强度由这些流派的技能的平均值决定。\n"

#. key: translocations
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:translocations"
msgid ""
"Translocations focus on the spatial movement of beings or objects, including\n"
"useful spells to translocate yourself over short distances quickly or to\n"
"transport your enemies away from you.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled in Translocations increases the success rate and spell power of\n"
"spells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools,\n"
"in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill\n"
"in these schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"移位系魔法关注生物和物体在空间中的移动，这一魔法流派包含了很多实用的法术，\n"
"例如使自身快速的移动一小段距离或把身边的敌人传送走。\n"
"\n"
"提升移位技能会提升移位系法术的成功率和强度。许多法术属于多个魔法流派，\n"
"对于这类法术，法术的成功率和强度由这些流派的技能的平均值决定。\n"

#. key: alchemy
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:alchemy"
msgid ""
"Alchemy is the art of toxins and transmutation. Spells in this school can twist\n"
"objects and creatures into different shapes, unleash powerful poisons, or even\n"
"unweave the fabric of magic itself.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled in Alchemy increases the success rate and spell power of\n"
"spells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools,\n"
"in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill\n"
"in these schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"炼金术是毒素和变化的艺术。这一流派的法术可以将物品和生物扭曲成不同的形状，\n"
"释出强大的毒物，甚至可以拆解魔法构造。\n"
"\n"
"提升炼金术技能会提升炼金术法术的成功率和强度。许多法术属于多个魔法流派，\n"
"对于这类法术，法术的成功率和强度由这些流派的技能的平均值决定。\n"

#. key: fire magic
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire magic"
msgid ""
"Fire Magic focuses mainly on dealing fire damage over long distances, with many\n"
"effective Conjurations.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled in Fire Magic increases the success rate and spell power of\n"
"spells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools,\n"
"in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill\n"
"in these schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"火系魔法主要关注对敌人造成远程火焰伤害，火系魔法通常与塑能系魔法相结合。\n"
"\n"
"提升火系魔法技能会提升火系法术的成功率和强度。许多法术属于多个魔法流派，\n"
"对于这类法术，法术的成功率和强度由这些流派的技能的平均值决定。\n"

#. key: ice magic
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice magic"
msgid ""
"Ice Magic contains a range of direct damage spells, as well as some defensive\n"
"effects - for example, crafting temporary ice armour.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled in Ice Magic increases the success rate and spell power of spells\n"
"in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools, in\n"
"which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill in\n"
"these schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"冰系魔法包含多种攻击法术，同时也包含一些防御法术，例如创造临时性的冰护甲。\n"
"\n"
"提升冰系魔法技能会提升冰系法术的成功率和强度。许多法术属于多个魔法流派，\n"
"对于这类法术，法术的成功率和强度由这些流派的技能的平均值决定。\n"

#. key: air magic
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:air magic"
msgid ""
"Air Magic provides spells to deal damage directly with the wind, as well as\n"
"noisy but powerful lightning Conjurations. It also provides some utility\n"
"spells, such as a call to the wind to assist your movement or a Hex to prevent\n"
"most use of magic in the area surrounding you.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled in Air Magic increases the success rate and spell power of spells\n"
"in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools, in\n"
"which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill in\n"
"these schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"气系魔法包含直接使用风造成伤害的法术，也包含轰鸣而强大的闪电塑能系法术。\n"
"其中也包含一些实用的法术，例如呼唤风来加快移动或阻碍周围区域使用魔法的妖术。\n"
"\n"
"提升气系魔法技能会提升气系法术的成功率和强度。许多法术属于多个魔法流派，\n"
"对于这类法术，法术的成功率和强度由这些流派的技能的平均值决定。\n"

#. key: earth magic
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:earth magic"
msgid ""
"Earth Magic contains spells able to deal large amounts of direct physical\n"
"damage, which cannot be resisted like fire, cold and lightning damage can. It\n"
"is also linked with Alchemy, with spells to liquefy the earth around you, or to\n"
"turn your enemies to stone.\n"
"\n"
"Being skilled in Earth Magic increases the success rate and spell power of\n"
"spells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools,\n"
"in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill\n"
"in these schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"土系魔法包含直接造成大量物理伤害的法术，\n"
"它不会像火系、寒系、电系伤害那样能被抗性抵挡。\n"
"土系魔法也包含一些炼金术法术，比如能液化身边的土地的法术和能石化敌人的法术。\n"
"\n"
"提升土系魔法技能会提升土系法术的成功率和强度。许多法术属于多个魔法流派，\n"
"对于这类法术，法术的成功率和强度由这些流派的技能的平均值决定。\n"

#. key: invocations
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:invocations"
msgid ""
"Your Invocations skill affects the likelihood that an attempt to use divine\n"
"abilities with certain gods will be successful, and often the power of such\n"
"abilities.\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Djinni\" then\n"
"        return \"The Invocations skill also affects your magical reserves, \" ..\n"
"               \"but to a lesser degree than the Spellcasting skill. Only the \" ..\n"
"               \"higher contribution is used.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"祈祷技能影响使用某些神赐予的能力的成功率，通常还影响其强度。\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Djinni\" then\n"
"        return \"祈祷技能也会影响你的魔力储备，\" ..\n"
"               \"但影响程度不如施法技能。魔力储备只受\" ..\n"
"               \"加成最大的技能影响。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: evocations
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:evocations"
msgid ""
"Evocations skill affects your ability to use magical items like wands and other\n"
"uncommon objects, increasing the power or success rate of such items.\n"
msgstr ""
"激活技能影响你使用魔法物品（例如魔杖和其他不常见的物品）的能力，\n"
"训练激活技能会提升它们的强度和使用成功率。\n"

#. key: shapeshifting
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shapeshifting"
msgid ""
"Shapeshifting enables the use of magical talismans to change oneself into other\n"
"forms. Sufficient skill allows one to use more powerful forms without gravely\n"
"damaging one's health. Being skilled in Shapeshifting also makes most forms\n"
"somewhat stronger, in ways which vary between forms.\n"
msgstr ""
"变身技能可以让人们使用魔法符咒改变自身形态。\n"
"技能足够熟练就能使用更强大的形态而不会严重损害健康。\n"
"精通变身技能也能让大多数形态变得更强大，具体因不同形态而异。\n"

#. key: no ability ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no ability ability"
msgid ""
"If you get this description, it is a bug.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果你碰到这个描述，说明你遇到程序错误了。\n"

#. key: spit poison ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spit poison ability"
msgid ""
"Spits poison at a targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个目标生物喷吐毒液。\n"

#. key: breathe fire ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:breathe fire ability"
msgid ""
"Breathes a blast of fire at a targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    local desc = \"向一个目标生物喷吐火焰气流\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Red Draconian\" then\n"
"        desc = desc .. \"，并且在火焰飞行的终点留下一团火焰云\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    desc = desc .. \"。\"\n"
"\n"
"    return desc\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: breathe poison gas ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:breathe poison gas ability"
msgid ""
"Breathes a blast of poison gas at a targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个目标生物喷吐一股毒气。\n"

#. key: hurl damnation ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hurl damnation ability"
msgid ""
"Blasts a targeted enemy with damnation. These unholy forces harm the victim and\n"
"anyone adjacent, and are not affected by any means of protection, such as armour\n"
"or resistances. However, certain creatures, usually those able to invoke\n"
"damnation themselves, are entirely unscathed by damnation.\n"
msgstr ""
"用天谴轰击一个目标敌人。\n"
"这些邪恶的力量会伤害目标和附近的任何人，并且不被任何保护手段削弱，\n"
"比如盔甲或抗性。但某些生物，通常是那些能够自己释放天遣的生物，\n"
"完全不受天遣的伤害。\n"

#. key: word of chaos ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:word of chaos ability"
msgid ""
"Speaks a word of chaos, forcing enemies nearby to blink away from the user.\n"
"Additionally, those affected may be slowed, ensnared, or terrified by the\n"
"experience. Invoking a word of chaos is no easy feat and will drain the user's\n"
"maximum health somewhat, and the ability then cannot be used again for a short\n"
"time.\n"
msgstr ""
"念出混沌之语，使附近的敌人从使用者那边闪送走。\n"
"此外，那些受影响的人可能会因此被减速、诱捕或恐惧。行使混沌之语绝非易事，\n"
"会让使用者的最大生命值流失，并且短时间内无法再次使用它。\n"

#. key: heal wounds ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:heal wounds ability"
msgid ""
"Heals the user significantly, with a chance of permanently reducing the user's\n"
"maximum magic capacity by one.\n"
msgstr ""
"显著恢复使用者的健康，使用过程中可能会永久减少1点魔力上限。\n"

#. key: dig ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dig ability"
msgid ""
"Allows making tunnels through soft rock and rusted grates. Activating the\n"
"ability has no cost and simply prepares you to start digging; once active,\n"
"moving into a wall will start tunnelling. Doing so makes some noise and drains\n"
"the user's maximum health.\n"
"\n"
"Once active, activating the ability again or making any non-digging movement\n"
"action will cancel the Dig status.\n"
msgstr ""
"可以在松动的岩石和生锈的大门上打通通道。\n"
"运用该技能无需消耗任何东西，准备好就可以开始挖掘了；\n"
"一旦开始，就会走向墙壁并开始挖掘通道。\n"
"这会制造一些噪音，并会消耗使用者的最大生命值。\n"
"\n"
"激活后，再次激活该技能或做其他非挖掘的动作，将不再是挖掘状态。\n"

#. key: shaft self ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shaft self ability"
msgid ""
"Sends you to a random position one to three floors down, as if you jumped into\n"
"a shaft trap. It takes some time to dig the shaft.\n"
msgstr ""
"把你送到往下一两层的随机位置，就像跳进地洞陷阱一样。挖通地洞需要一些时间。\n"

#. key: evoke blink ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:evoke blink ability"
msgid ""
"Randomly translocates the user a short distance. After translocating in this\n"
"way, the ability cannot be activated again for a short period of time depending\n"
"on Evocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"随机地将使用者转移一小段距离。\n"
"以这种方式移位后，短时间内无法再次激活该技能，其间隔时间取决于激活技能。\n"

#. key: evoke invisibility ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:evoke invisibility ability"
msgid ""
"Turns the user invisible for a short period of time.\n"
msgstr ""
"使用者隐形。隐形时会造成魔法污染。污染程度高了身体会发光，从而使隐形无效。\n"

#. key: end transformation ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:end transformation ability"
msgid ""
"Reverts you to your normal form.\n"
msgstr ""
"恢复到正常形态。\n"

#. key: begin untransformation ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:begin untransformation ability"
msgid ""
"Begins to transform you back into your native form. A short period of\n"
"concentration is required.\n"
msgstr ""
"开始将你变回你的原生形态。这需要花一小段时间来集中精力。\n"

#. key: recite ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:recite ability"
msgid ""
"Preaches to nearby monsters about Zin's laws for a short duration. After\n"
"finishing a recitation, it cannot be repeated for a short time.\n"
"\n"
"The recitation will have different effects depending on the target: the chaotic\n"
"and unclean will be affected by powerful and damaging effects, undead and\n"
"demons will be affected by weaker rebukes, and any other intelligent creatures\n"
"will have confusion sown amongst them, with heretics and priests of gods other\n"
"than Zin being punished much more strongly. The effectiveness of the recitation\n"
"is increased by Invocations skill and piety.\n"
msgstr ""
"在短暂的期间内，向附近的怪物传道辛的律令。\n"
"吟诵结束后，不能在短期内再次使用它。\n"
"\n"
"根据目标的不同，吟诵会产生不同的影响：\n"
"混沌和不洁的怪物会受到强大、破坏性效果，亡灵和恶魔会受到较弱的斥责；\n"
"任何其中的智慧生物也会被混乱，除辛以外的异教徒和祭司，会受到更重的惩罚。\n"
"吟诵的效果能通过祈祷技能和虔诚值的提升而提高。\n"

#. key: vitalisation ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vitalisation ability"
msgid ""
"Temporarily provides protection from poison, confusion, petrification, and\n"
"sickness, as well as the effects of clouds of foul pestilence. Your strength,\n"
"intelligence and dexterity are also temporarily increased by a degree dependent\n"
"on Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"暂时提供保护，免受毒、混乱、石化和疾病，以及腐臭瘟疫云的影响。\n"
"你的力量、智力、敏捷会暂时增加，增加的幅度取决于祈祷技能，\n"
"且在它们在该能力生效期间无法被衰竭。\n"

#. key: imprison ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:imprison ability"
msgid ""
"Temporarily imprisons a monster in walls of silver. The duration of the prison\n"
"is increased by Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"创造出临时性的白银墙壁，将一个怪物困在其中。\n"
"监牢的持续时间随祈祷技能的提升而增加。\n"

#. key: sanctuary ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sanctuary ability"
msgid ""
"Transforms the area around the user into a domain of unbreakable law for a short\n"
"duration. So long as anyone stands within this sanctuary, no harm may be done to\n"
"them by others, and they may do no harm to others in turn.\n"
"\n"
"Beings with hostile intent are unable to enter a sanctuary and those already\n"
"nearby when it is created will be forced to flee.\n"
msgstr ""
"创造一个短暂存在的神圣庇护所。当你处于庇护所之中时，怪物无法攻击你；\n"
"但如果你主动破坏神圣庇护所，保护会马上消失。\n"

#. key: cure all mutations ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cure all mutations ability"
msgid ""
"Cures all your mutations — but only once.\n"
msgstr ""
"治愈你体内所有变异。仅能使用一次。\n"

#. key: divine shield ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:divine shield ability"
msgid ""
"Manifests a blindingly bright shield in front of the user. Held aloft by the\n"
"Shining One's power, it will unerringly block the next several attacks which\n"
"could be blocked by a mundane shield. Ranged attacks will be reflected and melee\n"
"attackers have a chance of being briefly blinded by the resulting flash of\n"
"light.\n"
"\n"
"This shield will block only a limited number of attacks before vanishing, with\n"
"Invocations skill increasing how many.\n"
msgstr ""
"赐予你一面圣盾。光明神的神力使它浮在空中，\n"
"因此圣盾不会占用你的装备位置，但它在其他方面起到了普通的物理盾牌的作用。\n"
"它的力量和持续时间随祈祷技能的提升而增加。\n"

#. key: cleansing flame ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cleansing flame ability"
msgid ""
"Invokes a huge blast of divine fury centered on the user, severely damaging\n"
"undead and demons and dealing damage to all other hostile creatures. The power\n"
"of the blast is increased by Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"激起以使用者为中心的巨大的神怒爆炸，会对亡灵和恶魔造成严重伤害，\n"
"并对所有其他敌对生物造成伤害。爆炸的力量随祈祷技能的提升而增大。\n"

#. key: summon divine warrior ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon divine warrior ability"
msgid ""
"Summons a powerful warrior against evil, either an angel or a daeva. The\n"
"duration of their assistance is increased by Invocations skill, and glory in\n"
"battle may lead the Shining One to bless them with an even longer stay.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤一个强大的天使或守护者来帮助你扫除邪恶。\n"
"他们的持续时间随祈祷技能的提升而增加，战斗中的荣耀可能会让光明神祝福他们，\n"
"从而能持续更长时间。\n"

#. key: brand weapon with holy wrath ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brand weapon with holy wrath ability"
msgid ""
"Permanently blesses a weapon of your choice with the holy wrath of the Shining\n"
"One. Demon weapons will be converted into a more powerful sacred weapon. This\n"
"blessing may only be used once, and it cannot be used on artefact weapons.\n"
msgstr ""
"选择一件武器，让光明神的神怒永久祝福它。\n"
"恶魔武器将被转化为更强力的圣武器。这个祝福只能使用一次，且不可用于神器。\n"

#. key: unearth wretches ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:unearth wretches ability"
msgid ""
"Bring forth those near death from Kikubaaqudgha's necropolis, providing ample\n"
"fodder for all kinds of necromancy. Their number and quality is dependent on\n"
"Necromancy skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"将那些濒死的生物从奇库巴库哈的墓地带出，为各种死灵法术提供充足的食材。\n"
"它们的数量和质量随死灵术技能的提升而提升。\n"

#. key: brand weapon with pain ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brand weapon with pain ability"
msgid ""
"Permanently bloodies a weapon of your choice with the essence of pain\n"
"itself. This blessing cannot be used on artefact weapons. You must choose\n"
"between this gift or that of knowledge of the most powerful necromantic spells,\n"
"and either gift may only be received once.\n"
msgstr ""
"用永久的痛楚血浴一件武器。这个祝福无法用于神器。\n"
"你必须在这个礼物和最强大的死灵法术之间二选一，而且任何一个礼物只能收到一次。\n"

#. key: receive forbidden knowledge ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:receive forbidden knowledge ability"
msgid ""
"Grants you knowledge of the most powerful and sinister Necromancy spells:\n"
"Haunt, Borgnjor's Revivification, Infestation, and Death's Door. You must choose\n"
"between this gift or that of branding a weapon with pain, and either gift may\n"
"only be received once.\n"
msgstr ""
"赐予你最强大、最邪恶的死灵法术：作祟、博格尼尔的再生、侵扰和死亡之门。\n"
"你必须在这个礼物和痛楚武器印记之间二选一，而且任何一个礼物只能收到一次。\n"

#. key: recall undead harvest ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:recall undead harvest ability"
msgid ""
"Recalls your undead followers from anywhere in the dungeon to your immediate\n"
"surroundings.\n"
msgstr ""
"立即将地牢中所有隶属于你的亡灵随从召唤到你的身边。\n"

#. key: bind soul ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bind soul ability"
msgid ""
"Attempts to bind the soul of a living, holy, or demonic being into your eternal\n"
"service. If the targeted monster is slain before it leaves your sight, it will\n"
"return as a bound soul, retaining the equipment, spells and abilities it had in\n"
"life.\n"
"\n"
"Only beings who are relatively uninjured may be targeted, and the focus required\n"
"to keep their soul from escaping will consume 1/3 of the user's current health -\n"
"returning it only upon slaying them. The attempt will fail entirely if the\n"
"targeted monster leaves your sight before the process is complete.\n"
"\n"
"The bound soul's health is influenced by the user's Invocations skill. It will\n"
"follow its captor through stairs, and can be recalled from other levels.\n"
"\n"
"Only one soul can be bound at a time.\n"
msgstr ""
"标记着一个怪物的灵魂已经成熟，可以提取。\n"
"如果怪物在标记失效前死亡，它会以缚魂的形态回归，\n"
"仍然弥留着它生前拥有的装备、法术和能力。\n"
"\n"
"活物、圣物和邪物都可以成为目标（除了大多数魔窟领主），\n"
"只要他们相对来说安然无恙。标记的持续时间取决于祈祷技能。\n"
"\n"
"缚魂将跟随它的捕获者穿过楼梯，并能在从其他楼层召回。一次只能束缚住一个灵魂。\n"

#. key: heroism ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:heroism ability"
msgid ""
"Temporarily increases all of your combat skills, both offensive and defensive.\n"
"The duration is increased by Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"暂时强化你的所有战斗技能，包括进攻和防御能力。\n"
"持续时间随祈祷技能的提升而增加。\n"

#. key: finesse ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:finesse ability"
msgid ""
"Greatly increases your combat speed. The duration is increased by Invocations\n"
"skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"大幅加快你的战斗速度。持续时间随祈祷技能的提升而增加。\n"

#. key: duel ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:duel ability"
msgid ""
"Enters you into single combat with a worthy foe. On success, you and the\n"
"challenged foe will be transported to Okawaru's Arena to fight to the death,\n"
"with no escape until you either emerge victorious or are slain.\n"
"\n"
"Half of your missing health will be restored as the duel begins, and upon\n"
"victory, Okawaru will return your health and magical power to whatever they\n"
"were before you issued the challenge - letting you shake off any damage taken\n"
"during it in the blink of an eye.\n"
msgstr ""
"让你和一个值得重视的敌人进行一对一博斗。\n"
"成功使用这个能力，你和被挑战的敌人将被运送到奥卡瓦鲁的角斗场战斗至死，\n"
"除非你取得胜利或被杀，否则无法逃脱。\n"

#. key: receive weapon ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:receive weapon ability"
msgid ""
"Acquires a weapon from a choice of four. This blessing may only be redeemed\n"
"once.\n"
msgstr ""
"从四把武器中选取其中一把。这个福泽只能承蒙一次。\n"

#. key: receive armour ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:receive armour ability"
msgid ""
"Acquires a piece of armour from a choice of four. This blessing may only be\n"
"redeemed once.\n"
msgstr ""
"从四件防具中选取其中一件。这个福泽只能承蒙一次。\n"

#. key: channel magic ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:channel magic ability"
msgid ""
"Dramatically increases the user's regeneration of magical power for a duration\n"
"that increases with Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"显著提高使用者的魔力回复能力，持续时间随着祈祷技能的提升而增加。\n"

#. key: forget spell ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:forget spell ability"
msgid ""
"Removes a known spell from memory, so as to free memory to learn others.\n"
msgstr ""
"忘记一道你记忆中的法术，以便腾出记忆空间来学新法术。\n"

#. key: divine exegesis ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:divine exegesis ability"
msgid ""
"Casts any spell from your spell library with guaranteed success. You receive a\n"
"bonus to spell power based on your Invocations skill that is worth 50% more\n"
"than equivalent levels of training in the relevant skills of the spell itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"能施展你的法术库中的任何法术，并保证成功。\n"
"你会获得基于你的祈祷技能的法力的加成，\n"
"比同等训练水平下的相关法术技能要高出50％。\n"

#. key: berserk ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:berserk ability"
msgid ""
"Sends the user into a berserk rage. Going berserk temporarily increases health,\n"
"speed, and damage dealt in melee. It will time out quickly outside of combat,\n"
"but may be extended by multiple kills. While berserk, almost all actions other\n"
"than movement and melee combat are prevented. When the rage expires, the user\n"
"will be slowed and unable to berserk again for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"使用者进入狂暴状态。进入狂暴状态后，会暂时提升生命值、速度以及近战攻击力。\n"
"不进行战斗，狂暴很快就会结束，但可以通过多次击杀而延长。\n"
"狂暴时，除了移动和近战外，几乎无法进行其余所有行为。\n"
"狂暴结束后，使用者将被减速，并在短时间内无法再次狂暴。\n"

#. key: trog's hand ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trog's hand ability"
msgid ""
"Invokes a powerful regeneration ability which stacks with all other sources and\n"
"is effective even on those who would not otherwise be able to regenerate. It\n"
"also fortifies the user's willpower, protecting against many magical effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"唤起强大的恢复能力，并能与其他来源的进行叠加，\n"
"即使对那些无法自行恢复的物种也生效。\n"
"它还会强化使用者的意志力，从而能抵御许多魔法效果。\n"

#. key: brothers in arms ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brothers in arms ability"
msgid ""
"Summons huge angry allies to wreak havoc.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤庞大而愤怒的友军进行破坏。\n"

#. key: purification ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:purification ability"
msgid ""
"Purges your body of poison, confusion, slowness, petrification, weakness, and\n"
"sickness. Any drained maximum health will also be fully restored.\n"
msgstr ""
"净化你的身体，消除中毒、混乱、减速、石化、虚弱和疾病状态。\n"
"任何被衰竭的力量、敏捷或智力以及被衰竭的最大生命值将完全恢复。\n"

#. key: heal other ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:heal other ability"
msgid ""
"Heals a creature other than yourself by a moderate amount, depending on\n"
"Invocations skill. Using this ability on hostile monsters will try to turn them\n"
"neutral. This works best on living creatures, with the undead and demons being\n"
"progressively harder to pacify. Intelligent creatures are also more difficult\n"
"to pacify.\n"
"\n"
"Ghosts of dead adventurers and demon lords are too wrathful to be pacified,\n"
"mindless creatures are too unintelligent to be pacified, and no monster can be\n"
"pacified while it is asleep.\n"
"\n"
"Whether the pacification succeeds or not, the invested piety and magic points\n"
"are lost. If it does succeed, the monster is healed and you gain the monster's\n"
"full experience value. Otherwise, the monster is unaffected and you gain\n"
"nothing.\n"
msgstr ""
"根据祈祷技能，治疗好一个你以外的目标生物的一些创伤。\n"
"对敌对怪物使用此能力将尝试使其变为中立。\n"
"这对动物最有效，而亡灵和恶魔则更难以安抚。智慧生物也更难以安抚。\n"
"\n"
"死去的冒险者的鬼魂和恶魔领主因太过愤怒而无法被安抚；\n"
"没有心智的生物太笨拙而无法被安抚；在沉睡的怪物也无法被安抚。\n"
"\n"
"不管安抚成功与否，付出的虔诚值和魔力都会失去。\n"
"如果成功，那么怪物会被治愈，并且你会获得怪物一半经验值。\n"
"否则，怪物不受到影响，你却一无所获。\n"

#. key: heal self ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:heal self ability"
msgid ""
"Heals a moderate amount of health, depending on Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"根据祈祷技能，治疗好一些创伤。\n"

#. key: divine vigour ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:divine vigour ability"
msgid ""
"Greatly increases your maximum health and magic points, depending on\n"
"Invocations skill. Your current health and magic points will also be increased\n"
"proportionally.\n"
msgstr ""
"根据祈祷技能，极大地提高你的最大生命和魔力值。\n"
"你当前的生命和魔力值也会成比例增加。\n"

#. key: depart the abyss ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:depart the abyss ability"
msgid ""
"Transports you out of the Abyss, returning you to the location from which you\n"
"entered it.\n"
msgstr ""
"离开深渊，回到你原来所在的地方。\n"

#. key: banish ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:banish ability"
msgid ""
"Attempts to banish a creature into the Abyss. If the attempt succeeds, you gain\n"
"some piety and the creature's full experience value. Even creatures that resist\n"
"are left malmutated and weakened by the brush with the Abyss. Invocations skill\n"
"makes Banishment harder to resist.\n"
msgstr ""
"尝试将一只怪物放逐到深渊中。如果尝试成功，\n"
"你会获得一些虔诚值和怪物的一半经验值。即使是能够抵抗的生物，\n"
"也会因与深渊摩擦而招致有害变异并变得虚弱。祈祷技能会让此能力更难被怪物抵抗。\n"

#. key: corrupt ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corrupt ability"
msgid ""
"Corrupts the current level by unleashing Abyssal energies on it. This will\n"
"cause the area nearby to change appearance, and will gate in creatures from the\n"
"Abyss bent on causing destruction. This will not work on levels already\n"
"corrupted or in the Abyss itself. The size of the effect is increased by\n"
"Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"释放深渊的能量，腐化当前所在的楼层。\n"
"这会导致该楼层的外貌剧变，并为深渊的怪物敞开大门，来进行破坏。\n"
"它无法作用于已遭到腐化的楼层和深渊本身。其效果随祈祷技能的提升而增强。\n"

#. key: enter the abyss ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:enter the abyss ability"
msgid ""
"Transports you to Lugonu's realm instantly. The effort of even using the\n"
"ability will leave your health depleted.\n"
msgstr ""
"立刻将你传送到卢格努的领域中。即使只是使用该能力，也会耗竭你的生命值。\n"

#. key: brand weapon with distortion ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brand weapon with distortion ability"
msgid ""
"Permanently corrupts a melee weapon of your choice with a localised field of\n"
"distortion. This blessing may only be used once, and it cannot be used on\n"
"artefact weapons.\n"
msgstr ""
"用局部扭曲场永久腐化你所选择的一件武器。\n"
"这个祝福只能使用一次，且不可用于神器。\n"

#. key: draw ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:draw ability"
msgid ""
"Draws a card from a deck of power.\n"
msgstr ""
"从能力牌组中抽取一张牌。\n"

#. key: triple draw ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:triple draw ability"
msgid ""
"Draws three cards from any deck, and allows you to choose one to play,\n"
"discarding the other two.\n"
msgstr ""
"从任意一副牌组中抽三张牌，选择一张进行游戏，然后弃掉另外两张。\n"

#. key: deal four ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deal four ability"
msgid ""
"Plays four cards from a deck in the time it normally takes to draw a\n"
"single card.\n"
msgstr ""
"在通常抽一张牌的时间内，从一副牌中打出四张牌。\n"

#. key: stack five ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stack five ability"
msgid ""
"Draws five cards from your choice of decks, and allows you to sort them into\n"
"any order. Subsequently, you can draw these cards in the order you chose.\n"
"Re-using this ability will discard the current stack.\n"
msgstr ""
"从你选择的牌组中抽五张牌，并可以把它们排为任何次序。\n"
"随后，你可以按照你所选的次序抽取这些牌。\n"
"重新使用这个能力将丢弃当前的牌堆。\n"

#. key: smiting ability
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:smiting ability"
msgid ""
"[[Smiting spell]] The strength of the smiting is increased by Invocations skill.\n"
"\n"
"Beogh will not allow you to use this directly against another apostle during a\n"
"divine trial.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[Smiting spell]] 惩戒的强度随祈祷技能的提升而增强。\n"

#. key: wall of briars ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wall of briars ability"
msgid ""
"Grows short-lived briar patches around you. Monsters attacking these briars will\n"
"be damaged by sharp thorns. Invocations skill increases the briars' health.\n"
msgstr ""
"在你周围长出短暂存活的荆棘丛。攻击这些荆棘的怪物将被锋利的刺伤害。\n"
"提升祈祷技能可以增加荆棘的生命值。\n"

#. key: grow ballistomycete ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grow ballistomycete ability"
msgid ""
"Grows a short-lived ballistomycete at the location you choose. A ballistomycete\n"
"occasionally releases spores that quickly seek out foes and violently explode,\n"
"damaging and confusing all living things caught in the blast.\n"
"\n"
"Invocations skill increases the health and duration of the ballistomycete as\n"
"well as the damage of its exploding spores.\n"
msgstr ""
"在你所选的一个位置长出短暂存活的弹道真菌。弹道真菌偶尔会释放孢子，\n"
"它会迅速发现敌人并剧烈爆炸，对被卷入爆炸的所有活物造成伤害和混乱。\n"
"\n"
"提升祈祷技能可以提高弹道真菌的生命值和存在时间，以及孢子爆炸的伤害。\n"

#. key: overgrow ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:overgrow ability"
msgid ""
"Permanently destroys a wall-like structure, growing a short-lived plant ally in\n"
"its place. Even a tree will give its life to support the will of Fedhas, and\n"
"only truly indestructible walls are immune to this power.\n"
msgstr ""
"永久破坏一个墙类结构，在其位置生出一个短期存活的友方植物。\n"
"即使是一棵树也要献出生命来支持费德哈的意志，\n"
"只有真正无法破坏的墙壁才能抵抗这种力量。\n"

#. key: grow oklob ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grow oklob ability"
msgid ""
"Grows a short-lived oklob plant at the location you choose. These dangerous\n"
"plants spray corrosive vitriol at your foes.\n"
"\n"
"Invocations skill increases the health and duration of the oklob as well as the\n"
"frequency with which it sprays its acid.\n"
msgstr ""
"在你所选的一个位置长出短暂存活的酸箭草。\n"
"这些危险的植物会向你的敌人喷吐腐蚀性的酸。\n"
"\n"
"提升祈祷技能可提高酸箭草的生命值和存在时间，以及其喷吐酸液的频率。\n"

#. key: bend time ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bend time ability"
msgid ""
"Attempts to slow down everyone adjacent to you. High Invocations skill makes it\n"
"harder to resist.\n"
msgstr ""
"尝试将与你相邻的一切生物减速。高级别的祈祷技能会让此能力更难被怪物抵抗。\n"

#. key: temporal distortion ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:temporal distortion ability"
msgid ""
"Warps the flow of time, causing monsters to skip forwards in time relative to\n"
"you.\n"
msgstr ""
"扭曲时间流，导致周围的怪物相对于你跳跃到未来的时间。\n"

#. key: slouch ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slouch ability"
msgid ""
"Causes damage to everyone in sight who is moving faster than you, dealing more\n"
"damage with greater differences in speed.\n"
msgstr ""
"对视线中每个移动速度比你快的造成伤害，速度差异越大，造成的伤害越大。\n"

#. key: step from time ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:step from time ability"
msgid ""
"Removes you completely from the flow of time. Time will pass as it usually does,\n"
"and monsters will wander away and sometimes even fall back to sleep. After some\n"
"time has passed, you will return in the same state as the very second you\n"
"departed.\n"
"\n"
"Invocations skill increases the likelihood that your absence will have been so\n"
"long that alert monsters have fallen asleep again.\n"
msgstr ""
"将你从时间流中脱离出来。\n"
"周围的东西还是按它们平常的习性奔波：怪物会四处游荡，甚至可能会忘记你。\n"
"过一段时间后，你将回到与离开时的相同的状态。\n"
"提升祈祷技能可以增加你离去的时间。\n"

#. key: slimify ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slimify ability"
msgid ""
"Coats a wielded weapon or your fists with slime, turning the next living or\n"
"corporeal undead monster hit into a neutral slime.\n"
msgstr ""
"在你的武器或拳头上裹上黏液，\n"
"下一个击中的活物或有形的亡灵生物会变成一个中立的黏液。\n"

#. key: oozemancy ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:oozemancy ability"
msgid ""
"Calls forth acidic ooze from the walls of the dungeon around you, damaging foes\n"
"depending on the number of slimy walls they remain adjacent to.\n"
msgstr ""
"从你周围的地牢墙壁中召唤出酸性软泥，对敌人造成伤害，\n"
"伤害取决于与其相邻的黏性墙壁的数量。\n"

#. key: curse item ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:curse item ability"
msgid ""
"Curses a chosen equipped item, binding it to the wearer until the curse\n"
"and the item both are broken. Cursed items can no longer be enchanted or\n"
"modified.\n"
msgstr ""
"诅咒一个选定的装备着的物品，将其束缚到穿戴者身上，直到诅咒和物品都被打破。\n"
"被诅咒的物品再也无法被附魔或调整。\n"

#. key: shatter the chains ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shatter the chains ability"
msgid ""
"Destroys a chosen cursed equipped item, relieving the wearer of the curse.\n"
msgstr ""
"摧毁一个选定的诅咒装备，解除佩戴者的诅咒。\n"

#. key: potion petition ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion petition ability"
msgid ""
"Petitions Gozag to sell you the effects of a set of potions. (These effects will\n"
"be applied instantly and directly to the petitioner, rather than being provided\n"
"or being drunk as a normal potion.) Gozag will offer three lists at a time, with\n"
"varying prices.\n"
msgstr ""
"向哥萨戈祈求给你出售一批药水的效用。哥萨戈会一次给出三张清单，其价格不一。\n"

#. key: call merchant ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:call merchant ability"
msgid ""
"Sends funds to a merchant to help them set up shop at your location. The cost of\n"
"funding a shop increases with the number of shops funded.\n"
msgstr ""
"资助商人在你那里开店。\n"
"开店的成本会随以这种方式开设的商店的数量增加而增加。\n"

#. key: bribe branch ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bribe branch ability"
msgid ""
"Gives 3000 gold to Gozag to spread throughout the inhabitants of the current\n"
"branch, only possible if the branch has intelligent inhabitants. Those monsters\n"
"may then become uninterested in fighting you (with tougher inhabitants having\n"
"an increasing chance of being bribed), and more rarely will join your ranks,\n"
"though they will not leave their home branch. Enemies accepting a bribe will\n"
"lower the remaining bribe fund; upon its exhaustion, bribed enemies will become\n"
"indifferent if they have not become your allies.\n"
msgstr ""
"给哥萨戈3000金币，将其散布给当前分支的所有居住者，前提是该分支有智慧生物。\n"
"这些怪物可能会失去与你战斗的兴趣（越强大的生物被贿赂的几率越大），\n"
"并有很小的几率会加入你的行列，尽管他们还是不会离开自己的分支。\n"
"接受贿赂的敌人会降低剩余的贿赂资金；\n"
"当其耗尽时，如果贿赂的敌人没能成为盟友，他们将变得冷漠。\n"

#. key: upheaval ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:upheaval ability"
msgid ""
"Calls on the forces of nature to blast a small area with magma, ice, wind,\n"
"or rubble. This blast will never harm you or any elementals manifested by you.\n"
"Invocations skill increases both damage and area affected.\n"
msgstr ""
"呼唤自然力量，用岩浆、冰、风或碎石轰击一小片区域。\n"
"提升祈祷技能会增加伤害和受影响的范围。\n"

#. key: elemental force ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elemental force ability"
msgid ""
"Causes your elemental clouds to coalesce into friendly elementals. Your\n"
"Invocations skill increases the maximum number of elementals that can be\n"
"created with one use of the ability.\n"
msgstr ""
"使你的元素云合并成友好的元素。\n"
"提升祈祷技能，可以增加使用此能力时一次生成的最大元素数量。\n"

#. key: disaster area ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:disaster area ability"
msgid ""
"Blasts the entire area around you with powerful natural forces. Invocations\n"
"skill increases both damage and area affected.\n"
msgstr ""
"用强大的自然力量轰炸你周围整片区域。提升祈祷技能会增加伤害和受影响的范围。\n"

#. key: draw out power ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:draw out power ability"
msgid ""
"Taps into your inner power to restore health and magic, as well as freeing your\n"
"body and mind from external constraints, including nets, webs, constriction,\n"
"petrification, slowness, and confusion. The amount of health and magic restored\n"
"increases with piety.\n"
msgstr ""
"发掘你的潜力，恢复健康和魔力，并使你的身心从外部约束中解放出来，\n"
"包括网、束缚、石化、减慢和混乱。健康和魔法的恢复量随虔诚值增加而增加。\n"

#. key: power leap ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:power leap ability"
msgid ""
"Performs an incredibly fast leap to a targeted location, causing an explosion\n"
"upon landing which damages all adjacent foes. The amount of damage done\n"
"increases with your piety and experience level.\n"
msgstr ""
"以难以置信的速度跳到目标位置，着陆时引起爆炸，对所有相邻的敌人造成伤害。\n"
"造成的伤害会随你的虔诚值和经验等级的提高而增加。\n"

#. key: apocalypse ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:apocalypse ability"
msgid ""
"Reveals Ru's truth to your enemies, dealing severe damage to all enemies in\n"
"your line of sight. Affected creatures may be paralysed, slowed or have their\n"
"magic drained. The damage dealt increases with your piety and experience level.\n"
msgstr ""
"向敌人昭示入的真言，对视线内所有敌人造成严重伤害。\n"
"受影响的生物可能会麻痹、减慢或流失其魔力。\n"
"造成的伤害会随你的虔诚值和经验等级的提高而增加。\n"

#. key: sacrifice purity ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice purity ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices purity of body or mind, causing a single mutation.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃身体或心灵的纯洁，造成一次变异。\n"

#. key: sacrifice words ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice words ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices the ability to use magical scrolls in combat unless badly injured.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃在受伤时使用魔法卷轴的能力。\n"

#. key: sacrifice drink ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice drink ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices the ability to drink potions in combat unless badly injured.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃在受伤时使用饮用药水的能力。\n"

#. key: sacrifice essence ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice essence ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices magical essence, causing a single mutation.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃魔法精华，引发一次变异。\n"

#. key: sacrifice health ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice health ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices physical health, causing a single mutation.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃身体健康，引发一次变异。\n"

#. key: sacrifice stealth ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice stealth ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices stealth, causing you to always be noticed by foes and preventing\n"
"you from having any ranks in the Stealth skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃潜行，使你总能被敌人注意到，并让你的潜行技能无法达到任何等级。\n"

#. key: sacrifice forms ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice forms ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices forms, preventing you from voluntarily changing your form and from\n"
"having any ranks in the Shapeshifting skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃形态，你无法自行改变形态，也无法在变身技能上达到任何等级。\n"

#. key: sacrifice artifice ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice artifice ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices the ability to evoke any magical items, and prevents you from having\n"
"any ranks in the Evocations skill.\n"
"\n"
"This includes wands and other items which use Evocations skill - that is, it does\n"
"*not* affect reaching weapons, talismans, and ziggurat figurines. This also renders\n"
"magical staves much less effective in melee.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃激活魔法物品的能力，并让你的激活技能无法达到任何等级。\n"
"\n"
"这包括魔杖和其他需要用到激活技能的物品——\n"
"但这*不会*影响获得的武器、符咒和金字塔雕像。\n"
"这也使得法杖在近战时的效果大大降低。\n"

#. key: sacrifice love ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice love ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices love, causing all creatures to become hostile, even those created\n"
"by you. Monsters that are spell residue and which do not act independently,\n"
"such as orbs of destruction and spectral weapons, are the only things which can\n"
"remain friendly.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃爱，使所有的生物变得敌对，甚至那些由你创造的。\n"
"只有法术残留物和不能独立行动的，比如毁灭球和幽灵武器，才能保持友好。\n"

#. key: sacrifice courage ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice courage ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices courage, causing you to become terrified of dangerous monsters. Such\n"
"monsters fill you with horror, which reduces the power of your spells and your\n"
"ability to hit and damage monsters in combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃勇气，会让你恐惧危险的怪物。\n"
"这些怪物会让你充满恐惧，这会削弱你的法术威力以及战斗中打击和伤害怪物的能力。\n"

#. key: sacrifice arcana ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice arcana ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices arcana, causing you to lose the ability to use certain schools of\n"
"magic and preventing you from having any ranks in those skills.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃奥术，使你失去使用某些类型魔法的能力，并让你的这些技能无法达到任何等级。\n"

#. key: sacrifice nimbleness ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice nimbleness ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices nimbleness, preventing you from having any ranks in the Dodging\n"
"skill. This sacrifice is worth more if you cannot train Armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃敏捷，使你无法在闪避技能上达到任何等级。\n"
"如果你无法训练护甲技能，这个舍弃会更有价值。\n"

#. key: sacrifice durability ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice durability ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices durability, preventing you from having any ranks in the Armour\n"
"skill. This sacrifice is worth more if you cannot train Dodging.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃耐久，使你无法在护甲技能上达到任何等级。\n"
"如果你无法训练闪避技能，这个舍弃会更有价值。\n"

#. key: sacrifice a hand ability
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice a hand ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices a hand, causing you to lose the ability to use shields{{\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Formicid\" then\n"
"        return \" and two-handed weapons\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}, and to be able to wear one fewer ring.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃一只手，使你不能使用盾牌{{\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Formicid\" then\n"
"        return \"和双手武器\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}且可佩戴戒指数减一。\n"

#. key: sacrifice experience ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice experience ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices some of your past experiences, causing you to lose one level\n"
"immediately and also to have the maximum level you can attain lowered by one.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃一些你的过去的经验，使你立刻降两个等级，你可达到的等级上限也会降一级。\n"

#. key: sacrifice skill ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice skill ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices your skills, causing you to have all of your skill aptitudes\n"
"decreased by one. This will likely cause you to lose ranks in trained skills.\n"
msgstr ""
"牺牲你的技能，使你所有的技能下降1。这可能会使你失去训练过的技能等级。\n"

#. key: sacrifice an eye ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice an eye ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices an eye, causing you to have a much harder time hitting targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃一只眼，使你更难命中目标。\n"

#. key: sacrifice resistance ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacrifice resistance ability"
msgid ""
"Sacrifices your resistance to extreme temperatures, causing you to become\n"
"vulnerable to heat and cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"舍弃你对极端温度的抵抗力，使你易受冷和热的伤害。\n"

#. key: reject sacrifices ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:reject sacrifices ability"
msgid ""
"Rejects all offered sacrifices. Doing so means Ru will take more time\n"
"evaluating your readiness for future sacrifices. Ru will not offer more\n"
"sacrifices while there is an existing offer still extended.\n"
"\n"
"Each consecutive rejection increases the sacrifice timer significantly.\n"
"Accepting a sacrifice will reset the timer to the standard length.\n"
msgstr ""
"拒绝所有要求的舍弃。这意味着入将会花更多时间评估你对后面的舍弃所做的准备。\n"
"在现有的舍弃延期的情况下，入不会要求做出其他舍弃。\n"
"\n"
"每个连续的拒绝都会显著增加舍弃的计时。\n"
"接受舍弃会将计时重置到标准长度。\n"

#. key: stomp ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stomp ability"
msgid ""
"Stomps down in time with the rhythm of the dance, sending a shockwave through\n"
"all adjacent creatures. The shockwave damages each creature by a fraction of\n"
"its current health, plus damage increasing with Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"随着舞蹈的节奏及时跺地，向所有相邻生物发出冲击波。\n"
"冲击波对每个生物造成的伤害会是其当前生命值的一小部分，\n"
"提升祈祷技能会增加伤害。\n"

#. key: line pass ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:line pass ability"
msgid ""
"Passes through a contiguous line of creatures at superhuman speed, ending up\n"
"in a new location. Any creatures passed through in this way will be confused\n"
"briefly, with the duration of confusion increasing with Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"以超人的速度穿过连续的生物线，最终到一个新的位置。\n"
"穿过的任何生物都会被短暂地混乱，混乱持续时间随着祈祷技能的提升而增加。\n"

#. key: grand finale ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grand finale ability"
msgid ""
"Merges with a target emotionally and physically, and then bursts forth from\n"
"them, violently splitting them apart and killing them instantly. This ability\n"
"becomes easier to use as the worshipper's piety and Invocations skill increase.\n"
"\n"
"More violent Uskayaw sects consider their members not to be true worshippers\n"
"until they have performed this rite.\n"
msgstr ""
"在情感上和身体上与目标融合，然后从他们身上爆发，猛烈地将他们分开，\n"
"并立即杀死他们。当信徒的虔诚值和祈祷技能提升时，这个技能变得更易使用。\n"
"\n"
"更狂热的乌斯卡亚教派认为，其成员在完成这一仪式前不算真正的信徒。\n"

#. key: renounce religion ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:renounce religion ability"
msgid ""
"Renounces your faith. This will make you leave your god (and usually anger\n"
"said god).\n"
msgstr ""
"与你信仰的神断绝关系。这会导致你不再信仰该神（通常来说，这会触怒该神）。\n"

#. key: convert to beogh ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:convert to beogh ability"
msgid ""
"Swears fealty to Beogh, the god of cave orcs. This god demands that all\n"
"non-believers must die, but new believers must be spared and accepted into the\n"
"fold. Beware, for orcs who do not see you convert may still be hostile until\n"
"you have built your reputation!\n"
"\n"
"All other gods hate Beogh, and do not take desertion lightly.\n"
msgstr ""
"向洞穴兽人之神——比欧弗宣誓效忠。\n"
"比欧弗要求杀死一切异教徒，但新信徒会被饶恕，并被接纳入教会。需要小心：\n"
"在你名声响亮起来之前，没有看见你皈依比欧弗的兽人可能还是会与你为敌！\n"
"\n"
"所有其他神祗都厌恶比欧弗，不要轻易背叛。\n"

#. key: donate gold ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:donate gold ability"
msgid ""
"Donates half of your gold to Zin, which will increase your piety over time. The\n"
"overall increase is determined by the size of your donation.\n"
msgstr ""
"将你的一半黄金献给辛，你的虔诚值会随时间而增加。\n"
"所增的总量取决于你的捐献数额。\n"

#. key: recall ancestor ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:recall ancestor ability"
msgid ""
"Recalls your ancestor from anywhere in the dungeon to your immediate\n"
"surroundings.\n"
msgstr ""
"将你的先祖从地牢的任何地方召回到你的跟前。\n"

#. key: idealise ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:idealise ability"
msgid ""
"Restores your ancestor to an idyllic vision of their best self. Their wounds\n"
"are forgotten and a glow of perfection infuses them, giving them a short-lived\n"
"but dramatic increase in strength, spellcasting, and armour. The quality of the\n"
"healing and duration of the idealisation granted are both improved by the\n"
"Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"使你的先祖复现自己心目中完美的愿景。\n"
"他们的创伤被忘却，无瑕的光芒注入他们，使其力量、法术和防具短暂而急剧地增强。\n"
"祈祷技能可以提高治愈效果和理想化持续时间。\n"

#. key: transference ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:transference ability"
msgid ""
"Forces a targeted creature to pass through the realms of memory and exchange\n"
"places with your ancestor.\n"
"\n"
"With great piety, those near the target will be drained to a degree depending\n"
"on Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"迫使一个目标生物穿过记忆领域，与你的祖先交换位置。\n"
"\n"
"有着大量虔诚值，那些靠近目标的会被衰竭，其程度取决于祈祷技能。\n"

#. key: ancestor life: knight ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ancestor life: knight ability"
msgid ""
"Remembers your ancestor as a knight, a strong melee combatant with superior\n"
"defences. This choice is permanent and cannot be undone.\n"
msgstr ""
"回想起你的先祖是个骑士，他是个有着出色近战和防御能力的战士。\n"
"此选择是永久的，不能撤消。\n"

#. key: ancestor life: battlemage ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ancestor life: battlemage ability"
msgid ""
"Remembers your ancestor as a battlemage, a warrior capable of relentless offence\n"
"with both melee and conjurations. This choice is permanent and cannot be undone.\n"
msgstr ""
"回想你的先祖是个战斗法师，一个能够近战和使用魔法进行冷酷攻击的战士。\n"
"此选择是永久的，不能撤消。\n"

#. key: ancestor life: hexer ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ancestor life: hexer ability"
msgid ""
"Remembers your ancestor as a hexer, a cunning rogue capable of swift\n"
"knifework and debilitating spellcasting. This choice is permanent and cannot be\n"
"undone.\n"
msgstr ""
"回想起你的先祖是个妖术师，一个掌握熟练刀法和衰败魔法技能的狡猾的贼。\n"
"此选择是永久的，不能撤消。\n"

#. key: ancestor identity ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ancestor identity ability"
msgid ""
"Recalls who your ancestor preferred to be known as, correcting their name and\n"
"gender.\n"
msgstr ""
"回忆你的先祖更喜欢被称为什么，并更正其姓名和性别。\n"

#. key: wall jump ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wall jump ability"
msgid ""
"Vaults off an adjacent wall towards enemies, striking all enemies adjacent to\n"
"the landing spot and taking two turns to complete the motion.\n"
msgstr ""
"从相邻的墙壁跳起冲向敌人，对所有与着陆点相邻的敌人造成冲击，\n"
"这需要花两个回合完成动作。\n"

#. key: serpent's lash ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:serpent's lash ability"
msgid ""
"Allows you to move at supernatural speeds, making any normal movements up to a\n"
"distance of two tiles instant. Martial attacks performed under the effect of\n"
"Serpent's Lash are more damaging and never miss.\n"
msgstr ""
"使你以超自然的速度移动，能瞬间移动到两格远的位置。\n"
"在蛇鞭的作用下，武术攻击具有更大的杀伤力且总能命中。\n"

#. key: heavenly storm ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:heavenly storm ability"
msgid ""
"Invokes a storm of heavenly clouds. While the storm rages, your evasion and\n"
"combat accuracy and damage are substantially increased, and striking enemies\n"
"with martial attacks increases this bonus. The storm weakens over time and\n"
"fades away once the bonus reaches zero. The heavenly clouds prevent\n"
"invisibility, and obscure the vision of those outside the storm.\n"
msgstr ""
"引起一场天云风暴。当风暴肆虐时，你的闪避和战斗准确度和伤害会大幅增加，\n"
"而且通过武术攻击敌人时还会有加成。风暴会随着时间的推移而减弱，\n"
"一旦加成达到零就会消失。天云阻止了隐形，也模糊了风暴外的人的视线。\n"

#. key: fiery armour ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fiery armour ability"
msgid ""
"Armours yourself in fire, providing +7 AC and searing foes foolish enough to\n"
"strike you in melee. The fire takes quite a long time to burn out.\n"
msgstr ""
"用火焰武装自己，提供7点防护并灼烧那些蠢到胆敢近战攻击你敌人。\n"
"火需要很长时间才能熄灭。\n"

#. key: foxfire swarm ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:foxfire swarm ability"
msgid ""
"Conjures a swarm of animate flames all around you. These rapidly seek the\n"
"nearest monsters, burning them. They will dissipate harmlessly if unable to\n"
"reach a target or if you swap places with them.\n"
msgstr ""
"在你周围生成一群有生命的火焰。它们迅速寻找最近的怪物，灼烧它们。\n"
"如果没能碰到目标或与它们交换位置，它们将无害地消散。\n"

#. key: rising flame ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rising flame ability"
msgid ""
"Sends you floating upward and, after a short delay for Ignis to gather enough\n"
"power, blasts you through the ceiling and into the level above. This ability\n"
"may only be used once.\n"
msgstr ""
"你会向上飘浮，在伊格尼斯短暂延迟以收集足够的能量后，\n"
"会炸穿天花板，将你轰入上层。此能力只能使用一次。\n"

#. key: hop ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hop ability"
msgid ""
"Hops toward a chosen destination, landing somewhere nearby. After using this\n"
"ability, you will be unable to hop again until you have spent some time not\n"
"moving. (Other actions, such as casting spells and attacking, are fine.)\n"
msgstr ""
"向一个选定的目的地弹跳，会在附近的某个地方落地。\n"
"使用此能力后，在你有一段时间不进行移动后，才能重新弹跳。\n"
"（其他动作，比如施法和攻击，是可行的。）\n"

#. key: blinkbolt ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blinkbolt ability"
msgid ""
"Turns the user into living lightning and zaps them at the chosen monster,\n"
"dealing electric damage to everything in their path and depositing the user\n"
"at the bolt's end. After using this ability, you will be unable to use it\n"
"again for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"将使用者化成一道活体闪电并击向选定的怪物，\n"
"对其路径上的所有物体造成电击伤害并将使用者放置在它的终点。\n"
"使用此能力后，短时间内无法再次使用它。\n"

#. key: siphon essence ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:siphon essence ability"
msgid ""
"Torments nearby living foes, halving their health. The pain inflicted heals\n"
"the user to an extent determined by Shapeshifting skill. After using this\n"
"ability, you will be unable to use it again for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"折磨附近的活物敌人，使其生命值减半。\n"
"所造成的痛楚能治疗使用者，治愈量取决于变身技能。\n"
"使用此能力后，短时间内无法再次使用它。\n"

#. key: evoke the sceptre of asmodeus ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:evoke the sceptre of asmodeus ability"
msgid ""
"Calls on the power of Asmodeus to summon fiery demons of Hell. The demons\n"
"summoned will remain friendly only for a limited time, eventually becoming\n"
"hostile before vanishing. The success of the ability scales with the Evocations\n"
"skill, and this ability is available only while wielding the Sceptre of\n"
"Asmodeus.\n"
msgstr ""
"唤起阿斯蒙蒂斯的力量，召唤地狱的火系恶魔。\n"
"被召唤的恶魔只会在有限的时间内保持友好，在最终消失之前会变得敌对。\n"
"该能力的强度与激活技能成正比，并且该能力仅在使用阿斯蒙蒂斯的节杖时可用。\n"

#. key: evoke damnation ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:evoke damnation ability"
msgid ""
"Blasts a targeted enemy with damnation. These unholy forces harm the victim and\n"
"anyone adjacent, and are not affected by any means of protection, such as armour\n"
"or resistances. However, certain creatures, usually those able to invoke\n"
"damnation themselves, are entirely unscathed by damnation. The power of this\n"
"ability scales with the Evocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"用天谴轰击一个目标敌人。这些邪恶的力量会伤害目标和附近的任何人，\n"
"并且不被任何保护手段削弱，比如盔甲或抗性。\n"
"但某些生物，通常是那些能够自己释放天遣的生物，完全不受天遣的伤害。\n"
"该能力的强度与激活技能成正比。\n"

#. key: evoke the staff of olgreb ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:evoke the staff of olgreb ability"
msgid ""
"Causes the caster to radiate toxic energy, continuously inflicting poison on\n"
"everything in line of sight for as long as the aura lasts. The power of this\n"
"ability scales with the Evocations skill, and this ability is available only\n"
"while wielding the Staff of Olgreb.\n"
msgstr ""
"使施法者散发出剧毒能量，在光环存在的时间内，就会对视线内的一切持续进行毒害。\n"
"该能力的强度与激活技能成正比，并且该能力仅在使用奥格雷布的法杖时可用。\n"

#. key: velocity card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:velocity card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts an empty, well-worn pair of boots. Sand, ashes, and turf\n"
"coat the boots' soles.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card can grant great speed to allies or terrible slowness to foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一双破旧、空着的靴子。靴底沾着沙子、灰和草皮。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌，自己和友方的速度会得到极大提升，而敌人的行动会严重迟缓。\n"

#. key: the tomb card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the tomb card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a royal crypt, its entrance sealed by a heavy stone slab.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card entombs its user in protective, temporary walls of solid rock.\n"
"At lower power levels or with adjacent creatures, the tomb may be imperfect.\n"
"\n"
"The tomb is sustained by the presence of its creator within it, and moving from\n"
"the centre of the tomb will cause its walls to crumble away.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一个皇陵，其入口被沉重的石板密封。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌会将使用者封入具有临时保护作用的坚硬的岩墙中。\n"
"在能量不高或有相邻生物时，这个墓可能有缺陷。\n"
"\n"
"这个坟墓要有其创建者在内部维持，如果从坟墓中心离开，墙壁就会倒塌。\n"

#. key: exile card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:exile card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts ceaseless hands from a yawning portal overcoming a panicked\n"
"figure.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card can banish nearby creatures to the abyss, with more being banished\n"
"at higher power levels. It will never banish the user.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着源源不断的手从一个张着大口的传送门伸出，\n"
"正在淹没一个恐慌的身影。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌可以将附近的一个或多个怪物放逐到深渊，能量越高，放逐的生物越多。\n"
"它永远不会放逐使用者。\n"

#. key: the shaft card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the shaft card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a traveller plummeting into a chasm that has opened beneath\n"
"them.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will create a shaft beneath the user, and possibly beneath\n"
"their enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一名旅人跌入其下方的裂口。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌会在使用者下方生成地洞，也有可能生成在敌人的脚下。\n"

#. key: the elixir card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the elixir card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a smug smile formed out of nine chalices.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card rapidly restores the user's health and magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一个由九个圣杯组成的自鸣得意的微笑。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌可以快速恢复使用者的健康和魔法。\n"

#. key: the cloud card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the cloud card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts an iron gate enshrouded in mist.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card enshrouds the user's foes in rings of detrimental clouds. The\n"
"effects of such clouds will vary with card power.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一扇被笼罩在薄雾中的铁门。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌，使用者的的敌人会被笼罩在一圈云层中。\n"
"云层的持续时间将随着卡牌能力的提高而延长。\n"

#. key: vitriol card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vitriol card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts an oklob plant, dripping with its distinctive corrosive sap.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will unleash a corrosive attack spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着酸箭草，它正在滴着独特的腐蚀性汁液。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌，会释放一个腐蚀性攻击法术。\n"

#. key: the storm card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the storm card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a ship at sea sinking in a thunderstorm.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card unleashes a storm of wind and electrical discharges.\n"
"Increasing card power will result in a stronger wind force and stronger, more\n"
"numerous discharges.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着在海上的雷暴中沉没的一艘船。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌会释放风暴和电流。\n"
"增加牌的能量会生成更强的风和更强、更多的电流。\n"

#. key: pain card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pain card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts an iron wheel, menacing with spikes and rusted with blood.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card unleashes a necromantic attack spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一个布有尖刺，被血锈蚀的充满威胁的铁轮。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌会释放一个有着攻击性的死灵术。\n"

#. key: the orb card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the orb card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a figure surrounded by floating, glowing orbs of energy.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card unleashes one or possibly more destructive orbs of pure magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一个被浮动的、发光的能量球环绕着的身影。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌会释放一个或多个纯魔力毁灭球。\n"

#. key: degeneration card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:degeneration card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a dragon whose scales are sloughing off, revealing a sheep\n"
"underneath.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will attempt to polymorph and malmutate nearby enemies into\n"
"weaker forms, and will briefly daze those that cannot be polymorphed.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一只龙，其鳞片正在脱落，露出其中的绵羊。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌会尝试将附近的敌人变成较弱的形态，如果他们无法被变形，会暂时昏迷。\n"

#. key: wild magic card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wild magic card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a pointy wizard's hat, scorched and resting on a pile of ashes.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card causes wild magic (as if from miscasting a spell) to act upon\n"
"its user's enemies. Each creature affected will restore some of the user's\n"
"magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一个被烧焦的尖顶巫师帽，置在一堆灰烬上。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌会导致狂野魔法（就像是误施了法术）作用于使用者的敌人。\n"
"每当有生物受影响，就会恢复使用者的一些魔力。\n"

#. key: the elements card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the elements card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts the figures of great beasts lurking in a sandstorm.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will summon three beasts of the four elements.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着潜伏在沙尘暴中野兽的身影。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌，会从四类元素怪物中召唤三个野兽。\n"

#. key: the pentagram card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the pentagram card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts cultists marking out a ritual pentagram on the floor.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will summon a pair of demons to the user's aid. There is a\n"
"small chance one of the demons will be hostile.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着由邪教徒在地板上所刻画的仪式五角星图案。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌将召唤一对恶魔，来援助使用者。有小概率其中一个恶魔是敌对的。\n"

#. key: the dance card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the dance card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts an extravagantly-dressed, masked figure dancing alone in a\n"
"vast room.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will summon a dancing weapon. Its quality, brand, and\n"
"friendliness are all affected by card power.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一个衣着过度华丽、戴着面具的人在一个宽敞的房间里独自起舞。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌将召唤出一把飞舞的武器。其质量、印记和友好程度都受卡牌力量影响。\n"

#. key: the swarm card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the swarm card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a bear surrounded by a swarm of bees. It hums ominously.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will summon bees.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘了一只被蜂群包围的熊。它发出不祥的嗡嗡声。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌将会召唤群蜂。\n"

#. key: the rangers card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the rangers card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts an arrow in a bull's-eye, which has been split by a second\n"
"arrow.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will summon several archers.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着正中靶心一支箭，同时被第二支箭劈开。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌将召唤出几个射手。\n"

#. key: the illusion card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the illusion card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts someone standing in a hall of mirrors, surrounded by their own\n"
"reflections.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will summon an illusion of the user. Its power will depend\n"
"upon one's own.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一个人站在镜厅里，周围都是自己的倒影。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌将召唤出使用者的幻象。它的力量取决于你自己。\n"

#. key: wrath card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wrath card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts the hand of the divine, reaching down from the heavens to hurl\n"
"furious lightning.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will draw a god's wrath against the user.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着神之手，从天堂垂下来，投射出猛烈的闪电。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌会招致神怒。\n"

#. key: the wraith card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the wraith card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts absolutely nothing.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will drain the user.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上什么也没有。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌会让使用者衰竭。\n"

#. key: the swine card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:the swine card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts several feral hogs wallowing in a mud pit.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will make its user turn pink and root for truffles.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着几只野猪在泥坑中打滚。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌，使用者会变成寻找松露的粉色的猪。\n"

#. key: torment card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:torment card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a screaming figure being tortured on the rack.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card will cause agonising injury to the user.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一个尖叫的人在架子上受到拷打。\n"
"\n"
"抽出此牌会让使用者承受痛苦的伤害。\n"

#. key: a buggy card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a buggy card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a Crawl player filing a bug report on Mantis.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card is a bug, if one ever encounters it as such.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一个Crawl玩家在向Mantis提交错误报告。\n"
"\n"
"如果你抽到此牌，说明遇到错误了。\n"

#. key: a very buggy card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a very buggy card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts several Crawl players angrily filing several bug reports on\n"
"Mantis.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card is a bug, if one ever encounters it as such.\n"
msgstr ""
"这张牌上描绘着一些Crawl玩家气愤地向Mantis提交许多错误报告。\n"
"\n"
"如果你抽到此牌，说明遇到错误了。\n"

#. key: cmd_rest
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_rest"
msgid ""
"Rest and heal\n"
msgstr ""
"休息并回血\n"

#. key: cmd_rest verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_rest verbose"
msgid ""
"Rests while your health and magic regenerate. Resting is interrupted as soon\n"
"as a hostile monster comes into view. If health and magic are both already\n"
"full, resting will wait for 100 turns.\n"
msgstr ""
"恢复你的健康和魔力。一旦有敌对怪物出现，休息就会中断。\n"
"如果生命值和魔法值都已满，此将休息100回合。\n"

#. key: cmd_explore
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_explore"
msgid ""
"Autoexplore the current level\n"
msgstr ""
"自动探索当前楼层\n"

#. key: cmd_explore verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_explore verbose"
msgid ""
"Automatically explores the current level, collecting items on the way.\n"
"Exploration stops as soon as a hostile monster comes into view, or when you\n"
"encounter new items or features.\n"
msgstr ""
"自动探索当前楼层，并沿途收集物品。\n"
"一旦发现有敌对怪物，或是遇到新物品或新地标时，探索就会停止。\n"

#. key: cmd_interlevel_travel
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_interlevel_travel"
msgid ""
"Travel to distant levels\n"
msgstr ""
"前往其他楼层\n"

#. key: cmd_interlevel_travel verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_interlevel_travel verbose"
msgid ""
"Automatically travels to a chosen level or branch. Travel is interrupted by\n"
"monsters coming into view.\n"
msgstr ""
"自动前往指定的楼层或分支。一旦有怪物出现，移动就会中断。\n"

#. key: cmd_use_ability
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_use_ability"
msgid ""
"Use divine, innate or evokable abilities\n"
msgstr ""
"使用神赐的、先天的或激活的能力\n"

#. key: cmd_search_stashes
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_search_stashes"
msgid ""
"Search for items/features\n"
msgstr ""
"搜索物品/地标\n"

#. key: cmd_search_stashes verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_search_stashes verbose"
msgid ""
"Searches for items or features seen elsewhere, and allows you to travel to\n"
"their location.\n"
msgstr ""
"搜索看到过的物品或地标，并可以前往它们的所在地。\n"

#. key: cmd_replay_messages
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_replay_messages"
msgid ""
"Reread recent messages\n"
msgstr ""
"重读最近的游戏信息\n"

#. key: cmd_resists_screen
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_resists_screen"
msgid ""
"Display character overview\n"
msgstr ""
"显示角色概况\n"

#. key: cmd_resists_screen verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_resists_screen verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays an overview of your current resistances, abilities, equipment and\n"
"attributes.\n"
msgstr ""
"显示你当前的抗性、能力、装备和属性的概况。\n"

#. key: cmd_display_overmap
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_overmap"
msgid ""
"Display dungeon overview\n"
msgstr ""
"显示地牢概况\n"

#. key: cmd_display_overmap verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_overmap verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays an overview of dungeon branch locations, discovered altars, shops and\n"
"level annotations.\n"
msgstr ""
"显示地牢分支位置、发现的祭坛、商店和楼层注释的概况。\n"

#. key: cmd_display_religion
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_religion"
msgid ""
"Display religious status\n"
msgstr ""
"显示信仰状况\n"

#. key: cmd_display_religion verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_religion verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays your god's likes and dislikes, conduct, and your current religious\n"
"standing and divine abilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"显示你信仰的神祗的好恶、行为，以及当前的信仰等级和神赐的能力。\n"

#. key: cmd_display_mutations
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_mutations"
msgid ""
"Display mutations\n"
msgstr ""
"显示变异\n"

#. key: cmd_display_skills
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_skills"
msgid ""
"Manage skills\n"
msgstr ""
"管理技能\n"

#. key: cmd_display_character_status
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_character_status"
msgid ""
"Display character status\n"
msgstr ""
"显示角色状态\n"

#. key: cmd_display_character_status verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_character_status verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays details on your current movement speed, attack speed, stealth, magic\n"
"resistance, and any currently active enchantments or status effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"显示当前移动速度、攻击速度、潜行、魔法抗性以及\n"
"任何当前生效的附魔或状态效果的详细信息。\n"

#. key: cmd_display_known_objects
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_known_objects"
msgid ""
"List discovered item types\n"
msgstr ""
"已发现物品种类列表\n"

#. key: cmd_save_game_now
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_save_game_now"
msgid ""
"Save and exit\n"
msgstr ""
"保存并退出\n"

#. key: cmd_save_game_now verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_save_game_now verbose"
msgid ""
"Saves the game for later and exits. Once you resume the game, the save file is\n"
"deleted again.\n"
msgstr ""
"保存游戏并退出。重新进入这场游戏后，这个存档就会被删除。\n"

#. key: cmd_edit_player_tile
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_edit_player_tile"
msgid ""
"Modify the player tile\n"
msgstr ""
"修改玩家的贴图\n"

#. key: cmd_edit_player_tile verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_edit_player_tile verbose"
msgid ""
"Allows you to modify the equipment and species tile displayed in the player\n"
"doll.\n"
msgstr ""
"修改角色纸娃娃上显示的装备和种族的贴图。\n"

#. key: cmd_display_commands
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_commands"
msgid ""
"Game help\n"
msgstr ""
"游戏帮助\n"

#. key: cmd_display_commands verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_commands verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays a list of commands.\n"
msgstr ""
"显示命令列表。\n"

#. key: cmd_show_character_dump
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_show_character_dump"
msgid ""
"Dump and show character's progress\n"
msgstr ""
"丢弃并显示角色的进度\n"

#. key: cmd_show_character_dump verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_show_character_dump verbose"
msgid ""
"Dumps detailed information about your character into a file ‘playername.txt’ in\n"
"the morgue directory, and shows the file in-game. This includes main stats,\n"
"equipment, spells, skills, notes, etc.\n"
msgstr ""
"将角色的详细信息丢入到morgue目录中的文件“ 玩家名.txt”，\n"
"并在游戏中显示该文件。它包含主要数据、装备、魔法、技能、笔记等等。\n"
"\n"
"丢弃角色的进度\n"

#. key: cmd_character_dump verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_character_dump verbose"
msgid ""
"Dumps detailed information about your character into a file ‘playername.txt’ in\n"
"the morgue directory, to peruse at your leisure. This includes main stats,\n"
"equipment, spells, skills, notes, etc.\n"
msgstr ""
"将角色的详细信息丢入到morgue目录中的文件“ 玩家名.txt”，\n"
"以便你在闲暇时仔细阅读。它包含主要数据、装备、魔法、技能、笔记等等。\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight"
msgid ""
"Hit the closest monster\n"
msgstr ""
"攻击最近的怪物\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight verbose"
msgid ""
"Moves towards the closest hostile monster, or attacks an adjacent monster with\n"
"your current weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"向最近的敌对怪物移动，或用你所持的武器攻击相邻的怪物。\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight_nomove
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight_nomove"
msgid ""
"Hit an adjacent monster\n"
msgstr ""
"攻击相邻怪物\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight_nomove verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight_nomove verbose"
msgid ""
"Attacks an adjacent monster with your current weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"用你所持的武器攻击相邻的怪物。\n"

#. key: cmd_wait
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_wait"
msgid ""
"Wait a single turn\n"
msgstr ""
"等待一回合\n"

#. key: cmd_wait verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_wait verbose"
msgid ""
"Spends a single turn waiting and resting.\n"
msgstr ""
"等待并休息一个回合。\n"

#. key: cmd_safe_wait
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_safe_wait"
msgid ""
"Wait a single turn if safe\n"
msgstr ""
"如果安全，等待一回合\n"

#. key: cmd_safe_wait verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_safe_wait verbose"
msgid ""
"Spends a single turn waiting and resting, but only if there are no hostile\n"
"monsters in view.\n"
msgstr ""
"等待并休息一回合，前提是视野中没有敌人。\n"

#. key: cmd_display_inventory
