msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_game_menu verbose"
msgid ""
"Show the game menu\n"
msgstr ""
"显示这个游戏的菜单。\n"

#. key: flame cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flame cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of raging fire. Any creature not entirely immune to fire will be hurt\n"
"by time spent in the flames.\n"
"\n"
"Ranged cold attacks passing through the cloud are substantially reduced in\n"
"range, dissipating the cloud in the process.\n"
"\n"
"If placed near or over water, the heat will generate steam nearby.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团猛烈燃烧的火云。任何生物，\n"
"如果没有对火的完全免疫，身处其中就会受到伤害。\n"
"\n"
"穿过此云的远程寒冰攻击会被降低射程，并同时消散了云层。\n"
"\n"
"如果在水边或水上释放，高温会蒸腾出大量蒸汽。\n"

#. key: noxious fumes cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:noxious fumes cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of vile, choking fumes. Any creature spending time in it will be at\n"
"risk of becoming confused by the gases, unless resistant to poison. Tougher,\n"
"more experienced creatures are less likely to be affected.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团呛人又有毒的云。\n"
"任何生物身处其中，都有被气体混乱的危险，除非具有毒抗。\n"
"越坚韧、经验等级越高的怪物不太会受此影响。\n"

#. key: freezing vapour cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:freezing vapour cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of freezing air. Any creature not entirely immune to cold will be hurt\n"
"by time spent inside.\n"
"\n"
"Ranged fire attacks passing through the cloud are substantially reduced in\n"
"range, dissipating the cloud in the process.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团冰气云。任何生物，如果没有对寒的完全免疫，身处其中就会受到伤害。\n"
"\n"
"穿过此云的远程火焰攻击会被降低射程，并同时消散了云层。\n"

#. key: poison gas cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:poison gas cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of deadly poison. Any creature without resistance to poison will be\n"
"both poisoned and directly harmed by time spent in it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团有着致命毒性的云。任何没有毒抗的生物，在里面就会中毒并直接受到伤害。\n"

#. key: _smoke_cloud_
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:_smoke_cloud_"
msgid ""
"A cloud of coloured smoke. Harmless, except to the asthmatic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团有色的烟云。无害，除了对哮喘病人。\n"

#. key: translocational energy cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:translocational energy cloud"
msgid ""
"The remnant of some creature that was recently here but is no longer, banished\n"
"nearby, across the level, or out of reality itself, all the way into the Abyss.\n"
"Some wizards say these are a kind of \"allergic reaction\" the universe\n"
"produces, in response to magic that warps space in impossible ways; a cosmic\n"
"sneeze. Perhaps metaphysically gross, but otherwise harmless.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是某个最近来过这里的生物的残留物。\n"
"但它已经不在了，被放逐到附近，或穿过楼层，或者脱离现实，直到深渊。\n"
"一些巫师说，这是宇宙产生的一种“过敏反应”，\n"
"是对魔法以不可能的方式扭曲空间的反应；一个宇宙的喷嚏。\n"
"也许在形而上学意义上是恶心的，但在其他方面无害。\n"

#. key: spreading flames cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spreading flames cloud"
msgid ""
"A raging forest fire. Any creature not entirely immune to fire will be hurt by\n"
"time spent in the flames. The flames will intermittently flare up and fill\n"
"their surroundings with lesser fires. Any trees unfortunate enough to be nearby\n"
"will often find themselves transformed into more kindling for the fire.\n"
"\n"
"Ranged cold attacks passing through the cloud are substantially reduced in\n"
"range, dissipating the cloud in the process.\n"
"\n"
"If placed near or over water, the heat will generate steam nearby.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团熊熊的森林大火。任何生物，如果没有对火的完全免疫，\n"
"身处其中就会受到伤害。火焰会间歇地爆发，并让周围的环境充满更小的火。\n"
"不幸的是，附近的树木，常常自己会变成更多的火种。\n"
"\n"
"穿过此云的远程寒冰攻击会被降低射程，并同时消散了云层。\n"
"\n"
"如果在水边或水上释放，高温会蒸腾出大量蒸汽。\n"

#. key: steam cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:steam cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of scalding steam. Creatures caught within will be mildly injured,\n"
"and fire resistance will further reduce the damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团灼热的蒸汽云。在其中的生物会轻微受伤，火抗属性会大大抵消伤害。\n"

#. key: ink cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ink cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of ink, completely filling the water.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团墨云，里面完全是水。\n"

#. key: calcifying dust cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:calcifying dust cloud"
msgid ""
"A petrifying cloud. Creatures caught in the cloud for any length of time will\n"
"find themselves turning to stone, though more experienced creatures may be able\n"
"to resist the effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团石化云。在云中呆任何时长的生物都会发现自己在变成石头，\n"
"尽管更有经验的生物也许能够抵抗这种影响。\n"

#. key: blessed fire cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blessed fire cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of divine fire, imbued with holy power. Those in the service of one of\n"
"the good gods will be unaffected by it. All other creatures will be hurt by it,\n"
"with undead and demonic creatures being greatly harmed.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团圣火云，充满了神圣的力量。那些服侍善神的将不受影响。\n"
"其他生物会受伤，而那些亡灵和恶魔将受到很大的伤害。\n"

#. key: foul pestilence cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:foul pestilence cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of foul pestilence. Any living being caught within it will find\n"
"themselves poisoned, and may also find their movements slowed.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团腐臭的瘟疫云。任何身处其中的活物都会发现他们自己中了毒，\n"
"并且会发现他们的移动速度变慢了。\n"

#. key: thin mist cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:thin mist cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of thin mist. Atmospheric, but harmless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团蔳雾云。营造氛围的，但无害。\n"

#. key: seething chaos cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:seething chaos cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of seething chaos. A wide variety of unpredictable effects apply to\n"
"those within the clouds, ranging from invisibility to berserk rage to complete\n"
"paralysis.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团翻腾的混乱云。身处云中会受到各种不可预测的影响，\n"
"从隐身到狂暴，到完全麻痹。\n"

#. key: rain cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rain cloud"
msgid ""
"An extremely localised rainstorm. It may produce short-lived pools of shallow\n"
"water. Beings made of fire are averse to spending much time in the rain.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个极度集中的暴风雨。它可能形成浅水池，或临时加深现有水池。\n"
"完全由火形成的生物不愿在雨中呆太久。\n"

#. key: mutagenic fog cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mutagenic fog cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of pure, unstructured magic, condensed into a scintillating mist;\n"
"essentially toxic magical waste. Creatures venturing within will find\n"
"themselves increasingly contaminated with magical radiation, sufficient amounts\n"
"of which will inflict negative mutations when dissipating.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团纯净、无结构的魔法，凝结成一团闪烁的薄雾，本质上是有毒的魔法废料。\n"
"冒险进入其中的生物会发现自己逐渐受到魔法辐射的污染，\n"
"当消散时，足够多的辐射会造成负面变异。\n"

#. key: magical condensation cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:magical condensation cloud"
msgid ""
"The wake of some highly concentrated magical energy, itself entirely harmless.\n"
msgstr ""
"某种高度集中的魔法能量被唤醒，本身是完全无害的。\n"

#. key: whirling frost cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:whirling frost cloud"
msgid ""
"The winds of a polar vortex. It will deal severe damage to anyone within it,\n"
"only partially mitigated by resistance to cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个极地旋涡之风。它将对其内的任何怪物造成严重伤害，\n"
"只有一部分伤害能通过寒抗而减轻。\n"

#. key: sparse dust cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sparse dust cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of sparse dust. Atmospheric, but harmless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团薄灰云。营造氛围的，但无害。\n"

#. key: spectral mist cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spectral mist cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of spectral mist. It causes minor damage to all creatures other than\n"
"the undead. Dangerous but short-lived spectral undead creatures will coalesce\n"
"from the mist over time.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团幽灵迷雾云。它对除亡灵以外的所有生物造成轻微伤害。\n"
"随着时间的推移，危险却短暂的亡灵生物将从雾中聚集。\n"

#. key: acidic fog cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:acidic fog cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of flesh-searing acid, which will deal damage and apply corrosion to\n"
"those within it. Resistance to corrosion will provide immunity to its effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团腐蚀肉身的酸液云雾，对身处其中的生物造成伤害和酸蚀。\n"
"酸抗属性可以带来免疫效果。\n"

#. key: thunder cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:thunder cloud"
msgid ""
"A dark storm cloud. It will intermittently strike those within with lightning,\n"
"dealing severe damage to those without resistance to electricity.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团黑暗的暴风云。它会间歇地用闪电击打里面的人，\n"
"对那些没有电抗的造成巨大伤害。\n"

#. key: excruciating misery cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:excruciating misery cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of lingering despair and necromantic energy. Living creatures trapped\n"
"within will repeatedly lose small fractions of their maximum health, though\n"
"protection from negative energy will mitigate the effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团萦绕的绝望和死灵能量云。\n"
"陷入其中的生物会发现自己会不断流失与最大生命值成比例的生命值，\n"
"尽管对负能量的防护可以减轻其效果。\n"

#. key: white fluffiness cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:white fluffiness cloud"
msgid ""
"A white, fluffy cloud. Not actually solid enough to use as a pillow, and yet\n"
"still oddly peaceful.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团白色蓬松的云。实际上用作枕头还不够结实，但也出奇地平和。\n"

#. key: salt cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:salt cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of rapidly whirling dust and salt. It stings the eyes and skin of any\n"
"creatures caught within, although it is ultimately harmless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团急速旋转的尘和盐云。\n"
"它会刺入任何被捕获的生物的眼睛和皮肤，尽管它终究是无害的。\n"

#. key: golden dust cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:golden dust cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of shimmering golden dust. While within it, followers of the Council\n"
"gain tremendous strength in combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团闪闪发光的金色尘云。身处其中，门徒会在战斗中获得巨大力量。\n"

#. key: wisps of flame cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wisps of flame cloud"
msgid ""
"A trail of sparks and wisps of flame. Atmospheric, but harmless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一道火花和一缕烟。营造氛围的，但无害。\n"

#. key: blastmotes cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blastmotes cloud"
msgid ""
"A cloud of volatile blastmotes. These explode on contact with flame or creatures.\n"
"The explosion is concussive, knocking adjacent creatures away.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团不稳定的爆炸粉尘云。这些物质在接触火焰或生物时会爆炸。\n"
"其震荡性的爆炸，会对邻近生物造成冲击。\n"

#. key: sparks cloud
#: dat/descript/clouds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sparks cloud"
msgid ""
"A trail of electric sparks. Atmospheric, but harmless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一道电火花。营造氛围的，但无害。\n"

#. key: fast status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fast status"
msgid ""
"All of your actions are 50% faster.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的所有行动加速50%。\n"

#. key: invis status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:invis status"
msgid ""
"You are invisible. Most enemies will be unable to see you and will suffer\n"
"penalties to hit, though they may be able to guess at your general location.\n"
"If the status is greyed out, it is active but ineffective for some reason (for\n"
"example if you are glowing with magical contamination or standing in shallow\n"
"water).\n"
msgstr ""
"你隐身了。\n"
"大多数敌人看不到你，其命中率会受到负面影响，尽管他们也能猜到你的大概位置。\n"
"随时间推移，这会造成魔法污染，如果你在出现此状况前已经被污染了，\n"
"这会有一定危险。如果这个状态是灰色的，表明它是生效的（包括造成了魔法污染），\n"
"但仍会因一些原因而失效（比如你因为魔法污染而身体发光，或是站在浅水中）。\n"

#. key: tele status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tele status"
msgid ""
"You are about to teleport. While waiting to teleport, attempting to apply the\n"
"status again (such as by using a scroll of teleportation) will cancel the\n"
"teleportation.\n"
msgstr ""
"你很快就会传送。在等待传送的时候，如果再次进行传送（比如读了一个传送卷轴），\n"
"就会取消本次传送。\n"

#. key: fly status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fly status"
msgid ""
"You are flying above the ground, and are able to cross water and lava or fight\n"
"above shallow water without penalties. Most types of flight will time out – be\n"
"careful what you are above when that happens!\n"
msgstr ""
"你俯瞰地面，飞翔在空中，可以飞过水域和熔岩，或在浅水上不受影响地战斗。\n"
"大多数飞行能力有时间限制，快到时间的时候，可得当心飞在什么上面！\n"

#. key: agi status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:agi status"
msgid ""
"You are unnaturally agile, and gain a bonus to your evasion.\n"
msgstr ""
"你敏捷超群，闪避也有所增强。\n"

#. key: brill status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brill status"
msgid ""
"You are unnaturally smart, and gain a bonus to the power of your spells as well\n"
"as halving their magic cost (rounding up).\n"
msgstr ""
"你聪明异常，法术的威力增强，同时其消耗的法力减半（四舍五入）。\n"

#. key: might status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:might status"
msgid ""
"You are unnaturally mighty, doing significantly more damage in physical combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"你异常强壮，物理攻击力大大增强。\n"

#. key: regen status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:regen status"
msgid ""
"You regenerate health at an unnaturally fast rate. This is only shown for\n"
"temporary regeneration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你恢复健康的速度非常快。该状态只在临时性的加速回血时显示。\n"

#. key: -regen status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-regen status"
msgid ""
"Your health has stopped regenerating due to the presence of nearby monsters.\n"
msgstr ""
"因为附近的一些怪物，你无法恢复健康。\n"

#. key: mpregen status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mpregen status"
msgid ""
"You regenerate health and magic at an unnaturally fast rate. This is only shown\n"
"for temporary regeneration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你恢复健康和魔力的速度非常快。该状态只在临时性的加速回血时显示。\n"

#. key: touch status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:touch status"
msgid ""
"Your attacks deal no damage, but have a chance of confusing monsters that they\n"
"hit.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的攻击不会造成伤害，但可能使怪物进入混乱状态。\n"

#. key: will++ status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:will++ status"
msgid ""
"Your willpower is much stronger, protecting against many magical effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的意志力变得更强，能抵御许多魔法效果。\n"

#. key: berserk status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:berserk status"
msgid ""
"You are hasted, deal increased damage in combat, and have increased health, but\n"
"are unable to perform most actions other than moving and attacking in melee.\n"
"The status will wear off very quickly unless you are attacking monsters, and\n"
"when it expires you will be slowed and unable to berserk again for a short\n"
"duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的速度、攻击力、生命值都有所提升，\n"
"但除了移动和攻击， 无法进行其他大多动作。\n"
"除非你在攻击怪物，否则此状态很快会消失。\n"
"当狂暴结束后，使用者将被减速，短时间内无法再次狂暴。\n"

#. key: -berserk status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-berserk status"
msgid ""
"You are recovering from your berserk rage, and are unable to berserk again for\n"
"a short duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你刚从狂暴状态恢复正常，短时间内无法再次狂暴。\n"

#. key: bearserk status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bearserk status"
msgid ""
"You are filled with barbearic rage! You are hasted, deal grizzly damage, and\n"
"have greatly increased health, but find it impawsible to do much other than\n"
"move and maul foes. You'll bid furwell to this status very quickly unless you\n"
"are attacking, and when it expires you will be slowed and unable to bearserk\n"
"again for a short duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你充满了熊熊怒火！\n"
"你的速度变快，能造成灰熊般的重击，生命值得到大幅提升，\n"
"但除了移动和重击敌人外无法做其他事情。\n"
"除非你在攻击怪物，否则此状态很快会消失。\n"
"当熊暴结束后，使用者将被减速，并且短时间内无法再次熊暴。\n"

#. key: pois status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pois status"
msgid ""
"You are poisoned and will continually lose health. While poisoned, your current\n"
"health will be partially recoloured to display the eventual poison damage that\n"
"will be dealt. Poison can be cured immediately by potions of curing.\n"
msgstr ""
"你中毒了，会持续失去生命值。\n"
"中毒时，你当前的生命值的一部分会重新着色，以显示最终将受到的毒害。\n"
"服用治疗药水可立刻解毒。\n"

#. key: conf status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:conf status"
msgid ""
"You are confused. You may stumble in a random direction when attempting to move\n"
"or attack, and are unable to cast spells or use most items other than potions.\n"
"Confusion can be cured immediately by potions of curing.\n"
msgstr ""
"你陷入混乱。\n"
"你在尝试移动或攻击时会撞向随机的方向，并且不能施法或使用大多道具，除了药水。\n"
"服用治疗药水可立刻解除混乱状态。\n"

#. key: contam status
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:contam status"
msgid ""
"You are glowing with mutagenic radiation. This can inflict mutations over time\n"
"(usually negative) or even cause you to suffer damage as the unstable magic\n"
"explodes violently. In addition, your glow prevents invisibility and reduces\n"
"your stealth.\n"
"{{\n"
"    local dmg = you.contam_max_damage();\n"
"    if dmg > 0 then\n"
"        return \"\\nAn explosion at your current level of contamination could \" ..\n"
"               \"inflict up to \" .. dmg .. \" damage.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"你散发着诱变辐射。长此以往你会变异，通常会导致负面效果。\n"
"状态的颜色标识严重程度，第一级（灰色）只是警告，\n"
"不会造成变异或对潜行产生负面影响。\n"

#. key: drain status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:drain status"
msgid ""
"Your maximum health has been temporarily drained by negative energy. This\n"
"status will not wear off by waiting, but will gradually expire as you gain\n"
"experience.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的最大生命值暂时因负能量而流逝。\n"
"原地休息无法消除此状态，但它会随你提升经验而逐渐失效。\n"

#. key: breath status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:breath status"
msgid ""
"Indicates how many uses of your draconian breath weapon are available. If the\n"
"indicator is dim, there are zero. Otherwise, the number of plusses indicate\n"
"additional uses available.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在屏住呼吸，在状态结束前无法使用吐息能力。\n"

#. key: exh status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:exh status"
msgid ""
"You are exhausted, and are unable to activate divine powers that cause\n"
"exhaustion until the status expires.\n"
msgstr ""
"你精疲力尽，在状态结束前无法使用导致疲惫的神圣能力。\n"

#. key: slow status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slow status"
msgid ""
"All your actions take 50% longer.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的所有行动减慢50%。\n"

#. key: para status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:para status"
msgid ""
"You are paralysed, and completely unable to act.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被麻痹了，完全无法行动。\n"

#. key: sleep status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sleep status"
msgid ""
"You are asleep, and completely unable to act. Taking damage will wake you.\n"
msgstr ""
"你睡着了，完全无法行动。受到伤害时会被唤醒。\n"

#. key: held status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:held status"
msgid ""
"You are held in a net or a spider web. You cannot move freely and will instead\n"
"try to struggle free.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被困在网或蜘蛛网中。你无法自由移动，并试着挣脱。\n"

#. key: constr status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:constr status"
msgid ""
"You are being constricted by an enemy. Your evasion is impaired, and you will\n"
"take damage over time. You are unable to move away from the enemy, although you\n"
"can struggle to escape by attempting to do so, and will become increasingly more\n"
"likely to succeed and break the constriction when doing so multiple times.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被敌人所束缚，会受到更多伤害。\n"
"你无法从敌人那里走开（或闪现），\n"
"但你可以试着挣脱它，并且当你持续这么做时，将越来越有可能成功打破束缚。\n"

#. key: mesm status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mesm status"
msgid ""
"You are mesmerised and cannot move away from the monster mesmerising you. The\n"
"effect can be broken by killing or confusing the responsible monster or by\n"
"breaking line of sight with them.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被迷住了，无法远离让你着迷的怪物。\n"
"要打破该效果，可以杀死该怪物、使其混乱，或打断其视线。\n"

#. key: fear status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fear status"
msgid ""
"You are overcome with fear and cannot move towards the monster causing fear in\n"
"you. The effect can be broken by killing or confusing the responsible monster\n"
"or by breaking line of sight with them.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被恐惧所支配，无法移向让你心生恐惧的怪物。\n"
"要打破该效果，可以杀死该怪物、使其混乱，或打断其视线。\n"

#. key: -tele status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-tele status"
msgid ""
"You are prevented from teleporting or blinking.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法传送或闪现。\n"

#. key: -move status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-move status"
msgid ""
"You cannot walk, fly around, slither, etc. You can still take other actions,\n"
"and can still be moved via translocations or by being pushed, pulled, and so on.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法行走、飞行、滑翔，等等。\n"
"但你仍能做其他动作，并能通过移位或被推拉的方式进行移动。\n"

#. key: mark status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mark status"
msgid ""
"Your location is marked due to the effects of a trap or a spell, and monsters\n"
"will hunt you down more precisely and will be able to detect you even if you\n"
"are not in their vision.\n"
msgstr ""
"因踏入陷阱或被施法，你的位置被标示。\n"
"怪物能更准确地追杀你，即使你不在其视线中，他们也能找到你。\n"

#. key: fire status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire status"
msgid ""
"You are covered with sticky fire, which causes damage over a moderate duration.\n"
"Moving will quell the fire much more rapidly, and entering water will extinguish\n"
"it immediately.\n"
msgstr ""
"你身上附着粘性的火，在一段时间内会受到伤害。\n"
"进行移动能更快地灭火，如果进入水中能立即扑灭火焰。\n"

#. key: corona status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corona status"
msgid ""
"You are surrounded by light, greatly reducing your stealth and making you\n"
"easier to hit.\n"
msgstr ""
"你周身发光，潜行被大幅削弱，你更容易被击中。\n"

#. key: barbs status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:barbs status"
msgid ""
"There are barbs embedded in your skin, and moving around will cause you to take\n"
"damage. Remaining in place for a short time will allow you to remove the barbs\n"
"without taking damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"有刺扎入你的皮肤，移动时会受到伤害。\n"
"在原地休息一阵子，可以排出这些刺而不会受到伤害。\n"

#. key: sick status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sick status"
msgid ""
"You have been sickened, and your health will no longer regenerate.\n"
msgstr ""
"你患病了，无法恢复健康。\n"

#. key: vertigo status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vertigo status"
msgid ""
"You are disoriented and dizzy, reducing your accuracy, evasion, and\n"
"spellcasting success rate.\n"
msgstr ""
"你晕头转向，你的命中率、闪避和施法成功率均被削弱。\n"

#. key: corr status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corr status"
msgid ""
"You are corroded, reducing your damage in physical combat and your armour by an\n"
"amount depending on the severity of the corrosion.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被腐蚀了，你的物理攻击力和防护被削弱，削弱程度取决于腐蚀的严重程度。\n"

#. key: flay status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flay status"
msgid ""
"You are covered in illusionary wounds, causing severe damage while the effect\n"
"remains active. Destroying the source of the illusion will restore all health\n"
"lost to the flaying.\n"
msgstr ""
"你身上有虚幻的伤口，它在生效时会造成严重伤害。\n"
"摧毁幻觉来源可以恢复剥皮损失的所有生命值。\n"

#. key: weak status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:weak status"
msgid ""
"Your melee attacks do 25% less damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"你近战攻击造成的伤害减少25%。\n"

#. key: frozen status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frozen status"
msgid ""
"You are covered in ice, and your movement speed is reduced.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被冰封，移动速度降低。\n"

#. key: sap status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sap status"
msgid ""
"Your magic is sapped. Casting a spell will cause you to lose access to your\n"
"magic, briefly preventing you from casting any further spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的魔力衰竭了。施放一个法术后，你会失去魔法通道，暂时无法再施放任何法术。\n"

#. key: -cast status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-cast status"
msgid ""
"You are unable to cast spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法施放法术。\n"

#. key: dchan status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dchan status"
msgid ""
"You are channelling the dead, causing any living creatures killed in your\n"
"vicinity to be raised as spectral servants.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在引导死者，附近被杀死的生物，都会化为幽灵仆从。\n"

#. key: vit status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vit status"
msgid ""
"You are divinely vitalised, providing protection from poison, confusion,\n"
"petrification, and sickness, and increasing and sustaining your strength,\n"
"intelligence and dexterity.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被赐予活力，保护你免受毒、混乱、石化和疾病的侵害，\n"
"并增加、维持了你的力量、智力和敏捷。\n"

#. key: will/2 status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:will/2 status"
msgid ""
"Your willpower is weaker, making you vulnerable to many magical effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的意志力变弱，容易受到许多魔法效果的影响。\n"

#. key: stone status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stone status"
msgid ""
"You are petrified, and completely unable to act. You are very easy to hit,\n"
"but all damage taken is substantially reduced.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被石化了，完全无法行动。你很容易被击中，但受到的伤害大大减少。\n"

#. key: petr status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:petr status"
msgid ""
"You are turning to stone. Your actions are slowed, all damage taken is slightly\n"
"reduced, and you will soon be completely petrified (gaining the Stone status).\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在石化。\n"
"你的行动被减慢，会轻微减少所受的伤害，不久会完全石化（变为石状态）。\n"

#. key: resist status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:resist status"
msgid ""
"You are more resistant to fire, cold, electricity, poison and acid.\n"
msgstr ""
"你更能抵抗火、寒、电、毒和酸。\n"

#. key: slime status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slime status"
msgid ""
"Your wielded weapon or your fists are coated in slime, and will turn the next\n"
"living or corporeal undead monster you hit into a neutral slime.\n"
msgstr ""
"你挥舞的武器或拳头上裹着黏液，\n"
"下一个击中的活物或有形的亡灵生物会变成一个中立的黏液。\n"

#. key: swift status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:swift status"
msgid ""
"You are covering ground swiftly.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在迅捷地移动。\n"

#. key: -swift status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-swift status"
msgid ""
"You are covering ground slowly.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在缓慢地移动。\n"

#. key: ddoor status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ddoor status"
msgid ""
"You are temporarily invulnerable to harm, but are brought close to death in the\n"
"process and cannot be affected by healing while the effect is active. After the\n"
"spell expires, it cannot be immediately recast.\n"
msgstr ""
"你暂时不会受到伤害，但在这个过程中会濒临死亡，在此状态生效时也无法进行治疗。\n"
"法术失效后，不能立即重施。\n"

#. key: -ddoor status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-ddoor status"
msgid ""
"You are still close to death's doorway, and cannot recast Death's Door for a\n"
"short duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你离死亡之门仍然很近，短时间内无法重施死亡之门。\n"

#. key: quad status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quad status"
msgid ""
"QUAD DAMAGE!\n"
msgstr ""
"四倍伤害！\n"

#. key: sil status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sil status"
msgid ""
"You are silenced. This makes reading scrolls, casting spells, invoking divine\n"
"abilities, or shouting impossible.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被沉默了。这种情况下，无法阅读卷轴、施展咒语、喊叫或呼唤神的能力。\n"
"这种压抑、不自然的效果会极大地阻碍你的潜行。\n"

#. key: stealth status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stealth status"
msgid ""
"Your stealth is greatly increased.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的潜行大幅增强。\n"

#. key: vortex status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vortex status"
msgid ""
"You are in the eye of a mighty ice storm. After the vortex fades, it cannot be\n"
"called forth again for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"你处在一个强大的冰风暴的中心。旋涡消散后，短时间内无法再次施展它。\n"

#. key: -vortex status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-vortex status"
msgid ""
"You are surrounded by unstable winds, and cannot recast Polar Vortex for a short\n"
"duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被不稳定的云所环绕，短时间内无法重施极地旋涡。\n"

#. key: liquid status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:liquid status"
msgid ""
"You are liquefying the ground around you, slowing the movement of all creatures\n"
"in the area.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在液化周围地面，这片区域中所有生物的移动会减慢。\n"

#. key: hero status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hero status"
msgid ""
"Your combat skills are temporarily increased.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的战斗技能暂时得到提升。\n"

#. key: finesse status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:finesse status"
msgid ""
"Your combat speed is greatly increased.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的战斗技能暂时得到提升。\n"

#. key: duel status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:duel status"
msgid ""
"You are duelling a foe in Okawaru's Arena, and will be returned whence you came\n"
"if you are victorious.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在奥卡瓦鲁的角斗场与敌人决斗，获胜后，就能从那里回来。\n"

#. key: disjoin status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:disjoin status"
msgid ""
"You are destabilising space around yourself, causing nearby monsters to be\n"
"randomly blinked away from you.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在打破周围环境的稳定，附近的怪物会随机地被闪送走。\n"

#. key: fugue status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fugue status"
msgid ""
"Your weapon is temporarily enhanced by the souls of the damned, providing\n"
"slaying bonuses that increase with every enemy killed. At the maximum bonus,\n"
"foes adjacent to your attacks' targets suffer pain damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的武器暂时被诅咒的灵魂增强，每杀死一个敌人，你的杀戮加成就会提升。\n"
"加成达到最大，与你攻击目标相邻的敌人就会受到痛楚伤害。\n"

#. key: debt status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:debt status"
msgid ""
"You have lived beyond your means. You cannot spend gold again until you earn\n"
"enough to cancel out your debt.\n"
msgstr ""
"你已经入不敷出了。在你取得足以抵消债务的钱前，你无法使用金币进行消费。\n"

#. key: toxic status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:toxic status"
msgid ""
"You are radiating toxic energy, and will continuously inflict poison on all\n"
"nearby creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"你散发着有毒的能量，会持续对周围所有生物造成毒害。\n"

#. key: recite status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:recite status"
msgid ""
"You are reciting Zin's laws to nearby monsters, with a range of effects\n"
"depending on the target. After finishing a recitation, it cannot be repeated\n"
"for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在向附近的怪物吟诵辛的律令，并会产生一系列因目标而异的影响。\n"
"吟诵结束后，短时间内无法再次使用它。\n"

#. key: -recite status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-recite status"
msgid ""
"You have recently finished reciting Zin's laws, and cannot recite again for a\n"
"short duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你刚吟诵完辛的律令，短时间内无法再吟诵了。\n"

#. key: rf- status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rf- status"
msgid ""
"You are more vulnerable to fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"你更容易被火伤害。\n"

#. key: rp- status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rp- status"
msgid ""
"You are more vulnerable to poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"你更容易被毒伤害。\n"

#. key: bullseye status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bullseye status"
msgid ""
"You have targeted an enemy with a dimensional bullseye, causing missiles fired\n"
"or thrown at a different enemy to also be teleported at the target.\n"
msgstr ""
"你已经用次元靶心瞄准了一个敌人，这会使你向不同敌人投射的弹药会被传送到目标。\n"

#. key: forest status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:forest status"
msgid ""
"You are calling a forested plane into temporary existence, and awakening nearby\n"
"trees to damage your foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在召唤暂时存在的森林位面，并会唤醒周围的树攻击你的敌人。\n"

#. key: dragoncall status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dragoncall status"
msgid ""
"You are calling forth mighty dragons to attack your foes. Each dragon which\n"
"answers the call will drain your magical energy. After the call ends, it cannot\n"
"be issued again for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在召唤强大的龙来攻击你的敌人。每个响应你的召唤的龙将消耗你的能量。\n"
"召唤结束后，短时间内无法再次施展它。\n"

#. key: -dragoncall status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-dragoncall status"
msgid ""
"You have recently called forth dragons, and cannot recast Dragon's Call for a\n"
"short duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你刚召唤过龙，短时间内无法再次施展龙的呼唤了。\n"

#. key: -potion status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-potion status"
msgid ""
"You are unable to quaff potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法饮用药水。\n"

#. key: rf+ status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rf+ status"
msgid ""
"You are more resistant to fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"你对火的抗性有所提高。\n"

#. key: rc+ status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rc+ status"
msgid ""
"You are more resistant to cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"你对寒的抗性有所提高。\n"

#. key: relec+ status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:relec+ status"
msgid ""
"You are more resistant to electricity.\n"
msgstr ""
"你对电的抗性有所提高。\n"

#. key: horr status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:horr status"
msgid ""
"You are terrified of nearby monsters, reducing your damage and accuracy in\n"
"combat as well as the power of your spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"你害怕附近的怪物，你战斗中的攻击力、命中率和法术威力均被削弱。\n"

#. key: -scroll status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-scroll status"
msgid ""
"You are unable to read scrolls.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法阅读卷轴。\n"

#. key: cleave status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cleave status"
msgid ""
"Your melee attacks cleave, hitting all adjacent targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"你近战时能够顺劈，可以击中所有邻近目标。\n"

#. key: ambros status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ambros status"
msgid ""
"You are regenerating health and magic, but are also confused. Curing the\n"
"confusion will also end the regeneration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在恢复健康和魔力，但会被混乱。治好混乱后，也会中止恢复。\n"

#. key: surge status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:surge status"
msgid ""
"Your next use of an evokable device will have its power enhanced, at the cost\n"
"of some of your magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"你下次使用可激活装置时，其力量会被增强，同时会消耗你的一些魔力。\n"

#. key: howl status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:howl status"
msgid ""
"A terrifying howl is echoing in your mind, calling forth powerful creatures to\n"
"attack you.\n"
msgstr ""
"可怕的嚎叫回荡在你的脑海，呼唤着强大的生物攻击你。\n"

#. key: blood status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blood status"
msgid ""
"Your body is covered in congealed blood, serving as armour for as long as you\n"
"remain seriously injured.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的身体被凝固的血覆盖，当你受重伤时，它可以充当盔甲。\n"

#. key: channel status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:channel status"
msgid ""
"You are channelling magical energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在引导魔法能量。\n"

#. key: beast status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:beast status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into a monstrous, furry were-beast. The ferocious\n"
"energy pulsing through your limbs keeps you ready to kill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你变成了可怕的、毛茸茸的野兽。残暴的能量在你的肢体内脉动，让你时刻想要杀戮。\n"
"\n"
"任何手套、披风、帽子和靴子都会被融合。\n"

#. key: flux status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flux status"
msgid ""
"You are unstable at a fundamental level. You inflict dangerous levels of\n"
"magical contamination on foes with each touch. Sufficient contamination\n"
"causes a highly localised meltdown, dealing enormous damage.\n"
"\n"
"However, this instability makes you unable to use weapons, shields, or\n"
"body armour. You also glow, reducing stealth and preventing invisibility,\n"
"and you do less damage in melee, as your limbs sometimes destabilise mid-swing.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在基面上是不稳定的。你每次触碰敌人，都能造成危险程度的魔法污染。\n"
"污染程度够高，能使局部高度熔融，造成巨大的破坏。\n"
"\n"
"然而，由于不稳定的形态，你无法使用武器、盾牌或铠甲。\n"
"你还发着光，会削弱潜行并导致无法隐身，\n"
"你的近战攻击力也会降低，这是因为你的肢体在挥动时有时会摇摆不定。\n"

#. key: serpent status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:serpent status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into a giant, cold-blooded, poison-resistant serpent,\n"
"ready to wind your coils around foes and crush them to death.\n"
msgstr ""
"你变成了一条抗毒的、决意将敌人缠绕、挤压至死的冷血巨蛇。\n"
"\n"
"装备的武器和防具都会被融合。\n"

#. key: maw status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maw status"
msgid ""
"Your midsection has transformed into a giant mouth, gnashing and ready to devour\n"
"foes. The mouth may devour slain creatures, healing you to an extent increased\n"
"by your Shapeshifting skill and the power of the creature eaten. Skill also\n"
"increases the damage done by the maw.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的腹部变成了一个咬牙切齿、准备吞食敌人的大嘴。\n"
"这张嘴巴可以吞食被杀死的生物并治疗你，你的变身技能和被吞食的生物越强，\n"
"治疗程度也越强。提升技能也会增加胃部造成的伤害。\n"
"\n"
"变形后，装备的护甲都会被融合。\n"

#. key: statue status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:statue status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into a slow but extremely robust stone statue.\n"
"Your melee damage, both unarmed and with weapons, is substantially increased.\n"
"Your stone body is immune to poison and miasma, and gains resistance to\n"
"electricity, negative energy and torment.\n"
msgstr ""
"你变成了缓慢但极其坚固的石像。\n"
"你的近战攻击，无论是徒手还是使用武器，都大大增强了。\n"
"你的石质身躯免疫毒和瘴气，并获得对电、负能量和折磨的抗性。\n"
"\n"
"装备的铠甲、手套和靴子都会被融合。\n"

#. key: dragon status
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dragon status"
msgid ""
"{{\n"
"    local desc = \"You have been transformed into a mighty\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race():find(\"Draconian\") then\n"
"        desc = desc .. \" dragon\"\n"
"        if you.race() ~= \"Grey Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \", increasing the power of any innate breath attacks\"\n"
"        end\n"
"        if you.race() == \"Red Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \". You are highly resistant to fire and \" ..\n"
"                           \"resistant to poison, but vulnerable to cold\"\n"
"        elseif you.race() == \"White Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \". You are highly resistant to cold and \" ..\n"
"                           \"resistant to poison, but vulnerable to fire\"\n"
"        elseif you.race() == \"Green Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \" and retaining your innate colour\"\n"
"        else\n"
"            desc = desc .. \". You retain your innate colour, and are \" ..\n"
"                           \"also resistant to poison\"\n"
"        end\n"
"    else\n"
"        desc = desc .. \", fire-breathing dragon. You are highly resistant \" ..\n"
"                       \"to fire and resistant to poison, but vulnerable to \" ..\n"
"                       \"cold\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    desc = desc .. \".\"\n"
"\n"
"    return desc\n"
"}} Your melee attacks deal incredible damage, and you are much more robust but\n"
"less evasive.\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    local desc = \"你变成了强大的\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race():find(\"Draconian\") then\n"
"        desc = desc .. \"龙\"\n"
"        if you.race() ~= \"Grey Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \"，任何固有的吐息攻击的威力增强了\"\n"
"        end\n"
"        if you.race() == \"Red Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \"。你对火和\" ..\n"
"                           \"毒有很强的抗性，但易受寒的伤害\"\n"
"        elseif you.race() == \"White Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \"。你对寒和\" ..\n"
"                           \"毒有很强的抗性，但易受火的伤害\"\n"
"        elseif you.race() == \"Green Draconian\" then\n"
"            desc = desc .. \"并保留着你先天的颜色\"\n"
"        else\n"
"            desc = desc .. \"。你保留了先天色彩\" ..\n"
"                           \"并对毒有着抗性\"\n"
"        end\n"
"    else\n"
"        desc = desc .. \"，吐息火焰的龙。你能很好地抵抗\" ..\n"
"                       \"火和毒，但易受\" ..\n"
"                       \"寒的伤害\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    desc = desc .. \"。\"\n"
"\n"
"    return desc\n"
"}}你的近战攻击会造成难以置信的伤害，身体也变得更结实，但闪避受到削弱。\n"
"\n"
"装备的武器和防具都会被融合。\n"

#. key: storm status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:storm status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into a lightning-filled tempest. Your melee attacks\n"
"are strengthened and electrified, and strike all adjacent foes. You gain flight,\n"
"increased evasion, immunity to poison, miasma, petrification, and constriction,\n"
"and resistance to electricity. You gain the ability to launch yourself at foes\n"
"as a lightning bolt.\n"
msgstr ""
"你变成了闪着电的风暴。\n"
"你在近战中攻击力得到加强，并带有电属性，会打击到所有相邻的敌人。\n"
"你能够飞行，提升了闪避能力，免疫毒、瘴气、石化和束缚，并有了电抗。\n"
"你获得了如同闪电箭那样，向敌人投射自己的能力。\n"
"\n"
"装备的武器和盔甲都会被融合。\n"

#. key: death status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:death status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into an undying offence against life itself.\n"
"\n"
"Foes struck by your hands or melee weapons are weakened, slowed, and drained,\n"
"and you can heal yourself by tormenting living foes nearby. You also resist\n"
"cold, have enhanced willpower, and are immune to poison, miasma, negative\n"
"energy, and torment. Unfortunately, you are vulnerable to holy damage and\n"
"Dispel Undead, and cannot consume potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"你成为了对生命存在的永恒冒犯。\n"
"\n"
"被你用近战武器或手击中的敌人会被虚弱、减速、衰竭，\n"
"你还可以通过折磨附近的活物敌人来治疗自己。\n"
"此外，你能抵抗寒冷，意志力会增强，并免疫毒、瘴气、负能量和折磨。\n"
"不幸的是，你易受神圣攻击和驱散亡灵的伤害，且无法服用药水。\n"

#. key: bat status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bat status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into a swift-moving bat, increasing your evasion but\n"
"substantially weakening your melee attacks.\n"
"\n"
"Any equipped weapons, armour and rings are melded, and you are unable to cast\n"
"spells. The effectiveness of your melee attacks while in this form is based on\n"
"experience level instead of on Unarmed Combat skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你变成了行动迅捷的吸血蝠，闪避能力得到提升，但近战攻击力受到削弱。\n"
"\n"
"装备的武器、防具和戒指都会被融合，且无法施展法术。{{\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Vampire\" then\n"
"        return \"你的近战攻击效果\" ..\n"
"               \"在这种形态下取决于经验等级而不是\" ..\n"
"               \"徒手格斗技能。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: pig status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pig status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into a pig. You move quickly but are less effective\n"
"in melee.\n"
"\n"
"Any equipped weapons, armour and rings are melded, and you are unable to cast\n"
"spells. The effectiveness of your melee attacks while in this form is based on\n"
"experience level instead of on Unarmed Combat skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你变成了猪。你移动很快，但近战受到削弱。\n"
"\n"
"装备的武器、防具和戒指都会被融合，且无法施展法术。\n"
"在这种形态下你的近战效果取决于经验等级而不是徒手格斗技能。\n"

#. key: app status
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:app status"
msgid ""
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Octopode\" then\n"
"        return \"A vicious spike has grown from one of your tentacles, \" ..\n"
"               \"increasing the damage of your extra tentacle attacks.\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"Monstrous horns or talons have grown from your body, \" ..\n"
"               \"granting a chance of making an extra attack in melee.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Octopode\" then\n"
"        return \"你的一根触手上长出了邪恶的刺，\" ..\n"
"               \"增加了触手的攻击力。\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"你的身体上长出异常的角或爪，\" ..\n"
"               \"从而有机会在近战中进行一次额外的攻击。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: tree status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tree status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into a tree and are rooted to the ground, unable to\n"
"move or teleport. You have minimal evasion but increased health and natural\n"
"armour, and are resistant to poison, and immune to torment and drowning.\n"
"\n"
"Any equipped cloak, helmet, gloves, boots and body armour are melded.\n"
msgstr ""
"你变成了扎根于地面的树，无法移动或传送。\n"
"你更难闪避，但生命值和自身防护得到增强，有着毒抗，并免疫折磨和溺水。\n"
"\n"
"装备的披风、头盔、手套、靴子和铠甲都会被融合。\n"

#. key: wisp status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wisp status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into an insubstantial wisp of gas. You are highly\n"
"evasive and are resistant to fire, cold, electricity and acid, and immune to\n"
"poison, and negative energy.\n"
"\n"
"Any equipped weapons, armour and jewellery are melded, and you are unable to\n"
"cast spells. The effectiveness of your melee attacks while in this form is based\n"
"on experience level instead of on Unarmed Combat skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你变成无形的气体。你有着高闪避，并能抵抗火、寒、电和酸，并免疫毒和负能量。\n"
"\n"
"装备的武器、防具和首饰都会被融合，且无法施展法术。\n"
"在这种形态下你的近战效果取决于经验等级而不是徒手格斗技能。\n"

#. key: fungus status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fungus status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into a sentient fungus. You are highly evasive and\n"
"can release spores to cause confusion when attacking in melee, but are unable\n"
"to move when hostile creatures are present. You are resistant to poison and\n"
"immune to negative energy.\n"
"\n"
"Any equipped weapons and armour are melded, and you are unable to cast spells.\n"
"The effectiveness of your melee attacks while in this form is based on\n"
"experience level instead of on Unarmed Combat skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你变成了有意识的真菌。\n"
"你有着高闪避，在近战攻击时可以释放孢子造成混乱，但当敌方生物出现时无法移动。\n"
"你有着毒抗，并免疫负能量。\n"
"\n"
"装备的武器和防具都会被融合，且无法施展法术。\n"
"在这种形态下你的近战效果取决于经验等级而不是徒手格斗技能。\n"

#. key: shadow status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shadow status"
msgid ""
"You have been transformed into a swirling mass of dark shadows. You are\n"
"permanently invisible and are immune to poison, draining, and torment. All\n"
"incoming damage is halved, you bleed smoke on any incoming attack, and you have\n"
"infinite willpower. However, your ability to deal damage in melee and with\n"
"ranged attacks is halved, your spellcasting power is greatly hampered, and your\n"
"maximum health is further drained when taking damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"你变成了旋涡状的暗影团。你将持续隐形，且免疫毒、衰竭和折磨的影响。\n"
"所有受到的伤害会减半，受到任何攻击都会使你流出烟，并且你将拥有无限的意志力。\n"
"但是，你的近战和远程的攻击力将减半，施法会受到极大的阻碍，\n"
"在受到伤害时，你的最大生命值会流失。\n"

#. key: orb status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb status"
msgid ""
"You are near (or perhaps holding) the Orb of Zot, whose energies disrupt\n"
"translocation magic. Teleportation will take longer and scrolls of blinking may\n"
"transport you a short distance away from your intended destination.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在靠近（或持有）佐特宝珠时，其能量会扰乱位移魔法。\n"
"传送需要花费更长时间，格鲁布里亚的通道的传送门的位置将不太准确，也会更快失效。\n"

#. key: -hop status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-hop status"
msgid ""
"Your legs are tired, and you are unable to hop. This status will only recover\n"
"after you spend several turns not moving. (Other actions, such as attacking or\n"
"casting spells, are fine.)\n"
msgstr ""
"你的腿酸了，无法进行跳跃。\n"
"你需要花几个回合停下来休整，才能从这个状态恢复过来。\n"
"（其他动作，比如攻击或施法，是可行的。）\n"

#. key: ray status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ray status"
msgid ""
"You are currently channelling a ray of searing magical energy. Pressing\n"
"<w>.</w> or <w>s</w> to wait in place will maintain and intensify the ray, at\n"
"the cost of 1 MP per turn. Any other action, including recasting the spell,\n"
"will end it.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在引导灼热射线的魔法能量。\n"
"按<w>.</w>或<w>s</w>在原地等待，将保持并增强射线，每回合会消耗1魔力。\n"
"任何其他动作，包括重施这个法术，会打断它。\n"

#. key: lash status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lash status"
msgid ""
"You are moving at supernatural speed, causing movement actions to become\n"
"instant. Any martial attacks made while moving in this way deal increased\n"
"damage and never miss.\n"
msgstr ""
"你以超自然的速度移动，瞬间完成移动动作。\n"
"以这种方式移动时，任何武术攻击都会增强且总能命中。\n"

#. key: heavenly status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:heavenly status"
msgid ""
"You are surrounded by a storm of heavenly clouds. While the storm rages, your\n"
"evasion and combat accuracy and damage are substantially increased, and\n"
"striking enemies with martial attacks increases this bonus. The storm weakens\n"
"over time and fades away once the bonus reaches zero. The heavenly clouds\n"
"prevent invisibility, and obscure the vision of those outside the storm.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被天云风暴所围绕。\n"
"当风暴肆虐时，你的闪避、命中率和伤害都会大幅增强，\n"
"而且通过武术攻击敌人时还会有加成。\n"
"风暴会随着时间的推移而减弱，所给的加成达到零就会消失。\n"
"天云阻止了隐形，也模糊了风暴外的怪物的视线。\n"

#. key: slowm status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slowm status"
msgid ""
"Your movement is slowed on this liquid ground.\n"
msgstr ""
"在液体地面上，你的移动速度变慢了。\n"

#. key: alive status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:alive status"
msgid ""
"You are full of blood, and regenerate health quickly.\n"
msgstr ""
"你充满了血液，很快能恢复健康。\n"

#. key: aug status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:aug status"
msgid ""
"You receive spellcasting and slaying bonuses that scale with your health.\n"
msgstr ""
"你获得与生命值成比例的施法和杀戮加成。\n"

#. key: beogh status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:beogh status"
msgid ""
"You can swear fealty to Beogh, the god of all orcs, through a nearby priest.\n"
"To do so, use the Convert to Beogh ability in the ability menu.\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以通过附近的祭司，向洞穴兽人之神比欧弗宣誓效忠。\n"
"要这样做，请在<white>能力</white>菜单上按<white>Y</white>。\n"

#. key: bloodless status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bloodless status"
msgid ""
"Your body is entirely devoid of blood, reducing your maximum health and\n"
"preventing you from regenerating health when monsters are visible. You are\n"
"immune to poison and negative energy, significantly resist cold, and resist\n"
"torment.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的体内完全没有血液，最大生命值降低了，当你碰到怪物时还无法恢复健康。\n"
"你免疫毒和负能量，并有着很强的寒抗，还能抵抗折磨。\n"

#. key: bribe status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bribe status"
msgid ""
"You are bribing the inhabitants of the current branch.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在贿赂当前分支的栖息者。\n"

#. key: cloud status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloud status"
msgid ""
"You are in a cloud.\n"
msgstr ""
"你位于云中。\n"

#. key: -clouds status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-clouds status"
msgid ""
"The air is too still for clouds to form.\n"
msgstr ""
"这里的空气太过平静，无法形成云雾。\n"

#. key: dig status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dig status"
msgid ""
"You are digging.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在挖掘。\n"

#. key: elixir status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elixir status"
msgid ""
"Your health and/or magic are being rapidly restored, as well as the health of\n"
"your allies.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的健康和/或魔法，还有你盟友的健康正在快速恢复。\n"

#. key: fast+slow status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fast+slow status"
msgid ""
"You are under both slowing and hasting effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"你同时受到减速和加速的效果。\n"

#. key: lava status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lava status"
msgid ""
"You are currently flying over lava.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在飞越岩浆。\n"

#. key: recall status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:recall status"
msgid ""
"You are recalling your allies.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在召回你的盟友。\n"

#. key: water status
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:water status"
msgid ""
"{{\n"
"    local verb = you.flying() and \"flying over\" or\n"
"                 you.race() == \"Merfolk\" and \"swimming in\" or \"standing in\"\n"
"    local feat = view.feature_at(0, 0):gsub(\"_\", \" \")\n"
"\n"
"    if feat ~= \"deep water\" and feat ~= \"shallow water\" then\n"
"        feat = \"water\"\n"
"        verb = \"over\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    return \"You are currently \" .. verb .. \" \" .. feat .. \".\"\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    local verb = you.flying() and \"飞越\" or\n"
"                 you.race() == \"Merfolk\" and \"游在\" or \"站在\"\n"
"    local feat = view.feature_at(0, 0):gsub(\"_\", \" \")\n"
"\n"
"    if feat ~= \"深水\" and feat ~= \"浅水\" then\n"
"        feat = \"水面\"\n"
"        verb = \"越过\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    return \"你正\" .. verb .. \"\" .. feat .. \"。\"\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: attr status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:attr status"
msgid ""
"Enemies are magically translocated toward you. (This won't wake them up.)\n"
msgstr ""
"敌人会魔法般地向你移来。（这不会让他们苏醒。）\n"

#. key: zot status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zot status"
msgid ""
"You have spent too much time in one branch, allowing the malevolent power of Zot\n"
"to notice you. If you spend the indicated number of turns in the branch without\n"
"descending to a new floor, Zot will find you, causing permanent health damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在一个分支上逗留了太多时间，佐特的邪恶力量注意到了你。\n"
"如果你在这个分支上耗尽了指定的回合数，但没有下到新的楼层，\n"
"佐特将会发现你，并对你的健康造成永久性伤害。\n"

#. key: zot count status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zot count status"
msgid ""
"If you spend the indicated number of turns in this branch without descending to\n"
"a new floor, Zot will find you, causing permanent health damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果你在这个分支上耗尽了指定的回合数，但没有下到新的楼层，\n"
"佐特将会发现你，并对你的健康造成永久性伤害。\n"

#. key: gem status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gem status"
msgid ""
"If you spend the indicated number of turns in this branch, its gem will be found\n"
"and shattered by the power of Zot.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果你在这个分支上耗尽了指定的回合数，其中的宝石就会被佐特的力量发现并被粉碎。\n"

#. key: rf0 status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rf0 status"
msgid ""
"The wrath of Ignis prevents you from resisting fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"伊格尼斯的愤怒让你无法抵御火。\n"

#. key: -blink status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-blink status"
msgid ""
"You are unstable and cannot cast Blink or activate evoked blink abilities\n"
"for a short period of time. Powerful sources of translocation magic such as\n"
"scrolls of blinking ignore this limitation, as do external sources of blinking\n"
"outside of your control.\n"
msgstr ""
"你不稳定，短时间内无法施放闪现魔法或激活闪现能力。\n"
"强大的易位来源，如闪现卷轴，则不受此限制，\n"
"就像那些不受你控制的、能诱发闪现的外因一样。\n"

#. key: -bbolt status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-bbolt status"
msgid ""
"You are recovering from becoming lightning, and are unable to blinkbolt again\n"
"for a short duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"你刚从闪电形态中恢复正常，短时间无法再次使用闪现箭。\n"

#. key: charge- status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:charge- status"
msgid ""
"You are currently channelling electrical charge. Pressing <w>.</w> or <w>s</w>\n"
"to wait in place will maintain and continue this process until it discharges.\n"
"Any other action, including recasting the spell, will dissipate the charge\n"
"harmlessly.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在引导电荷。按<w>.</w>或<w>s</w>在原地等待，\n"
"将保持并继续此进程，直到放电。\n"
"任何其他动作，包括重施这个法术，电荷会无害地消散。\n"

#. key: wave status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wave status"
msgid ""
"You are currently channelling waves of flames. Pressing <w>.</w> or <w>s</w>\n"
"to wait in place will maintain and intensify the waves, at the cost of 1 MP per\n"
"turn. Any other action, including recasting the spell, will end it.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在引导火焰波。按<w>.</w>或<w>s</w>在原地等待，\n"
"将保持并增强火焰波，每回合会消耗1魔力。\n"
"任何其他动作，包括重施这个法术，会打断它。\n"

#. key: ramparts status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ramparts status"
msgid ""
"You are encasing nearby walls in ice. The ice will crack and fall away if you\n"
"move to a new position.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在冰封周围的墙。如果你移动到新位置，冰会破裂、脱落。\n"

#. key: bog status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bog status"
msgid ""
"You are creating a toxic bog in the nearby area, and are immune to its effects.\n"
"You cannot sustain this transformation in areas out of your line of sight.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在附近生成了一个有毒的沼泽，并免疫其影响。\n"
"一旦它在你的视线之外，你将无力维持这个变化。\n"

#. key: enlightened status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:enlightened status"
msgid ""
"You are in touch with a greater truth, increasing your resistance to effects\n"
"which target your willpower. Tragically, this epiphany won't last.\n"
msgstr ""
"你接触到了更为宏大的真理，提升了对那些与意志力挂钩的效果的抵抗力。\n"
"不幸的是，这样的顿悟不会一直持续下去。\n"

#. key: reap status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:reap status"
msgid ""
"The dead are hopping! Living creatures you kill may rise as zombified servants.\n"
msgstr ""
"死物在跳跃！你杀死的生物可能会复活，变为丧尸仆从。\n"

#. key: peek status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:peek status"
msgid ""
"You are peering down the stairs. You can freely return to the previous level, but\n"
"once you take any action on this floor, all stairs leading back up will collapse.\n"
msgstr ""
"你顺着楼梯往下看。\n"
"你可以自由返回前一层，但一旦在此楼层上采取任何行动，所有返回的楼梯都将坍塌。\n"

#. key: fragile status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fragile status"
msgid ""
"Your body is as fragile and brittle as glass, increasing the damage you take from\n"
"all sources.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的身体像玻璃那样易碎而脆弱，任何来源的攻击都会对你造成更多伤害。\n"

#. key: ooze status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ooze status"
msgid ""
"Acidic ooze creeps out of the walls around you. Each turn, foes are damaged\n"
"depending on the number of slimy walls they remain adjacent to.\n"
msgstr ""
"酸性软泥从你周围的墙上渗出。\n"
"每回合敌人受到的伤害取决于与其相邻的黏性墙壁的数量。\n"

#. key: dog status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dog status"
msgid ""
"You have summoned your canine familiar.\n"
msgstr ""
"你已经召唤了你的魔犬。\n"

#. key: -dog status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-dog status"
msgid ""
"Your canine familiar is recovering from its injuries, and cannot be summoned\n"
"again for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的魔犬正在从伤势中恢复，短时间内不能再次召唤它。\n"

#. key: -siphon status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-siphon status"
msgid ""
"You have recently siphoned the essence of the living, and cannot do so again for\n"
"a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"你刚吸取过生者的精华，短时间内无法再次吸取它。\n"

#. key: -word status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:-word status"
msgid ""
"You are fatigued from recently speaking a word of chaos, and are unable to do so\n"
"again for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"你刚刚念出过混乱之语，短时间内无法再次念诵它。\n"

#. key: jinx status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jinx status"
msgid ""
"Jinxing spirits encircle you. When you attack foes, those who fail a Will check\n"
"are jinxed, taking damage and becoming drained. The spirits depart quickly when\n"
"no foes are in sight.\n"
msgstr ""
"厄灵环绕着你。当你攻击敌人时，那些意志力不够强的会被诅咒，受到伤害并变被衰竭。\n"
"当视线中没有敌人时，这些灵体会迅速消散。\n"

#. key: rise status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rise status"
msgid ""
"You are hovering upward toward the ceiling. After a short delay, Ignis' power\n"
"will blast you into the level above.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正朝着天花板向上飘浮。在短暂延迟之后，伊格尼斯的力量会把你轰入上层。\n"

#. key: blade status
#: dat/descript/status.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blade status"
msgid ""
"Multiple vicious blades are growing out of your body.\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    local hands = you.hand() .. \"s\"\n"
"    return \"长长的、针般薄的刀片从你的\" .. hands\n"
"}}中生出，更小的金属碎片在你的体内生长，使其变形并降低铠甲的效力。\n"
"\n"
"装备的武器、盾牌和手套都会被融合。\n"

#. key: tough skin mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tough skin mutation"
msgid ""
"Your epidermis has hardened, providing a small amount of protection. Each level\n"
"of this mutation provides +1 AC.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的表皮已经硬化，这会提供少量保护。这个变异每升一级会加1点防护。\n"

#. key: shaggy fur mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shaggy fur mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in fur, providing a small amount of protection. Each level of\n"
"this mutation provides +1 AC. The third level of this mutation also provides\n"
"resistance to cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被皮毛覆盖，这会提供少量保护。这个变异每升一级会加1点防护。\n"
"这个变异达到第三级会提供寒抗。\n"

#. key: repulsion field mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:repulsion field mutation"
msgid ""
"You are surrounded by a repulsion field, providing a small amount of evasion.\n"
"Each level of this mutation provides more EV. The third level of this mutation\n"
"also repels missiles, greatly increasing your EV against such attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被排斥力场围绕，这会提供少量闪避。\n"
"这个变异每升一级会提供更多闪避。\n"
"这个变异达到第三级也会使射向你的远程攻击的命中率减半。\n"

#. key: icy blue scales mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:icy blue scales mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in blue scales, providing a small amount of protection. Each\n"
"level of this mutation provides more AC. The third level of this mutation also\n"
"provides resistance to cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被蓝色鳞片覆盖，这会提供少量保护。这个变异每升一级会提供更多防护。\n"
"这个变异达到第三级会提供寒抗。\n"

#. key: molten scales mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:molten scales mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in molten scales, providing a small amount of protection. Each\n"
"level of this mutation provides more AC. The third level of this mutation also\n"
"provides resistance to fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被熔融的鳞片覆盖，这会提供少量保护。这个变异每升一级会提供更多防护。\n"
"这个变异达到第三级会提供火抗。\n"

#. key: slimy green scales mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slimy green scales mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in green scales, providing a small amount of protection. Each\n"
"level of this mutation provides more AC. The third level of this mutation also\n"
"provides resistance to poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被绿色鳞片覆盖，这会提供少量保护。这个变异每升一级会提供更多防护。\n"
"这个变异达到第三级会提供毒抗。\n"

#. key: yellow scales mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:yellow scales mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in yellow scales, providing a small amount of protection. Each\n"
"level of this mutation provides more AC. The third level of this mutation also\n"
"provides resistance to acid and corrosion.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被黄色鳞片覆盖，这会提供少量保护。这个变异每升一级会提供更多防护。\n"
"这个变异达到第三级会提供酸抗和腐蚀抗。\n"

#. key: thin metallic scales mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:thin metallic scales mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in metallic scales, providing a small amount of protection.\n"
"Each level of this mutation provides more AC. The third level of this mutation\n"
"also provides resistance to electricity.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被金属鳞片覆盖，这会提供少量保护。\n"
"这个变异每升一级会提供更多防护。这个变异达到第三级会提供电抗。\n"

#. key: rugged brown scales mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rugged brown scales mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in brown scales, providing a small amount of protection. Each\n"
"level of this mutation provides +1 AC and also increases your health slightly.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被褐色鳞片覆盖，这会提供少量保护。\n"
"这个变异每升一级会加1点防护，并会稍稍提升你的生命力。\n"

#. key: sharp scales mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sharp scales mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in sharp scales, providing a small amount of protection. Each\n"
"level of this mutation provides +1 AC and Slay +1, improving your accuracy and\n"
"damage with melee and ranged attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被尖锐的鳞片覆盖，这会提供少量保护。这个变异每升一级会加1点防护和1点杀戮，\n"
"这会提升你在近身和远程攻击中的命中率和伤害。\n"

#. key: iridescent scales mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:iridescent scales mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in iridescent scales, providing a small amount of protection.\n"
"Each level of this mutation provides +2 AC.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被彩色鳞片覆盖，这会提供少量保护。这个变异每升一级会加2点防护。\n"

#. key: large bone plates mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:large bone plates mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in bone plates, providing a small amount of shielding. Each\n"
"level of this mutation provides more SH.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被大骨板保护着，这会提供少量格挡。这个变异每升一级会提供更多格挡。\n"

#. key: thin skeletal structure mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:thin skeletal structure mutation"
msgid ""
"Your bones are light and porous. Each level of this mutation provides +2\n"
"Dexterity and Stealth+.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的骨头变得轻巧、多孔。这个变异每升一级会加2点敏捷和潜行。\n"

#. key: strong mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:strong mutation"
msgid ""
"Your muscles have grown unnaturally strong. Each level of this mutation provides\n"
"+4 Strength, but the extra muscles slow your movements and thoughts, giving -1 to\n"
"both your Intelligence and Dexterity for each level.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的肌肉变得异常强壮。这个变异每升一级会加4点力量，\n"
"但额外的肌肉会让你的动作和思维变得迟钝，每升一级，你的智力和敏捷会减1点。\n"

#. key: clever mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:clever mutation"
msgid ""
"Your mind has become unnaturally acute. Each level of this mutation provides +4\n"
"Intelligence, but all the blood flowing to your head weakens your constitution,\n"
"giving -1 to both your Strength and Dexterity for each level.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的心智变得异常敏锐。这个变异每升一级会加4点智力，\n"
"但所有的血液都供向了头部，因而削弱了你的体质，\n"
"每升一级，你的力量和敏捷会减1点。\n"

#. key: agile mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:agile mutation"
msgid ""
"Your reflexes have become unnaturally fast. Each level of this mutation\n"
"provides +4 Dexterity, but the rest of your body can't keep up with your speed,\n"
"giving -1 to both your Strength and Intelligence for each level.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的反应变得异常迅捷。这个变异每升一级会加4点敏捷，\n"
"但你身体的其他部分无法跟上你的速度，每升一级，你的力量和智力会减1点。\n"

#. key: weak mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:weak mutation"
msgid ""
"Your muscles have grown unnaturally weak. Each level of this mutation provides\n"
"-3 Strength.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的肌肉变得异常虚弱。这个变异每升一级会减2点力量。\n"

#. key: dopey mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dopey mutation"
msgid ""
"Your mind has become unnaturally dopey. Each level of this mutation provides -3\n"
"Intelligence.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的心智变得异常愚钝。这个变异每升一级会减2点智力。\n"

#. key: clumsy mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:clumsy mutation"
msgid ""
"Your reflexes have become unnaturally clumsy. Each level of this mutation\n"
"provides -3 Dexterity.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的反应变得异常笨拙。这个变异每升一级会减2点敏捷。\n"

#. key: high mp mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:high mp mutation"
msgid ""
"You have an increased reservoir of magic. Each level of this mutation provides\n"
"+10% MP.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的魔力储备会增加。这个变异每升一级会加10点魔力。\n"

#. key: low mp mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:low mp mutation"
msgid ""
"You have a low magical capacity. Each level of this mutation provides -10% MP.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的魔力储备会减少。这个变异每升一级会减10点魔力。\n"

#. key: camouflage mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:camouflage mutation"
msgid ""
"Your skin changes colour to match your surroundings. Each level of this\n"
"mutation provides Stealth+.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的皮肤会根据周围环境而变色。这个变异每升一级会提升潜行。\n"

#. key: passive freeze mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:passive freeze mutation"
msgid ""
"Foes who strike you in melee will be frozen, taking damage. This effect is\n"
"guaranteed to trigger if your foe does any damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"近战攻击你的敌人会被冻结，并受到伤害。\n"
"如果敌人造成了任何伤害，这个效果就必会触发。\n"

#. key: horns mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:horns mutation"
msgid ""
"You have horns on your head, allowing you to try to gore foes when launching\n"
"melee attacks, but preventing you from wearing helmets. Each level of this mutation\n"
"increases the damage of your gore attacks. The third level of this mutation\n"
"prevents you from wearing any type of headgear.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的头上长出角，在近战时会尝试顶伤敌人，但无法戴头盔。这个变异每升一级，\n"
"就会增加你顶撞的攻击力。这个变异达到第三级，你将无法戴任何帽子。\n"

#. key: beak mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:beak mutation"
msgid ""
"You have a beak for a mouth, allowing you to peck at foes when launching melee\n"
"attacks, but preventing you from wearing helmets.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的嘴成了鸟喙，在近战时能够啄击敌人，但无法戴头盔。\n"

#. key: fangs mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fangs mutation"
msgid ""
"You have sharp teeth, allowing you to bite foes when launching melee attacks.\n"
"Each level of this mutation makes your teeth sharper, longer, and stronger.\n"
msgstr ""
"你长出锋利的牙齿，在近战时能够撕咬敌人。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，你的牙齿就会更尖、更长、更强。\n"

#. key: acidic bite mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:acidic bite mutation"
msgid ""
"You have acidic saliva, allowing you to bite foes and apply corrosion to them\n"
"when launching melee attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"你有了酸性唾液，在近战时能够咬伤敌人，并对其造成腐蚀。\n"

#. key: antimagic bite mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:antimagic bite mutation"
msgid ""
"You have a thirst for magic, allowing you to bite foes when launching melee\n"
"attacks. This restores your magical reserves and also disrupts magical foes,\n"
"sometimes leaving them unable to act.\n"
msgstr ""
"你对魔法有着渴求，在近战时能够咬伤敌人。\n"
"这可以恢复你的魔力并扰乱使用魔法的敌人，有时会让他们无法行动。\n"

#. key: claws mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:claws mutation"
msgid ""
"You have sharp nails, increasing the strength of your main-hand unarmed attacks\n"
"if you aren't wearing gloves. If your off-hand is free, the strength of your\n"
"off-hand punch attacks is also increased. Each level of this mutation makes your\n"
"nails sharper, longer, and stronger. The third level of this mutation prevents\n"
"you from wearing gloves.\n"
msgstr ""
"你长出锋利的指甲，如果不戴手套，会增加主手的徒手攻击强度。\n"
"如果你的副手没有装备东西，也会增强其拳击强度。这个变异每升一级，\n"
"你的指甲就会更尖、更长、更强。这个变异达到第三级，你将无法戴手套。\n"

#. key: demonic touch mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonic touch mutation"
msgid ""
"Your hands glow with unholy energy, allowing you to inflict irresistible damage\n"
"when launching melee attacks as long as your off-hand is free. Your touch\n"
"attacks deal damage which ignores armour, and each level of this mutation\n"
"increases the damage dealt. The third level of this mutation prevents you from\n"
"wearing gloves, and also causes your touch attacks to reduce your foes'\n"
"willpower.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的手散发着邪恶的能量，只要你的副手没有装备东西，\n"
"在近战时就能造成无法抵御的伤害。你的触碰攻击会造成无视护甲的伤害，\n"
"并且这个变异每升一级会增加更多攻击力。这个变异达到第三级，\n"
"能削弱受到你触碰攻击的敌人的意志力，但你将无法戴手套。\n"

#. key: hooves mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hooves mutation"
msgid ""
"You have hooves, allowing you to kick foes when launching melee attacks if you\n"
"aren't wearing boots. Each level of this mutation makes your hooves harder and\n"
"stronger. The third level of this mutation prevents you from wearing boots.\n"
msgstr ""
"你长出蹄子，如果不穿靴子，在近战时能够踢击敌人。这个变异每升一级，\n"
"你的蹄子就会更硬、更强。这个变异达到第三级，你将无法穿靴子。\n"

#. key: talons mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:talons mutation"
msgid ""
"You have sharp toenails, allowing you to kick foes when launching melee attacks\n"
"if you aren't wearing boots. Each level of this mutation makes your nails\n"
"sharper, longer, and stronger. The third level of this mutation prevents you\n"
"from wearing boots.\n"
msgstr ""
"你长出锋利的趾甲，如果不穿靴子，在近战时能够踢击敌人。这个变异每升一级，\n"
"你的趾甲就会更尖、更长、更强。这个变异达到第三级，你将无法穿靴子。\n"

#. key: antennae mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:antennae mutation"
msgid ""
"You have antennae, allowing you to sense nearby monsters, but preventing you\n"
"from wearing helmets. Each level of this mutation lets you sense monsters from\n"
"further away. The third level of this mutation prevents you from wearing any\n"
"type of headgear, and allows you to see invisible monsters.\n"
msgstr ""
"你长出触角，可以感知周围的怪物，但无法戴头盔。这个变异每升一级，\n"
"你会感知到更远的怪物。这个变异达到第三级，\n"
"能看到隐形的怪物，但你将无法戴任何帽子。\n"

#. key: tentacle spike mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tentacle spike mutation"
msgid ""
"You have a spiked tentacle, allowing you to pierce foes when launching melee\n"
"attacks. Each level of this mutation makes your spike sharper, longer, and\n"
"stronger.\n"
msgstr ""
"你长出一个带有尖刺的触手，在近战时能够刺穿敌人。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，你的刺就会更尖、更长、更强。\n"

#. key: naga tail mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:naga tail mutation"
msgid ""
"You have a long, snake-like tail in place of feet. This gives you stability in\n"
"water, but causes you to move much more slowly than most species.\n"
"\n"
"The second level of this mutation allows you to constrict foes with your tail\n"
"when attacking in melee. Your tail can constrict only one enemy at a time, and\n"
"every attack at this mutation level will begin or renew a constriction attempt.\n"
"The chances of succeeding are determined primarily by Dexterity, Fighting skill,\n"
"and any slaying bonuses.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的脚变成一条长长的蛇状尾巴。这个变异达到第二级，\n"
"你在近战时可以用尾巴束缚敌人。你的尾巴一次只能束缚一个敌人，\n"
"在这个变异等级，每次攻击都会尝试开始或再次进行束缚。\n"
"成功率主要取决于敏捷、格斗技能和任何杀戮加成。\n"

#. key: stinger mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stinger mutation"
msgid ""
"You have a venomous barb on the end of your tail, allowing you to sting foes\n"
"when launching melee attacks. Each level of this mutation makes your stinger\n"
"sharper, longer, and stronger.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的尾部长出一个毒刺，在近战时能够蛰刺敌人。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，你的螫刺就会更尖、更长、更强。\n"

#. key: weakness stinger mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:weakness stinger mutation"
msgid ""
"You have a thin, orange tail, allowing you to attack foes when launching melee\n"
"attacks. Each level of this mutation increases your tail's strength as it turns\n"
"into a sharp stinger. The third level of this mutation prevents wearing cloaks\n"
"or scarves, and causes the stinger to inflict brief weakness on those struck.\n"
msgstr ""
"你长出一条细长的红色尾巴，在近战时能够扫打敌人。\n"
"这个变异每升一级会增强你的尾巴的力量，并使其变成尖锐的螫刺。\n"
"这个变异达到第三级，那些不幸被螫刺击中的怪物会被短暂虚弱，\n"
"但你将无法穿戴披风或围巾。\n"

#. key: armoured tail mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:armoured tail mutation"
msgid ""
"You have a large scaly tail, allowing you to tail-slap foes when launching\n"
"melee attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"你长出一条披着甲的大尾巴，在近战时能够扫打敌人。\n"

#. key: pseudopods mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pseudopods mutation"
msgid ""
"You are covered in pseudopods, allowing you to slap your foes when launching\n"
"melee attacks, but somewhat reducing the amount of protection provided by body\n"
"armour. This has no effect on protection provided by armour enchantments. Each\n"
"level of this mutation makes your pseudopods larger and stronger.\n"
msgstr ""
"你身上长满了伪足，在近战时能够扫打敌人，但在一定程度上会削弱护甲提供的防护。\n"
"这对护甲附魔提供的防护没有影响，也不会影响训练的护甲技能的防御效果。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，你的伪足就会更大、更强。\n"

#. key: steam resistance mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:steam resistance mutation"
msgid ""
"You are immune to the damage from steam breath and steam clouds.\n"
msgstr ""
"你对蒸汽吐息和蒸汽云的伤害免疫。\n"

#. key: mutation resistance mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mutation resistance mutation"
msgid ""
"Your genetic code is unusually stable, making it less likely that you will be\n"
"mutated (or have existing mutations removed). Each level of this mutation makes\n"
"you more resistant.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的遗传密码出奇地稳定，使你不太可能发生变异（或消除现有变异）。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，你就会有更强的抵抗力。\n"

#. key: torment resistance mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:torment resistance mutation"
msgid ""
"You are less affected by unholy torment, which would otherwise cut your health\n"
"in half. The second level of this mutation renders you entirely immune.\n"
msgstr ""
"折磨对你的影响较弱，否则这会让你的生命值减半。\n"
"这个变异达到第二级，你将完全免疫折磨。\n"

#. key: poison resistance mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:poison resistance mutation"
msgid ""
"You resist poisons, toxins and other contaminants. This does not confer\n"
"full immunity, but reduces your chances of being affected to roughly\n"
"one-third what it would be otherwise.\n"
msgstr ""
"你对毒物、毒素和其他污染物有着抗性。\n"
"它不会赋予完全的免疫力，但你中毒的几率会降低到原先的三分之一左右。\n"

#. key: fire resistance mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire resistance mutation"
msgid ""
"You resist heat. Each level of this mutation reduces the amount of damage taken\n"
"from fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"你抵抗热。这个变异每升一级，就会削弱火对你造成的伤害。\n"

#. key: cold resistance mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cold resistance mutation"
msgid ""
"You resist cold. Each level of this mutation reduces the amount of damage taken\n"
"from cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"你抵抗寒冷。这个变异每升一级，就会削弱寒冷对你造成的伤害。\n"

#. key: electricity resistance mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:electricity resistance mutation"
msgid ""
"You resist electricity (rElec), taking less damage from it.\n"
msgstr ""
"你抵抗电（rElec），电对你造成的伤害变弱。\n"

#. key: acid resistance mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:acid resistance mutation"
msgid ""
"You resist acid (rCorr), taking less damage from it. You are also less likely to\n"
"become corroded.\n"
msgstr ""
"你抵抗酸（rCorr），酸对你造成的伤害变弱。你也变得更难被腐蚀。\n"

#. key: negative energy resistance mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:negative energy resistance mutation"
msgid ""
"You resist negative energy. Each level of this mutation reduces the amount of\n"
"damage taken from negative energy, along with the amount that it drains your\n"
"health.\n"
msgstr ""
"你抵抗负能量。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，就会减小负能量对你造成的伤害和从你身上汲取的生命值。\n"

#. key: heat vulnerability mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:heat vulnerability mutation"
msgid ""
"You are vulnerable to fire and take more damage from it.\n"
msgstr ""
"火很容易对你造成伤害，并会对你造成更多伤害。\n"

#. key: cold vulnerability mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cold vulnerability mutation"
msgid ""
"You are vulnerable to cold and take more damage from it.\n"
msgstr ""
"寒冷很容易对你造成伤害，并会对你造成更多伤害。\n"

#. key: temperature sensitive mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:temperature sensitive mutation"
msgid ""
"You are vulnerable to both cold and fire, and you take more damage from those\n"
"effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"寒冷和火都很容易对你造成伤害，并会对你造成更多伤害。\n"

#. key: electricity vulnerability mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:electricity vulnerability mutation"
msgid ""
"You are vulnerable to electricity and take more damage from it.\n"
msgstr ""
"电很容易对你造成伤害，并会对你造成更多伤害。\n"

#. key: strong-willed mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:strong-willed mutation"
msgid ""
"You have an unnaturally strong will, improving your resistance to certain types\n"
"of hostile magic. Each level of this mutation increases your willpower further.\n"
msgstr ""
"你有着异常强大的意志，提升了对某类敌对魔法的抵抗力。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，就会增加你的意志力。\n"

#. key: weak-willed mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:weak-willed mutation"
msgid ""
"You have an unnaturally weak will, reducing your resistance to certain types\n"
"of hostile magic. Each level of this mutation reduces your willpower further.\n"
msgstr ""
"你有着异常疲弱的意志，削弱了对某类敌对魔法的抵抗力。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，就会削弱你的意志力。\n"

#. key: see invisible mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:see invisible mutation"
msgid ""
"You have supernaturally acute vision, allowing you to see monsters that are\n"
"hidden from mundane sight. This has no effect on your accuracy otherwise.\n"
msgstr ""
"你有着超乎寻常的敏锐视力，可以看到隐藏在世俗眼界之外的怪物。\n"
"然而，它对你的命中率没有影响。\n"

#. key: clarity mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:clarity mutation"
msgid ""
"Your mind is exceptionally clear, preventing you from becoming confused,\n"
"mesmerised, or supernaturally afraid. You also cannot become involuntarily\n"
"enraged.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的头脑异常清晰，你不会被混乱、迷惑或产生超自然的恐惧。\n"
"你也不会不由自主地狂暴。\n"

#. key: sense surroundings mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sense surroundings mutation"
msgid ""
"You have a second sense for the dungeon, allowing you to sense terrain you\n"
"haven't yet seen. Each level of this mutation allows you to sense more and\n"
"more thoroughly.\n"
msgstr ""
"你对地牢有第二种感知，可以感知到你还没有看到的地形。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，你的感知就越来越全面。\n"

#. key: mp-powered wands mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mp-powered wands mutation"
msgid ""
"Your wands draw upon your magical reserves, becoming somewhat more powerful in\n"
"the process. If you have no magic left to draw upon, your wands function as\n"
"normal.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的魔杖会汲取你的魔力，在这个过程中会变得更强大。\n"
"如果你没有魔力了，你的魔杖的效果会恢复正常。\n"

#. key: regeneration mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:regeneration mutation"
msgid ""
"You heal quickly. Each level of this mutation increases the rate at which you\n"
"heal.\n"
msgstr ""
"你愈合得很快。这个变异每升一级，就会增加你的愈合速率。\n"

#. key: inhibited regeneration mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:inhibited regeneration mutation"
msgid ""
"You do not heal over time while foes are in sight. Other sources of healing,\n"
"such as potions, are unaffected.\n"
msgstr ""
"当敌人出现时，你不会随着时间推移而痊愈。其他治疗来源，如药水，不受此影响。\n"

#. key: speed mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:speed mutation"
msgid ""
"You cover ground quickly - moving to new positions takes you less time. This\n"
"has no effect on other types of actions, like attacking or casting spells.\n"
"Each level of this mutation makes you move faster.\n"
msgstr ""
"你行进得很快——移动到新位置所需的时间会更短。它对其他类型的动作没有影响，\n"
"比如攻击或施法。这个变异每升一级，你移动得会更快。\n"

#. key: slowness mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slowness mutation"
msgid ""
"You cover ground slowly - moving to new positions takes you more time. This\n"
"has no effect on other types of actions, like attacking or casting spells.\n"
"Each level of this mutation makes you move slower.\n"
msgstr ""
"你行进得很慢——移动到新位置所需的时间会更长。它对其他类型的动作没有影响，\n"
"比如攻击或施法。这个变异每升一级，你移动得会更慢。\n"

#. key: robust mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robust mutation"
msgid ""
"You can take a beating. Each level of this mutation improves your health\n"
"further (+10% HP).\n"
msgstr ""
"你承受得住打击。这个变异每升一级，你的健康状况会改善（+10%生命值）。\n"

#. key: frail mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frail mutation"
msgid ""
"Your health is poor. Each level of this mutation worsens your health further\n"
"(-10% HP).\n"
msgstr ""
"你的健康状况很差。这个变异每升一级，你的健康状况会恶化（-10%生命值）。\n"

#. key: evolution mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:evolution mutation"
msgid ""
"As you gain experience, your body's hidden potential will express itself in the\n"
"form of new beneficial mutations.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你获得经验时，你身体的隐藏特质会导致新的有益变异。\n"

#. key: devolution mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:devolution mutation"
msgid ""
"As you gain experience, your body's hidden potential will express itself in the\n"
"form of new detrimental mutations.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你获得经验时，你身体的隐藏特质会导致新的有害变异。\n"

#. key: wild magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wild magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your spells are slightly harder to cast (increased miscast chance and severity),\n"
"but more powerful. Each level of this mutation increases both effects further.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的法术将略难施放（增加了失误率和判定的严苛程度），但威力会变强。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，两方面的效果都会增强。\n"

#. key: subdued magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:subdued magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your spells are slightly easier to cast (reduced miscast chance and severity),\n"
"but less powerful. Each level of this mutation increases both effects further.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的法术将略易施放（减少了失误率和判定的严苛程度），但威力会变弱。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，两方面的效果都会增强。\n"

#. key: teleportitis mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:teleportitis mutation"
msgid ""
"You periodically teleport towards hostile monsters. You will sense yourself\n"
"destabilising several turns in advance of this happening, and may suppress it\n"
"temporarily by reading a scroll of teleportation.\n"
"\n"
"Each level of this mutation increases the frequency with which you start to\n"
"teleport.\n"
msgstr ""
"你偶尔会穿过本层，传送到敌方怪物那里。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，就会增加这种情况发生的频率。\n"

#. key: deformed body mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deformed body mutation"
msgid ""
"Your body is shaped in an inhuman way, somewhat reducing the amount of\n"
"protection provided by body armour. This has no effect on protection provided\n"
"by armour enchantments.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的身体被一种非人的方式塑造，这在一定程度上削弱了铠甲提供的防护。\n"
"这对护甲附魔提供的防护没有影响，也不会影响训练的护甲技能的防御效果。\n"

#. key: screaming mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:screaming mutation"
msgid ""
"You are sometimes seized by an uncontrollable urge to scream whenever you\n"
"sustain an injury. All of your shouts are also louder than usual.\n"
"\n"
"The second level of this mutation makes this urge harder to resist and makes\n"
"your shouts even louder.\n"
msgstr ""
"当敌人第一次出现在你的视线中时，有时你会有种无法克制的冲动，要冲他们喊叫。\n"
"你的喊叫声也都比平时更大。这个变异达到第二级，你将更难克制那股冲动，\n"
"你的喊叫声也会更大。\n"

#. key: no potion heal mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no potion heal mutation"
msgid ""
"Your system is resistant to potable panaceas, reducing the effectiveness of all\n"
"kinds of healing potions. The second level of this mutation completely blocks\n"
"potion-based healing. (Aid from the god Gozag is unaffected.)\n"
msgstr ""
"你的系统会抗拒饮用的灵丹妙药，削弱了各种治疗药水的效果。\n"
"这个变异达到第二级，会完全阻断药水的疗效。（哥萨戈神的援助不受影响。）\n"

#. key: persistent drain mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:persistent drain mutation"
msgid ""
"Your health recovers twice as slowly from being drained. (The total experience\n"
"needed is doubled.)\n"
msgstr ""
"你衰竭后，恢复正常所用的时间是原先的两倍。（所需的总经验值增加了一倍。）\n"

#. key: demonic guardian mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonic guardian mutation"
msgid ""
"When you are harmed, there is a chance that a demonic guardian will rush to aid\n"
"you. The greater the damage done and the closer you are to death, the greater\n"
"the odds. Each level of this mutation increases the strength of your guardians.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你受到伤害时，可能会有恶魔守卫冲过来帮助你。受到的伤害越大，离死亡越近，\n"
"其可能性就越大。这个变异每升一级，就会增加你的守卫的力量。\n"

#. key: powered by pain mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:powered by pain mutation"
msgid ""
"When you are harmed, you sometimes gain power, refilling your magical reservoir\n"
"or granting you temporary agility or might. Each level of this mutation\n"
"increases the magnitude of this effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你受伤时，有时你会获得能量，它会注入你的魔力储备，\n"
"有时你的敏捷或力量会得到暂时的提升。这个变异每升一级，其效果就会增强。\n"

#. key: foul stench mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:foul stench mutation"
msgid ""
"Foes who strike you in melee sometimes cause you to emit a cloud of foul\n"
"miasma, slowing and severely poisoning those caught within. This mutation also\n"
"grants you immunity to miasma (from any source).\n"
msgstr ""
"敌人的近战攻击有时会让你发出一团恶臭的瘴气，\n"
"卷入其中的怪物会变慢并受到严重毒害。\n"
"这个变异还能让你对（任何来源的）瘴气免疫。\n"

#. key: spiny mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spiny mutation"
msgid ""
"Foes who strike you in melee have a 50% chance of being impaled on your spines,\n"
"taking damage. Each level of this mutation increases the damage. This mutation\n"
"also grants you immunity to constriction.\n"
msgstr ""
"近战中，你的敌人有50%的几率被你的尖刺所刺穿，并受到伤害。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，就会增加攻击力。\n"

#. key: augmentation mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:augmentation mutation"
msgid ""
"While in good health, you are more powerful, casting spells and slaying foes\n"
"more effectively. Each level of this mutation increases this effect further.\n"
msgstr ""
"在健康状况良好的情况下，你会更有能量，更有效地施展法术并杀死敌人。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，其效果都会增强。\n"

#. key: magic shield mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:magic shield mutation"
msgid ""
"When you are harmed, some damage is redirected to deplete your magic reserves\n"
"instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你受到伤害时，一些伤害会转而消耗你的魔力储备。\n"

#. key: magic regeneration mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:magic regeneration mutation"
msgid ""
"Your magical reserves regenerate quickly.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的魔力储备的恢复速度变快。\n"

#. key: magic link mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:magic link mutation"
msgid ""
"When low on magic, you restore magic in place of health.\n"
msgstr ""
"当魔力不足时，你会恢复魔法而不是生命值。\n"

#. key: demonic magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonic magic mutation"
msgid ""
"When you cast spells, there's a chance that adjacent monsters will be\n"
"paralysed. This effect is more powerful when casting higher-level spells, but\n"
"monsters with greater willpower can resist it. Each level of this mutation\n"
"allows more distant monsters to be affected. The third level of this mutation\n"
"also allows you to paralyse monsters in the same way while zapping wands.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你施放法术时，相邻的怪物可能会麻痹。在施放更高等级的法术时，\n"
"效果会更为强大，但具有更强意志力的怪物能够抵御它。这个变异每升一级，\n"
"就能影响更远的怪物。这个变异达到第三级，你在挥动魔杖时也能麻痹怪物。\n"

#. key: icemail mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:icemail mutation"
msgid ""
"You are coated in a protective layer of ice. Fiery attacks can temporarily melt\n"
"the ice, removing the protection until the ice reforms. Each level of this\n"
"mutation increases the protection imparted.\n"
msgstr ""
"你身上覆盖着一层起保护作用的冰。火焰攻击能暂时融化冰层，\n"
"在冰层重新形成之前会消除保护。这个变异每升一级，就会提升获得的保护。\n"

#. key: condensation shield mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:condensation shield mutation"
msgid ""
"A shield of frost guards you, blocking some incoming attacks. Fiery attacks can\n"
"temporarily melt the shield.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个冰霜盾守护着你，阻挡着一些来袭的攻击。火焰攻击能暂时融化此盾。\n"

#. key: powered by death mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:powered by death mutation"
msgid ""
"Death fuels you, allowing you to heal somewhat for each life you take. Each\n"
"level of this mutation increases the healing further.\n"
msgstr ""
"死亡滋养着你，你每夺取一条生命，就能得到一定程度的治疗。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，治疗效果就会增强。\n"

#. key: sturdy frame mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sturdy frame mutation"
msgid ""
"Your movements are less encumbered by armour, mitigating penalties to spell\n"
"success, evasion, and ranged weapon attack speed. Each level of this mutation\n"
"reduces armour ER by 2.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的行动将少受到护甲的阻碍，\n"
"并减少了护甲对施法的成功率、命中率和远程武器的攻击速度的负面影响。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，就会减少2点护甲的妨碍等级。\n"

#. key: sanguine armour mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sanguine armour mutation"
msgid ""
"When seriously injured, your blood congeals around you, forming armour. Each\n"
"level of this mutation increases the AC provided.\n"
msgstr ""
"当受重伤时，你的血液会在你周围凝结，形成护甲。这个变异每升一级就会提升防护。\n"

#. key: big brain mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:big brain mutation"
msgid ""
"What's up? You have a big brain. Each level of this mutation provides +2\n"
"Intelligence. The third level of this mutation also makes you less likely to\n"
"miscast spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"出什么事了？你有一个大脑袋。这个变异每升一级会加2点智力。\n"
"这个变异达到第三级，你在施法时就更不容易失误。\n"

#. key: ignite blood mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ignite blood mutation"
msgid ""
"Whenever you see blood spilled (yours or others'), it may ignite, bursting into\n"
"a cloud of flame. Each level of this mutation makes this more likely. This\n"
"mutation also grants you immunity to clouds of flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"每当你看到（你的或他人的）飞溅的血液，它可能会燃烧，爆发成火焰云。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，这种可能性就越大。这个变异还能让你免疫火焰云。\n"

#. key: corrupting presence mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corrupting presence mutation"
msgid ""
"When you injure a foe, your presence may intensify the damage, corroding their\n"
"weapons and defences. The second level of this mutation makes matters even\n"
"worse, adding a chance that your wretched victims may become mutated and\n"
"deformed.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你伤害到敌人时，攻击力可能会增强，并能腐蚀他们的武器和防具。\n"
"这个变异达到第二级，事态会更为严重，你那可怜的受害者将有可能被变异、变形。\n"

#. key: black mark mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:black mark mutation"
msgid ""
"When you strike a foe in melee, the black mark on your body may debilitate\n"
"them. This can weaken foes, drain their health, or disrupt their magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你近战攻击敌人时，你身上的黑色标记可能会削弱敌人。\n"
"它能够虚弱敌人、汲取他们的生命力，或扰乱他们的魔法。\n"

#. key: aura of silence mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:aura of silence mutation"
msgid ""
"You are surrounded by an aura of silence. Those adjacent to you cannot make any\n"
"sound. This prevents most forms of spellcasting and prayer, though demonic\n"
"magic, being noiseless, is unaffected.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被沉默力场所围绕。与你相邻的怪物无法发出任何声音。\n"
"它可以阻止大多数形式的施法和祈祷，但恶魔的魔法是无声的，不受此影响。\n"

#. key: bedevilling mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bedevilling mutation"
msgid ""
"You cast Hex spells with increased power.\n"
msgstr ""
"你施放的妖术威力增强。\n"

#. key: demonic willpower mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demonic willpower mutation"
msgid ""
"Your willpower has a will of its own, sometimes injuring those who attempt to\n"
"hex you. This mutation also bolsters your willpower.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的意志力有了自己的意图，有时它会伤害那些试图给你下咒的人。\n"
"这个变异还会增强你的意志力。\n"

#. key: hurl damnation mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hurl damnation mutation"
msgid ""
"You can hurl damnation with <input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input>. Foes beware!\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以通过<input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input>发动天遣。敌人们可要当心了！\n"

#. key: word of chaos mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:word of chaos mutation"
msgid ""
"You can speak a Word of Chaos with <input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以通过<input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input>念出混沌之语。\n"

#. key: freezing cloud immunity mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:freezing cloud immunity mutation"
msgid ""
"You are immune to freezing clouds.\n"
msgstr ""
"你免疫冰汽云。\n"

#. key: flame cloud immunity mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:flame cloud immunity mutation"
msgid ""
"You are immune to clouds of flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"你免疫火焰云。\n"

#. key: spit poison mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spit poison mutation"
msgid ""
"You can spit poison with <input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input>. The second level\n"
"of this mutation intensifies the poison from a single glob into a large cloud.\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以通过<input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input>喷吐毒液。\n"
"这个变异达到第二级，毒素会从一小团毒液，变成一大片毒云。\n"

#. key: in touch with death mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:in touch with death mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Necromancy spells are more powerful. The second level of this mutation\n"
"enhances your Necromancy spellpower further.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的死灵法术变得更为强大。这个变异达到第二级，就会增强你的死灵术的法力。\n"

#. key: acrobatic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:acrobatic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your magical nature helps you tumble your hollow bones around acrobatically,\n"
"allowing you to evade attacks while moving or waiting.\n"
msgstr ""
"你那神奇的天性有助于你杂技般地翻滚你的空心骨头，从而能在移动或等待时躲避攻击。\n"

#. key: evasive flight mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:evasive flight mutation"
msgid ""
"You fly evasively through the air, increasing your evasion somewhat.\n"
msgstr ""
"你地在空中扑闪，闪避能力得到一定提升。\n"

#. key: big wings mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:big wings mutation"
msgid ""
"You have big, strong wings, capable of bearing you through the air.\n"
msgstr ""
"你长出巨大、强壮的翅膀，它能够承载你在空中飞行。\n"

#. key: float mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:float mutation"
msgid ""
"You hover through the air, forever free from the surly bonds of earth.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在空中悬浮，永远摆脱了大地的束缚。\n"

#. key: innate caster mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:innate caster mutation"
msgid ""
"You cannot learn spells from books. Instead, as you gain experience, spells\n"
"of higher and higher level bubble up from your fiery heart. These spells are\n"
"unpredictable and unaffected by your choice of god. You cannot train specific\n"
"spell schools - you can either train all spell schools at once, or none.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法从书本习得法术。取而代之的是，随着你经验的增加，\n"
"越来越高级的法术从你炽热的内心中涌现。\n"
"这些法术是不可预知的，且不受你皈依的神影响。\n"
"你无法训练特定的法术流派——要么同时都进行训练，要么一个都不进行训练。\n"

#. key: hp casting mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hp casting mutation"
msgid ""
"You have no separate reserve of magical power, and anything that would affect\n"
"MP has no effect on you. When casting spells, using abilities, or doing anything\n"
"else that *costs* MP for normal species, you spend HP instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"你没有独立的魔力储备，任何会影响魔力的都将对你失效。\n"
"当施展法术、使用能力或做任何对其他物种来说需要花费魔力的事时，\n"
"你将转而消耗生命值。\n"

#. key: extra vitality mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:extra vitality mutation"
msgid ""
"You are built differently from most species, making you slightly harder to kill.\n"
"Each level of this mutation increases your maximum health by 4 points.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的身体结构与大多数物种不同，这让你略难被杀死。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，你的生命值上限就会增加4点。\n"

#. key: forlorn mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:forlorn mutation"
msgid ""
"You cannot, will not, and will never worship any god.\n"
msgstr ""
"你不能、不会、也永远无法皈依任何神。\n"

#. key: nightstalker mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nightstalker mutation"
msgid ""
"You are attuned to the shadows, reducing the distance that you can see or be\n"
"seen from.\n"
msgstr ""
"你适应了阴影，减小了你能看到和被看到的距离。\n"

#. key: +los mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:+los mutation"
msgid ""
"You are born to the light, increasing the distance that you can see and be seen\n"
"from.\n"
msgstr ""
"在你的道路上黑暗会遁形，从而扩大了视野和远程攻击范围（+1视线），\n"
"但也使得你能从更远的地方被发现并成为潜在目标。\n"

#. key: cold-blooded mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cold-blooded mutation"
msgid ""
"When struck by a cold attack, you may be slowed until your blood warms again.\n"
msgstr ""
"当受到寒冷攻击时，你可能会变慢，直到你的血液再次变暖。\n"

#. key: stealthy paws mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stealthy paws mutation"
msgid ""
"When launching attacks on unaware or incapacitated enemies, you inflict extra\n"
"damage in the same way as a human with a short blade might.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你攻击没有意识或失去行动能力的敌人时，你会造成额外的伤害，\n"
"就像人类使用短刀一样。\n"

#. key: four strong arms mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:four strong arms mutation"
msgid ""
"You have two pairs of two arms, allowing you to wield two-handed weapons with\n"
"one pair and a shield with the other, as well as wear a second pair of gloves.\n"
"You can even wield extremely large weapons like giant clubs, though this takes\n"
"both arm-pairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"你有两对双臂，可以一对手持双手武器，另一对手持盾牌。\n"
"你甚至可以挥舞极其巨大的武器，比如大棒，不过这需要两对手臂的配合。\n"
"每对手臂的副臂的形状都很奇怪，因此你无法戴上额外的手套或魔法戒指。\n"

#. key: retaliatory headbutt mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:retaliatory headbutt mutation"
msgid ""
"When a foe misses you in melee, you may reflexively retaliate, attempting to\n"
"gore your attacker with your horns. You can perform this against a given enemy\n"
"no more than once per player action.\n"
msgstr ""
"当敌人未在近战中击中你时，你可能会本能地进行报复，试图用你的角顶伤攻击者。\n"

#. key: multi-lived mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:multi-lived mutation"
msgid ""
"Every third experience level, you gain an extra life. If you are slain while\n"
"you still have a life remaining, you will reappear elsewhere on the current\n"
"floor. You can continue to gain extra lives even once you reach the maximum\n"
"experience level, but you can't have more than two extra lives at a time.\n"
msgstr ""
"每过三级，你将获得额外的生命。\n"
"如果你被杀的时候还有一条命，你会在当前楼层的其他地方重新出现。\n"
"即使你达到了最高的经验等级，你也可以继续获得额外的生命，\n"
"但最多只能有两条额外生命。\n"

#. key: distributed training mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:distributed training mutation"
msgid ""
"Whenever you gain experience, it is split between all of your skills. You\n"
"cannot choose to focus. Effects that prevent you from training certain skills,\n"
"such as divine restrictions, do not cause your other skills to rise faster.\n"
msgstr ""
"无论你何时获得经验，它都会分配到你的所有技能之中。\n"
"你无法选择技能进行着重训练。\n"
"此效果让你无法训练特定技能，仿佛是神的限制，不会让你的其他技能提升得更快。\n"

#. key: nimble swimmer mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nimble swimmer mutation"
msgid ""
"You can blend into the waves while swimming through water or flying above it,\n"
"gaining Stealth+. The second level of this mutation also grants you improved\n"
"evasion and increases your movement speed when in or above water.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在水中游泳或在水面上飞行时能融入波浪，潜行获得加成。\n"
"这个变异达到第二级，还会提升你在水中或水上的闪避能力和移动速度。\n"

#. key: divine attributes mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:divine attributes mutation"
msgid ""
"Your divine heritage dramatically boosts your attribute gain (Strength,\n"
"Intelligence, and Dexterity) as you level up relative to other species, both\n"
"in quantity and in how much you can control your development. Every three\n"
"levels, you choose an attribute to increase by four points.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你与其他物种相比，无论是在数值还是在发育程度的掌控上，\n"
"神圣属性都显著提升了你的属性增益（力量、智力和敏捷）。\n"
"每过三级，你可以选一个属性，提升四点。\n"

#. key: tentacles mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tentacles mutation"
msgid ""
"Your gelatinous body has eight tentacles that help you move around in shallow\n"
"or deep water and can be used to constrict enemies while attacking them in\n"
"melee. Each tentacle can wear a ring, but you need four of them to move around,\n"
"and either two or four tentacles to hold a weapon depending on its size, and\n"
"two tentacles to hold a shield.\n"
"\n"
"Your tentacles will try to constrict foes which you attack in melee. (You cannot\n"
"constrict monsters larger than you.) Independently, you have a two-thirds chance\n"
"of launching a damaging 'squeeze' attack whenever you attack in melee.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的胶状身体有八个触手，可以帮助你在浅水或深水中移动，并能在近战时束缚敌人。\n"
"每只触手都可以戴上戒指，但你需要四只触手用来移动，根据武器的大小，\n"
"两只或四只触手可以拿一把武器，两只触手可以拿一面盾牌。\n"
"\n"
"当你近战时，你的触手会尝试束缚敌人。（你无法束缚比你大的怪物。）\n"
"顺便一提，每当你近战攻击时，你有三分之二的机会发动破坏性的“挤压”攻击。\n"

#. key: mertail mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mertail mutation"
msgid ""
"Your morphogenic matrix is unstable, allowing your lower body to shift to\n"
"a powerful aquatic tail when in shallow or deep water. It will quickly\n"
"reform into legs once you leave the water. When in merform, your tail allows\n"
"you to tail-slap foes when launching melee attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的基体形态不稳定，当你在浅水或深水中，\n"
"你的下半身会变成强有力的水生生物的尾巴。一旦你离开水面，它会很快变成腿。\n"
"处于人鱼形态时，你的尾巴在近战时能够扫打敌人。\n"

#. key: +los mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:+los mutation"
msgid ""
"The darkness flees at your approach, allowing an extended range of vision and\n"
"ranged attack (+1 line of sight), but also allowing you to be seen and\n"
"potentially targeted from further away.\n"
msgstr ""
"在你的道路上黑暗会遁形，从而扩大了视野和远程攻击范围（+1视线），\n"
"但也使得你能从更远的地方被发现并成为潜在目标。\n"

#. key: no regeneration mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no regeneration mutation"
msgid ""
"You do not regenerate health while resting, and are unable to receive the\n"
"effects of magic that hastens the speed of regeneration. Sources of HP gain\n"
"such as potions and religious invocations will still heal you, and certain\n"
"divine invocations can temporarily grant you the ability to regenerate.\n"
"To compensate, you are able to heal yourself via the\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input> key, at the cost of permanent MP.\n"
msgstr ""
"你在休息时无法恢复健康，也无法获得提升恢复速度的魔法效果。\n"
"至于提升生命力的手段，像药水和虔诚的祈祷仍能治疗你，\n"
"某些神圣祈祷能力可以短暂赋予你自愈的能力。\n"
"作为补偿，你可以通过<input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input> 键治疗自己，\n"
"但代价是要永久地失去一些魔力。\n"

#. key: gelatinous body mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gelatinous body mutation"
msgid ""
"Your body is rubbery, and your foes like glue. Each level of this mutation\n"
"confers +1 AC and +1 EV.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的身体富有弹性，你的敌人就像胶水。这个变异每升一级会加1点防护和1点闪避。\n"

#. key: eyeballs mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eyeballs mutation"
msgid ""
"Golden eyeballs sprout from your flesh like mushrooms, confusing your foes.\n"
"Each level of this mutation improves your accuracy with weapons, unarmed\n"
"attacks, auxiliary attacks, and spells. The third level of this mutation also\n"
"allows you to see invisible foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"金色的眼球像蘑菇一样从你的肉里长出来，能够混乱你的敌人。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，就能提升你的武器、徒手攻击、辅助攻击和法术的命中率。\n"
"这个变异达到第三级，你将能够看到隐形的敌人。\n"

#. key: translucent skin mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:translucent skin mutation"
msgid ""
"Your skin is transparent, improving your stealth and reducing the accuracy of\n"
"your foes' attacks against you. Each level of this mutation reduces your foes'\n"
"accuracy further.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的皮肤是透明的，你的潜行能力得到提升，敌人攻击你的命中率会降低。\n"
"这个变异每升一级，就会削弱你的敌人的命中率。\n"

#. key: tendrils mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tendrils mutation"
msgid ""
"When struck in melee, the slimy tendrils covering your body may grab your\n"
"attacker's weapon and yank it from their grasp, disarming them.\n"
msgstr ""
"受到近战伤害时，覆盖在你身体上的黏稠卷须可能会抓住攻击者的武器，\n"
"并从他手上将其拽出，解除他们的武装。\n"

#. key: jelly sensing items mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jelly sensing items mutation"
msgid ""
"You have a small jelly attached to you that senses nearby items.\n"
msgstr ""
"你身上附有一个小胶冻，它可以感知周围物品。\n"

#. key: jelly absorbing missiles mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jelly absorbing missiles mutation"
msgid ""
"When struck by a missile (such as an arrow or crossbow bolt), a jelly on your\n"
"body may eat it, healing you somewhat.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你被飞弹击中时（比如箭或弩箭），你身上的胶冻可能会吞掉它，并进行一定治疗。\n"

#. key: otherworldly mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:otherworldly mutation"
msgid ""
"You are foreign to this world, easily perceived by dark forces. You have only\n"
"one-tenth the normal time on each dungeon floor before Zot finds you and\n"
"permanently reduces your health.\n"
msgstr ""
"你与这个世界格格不入，很容易被黑暗势力察觉。\n"
"在佐特找到你并永久降低你的生命值之前，你在每层地牢的时间只有正常时间的十分之一。\n"

#. key: explore regen mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:explore regen mutation"
msgid ""
"You are invigorated by the discovery of the unknown. As you explore the dungeon,\n"
"your wounds will heal and your magic will replenish.\n"
msgstr ""
"探索未知会让你精神振奋。当你探索地牢时，你的伤口会愈合，你的魔力会恢复。\n"

#. key: faith mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:faith mutation"
msgid ""
"You were embalmed with holy oils and sacred spices and bound about with blessed\n"
"cloth. Now you have a special connection with the divine, allowing you to gain\n"
"favour with your chosen god more quickly.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被熏了圣油和圣香料，被蒙福的布裹着。\n"
"现在你与神有一种特殊的联系，你会更快被你皈依的神所赏识。\n"

#. key: devour on kill mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:devour on kill mutation"
msgid ""
"When you kill living creatures you have a chance to devour their life force\n"
"and restore health.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你杀死生物时，你有机会吞噬它们的生命力并恢复健康。\n"

#. key: rollpage mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rollpage mutation"
msgid ""
"You instinctively roll as you move toward enemies, rampaging forward an\n"
"additional space. This mutation grants magic regeneration when rolling; the\n"
"second level of this mutation regenerates both magic and health.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你移向敌人时会本能地翻滚，会向前再冲出一格。\n"
"这个变异能在你滚动时提升魔力恢复速度；\n"
"这个变异达到第二级，魔力和生命值的恢复速度会同时提升。\n"

#. key: double potion healing mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:double potion healing mutation"
msgid ""
"Whenever a potion restores your health or magic, it restores twice as much.\n"
msgstr ""
"每当药水恢复你的生命值或魔力时，其恢复量是原先的两倍。\n"

#. key: drunken brawling mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:drunken brawling mutation"
msgid ""
"Whenever you drink a potion that restores health or magic, you perform an\n"
"immediate attack against all enemies adjacent to you.\n"
"\n"
"(This includes potions of curing, heal wounds, magic, and ambrosia.)\n"
msgstr ""
"当你喝下恢复健康或魔力的药水时，你会立即攻击附近的所有敌人。\n"
"\n"
"（这包括治疗、愈伤、魔力和琼浆药水。）\n"

#. key: missing a hand mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:missing a hand mutation"
msgid ""
"You are considerably less handy than you used to be. You cannot wield\n"
"two-handed weapons, wear a shield, launch off-handed attacks, or use more than\n"
"one magical ring at a time.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的手要比以前不方便得多。\n"
"你不能使用双手武器、装备盾牌、发起徒手攻击或一次使用多个魔法戒指。\n"

#. key: no stealth mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no stealth mutation"
msgid ""
"You have no Stealth. You will always alert monsters when they see you, and\n"
"they will track you very effectively.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法潜行。\n"
"当敌人能看到你时，你总是能引起他们的警觉，并且他们能够轻易追踪你。\n"

#. key: no forms mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no forms mutation"
msgid ""
"You cannot voluntarily change forms, via talismans, potions, or any other means.\n"
"You may still be involuntarily transformed by effects such as wands of polymorph.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法通过符咒、药水或其他任何方式自行改变形态。\n"
"但你仍有可能会被变形魔杖等方式不由自主地改变形态。\n"

#. key: inability to use devices mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:inability to use devices mutation"
msgid ""
"You cannot use magical devices. This includes wands and most items evoked with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</input>, excepting reaching weapons, talismans, and\n"
"ziggurat figurines. This also renders magical staves much less effective in\n"
"melee.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法使用魔法设备。\n"
"其中包括魔杖和大多数需要通过<input>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</input>激活的物品，\n"
"但不包括获得的武器、符咒和金字塔雕像。这也使得法杖在近战时的威力大大降低。\n"

#. key: hated by all mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hated by all mutation"
msgid ""
"You are hated by all and cannot acquire allies, temporarily or permanently, by\n"
"any means. Simplistic, unthinking magical constructs, such as spectral weapons,\n"
"orbs of destruction, and battlespheres, are unaffected.\n"
msgstr ""
"你被所有怪物憎恨，无法以任何方式获得暂时或永久的盟友。\n"
"简单、没有意识的魔法造物，比如幽灵武器、毁灭球和作战球则不受此影响。\n"

#. key: cowardly mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cowardly mutation"
msgid ""
"Seeing threatening monsters fills you with dread, reducing the power of your\n"
"spells and your ability to slay monsters with melee and ranged attacks. Seeing\n"
"multiple such monsters at once, or extremely threatening monsters, renders this\n"
"even worse.\n"
msgstr ""
"看到有威胁的怪物会让你充满恐惧，\n"
"你的法术威力、近战和远程攻击杀怪物的能力都会受到削弱。\n"
"一次看到多个这样的怪物，或极其危险的怪物，会让情况变得更糟。\n"

#. key: disrupted magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:disrupted magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your chance to miscast spells is higher. Each level of this sacrifice increases\n"
"the chance to miscast further.\n"
msgstr ""
"你施法的失误几率会更高。这个舍弃每升一级，施法就越容易失误。\n"

#. key: unskilled mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:unskilled mutation"
msgid ""
"It takes you more experience to improve your skills. Each level of this\n"
"sacrifice makes your skills cost even more.\n"
msgstr ""
"你提升技能需要更多经验。这个舍弃每升一级，技能成本就会更高。\n"

#. key: reduced ac mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:reduced ac mutation"
msgid ""
"You are easily battered and bruised, reducing the benefits of your armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"你很容易受到创伤，你的防具的增益受到削弱。\n"

#. key: reduced ev mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:reduced ev mutation"
msgid ""
"Your reflexes are slow, making it easier for foes to hit you.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的反应很慢，敌人很容易攻击你。\n"

#. key: inexperienced mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:inexperienced mutation"
msgid ""
"You are inexperienced and unable to fully gain 27 levels.\n"
msgstr ""
"你缺乏经验，无法完全升到27级。\n"

#. key: missing an eye mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:missing an eye mutation"
msgid ""
"You are missing an eye, reducing the accuracy of your physical and magical\n"
"attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"你失去了一只眼睛，降低了你的物理和魔法攻击的命中率。\n"

#. key: no potions mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no potions mutation"
msgid ""
"You are unable to quaff potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法饮用药水。\n"

#. key: no weapons or thrown items mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no weapons or thrown items mutation"
msgid ""
"You are incapable of wielding weapons or throwing items.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法装备武器或投掷物品。\n"

#. key: no armour mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no armour mutation"
msgid ""
"You cannot wear armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法装备防具。\n"

#. key: inability to train dodging mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:inability to train dodging mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Dodging skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的闪避技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: inability to train armour mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:inability to train armour mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Armour skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的护甲技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no air magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no air magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Air Magic skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的气系魔法技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no conjurations magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no conjurations magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Conjurations skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的塑能技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no earth magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no earth magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Earth Magic skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的土系魔法技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no fire magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no fire magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Fire Magic skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的火系魔法技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no hexes magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no hexes magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Hexes skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的妖术技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no ice magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no ice magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Ice Magic skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的冰系魔法技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no necromancy magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no necromancy magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Necromancy skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的死灵术技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no alchemy magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no alchemy magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Alchemy skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的炼金术技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no summoning magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no summoning magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Summoning skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的召唤技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no translocations magic mutation
#: dat/descript/mutations.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no translocations magic mutation"
msgid ""
"Your Translocations skill is 0 and you cannot train the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的移位技能等级为0，你也无法训练它。\n"

#. key: no teleportation passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no teleportation passive"
msgid ""
"You cannot teleport or blink.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法传送或闪现。\n"

#. key: no spellcasting passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no spellcasting passive"
msgid ""
"You cannot cast spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"你无法施放法术。\n"

#. key: random rage passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:random rage passive"
msgid ""
"You have a chance of going berserk when you make a melee attack.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你近战攻击时，你有可能变得狂暴。\n"

#. key: corrode self passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corrode self passive"
msgid ""
"You have a chance of being corroded when you take damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你受到伤害时，你有可能会被腐蚀。\n"

#. key: slow self passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slow self passive"
msgid ""
"You have a chance of being slowed when you take damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你受到伤害时，你有可能会变慢。\n"

#. key: harm passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:harm passive"
msgid ""
"Any damage you deal or take is increased.\n"
msgstr ""
"你造成的和承受的伤害都有所增加。\n"

#. key: mayhem passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mayhem passive"
msgid ""
"You have a chance of causing visible monsters to go into a frenzy when you kill\n"
"a foe.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你杀死敌人时，有可能会让看得见的怪物变得疯狂。\n"

#. key: repel missiles passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:repel missiles passive"
msgid ""
"You repel missiles, improving your chance to evade them.\n"
msgstr ""
"你驱逐了飞弹，提升了躲开它们的几率。\n"

#. key: reflection passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:reflection passive"
msgid ""
"You reflect any successfully blocked ranged attacks back towards the attacker.\n"
msgstr ""
"你将被格挡的远程攻击，返给攻击者。\n"

#. key: acrobat passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:acrobat passive"
msgid ""
"Your evasion is increased while moving and waiting.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你移动和等待时，你的闪避有所提升。\n"

#. key: clarity passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:clarity passive"
msgid ""
"You are protected from involuntary confusion, rage, fear and mesmerisation.\n"
msgstr ""
"你受到保护，不会不由自主地混乱、狂暴、畏惧和迷惑。\n"

#. key: resist mutation passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:resist mutation passive"
msgid ""
"You are partially protected from mutation.\n"
msgstr ""
"你能抵抗部分变异。\n"

#. key: guardian spirit passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:guardian spirit passive"
msgid ""
"Any damage you take is divided between your reserves of health and magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"你受到的任何伤害，都会被生命和魔力储备分摊承受。\n"

#. key: rampage passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rampage passive"
msgid ""
"You take an additional free step when moving towards enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你向敌人移动时，你会获得额外的一个自由步。\n"

#. key: faith passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:faith passive"
msgid ""
"You gain divine favour quickly, and greater notice is taken of any religious\n"
"transgressions you make.\n"
msgstr ""
"神很快会眷顾你，但也会更容易察觉到你在信仰上的冒犯行为。\n"

#. key: wizardry passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wizardry passive"
msgid ""
"Your spell success rate is improved.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的法术成功率有所提升。\n"

#. key: archmagi passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:archmagi passive"
msgid ""
"Your spell power is increased.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的法力有所提升。\n"

#. key: channel magic passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:channel magic passive"
msgid ""
"You have a chance of regaining the magic spent when successfully casting a\n"
"spell, and always regain the magic spent when you miscast a spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你成功施法时，有可能重新获得施法时所消耗的魔力；\n"
"当你施法失败时，总是能重新获得所消耗的魔力。\n"

#. key: infuse magic passive
#: dat/descript/passives.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:infuse magic passive"
msgid ""
"You spend magic each time you make a melee attack, empowering your blows.\n"
msgstr ""
"你每次近战攻击时都会消耗魔力，让你的攻击更有力量。\n"

#. key: barachi
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:barachi"
msgid ""
"Barachim are slow-moving, amphibious humanoids who can hop long distances.\n"
"Their extended range of vision also allows them to be seen from further away.\n"
msgstr ""
"蛙人是移动缓慢的人形两栖生物，但可以跳得很远。\n"
"他们的视野更广，但别人也能从更远的地方看到他们。\n"

#. key: deep elf
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:deep elf"
msgid ""
"Deep Elves have a strong affinity for all kinds of magic, but are very fragile.\n"
"They regenerate magical power rapidly.\n"
msgstr ""
"地底精灵与各种魔法都很亲和，但却非常脆弱。\n"

#. key: demigod
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:demigod"
msgid ""
"Demigods refuse to worship any god, but make up for this with divine attributes\n"
"and high reserves of health and magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"半神拒绝崇拜任何神，但作为弥补，有着神圣属性、高生命值和高魔力值。\n"

#. key: demonspawn
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:demonspawn"
msgid ""
"Demonspawn are half human, half demon. They acquire strong demonic mutations as\n"
"they grow.\n"
msgstr ""
"魔人一半是人，一半是魔。随着他们的成长，他们可获得强大的魔性变异。\n"

#. key: djinni
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:djinni"
msgid ""
"Djinn are ever-burning spirits. They learn spells automatically as they grow,\n"
"and cast by drawing down their own fires.\n"
msgstr ""
"灯神是永远燃烧的灵体。\n"
"他们不需要书本，自身就能掌握咒语，通过汲取自己的火焰施展法术。\n"

#. key: draconian
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:draconian"
msgid ""
"Draconians are versatile hybrids. They mature when reaching level 7 and develop\n"
"a colour.\n"
msgstr ""
"龙人是多才多艺的种族。到达第7级时，他们会成长为有特殊颜色的龙人。\n"

#. key: formicid
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:formicid"
msgid ""
"Formicids are humanoid ants adept at digging. Their limbs are exceptionally\n"
"strong and they live in a state of permanent stasis.\n"
msgstr ""
"蚁人是人形蚂蚁，善于挖掘。他们四肢非常强壮，但他们却深扎于地面上。\n"

#. key: felid
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:felid"
msgid ""
"Felids are many-lived sentient cats. They cannot use armour or weapons.\n"
msgstr ""
"这种有意识的猫有好几条命。但它们无法使用防具或武器。\n"

#. key: gargoyle
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:gargoyle"
msgid ""
"Made of living stone, Gargoyles have a preternatural affinity for earth magic.\n"
"They have low health, but their stone bodies are incredibly tough.\n"
msgstr ""
"石像鬼由活性石头生成，与大地超乎寻常地亲近。\n"
"他们的生命值偏低，但石头身体非常坚硬。\n"

#. key: gnoll
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:gnoll"
msgid ""
"Gnolls are canine-like humanoids. They are unable to specialise in any single\n"
"skill, but instead gradually become proficient in all skills at once.\n"
msgstr ""
"豺狼人是犬类人形动物。他们无法专攻某一项技能，而是逐渐精通所有技能。\n"

#. key: human
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:human"
msgid ""
"Humans are natural explorers. Discovering new places refreshes and invigorates them.\n"
"They are otherwise completely average.\n"
msgstr ""
"人类是天生的探险家。发现新的地方会让他们精神焕发。但他们在其他方面就非常普通。\n"

#. key: tengu
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:tengu"
msgid ""
"Tengu are bird-people who love to fight, both with weapons and spells. They are\n"
"fragile but agile, and eventually learn to fly.\n"
msgstr ""
"天狗是鸟人，喜欢飞翔，以及武器和魔法。他们脆弱但敏捷，最终能掌握飞行能力。\n"

#. key: kobold
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:kobold"
msgid ""
"Kobolds are attuned to the shadows and can only see or be seen at a close range.\n"
"They are small and a little fragile, and are talented in most skills.\n"
msgstr ""
"狗头人适应了阴影，只能在近距离内看到或被看到。\n"
"他们体形小且有点脆弱，但在大多数技能上很有天赋。\n"

#. key: merfolk
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:merfolk"
msgid ""
"Half fish, half human, Merfolk are citizens of both water and land. They are\n"
"strong combatants, and adept at using magic to assist in battle.\n"
msgstr ""
"半鱼半人，鱼人是水陆两栖的住民。\n"
"他们是强大的战士，也擅长使用魔法来帮助作战。\n"

#. key: minotaur
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:minotaur"
msgid ""
"Minotaurs are large muscular humans with bovine heads. They excel at all forms\n"
"of close and ranged combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"牛头人是体形庞大、肌肉发达的人形生物，长有一颗牛头。\n"
"他们擅长各种形式的近程和远程战斗。\n"

#. key: mummy
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:mummy"
msgid ""
"Compelled to walk by an ancient curse, Mummies have innate faith and are adept\n"
"at Necromancy, but learn other skills very slowly. They cannot drink potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"木乃伊受古老的诅咒驱使，有着与生俱来的信仰，\n"
"擅长死灵术，但学习其他技能的速度很慢。他们无法饮用药水。\n"

#. key: naga
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:naga"
msgid ""
"Nagas are hybrids: human from the waist up, with a snake-like tail instead of\n"
"legs. They move very slowly but are naturally resilient.\n"
msgstr ""
"纳迦是混种生物，其腰部以上是人类，下面是一条蛇尾，而不是腿。\n"
"他们移动速度很慢，但却很坚韧。\n"

#. key: octopode
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:octopode"
msgid ""
"Octopodes are a species of amphibious cephalopods. They can wear eight rings,\n"
"but almost no armour fits them.\n"
msgstr ""
"章鱼是水陆两栖的头足类生物。\n"
"他们可以戴八枚戒指，但几乎没有适合他们体形的护甲。\n"

#. key: oni
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:oni"
msgid ""
"Large, robust, and extremely fond of drinking, Oni make capable brawlers and\n"
"spellcasters and gain extra benefits from healing potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"鬼体形硕大、结实，非常喜欢饮酒，\n"
"他们能够成为出色的打手和施法者，并能从治疗药水中获得更多增益。\n"

#. key: spriggan
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:spriggan"
msgid ""
"Very small, very frail and very fast, Spriggans are highly competent stabbers\n"
"and spellcasters.\n"
msgstr ""
"树精体形很小、相当脆弱，但速度非常快，他们在刺杀和魔法方面很有天赋。\n"

#. key: troll
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:troll"
msgid ""
"Trolls are monstrous creatures with powerful claws. They regenerate health\n"
"rapidly.\n"
msgstr ""
"巨魔是有着强大爪子的怪物。他们能快速恢复健康。\n"

#. key: vine stalker
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:vine stalker"
msgid ""
"Frail symbionts, Vine Stalkers cannot regain health from potions. Their magical\n"
"reserves absorb damage, and they pack a magic-restoring bite.\n"
msgstr ""
"藤蔓人是脆弱的共生生物，无法通过药水恢复健康。\n"
"其魔力储备可以用来抵消伤害，并能通过撕咬敌人回复魔力。\n"

#. key: air elementalist
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:air elementalist"
msgid ""
"Air Elementalists have learned the Shock spell. Their electrical magic can harm\n"
"groups of foes, while their air spells assist in fighting or fleeing enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"气元素使在开局就掌握着电击法术。此后，他们会运用气系魔法灵活地生存立足。\n"

#. key: artificer
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:artificer"
msgid ""
"Artificers start with a few magic wands and a club. They'll need to find better\n"
"weapons and armour before their wands run out.\n"
msgstr ""
"技师在开局会带着一些魔杖和一个棍棒。\n"
"他们需要在魔杖的能量用光之前，找到更好的武器和防具。\n"

#. key: berserker
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:berserker"
msgid ""
"Berserkers believe in Trog, the magic-hating god of frenzy. Not much can stop a\n"
"raging berserker early on, apart from hubris.\n"
msgstr ""
"狂战士追随着仇恨魔法的狂暴之神特洛戈。\n"
"除了骄傲自满之外，早期几乎没有什么东西抵挡得了一个狂暴的狂战士。\n"

#. key: brigand
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:brigand"
msgid ""
"Brigands carry poisoned darts and a small number of nasty curare darts.\n"
msgstr ""
"强盗携带着有毒的飞镖，其中一些还涂有有令人厌恶的箭毒。\n"

#. key: chaos knight
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:chaos knight"
msgid ""
"Chaos Knights are playthings of the unpredictable Xom, and are subject to the\n"
"god's constantly changing moods.\n"
msgstr ""
"混沌骑士是无常之主佐姆手中的玩物，受尽了佐姆那阴晴不定的情绪的摆布。\n"

#. key: cinder acolyte
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:cinder acolyte"
msgid ""
"Cinder Acolytes worship Ignis, drawing upon the flame of a dying god until\n"
"there is nothing left. They have both melee and fire magic capabilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"余烬侍僧追随着伊格尼斯，汲取着那位濒死之神的火焰，直到什么都不剩。\n"

#. key: conjurer
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:conjurer"
msgid ""
"Conjurers begin with the Magic Dart spell, and can learn other non-elemental\n"
"spells to reliably blast their foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"塑能师会运用攻击魔法来解决问题。\n"

#. key: delver
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:delver"
msgid ""
"Delvers start their quest five levels below the surface. A set of powerful magic\n"
"items helps them survive the dangerous journey upward.\n"
msgstr ""
"挖掘者从地下五层开始探索。\n"
"所携带的成套强大的魔法道具能助力他们度过危险的上升之旅。\n"

#. key: earth elementalist
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:earth elementalist"
msgid ""
"Earth Elementalists know the Sandblast spell, and can later learn more earthen\n"
"spells suitable for subtle stabbing or brute-force blasting.\n"
msgstr ""
"土元素使掌握着沙爆术，此后还可以学习更多用于微妙刺击或蛮力爆破的土系魔法。\n"

#. key: enchanter
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:enchanter"
msgid ""
"Enchanters know a variety of Hexes that can incapacitate their foes, and are\n"
"equipped with an enchanted dagger and potions of invisibility.\n"
msgstr ""
"附魔师掌握各种可以使敌人丧失行动能力的妖术，\n"
"并装备着一把有着附魔的匕首和隐形药水。\n"

#. key: fighter
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:fighter"
msgid ""
"Fighters are equipped with armour and shield, as well as a weapon of their\n"
"choice and potions of might.\n"
msgstr ""
"战士配备着铠甲、盾牌、一瓶力量药水，还有一把自己选择的武器。\n"

#. key: fire elementalist
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:fire elementalist"
msgid ""
"Fire Elementalists have learned the Foxfire spell. Their other starting spells\n"
"are likewise focused on fiery and explosive destruction.\n"
msgstr ""
"火元素使在开局就掌握着狐火法术。他们的其他起始法术同样致力于燃烧毁灭。\n"

#. key: gladiator
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:gladiator"
msgid ""
"Gladiators are ready for the arena with light armour, a weapon of their choice,\n"
"and a few throwing weapons and nets.\n"
msgstr ""
"角斗士已准备好进入角斗场，配备着轻甲、一些投掷网，还有一把自己选择的武器。\n"

#. key: hedge wizard
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:hedge wizard"
msgid ""
"Hedge Wizards are magic generalists, good at using a wide variety of tools to\n"
"frustrate their foes and gain an edge in the battlefield.\n"
msgstr ""
"卑劣巫师掌握着许多用以背刺或逃离被迷惑的敌人的小魔法。\n"

#. key: hunter
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:hunter"
msgid ""
"Hunters carry a shortbow, light armour and a scroll of butterflies.\n"
msgstr ""
"猎手带有短弓、轻甲和一张蝴蝶卷轴。\n"

#. key: hexslinger
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:hexslinger"
msgid ""
"Hexslingers carry a sling, and use hex magic to make their foes more vulnerable\n"
"to attacks from afar.\n"
msgstr ""
"妖术投手带着一个投石索，并使用妖术使敌人更易于受到远程攻击。\n"

#. key: ice elementalist
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:ice elementalist"
msgid ""
"Ice Elementalists begin with the Freeze spell. Their later spells provide strong\n"
"offence and defence, but may restrict their movement.\n"
msgstr ""
"冰元素使在开局就掌握着冰冻法术。他们的起始库中的法术非常多样。\n"

#. key: monk
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:monk"
msgid ""
"Monks start with a simple weapon of their choice, an orb of light, and a potion\n"
"of divine ambrosia, and gain additional piety with the first god they worship.\n"
msgstr ""
"武僧带着所选的一把简陋的武器、一个光亮水晶球和一瓶神圣的琼浆药水，\n"
"还能从所皈依的第一位神那里获得更多的虔诚值。\n"

#. key: necromancer
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:necromancer"
msgid ""
"Necromancers start out with the Soul Splinter spell. Eventually, they can turn\n"
"the dead into allies and use the life force of the living to restore themselves.\n"
msgstr ""
"死灵法师专精于死亡魔法。他们在开局就可以使用死灵化法术。\n"

#. key: reaver
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:reaver"
msgid ""
"Reavers start with a weapon of their choice and deadly magic to supplement it\n"
"when in need. They start with the Kiss of Death spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"掠夺者带有所选的一把的武器和致命的魔法，以应不时之需。\n"
"他们在开局就可以使用死亡之吻法术。\n"

#. key: summoner
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:summoner"
msgid ""
"Summoners are able to cast Summon Small Mammal from the start, and begin with\n"
"spells to summon stronger and more exotic allies in their library.\n"
msgstr ""
"召唤师在开局就能施放召唤小动物法术，他的库中还有其他召唤术。\n"

#. key: shapeshifter
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:shapeshifter"
msgid ""
"Shapeshifters use talismans to shift their form, making them powerful melee\n"
"fighters (especially when unarmed) at the cost of armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"变形人使用符咒来改变自身形态，以牺牲防具为代价，\n"
"成为强大的近战战士（特别是在徒手的情况下）。\n"

#. key: alchemist
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:alchemist"
msgid ""
"Alchemists start with the Poisonous Vapours spell, and their magic is very\n"
"effective against foes susceptible to poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"炼金术士在开局就可以使用毒刺法术，其毒系魔法对易感目标十分有效。\n"

#. key: wanderer
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:wanderer"
msgid ""
"Wanderers start with random equipment and skills.\n"
msgstr ""
"漫游者的开局装备和技能是随机的。\n"

#. key: warper
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:warper"
msgid ""
"Warpers start with a weapon of their choice, a scroll of blinking, darts of\n"
"disjunction, and some Translocation spells in their library.\n"
msgstr ""
"在开局，折跃者会带有所选的一把武器、一张闪现卷轴、附着驱散印记的飞镖，\n"
"库中还有一些移位法术。\n"

#. key: pick-up
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:pick-up"
msgid ""
"                   <h>Picking up and dropping items</h>\n"
"\n"
"<h>Navigation and selecting items</h>\n"
"Use the usual navigation keys (<w>arrow</w> keys, <w>pgdn</w>/<w>pgup</w>, <w>home</w>, <w>end</w>) to select\n"
"items, and <w>Space</w>/<w>.</w> to toggle whether the selected item will be picked up or\n"
"dropped. Pressing an item's letter key will also toggle its pickup/drop state.\n"
"Gear, potions, scrolls, and evocable items are on separate pages which can be\n"
"switched between by <w>left arrow</w> and <w>right arrow</w> or <w>Tab</w> and <w>Shift-Tab</w>.\n"
"Press <w>Return</w> to accept the current set of items.\n"
"\n"
"Entering a number before selecting by letter will toggle just that quantity of\n"
"a stack of items.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Regular expressions</h>\n"
"You can press <w>Ctrl-F</w> to enter a word (or a regular expression). All matching\n"
"items will be selected.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Category shortcuts</h>\n"
"You can quickly select items by type by pressing:\n"
"<w>!</w>   potions      <w>(</w>   weapons        <w>)</w>   ammunition      <w>[</w>   armour\n"
"<w>/</w>   wands        <w>|</w>   magical staves <w>?</w>   scrolls         <w>:</w>   books\n"
"<w>\"</w>   amulets      <w>=</w>   rings          <w>}</w>   miscellaneous\n"
"Global selects:  <w>,</w>   select all     <w>*</w>   invert all      <w>-</w>   deselect all\n"
"                 <w>;</w>   select last unequipped\n"
"Note that for dropping, the <w>,</w> command uses the <w>drop_filter</w> option, which\n"
"narrows the range of items to be (de)selected. The default is all useless items.\n"
msgstr ""
"                   <h>拾取和丢弃物品</h>\n"
"\n"
"<h>定位和选择物品</h>\n"
"使用通常的定位键（<w>方向</w>键，<w>pgdn</w>/<w>pgup</w>、<w>home</w>、<w>end</w>）选择物品，\n"
"使用<w>空格</w>/<w>.</w>切换所选物品的拾取或丢弃状态。\n"
"按下物品的字母键也将切换其拾取/丢弃状态。\n"
"按<w>回车</w>选取当前所有物品。\n"
"\n"
"在按字母选择物品之前输入数字，可以指定要操作的那堆物品的数量。\n"
"\n"
"<h>正规表示式</h>\n"
"你可以按<w>Ctrl-F</w>输入一个单词（或一个正则表达式）。\n"
"所匹配的物品都会被选定。\n"
"\n"
"<h>各类物品的快捷键</h>\n"
"你可以按以下键快速选择某类物品：\n"
"<w>!</w>   药水      <w>(</w>   武器        <w>)</w>   弹药      <w>[</w>   防具\n"
"<w>/</w>   魔杖      <w>|</w>   法杖        <w>?</w>   卷轴      <w>:</w>   书\n"
"<w>\"</w>   护身符    <w>=</w>   戒指        <w>}</w>   杂项\n"
"全局选择：<w>,</w>   全选     <w>*</w>   反选      <w>-</w>   取消全选\n"
"          <w>;</w>   选择最后一个未装备的\n"
"请注意，对于丢弃，<w>,</w>命令使用了<w>drop_filter</w>选项，\n"
"那会缩小（取消）选择物品的范围。默认为所有无用物品。\n"
"\n"
"<h>通过丢弃菜单禁用自动拾取</h>\n"
"在丢弃菜单上，按<w>\\</w>后选择的物品会被标记为<w>*</w>，\n"
"而不是通常的<w>+</w>。\n"
"当你离开这个菜单后，这些物品不会再被自动拾取。\n"
"要返回正常选择模式，请再次按<w>\\</w>。\n"

#. key: known-menu
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:known-menu"
msgid ""
"                   <h>Known items menu</h>\n"
"\n"
"<h>Navigation and selecting items</h>\n"
"Use the usual navigation keys (<w>arrow</w> keys, <w>pgdn</w>/<w>pgup</w>, <w>home</w>, <w>end</w>) to select\n"
"items, and <w>Space</w>/<w>.</w> to toggle the autopickup mode for the selected item type.\n"
"Pressing an item type's letter key will also toggle its autopickup state.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Selecting item types</h>\n"
"Item types displayed in grey use the default autopickup options set in your\n"
"configuration file. (Items that are useless to your character are displayed\n"
"in <darkgrey>dark grey</darkgrey>.) Selecting a type of item overrides those options\n"
"(indicated by <w>white</w> text), and toggles the item between the states:\n"
" <w>+</w>  Items of this type will be picked up automatically.\n"
" <w>-</w>  Items of this type will not be picked up automatically.\n"
"Autopickup can also be toggled for all unknown items of a given category.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Category shortcuts</h>\n"
"You can quickly select all item types in a given category by pressing:\n"
"<w>!</w>   potions      <w>?</w>   scrolls      <w>(</w>   ammunition        <w>\"</w>   amulets\n"
"<w>=</w>   rings        <w>/</w>   wands        <w>|</w>   magical staves\n"
"Global selects:  <w>*</w>   invert all   <w>^</w>   reset all to default\n"
"\n"
"<h>Viewing unknown and known items</h>\n"
"<w>\\</w> and <w>-</w> toggle between the known and unknown items menus. Note\n"
"that none of the above features are available from the unknown items menu.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Restoring autopickup defaults</h>\n"
"Pressing <w>Ctrl-D</w> followed by an item letter or a category shortcut\n"
"cancels the override and restores the selected item or items to their default\n"
"settings.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Regular expressions</h>\n"
"You can press <w>Ctrl-F</w> to enter a word (or a regular expression).\n"
"All matching items will be selected.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"                   <h>已知物品菜单</h>\n"
"\n"
"<h>定位和选择物品</h>\n"
"使用通常的定位键（<w>方向</w>键、<w>pgdn</w>/<w>pgup</w>、<w>home</w>、<w>end</w>）选择物品，\n"
"使用<w>空格</w>/<w>.</w>切换所选物品的自动拾取状态。\n"
"按下物品各类的字符键也将切换其自动拾取状态。\n"
"\n"
"<h>选择物品种类</h>\n"
"以灰色显示的物品类型会采用配置文件中设定的默认自动拾取选项。\n"
"（对你的角色无用的物品会以<darkgrey>深灰色</darkgrey>显示。）\n"
"选定一类物品后会覆盖这些选项（以<w>白色</w>文本显示），切换物品为以下状态：\n"
" <w>+</w>  将自动拾取此类物品。\n"
" <w>-</w>  将不再自动拾取此粝物品。\n"
"还可以设定自动拾取所有未知物品。\n"
"\n"
"<h>各类物品的快捷键</h>\n"
"你可以按以下键快速选择某类物品：\n"
"<w>!</w>   药水      <w>?</w>   卷轴      <w>(</w>   弹药        <w>\"</w>   护身符\n"
"<w>=</w>   戒指      <w>/</w>   魔杖      <w>|</w>   法杖\n"
"全局选择：<w>*</w>   反选   <w>^</w>   全部重置为默认状态\n"
"\n"
"<h>查看未知和已知物品</h>\n"
"按<w>\\</w>和<w>-</w>切换已知和未知物品菜单。\n"
"请注意，未知物品菜单中没有上述功能。\n"
"\n"
"<h>将自动拾取重置为默认设定</h>\n"
"按<w>Ctrl-D</w>然后按物品字母或类别快捷键，会将所选物品重置为默认设定。\n"
"\n"
"<h>正规表示式</h>\n"
"你可以按<w>Ctrl-F</w>输入一个单词（或一个正则表达式）。\n"
"所匹配的物品都会被选定。\n"
"\n"

#. key: stash-search.prompt
#. Preserve @marker@ substitutions exactly.
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:stash-search.prompt"
msgid ""
"<h>Searching the stash-tracker</h>\n"
"\n"
"You can search for items and dungeon features by name (or a substring of the\n"
"name). In the list of search results, you can select a search result by its\n"
"hotkey to travel to its location.\n"
"\n"
"Some examples of search strings:\n"
"<w>mutation</w>      find all potions of mutation, including potions in shops.\n"
"<w>throwing net</w>  finds every single throwing net and piles of nets.\n"
"<w>shop</w>          lists all shops. Press <w>!</w> and a shop's letter for the stock.\n"
"<w>Lair:2</w>        find everything known to be on Lair:2.\n"
"<w>/D:[2-4]</w>      finds everything on Dungeon levels 2-4. Regexes are allowed!\n"
"              Note that /D:[3-10] will not work as intended, since [x-y] is a\n"
"              regex character range.\n"
"<w>rPois</w>         finds all items with an rPois resistance.\n"
"<w>rC++</w>          finds all items with an rC++ resistance.\n"
"<w>+3</w>            finds all items with a +3 enchantment.\n"
"<w>/Lair.*axe</w> and <w>axe && Lair</w> both show all axes in the Lair.\n"
"\n"
"Some shortcuts:\n"
"<w>.</w>             lists everything on your current level.\n"
"<w>..</w>            lists all items you know.\n"
"<w>0</w> to <w>9</w>        lists all items at the specified waypoint.\n"
"<w>*</w>             lists all items at all waypoints.\n"
"<w>@<<query></w>      lists everything matching <<query> on your current level.\n"
"<w>/<<regex></w>      lists items matching <<regex> as a regular expression.\n"
"<w>=<<string></w>     lists items containing <<string> as a substring.\n"
"\n"
"You can also examine shops and items in the search results by pressing <w>?</w> and\n"
"then selecting the hotkey for the search result. This will give a description\n"
"of the item or the contents of the shop.\n"
"\n"
"The stash search string is case-insensitive.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Searching by item properties:</h>\n"
"\n"
"You can search for spell names (such as <w>Ignite Poison</w>) to find spellbooks\n"
"that contain the spell.\n"
"\n"
"You can search for artefact item properties (such as <w>/prevents.*teleport</w>)\n"
"to find artefacts that have the property.\n"
"\n"
"You can search by some additional item properties: <w>artefact</w> or\n"
"<w>artifact</w> will find identified artefacts, <w>ego</w> or <w>branded</w>\n"
"will find non-artefacts with a brand and unidentified items which may be\n"
"branded, <w>throwable</w> will find things you can throw, <w>dropped</w> will\n"
"find items you have dropped, <w>in_shop</w> will find items in shops, and (if\n"
"the autopickup_search option is enabled) <w>autopickup</w> will find items that\n"
"would be automatically picked up.\n"
"\n"
"Skill names (such as <w>Polearms</w> or <w>Long Blades</w>) will find all weapons that\n"
"train that skill. You can also look for <w>melee weapon</w> and <w>ranged weapon</w>.\n"
"\n"
"You can also search by item types such as <w>book</w> or <w>manual</w> or <w>jewellery</w>.\n"
"For armour slots, use <w>helmet</w> (all headgear), <w>gloves</w>, <w>shield</w>, and <w>body</w>.\n"
"Use <w>armour && !!body</w> to list all armour pieces except for body armour.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Finding Dungeon Features:</h>\n"
"\n"
"You can search for dungeon features by name: all shops will be found by a search\n"
"for <w>shop</w> (including shops that do not have \"shop\" in their name); other\n"
"dungeon features can also be found by name: <w>dispersal trap</w>, <w>altar</w>,\n"
"etc. You can also search for altars by deity name: <w>Zin</w>.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Non-regex operators:</h>\n"
"\n"
"You can use !! to negate a search string, && for a boolean AND, || for\n"
"boolean OR, and <<<< >> for grouping.\n"
"\n"
"For instance, to find rings (jewellery) but not ring mail you could use:\n"
"<w>ring && !!mail</w>\n"
"\n"
"Note that <w>/</w> and <w>=</w> apply to individual patterns, not the entire query:\n"
"you should search for <w>armour && /r(C|F|Pois|Elec)</w>, not\n"
"<w>/armour && r(C|F|Pois|Elec)</w>.\n"
msgstr ""
"<h>追踪</h>\n"
"\n"
"你可以按名称（或被包含在名称中的子字符串）搜索物品和地牢地标。\n"
"在搜索结果列表中，你可以通过热键选择一个搜索结果以移动到其位置。\n"
"\n"
"搜索字符串的一些示例：\n"
"<w>mutation</w>      找出所有的变异药水，包括在商店中的。\n"
"<w>throwing net</w>  找出单独的一个或堆叠的投掷网。\n"
"<w>shop</w>          列出所有商店。按<w>?</w>以及一个商店的库存的字母。\n"
"<w>Lair:2</w>        找出所有位于兽穴：2的已知东西。\n"
"<w>/D:[2-4]</w>      找出所有位于地牢第2-4层的东西。可以使用正则表达式！\n"
"              注意，/D:[3-10]将无法按预期运作，因为[x-y]是一个\n"
"              正则表达式的字符范围。\n"
"<w>rPois</w>         找出所有具有rPois抗性的物品。\n"
"<w>rC++</w>          找出所有具有rC++抗性的物品。\n"
"<w>+3</w>            找出所有具有+3附魔的物品。\n"
"<w>/Lair.*axe</w>和<w>axe && Lair</w>都能显示所有位于兽穴的斧子。\n"
"\n"
"一些快捷键：\n"
"<w>.</w>             列出当前层的所有东西。\n"
"<w>..</w>            列出已知的所有物品。\n"
"<w>0</w> to <w>9</w>        列出指定导航点上的所有物品。\n"
"<w>*</w>             列出所有导航点上的所有物品。\n"
"<w>@<<query></w>      列出当前层上所有匹配<<query>的东西。\n"
"<w>/<<regex></w>      列出匹配<<regex>这一正则表达式的物品。\n"
"<w>=<<string></w>     列出所有包含<<string>这一子字符串的物品。\n"
"\n"
"你也可以在搜索结果中按<w>?</w>查看商店和物品，并在搜索结果中用热键进行选择。\n"
"这会给出物品或商店内容的描述。\n"
"\n"
"按字符串搜索时不区分大小写。\n"
"\n"
"<h>按照物品属性进行搜索：</h>\n"
"\n"
"你可以搜索法术名称（如<w>Ignite Poison</w>）以寻找包含这道法术的魔法书。\n"
"\n"
"你可以搜索神器的属性（如<w>/prevents.*teleport</w>）以寻找具有这项属性的神器。\n"
"\n"
"你还可以按物品的某些附加属性搜索：\n"
"<w>artefact</w>或<w>artifact</w>会寻找所有鉴别出的神器；<w>ego</w>或<w>branded</w>\n"
"会寻找具有印记的非神器和可能具有印记的未鉴定物品；\n"
"<w>throwable</w>会寻找所有可投掷的物品；\n"
"<w>dropped</w>会寻找所有丢弃过的物品；\n"
"<w>in_shop</w>会寻找所有在商店中的物品；\n"
"而（如果autopickup_search选项是开启的）<w>autopickup</w>\n"
"会寻找能被自动拾取的物品。\n"
"\n"
"技能名（如<w>Polearms</w>或<w>Long Blades</w>）会寻找所有训练该技能的武器。\n"
"你也可以搜寻<w>melee weapon</w>和<w>ranged weapon</w>。\n"
"\n"
"你也可以按物品类型搜索，如<w>book</w>或<w>manual</w>或<w>jewellery</w>。\n"
"对于各部位的防具，\n"
"使用<w>helmet</w>（所有帽子）<w>gloves</w>、<w>shield</w>、和<w>body</w>。\n"
"使用<w>armour && !!body</w>会列出除了铠甲以外的所有防具。\n"
"\n"
"<h>寻找地牢地标：</h>\n"
"\n"
"你可以按名称搜索地牢地标：\n"
"可以通过<w>shop</w>寻找所有商店（包含那些名字中不含“shop”的商店；\n"
"其他地牢地标也可以按名称搜寻：<w>dispersal trap</w>、<w>altar</w>，等等。\n"
"你也可以按照神的名字搜索祭坛：<w>Zin</w>。\n"
"\n"
"<h>非正则表达式操作符：</h>\n"
"\n"
"你可以使用！！\n"
"为了在搜索字符串时进行限定，&&表示逻辑与；||表示逻辑或；而<<<< >>则用以分组。\n"
"\n"
"例如，要寻找戒指（首饰），而不是连环甲，可以用：<w>ring && !!mail</w>。\n"
"\n"
"请注意，<w>/</w>和<w>=</w>适用于单个模式，而不是整体：\n"
"你应该搜索<w>armour && /r(C|F|Pois|Elec)</w>\n"
"而不是<w>/armour && r(C|F|Pois|Elec)</w>。\n"

#. key: level-map
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#. Preserve @marker@ substitutions exactly.
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:level-map"
msgid ""
"<h>Level Map ('<w>X</w>' in the main screen):</h>\n"
"<w>Esc</w>        : Leave level map (also <w>Space</w> or any unused key).\n"
"<w>Dir.</w>       : Move the cursor.\n"
"<w>Shift-Dir.</w> : Move the cursor in larger steps (7 by default).\n"
"<w>-</w> or <w>+</w>     : Scroll level map 20 grids up or down.\n"
"<w>.</w>          : Start travel (also <w>Enter</w> and <w>,</w> and <w>;</w>).\n"
"             (Moves cursor to the last travel destination if still on @.)\n"
"<w>[</w> or <w>]</w>     : Examine the next higher or lower level.\n"
"             (Moves cursor to the staircase destination if a known staircase is\n"
"             highlighted.)\n"
"<w>G</w>          : View another level by choosing a branch and depth.\n"
"<w>o</w>          : Move the cursor to the next autoexplore target.\n"
"<w>{</w> or <w>}</w>     : Zoom out or in (tiles only).\n"
"\n"
"<h>Travel exclusions</h>\n"
"<w>e</w>          : Create a travel exclusion, change its radius, or remove it.\n"
"<w>R#</w>         : Create a travel exclusion with a specified radius or change\n"
"             its radius to #, where # is a number from 1 to 8.\n"
"<w>E</w>          : Cycle through travel exclusions.\n"
"<w>Ctrl-E</w>     : Erase all travel exclusions on the level.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Waypoints</h>\n"
"<w>w</w>          : Set waypoint to current position.\n"
"<w>W</w>          : Cycle through all waypoints on the level.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Cycle through features</h>\n"
"<w><<</w> or <w>></w>     : Cycle through up or down stairs.\n"
"<w>^</w>          : Cycle through traps.\n"
"<w>\\</w> or <w>Tab</w>   : Cycle through shops and portals.\n"
"<w>I</w>          : Cycle forward through all items.\n"
"<w>O</w>          : Cycle backward through all items.\n"
"<w>_</w>          : Cycle through altars.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Other</h>\n"
"<w>v</w>          : Examine the last remembered state of the indicated tile.\n"
"<w>!</w>          : Annotate level.\n"
"<w>Ctrl-C</w>     : Clear monster memory.\n"
"<w>Ctrl-F</w>     : Forget level map.\n"
"<w>Ctrl-U</w>     : Restore forgotten level map.{{\n"
"if you.wizard() then\n"
"    return \"\\n\\n\"\n"
"          .. \"<h>Wizard commands</h>\\n\"\n"
"          .. \"<w>T</w>          : Teleport to cursor.\\n\"\n"
"          .. \"<w>Ctrl-X</w>     : Completely wipe out map.\"\n"
"end }}\n"
msgstr ""
"<h>楼层地图（在主界面中按“<w>X</w>”）：</h>\n"
"<w>Esc</w>        ：离开楼层地图（也可以使用<w>空格</w>或其他未被占用的键）。\n"
"<w>方向</w>       ：移动光标。\n"
"<w>Shift-方向键</w> ：以更大的步长移动光标（默认为7）。\n"
"<w>-</w>或<w>+</w>  ：向上或向下滚动20个网格。\n"
"<w>.</w>          ：开始移动（也可以用<w>Enter</w>、<w>,</w>和<w>;</w>）。\n"
"             （如果仍在@上，则将光标移动到最后一次移动目的地。）\n"
"<w>[</w> or <w>]</w>     ：查看更高或更低的一个楼层。\n"
"             （将光标移动到楼梯，如果有已知的楼梯被高亮显示的话。）\n"
"<w>G</w>          ：设定分支和深度，显示另一个楼层。\n"
"<w>o</w>          ：将光标移动到下一个自动探索目标。\n"
"<w>{</w>或<w>}</w>     ：缩放（只适用于贴图版）。\n"
"\n"
"<h>移动禁区</h>\n"
"<w>e</w>          ：创建一个移动禁区，可以改变它的半径，或是移除它。\n"
"<w>R#</w>         ：创建一个具有特定半径的移动禁区，或是将其半径调整为#，\n"
"                    #为1到8的数字。\n"
"<w>E</w>          ：循环显示移动禁区。\n"
"<w>Ctrl-E</w>     ：清除本层的所有移动禁区。\n"
"\n"
"<h>导航点</h>\n"
"<w>W</w>          ：在当前位置创建导航点。\n"
"<w>W</w>          ：循环显示本层的导航点。\n"
"\n"
"<h>循环显示地标</h>\n"
"<w><<</w> or <w>></w>     ：循环显示上楼或下楼楼梯。\n"
"<w>^</w>          ：循环显示陷阱。\n"
"<w>\\</w>或<w>Tab</w>   ：循环显示商店和门户。\n"
"<w>I</w>          ：循环正向显示所有物品。\n"
"<w>O</w>          ：循环反向显示所有物品。\n"
"<w>_</w>          ：循环显示祭坛。\n"
"\n"
"<h>其他</h>\n"
"<w>v</w>          ：查看所示贴图的上次记录状态。\n"
"<w>!</w>          ：注释楼层。\n"
"<w>Ctrl-C</w>     ：清除怪物记录。\n"
"<w>Ctrl-F</w>     ：忘记楼层地图。\n"
"<w>Ctrl-U</w>     ：恢复被遗忘的楼层地图{{\n"
"if you.wizard() then\n"
"    return \"\\n\\n\"\n"
"          .. \"<h>向导模式命令</h>\\n\"\n"
"          .. \"<w>T</w>          ：传送到光标处。\\n\"\n"
"          .. \"<w>Ctrl-X</w>     ：完全擦除地图\"\n"
"end }}\n"

#. key: interlevel-travel.branch.prompt
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:interlevel-travel.branch.prompt"
msgid ""
"<h>Interlevel Travel (choose a branch):\n"
" Use the shortcut letter for a branch to select the branch for travel.\n"
"\n"
" Once you select a branch, you will be prompted for a depth in that\n"
" branch (more help is available there).\n"
"\n"
" <w>Tab</w>    : Repeat last interlevel travel.\n"
" <w>.</w>      : Travel to a level in the current branch.\n"
" <w><<</w>      : Go up the nearest stairs.\n"
" <w>></w>      : Go down the nearest stairs.\n"
" <w>Ctrl-P</w> : Travel to a level in the branch above this one.\n"
" <w>*</w>      : Show available waypoints (if any are set).\n"
" <w>0</w>-<w>9</w>    : Go to the numbered waypoint.\n"
" <w>_</w>      : Show available altars (if any are discovered).\n"
msgstr ""
"<h>跨层移动（选择分支）：\n"
" 使用分支的快捷键以移动到相应分支。\n"
"\n"
" 选择分支后，系统将提示你输入该分支的深度（这里有更多帮助）。\n"
"\n"
" <w>Tab</w>    ：重复上一次的跨层移动。\n"
" <w>.</w>      ：移动到当前分支的另一楼层。\n"
" <w><<</w>     ：上最近的楼梯。\n"
" <w>></w>      ：下最近的楼梯。\n"
" <w>Ctrl-P</w> ：移动到当前分支的上一楼层。\n"
" <w>*</w>      ：显示所有可用导航点（如有设置）。\n"
" <w>0</w>-<w>9</w>    ：移动到有编号的导航点。\n"
" <w>_</w>      ：显示可用祭坛（如有发现）。\n"

#. key: interlevel-travel.depth.prompt
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:interlevel-travel.depth.prompt"
msgid ""
"<h>Interlevel Travel (go to a specific level in the selected branch)\n"
" Type in the level number you want to go to and press Enter, or use:\n"
" <w>Enter</w>  : Go to the default level.\n"
" <w>0</w>      : Go to the entrance to the current branch.\n"
" <w><<</w>      : Change the default to one level above the current.\n"
" <w>></w>      : Change default to one level below the current.\n"
" <w>-</w> or <w>p</w> : Change default to the branch above this one.\n"
" <w>$</w>      : Change default to deepest visited level in this branch.\n"
" <w>^</w>      : Change default to the entrance to the current branch.\n"
msgstr ""
"<h>跨层移动（移动到所选分支的某一楼层）\n"
" 键入要前往的楼层数，然后按Enter键，或使用：\n"
" <w>Enter</w>  ：移动到默认楼层。\n"
" <w>0</w>      ：移动到当前分支的入口。\n"
" <w><<</w>      ：将默认值改为当前层的上一楼层。\n"
" <w>></w>      ：将默认值改为当前层的下一楼层。\n"
" <w>-</w>或<w>p</w> ：将默认值改为当前分支的上一楼层。\n"
" <w>$</w>      ：将默认值改为在当前分支中探索过的最深楼层。\n"
" <w>^</w>      ：将默认值改为当前分支的入口。\n"

#. key: interlevel-travel.altar.prompt
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:interlevel-travel.altar.prompt"
msgid ""
"<h>Interlevel Travel (go to an altar):\n"
" Use the shortcut letter (the initial of a god, with TSO being replaced by 1)\n"
" to select the altar for travel.\n"
"\n"
" Once you select a god, you will begin travelling to the nearst altar.\n"
"\n"
" <w>Enter</w>  : Repeat last interlevel travel.\n"
msgstr ""
"<h>跨层移动（移动到某一祭坛）：\n"
" 使用快捷键（神的首字母，光明神替换为1）\n"
" 前往选择的祭坛。\n"
"\n"
" 一旦你选择了一位神，你将开始前往最近的祂的祭坛。\n"
"\n"
" <w>Enter</w>  ：重复上一次的跨层移动。\n"

#. key: annotate.prompt
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:annotate.prompt"
msgid ""
"<h>Annotate (select level):\n"
" <w>Enter</w> or <w>.</w> : Annotate current level.\n"
" any <w>letter</w> : Annotate a level in the branch corresponding to the letter.\n"
" <w><<</w>          : Annotate the level upstairs.\n"
" <w>></w>          : Annotate the level downstairs.\n"
" <w>Ctrl-P</w>     : Annotate a level in the branch above this one.\n"
" <w>!</w>          : Show list of dungeon branches.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<h>注释（选择楼层）：\n"
" <w>Enter</w> or <w>.</w> ：注释湔楼层。\n"
" 任何<w>字母</w> ：注释与字母对应的分支。\n"
" <w><<</w>          ：注释楼上一层。\n"
" <w>></w>          ：注释楼下一层。\n"
" <w>Ctrl-P</w>     ：注释当前分支的上一层。\n"
" <w>!</w>          ：显示地牢分支列表。\n"
"\n"

#. key: skill-menu
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:skill-menu"
msgid ""
"                        <h>Skill management</h>\n"
"\n"
"You gain experience for killing monsters (and very few other activities). This\n"
"experience is used to train skills. The skill screen allows you to select which\n"
"skills to train.\n"
"\n"
"By pressing its letter, you can cycle if and how a skill is trained:\n"
"  <darkgrey>- deselected</darkgrey>    Skill will not be trained.\n"
"  + selected      Skill will be trained.\n"
"  <w>* focused</w>       Skill will be weighted higher for training.\n"
"\n"
"Pressing a capital letter selects that skill and deselects all the others.\n"
"This shortcut is useful when you want to train only one skill.\n"
"\n"
"Training can be done in two modes, which are toggled with the <w>/</w> key.\n"
"  - automatic:    Skills are weighted based on your use of them.\n"
"  - manual:       Experience is spread evenly across all activated skills.\n"
"\n"
"In training target mode you can set skill training targets: target skill levels\n"
"at which training of the skill will be automatically disabled.\n"
"\n"
"How fast you train a skill is governed by the following factors:\n"
"  - aptitude: Shown <white>white</white> in the Apt column. Higher numbers mean that less\n"
"              experience is needed to advance a skill. Depends on species.\n"
"  - skill manuals: Rare books giving an aptitude bonus of <lightred>+4</lightred> in one skill.\n"
"\n"
"On top of that, there are some effects which directly modify a skill, for\n"
"example having trained a related skill (crosstraining), or certain god powers.\n"
"Reduced skills are shown in <magenta>magenta</magenta>, and enhanced skills in <green>green</green>.\n"
"The training percentage (in <brown>brown</brown>) shows the relative amount of experience\n"
"which will be used to train this skill.\n"
"\n"
"Apart from (de)selecting skills, you also have the following toggles:\n"
"  <w>/</w> :  Switch between automatic and manual training modes.\n"
"  <w>*</w> :  Display all skills, even those which aren't currently useful.\n"
"  <w>?</w> :  Allows you to read the descriptions of skills.\n"
"  <w>_</w> :  Show or hide skill level modifications (god powers, crosstraining).\n"
"  <w>!</w> :  Switch between displaying training percentage, skill cost, or training\n"
"       targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"                        <h>技能管理</h>\n"
"\n"
"你可以通过杀死怪物（及很少的其他一些活动）获得经验值。\n"
"经验值被用来训练技能。\n"
"在技能界面，你可以选择技能进行训练。\n"
"\n"
"通过按下字母，你可以循环调整是否及如何训练技能：\n"
"  <darkgrey>- 取消选择</darkgrey>  不会训练此技能。\n"
"  + 选择      会训练此技能\n"
"  <w>* 聚焦</w>      此技能在训练时会有更高权重。\n"
"\n"
"按下大写字母可选择此技能并取消选择其他所有技能。\n"
"当你只想训练营一种技能时，这个快捷键非常有用。\n"
"\n"
"训练可在两种模式下进行，通过<w>/</w>键切换。\n"
"  - 自动：    技能权重取决于你对它们的使用。\n"
"  - 手动：    经验会被均匀分配给所有激活的技能。\n"
"\n"
"在训练目标模式下，你可以设置技能的训练目标：\n"
"在该技能达到某一等级后将不会自动训练它。\n"
"\n"
"训练技能的速度取决于以下因素：\n"
"  - 天赋：在Apt栏中以<white>白色</white>显示。\n"
"数值越高则意味着升级某一技能所需的经验越少。这取决于种族。\n"
"  - 技能手册：这种罕见的书能为一个技能提供<lightred>+4</lightred>的天赋加成。\n"
"\n"
"除此之外，还有一些效果能直接调整技能，\n"
"例如训练了相关技能（交叉训练）或某些神力。\n"
"削弱的技能以<magenta>洋红色</magenta>显示，\n"
"增强的技能以<green>绿色</green>显示。\n"
"训练百分比（以<brown>棕色</brown>）显示了用于训练该技能的经验值比例。\n"
"\n"
"除了（取消）选择技能外，还可以进行以下切换：\n"
"  <w>/</w> ：在自动和手动训练模式之间进行切换。\n"
"  <w>*</w> ：显示所有技能，即使是那些目前无用的技能。\n"
"  <w>?</w> ：阅读技能描述。\n"
"  <w>_</w> ：显示或隐藏技能等级的调整（神力、交叉训练）。\n"
"  <w>!</w> ：切换显示技能百分比、技能消耗或训练目标。\n"

#. key: spell-library
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:spell-library"
msgid ""
"<h>Spell Library</h>\n"
"<w>Tab</w> or <w>!</w>  : Cycle forward through <w>Memorise</w>, <w>Describe</w>, <w>Hide</w>, and <w>Show</w> pages.\n"
"<w>Shift-Tab</w> : Cycle backward through these pages.\n"
"<w>Ctrl-F</w>    : Filter the list of spells shown with a regex.\n"
"<w>?</w>         : Show this help.\n"
"\n"
"By default, the spell library opens to the <w>Memorise</w> page; to begin memorising a\n"
"spell, just press its letter. To read a spell's description, first switch to\n"
"the <w>Describe</w> page by pressing <w>Tab</w>, then press the spell's letter.\n"
"\n"
"Most characters will not be interested in memorising the majority of spells that\n"
"accumulate in their spell library; this is where the <w>Show</w> and <w>Hide</w> pages come in\n"
"handy. To hide a spell from the <w>Memorise</w> and <w>Describe</w> pages, press its spell\n"
"letter from the <w>Hide</w> page. Hidden spells can be shown again from the <w>Show</w> page.\n"
"\n"
"The <w>auto_hide_spells</w> option can be useful; when enabled, all newly discovered\n"
"spells are hidden by default.\n"
"\n"
"<w>Ctrl-F</w> can be used to filter the list of spells. Any filter set in this way will\n"
"persist until the spell library is closed and reopened, or until a new filter is\n"
"set with <w>Ctrl-F</w>. If <w>Enter</w> is pressed at the prompt without entering any text,\n"
"that will reset the filter to none.\n"
"You can filter spells by name and by spell school.\n"
msgstr ""
"<h>法术库</h>\n"
"<w>!</w>        ：循环切换<w>记忆</w>、<w>描述</w>、<w>隐藏</w>和<w>显示</w>页面。\n"
"<w>Ctrl-F</w>   ：使用正则表达式过滤列出的法术。\n"
"<w>?</w>        ：显示帮助。\n"
"\n"
"默认情况下，法术库会显示<w>记忆</w>页面，要记忆一道咒语，只需按下它的字母。\n"
"要阅读法术的描述，请先按<w>!</w>切换到<w>描述</w>页面，然后按法术的字母。\n"
"\n"
"大多数角色用不着记忆他们法术库中积累的大部分法术，\n"
"这样，<w>显示</w>和<w>隐藏</w>页面就能派上用场。\n"
"要将一道法术从<w>记忆</w>和<w>描述</w>页面中隐去，\n"
"请在<w>隐藏</w>页面按下那个法术的字母。\n"
"被隐藏的法术可以从<w>显示</w>页面再次显示。\n"
"\n"
"<w>auto_hide_spells</w>可能会很有用；启用时，默认会隐藏所有新发现的法术。\n"
"\n"
"<w>Ctrl-F</w>可以用来过滤列出的法术。\n"
"以这种方式设置的任何过滤器都将持续存在，直到关闭并重新打开法术库，\n"
"或按<w>Ctrl-F</w>设置新过滤器。\n"
"如果在提示后按下<w>Enter</w>而不输入任何文本，则会将过滤器重制为空。\n"
"你可以按名称和法术流派过滤法术。\n"

#. key: wiz-monster
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:wiz-monster"
msgid ""
"<h>Create specified monster</h>\n"
"\n"
"To create a monster with the default equipment for its species, simply enter\n"
"the species name, such as <w>kobold</w> or <w>Yiuf</w>.\n"
"\n"
"A hydra or slymdra can be given a specific number of heads by calling it an\n"
"n<w>-headed</w> <w>hydra</w> or n<w>-headed</w> <w>slymdra</w> (with a maximum of 20 heads):\n"
"\n"
"<w>four-headed hydra</w>\n"
"\n"
"To set the colour a (very) ugly thing takes when it is first created, use:\n"
"\n"
"<w>white very ugly thing</w>\n"
"\n"
"The valid colours are <w>brown</w>, <w>cyan</w>, <w>green</w>, <w>purple</w>, <w>red</w> and <w>white</w>.\n"
"\n"
"A mutant beast can be customised by prefacing it with a maturity level and/or\n"
"hyphen-separated set of traits, as follows:\n"
"\n"
"<w>mature shock-weird mutant beast</w>\n"
"\n"
"The valid maturity levels are <w>larval</w>, <w>juvenile</w>, <w>mature</w>, <w>elder</w> and <w>primal</w>. The\n"
"facets are <w>sting</w>, <w>bat</w>, <w>fire</w>, <w>weird</w>, <w>shock</w> and <w>ox</w>.\n"
"\n"
"A slime creature's size can be set to other than normal using the prefixes\n"
"<w>large</w>, <w>very large</w>, <w>enormous</w> or <w>titanic</w>:\n"
"\n"
"<w>very large slime creature</w>\n"
"\n"
"If a monster is a member of a band, you can request that it be eligible for\n"
"band members by adding the keyword <w>band</w> to the name. For instance:\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc warlord band</w>\n"
"\n"
"Specifying <w>band</w> doesn't force bands to be placed - it requests that the game\n"
"use the normal chances of creating a band. A band will only be placed if there\n"
"is space for it.\n"
"\n"
"A monster can be given specific items by following the monster name with a\n"
"semi-colon and then with an item list. For example:\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc ; rapier | quick blade . chain mail | plate armour</w>\n"
"\n"
"will generate an orc wielding either a rapier or a quick blade and wearing\n"
"either chain mail or plate armour. Randarts and ego items are only generated\n"
"if they are explicitly requested. Note that any items that the monster was\n"
"originally generated with will be removed and destroyed. This can be used to\n"
"force a monster to have no items whatsoever:\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc; nothing</w>\n"
"\n"
"For further information, see <cyan>docs/develop/levels/syntax.txt</cyan>, section <cyan>ITEMS</cyan>.\n"
"Any reference to a slash (<w>/</w>) should be replaced with a pipe (<w>|</w>) and any comma\n"
"(<w>,</w>) with a full stop (<w>.</w>).\n"
"\n"
"The same syntax is also used to create a specific type of dancing weapon:\n"
"\n"
"<w>dancing weapon; rapier</w>\n"
"\n"
"Limitations: If a monster is given a random launcher, there is no way to force\n"
"the ammo type to match the launcher type. As a special case, however, a\n"
"launcher dancing weapon is always generated with some suitable ammunition.\n"
"\n"
"You can specify that a monster will always generate a corpse by using the tag\n"
"<w>always_corpse</w>, or that it will never generate a corpse with <w>never_corpse</w>.\n"
"\n"
"By default, monsters are generated asleep. This is changed by prefixing the\n"
"name with <w>generate_awake</w>.\n"
"\n"
"<w>generate_awake boulder beetle</w>\n"
"\n"
"A prefix of <w>patrolling</w> prevents it from walking out of sight of the the place\n"
"where it was created.\n"
"\n"
"You can set the monster's god using the <w>god</w>: specifier as follows:\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc god:the_shining_one</w>\n"
"\n"
"If the monster is to be a gift of the specified god, this should be suffixed\n"
"with <w>god_gift</w>:\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc god:the_shining_one god_gift</w>\n"
"\n"
"Note that the monster will not be considered a god gift unless <w>god_gift</w> is\n"
"explicitly set.\n"
"\n"
"You can set the monster's faction by specifying <w>att</w>: one of:\n"
"\n"
"* <w>att:hostile</w> -- the default\n"
"* <w>att:friendly</w> -- tame, will follow you\n"
"* <w>att:neutral</w> -- hostile to both you and att:hostile monsters\n"
"* <w>att:good_neutral</w> -- hostile to att:hostile\n"
"* <w>att:fellow_slime</w> -- tame, won't follow you\n"
"\n"
"Monsters can be given colours that override their default colour:\n"
"\n"
"<w>col:darkgrey fungus</w>\n"
"\n"
"The colour <w>any</w> can be given, in which case a random colour will be chosen.\n"
"\n"
"You can override the displayed monster tile using the <w>tile</w>: specifier as\n"
"follows:\n"
"\n"
"<w>rat tile:mons_giant_bat</w>\n"
"\n"
"In tiles version, this would create a monster that uses the \"<cyan>mons_giant_bat</cyan>\"\n"
"tile, but is otherwise identical to a rat. In ASCII mode, this will do\n"
"nothing.\n"
"\n"
"If you want to place a random monster suitable for the level the map is\n"
"generated on, you can use\n"
"\n"
"<w>random</w>\n"
"\n"
"If you want to place a random monster suitable for some other place, you can\n"
"use a place: tag in the monster spec:\n"
"\n"
"<w>place:Abyss</w>\n"
"\n"
"Using <w>place</w>: implies that you want a random monster. You can also request\n"
"zombies from random monsters suitable for some other depth as (e.g.):\n"
"\n"
"<w>place:Elf:3 zombie</w>\n"
"\n"
"The available modifiers are <w>zombie</w>, <w>draugr</w>, <w>simulacrum</w>, and <w>spectre</w>.\n"
"\n"
"<h>Overriding Monster Names</h>\n"
"\n"
"Individual monsters can be given names as follows:\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:Durwent</w>\n"
"\n"
"This will cause the monster to appear as \"<cyan>Durwent the kobold</cyan>\". Spaces can be\n"
"placed in the name by substituting them with the _ symbol. It is worth noting\n"
"that \"<cyan>the <<race></cyan>\" will be appended to all names, which should be considered\n"
"when coming up with them.\n"
"\n"
"There are three different modifiers that can be used on a name:\n"
"<w>name_adjective</w>, <w>name_suffix and </w>name_replace. <w>name_adjective</w> makes the\n"
"name act as an adjective. For example:\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:ugly name_adjective</w>\n"
"\n"
"Will cause \"<cyan>An ugly kobold</cyan>\", \"<cyan>The ugly kobold hits you</cyan>\", and so on.\n"
"\n"
"<w>name_suffix</w> does the same, but after the monster's base name:\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:wearing_mittens name_suffix</w>\n"
"\n"
"Will give \"<cyan>A kobold wearing mittens</cyan>\", \"<cyan>The kobold wearing mittens hits you</cyan>\",\n"
"and so on.\n"
"\n"
"<w>name_replace</w> causes the base name to be replaced by given name, as if the\n"
"monster was a unique:\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:Durwent name_replace</w>\n"
"\n"
"Will result in \"<cyan>Durwent</cyan>\" rather than \"<cyan>Durwent the kobold</cyan>\". The corpse will\n"
"still be a \"<cyan>kobold corpse of Durwent</cyan>\".\n"
"\n"
"<w>name_species</w> uses the name for corpses as-is, without prefixing it with\n"
"\"<cyan>kobold</cyan> <cyan>corpse of X</cyan>\" for <w>name_replace</w>. It also avoids the usual name tag\n"
"that displays above unique and renamed monsters in local tiles.\n"
"\n"
"In combination with <w>name_replace</w> or <w>name_species</w>, there are two further tags\n"
"that can be used when renaming monsters, but not giving them an actual \"name\":\n"
"<w>name_descriptor</w>, and <w>name_definite</w>.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:goblin name_replace</w>\n"
"\n"
"Will result in \"<cyan>goblin hits you</cyan>\". However, adding <w>name_descriptor</w> from the\n"
"above flags will result in \"<cyan>The goblin hits you</cyan>\" and in the description of the\n"
"monster, \"<cyan>A goblin</cyan>\".\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:goblin name_replace name_descriptor</w>\n"
"\n"
"The <w>name_definite</w> flag ensures that it is never referred to as \"<cyan>a</cyan>\" or \"<cyan>an</cyan>\",\n"
"but that the definite object is always used. Therefore, you will see \"<cyan>The\n"
"<cyan>goblin</cyan> <cyan>hits you</cyan>\", as per above, but also \"<cyan>The goblin</cyan>\" in its description.\n"
"Setting <w>name_definite</w> will automatically set the flag <w>name_descriptor</w>,\n"
"therefore meaning that:\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:goblin name_replace name_definite</w>\n"
"\n"
"is exactly the same as:\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:goblin name_replace name_descriptor name_definite</w>\n"
"\n"
"<w>name_zombie</w> can be used to redefine already zombified monsters (including\n"
"draugr, simulacra and spectrals).\n"
"\n"
"Finally, <w>name_nocorpse</w> will cause the name to be completely ignored for\n"
"corpses. For example:\n"
"\n"
"<w>wizard name:sad name_adjective name_nocorpse</w>\n"
"\n"
"will result in \"<cyan>a sad wizard</cyan>\" that leaves \"<cyan>a wizard corpse</cyan>\".\n"
"\n"
"For instances where space in definitions is limited, you can use abbreviated\n"
"forms of these tags:\n"
"\n"
"* <w>name_suffix</w> -> <w>n_suf</w>\n"
"* <w>name_adjective</w> -> <w>n_adj</w>\n"
"* <w>name_replace</w> -> <w>n_rpl</w>\n"
"* <w>name_species</w> -> <w>n_spe</w>\n"
"* <w>name_descriptor</w> -> <w>n_des</w>\n"
"* <w>name_definite</w> -> <w>n_the</w>\n"
"* <w>name_zombie</w> -> <w>n_zom</w>\n"
"* <w>name_nocorpse</w> -> <w>n_noc</w>\n"
"\n"
"<h>Overriding Monster Stats</h>\n"
"\n"
"Further monster customisation can be made by using <w>hd</w> and <w>hp</w>. These two tags\n"
"allow you to completely overwrite the original hit dice and hit points of a\n"
"monster:\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold hd:20</w>\n"
"\n"
"Creates a kobold with a hit dice of 20. As its hp is randomised, based on its\n"
"hit dice, this will also be re-rolled. Monsters with a specific hit point\n"
"value will not have this value change.\n"
"\n"
"You can also have a specific value for hit points:\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold hp:20</w>\n"
"\n"
"Creates a kobold with 20 hit points. This is also useful for monsters (such as\n"
"statues) which come with non-randomised HP values.\n"
"\n"
"Monsters can be marked as summoned by using <w>dur</w> and <w>sum</w> tags. The <w>dur</w> tag\n"
"accepts an integer between 1 and 6 inclusive. The <w>sum</w> tag accepts the name of\n"
"a spell (parsed as per the <w>spells</w> tag, described below) or any of <w>clone</w>\n"
"(Rakshasa), <w>animate</w> (from animate dead), <w>chaos</w> (made from pure chaos), <w>miscast</w>\n"
"(summoned from by spell miscast effect), <w>zot</w> (summoned by a Zot trap), <w>wrath</w>\n"
"(summoned by a god in an act of retribution), <w>aid</w> (summoned by a god in order\n"
"to give aid).\n"
"\n"
"Of the spells, <w>shadow_creatures</w> has the most significant effect, in that\n"
"monsters will dissipate into the shadows rather than disappear in a puff of\n"
"smoke. Using non-summoning spells will also have no effect.\n"
"\n"
"Tagging a monster with <w>seen</w> will override the system and force that monster to\n"
"be marked as already viewed; this means that it won't generate messages such\n"
"as \"<cyan>A kobold comes into view</cyan>\".\n"
"\n"
"<h>Overriding Monster Spells</h>\n"
"\n"
"Monster spell sets can be overridden with a <w>spells</w>: tag, used as follows:\n"
"\n"
"*<w>goblin spells:throw_flame.50.wizard</w>\n"
"*<w>ancient lich spells:symbol_of_torment.26.wizard; glaciate.51.wizard</w>\n"
"\n"
"(a list of spell slots, consisting of a spell name with spaces replaced with\n"
"underscores, a frequency of casting and set of spell slot flags specified\n"
"afterwards with <w>.</w>, with slots separated by <w>;</w>. There should be no spaces around\n"
"the <w>;</w> or after the <w>spells</w>: prefix)\n"
"\n"
"Spell names must exactly match the names in <cyan>spl-data.h</cyan>, with spaces replaced\n"
"by underscores. Spell frequencies are an (x in 200) chance that that spell\n"
"will be cast. Spell flags include:\n"
"\n"
"* <w>natural</w>, <w>magical</w>, <w>demonic</w>, <w>wizard</w>, or <w>priest</w> - the manner in which this\n"
"spell is being cast. Wizards and priests can be silenced and will trigger\n"
"appropriate conducts (Trog will appreciate killing wizards, Beogh will\n"
"appreciate killing priests). Magical, demonic, and wizard spells are subject\n"
"to anti-magic effects. Natural spells do not generate noise.\n"
"* <w>emergency</w> - the monster will only cast the spell when low on health.\n"
"* <w>breath</w> - the spell is a breath weapon, and using it triggers a breath\n"
"timeout during which the spell cannot be cast again.\n"
"* <w>no_silent</w> - the spell cannot be used while silent, even if it is an ability\n"
"type normally not subject to silence.\n"
"* <w>instant</w> - the spell does not expend the monster's energy; they may take\n"
"another action on the same turn.\n"
"* <w>noisy</w> - forces the spell to make noise even if it is a natural ability.\n"
"\n"
"You may use <w>none</w> specify that a slot should be left empty. You can force a\n"
"spell-less monster with:\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc wizard spells:none</w>\n"
"\n"
"<h>Setting enchantments</h>\n"
"\n"
"You may give a monster any number of enchantments. It may start hasted, blind,\n"
"have permanent RMsl, etc. The syntax is <w>ench:<<name>:<<duration>:<<degree></w> or\n"
"<w>perm_ench:<<name>:<<degree></w>. The <w><<degree></w> and <w><<duration></w> fields may be\n"
"omitted.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"* <w>orc perm_ench:blind perm_ench:mad</w>\n"
"* <w>dream sheep ench:sticky_flame</w>\n"
"* <w>stone giant dur:1 ench:berserk</w>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<h>生成指定怪物</h>\n"
"\n"
"要生成带有其种族的默认装备的怪物，只需输入物种名称，\n"
"如<w>kobold</w>或<w>Yiuf</w>。\n"
"\n"
"可以按照n<w>-headed</w>\n"
"<w>hydra</w>的格式指定九头蛇的头的数量（最多20个头）：\n"
"\n"
"<w>four-headed hydra</w>\n"
"\n"
"要设定一个（极）丑物的初始颜色，使用：\n"
"\n"
"<w>white very ugly thing</w>\n"
"\n"
"有效的颜色有：<w>brown</w>、<w>cyan</w>、<w>green</w>、<w>purple</w>、<w>red</w>和<w>white</w>。\n"
"\n"
"变异兽则可以通过在其前面加上成熟度等级和/或由连字符分隔的一组特征来进行设定，\n"
"如下所示：\n"
"\n"
"<w>mature shock-weird mutant beast</w>\n"
"\n"
"有效的成熟度等级有：<w>larval</w>、<w>juvenile</w>、<w>mature</w>、<w>elder</w>和<w>primal</w>。\n"
"特征有：<w>sting</w>、<w>bat</w>、<w>fire</w>、<w>weird</w>、<w>shock</w>和<w>ox</w>。\n"
"\n"
"黏液生物的体型可以通过前缀<w>large</w>、<w>very large</w>、<w>enormous</w>或<w>titanic</w>设置为非正常体型：\n"
"\n"
"<w>very large slime creature</w>\n"
"\n"
"如果某个怪物是某个群体的一员，你可以通过在名称中添加关键词<w>band</w>使之成为群体成员。例如：\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc warlord band</w>\n"
"\n"
"设定<w>band</w>并不会强制放置群体——它会用游戏的正常生成机率生成群体。\n"
"只有在有空间的情况下，才会生成群体。\n"
"\n"
"通过在怪物名称后面加上分号，然后加上物品列表，可以指定怪物所携带的物品。\n"
"例如：\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc ; rapier | quick blade . chain mail | plate armour</w>\n"
"\n"
"会生成一个兽人，他持握轻剑或快刃，身着锁子甲或板甲。\n"
"神器和属性只有在明确设定时才会生成。\n"
"请注意，怪物原先使用的任何物品都会被移除。这个能强制让怪物没有任何物品：\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc; nothing</w>\n"
"\n"
"有关详细信息，\n"
"请参阅<cyan>docs/develop/levels/syntax.txt</cyan>，<cyan>ITEMS</cyan>章节。\n"
"任何引用的斜线（<w>/</w>）都应换为管道符（<w>|</w>），\n"
"任何逗号（<w>,</w>）都换为句号（<w>.</w>）。\n"
"\n"
"同样的语法也适用于创建特定类型的飞舞的武器武器：\n"
"\n"
"<w>dancing weapon; rapier</w>\n"
"\n"
"限制：如果给怪物一个随机投射器，就没有办法强制弹药类型与投射器类型匹配。\n"
"然而，作为一种特殊情况，飞舞的武器如果是投射器，总会产生一些合适的弹药。\n"
"\n"
"你可以通过使用标签<w>always_corpse</w>指定怪物永远生成尸体，\n"
"或使用<w>never_corpse</w>，这将永远不会生成尸体。\n"
"\n"
"默认情况下，怪物在被生成时处于睡眠状态。\n"
"这可以通过在名称前加<w>generate_awake</w>来更改。\n"
"\n"
"<w>generate_awake boulder beetle</w>\n"
"\n"
"前缀<w>patrolling</w>防止它从生成的地方走开。\n"
"\n"
"你可以通过<w>god</w>:说明符设定怪物所皈依的神，如下所示：\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc god:the_shining_one</w>\n"
"\n"
"如果设定这个怪物是由指定的神所赋予的，则应以<w>god_gift</w>为后缀：\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc god:the_shining_one god_gift</w>\n"
"\n"
"注意，除非明确指定了<w>god_gift</w>，否则这个怪物是不会被视作由神所赋予的。\n"
"\n"
"你可以通过指定<w>att</w>:来设定怪物从属于以下之一派系：\n"
"\n"
"* <w>att:hostile</w> -- 默认\n"
"* <w>att:friendly</w> -- 驯服的，会跟随你\n"
"* <w>att:neutral</w> -- 对你和敌对怪物都有敌意\n"
"* <w>att:good_neutral</w> -- 对敌对怪物有敌意\n"
"* <w>att:fellow_slime</w> -- 驯服的，但不会跟随你\n"
"\n"
"给怪物设定颜色，覆盖其默认颜色：\n"
"\n"
"<w>col:darkgrey fungus</w>\n"
"\n"
"如果设定为<w>any</w>，将选择为一个随机的颜色。\n"
"\n"
"你可以使用<w>tile</w>:说明符以设定怪物的贴图，如下所示：\n"
"\n"
"<w>rat tile:mons_giant_bat</w>\n"
"\n"
"在图像版中，这会创建一个使用“<cyan>mons_giant_bat</cyan>”贴图的怪物，\n"
"但在其他方面与老鼠相同。在ASCII模式下，这将不起作用。\n"
"\n"
"如果你想在生成的地图中放置一个与当前楼层匹配的随机怪物，你可以使用\n"
"\n"
"<w>random</w>\n"
"\n"
"如果你想在其他地方放置一个与之匹配的随机怪物，\n"
"你可以在怪物语句中使用place:标签：\n"
"\n"
"<w>place:Abyss</w>\n"
"\n"
"使用<w>place</w>:表示你要生成一个随机怪物。\n"
"你也可以在其他深度有随机怪物的楼层生成僵尸，例如：\n"
"\n"
"<w>place:Elf:3 zombie</w>\n"
"\n"
"可用的修饰语有<w>zombie</w>、<w>draugr</w>、<w>simulacrum</w>和<w>spectre</w>。\n"
"\n"
"<h>覆盖怪物名称</h>\n"
"\n"
"给单个怪物设定名字：\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:Durwent</w>\n"
"\n"
"这会让怪物显示为“<cyan>Durwent the kobold</cyan>”。\n"
"可以用_符号替换名称中的空格。\n"
"值得注意的是，“<cyan>the <<race></cyan>”将被附加到所有名称上，\n"
"在使用这些名称时应予以考虑。\n"
"\n"
"可以在名称上使用三种不同的修饰语：\n"
"<w>name_adjective</w>、<w>name_suffix和</w>name_replace。\n"
"<w>name_adjective</w>会把那个名称作为形容词。例如：\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:ugly name_adjective</w>\n"
"\n"
"会生成“<cyan>An ugly kobold</cyan>”“<cyan>The ugly kobold hits you</cyan>”等文本。\n"
"\n"
"<w>name_suffix</w> does the same, but after the monster's base name:\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:wearing_mittens name_suffix</w>\n"
"\n"
"会生成“<cyan>A kobold wearing mittens</cyan>”“<cyan>The kobold wearing mittens hits you</cyan>”等文本。\n"
"\n"
"<w>name_replace</w>会把基础名称替换为给定名称，就好像那个怪物是唯一的：\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:Durwent name_replace</w>\n"
"\n"
"会生成“<cyan>Durwent</cyan>”而不是“<cyan>Durwent the kobold</cyan>”。\n"
"而尸体则仍然是“<cyan>kobold corpse of Durwent</cyan>”。\n"
"\n"
"<w>name_species</w>按原样使用尸体的名称，\n"
"而不使用“<cyan>kobold</cyan> <cyan>corpse of X</cyan>”\n"
"作为<w>name_replace</w>的前缀。\n"
"它也避免使通常的名称标签显示在此处贴图中独一无二的、被重命名的怪物上方。\n"
"\n"
"与<w>name_replace</w>或<w>name_species</w>一并使用，\n"
"在重命名怪物时会有两个标签，但不会加到实际的“名字”中：\n"
"<w>name_descriptor</w>, and <w>name_definite</w>。\n"
"\n"
"例如：\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:goblin name_replace</w>\n"
"\n"
"会生成“<cyan>goblin hits you</cyan>”。然而，\n"
"在以上标记中加入<w>name_descriptor</w>会生成“<cyan>The goblin hits you</cyan>”，\n"
"那个怪物的描述会变为“<cyan>A goblin</cyan>”。\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:goblin name_replace name_descriptor</w>\n"
"\n"
"The <w>name_definite</w>标记会确保它永远不会被冠以“<cyan>a</cyan>”或\n"
"“<cyan>an</cyan>”，但始终使用确定的宾语。因此，如上所述，\n"
"你将看到“<cyan>The<cyan>goblin</cyan> <cyan>hits you</cyan>”，\n"
"但在其描述中也将看到“<cyan>The goblin</cyan>”。\n"
"设定<w>name_definite</w>将自动设定标记<w>name_descriptor</w>，因此意味着：\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:goblin name_replace name_definite</w>\n"
"\n"
"完全等同于：\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold name:goblin name_replace name_descriptor name_definite</w>\n"
"\n"
"<w>name_zombie</w>可以用来重新定义已经僵尸化的怪物（包括骷髅、拟像和幽灵）。\n"
"\n"
"最后，<w>name_nocorpse</w>能让尸体的名称完全被隐去。例如：\n"
"\n"
"<w>wizard name:sad name_adjective name_nocorpse</w>\n"
"\n"
"会让“<cyan>a sad wizard</cyan>”留下“<cyan>a wizard corpse</cyan>”。\n"
"\n"
"当在定义中空间受限时，可以使用以下标签的缩写形式：\n"
"\n"
"* <w>name_suffix</w> -> <w>n_suf</w>\n"
"* <w>name_adjective</w> -> <w>n_adj</w>\n"
"* <w>name_replace</w> -> <w>n_rpl</w>\n"
"* <w>name_species</w> -> <w>n_spe</w>\n"
"* <w>name_descriptor</w> -> <w>n_des</w>\n"
"* <w>name_definite</w> -> <w>n_the</w>\n"
"* <w>name_zombie</w> -> <w>n_zom</w>\n"
"* <w>name_nocorpse</w> -> <w>n_noc</w>\n"
"\n"
"<h>Overriding Monster Stats</h>\n"
"\n"
"使用<w>hd</w>和<w>hp</w>进一步对怪物进行定制。\n"
"可以用这两个标签完全覆盖怪物的初始生命骰和生命值：\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold hd:20</w>\n"
"\n"
"将生成一个有着20点生命骰的狗头人。它的生命值是随机的，但取决于它的生命骰，\n"
"而生命骰也会被再次掷出。被设定了明确的生命值的怪物，这个值则不会变化。\n"
"\n"
"你也可以设定一个明确的生命值：\n"
"\n"
"<w>kobold hp:20</w>\n"
"\n"
"将生成一个有着20点生命值的狗头人。\n"
"这对于生命值非随机的怪物（如雕像）也很有用。\n"
"\n"
"可以通过<w>dur</w>和<w>sum</w>标签，将怪物标记为召唤生成的。\n"
"<w>dur</w>标签接受1到6之间的整数。The <w>sum</w>授受一个法术名称\n"
"（根据<w>spells</w>标签进行解析，如下所述）或<w>clone</w>（罗刹天）、\n"
"<w>animate</w>（源于活化死者）、<w>chaos</w>（由纯粹的混乱生成）、\n"
"<w>miscast</w>（由施法失误召唤）、<w>zot</w>（由佐特陷阱召唤）、\n"
"<w>wrath</w>（由神在惩罚时所召唤）、<w>aid</w>（由神在支援时所召唤）\n"
"中的任何一个。\n"
"\n"
"在这些法术中，<w>shadow_creatures</w>的效果最为显著，\n"
"因为怪物会隐没在阴影中，而不是消散在烟雾中。使用非召唤法术也没有效果。\n"
"\n"
"将一个怪物标记为<w>seen</w>将覆盖系统，并强制将怪物标记为已看到；\n"
"这意味着它不会生成诸如“<cyan>A kobold comes into view</cyan>”之类的消息。\n"
"\n"
"<h>覆盖怪物的法术</h>\n"
"\n"
"怪物的法术集可以用<w>spells</w>: 标签进行覆盖，用法如下：\n"
"\n"
"*<w>goblin spells:throw_flame.50.wizard</w>\n"
"*<w>ancient lich spells:symbol_of_torment.26.wizard; glaciate.51.wizard</w>\n"
"\n"
"（一个法术槽列表，由用下划线替换空格的法术名称、施法频率组成，\n"
"法术槽后面用<w>.</w>标记，法术槽用<w>;</w>进行分隔。\n"
"<w>;</w>周围不能有空格，<w>spells</w>: 前缀后不能有空格）\n"
"\n"
"法术名称必须与<cyan>spl-data.h</cyan>中的名称完全一致，空格用下划线替换。\n"
"法术频率是施放该法术的几率（200分之x）。法术标记包括：\n"
"\n"
"* <w>natural</w>、<w>magical</w>、<w>demonic</w>、<w>wizard</w>或\n"
"<w>priest</w> - 施放此法术的方式。巫师和祭司能被沉默，\n"
"并触发某些行为（特洛戈会常识杀死巫师的行为，比欧弗会赏识杀死祭司的行为）。\n"
"魔法、恶魔和巫师法术受到反魔法效果的影响。自然法术不会产生噪音。\n"
"* <w>emergency</w> - 怪物只会在生命值低时才会施展这个法术。\n"
"* <w>breath</w> - 该法术是一种吐息武器，使用它时会闭气，\n"
"在此期间该法术无法再次施放。\n"
"* <w>no_silent</w> - 该法术不能在沉默时施放，\n"
"即使它是一种通常不受影响的能力类型。\n"
"* <w>instant</w> - 该法术不会耗费怪物的精力；\n"
"他们可以在一个回合内同时进行另一动作。\n"
"* <w>noisy</w> - 强制让该法术发出噪音，即使它通常是种自然能力。\n"
"\n"
"你可以使用<w>none</w> 将槽指定为空。你可以用以下方式强制生成一个无法术怪物：\n"
"\n"
"<w>orc wizard spells:none</w>\n"
"\n"
"<h>Setting enchantments</h>\n"
"\n"
"你可以给怪物施加任何魔力。它可以启用快速、失明、具有永久性驱逐飞弹等效果。\n"
"语法为：<w>ench:<<name>:<<degree>:<<duration></w>或\n"
"<w>perm_ench:<<name>:<<degree></w>。\n"
"<w><<degree></w>和<w><<duration></w>字段可以省略。\n"
"\n"
"例如：\n"
"\n"
"* <w>orc perm_ench:blind perm_ench:mad</w>\n"
"* <w>dream sheep ench:sticky_flame</w>\n"
"* <w>stone giant dur:1 ench:berserk</w>\n"
"\n"

#. key: macro-menu
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:macro-menu"
msgid ""
"<h>Editing macros and keymaps</h>\n"
"\n"
"To edit a current macro/keymap, select from the menu using the arrow keys or\n"
"by hotkey. (Hotkeys that are used to navigate the menu can be selected by\n"
"arrow keys). To create a new mapping by entering a key, use the [<w>~</w>] key\n"
"or the corresponding menu item, and then enter the key. This allows you to\n"
"create (and edit) mappings that use menu keys. Use the [<w>!</w>] key to switch\n"
"to keymap editing mode (see below for more information on keymaps).\n"
"\n"
"<w>Macros</w> allow remapping keys that are sent to the game when inputting\n"
"commands. This can be used to redefine a command key, or to define an unused\n"
"key. They map a key to a sequence of keystrokes, and keystrokes do carry over\n"
"into submenus.\n"
"\n"
"Example 1: mapping <w>e</w> to <w>p</w> would let the `e` key trigger the same\n"
"command as the `p` key (which on the default settings is autofire).\n"
"\n"
"Example 2: mapping <w>1</w> to the sequence <w>zaf</w> would let the `1` key\n"
"cast a spell that is on the letter `a` with default targeting.\n"
"\n"
"Example 3: mapping <w>F1</w> to <w>Q&a</w> would let the F1 key quiver the spell\n"
"that is on letter `a`.\n"
"\n"
"<w>Keymaps</w> are lower-level key substitutions that replace keys entirely with\n"
"a sequence of keystrokes. They are recommended for changing keys uniformly to\n"
"deal with alternative keyboard layouts. Keymaps are contextual, and the\n"
"default/\"regular\" context is used anywhere that a non-specialised context is not\n"
"active. Macros take the result of keymaps as input.\n"
"\n"
"Example: In some European keyboard layouts, the § symbol replaces ~. Therefore,\n"
"it could be useful to keymap § to ~ in both the regular and menu keymap contexts\n"
"so that the main menu and macro menu become a bit easier to access. (In other\n"
"layouts, this applies instead to ½.)\n"
"\n"
"When used for mapping commands, keymaps can have unexpected side effects: e.g.\n"
"mapping <w>1</w> to <w>zaf</w> via keymap is not recommended, because this will\n"
"make it hard to type `1` when entering a skill target.\n"
"\n"
"<w>Keycodes</w>: Both macros and keymaps accept keycodes when describing the\n"
"action, in the form of <w>\\{n}</w> to enter keycode <w>n</w>. (Use <w>\\\\</w> to\n"
"enter a backslash.) For example, use <w>\\{9}</w> to enter the keycode for the\n"
"<w>tab</w> button. You can bind macros and keymaps by keycode by using <w>~~</w>\n"
"at the macro edit menu.\n"
"\n"
"<w>Saving</w>: Bindings edited at this menu are saved in a .macro file in your\n"
"save directory. They will be overridden by settings in your options file. See\n"
"the `macro` command in options_guide.txt for more information.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<h>编辑宏和键位</h>\n"
"\n"
"要编辑当前宏/键位，请用方向键或热键在菜单中选择。\n"
"（可通过方向键选择用于定位菜单的热键）。要通过键入以创建新的键位，\n"
"使用[<w>~</w>]键或相应的菜单项，然后输入该键。\n"
"你可以通过它来创建（和编辑）使用菜单键的键位。\n"
"使用[<w>!</w>]键切换到键位编辑模式（有关键位的详细信息，参见下文）。\n"
"\n"
"<w>Macros</w>可以在输入命令时重新修改传送到游戏的键位。\n"
"这可用于重新设定命令键，或定义未使用的键。\n"
"它们将一个键映射到一组按键，按键会传入到子菜单中。\n"
"\n"
"示例1：将<w>e</w> 映射到<w>p</w>会让“e”键触发与“p”键相同的命令\n"
"（默认设定为自动开火）。\n"
"\n"
"示例2：将<w>1</w>映射到序列<w>zaf</w>\n"
"会让“1”键字母朝默认目标施放标记为字母“a”的法术。\n"
"\n"
"示例3：将<w>F1</w>映射到 <w>Q&a</w>会让F1键预备标记为字母“a”的法术。\n"
"\n"
"<w>Keymaps</w>是较底层的键替换，用一系列按键击完全替换按键。\n"
"建议使用它们来统一更改按键，以处理其他键盘布局。\n"
"按键映射取决于情境，在非特定情境未激活的情况下，使用默认/\"regular\"情境。\n"
"\n"
"例如：在一些欧洲键盘布局中，§符号取代了~。因此，\n"
"因此，在常规和菜单情境中将§映射为~会很有用，\n"
"这样主菜单和宏菜单就更容易访问了。（在其他布局中，这适用于½。）\n"
"\n"
"当用于映射命令时，按键映射可能会产生意想不到的副作用：例如，\n"
"不建议将<w>1</w>映射为<w>zaf</w>，因为这会使输入技能目标时很难键入“1”。\n"
"\n"
"<w> Keycodes</w>：宏和键映射在描述操作时都接受键码，\n"
"以<w>\\{n}</w>的形式输入键码<w>n</w>。（使用<w>\\\\</w>输入反斜杠。）例如，\n"
"使用<w>\\{9}</w> 为<w>tab</w>按钮输入键码。\n"
"可以通过宏编辑菜单上的<w>~~</w>，使用键码绑定宏和键映射。\n"
"\n"
"<w>Saving</w>：在此菜单中编辑的绑定内容以.macro文件保存在save目录中。\n"
"它们会被配置文件中的设定覆盖。\n"
"参见options_guide.txt中的“macro”命令以获得更多信息。\n"
"\n"

#. key: console-keycodes
#: dat/database/help.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:help:console-keycodes"
msgid ""
"<h>Keycodes for console and webtiles</h>\n"
"\n"
"Keycodes can be entered as numbers, or in some cases, human readable strings.\n"
"The following tables give both the numeric keycode, and the string; modified\n"
"keys generally must be entered by number. When entering a keycode  as part of a\n"
"macro action, it should be wrapped using the following syntax for keycode n:\n"
"<w>\\{n}</w>. This should also be used when defining a keycode by number in your\n"
"rc file. Example: when defining a macro that triggers F1, you can write\n"
"\"\\{F1\\}\" or \"\\{-265}\". For named keys as part of a macro definition, the \\{}\n"
"may be omitted.\n"
"\n"
"Positive numeric values are ASCII character codes. Negative values are\n"
"crawl-internal keycodes for special keys. The sign is required for these to\n"
"be interpreted correctly. Keyboards vary quite a bit, and so not all of these\n"
"bindings are available on all keyboards; cases where there is often variation\n"
"are indicated specifically below.\n"
"\n"
"The following is a quick-reference for some of the main keys you might want to\n"
"bind.\n"
"\n"
"<w>8</w>: Backspace (and/or Delete, depending on keyboard)\n"
"<w>9</w>: Tab\n"
"<w>13</w>: Enter (and/or the Return key, depending on keyboard)\n"
"<w>27</w>: Esc\n"
"\n"
"<w>-233</w>: Shift-Tab\n"
"<w>-222</w>: Ctrl-Tab (on some keyboards)\n"
"<w>-255</w>: Delete (on some keyboards)\n"
"<w>-265</w>: F1   <w>-264</w>: F2   <w>-263</w>: F3   <w>-262</w>: F4   <w>-261</w>: F5\n"
"<w>-260</w>: F6   <w>-259</w>: F7   <w>-258</w>: F8   <w>-257</w>: F9   <w>-256</w>: F10\n"
"\n"
"Keycodes up to F22 are defined, but may not work on all builds. (On webtiles,\n"
"F11 and F12 are reserved.)\n"
"\n"
"<w>Number pad and navigation keys:</w>\n"
"\n"
"On many keyboards, <w>numlock</w> switches between the number keys and\n"
"navigation keys. Modifiers for these keys may not work on all keyboards. When\n"
"modified number pad keys do work, Shift and Ctrl typically treats those keys as\n"
"modified navigation keys regardless of numlock status.\n"
"\n"
"Navigation keys:\n"
"\n"
"<w>-245</w>: PgDn    <w>-234</w>: Shift-PgDn    <w>-223</w>: Ctrl-PgDn\n"
"<w>-246</w>: PgUp    <w>-235</w>: Shift-PgUp    <w>-224</w>: Ctrl-PgUp\n"
"<w>-247</w>: Clear   <w>-236</w>: Shift-Clear   <w>-225</w>: Ctrl-Clear\n"
"<w>-248</w>: End     <w>-237</w>: Shift-End     <w>-226</w>: Ctrl-End\n"
"<w>-249</w>: Home    <w>-238</w>: Shift-Home    <w>-227</w>: Ctrl-Home\n"
"<w>-250</w>: Insert  <w>-239</w>: Shift-Insert  <w>-228</w>: Ctrl-Insert\n"
"<w>-251</w>: Right   <w>-240</w>: Shift-Right   <w>-229</w>: Ctrl-Right\n"
"<w>-252</w>: Left    <w>-241</w>: Shift-Left    <w>-230</w>: Ctrl-Left\n"
"<w>-253</w>: Down    <w>-242</w>: Shift-Down    <w>-231</w>: Ctrl-Down\n"
"<w>-254</w>: Up      <w>-243</w>: Shift-Up      <w>-232</w>: Ctrl-Up\n"
"\n"
"Number pad keys:\n"
"\n"
"<w>-1007</w>: NP7   <w>-1008</w>: NP8   <w>-1009</w>: NP9\n"
"<w>-1004</w>: NP4   <w>-1005</w>: NP5   <w>-1006</w>: NP6\n"
"<w>-1001</w>: NP1   <w>-1002</w>: NP2   <w>-1003</w>: NP3\n"
"<w>-1000</w>: NP0\n"
"<w>-1010</w>: NPenter\n"
"<w>-1012</w>: NP/   <w>-1015</w>: NP*   <w>-1016</w>: NP+   <w>-1018</w>: NP-\n"
"<w>-1019</w>: NP.   <w>-1021</w>: NP=\n"
"\n"
"Some number pad punctuation keys may not be distinguished from their \"regular\"\n"
"counterparts, again depending on keyboard and build.\n"
msgstr ""
"<h>用于控制台和网页贴图版的键码</h>\n"
"\n"
"键码可以输入数字，在某些情况下，可以输入人类可读的字符串。\n"
"下表给出了数字键代码和字符串；修改的键通常必须以数字形式输入。\n"
"当输入一个键码作为宏操作的一部分时，应使用键码n的以下语法对其进行包装：\n"
"<w>\\{n}</w>。当在rc文件中通过数字定义键码时，也应使用此方法。示例：\n"
"定义触发F1的宏时，可以编写“\\{F1\\}”或“\\{-265}”。\n"
"对于作为宏定义一部分的命名键，可以省略\\{}。\n"
"\n"
"正值是ASCII字符代码。负值是Crawl内部用于特殊键的键码。\n"
"正确解释这些符号是必需的。键盘差异很大，因此并非所有键盘上都适用于这些绑定；\n"
"常见的变体如下所示。\n"
"\n"
"下面是一些可能想要绑定的主键的便捷参考。\n"
"\n"
"<w>8</w>：Backspace（和/或Delete，取决于键盘）\n"
"<w>9</w>：Tab\n"
"<w>13</w>：Enter（和/或Return键，取决于键盘）\n"
"<w>27</w>：Esc\n"
"\n"
"<w>-233</w>：Shift-Tab\n"
"<w>-222</w>：Ctrl-Tab（在一些键盘上）\n"
"<w>-255</w>：Delete（在一些键盘上）\n"
"<w>-265</w>：F1   <w>-264</w>：F2   <w>-263</w>：F3   <w>-262</w>：F4   <w>-261</w>：F5\n"
"<w>-260</w>：F6   <w>-259</w>：F7   <w>-258</w>：F8   <w>-257</w>：F9   <w>-256</w>：F10\n"
"\n"
"最高可定义达F22的键码，但可能不适用于所有结构。\n"
"（在网页图像版，保留F11和F12。）\n"
"\n"
"<w>数字键盘和定位键：</w>\n"
"\n"
"在许多键盘上，用<w>numlock</w>切换数字键和定位键。\n"
"这些键的修饰符可能不适用于所有键盘。当被修改的数字键盘键生效时，\n"
"Shift和Ctrl通常将这些键视为被修改的定位键，而不管数字锁的状态如何。\n"
"\n"
"定位键：\n"
"\n"
"<w>-245</w>: PgDn    <w>-234</w>: Shift-PgDn    <w>-223</w>: Ctrl-PgDn\n"
"<w>-246</w>: PgUp    <w>-235</w>: Shift-PgUp    <w>-224</w>: Ctrl-PgUp\n"
"<w>-247</w>: Clear   <w>-236</w>: Shift-Clear   <w>-225</w>: Ctrl-Clear\n"
"<w>-248</w>: End     <w>-237</w>: Shift-End     <w>-226</w>: Ctrl-End\n"
"<w>-249</w>: Home    <w>-238</w>: Shift-Home    <w>-227</w>: Ctrl-Home\n"
"<w>-250</w>: Insert  <w>-239</w>: Shift-Insert  <w>-228</w>: Ctrl-Insert\n"
"<w>-251</w>: Right   <w>-240</w>: Shift-Right   <w>-229</w>: Ctrl-Right\n"
"<w>-252</w>: Left    <w>-241</w>: Shift-Left    <w>-230</w>: Ctrl-Left\n"
"<w>-253</w>: Down    <w>-242</w>: Shift-Down    <w>-231</w>: Ctrl-Down\n"
"<w>-254</w>: Up      <w>-243</w>: Shift-Up      <w>-232</w>: Ctrl-Up\n"
"\n"
"数字键盘键：\n"
"\n"
"<w>-1007</w>: NP7   <w>-1008</w>: NP8   <w>-1009</w>: NP9\n"
"<w>-1004</w>: NP4   <w>-1005</w>: NP5   <w>-1006</w>: NP6\n"
"<w>-1001</w>: NP1   <w>-1002</w>: NP2   <w>-1003</w>: NP3\n"
"<w>-1000</w>: NP0\n"
"<w>-1010</w>: NPenter\n"
"<w>-1012</2>: NP/   <w>-1015</w>: NP*   <w>-1016</w>: NP+   <w>-1018</w>: NP-\n"
"<w>-1019</w>: NP.   <w>-1021</w>: NP=\n"
"\n"
"一些些数字键盘上的标点键可能与“常规”标点键没有区别，这同样取决于键盘和结构。\n"

#. key: q:goal
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:goal"
msgid ""
"What exactly is the goal of this game?\n"
msgstr ""
"这个游戏的终极目标是什么？\n"

#. key: a:goal
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:goal"
msgid ""
"A: To survive and to win, obviously. For this you need to find the fabled Orb\n"
"of Zot deep down in the dungeon and bring it back to the surface. To enter the\n"
"realm of Zot, you'll first need to collect three runes to be found in various\n"
"branches of the dungeon.\n"
"\n"
"However, if you're new to the game, you really shouldn't worry about this. Just\n"
"try to delve as deeply as possible and have fun exploring the many side\n"
"branches in Crawl with various characters of different species, skill sets, and\n"
"religions.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 显然是为了生存和胜利。为此你需要深入地牢找到佐特宝珠，然后把它带回地面。\n"
"你需要先要从地牢的不同分支收集三个符文，才能进入佐特领域。\n"
"\n"
"但如果你是刚开始玩这个游戏，这些你就都不用考虑了。\n"
"先试着用各种角色、种族、技能集和信仰，尽可能深地探索Crawl的各个分支，\n"
"体验其中的乐趣。\n"

#. key: q:userdir
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:userdir"
msgid ""
"I can't find my save files, morgue and character dumps. Where are they?\n"
msgstr ""
"我找不到保存的文件，死亡记录和角色记录。他们都在哪儿呢？\n"

#. key: a:userdir
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:userdir"
msgid ""
"If you're playing locally (i.e. not on one of the servers), the chardump\n"
"command will tell you where the morgue file is written, and this information is\n"
"also displayed below the highscore at the end of a game.\n"
"\n"
"The saves/ directory can be found in the same directory as the morgue/ one.\n"
"\n"
"If you'd like to change either location, modify the morgue_dir and/or save_dir\n"
"options in the init file.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果你玩的是单机版，chardump命令可以指引你那些死亡记录文件存在哪里，\n"
"在游戏结束后的高分榜上也有这些信息。\n"
"\n"
"saves/和morgue/目录位于同一目录之中。\n"
"\n"
"如果你想改变保存的位置，\n"
"在init文件中更改morgue_dir和 save_dir的配置参数就可以了。\n"

#. key: q:roguelike difference
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:roguelike difference"
msgid ""
"What are the biggest differences to other popular roguelike games?\n"
msgstr ""
"和其他主流的roguelike游戏相比，最大的不同点在哪里呢？\n"

#. key: a:roguelike difference
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:roguelike difference"
msgid ""
"A: First, you might want to read the philosophy section in the manual ('?N') to\n"
"read about general important principles in Stone Soup's game design.\n"
"\n"
"As for specific differences, the most important are probably the following:\n"
"\n"
"* Species is *much* more important than the character background (or \"class\").\n"
"\n"
"* Bones files only contain ghosts, never their equipment or cause of death.\n"
"\n"
"* You cannot sell items to shops or elsewhere.\n"
"\n"
"* Resistances can be gained via mutations or items, never through eating.\n"
"\n"
"* There are inevitable deaths, but new players can win without spoilers, if\n"
"  they learn from their mistakes. Very good players can win several consecutive\n"
"  games.\n"
"\n"
"Also, our aim is to give Crawl a really smooth interface, so you should really\n"
"read through the command list ('??') some time. The following commands are\n"
"particularly convenient:\n"
"\n"
"* 'o', for automatic exploration of an unknown level\n"
"\n"
"* 'G', for automatic travel to another level ('G?' for help)\n"
"\n"
"* 'X', to access the level map for travelling and other tasks ('X?')\n"
"\n"
"* 'Ctrl-F', to find and travel to items you've seen before ('Ctrl-F?')\n"
"\n"
"* 'Tab', to move towards or attack the nearest monster\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 首先，你得去读读手册（'?N'）中“游戏哲学”这一章节，\n"
"这里面写了关于石头汤这个游戏设计思路的很多关键要点。\n"
"\n"
"至于具体差异，最重要的可能是以下几点：\n"
"\n"
"* 种族要比角色职业（或“类别”）重要*得多*。\n"
"\n"
"* 骨档包含鬼魂，但不会记录生前的装备和死亡的原因。\n"
"\n"
"* 你无法在商店或别的地方卖出东西。\n"
"\n"
"* 可以通过变异、物品来获得抗性，但吃东西可不行。\n"
"\n"
"* 死亡是难免的，但新手也能在不看攻略的情况下取胜，\n"
"  如果他们能从错误中汲取教训的话。优秀的玩家甚至以不断取得几次连胜。\n"
"\n"
"此外，我们旨在为Crawl提供一个真正人性化的界面，因此，\n"
"你应该花些时间阅读命令列表('??')。下列命令非常方便实用：\n"
"\n"
"* 'o'，自动探索一个未知楼层\n"
"\n"
"* 'G'，自动前往另一楼层（'G?'查看帮助）\n"
"\n"
"* 'X'，显示楼层地图，以进行移动或执行其他任务（'X?'）\n"
"\n"
"* 'Ctrl-F'寻找之前遇到的物品（'Ctrl-F?'）\n"
"\n"
"* 'Tab'，自动接近、攻击附近的怪物\n"

#. key: q:survival
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:survival"
msgid ""
"How can I avoid dying all the time? Can you give me some playing tips?\n"
msgstr ""
"如何才能避免死亡？有什么游戏技巧？\n"

#. key: a:survival
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:survival"
msgid ""
"A: If you've got trouble even reaching the Temple, you might want to try a game\n"
"or two in hints mode for some general playing hints.\n"
"\n"
"Also, there are easy playing combinations and more challenging ones (marked in\n"
"dark grey on the selection screen). If you are new to Crawl, sticking to the\n"
"easier ones is advisable. In general, treat each new monster you meet with\n"
"utmost caution, try to choose the location where you fight monsters, and keep\n"
"an eye on your health and magic.\n"
"\n"
"For specific hints dealing with a particular character, you can press '#'\n"
"in-game to create a \"character dump\" in your morgue directory that details your\n"
"equipment, items, skilling, and available spells. You can share this with other\n"
"players to get feedback and advice through any of the community discussion\n"
"resources listed at http://crawl.develz.org/.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 如果你连到达神庙都觉得困难，则可能需要在提示模式下尝试一两个游戏，\n"
"以获得一些常规的游玩提示。\n"
"\n"
"此外，还有简单的组合和更具挑战性的组合（在选择屏幕上以深灰色标记）。\n"
"如果你对Crawl不熟悉，建议先坚持使用更简单的组合。\n"
"通常，要格外小心地处理遇到的每个新怪物，试着挑选与怪物战斗的位置，\n"
"并时刻留意自己的生命值与魔法值。\n"
"\n"
"对于涉及特定角色的特定提示，\n"
"你可以在游戏中按'#'以在morgue目录中创建“角色记录”，\n"
"详细说明你的装备、物品、技能和可用法术。\n"
"你可以在http://crawl.develz.org/ 这个网页上列出的社区中向其他玩家分享它，\n"
"以获取反馈和建议。\n"
"\n"

#. key: q:downstairs
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:downstairs"
msgid ""
"I can't find any downstairs. Am I missing something?\n"
msgstr ""
"我找不到向下的楼梯。我是不是错过了什么啊？\n"

#. key: a:downstairs
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:downstairs"
msgid ""
"A: They may be in a part of the level that is not reachable from the upstairs\n"
"you came from. Try going up to the previous level and coming back down from\n"
"there via a different set of stairs. Note that most levels feature three\n"
"downstairs as well as three upstairs, not counting any escape hatches.\n"
"\n"
"Alternatively, if you are in one of the branches, you might also have reached\n"
"its lowest level and have to turn around to explore another one. Check the\n"
"dungeon overview ('Ctrl-O') to see how deep you've delved into a given branch,\n"
"or the database ('?/b') for the number of levels for unseen branches.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 它们可能位于楼上的那个楼梯无法连通到本层一块区域中。尝试到上一层，\n"
"然后从另一个楼梯那里下来。请注意，大多数楼层有着三个上楼楼梯，三个下楼楼梯，\n"
"这里面不纳入任何逃生通道。\n"
"\n"
"也有可能，你已经到了某一分支的最低层，必须转而探索另一个分支。\n"
"查看地牢概述（'Ctrl-O'）以了解你在某一分支的深入程度，\n"
"或查看数据库（'?/b'）以了解未探索分支的楼层数。\n"

#. key: q:cheating
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:cheating"
msgid ""
"Is there a cheating mode to Crawl where I can play without dying?\n"
msgstr ""
"Crawl有没有作弊模式，这样我就不用死亡？\n"

#. key: a:cheating
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:cheating"
msgid ""
"A: Press '+'!\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 按'+'！\n"

#. key: q:weapons
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:weapons"
msgid ""
"I've got two cool weapons. How can I tell which one is better?\n"
msgstr ""
"我捡了两把很棒的武器。怎么才能比较哪个更好？\n"

#. key: a:weapons
#. Preserve @marker@ substitutions exactly.
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:weapons"
msgid ""
"A: \"Better\" depends on a number of factors, such as your weapon skills, whether\n"
"it's one- or two-handed, the randart properties, the weapon brand, and the\n"
"monsters you're about to face. In general, switching from a weapon type at\n"
"which you are already highly skilled to another one that you have no skill in\n"
"is a waste of time. The brands may greatly differ in damage output, but you can\n"
"get a good idea by bashing a few comparatively harmless monsters with each and\n"
"comparing the results.\n"
"\n"
"The delay in swinging a weapon can be reduced by the corresponding weapon skill.\n"
"You can view your delay and damage rating with a weapon by reading its\n"
"description or pressing '@' while the weapon is equipped. '@' works while\n"
"unarmed too.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 武器的好坏从很多方面来看，比如你的武器技能、它是单手还是双手武器、\n"
"随机神器属性、武器印记，以及你要面对的敌人类型。通常，\n"
"从一种你已经很熟练的武器类型切换到另一种你还不熟练的武器类型就是浪费时间。\n"
"印记在伤害输出上可能有很大不同，\n"
"你也可以通过攻击几个没什么威胁的怪物试试哪把武器更好。\n"
"\n"
"武器的攻击延迟可以通过提升武器技能等级来降低。\n"

#. key: q:religion
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:religion"
msgid ""
"Which gods would you recommend to a beginning player?\n"
msgstr ""
"对于新手来说，推荐皈依哪些神？\n"

#. key: a:religion
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:religion"
msgid ""
"A: The most straightforward gods to play are probably Trog or Okawaru (for melee\n"
"combat), Hepliaklqana or Okawaru (for ranged combat), Vehumet or Sif Muna (for\n"
"spellcasting). Also, while unreliable, Xom can be a lot of fun.\n"
"\n"
"Whenever you encounter an altar, be sure to read the corresponding god's\n"
"description (by praying on the altar with '>') and take your time in deciding\n"
"whether to pick this deity or not. As a follower, you can reread your god's\n"
"description, now more detailed via the '!' toggle, on the '^' screen.\n"
"\n"
"You're guaranteed to find altars to almost every god on the first ten levels of\n"
"the main dungeon.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 最直接的神灵可能是特洛戈或奥卡瓦鲁（用于提升近战和远程战斗能力），\n"
"维胡梅特或席夫·穆纳（用于提升施法能力）和\n"
"伊莱德莱姆努尔（用于召唤亡灵盟友）。\n"
"另外，虽然不可靠，但佐姆可能会很有趣。\n"
"\n"
"每当你遇到一个祭坛时，请务必阅读相应神的描述（通过在祭坛上用 '>'祈祷），\n"
"并花点时间决定是否皈依这个神灵。作为追随者，你可以重新阅读神的描述，\n"
"现在还可以通过'!'在'^'界面上切换为更详细的描述。\n"
"\n"
"你一定会在地牢的前九层找到几乎所有神的祭坛。\n"

#. key: q:ghosts
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:ghosts"
msgid ""
"I keep getting murdered by my own ghosts. Can I deactivate them?\n"
msgstr ""
"我一直被自己的鬼魂杀掉。我可以关掉它们吗？\n"

#. key: a:ghosts
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:ghosts"
msgid ""
"A: There isn't any such option, and we're not planning to add one, either.\n"
"\n"
"Keep in mind that you don't absolutely have to fight every monster you\n"
"meet, and with ghosts it's even easier: they are generated in sealed\n"
"vaults, and it is your choice whether to open each ghost vault.\n"
"\n"
"Alternatively, you could play a couple characters of strong species/background\n"
"combinations for the sole purpose of busting those ghosts, e.g. Troll\n"
"Berserkers. Or play online, where you'll mostly be killed by others' ghosts\n"
"instead!\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 没有任何这样的选项，并且我们也不打算添加一个。\n"
"\n"
"请记住，你不必和遇到的每个怪物战斗，而且与鬼魂战斗甚至要更容易：\n"
"他们总是在被封印的宝库中生成，而你可以选择是否要打开各个鬼魂宝库。\n"
"\n"
"另外，你也可以选用强势的种族和职业，比如巨魔狂战士，专门用来消灭这些鬼魂。\n"
"如果是在线游戏，那你很可能要被他人的鬼魂杀死！\n"

#. key: q:abyss
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:abyss"
msgid ""
"I've somehow ended up in a place called \"Abyss\". How do I get out of here?\n"
msgstr ""
"我已经以某种方式到达了一个叫做“深渊”的地方。我怎么才能离开这里？\n"

#. key: a:abyss
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:abyss"
msgid ""
"A: If you are in the Abyss for the first time, chances of getting out are\n"
"slim. Still, here are a few general hints:\n"
"\n"
"* You need to find a gateway leading out of the Abyss. These are rare!\n"
"\n"
"* Don't stick around to fight; move as much as possible!\n"
"\n"
"* If you have it, use defensive equipment (weapons of protection, etc.).\n"
"\n"
"* Use teleportation to end up in a completely new part of the Abyss. (But keep\n"
"  in mind that teleportation will take much longer to kick in than in the\n"
"  Dungeon...)\n"
"\n"
"* Consider switching your allegiance to Lugonu, the god of the Abyss. Upon\n"
"  conversion, you will be able to escape the Abyss immediately (but you may\n"
"  anger your previous god!).\n"
"\n"
"* Descending deeper in the Abyss will increase the chance of finding an exit\n"
"  out, but also increase the danger you face.\n"
"\n"
"* Killing enemies can create a gateway out, but most enemies will be\n"
"  too dangerous to fight; pick your battles carefully!\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 如果你是第一次进入深渊，那么能够离开的机会很小。不过，\n"
"这里仍然有一些一般性提示：\n"
"\n"
"* 你需要找到能走出深渊的出口。它们很少！\n"
"\n"
"* 不要恋战，尽可能移动！\n"
"\n"
"* 如果你有的话，使用防御装备（防护武器等）。\n"
"\n"
"* 通过传送到达深渊的一个全新区域。（但要记住，\n"
"  在深渊中传送花费的时间要长于在地牢之中……）\n"
"\n"
"* 考虑转而皈依深渊之神卢格努。一旦皈依，你就能立刻逃出深渊\n"
"  （但这可能会触怒你之前的神！）。\n"
"\n"
"*  深入深渊会增加找到出路的机会，但也会增加你面临的危险。\n"
"\n"
"* 可以通过杀死敌人来创造出一个出口，但大多数敌人都过于危险，因此，\n"
"  一定要小心地、有选择地战斗！\n"

#. key: q:randart
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:randart"
msgid ""
"What do the terms \"randart\" and \"unrandart\" signify?\n"
msgstr ""
"术语“ 随机神器”和“ 非随机神器”分别表示什么？\n"

#. key: a:randart
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:randart"
msgid ""
"A: Apart from the standard items you'll find lying around in the dungeon, you\n"
"might also stumble upon artefacts which come in two varieties:\n"
"\n"
"* randart: a random artefact, usually a weapon, armour or jewellery, with\n"
"  random properties such as conferring resistances or abilities.\n"
"\n"
"* unrandart: a rarer variety of artefact that is predefined instead of randomly\n"
"  generated. Most unrandarts are identified on sight, and some come with\n"
"  special effects or unique abilities that are not available elsewhere.\n"
"\n"
"Neither of these types can be enchanted or branded, either temporarily or\n"
"permanently.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 在地牢中除了可以找到的普通物品外，你还可能会偶然发现有两种不同的神器：\n"
"\n"
"* 随机神器：随机的神器通常是武器、防具或首饰，它们具有随机属性，\n"
"  能带来抗性或能力。\n"
"\n"
"* 非随机神器：稀有的神器，其属性是预先定义好的，而非随机生成的。\n"
"  大多数非随机神器一眼就能鉴定出来，具有别的地方没有的特殊效果或独特能力。\n"
"\n"
"这些神器都不能被暂时或永久地附魔或烙印。\n"

#. key: q:interact
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:interact"
msgid ""
"Is there a way for me to interact with other players?\n"
msgstr ""
"可以多人联机玩吗？\n"

#. key: a:interact
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:interact"
msgid ""
"A: If you play online you can watch games in progress, other players can watch\n"
"you while you play, and you can kill other players' ghosts. You can even send\n"
"and receive messages.\n"
"\n"
"See http://crawl.develz.org/ to find an online server. The website also lists\n"
"community discussion resources for Discord, Reddit, and IRC.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 如果你玩的是在线版的，你可以在线观看其他玩家的游戏，\n"
"其他玩家也可以看你玩，你也可以杀死其他玩家的鬼魂。\n"
"你甚至可以在游戏中收发信息。\n"
"\n"
"在http://crawl.develz.org/ 上，可以找到在线服务器。\n"
"该网站还列出了Discord、Reddit和IRC社区讨论资源。\n"

#. key: q:version
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:version"
msgid ""
"When will development reach the \"stable\" version 1.0?\n"
msgstr ""
"什么时候才能开发出“稳定”的1.0版本？\n"

#. key: a:version
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:version"
msgid ""
"A: Actually, by now we consider Stone Soup to be reasonably stable for a game\n"
"of such active development, so please don't get hung up about the 0.X\n"
"versioning and give it a try.\n"
"\n"
"We've mostly kept the versioning for historic reasons and because it might\n"
"cause undue confusion. We might decide to change that at some point, but maybe\n"
"we won't.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 我们认为对于一款处于积极开发状态的游戏来说，石头汤已经相当稳定，\n"
"所以请不要因为版本号是0.X而烦恼，尝试一下。\n"
"\n"
"因为某些历史原因，我们必须这么保持版本号，否则将会引起不必要的混乱。\n"
"我们或许会在某个时候改变这一点，也有可能不会。\n"

#. key: q:beta
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:beta"
msgid ""
"Is there a way for me to play the new version before it is released?\n"
msgstr ""
"在新版本正式发布前，我可以玩玩测试版么？\n"

#. key: a:beta
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:beta"
msgid ""
"A: There certainly is! You can play \"trunk\" (what will eventually become the\n"
"next version) online on any of the online servers; https://crawl.develz.org\n"
"also hosts Windows and Mac binaries you can download. Note that trunk may be\n"
"buggy, and that very rarely a bug may invalidate your saved games. If that\n"
"doesn't bother you, go ahead and play!\n"
"\n"
"Please report bugs on github (https://github.com/crawl/crawl/issues).\n"
"\n"
"When doing so, please mention the version (see '?v') you're currently playing,\n"
"in case the bug's already been fixed or the feature already implemented.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 当然有！你可以在任何在线服务器上游玩“ trunk”（最终将成为下一版本）；\n"
"https://crawl.develz.org 还存储着可下载的Windows和Mac版本的游戏文件。\n"
"请注意，trunk可能有问题，而且错误可能会有小概率让你保存的游戏无效。\n"
"如果那不影响你，请继续玩！\n"
"\n"
"一定要在github上（https://github.com/crawl/crawl/issues）报告错误。\n"
"如果你有mantis账号的话，也可以使用错误跟踪器。\n"
"（https://crawl.develz.org/mantis/）。\n"
"\n"
"当你这样做时，请提及当前正在游玩的游戏版本（见'?v'），\n"
"以免出现错误已被修复或功能已经实现的情况。\n"

#. key: q:bug
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:bug"
msgid ""
"The game keeps crashing. / I think I found a bug. What do I do?\n"
msgstr ""
"游戏一直崩溃，/ 我觉得我找到了一个错误。我该怎么办？\n"

#. key: a:bug
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:bug"
msgid ""
"A: Please submit a bug report on github (https://github.com/crawl/crawl/issues),\n"
"and give as much information as you can:\n"
"\n"
"* What were you doing at the time?\n"
"\n"
"* What did you expect to happen, what happened instead, etc.\n"
"\n"
"* Most importantly, what version are you playing?\n"
"  (If you're not sure, you can check in-game with '?v'.)\n"
"\n"
"* Console or tiles?\n"
"\n"
"For crashes or monsters/items/levels behaving oddly, we probably need a save\n"
"file. If you're playing online console, you can create a copy of your save file\n"
"for the developers to access by selecting the version you are playing and then\n"
"pressing 'A' for Advanced options. Don't forget to include the server and your\n"
"username in your bug report!\n"
"\n"
"Sometimes a screenshot can be helpful. If there are error messages, please\n"
"write them down. Short of a save file, a guide on how to reproduce the crash\n"
"(or bug) can be useful; you can use wizard mode for this.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks in advance!\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 请在github（https://github.com/crawl/crawl/issues）或Mantis\n"
"（https://crawl.develz.org/mantis/）上提交错误报告，并提供尽可能多的信息：\n"
"\n"
"* 那时你在做什么？\n"
"\n"
"*你期望发生什么，实际发生了什么，等等。\n"
"\n"
"* 最重要的是，你玩的哪个版本？\n"
"  （如果不确定，则可以在游戏中使用'?v'进行查看。）\n"
"\n"
"* 控制台或者图形版？\n"
"\n"
"对于崩溃或是怪物/物品/楼层的异常行为，我们可能需要一个存档文件。\n"
"如果你玩的是在线控制台版本，则可以通过选择要游玩的版本，\n"
"然后按'A'使用高级选项来创建保存文件的副本，以供开发人员访问。\n"
"不要忘记在你提交的错误报告中包含服务器和用户名！\n"
"\n"
"有时截图会很有用。如果有错误消息，请记录下来。如果没有存档文件，\n"
"则有关如何重现崩溃（或错误）的指导可能会很有用；为此，你可能会用到向导模式。\n"
"\n"
"先行致谢！\n"

#. key: q:idea
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:idea"
msgid ""
"I've got a cool idea! What can I do with it?\n"
msgstr ""
"我有个很酷的想法！该跟谁说？\n"

#. key: a:idea
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:idea"
msgid ""
"A: If you'd like your idea to get in, your surest bet is to put it in a place\n"
"where a developer can see it. One good place is the official forum, at\n"
"https://tavern.dcss.io/. If it catches the interest of at least one coder,\n"
"chances are it'll make it into the game.\n"
"\n"
"Note that your idea has a better chance of being accepted if you present the\n"
"ramifications on gameplay. (\"How does [adding/removing X] make the game\n"
"better?\") A suggestion for how to improve the interface may go in without much\n"
"ado, but other suggestions will probably require to defend & justify them.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 如果你希望将想法付诸实践，\n"
"那么最好的选择就是将其发布在开发人员可以看到的地方。\n"
"官方论坛是一个合适的地方，网址为https://tavern.dcss.io/。\n"
"如果这个想法至少吸引了一个开发人员的兴趣，那就很有可能会加入游戏。\n"
"\n"
"注意，如果你在游戏玩法上有更好的建议，那它更有可能被接受。\n"
"（“关于[添加/删除 XXX]会怎样使游戏变得更好？”）\n"
"而关于如何改善界面的建议可能没有多大用处，另外，\n"
"对于其他建议你可能需要辩护、证明其价值。\n"

#. key: q:help
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:help"
msgid ""
"I'd like to help improve the game. What can I do?\n"
msgstr ""
"我想帮助改善游戏。我该怎么办？\n"

#. key: a:help
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:help"
msgid ""
"A: There are several areas where you can get creative and outside help is much\n"
"appreciated. These are:\n"
"\n"
"* maps/vaults (see dat/ directory, docs/develop/levels/introduction.txt)\n"
"\n"
"* monster speech (see dat/database/, docs/develop/monster_speech.txt)\n"
"\n"
"* monster/item/spell descriptions (see dat/descript/)\n"
"\n"
"* tiles (see source/rltiles/, docs/develop/tiles_creation.txt)\n"
"\n"
"Also, if you'd like to write a patch but don't know how to go about it, read\n"
"patch_guide.txt in the docs/develop/ directory. Submit it and other new things\n"
"at our github repository: https://github.com/crawl/crawl/issues\n"
"\n"
"Keep in mind that without previous discussions, we may not be able to use the\n"
"patch, or it might need heavy modification. It's possible that it won't be\n"
"accepted, usually for one of three reasons:\n"
"\n"
"* It doesn't fit into the Crawl world as we see it.\n"
"\n"
"* It violates Crawl's philosophy to avoid grinding and spoiler-heavy stuff.\n"
"\n"
"* We just don't think it's interesting enough to ever be implemented.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks a lot for your support!\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 你可以在这几个方面发挥创造力，并且我们非常感谢你的外援。这些是：\n"
"\n"
"* 地图/宝库（见dat/ directory, docs/develop/levels/introduction.txt）\n"
"\n"
"* 怪物的语句（见dat/database/, docs/develop/monster_speech.txt）\n"
"\n"
"* 怪物/物品/法术的描述（见dat/descript/）\n"
"\n"
"* 贴图（见source/rltiles/, docs/develop/tiles_creation.txt）\n"
"\n"
"另外，如果你想编写补丁程序，但不知道该怎么做，\n"
"请阅读docs/develop/目录中的patch_guide.txt。\n"
"在我们的Mantis跟踪器上提交它和其他新内容：https://crawl.develz.org/mantis/\n"
"\n"
"请记住，如果没有事先的讨论，我们可能无法使用该补丁，\n"
"或者可能需要对它进行大量修改。它也有可能不被接受，通常是由于以下三个原因：\n"
"\n"
"* 正如我们所看到的，它不适合Crawl的世界。\n"
"\n"
"* 它违反了Crawl的哲学，即避免磨损和破坏重物。\n"
"\n"
"* 也有可能我们只是认为它没有足够的趣味而没有实施。\n"
"\n"
"非常感谢你的支持！\n"

#. key: q:changes
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:changes"
msgid ""
"What did you change in the most recent version?\n"
msgstr ""
"你们在最新版本中做了哪些更改？\n"

#. key: a:changes
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:changes"
msgid ""
"A: The admittedly highly subjective highlights of the most recent major release\n"
"are listed along with the version information under '?v'. For older releases'\n"
"changes, check out changelog.txt in the docs/ directory.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: 在最近的主要发行版本中，\n"
"无可否认只是我们主观认为的亮点及版本信息均会列出，\n"
"按'?v'进行查看。有关旧版本的更改，请查看目录中的changelog.txt。\n"

#. key: q:tiles lag
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:q:tiles lag"
msgid ""
"The Tiles version is awfully slow! How can I improve that?\n"
msgstr ""
"图像版真的好慢！怎样才能让它跑得快点？\n"

#. key: a:tiles lag
#: dat/database/FAQ.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:FAQ:a:tiles lag"
msgid ""
"A: Crawl renders its graphics using OpenGL and SDL. Because it uses OpenGL, it\n"
"depends on a little bit of hardware acceleration to not run slowly. If your\n"
"system is not set up to enable this, then Crawl will run quite poorly.\n"
"\n"
"On Windows, the default driver that ships with Windows is extremely slow. Make\n"
"sure to update your graphics card driver to the latest one available. On Linux,\n"
"you should be sure to enable DRI.\n"
"\n"
"In addition to these suggestions, you can also try to see whether tweaking some\n"
"options will improve performance. See docs/tiles_help.txt for details. If\n"
"things are still too laggy after all of that, you could try the non-graphical\n"
"console version, or wait for a future version that does not depend on OpenGL.\n"
msgstr ""
"A: Crawl使用OpenGL和SDL渲染其图形。因为它用的是OpenGL，\n"
"所以要依靠一点硬件加速才能使其迅速运行。如果你的系统未启用此功能，\n"
"那么Crawl会运行得很差。\n"
"\n"
"在Windows上，Windows自带的默认驱动程序运行得非常缓慢。\n"
"确保将你的显卡驱动程序更新为最新可用版本。在Linux上，你应确保启用了DRI。\n"
"\n"
"除了这些建议之外，你还可以尝试查看调整某些选项是否可以提高性能。\n"
"有关详细信息，请参阅docs/tiles_help.txt。如果做了这一切还是太卡，\n"
"则可以尝试使用非图形的控制台版本，或者等待不依赖OpenGL的未来版本。\n"

#. key: welcome
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:welcome"
msgid ""
"<white>Welcome to Dungeon Crawl!</white>\n"
"\n"
"Your objective is to lead your <w>{{ return you.race() }} {{ return you.class()\n"
"}}</w> safely through the depths of the dungeon, retrieving the fabled Orb of\n"
"Zot and returning it to the surface. In the beginning, however, let discovery\n"
"be your main goal. Try to delve as deeply as possible but beware; death lurks\n"
"around every corner.\n"
"\n"
"For the moment, just remember the following keys and their functions:\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input> — shows the items and the commands\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_SAVE_GAME]</input>  — saves the game, to be resumed later\n"
"(but note that death is permanent)\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</input>  — examines something in your vicinity\n"
"\n"
"The hint mode will help you play Crawl without reading any documentation. If\n"
"you haven't yet, you might want to try out the tutorial. Also, if you feel\n"
"intrigued, there is more information available in the following files from the\n"
"docs/ directory (all of which can also be read in-game):\n"
"  <lightblue>quickstart.txt</lightblue>     — A very short guide to Crawl.\n"
"  <lightblue>crawl_manual.txt</lightblue>   — This contains all details on\n"
"species, magic, skills, etc.\n"
"  <lightblue>options_guide.txt</lightblue>  — Crawl's interface is highly\n"
"configurable. This document explains all the options.\n"
"\n"
"Happy Crawling!\n"
msgstr ""
"<white>欢迎你来到Dungeon Crawl的游戏世界！</white>\n"
"\n"
"你的任务是扮演<w>{{ return you.race() }} {{ return you.class() }}</w>\n"
"角色深入地城深处，找到传说中的佐特之球并带着它返回地面。不过，在刚开始玩的时候，\n"
"你只要探索地城就好。尽你所能层层推进，不过要小心：死亡的危险无处不在。\n"
"\n"
"目前，你只需要记住以下按键的功能：\n"
"  <white>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</white> — 显示物品及命令\n"
"  <white>$cmd[CMD_SAVE_GAME]</white>  — 保存游戏，以便以后继续目前的进度（注意：\n"
"如果死了，就没法重来了）\n"
"  <white>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</white>  — 调查附近的某个物体\n"
"\n"
"提示模式可以帮助你进行游戏而不用阅读游戏说明。如果你还没有玩过教程关卡，\n"
"建议你先尝试通过教程关。当然，如果你想对这个游戏有深入的了解，你可以在docs/\n"
"directory\n"
"文件夹中阅读以下文档以获取更加详细的游戏资料（所有这些资料在游戏内也能阅读）：\n"
"  <lightblue>quickstart.txt</lightblue>     — 简短的游戏入门说明。\n"
"  <lightblue>crawl_manual.txt</lightblue>   — 包括种族、魔法、\n"
"技能等等的详细说明。\n"
"  <lightblue>options_guide.txt</lightblue>  — 游戏设置详解。\n"
"Crawl的界面有很多地方是可以让玩家自由设置的。\n"
"\n"
"祝你游戏愉快！\n"

#. key: death
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death"
msgid ""
"Condolences! Your character's premature death is a sad, but common occurrence\n"
"in Crawl. Rest assured that with diligence and playing experience your\n"
"characters will last longer.\n"
"\n"
"Perhaps the following advice can improve your playing style:\n"
msgstr ""
"真遗憾！你角色的英年早逝令人悲伤，不过这在本作中是常有的事。不管怎么说，\n"
"失败是成功之母，你长久积累下来的游戏经验会帮助你以后的角色走得更远。\n"
"\n"
"也许下面的一些建议可以帮助你提高游戏水平：\n"

#. key: death conjurer melee
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death conjurer melee"
msgid ""
"As a Conjurer your main weapon should be offensive magic. Cast spells more\n"
"often! Remember to rest when your Magic is low.\n"
msgstr ""
"作为一个塑能师，你的主要武器应是攻击性魔法。施法多多益善！牢记一点：\n"
"在魔力比较低的时候你需要休息来回复魔力。\n"

#. key: death berserker unberserked
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death berserker unberserked"
msgid ""
"Don't forget to go berserk when fighting particularly difficult foes. It's\n"
"risky, but makes you faster and beefier.\n"
msgstr ""
"当面对特别困难的对手时，别忘记开狂暴。虽然有一定风险，但这会使你变得更快、\n"
"更强壮。\n"

#. key: death ranger melee
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death ranger melee"
msgid ""
"Your bow and arrows are extremely powerful against distant monsters.\n"
msgstr ""
"你的弓与箭能非常有效地打击远处的敌人，所以应尽量搜集地城中有用的箭矢。\n"

#. key: death random 0
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death random 0"
msgid ""
"Always consider using projectiles, wands or spells before engaging monsters in\n"
"close combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"尽量在怪物近身之前使用弹药、魔杖或者法术打击它们。\n"

#. key: death random 1
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death random 1"
msgid ""
"Learn when to run away from things you can't handle — this is important! It is\n"
"often wise to skip a particularly dangerous level. But don't overdo this as\n"
"monsters will only get harder the deeper you delve.\n"
msgstr ""
"学会在你搞不定的时候及时脱身——这非常重要！跳过一些难度太大的楼层通常是明智之举。\n"
"不过也不要过度使用这个方法，因为随着地城的深入怪物会越来越强。\n"

#. key: death random 2
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death random 2"
msgid ""
"Rest between encounters, if possible in an area already explored and cleared of\n"
"monsters. Pressing <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input><localtiles>, or\n"
"<input>clicking on the 'rest' button in the command bar'</input></localtiles>\n"
"will rest for 100 turns, or until fully healed.\n"
msgstr ""
"在打完一场战斗后要记得休息，而且最好是在一片已经被清扫完毕的区域。\n"
"游戏中搜索和休息是同时进行的。要搜索一回合，按下 <input>s</input>，\n"
"<input>.</input>， <input>delete</input> 或 <input>小键盘5</input>。按下\n"
"<input>5</input> 或 <input>shift+小键盘5</input> <tiles>，或\n"
"<input>点击属性区域</input></tiles> 会让你休息更长时间（你会停下来休息100回合，\n"
"或是直到完全恢复为止）。\n"

#. key: death random 3
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death random 3"
msgid ""
"Remember to use those scrolls, potions or wands you've found. Learn to\n"
"improvise: you will need to identify potions and scrolls by using them.\n"
msgstr ""
"记得使用你找到的卷轴、药水和魔杖。通常来说，你不能依赖卷轴来鉴定所有的东西。\n"
"你必须学着应对这种情况；有时候你要通过亲自使用物品来鉴定它们。\n"

#. key: death random 5
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death random 5"
msgid ""
"Never fight more than one monster, if you can help it. Always back into a\n"
"corridor so that they are forced to fight you one on one.\n"
msgstr ""
"除非别无选择，否则永远不要同时面对多个怪物。你应该退回到一个狭长通道，\n"
"这样怪物只能挨个与你战斗。\n"

#. key: finished
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:finished"
msgid ""
"Congrats! You survived until the end of hints mode — be sure to try the\n"
"other characters as well. Note that the command help screen\n"
"(<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input>) will look very different from now\n"
"on. Here's a last playing hint:\n"
msgstr ""
"恭喜！你成功通过了提示模式——试试别的模式吧。注意，\n"
"现在命令与帮助界面（按<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input>呼出）\n"
"界面从现在开始会变得和以前完全不同。这里有最后一条游戏提示：\n"

#. key: finished explored
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:finished explored"
msgid ""
"Walking around and exploring levels gets easier by using auto-explore\n"
"(<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>). Crawl will let you automatically move to\n"
"and pick up interesting items.<localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"Autoexploration can also be started by <input>Ctrl-Leftclick</input> on the\n"
"minimap.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以使用自动探索机能 (<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>) 来非常方便地探索地城。\n"
"游戏会将你自动移动至有物品的地方以便你拾取你感兴趣的东西。 <tiles>\n"
"\n"
"你也可以在小地图上按下<input>Ctrl</input> + <input>鼠标左键</input> 来自动探索。\n"
" </tiles>\n"

#. key: finished travel
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:finished travel"
msgid ""
"There is a convenient way to travel between distant dungeon levels: press\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_INTERLEVEL_TRAVEL]</input> and enter the desired destination.\n"
"If your travel gets interrupted, issuing <input>$cmd[CMD_INTERLEVEL_TRAVEL]\n"
"Enter</input> will continue it.\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以很方便地在各个楼层间旅行：按下 <input>$cmd[CMD_INTERLEVEL_TRAVEL]</input>\n"
"或 <input>G</input> 然后输入目的地便可。如果你的旅行被打断了，再按下\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_INTERLEVEL_TRAVEL] Enter</input> 或 <input>G Enter</input>\n"
"就可以继续。\n"

#. key: finished stashes
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:finished stashes"
msgid ""
"You can search among all items existing in the dungeon with the\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> command. For example,\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> <w>“dagger”</w> will list all daggers,\n"
"and allow you to travel to them. You can even search for dungeon features, like\n"
"<w>“shop”</w> or <w>“altar”</w>.\n"
msgstr ""
"按下 <input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> 命令可以搜索地城中所有存在的物品。\n"
"例如：搜索 <input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES] “小刀”</input> 会显示出所有的小刀。\n"
"你可以选择其中的一个，然后自动移动至那里。你也可以搜索诸如 <w>“商店”</w> 或\n"
"<w>“祭坛”</w> 这样的关键词。\n"

#. key: finished random 0
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:finished random 0"
msgid ""
"The game keeps an automated log for your characters. Use\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]:</input> to read it. Once your character\n"
"perishes, two morgue files are left in the <w>morgue/</w> directory. The one\n"
"ending in .txt contains a copy of your log. During play, you can create a dump\n"
"file with <input>$cmd[CMD_CHARACTER_DUMP]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"游戏自动会对你的当前角色进行冒险记录。按下\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]:</input> 来查阅记录。你可以按下\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_MAKE_NOTE]</input> 输入你想记录的信息。一旦你的角色死亡，在\n"
"<w>morgue/</w> 文件夹中会保留两个资料文档，其中那个 .txt\n"
"格式的文件就是该角色的游戏记录。在游戏中你可以按下\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_CHARACTER_DUMP]</input> 来输出一个缓存记录。\n"

#. key: finished random 1
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:finished random 1"
msgid ""
"Crawl has a macro function built in: press <input>$cmd[CMD_MACRO_MENU]</input>\n"
"to define a macro by first specifying a trigger key (say, <input>F1</input>)\n"
"and a command sequence, for example <input>za.</input>. The latter will make\n"
"the <input>F1</input> key always zap the spell in slot a at the nearest\n"
"monster. For more information on macros, type\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]~</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"本游戏还可以使用宏命令：按下 <input>~m</input> 首先设定一个触发快捷键（例如\n"
"<input>F1</input>），然后输入一个命令序列，例如 <input>za+.</input>。\n"
"此后按<input>F1</input> 键就会对最近的怪物施放 a 键位的法术。你可以输入\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]~</input> 来查看有关宏命令的详细说明。\n"

#. key: finished random 2
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:finished random 2"
msgid ""
"The interface can be greatly customised. All options are explained in the file\n"
"<w>options_guide.txt</w> which can be found in the <w>docs</w> directory. The\n"
"options themselves are set in <w>init.txt</w> or <w>.crawlrc</w>. Crawl will\n"
"complain if it can't find either file.\n"
msgstr ""
"游戏界面的很多元素都可以自由设定。 <w>docs</w> 文件夹下的\n"
"<w>options_guide.txt</w> 文件介绍了详细的设定方法。你可以通过修改\n"
"<w>init.txt</w> 或 <w>.crawlrc</w>文件来更改设置。\n"
"如果找不到这两个文件中的任何一个，游戏就会弹出提示。\n"

#. key: finished random 3
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:finished random 3"
msgid ""
"You can ask other Crawl players for advice and help using any of the community\n"
"resources described at http://crawl.develz.org/\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以通过IRC（因特网中继聊天）与其他Crawl玩家进行交流：请移步Libera\n"
"(<w>irc.libera.chat</w>) 上的<w>#crawl</w> 频道。\n"

#. key: hint_convert xom
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:hint_convert xom"
msgid ""
"You've just converted to worshipping <w>Xom</w>. As a follower of Xom, you'll\n"
"be treated like a plaything, randomly helped or harmed for Xom's own amusement.\n"
"\n"
"There is no way to guarantee Xom remains in a good mood - the best any follower\n"
"can hope for is to avoid letting Xom grow bored!\n"
msgstr ""
"你选择了信仰 <w>扫姆</w>。你可以做出好笑的事情来取悦扫姆；\n"
"千万别让这家伙对你失去兴趣！\n"
"\n"
"如果你一直取悦扫姆，他会把你当成他喜欢的玩具，随他高兴帮助你或者伤害你；\n"
"要不然他会把你当成他一件讨厌的玩具来玩弄你。\n"

#. key: hint_convert
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:hint_convert"
msgid ""
"You've just converted to worshipping <w>{{ return you.god() }}</w>. Your piety\n"
"(divine favour) will increase as you do things to please your new god, and will\n"
"gradually decrease over time.\n"
"\n"
"You can check your god's likes and dislikes, as well as your current standing\n"
"and divine abilities, by typing\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</input><localtiles>, or by pressing\n"
"<input>Shift-right-click</input> on your avatar</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"你刚刚选择了转而信仰 <w>{{ return you.god() }}</w>。\n"
"你的信仰度会随着时间慢慢降低，如果太低， {{ return you.god() }}\n"
"会将你驱逐出教会并惩罚你。不过，只要你一直让 {{ return you.god() }} 高兴，\n"
"这种事就不会发生，而且你还能得到神明赏赐的力量和赐品。不用惊慌：\n"
"你一开始就有一定信仰度，因此在短时间内没有受驱逐的危险。\n"
"\n"
"按下 <input>^</input> <tiles> (或者在你的人物上按下 <input>Shift</input> +\n"
"<input>鼠标右键 </input>)</tiles> 可以查看你信仰的神祗的好恶，\n"
"也可以查看你在神祗眼里的地位和神祗赐给你的神力。\n"

#. key: hint_seen_first_object
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:hint_seen_first_object"
msgid ""
"That <console>$1 </console>is an item. If you move there and press\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input><localtiles>, or <input>left-click</input> on it\n"
"in your inventory</localtiles>, you will pick it up.<console> Generally, items\n"
"are shown by non-letter symbols like <w>%?!\"=()[</w>.</console> Some\n"
"objects<tiles>, marked with a green frame,</tiles> will be picked up\n"
"automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Once it is in your inventory, you can drop it again with <localtiles>a\n"
"<input>Shift-left-click</input>. Whenever you <input>right-click</input> on an\n"
"item</localtiles><console><input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input>. Any time you look at an\n"
"item in your inventory (<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>)</console>,\n"
"you can read about its properties and its description.\n"
msgstr ""
"那边<console>那个$1</console>是一个物品，你可以移动过去然后按下\n"
"<input>g</input> 或 <input>,</input> 来拾取它。\n"
"<console>通常物品会以非字母字符如 <w>%?!\"=()[</w>来表示。 </console>\n"
"<tiles>你也可以在站在物品上之后按下<input>鼠标左键</input>来拾取。 </tiles>另外，\n"
"一些物品通常会自动被拾取。 <tiles>（图像模式中这类物品周围会有一个绿色的边框。）\n"
"</tiles>\n"
"\n"
"当拾取进包包之后你可以再次用<tiles><input>Shift</input> +\n"
"<input>鼠标左键点击</w >组合键来丢弃这个物品。\n"
"你还可以在一个物品上按<input>鼠标右键</input></tiles><console><input>d键\n"
"</w>来丢弃这个物品。你还可以打开背包界面（<input>i</input>）\n"
"并选择一个物品</console>来查看该物品的详细描述。\n"

#. key: tutorial intro
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial intro"
msgid ""
"You can reread all messages at any time with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_REPLAY_MESSAGES]</input>. Also, press <input>Space</input>\n"
"<localtiles> or <input>left click</input> with mouse</localtiles> to clear the\n"
"<cyan>--more--</cyan> prompts.\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以按下<input>$cmd[CMD_REPLAY_MESSAGES]</input>随时查看所有消息。另外，\n"
"按下<input>空格</input><localtiles>或鼠标<input>左击</input></localtiles>\n"
"可以清除<cyan>--更多--</cyan> 信息。\n"

#. key: tutorial death
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial death"
msgid ""
"You die...\n"
"\n"
"In Crawl, death is a sad but common occurrence. Note that there's usually\n"
"something you could have done to survive, for example by using some kind of\n"
"item, running away, resting between fights, or by avoiding combat entirely.\n"
"Keep trying, eventually you'll prevail!\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"你死了……\n"
"\n"
"在Crawl中，死亡是一个令人悲伤却又常见的事情。\n"
"注意，通常情况下你可以做一些事情来活下去，\n"
"比如使用某些物品、逃跑、在战斗之间休息，或是干脆回避战斗。\n"
"继续努力，最终你会成功的！\n"
"\n"

#. key: tutorial1 start
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 start"
msgid ""
"In this lesson you're going to learn how to move around and explore a level.\n"
"You can move <localtiles>by clicking somewhere with your <input>Mouse</input>,\n"
"or </localtiles>with the <input>arrow keys</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"这一课中你将学习如何移动以及如何探索楼层。\n"
"你可以用<localtiles>你的<input>鼠标</input>点击某个地方，\n"
"或</localtiles>用<input>方向键</input>进行移动。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 go_on
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 go_on"
msgid ""
"You're doing great! Now, explore a bit until you reach the next blue square.\n"
msgstr ""
"干得好！继续探索，直到你到达下一个蓝色方块标记。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 diagonal
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 diagonal"
msgid ""
":nowrap\n"
"Move diagonally with the <input>number pad</input> (try Numlock on/off)<localtiles>,</localtiles> <console>or the </console><input>vi keys</input><console>.</console><localtiles>, or <input>mouse</input>.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"  Numpad:     <w>7 8 9</w>       vi-keys: <w>   $cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP_LEFT] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP_RIGHT]</w><localtiles>    Mouse:     <w>click</w> on the floor</localtiles>\n"
"               \\|/                     \\|/\n"
"              <w>4</w>-<w>.</w>-<w>6</w> <w>                  $cmd[CMD_MOVE_LEFT]</w>-<w>.</w>-<w>$cmd[CMD_MOVE_RIGHT]</w>\n"
"               /|\\                     /|\\\n"
"              <w>1 2 3</w> <w>                  $cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN_LEFT] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN_RIGHT]</w>\n"
msgstr ""
":nowrap\n"
"斜向移动的话，可以通过<input>数字键盘</input>（试着打开/关闭Numlock）<localtiles>，</localtiles> <console>或</console><input>vi键位</input><console>.</console><localtiles>，或是<input>鼠标</input>。</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"  数字键盘：  <w>7 8 9</w>        vi键位：<w>   $cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP_LEFT] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP_RIGHT]</w><localtiles>    鼠标：     <w>点击</w>地面</localtiles>\n"
"               \\|/                     \\|/\n"
"              <w>4</w>-<w>.</w>-<w>6</w> <w>                  $cmd[CMD_MOVE_LEFT]</w>-<w>.</w>-<w>$cmd[CMD_MOVE_RIGHT]</w>\n"
"               /|\\                     /|\\\n"
"              <w>1 2 3</w> <w>                  $cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN_LEFT] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN_RIGHT]</w>\n"

#. key: tutorial1 shiftmove
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 shiftmove"
msgid ""
"A quicker way to “run” through a corridor is to press <input>Shift</input>\n"
"along with the <input>number pad</input> (try Numlock on/off) or <input>vi\n"
"keys</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"想要快速穿过通道，可以按下<input>Shift</input>\n"
"+<input>数字键盘</input>（试着打开/关闭Numlock）或<input>vi键位</input>。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 downstairs
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 downstairs"
msgid ""
"When standing on a staircase leading downwards, you can enter the next level\n"
"with <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input><localtiles> or with\n"
"a <input>left click</input> on your character</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你站在向下的楼梯口时，\n"
"你可以按下<input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>左击</input>你的角色</localtiles>。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 levelmap
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 levelmap"
msgid ""
"What's this? To find out where you are, <tiles>have a look at the\n"
"<w>minimap</w> to the right of the screen.</tiles><localtiles> You can have a\n"
"closer look at a part of the map with a <input>right mouse click</input> and\n"
"also can travel there with a <input>left click</input>.</localtiles><webtiles>\n"
"You can </webtiles><nomouse>enter the overmap view with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</input> and then move the cursor around to look\n"
"around the level. You also can travel wherever your cursor is pointing by\n"
"pressing <input>.</input> or <input>Enter</input>. Press <input>Escape</input>\n"
"to return to the normal game mode.</nomouse>\n"
msgstr ""
"什么情况？要搞清楚你在哪里，<tiles>请查看位于屏幕右侧的<w>小地图</w>。\n"
"</tiles><localtiles>你可以<input>鼠标右击</input> 仔细查看地图的一部分，\n"
"也可以<input>左击</input>移至那里。\n"
"</localtiles><webtiles>你可以</webtiles><nomouse>按下\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</input>查看整个地图，移动光标浏览整个楼层。\n"
"你也可以按下<input>.</input>或<input>Enter</input>前往光标位置。\n"
"按下<input>Escape</input>返回正常游戏。</nomouse>\n"

#. key: tutorial1 autoexplore
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 autoexplore"
msgid ""
"Exploring manually can get tedious after a while, so you might want to let that\n"
"happen automatically. Try it by pressing <input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>\n"
"<localtiles>, or by clicking on 'autoexplore', the first button in the command\n"
"bar below the minimap.</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"长时间手动探索地图会比较乏味，你可能会希望将其自动进行。\n"
"试着按下<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input><localtiles>，\n"
"或点击“自动探索”，小地图下方的命令栏中的第一个按钮</localtiles>。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 exclusion
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 exclusion"
msgid ""
"Some dangerous ground is marked with <w>exclusions</w>. Autotravel\n"
"<localtiles>(including <input>mouseclick</input>!) </localtiles>will not lead\n"
"you into exclusions. Instead you will automatically stop.\n"
"\n"
"However, autoexplore will move you safely around exclusions: so, you can safely\n"
"continue by pressing <input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"有些危险的地方会被标记为<w>禁区</w>。\n"
"自动行进<localtiles>（包含 <input>鼠标击键</input>！） </localtiles>\n"
"不会将你带往禁区。而是会自动停下来。\n"
"\n"
"自动探索能让你安全地绕过禁区：\n"
"所以，你大可以继续按<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 autoexplore_announce
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 autoexplore_announce"
msgid ""
"Autoexplore will stop when you first see items or dungeon features, like these\n"
"stairs. To travel directly to the stairs, you can\n"
"<localtiles><input>click</input> on them; or you can </localtiles>press\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</input> to enter the map overview, then\n"
"<input><<</input> to move the cursor to the nearest up-stairs, and\n"
"<input>Enter</input> to go there.\n"
msgstr ""
"在第一次碰到物品或地牢地标时，比如这些楼梯，自动探索会停下来。\n"
"如果要直接前往楼梯，可以<localtiles><input>点击</input> 它们；\n"
"或是</localtiles>点击<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</input>以查看地图概览，\n"
"然后<input><<</input>将光标移动到最近楼梯，\n"
"键入<input>Enter</input>开始前往。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 tutorial_end
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 tutorial_end"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've completed the first lesson!\n"
"\n"
"To exit the tutorial, simply go up these stairs with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>left clicking</input> on your character</localtiles>. Confirm the\n"
"resulting prompt with an uppercase <input>Y</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你！你已经成功完成了第一课教程！\n"
"\n"
"要结束此教程，只需按下<input>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>左击</input>你的角色</localtiles>，从这些楼梯上去。\n"
"按大写<input>Y</input>确定。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 newlevel
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 newlevel"
msgid ""
"A new level! To begin with, head over to that door to the right.\n"
"\n"
"Also, remember: You can reread old messages with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_REPLAY_MESSAGES]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到新的一层！首先，移动到右边的那扇门前。\n"
"\n"
"记住：你可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_REPLAY_MESSAGES]</input>来查看之前的提示信息。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 door
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 door"
msgid ""
"You can open a closed door by walking into it.\n"
msgstr ""
"只要向门移动就可以打开这扇门。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 close_door
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 close_door"
msgid ""
"To close an open door, press <input>$cmd[CMD_CLOSE_DOOR]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"关闭一扇门，请按<input>$cmd[CMD_CLOSE_DOOR]</input>。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 water
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 water"
msgid ""
"Note how you can move through shallow but not through deep water.\n"
msgstr ""
"注意，你可以穿过浅水，但是不能穿过深水。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 upstairs
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 upstairs"
msgid ""
"When standing on a staircase leading upwards, you can enter the previous level\n"
"with <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>left clicking</input> on your character</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"当你站在一个向上的楼梯上时，\n"
"你可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>左击</input>你的角色</localtiles>进入上一层。\n"

#. key: tutorial1 exit
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 exit"
msgid ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>Tutorial 1 summary: Movement</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Movement commands</yellow>\n"
"   Numpad:       <w>7 8 9</w>           vi-keys:    <w>$cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP_LEFT] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP_RIGHT]</w>\n"
"                  \\|/                         \\|/\n"
"                 <w>4</w>-<w>.</w>-<w>6</w>                       <w>$cmd[CMD_MOVE_LEFT]</w>-<w>.</w>-<w>$cmd[CMD_MOVE_RIGHT]</w>\n"
"                  /|\\                         /|\\\n"
"                 <w>1 2 3</w>                       <w>$cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN_LEFT] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN_RIGHT]</w>\n"
"\n"
"  <input>Shift + direction</input> moves you several squares in this direction.<localtiles>\n"
"  You also can move by <input>clicking</input> somewhere in sight or on the <w>minimap</w>.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Staircases</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</input>  go back to the previous level\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input>  enter the next level\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]></input>/<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]<<</input> travel to the nearest up/downstairs\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Doors</yellow> can be opened by walking into them\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_CLOSE_DOOR]</input>  close an open door\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Travel</yellow><localtiles>\n"
"  mouseclick on the <w>minimap</w></localtiles><nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</input>  enter the level map, travel with <input>Enter</input></nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>  autoexplore\n"
msgstr ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>教程1总结：移动</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>移动命令</yellow>\n"
"   数字键盘：    <w>7 8 9</w>           vi键位：    <w>$cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP_LEFT] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_UP_RIGHT]</w>\n"
"                  \\|/                         \\|/\n"
"                 <w>4</w>-<w>.</w>-<w>6</w>                       <w>$cmd[CMD_MOVE_LEFT]</w>-<w>.</w>-<w>$cmd[CMD_MOVE_RIGHT]</w>\n"
"                  /|\\                         /|\\\n"
"                 <w>1 2 3</w>                       <w>$cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN_LEFT] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN] $cmd[CMD_MOVE_DOWN_RIGHT]</w>\n"
"\n"
"  <input>Shift + 方向</input>让你在该方向上移动数个格子。<localtiles>\n"
"  你也可以通过<input>点击</input><w>小地图</w>的某个地方进行移动。</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>楼梯</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</input> 回到上一层\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input> 进入下一层\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]></input>/<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]<<</input> 前往最近的楼梯\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>门</yellow> 向门移动即可打开门\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_CLOSE_DOOR]</input>  关闭一扇门\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>移动</yellow><localtiles>\n"
"  鼠标点击<w>小地图</w></localtiles><nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</input>进入本楼层地图，按<input>Enter</input></nomouse>进行移动\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input> 自动探索\n"

#. key: tutorial2 start
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 start"
msgid ""
"This lesson will teach you about monsters and fighting. First, we need a\n"
"weapon! Go and grab the one lying over there.\n"
msgstr ""
"这一课将会教你有关怪物和格斗的内容。\n"
"首先，我们需要一把武器！过去捡起地上那把。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 pickup_weapon
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 pickup_weapon"
msgid ""
"Pick up this weapon<localtiles> by clicking on it in the inventory panel, and\n"
"then wield it by clicking on it again. Alternatively, pick it up</localtiles>\n"
"with <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input> or <input>g</input> and then wield it with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"要捡起这把武器的话，<localtiles>可以在物品栏中点击它，然后再次点击它进行装备。\n"
"捡起它也可以</localtiles>用<input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input>\n"
"或<input>g</input>，装备它则用<input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 melee
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 melee"
msgid ""
"To attack a monster with your bare hands or wielded weapon, simply walk into\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"要用空手或者已经装备的武器攻击敌人，只要向它移动就行了。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 resting
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 resting"
msgid ""
"Very good! You can heal by resting with <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>\n"
"<localtiles>, or by clicking the 'rest' button in the command bar below the\n"
"minimap</localtiles>. This will make you rest until your health is full, but\n"
"will be interrupted by important events.\n"
msgstr ""
"非常好！你可以通过按<input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>\n"
"<localtiles>，或点击小地图下方的命令栏中的“休息”按钮来休息以恢复损失的生命值</localtiles>。\n"
"在身体痊愈前会一直休息，但如果发生重要事件，会被打断。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 wait
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 wait"
msgid ""
"Rather than storm the room and get swarmed by monsters, you can also step back\n"
"and wait (with <input>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>clicking</input> on your character</localtiles>) for them to come to you.\n"
msgstr ""
"与其冲进房间然后被一群怪物围攻，不如退后几步，等待它们自己走过来。\n"
"（按<input>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>点击</input>你的角色</localtiles>），他们就会走向你。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 resting_reminder
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 resting_reminder"
msgid ""
"Remember, you can rest up with <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"记住，你可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>进行休息。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 compare_monster_desc
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 compare_monster_desc"
msgid ""
"Examine these monsters (<localtiles>via <input>mouseover</input></localtiles>\n"
"<nomouse>by pressing <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</input> to enter examine mode,\n"
"and then <input>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_CYCLE_FORWARD]</input> to cycle through nearby\n"
"monsters</nomouse>)\n"
"and compare their descriptions (<localtiles>with <input>rightmouseclick</input></localtiles>\n"
"<nomouse>by pressing <input>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</input> while selecting\n"
"them in examine mode</nomouse>)\n"
"to find out which of these cages is safer to fight through.\n"
msgstr ""
"查看这些怪物（<localtiles>通过 <input>鼠标悬停</input></localtiles>\n"
"<nomouse>按下<input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</input>进入查看模式，\n"
"并用<input>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_CYCLE_FORWARD]</input>循环切换周围怪物</nomouse>）\n"
"接着比较他们的描述（<localtiles>用 <input>鼠标右击</input></localtiles>\n"
"<nomouse>按下<input>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</input>\n"
"在查看模式中选择他们</nomouse>）看看从哪个笼子通过才是最安全的。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 downstairs
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 downstairs"
msgid ""
"Well done! After resting to full health continue to the next level with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input><localtiles> or by <input>clicking</input>\n"
"on your character</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"干得好！休息恢复满生命值之后按\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>点击</input>你的角色</localtiles>进入下一层。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 newlevel
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 newlevel"
msgid ""
"Remember: You can reread old messages with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_REPLAY_MESSAGES]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"记住：你可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_REPLAY_MESSAGES]</input>来查看之前的提示信息。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 boomerangs
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 boomerangs"
msgid ""
"Now, for ranged combat! Pick up these boomerangs with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input> or <input>g</input><localtiles>, or by\n"
"<input>mouseclick</input>,</localtiles> and continue.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在来试试远程攻击！通过按\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input>或<input>g</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>鼠标点击</input>，</localtiles>捡起这些回旋镖并继续。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 throwing
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 throwing"
msgid ""
"You can fire your boomerangs at a monster with <input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]</input>\n"
"<localtiles> or by <input>clicking</input> on them in the inventory\n"
"panel</localtiles>. To confirm the auto-targeted monster, press\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_SELECT]</input> or <input>Enter</input>. You can skip\n"
"this and fire at the closest monster with <input>shift-tab</input> or <input>p</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"要朝一个怪物投掷回旋镖，可以通过<input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或在物品栏中<input>点击</input>它们panel</localtiles>。\n"
"要射向被自动瞄准的怪物，按<input>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_SELECT]</input>\n"
"或<input>Enter</input>。你也可以跳过这个，\n"
"按<input>shift-tab</input>或<input>p</input>，向最近的怪物射击。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 wield_bow
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 wield_bow"
msgid ""
"Pick up this shortbow and wield it with <input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>\n"
"<localtiles> or by <input>mouseclick</input></localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过按<input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>鼠标点击</input></localtiles>捡起这把短弓。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 firing
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 firing"
msgid ""
"Firing arrows from your wielded shortbow works a bit differently from throwing boomerangs.\n"
"Use <input>$cmd[CMD_PRIMARY_ATTACK]</input><localtiles> or <input>mouseclick</input>\n"
"</localtiles>. You can change the targeted monster by pressing\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_CYCLE_FORWARD]</input> while in target mode. The worm is\n"
"harmless behind the lava, so concentrate on the dummy which can fire at you.\n"
"Again, confirm your choice with <input>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_SELECT]</input> or\n"
"<input>Enter</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"用装备的短弓射箭的操作与投掷回旋镖的操作稍有不同。\n"
"通过按<input>$cmd[CMD_PRIMARY_ATTACK]</input><localtiles>或<input>鼠标点击</input>\n"
"</localtiles>。在瞄准时，你可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_CYCLE_FORWARD]</input>选择其他目标。\n"
"这只蠕虫在熔岩后面无法对你造成任何威胁，但是那个假人可以射击你，因此先搞定它。\n"
"同样，按<input>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_SELECT]</input>或<input>Enter</input>确定你选择的目标。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 travel_reminder
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 travel_reminder"
msgid ""
"Remember that you can autoexplore using <input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"记住，你可以用<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>自动探索。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 explore
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 explore"
msgid ""
"Find the exit! Remember that you can autoexplore using\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"去找出口吧！记住，你可以用<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>自动探索。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 tutorial_end
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 tutorial_end"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've survived your first batch of monsters! To exit the\n"
"tutorial, simply go down these stairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你！你已经成功地从你的第一批怪物手中活下来了！\n"
"只要从楼梯走下去就可以退出此教程。\n"

#. key: tutorial2 exit
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial2 exit"
msgid ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>Tutorial 2 summary: Combat</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Weapons<console> <cyan>)</cyan></console></yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input>  pick up an item\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>  equip an item<localtiles>\n"
"  You can also do this by <input>clicking</input> on the weapon in your inventory.</localtiles>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_QUIVER_ITEM]</input>  adjust your quiver\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Monsters</yellow><localtiles>\n"
"  <input>mouseover</input>  examine a monster\n"
"  <input>rightclick</input> read a more detailed description</localtiles><nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</input>  examine a monster\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</input> read a more detailed description</nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PRIMARY_ATTACK]</input> fire held weapon\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_SELECT]</input> fire quiver at pre-targeted monster\n"
"  <input>shift-tab</input>, <input>p</input> fire quiver at closest monster\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_CYCLE_FORWARD]</input> target another monster<localtiles>\n"
"  You can also fire a missile by <input>clicking</input> on it, then confirming the target with <input>Enter</input>.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Resting</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</input>  wait and rest a single turn\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>  wait and rest up to 100 turns\n"
msgstr ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>教程2总结：战斗</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>武器<console> <cyan>)</cyan></console></yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input> 捡起物品\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>装备物品<localtiles>\n"
"  你也可以在你的物品栏中<input>点击</input>武器进行装备。</localtiles>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_QUIVER_ITEM]</input> 调整你的弹药\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>怪物</yellow><localtiles>\n"
"  <input>鼠标悬停</input> 查看怪物\n"
"  <input>右键</input>查看详细描述</localtiles><nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</input> 查看怪物\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</input> 查看详细描述</nomouse>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PRIMARY_ATTACK]</input> 用所持武器射击\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_SELECT]</input> 向一个被瞄准的怪物射出弹药\n"
"  <input>shift-tab</input>, <input>p</input> 向一个最近的怪物发射弹药\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]$cmd[CMD_TARGET_CYCLE_FORWARD]</input> 瞄准另一个怪物<localtiles>\n"
"  你还可以通过<input>点击</input>它来发射飞弹，然后用<input>Enter</input>确认目标。</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>休息</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</input>  等待并休息一回合\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>  等待并休息100回合\n"

#. key: tutorial3 start
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 start"
msgid ""
"In this lesson you're going to learn about items and how to use them.\n"
msgstr ""
"这一课中你将学到关于物品的事项，包括如何使用物品。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 armour
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 armour"
msgid ""
"Pick up these boots with <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input> and wear them with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>.<localtiles> Or simply <input>mouseclick</input>\n"
"on them in the inventory panel.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr ""
"按<input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input>捡起这双靴子，\n"
"并按<input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>穿上它。\n"
"<localtiles>或者直接在物品栏上<input>鼠标点击</input>它。</localtiles>\n"

#. key: tutorial3 autopickup
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 autopickup"
msgid ""
"Some types of items<tiles>, marked with a green frame,</tiles> are picked up\n"
"automatically as you step on them.\n"
msgstr ""
"某些种类的物品<tiles>，周围有一个绿框，</tiles>你在踩上时它能被自动拾取。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 scroll
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 scroll"
msgid ""
"Many items are unidentified when you find them. One way to find out what they\n"
"do is to use them. Try reading this scroll with <input>$cmd[CMD_READ]</input>\n"
"<localtiles> or with <input>mouseclick</input> in the inventory\n"
"panel</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"许多物品在你刚发现它们的时候都是未鉴定的。鉴定它们的方法之一就是使用它们。\n"
"试试按<input>$cmd[CMD_READ]</input>\n"
"<localtiles>或在物品栏中<input>鼠标点击</input>它</localtiles>来阅读这张卷轴。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 scroll_noautopickup
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 scroll_noautopickup"
msgid ""
"Autopickup does not work if there's a monster around. You can either pick up\n"
"this scroll now with <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input><localtiles> or\n"
"<input>clicking</input> on your character,</localtiles> or you can fight the\n"
"nearby enemy and pick it up afterwards.\n"
msgstr ""
"在周围有怪物的时候，自动拾取不会生效。\n"
"你现在可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>点击</input>你的角色来拾取它，\n"
"</localtiles>或者你也可以先干掉附近的敌人然后再拾取它。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 ego_weapon
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 ego_weapon"
msgid ""
"An item described as <lightblue>runed</lightblue> or\n"
"<lightblue>glowing</lightblue> will always be enchanted, or have special\n"
"properties, or both. Once you step on top of such an item, its properties will\n"
"be revealed to you.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果一个物品的描述中含有<lightblue>符文</lightblue>或<lightblue>发光</lightblue>，\n"
"那么它要么附有魔力，要么有特殊属性，也可能两个都有。\n"
"一旦你走到这种物品上面，其属性就会向你揭示。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 inventory
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 inventory"
msgid ""
"To view the description of your new weapon, find and select it in your\n"
"inventory (<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>). <localtiles>You can\n"
"also <input>mouseover</input> or <input>right click</input> it in the inventory\n"
"panel. </localtiles>Notice that all the item commands also work from the item\n"
"description screens.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果你想查阅新武器的描述，只要在物品栏中找到并选中它（<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>）即可。\n"
"<localtiles>你也可以在物品栏中<input>鼠标悬停</input>或<input>右击</input>它，实现同样效果。</localtiles>\n"
"另外要注意的是，所有与物品有关的命令在物品描述界面同样有效。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 battle
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 battle"
msgid ""
"Once you've successfully managed to poison a monster, it is sometimes best to\n"
"retreat and let the poison do the work. Don't forget to retreat to heal too, if\n"
"necessary.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果你成功使敌人中毒，有时最好后撤并让毒来完成剩下的工作。\n"
"撤退时也别忘了治疗。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 downstairs
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 downstairs"
msgid ""
"Well fought! If necessary, rest up with <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>, then\n"
"continue downwards with <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input><localtiles> or\n"
"with a <input>click</input> on your character</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"战得漂亮！如有必要，你可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>来休息一下，\n"
"然后按<input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>点击</input>你的角色</localtiles>走下楼梯。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 command_help
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 command_help"
msgid ""
"If the many commands are too confusing, you can also look them up in the\n"
"command help <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]</input>. <localtiles>A number of\n"
"commands are also available in the clickable <w>command panel</w> to the right\n"
"of the screen. </localtiles>Rereading old messages with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_REPLAY_MESSAGES]</input> is available as usual.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果这么多命令让你感觉有点头晕，\n"
"你也可以在命令帮助<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]</input>中查找各个命令。\n"
"<localtiles>部分命令也可以通过点击屏幕右边的<w>命令栏</w>来实现。</localtiles>\n"
"和以前一样，你可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_REPLAY_MESSAGES]</input>来查阅过去信息。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 trap
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 trap"
msgid ""
"Traps can have a variety of unpleasant effects, such as alerting monsters or\n"
"teleporting you into danger. Some traps are permanent and will always be\n"
"revealed as part of the map, but other traps can be triggered by exploring new\n"
"tiles, and won't exist after being triggered. If there's no way around, you'll\n"
"have to trigger the trap and deal with the consequences.\n"
msgstr ""
"陷阱有很多恼人的效果，比如惊醒怪物或将你传送到险境之中。\n"
"一些陷阱是永久的，显示为地图的一部分，\n"
"但另一些陷阱会在探索新图块时被触发并在触发后消失。\n"
"如果周围没有别的路，有时你不得不触发陷阱并处理后果。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 potion
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 potion"
msgid ""
"Potions may provide vital healing or useful enchantments, but some have less\n"
"desirable effects. You can quaff this potion with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_QUAFF]</input><localtiles> or with\n"
"<input>mouseclick</input></localtiles> to discover what it does.\n"
msgstr ""
"药水可以用来治疗或附加魔力，但有的效果则令人不快。\n"
"你可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_QUAFF]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>鼠标点击</input>来饮用药水，</localtiles>以发现它的作用。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 artefact_armour
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 artefact_armour"
msgid ""
"Items with <w>unusual names</w> are artefacts. Artefacts can have a number of\n"
"special properties. Some unique artefacts (such as this cloak) are always\n"
"identified and may have special properties that cannot be found anywhere else!\n"
"Others are generated with a random selection of properties, and are\n"
"unidentified until you step on top of them. Try equipping this cloak with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input><localtiles> or <input>mouseclick</input>\n"
"in the inventory panel</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"有<w>不寻常名字</w>的物品就是神器了。神器可能有各种特殊的属性。\n"
"一些独特的神器（如这件披风）总是能被鉴别出来，\n"
"并且可能有着其他地方见不到的特殊属性！\n"
"其他一些神器则是随机组合一些属性生成的，并且只有在走上去后才能被鉴别出来。\n"
"试着按<input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]<input><localtiles>\n"
"或在物品栏中<input>鼠标点击</input>它来装备这件披风</localtiles>。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 wand_fire
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 wand_fire"
msgid ""
"You can evoke a wand with <input>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</input><localtiles> or with\n"
"<input>mouseclick</input> in the inventory panel</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或在物品栏中<input>鼠标点击</input>它来使用魔杖</localtiles>。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 wand_digging
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 wand_digging"
msgid ""
"A wand of digging can destroy rock walls. Use\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]][$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</input> <localtiles>or\n"
"<input>mouseover</input>/<input>right click</input> </localtiles>to check wall\n"
"types.\n"
msgstr ""
"挖掘魔杖可以摧毁岩墙。\n"
"通过<input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]][$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</input> <localtiles>\n"
"或<input>鼠标悬停</input>/<input>右键</input> </localtiles>来查看墙壁类型。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 amulet
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 amulet"
msgid ""
"Jewellery is put on with <input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input><localtiles>\n"
"or with <input>mouseclick</input> in the inventory panel</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过按<input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或在物品栏中<input>鼠标点击</input>首饰来佩戴它</localtiles>。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 drop
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 drop"
msgid ""
"This amulet would be very powerful if your character had a god to worship,\n"
"but here and now, it's useless. You may want to drop it with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>Shift-leftclicking</input> it in the inventory panel</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果你追随了一个神，这个护身符会非常强大，但现在，它是没用的。\n"
"你要是想扔下它的话，可以用<input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或在物品栏中<input>Shift-左键点击</input>它</localtiles>。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 gold
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 gold"
msgid ""
"Gold can be spent in shops. It takes no inventory space and cannot be dropped.\n"
msgstr ""
"金币可以用于在商店中购买物品。它不占用库存空间，且无法丢弃。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 shop
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 shop"
msgid ""
"Shops offer a variety of items, but they don't buy items from anyone.\n"
msgstr ""
"商店中有各种各样的物品，但你无法向他们出售任何东西。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 enter_shop
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 enter_shop"
msgid ""
"To enter this shop, press <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</input><localtiles> or\n"
"<input>click</input> on your character</localtiles>. To buy items,\n"
"select them with their hotkey, hit <input>Enter</input> and confirm with\n"
"<input>y</input>es. You can switch to description mode with <input>!</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"要进入这家商店，请按<input>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>点击</input>你的角色</localtiles>。\n"
"要购买物品，请按它们对应的字母键选中它，\n"
"按<input>Enter</input>并按<input>y</input>es确定。\n"
"你可以按<input>!</input>切换到描述模式。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 autoexplore_reminder
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 autoexplore_reminder"
msgid ""
"Remember, you can explore the level automatically with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input><localtiles> or by <input>clicking</input> the\n"
"autoexplore command button in the <w>command panel</w></localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"记住，你可以按<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>点击</input><w>命令栏</w>上的自动探索图标来自动探索本楼层</localtiles>。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 go_shopping
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 go_shopping"
msgid ""
"You now have enough gold to do some serious shopping! The quickest way back to\n"
"the shop is by searching for it. Type <input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input>,\n"
"and then enter “<w>shop</w>”. Select the result to start travelling.<localtiles>\n"
"You can also <input>click</input> on the search button in the command panel, or\n"
"use the minimap to return to the shop.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr ""
"你现在有钱去商店买东西啦！要想回到商店，最快捷的方法就是搜索它。\n"
"按下<input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input>，然后输入“<w>shop</w>”。\n"
"选择一个结果前往它。<localtiles>\n"
"你也可以<input>点击</input>命令栏上的搜索按钮，或者通过小地图来回到商店。</localtiles>\n"

#. key: tutorial3 optional_battle
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 optional_battle"
msgid ""
"Warning, this way leads to <lightred>a difficult battle</lightred>. You may\n"
"choose to use what you've learned so far in a fight, or try to reach the other\n"
"exit on the island. Either way, it may be a good idea to do some shopping, if\n"
"you haven't already.\n"
msgstr ""
"小心，前面有<lightred>一场恶斗</lightred>。\n"
"你可以试试在战斗中使用你学到的知识，也可以尝试直奔那座岛上的出口。\n"
"不管怎么说，如果你还没买过东西，最好先去一下。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 tutorial_end
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 tutorial_end"
msgid ""
"Well done! To exit the tutorial, simply go down these stairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"干得好！只要从楼梯走下去就可以退出此教程。\n"

#. key: tutorial3 exit
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial3 exit"
msgid ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>Tutorial 3 summary: Items</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Item commands</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input>  pick up an item\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input>  drop an item\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>  equip armour, weapons, and jewellery\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_UNEQUIP]</input>  unequip armour, weapons, and jewellery\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_READ]</input>  read a scroll\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_QUAFF]</input>  quaff a potion\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</input>  evoke a wand\n"
"\n"
"  Use and (un)equip commands are also available from item descriptions in the inventory menu (<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>).<localtiles>\n"
"  And of course, <input>mouseclicks</input> also work.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Other</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input> access the command help\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>  explore automatically\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> search for items/features previously seen<localtiles>\n"
"  Several of these commands can also be executed by clicking in the <w>command panel</w>.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>教程3总结：物品</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>物品命令</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input>  捡起物品\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input>  丢弃物品\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input>  装备防具、武器和首饰\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_UNEQUIP]</input>  卸下防具、武器和首饰\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_READ]</input>  阅读卷轴\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_QUAFF]</input>  饮用药水\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</input> 使用魔杖\n"
"\n"
"  也可以在在物品栏菜单(<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]<input>)中的物品描述界面中使用装备或卸下命令。<localtiles>\n"
"  当然，你也可以用<input>鼠标点击</input>。</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>其他</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input> 查看命令帮助\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>  自动探索\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> 搜索之前看到过的物品/地标<localtiles>\n"
"  上述命令中有很多都可以通过点击<w>命令栏</w>来下达。</localtiles>\n"

#. key: tutorial4 start
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 start"
msgid ""
"In this lesson you're going to learn how to memorise and cast spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"这一课中你将学习如何记忆以及释放法术。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 spellbook
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 spellbook"
msgid ""
"You can memorise a spell from your spell library with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>clicking</input> on the memorisation tab and selecting the spell\n"
"tile</localtiles>. At experience level 1, only level 1 spells are available to\n"
"you. This will change as you gain experience. To find new spells, find and pick\n"
"up spellbooks, and the spells will be added to your library.\n"
msgstr ""
"从法术库中记忆法术通过<input>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或在记忆标签页中<input>点击</input>所选的法术贴图</localtiles>。\n"
"当经验等级为1时，只有1级法术可供你使用。这会随你提升经验而改变。\n"
"要获得新法术，需要捡到魔法书，法术才会被添入库中。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 spellcasting
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 spellcasting"
msgid ""
"To cast a spell, first memorise it with <input>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</input>.\n"
"You can then cast it with <input>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>clicking</input> on the spell tile</localtiles>.\n"
"\n"
"Press <input>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]</input>, then press <input>?</input> to get a\n"
"list of your spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以用<input>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>点击</input>法术贴图进行施法</localtiles>。\n"
"按<input>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]?</input>获得你的法术列表。\n"
"魔法如同弹药，会显示在弹药槽，\n"
"你可以用<input>$cmd[CMD_QUIVER_ITEM]</input>查看预备的法术。\n"
"使用<input>$cmd[CMD_FIRE]</input>或<input>shift-tab</input>投射当前预备的法术。\n"
"\n"
"一旦你的魔力用尽了，撤退后可以通过<input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>点击</input>命令栏中的休息图标进行休息和回复</localtiles>。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 ring_power
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 ring_power"
msgid ""
"Put on this ring with <input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input><localtiles> or\n"
"by <input>clicking</input> it in the inventory panel</localtiles>, and then\n"
"rest up to your new full potential.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过按<input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或在物品栏中<input>点击</input>它，就能戴上这枚戒指</localtiles>，\n"
"在休整后你将拥有全新的潜能。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 undead
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 undead"
msgid ""
"Unlike most monsters, zombies and skeletons do not regenerate health.\n"
"<localtiles> You can also attempt to re-cast the last spell you used by\n"
"pressing <input>Ctrl+leftclick</input> on the monster.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr ""
"与绝大多数怪物不同，丧尸和骷髅无法恢复健康。\n"
"<localtiles>你可以尝试重施最后用的那个法术，\n"
"通过对着那个怪物按<input>Ctrl+左键</input>。</localtiles>\n"

#. key: tutorial4 spell_success
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 spell_success"
msgid ""
"To check your spell proficiency, press <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SPELLS]</input>\n"
"<localtiles> or <input>mouseover</input> over your memorised\n"
"spells</localtiles>. Compare your spell failure rates before and after wearing\n"
"this ring.\n"
msgstr ""
"要查看你的法术熟练度，按<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SPELLS]</input>\n"
"<localtiles>或<input>鼠标悬停</input>在你记住法术上面</localtiles>。\n"
"比较佩戴此戒指前后的法术失败率。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 mephitic_cloud
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 mephitic_cloud"
msgid ""
"Mephitic Cloud is a level 3 spell, so you can't memorise it yet. To level up\n"
"quickly, here are more training dummies — without stones to throw this time.\n"
"\n"
"At experience level 3, you'll be able to increase one of your stats — choosing\n"
"<input>I</input>ntelligence will help your spellcasting even further.\n"
msgstr ""
"臭云是个3级法术，因此你暂时无法记忆它。\n"
"为了快速升级，这里有更多的训练假人，这次没有石头可扔。\n"
"\n"
"当经验等级到3时，你可以选择增强一个属性——通过<input>I</input>选择智力，\n"
"这会对施法有帮助。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 meph_reminder
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 meph_reminder"
msgid ""
"Don't forget to memorise your newly-available spell, by pressing\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>clicking</input> on the memorisation tab and selecting the spell\n"
"tile</localtiles>!\n"
msgstr ""
"不要忘记你的新的可用法术，\n"
"通过按<input>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或在记忆标签页中<input>点击</input>所选的法术贴图进行记忆</localtiles>！\n"

#. key: tutorial4 aiming_clouds
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 aiming_clouds"
msgid ""
"Mephitic Cloud covers an area in noxious fumes when cast, and you'll be able to\n"
"see the area it affects as you target it. Try to catch multiple enemies in a\n"
"single cloud in order to be more efficient with your magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"当释放臭云时，有毒气体会覆盖一片区域，当你瞄准时，你会看到受影响的区域。\n"
"设法将多个敌人捕在一片云中，以更有效地利用你的魔法。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 forget_spell
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 forget_spell"
msgid ""
"Gaining experience levels and raising your Spellcasting skill gives you spell\n"
"slots to spend on spells. You can also <w>forget a memorised spell</w> to make\n"
"space for a new one by reading a scroll of amnesia. Read the scroll (with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_READ]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>clicking</input> on it</localtiles>), and then select the spell you want\n"
"to forget. You can relearn forgotten spells from your spell library later, as\n"
"long as you have spell slots available.\n"
msgstr ""
"获得经验并提高你的施法技能可以获得法术槽位。\n"
"你也可以通过阅读失忆卷轴<w>忘记一个记过的法术</w>来给新的腾出位置。\n"
"阅读那张卷轴（通过<input>$cmd[CMD_READ]</input><localtiles>或<input>点击</input>它</localtiles>），\n"
"然后选择要遗忘的法术。只要你有可用的法术槽，\n"
"你稍后可以从你的法术库中重新学习被遗忘的法术。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 memorise2
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 memorise2"
msgid ""
"After forgetting one of your old spells to make space, memorise this new spell\n"
"with <input>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>clicking</input> on the memorisation tab and selecting the spell\n"
"tile</localtiles>. Then try your new spell and summon some demonic allies!\n"
msgstr ""
"遗忘旧法术腾出空间后，\n"
"通过<input>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或在记忆标签页中<input>点击</input>所选的法术贴图</localtiles>记忆这个新法术。\n"
"然后试着用你的新法术召唤恶魔盟友！\n"

#. key: tutorial4 displace_allies
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 displace_allies"
msgid ""
"Did you notice you can swap positions with your allies by moving into them?\n"
"Among other things, displacing a friendly creature can be a good way to escape\n"
"a fight.\n"
msgstr ""
"你是否注意到，当你移向友方的位置时，会与其换位？\n"
"此外，与友好生物换位也是个逃离战斗的好办法。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 order_allies
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 order_allies"
msgid ""
"Try to let your allies do the killing! If necessary, you can order them about\n"
"with <input>$cmd[CMD_SHOUT]</input>. Before opening this gate, you may want to\n"
"wait with <input>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</input> until your allies have caught\n"
"up with you. Your summons will only stick around for a short time, so don't\n"
"wait too long, or summon some new ones before starting a fight.\n"
msgstr ""
"设法让你的友方进行击杀！如有必要，\n"
"可以通过<input>$cmd[CMD_SHOUT]</input>命令他们。在进入大门前，\n"
"你可能需要通过<input>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</input>来等待他们，直到你的友方赶上你。\n"
"你的召唤物只会停留一段时间，所以不要等待太久，或是在开始战斗前才进行召唤。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 heavy_armour
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 heavy_armour"
msgid ""
"Heavy armour really hampers spellcasting. Try putting on that mail and shield\n"
"(with <input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>clicking</input> on them</localtiles>), and compare your spellcasting\n"
"failure rates with <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SPELLS]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>mouseovering</input> your memorised spells</localtiles>. You can take\n"
"armour off again with <input>$cmd[CMD_UNEQUIP]</input><localtiles> or,\n"
"again, via <input>mouseclick</input></localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"重甲确实会妨碍施法。试着装备护甲、盾牌\n"
"（通过<input>$cmd[CMD_EQUIP]</input><localtiles>或<input>点击</input>它们</localtiles>），\n"
"并通过<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SPELLS]</input><localtiles>或<input>鼠标悬停</input>\n"
"在你记住的法术</localtiles>上，来比较你的施法失败率。\n"
"你可以通过<input>$cmd[CMD_UNEQUIP]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>鼠标点击</input></localtiles>脱下防具。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 resting_reminder
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 resting_reminder"
msgid ""
"Make sure you are at full health and magic points before entering a new area.\n"
"If necessary, rest up with <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input><localtiles> or by\n"
"<input>mouseclick</input> in the command panel</localtiles>.\n"
"\n"
"You can only summon a limited number of allies at once from any given spell,\n"
"so try to take advantage of a wide range of spells. For example, your summoned\n"
"imps are resistant to poison, so you can cast Mephitic Cloud to fight alongside\n"
"them without harming your allies.\n"
msgstr ""
"确保你在进入新区域前健康和魔力值是满的。\n"
"如有必要，通过<input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input><localtiles>或在命令栏中<input>鼠标点击</input>它</localtiles>。\n"
"\n"
"你一次只能用给定任何的法术召唤数量有限的盟友，所以尽量利用范围广的法术。\n"
"例如，你召唤的小鬼是抗毒的，所以你与他们并肩作战时可以施放臭云，\n"
"而不会伤害你的盟友。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 tutorial_end
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 tutorial_end"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, you're a real wizard now! To exit the tutorial, simply go down\n"
"these stairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"恭喜，你已经是真正的巫师了！只要从楼梯走下去就可以退出此教程。\n"

#. key: tutorial4 exit
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial4 exit"
msgid ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>Tutorial 4 summary: Magic</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Spellcasting commands</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</input>  learn a new spell\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SPELLS]</input>  check spell proficiency\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]</input>  cast a spell<localtiles>\n"
"  You can also learn new spells via the <w>memorisation tab</w>.\n"
"  You can cast memorised spells via <input>leftclick</input>, and read their descriptions and check your spell proficiency by <input>mouseover</input> or <input>rightclick</input></localtiles>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_QUIVER_ITEM]</input>  adjust your quiver\n"
"\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>  rest up to 100 turns to regain magic points and health\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_SHOUT]</input>  order allies\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_UNEQUIP]</input>  take off equipment\n"
msgstr ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>教程4总结：魔法</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>施法命令</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</input>  学习新法术\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SPELLS]</input>  查看法术熟练度\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]</input>  施法<localtiles>\n"
"  你也可以通过<w>记忆标签页</w>学习新的法术。\n"
"  你可以通过<input>左键</input>记忆法术，通过<input>鼠标悬停</input>或<input>右键</input></localtiles>阅读描述和查看法术熟练度。\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_QUIVER_ITEM]</input> 调整你的弹药\n"
"\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>  休息一百回合以回复健康和魔力\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_SHOUT]</input>  命令友军\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_UNEQUIP]</input>  脱下装备\n"

#. key: tutorial5 start
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 start"
msgid ""
"In this lesson you're going to learn about gods and how to use their powers.\n"
msgstr ""
"这一课中你将会学到有关神祗的知识，包括如何使用他们的力量。\n"

#. key: tutorial5 dungeon_overview
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 dungeon_overview"
msgid ""
"Up ahead is an altar to Trog the Wrathful! Trog is just one of many gods. In a\n"
"real game, you can check <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_OVERMAP]</input><localtiles>\n"
"or <input>click the dungeon overmap button</input> in the command\n"
"panel</localtiles> for a list of all altars and other interesting features\n"
"found so far.\n"
msgstr ""
"前面是狂怒者特洛戈的祭坛！特洛戈只是众神之一。在实际游戏中，\n"
"你可以通过<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_OVERMAP]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或在命令栏中<input>点击地牢概览按钮</input></localtiles>\n"
"来查看所有已经发现的祭坛和其他有趣的地标。\n"

#. key: tutorial5 altar
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 altar"
msgid ""
"You can pray on an altar with <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input>\n"
"<localtiles> (or by <input>left clicking</input> on your character)</localtiles>\n"
"to get an idea what a god offers you, and to join the faith. If\n"
"you press <input>!</input><localtiles> or\n"
"<input>rightclick</input></localtiles> on the religion screen, you can see a\n"
"more detailed description.\n"
"\n"
"Confirm your choice with <input>J</input> or <input>Enter</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以在祭坛上用<input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input><localtiles>\n"
"（或<input>左击</input>你的角色）</localtiles>来祈祷，\n"
"这样你就可以知道这个神能给你什么好处，然后可以选择皈依它。\n"
"如果你在信仰界面按<input>!</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>右键</input></localtiles>你还可以看到更详细的描述。\n"
"\n"
"输入大写的<input>J</input>或<input>Enter</input>确认你的选择。\n"

#. key: tutorial5 religion
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 religion"
msgid ""
"Have a look at your current religious standing with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</input><localtiles> (or via the <w>religion\n"
"button</w> in the command panel, or by <input>Shift-rightclicking</input> on\n"
"the player tile)</localtiles>. Again, pressing <input>!</input><localtiles> or\n"
"<input>rightclicking</input></localtiles> will bring up a more detailed\n"
"description of your god.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</input><localtiles>\n"
"（或通过在命令栏中<w>信仰按钮</w>，或通过<input>Shift-右击</input>玩家贴图）\n"
"</localtiles>来查看你的信仰状态。和以前一样，按<input>!</input><localtiles>\n"
"或<input>右击</input></localtiles>可以调出你的神的更详细的描述。\n"

#. key: tutorial5 piety_on_kill
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 piety_on_kill"
msgid ""
"Some gods really like it if you kill monsters in their name. Let the slaughter\n"
"begin!\n"
msgstr ""
"有些神特别喜欢你以祂的名义杀死怪物。让屠杀开始吧！\n"

#. key: tutorial5 berserk
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 berserk"
msgid ""
"Against particularly tough foes, you may want to use Trog's Berserk power with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input><localtiles> or via the <w>command\n"
"panel</w></localtiles>.\n"
msgstr ""
"面对特别强大的敌人时，\n"
"你可能需要通过<input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input><localtiles>\n"
"或通过<w>命令栏</w>来使用特洛戈赐予你的狂暴能力</w></localtiles>。\n"

#. key: tutorial5 exhaustion
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 exhaustion"
msgid ""
"A berserker rage is truly exhausting. After it ends, you cannot berserk again\n"
"for a short while and are slowed. It's best to rest with\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input><localtiles> (or via the\n"
"<w>command panel</w>)</localtiles> until you feel fit again.\n"
msgstr ""
"狂暴会令人筋疲力尽。狂暴后，短时间内你无法再次狂暴，而且行动速度也会减慢。\n"
"最好是通过<input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input><localtiles>\n"
"（或通过<w>命令栏</w>）</localtiles>来休息一会，等到精力恢复了再出发。\n"

#. key: tutorial5 berserk2
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 berserk2"
msgid ""
"Berserk is also really useful against multiple enemies — as long as you don't\n"
"run out of steam in-between.\n"
msgstr ""
"狂暴在面对多个敌人的时候也非常有用——但要是打到一半的时候狂暴结束就麻烦了。\n"

#. key: tutorial5 tutorial_end
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 tutorial_end"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've finished the last tutorial lesson and are now ready for\n"
"the real game. Good luck!\n"
"\n"
"To exit the tutorial, just go down these stairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你！你已经通过了最后一个教学关，现在你可以开始玩真正的游戏了。祝你好运！\n"
"\n"
"从楼梯走下去就可以退出此教程。\n"

#. key: tutorial5 exit
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 exit"
msgid ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>Tutorial 5 summary: Religion</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Religious commands</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input>  pray at an altar to join a god\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input>  use a divine ability\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</input>  check your religious standing<localtiles>\n"
"  A <input>rightclick</input> on the player tile will also bring up the religion screen.</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Resting</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</input>  wait and rest a single turn\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>  wait and rest up to 100 turns\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>Other commands</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_OVERMAP]</input> display an overview of the dungeon\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]/</input>  search the description database\n"
msgstr ""
":nowrap\n"
"<white>教程5：信仰</white>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>信仰命令</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</input>  在祭坛上祈祷，以皈依一位神\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</input>  使用神的能力\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</input>  查看你的信仰状况<localtiles>\n"
"  <input>右击</input>玩家贴图，也能调出信仰界面。</localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"<yellow>休息</yellow>\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</input>  等待并休息一回合\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input>  等待并休息100回合\n"
"\n"
